  ('261050387965361476', 'Untitled Horror Movie', 2021, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Nick Simon, Kevin Duggin', 'Luke Baines, Nick Simon', 'Claire Holt, Darren Barnet, Emmy Raver-Lampman, Katherine McNamara, Timothy Granaderos, Luke Baines, Kal Penn, Aisha Tyler', null, 'Set on computer screens and found footage style content, the movie follows six actors who decide to shoot their own horror movie as their hit TV show is on the brink of cancellation. In their search for a plot, they unintentionally summon a spirit with an affinity for violence, who starts picking them off one by one.', 'Set on computer screens and found footage style content, the movie follows six actors who decide to shoot their own horror movie as their hit TV show is on the brink of cancellation. In their search for a plot, they unintentionally summon a spirit with an affinity for violence, who starts picking them off one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HizqO0Htv6e68pWu0gzsoDthXq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:720407'),
