  ('203389561997971972', 'Untouched', 1954, 'Drama, Adventure, Romance', 'Roberto Gavaldón, Alex Phillips', 'Roberto Gavaldón, Luis Alcoriza, José Revueltas', 'Ricardo Montalban, Ariadna Welter, Víctor Parra, Jorge Martínez de Hoyos, Miguel Inclán, Jaime Fernández, Roberto G. Rivera, Enriqueta Reza', null, 'With the purpose of using barbasco roots in the production of cortisone, a pharmaceutical company sends a scientist to investigate the possibilities of exploitation in Veracruz, but the man gets lost in the jungle and lives a strange romantic adventure in a remote location called Paradise.', 'With the purpose of using barbasco roots in the production of cortisone, a pharmaceutical company sends a scientist to investigate the possibilities of exploitation in Veracruz, but the man gets lost in the jungle and lives a strange romantic adventure in a remote location called Paradise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWb01HKEZbMVKFQSRaItjCdNllc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176923'),
  ('74985114613312595', 'Untraceable', 2008, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery, Drama, Horror', 'Gregory Hoblit, Anastas N. Michos, Scott Robertson', 'Robert Fyvolent, Allison Burnett, Mark Brinker', 'Diane Lane, Billy Burke, Colin Hanks, Joseph Cross, Mary Beth Hurt, Peter Gray Lewis, Perla Haney-Jardine, Christopher Cousins', 'R', 'Special Agent Jennifer Marsh works in an elite division of the FBI dedicated to fighting cybercrime. She thinks she has seen it all, until a particularly sadistic criminal arises on the Internet. This tech-savvy killer posts live feeds of his crimes on his website; the more hits the site gets, the faster the victim dies. Marsh and her team must find the elusive killer before time runs out.', 'Special Agent Jennifer Marsh works in an elite division of the FBI dedicated to fighting cybercrime. She thinks she has seen it all, until a particularly sadistic criminal arises on the Internet. This tech-savvy killer posts live feeds of his crimes on his website; the more hits the site gets, the faster the victim dies. Marsh and her team must find the elusive killer before time runs out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySUwDRDEn01lKIMPQorpFCMLWqE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8090'),
  ('938487279374210916', 'Unveiled', 2005, 'Drama', 'Angelina Maccarone, Judith Kaufmann', 'Judith Kaufmann, Angelina Maccarone', 'Jasmin Tabatabai, Anneke Kim Sarnau, Navid Navid, Georg Friedrich, Jens Münchow, Ruth Wohlschlegel, Monika Hansen, Nina Vorbrodt', 'NR', 'Survival is not enough. Fariba Tabrizi has made it. Under peril of death she has fled from Iran. In Germany she has no alternative way of avoiding the threat of deportation other than to assume the identity of a deceased co-detainee. So what happens after a few month in which she has tried to come to terms with a situation which is actually an insufferable one for her? How does Fariba live not only in this external state of exile but also in an inner state of exile? The term "in orbit" is officially used by the UN to refer to asylum-seekers who find themselves orbiting around planet Earth because they can actually find legal domicile nowhere at all.', 'Survival is not enough. Fariba Tabrizi has made it. Under peril of death she has fled from Iran. In Germany she has no alternative way of avoiding the threat of deportation other than to assume the identity of a deceased co-detainee. So what happens after a few month in which she has tried to come to terms with a situation which is actually an insufferable one for her? How does Fariba live not only in this external state of exile but also in an inner state of exile? The term "in orbit" is officially used by the UN to refer to asylum-seekers who find themselves orbiting around planet Earth because they can actually find legal domicile nowhere at all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/I9zdSIDMlbFOhS9pGnYwUAtIPf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56823'),
  ('935664283070930404', 'Unveiled', 2018, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Felix von Muralt, Jacob Berger', 'Noémie Kocher, Jacob Berger', 'Marthe Keller, Julie Gayet, Lola Créton, Nastassja Tanner, Cléa Eden, Yann Philipona, Lyes Salem, Pierre Banderet', null, 'Three women, three generations, two secrets. In the early 1970s, a bomb exploded on board the Swissair flight 330 to Tel Aviv. Isabelle''s husband also died. The young, very pregnant widow feared that her lover, the Palestinian activist Djibril, might be entangled in it ... Now, 47 years later, Isabelle finds out that her granddaughter Anaïs has converted to Islam. But why does the young student keep her new faith secret from the family? Anaïs''s mother, Léa, immediately rings the alarm.', 'Three women, three generations, two secrets. In the early 1970s, a bomb exploded on board the Swissair flight 330 to Tel Aviv. Isabelle''s husband also died. The young, very pregnant widow feared that her lover, the Palestinian activist Djibril, might be entangled in it ... Now, 47 years later, Isabelle finds out that her granddaughter Anaïs has converted to Islam. But why does the young student keep her new faith secret from the family? Anaïs''s mother, Léa, immediately rings the alarm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kn4oAsTELV32EvVq1lGS9CwBooo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583274'),
  ('762398038358457240', 'Unwed Father', 1997, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Michael Switzer, Robert Draper', 'Nina Shengold', 'Brian Austin Green, Nicholle Tom, Isabella Hofmann, Faye Grant, Ari Meyers, Alan Rachins, Sarah Strange, Michelle Thrush', null, '9 months after a drunken sexual encounter, a young man winds up raising a baby on his own.', '9 months after a drunken sexual encounter, a young man winds up raising a baby on his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKSfMRsmkjduysaz9CncDjaC68q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117402'),
  ('1116665575672006247', 'Unwelcome', 2023, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Hamish Doyne-Ditmas, Jon Wright', 'Mark Stay', 'Hannah John-Kamen, Douglas Booth, Jamie Lee O''Donnell, Chris Walley, Kristian Nairn, Colm Meaney, Niamh Cusack, Lalor Roddy', 'R', 'Londoners Maya and Jamie escape their urban nightmare to the tranquility of rural Ireland only to discover malevolent, murderous goblins lurking in the gnarled, ancient wood at the foot of their new garden. When heavily pregnant Maya’s relationship with a local family turns sour, who – or what – will come to her rescue and to what extremes will she go to protect her unborn child?', 'Londoners Maya and Jamie escape their urban nightmare to the tranquility of rural Ireland only to discover malevolent, murderous goblins lurking in the gnarled, ancient wood at the foot of their new garden. When heavily pregnant Maya’s relationship with a local family turns sour, who – or what – will come to her rescue and to what extremes will she go to protect her unborn child?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88bGObx8YKLQDOOhcrBHHzXpiAv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:758769'),
  ('747785855737265862', 'Unzipped', 1995, 'Documentary', 'Douglas Keeve, Robert Leacock, Ellen Kuras', null, 'Isaac Mizrahi, Sandra Bernhard, Naomi Campbell, John Galliano, Kate Moss, Linda Evangelista, Cindy Crawford, Eartha Kitt', 'R', 'Isaac Mizrahi, one of the most successful designers in high fashion, plans his fall 1994 collection.', 'Isaac Mizrahi, one of the most successful designers in high fashion, plans his fall 1994 collection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnIzv4rXr9FXkqW880E3rStYQA7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77350'),
  ('252011561221466276', 'Uomini senza donne', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Angelo Longoni, Alfio Contini, Sebastiano Celeste', 'Angelo Longoni, Massimo Sgorbani', 'Alessandro Gassmann, Gianmarco Tognazzi, Alessandra Acciai, Veronica Logan, Eleonora Ivone, Manuela Arcuri, Riccardo Rossi, Francesco Barilli', null, 'Alex and Max are two "bachelors" who share the same house: Alex, advertising copywriter, is boxing, is an impenitent dongiovanni and does not hesitate to betray his colleague and girlfriend Paola; Max, saxophonist, neglects his ulcer and is attracted, yes, but also scared, by women.', 'Alex and Max are two "bachelors" who share the same house: Alex, advertising copywriter, is boxing, is an impenitent dongiovanni and does not hesitate to betray his colleague and girlfriend Paola; Max, saxophonist, neglects his ulcer and is attracted, yes, but also scared, by women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGUA6gdZRwTsR2TdloATwelNtWM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161973'),
  ('452855051357520393', 'Uomo d''acqua dolce', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Antonio Albanese, Giulio Manfredonia, Massimo Pau', 'Antonio Albanese, Vincenzo Cerami', 'Antonio Albanese, Valeria Milillo, Antonio Petrocelli, Sara Anticoli, Emanuela Grimalda, Stefano Sarcinelli, Valerio Isidori, Birte Berg', null, 'Antonio takes a hit on his head when he''s out to buy a jar of mushrooms for his wife, and loses his memory. He reappears five years later unaware that time has passed.', 'Antonio takes a hit on his head when he''s out to buy a jar of mushrooms for his wife, and loses his memory. He reappears five years later unaware that time has passed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xeQvisnaK9HrqImR8WyPnOe0HAT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56484'),
  ('191653808582684412', 'Up', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Pete Docter, Jean-Claude Kalache, Lou Romano', 'Bob Peterson, Pete Docter', 'Ed Asner, Christopher Plummer, Jordan Nagai, Bob Peterson, Delroy Lindo, Jerome Ranft, John Ratzenberger, David Kaye', 'PG', 'Carl Fredricksen spent his entire life dreaming of exploring the globe and experiencing life to its fullest. But at age 78, life seems to have passed him by, until a twist of fate (and a persistent 8-year old Wilderness Explorer named Russell) gives him a new lease on life.', 'Carl Fredricksen spent his entire life dreaming of exploring the globe and experiencing life to its fullest. But at age 78, life seems to have passed him by, until a twist of fate (and a persistent 8-year old Wilderness Explorer named Russell) gives him a new lease on life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFvoEwSfLqbcWwFsDjQebn9bzFe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14160'),
  ('889650496188979266', 'Up ''n'' Under', 1998, 'Comedy', 'John Godber', 'John Godber', 'Gary Olsen, Samantha Womack, Neil Morrissey, Ralph Brown, Richard Ridings, Adrian Hood, David MacCreedy, Griff Rhys Jones', null, 'The Cobblers Arms have been the best and most feared Amateur Rugby League team for the past ten years. Ex-pro Arthur bets their boss that he could train a bunch of deadbeats to defeat them in a local rugby sevens tournament. But to do so he must first get them into shape with the help of the very attractive Hazel Scott.', 'The Cobblers Arms have been the best and most feared Amateur Rugby League team for the past ten years. Ex-pro Arthur bets their boss that he could train a bunch of deadbeats to defeat them in a local rugby sevens tournament. But to do so he must first get them into shape with the help of the very attractive Hazel Scott.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5W33lPSEjioH0YSLa6HKrwJB4MA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48959'),
  ('914343812051185816', 'Up a Tree', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, James MacDonald, Dessie Flynn', 'NR', 'Donald''s playing lumberjack, but the targeted tree just happens to be the home of Chip ''n Dale. They give Donald plenty of trouble cutting down the tree, but eventually he succeeds. The wily chipmunks, though, manage to get their revenge on the homewrecker.', 'Donald''s playing lumberjack, but the targeted tree just happens to be the home of Chip ''n Dale. They give Donald plenty of trouble cutting down the tree, but eventually he succeeds. The wily chipmunks, though, manage to get their revenge on the homewrecker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQCoil3WiVFcLPd9U5WbERq35Sd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67709'),
  ('564413185288023193', 'Up Against Them All', 2004, 'Drama, Crime', 'Roberto Moreira, Júlia Pacheco Jordão, Adrian Cooper', 'Roberto Moreira', 'Leona Cavalli, Sílvia Lourenço, Aílton Graça, Giulio Lopes, Martha Meola, Dionísio Neto, Gustavo Machado, Paula Pretta', null, 'A story about the lies, treachery and vengeance of a middle-class family living on the outskirts of São Paulo. Four characters try desperately to change their lives, but are unable to escape their destiny.', 'A story about the lies, treachery and vengeance of a middle-class family living on the outskirts of São Paulo. Four characters try desperately to change their lives, but are unable to escape their destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWQP5PuJQtJz2iFlAcX3GGoc37y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157366'),
  ('1109250684059362290', 'Up Among the Stars', 2018, 'Drama', 'Zoe Berriatúa, Ivan Román', 'Zoe Berriatúa', 'Luis Callejo, Jorge Andreu, Macarena Gómez, Ingrid García Jonsson, Kiti Mánver, María Morales, José Luis García Pérez, Pablo Turégano', null, 'Víctor is a film director who is overcome by his own misfortunes. He is an alcoholic, unemployed and terribly depressed, largely because of the death of his wife. However, Victor is still the best in one thing: telling fantastic stories to his nine-year-old son, Ingmar. These stories are each of the scripts he dreams of directing in the future, when he gathers all the necessary resources. Victor and Ingmar share a present full of sadness and precariousness, but also full of robots and locations of films they have seen together. Despite forming a great team, their problems will multiply when others begin to question their role as a father.', 'Víctor is a film director who is overcome by his own misfortunes. He is an alcoholic, unemployed and terribly depressed, largely because of the death of his wife. However, Victor is still the best in one thing: telling fantastic stories to his nine-year-old son, Ingmar. These stories are each of the scripts he dreams of directing in the future, when he gathers all the necessary resources. Victor and Ingmar share a present full of sadness and precariousness, but also full of robots and locations of films they have seen together. Despite forming a great team, their problems will multiply when others begin to question their role as a father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvdnPjkvOftz6drRiEeAK393hxL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:533983'),
  ('926635458356579531', 'Up and Down', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Miguel M. Delgado, Alex Phillips', 'Miguel M. Delgado', 'Cantinflas, Teresa Velázquez, Joaquín García Vargas, Carlos Agostí, Domingo Soler, Alejandro Ciangherotti, Georgina Barragán, Luis Manuel Pelayo', null, 'It is the story of a sportsman who is a little bit dumber than most people but nevertheless he succeeds in getting a job at a sports article saler''s. Having this job is the beginning of a lot of funny problems he causes due to his dumbness.', 'It is the story of a sportsman who is a little bit dumber than most people but nevertheless he succeeds in getting a job at a sports article saler''s. Having this job is the beginning of a lot of funny problems he causes due to his dumbness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7UH0vBGvFjFdm6SvsC7mHcDnYRg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45189'),
  ('1102683815653281278', 'Up and Down', 1991, 'Animation, Family', 'John Lasseter', null, 'Craig Good', null, 'An educational short film directed featuring the Luxo Jr. discovering the concept of "Up" and "Down" with the help of his dad, Luxo Sr.', 'An educational short film directed featuring the Luxo Jr. discovering the concept of "Up" and "Down" with the help of his dad, Luxo Sr.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2T01Z5mW5xKjR5KE2fwn9OunT2r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287097'),
  ('846267813804818540', 'Up and Down', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jan Hřebejk, Ladislav Ondráček, Jan Malíř', 'Petr Jarchovský', 'Petr Forman, Jan Tříska, Emília Vášáryová, Ingrid Timková, Kristýna Boková, Jiří Macháček, Nataša Burger, Jaroslav Dušek', null, 'Milan and Goran are two criminals who smuggle illegal immigrants. One night after they complete a smuggle, they discover that one of the immigrants has left a baby behind. Milan and Goran decide to sell the baby to Lubos and Eman, who are responsible for running an illegal baby adoption center. Lubos and Eman make attempts to sell the baby to Miluska and Frantisek, a barren couple.', 'Milan and Goran are two criminals who smuggle illegal immigrants. One night after they complete a smuggle, they discover that one of the immigrants has left a baby behind. Milan and Goran decide to sell the baby to Lubos and Eman, who are responsible for running an illegal baby adoption center. Lubos and Eman make attempts to sell the baby to Miluska and Frantisek, a barren couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNe8hVohFlPmN561fKcHAfeSFOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65967'),
  ('811025119490900302', 'Up at the Villa', 2000, 'Drama, Romance', 'Philip Haas, Maurizio Calvesi', 'Belinda Haas', 'Kristin Scott Thomas, Sean Penn, Anne Bancroft, James Fox, Derek Jacobi, Jeremy Davies, Roger Hammond, Dudley Sutton', null, 'Superficial people are revealed and drastically changed by circumstance or luck in this a tale of death, seduction, blackmail and theft among British and Americans in Florence in the turbulent days just before World War II.', 'Superficial people are revealed and drastically changed by circumstance or luck in this a tale of death, seduction, blackmail and theft among British and Americans in Florence in the turbulent days just before World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkjBOhbNVCk6zbnC8Xo1cNYMmuA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47724'),
  ('988694097713349127', 'Up Close & Personal', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jon Avnet, Karl Walter Lindenlaub, David Rubin', 'Joan Didion, John Gregory Dunne', 'Robert Redford, Michelle Pfeiffer, Stockard Channing, Joe Mantegna, Kate Nelligan, Glenn Plummer, James Rebhorn, Scott Bryce', 'PG-13', 'Tally Atwater has a dream: to be a prime-time network newscaster. She pursues this dream with nothing but ambition, raw talent and a homemade demo tape. Warren Justice is a brilliant, hard edged, veteran newsman. He sees Tally has talent and becomes her mentor. Tally’s career takes a meteoric rise and she and Warren fall in love. The romance that results is as intense and revealing as television news itself. Yet, each breaking story, every videotaped crisis that brings them together, also threatens to drive them apart...', 'Tally Atwater has a dream: to be a prime-time network newscaster. She pursues this dream with nothing but ambition, raw talent and a homemade demo tape. Warren Justice is a brilliant, hard edged, veteran newsman. He sees Tally has talent and becomes her mentor. Tally’s career takes a meteoric rise and she and Warren fall in love. The romance that results is as intense and revealing as television news itself. Yet, each breaking story, every videotaped crisis that brings them together, also threatens to drive them apart...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zF67qcf7skMHLpXnifodinUqCFr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9302'),
  ('535933773225650640', 'Up for Love', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Laurent Tirard, Jérôme Alméras', 'Marcos Carnevale, Laurent Tirard, Grégoire Vigneron', 'Jean Dujardin, Virginie Efira, Cédric Kahn, César Domboy, Stéphanie Papanian, Edmonde Franchi, Manoëlle Gaillard, Bruno Gomila', null, 'Diane is a well-known lawyer, divorced for three years. She loses her mobile telephone and receives a call from the person who finds it. That person is Alexandre, a charming man and the perfect gentleman. They make a connection over the phone and agree to meet up the following day. But when Alexandre arrives, there''s a surprise in store when Diane discovers he is only 4'' 6" tall. From that moment on, Diane tries to overcome the prejudices of society and her own fears to experience the best time of her life...', 'Diane is a well-known lawyer, divorced for three years. She loses her mobile telephone and receives a call from the person who finds it. That person is Alexandre, a charming man and the perfect gentleman. They make a connection over the phone and agree to meet up the following day. But when Alexandre arrives, there''s a surprise in store when Diane discovers he is only 4'' 6" tall. From that moment on, Diane tries to overcome the prejudices of society and her own fears to experience the best time of her life...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBOioZKaGacNtx8G7qZeTPqemk7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366514'),
  ('6006705117253568', 'Up from the Depths', 1979, 'Horror', 'Ricardo Remias, Charles B. Griffith, Leo Martinez', 'Anne Dyer', 'Sam Bottoms, Susanne Reed, Virgil Frye, Kedric Wolfe, Charles Howerton, Denise Hayes, Chuck Doherty, Helen McNeely', 'R', 'The staff and vacationers at a first-class resort on the island of Maui are beginning to mysteriously disappear. A biologist believes that an underwater earthquake has caused a giant and very hungry dormant prehistoric fish to be released from its slumber. The fish voraciously helps itself to a tourist buffet. Now it is open season for the local fishermen to find and kill the creature.', 'The staff and vacationers at a first-class resort on the island of Maui are beginning to mysteriously disappear. A biologist believes that an underwater earthquake has caused a giant and very hungry dormant prehistoric fish to be released from its slumber. The fish voraciously helps itself to a tourist buffet. Now it is open season for the local fishermen to find and kill the creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pskHeZCsUgSZDTOUGFPnuJsNfsd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56429'),
  ('174059632995707571', 'Up in Smoke', 1978, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Gene Polito, Lou Adler, Mike Moder', 'Tommy Chong, Cheech Marin', 'Cheech Marin, Tommy Chong, Strother Martin, Edie Adams, Harold Fong, Richard Novo, Jane Moder, Pam Bille', 'R', 'An unemployed pot-smoking slacker and amateur drummer, Anthony Stoner ditches his strict parents and hits the road, eventually meeting kindred spirit Pedro de Pacas. While the drug-ingesting duo is soon arrested for possession of marijuana, Anthony and Pedro get released on a technicality, allowing them to continue their many misadventures and ultimately compete in a rock band contest, where they perform the raucous tune "Earache My Eye."', 'An unemployed pot-smoking slacker and amateur drummer, Anthony Stoner ditches his strict parents and hits the road, eventually meeting kindred spirit Pedro de Pacas. While the drug-ingesting duo is soon arrested for possession of marijuana, Anthony and Pedro get released on a technicality, allowing them to continue their many misadventures and ultimately compete in a rock band contest, where they perform the raucous tune "Earache My Eye."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKXINU3ApbhFPQJ3pqgMzGPCYnH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11455'),
  ('852416054578287716', 'Up in the Air', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jason Reitman, Jason Blumenfeld, Sonia Bhalla', 'Jason Reitman, Sheldon Turner', 'George Clooney, Vera Farmiga, Anna Kendrick, Sam Elliott, Amy Morton, Jason Bateman, Melanie Lynskey, J.K. Simmons', 'R', 'Corporate downsizing expert Ryan Bingham spends his life in planes, airports, and hotels, but just as he’s about to reach a milestone of ten million frequent flyer miles, he meets a woman who causes him to rethink his transient life.', 'Corporate downsizing expert Ryan Bingham spends his life in planes, airports, and hotels, but just as he’s about to reach a milestone of ten million frequent flyer miles, he meets a woman who causes him to rethink his transient life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/useGH8nfwlaHK44IWEZdUYJOE2N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22947'),
  ('44303939970591892', 'Up in the World', 1956, 'Comedy', 'John Paddy Carstairs', 'Peter Blackmore, Jack Davis, Henry Blyth', 'Norman Wisdom, Maureen Swanson, Jerry Desmonde, Michael Caridia, Colin Gordon, Ambrosine Phillpotts, Michael Ward, Jill Dixon', null, 'Norman is a window cleaner who has to clean a manor house with hundreds of windows. He is distracted by the son of the house who persuades him to go into town. When some villains try and kidnap the young heir Norman fights them off but the heir has banged his head and can''t remember Norman''s heroic stand', 'Norman is a window cleaner who has to clean a manor house with hundreds of windows. He is distracted by the son of the house who persuades him to go into town. When some villains try and kidnap the young heir Norman fights them off but the heir has banged his head and can''t remember Norman''s heroic stand', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/weIEN7tqG0A6sGQv3HFuYcaZISk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38389'),
  ('285950001075638364', 'Up Periscope', 1959, 'War, Adventure, Action', 'Gordon Douglas, Carl E. Guthrie, C.M. Florance', 'Richard H. Landau', 'James Garner, Edmond O''Brien, Andra Martin, Alan Hale Jr., Carleton Carpenter, Frank Gifford, William Leslie, Richard Bakalyan', 'NR', 'Lieutenant Braden discovers that Sally, the woman he''s been falling in love with, has actually been checking out his qualifications to be a U.S. Navy frogman. He must put his personal life behind him after being assigned to be smuggled into a Japanese-held island via submarine to photograph radio codes.', 'Lieutenant Braden discovers that Sally, the woman he''s been falling in love with, has actually been checking out his qualifications to be a U.S. Navy frogman. He must put his personal life behind him after being assigned to be smuggled into a Japanese-held island via submarine to photograph radio codes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1t0Zo7y4L7PSJV1T5K5JM8HFQqw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18146'),
  ('108400308596360073', 'Up Pompeii', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Bob Kellett, Allan James, Thelma Graves', 'Sid Colin', 'Frankie Howerd, Patrick Cargill, Bill Fraser, Michael Hordern, Barbara Murray, Lance Percival, Adrienne Posta, Bernard Bresslaw', null, 'A funny thing happens to Lurcio on the way to the rent-a-vestal-virgin market stall. A mysterious scroll falls into his hands, listing the names of all the conspirators plotting to murder Emperor Nero. And when the upstart slave is elected to infiltrate the ringleader''s den, the comical ups-and-downs lead to total uproar.', 'A funny thing happens to Lurcio on the way to the rent-a-vestal-virgin market stall. A mysterious scroll falls into his hands, listing the names of all the conspirators plotting to murder Emperor Nero. And when the upstart slave is elected to infiltrate the ringleader''s den, the comical ups-and-downs lead to total uproar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bF0tIIRMhul0oYEb1Av4nusAc3L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32116'),
  ('573494303392654513', 'Up the Academy', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Robert Downey Sr., Harry Stradling Jr.', 'Tom Patchett, Jay Tarses', 'Ralph Macchio, Wendell Brown, Tommy Citera, Hutch Parker, Harry Teinowitz, Tom Poston, Antonio Fargas, Stacey Nelkin', 'R', 'Four boys are sent, for different reasons, to a Military Academy. The life of discipline asks a lot of the four geeks. Of course these boys know how to make a party out of the hard times. Will they be "real men" after one year.', 'Four boys are sent, for different reasons, to a Military Academy. The life of discipline asks a lot of the four geeks. Of course these boys know how to make a party out of the hard times. Will they be "real men" after one year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAV7DzHETyijMY2AsRSzoIcIxoj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33670'),
  ('465072868747728247', 'Up the Chastity Belt', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Bob Kellett, Ian Wilson, Mike Gowans', 'Sid Colin, Ray Galton, Alan Simpson', 'Frankie Howerd, Graham Crowden, Bill Fraser, Roy Hudd, Hugh Paddick, Anna Quayle, Fred Emney, Dave King', null, 'A funny thing happened to Lurkalot, serf to Sir Coward de Custard, on the way to Custard Castle. Lurkalot sells lusty love potions and rusty chastity belts in the market place, but on this day Sir Graggart de Bombast arrives to sack the castle, and to get the lovely Lobelia Custard in the sack! Lurkalot must help Custard cream the knight in pining armour...', 'A funny thing happened to Lurkalot, serf to Sir Coward de Custard, on the way to Custard Castle. Lurkalot sells lusty love potions and rusty chastity belts in the market place, but on this day Sir Graggart de Bombast arrives to sack the castle, and to get the lovely Lobelia Custard in the sack! Lurkalot must help Custard cream the knight in pining armour...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HzZHrVP3ILpDKsJlnEoIsPZ0s9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24144'),
  ('850761760713033775', 'Up the Creek', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Robert Butler, James Glennon, Roger Shearman Jr.', 'Jim Kouf', 'Tim Matheson, Dan Monahan, Sandy Helberg, Stephen Furst, Blaine Novak, Jeff East, Will Bledsoe, Grant Wilson', 'R', 'Bob McGraw is in his 12th year of college, goofing his way through life. Bob, Irwing, Gonzer and Max are the four losers forced and bribed to represent their university in an intercollegiate raft race. Forced and bribed into this role, they make some friends, the lovely Heather Merriweather, but mostly enemies, among others a whole team of marines, and preppy IVY-leaguers determined to win.', 'Bob McGraw is in his 12th year of college, goofing his way through life. Bob, Irwing, Gonzer and Max are the four losers forced and bribed to represent their university in an intercollegiate raft race. Forced and bribed into this role, they make some friends, the lovely Heather Merriweather, but mostly enemies, among others a whole team of marines, and preppy IVY-leaguers determined to win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNk9qVfIkLu7r1QCSONnhIMMHhR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28692'),
  ('652539450420196037', 'Up the Down Staircase', 1967, 'Drama', 'Robert Mulligan, Don Kranze, Joseph F. Coffey', 'Tad Mosel', 'Sandy Dennis, Patrick Bedford, Eileen Heckart, Ruth White, Jean Stapleton, Sorrell Booke, Roy Poole, Florence Stanley', 'NR', 'Sylvia, a novice schoolteacher, is hired to teach English in a high school, but she’s met with an apathetic faculty, a delinquent student body and an administration that drowns its staff in paperwork. The following days go from bad to worse as Sylvia struggles to reach her most troubled students.', 'Sylvia, a novice schoolteacher, is hired to teach English in a high school, but she’s met with an apathetic faculty, a delinquent student body and an administration that drowns its staff in paperwork. The following days go from bad to worse as Sylvia struggles to reach her most troubled students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYhmhTdltV030QvotEqiVx9I1L3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42713'),
  ('383254017705619135', 'Up the Front', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Bob Kellett, Tony Spratling', 'Sid Colin, Eddie Braben', 'Frankie Howerd, Hermione Baddeley, Robert Coote, Bill Fraser, Lance Percival, Dora Bryan, Peter Bull, Jonathan Cecil', null, 'In Frankie Howerd''s third Up... film it''s World War I and he plays Lurk, an absolute cowerd, er coward. He''s evading the call-up for all he''s worth. But one evening he''s hypnotised by a drunken hypnotist (Stanley Holloway) into being brave, but he fails to be released from it. So with his yellow streak gone Lurk is down that army office before you can say "titter ye not." Off to war he goes, mingling with sexy spies like Zsa Zsa Gabor and before long, the spellbound recruit is heading hot-foot back to Blighty with the Germans'' plan of attack tattooed on his bum, and the Germans are bringing up the rear...! Full of sauce, knowing real-life references and witty remarks to camera, this is a cheeky incorrigible final instalment.', 'In Frankie Howerd''s third Up... film it''s World War I and he plays Lurk, an absolute cowerd, er coward. He''s evading the call-up for all he''s worth. But one evening he''s hypnotised by a drunken hypnotist (Stanley Holloway) into being brave, but he fails to be released from it. So with his yellow streak gone Lurk is down that army office before you can say "titter ye not." Off to war he goes, mingling with sexy spies like Zsa Zsa Gabor and before long, the spellbound recruit is heading hot-foot back to Blighty with the Germans'' plan of attack tattooed on his bum, and the Germans are bringing up the rear...! Full of sauce, knowing real-life references and witty remarks to camera, this is a cheeky incorrigible final instalment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKKZRuOGnAojcbcyqP79RnCZZ1c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48220'),
  ('642031151771459131', 'Up the Junction', 1968, 'Drama', 'Peter Collinson, Arthur Lavis, Tony Spratling', 'Roger Smith', 'Suzy Kendall, Dennis Waterman, Maureen Lipman, Adrienne Posta, Liz Fraser, Linda Cole, Doreen Herrington, Jessie Robins', 'R', 'A young woman trades her upper-class existence for a new life in an economically depressed suburb of London.', 'A young woman trades her upper-class existence for a new life in an economically depressed suburb of London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOQqU0xdqx1zWRrsGwcLzcxCKi3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47069'),
  ('72229625393534849', 'Up the Mountain', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Sébastien Betbeder', 'Sébastien Betbeder', 'William Lebghil, Izïa Higelin, Bastien Bouillon, Jérémie Elkaïm, Guillaume Labbé, François Chattot, Rabah Nait Oufella, Pauline Lorillard', null, 'Hugo, Stan and Bérénice grew up together then grew apart. They were inseparable. Fifteen years later, they meet again as adults. But life has been tough on them. Will they reignite the crazy sparks of their childhood ?', 'Hugo, Stan and Bérénice grew up together then grew apart. They were inseparable. Fifteen years later, they meet again as adults. But life has been tough on them. Will they reignite the crazy sparks of their childhood ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uH8wtIqY8SN7bHTfpDLzbyFNKUo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612655'),
