  ('368463647438542450', 'Up to the World', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alessandro Lunardelli', null, 'Luca Marinelli, Filippo Scicchitano, Alfredo Castro, Barbora Bobuľová, Manuela Martelli, Eradis Josende Oberto, Carlo Alberto Cravino', null, 'Davide and Loris are brothers and live in a very small village in the north of Italy. While Davide is eighteen years old and gay, Loris is almost thirty and doesn''t know anything about his brother''s sexuality.', 'Davide and Loris are brothers and live in a very small village in the north of Italy. While Davide is eighteen years old and gay, Loris is almost thirty and doesn''t know anything about his brother''s sexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1aemUgsUM4SLN2m5hO0zGJqA0k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267635'),
  ('584088990660298860', 'Up to You', 2018, 'Romance', 'Hideo Jojo, Takehiko Tamiya', 'Hitoshi Ishikawa, Hideo Jojo', 'Katsuya Maiguma, Mio Sugiyama, Aika Yukihira, Yurisa, Chiharu Yamane, Sasa Handa, Hideo Sakaki, Ishida Yoshihisa', null, 'There is a man who has many sex slaves. Another man offers his wife as a sex slave to him and the slave owner agrees. He adds the man''s wife to his stable. Alas, the husband comes to reverse his decision and takes his wife back. The reversal of the arrangement causes trauma.', 'There is a man who has many sex slaves. Another man offers his wife as a sex slave to him and the slave owner agrees. He adds the man''s wife to his stable. Alas, the husband comes to reverse his decision and takes his wife back. The reversal of the arrangement causes trauma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8aRDyyaGabApbwHTouQVRfeq6nu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592741'),
