  ('154540190465532342', 'Up-to-Date Spiritualism', 1900, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'In this subject a "comique eccentric" enters the drawing room inhabited by spirits. He tries to take off his coat and hat, but these garments return to his head and shoulders as soon as he takes them off. The chairs, his umbrella, his hat, etc., fly away in different directions and by various methods. (Star Film Catalog)', 'In this subject a "comique eccentric" enters the drawing room inhabited by spirits. He tries to take off his coat and hat, but these garments return to his head and shoulders as soon as he takes them off. The chairs, his umbrella, his hat, etc., fly away in different directions and by various methods. (Star Film Catalog)', null, 'tmdb:movie:106804'),
  ('1127746060296975217', 'Up, Down and Sideways', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Andreas Sinanos, Mihalis Kakogiannis', 'Mihalis Kakogiannis', 'Irene Papas, Stratos Tzortzoglou, Panos Mihalopoulos, Eleni Gerasimidou, Elda Panopoulou, Antonis Zaharatos, Takis Zaharatos, Christos Efthimiou', null, 'A prosperous widow with a gay son falls for a young gym instructor in Athens.', 'A prosperous widow with a gay son falls for a young gym instructor in Athens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pi37ojGpWL9KfhsITmjccHWcYzX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358425'),
