  ('279406045855295880', 'Upendra', 1999, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Upendra', 'Upendra', 'Upendra, Damini, Prema, Raveena Tandon, Arun Govil, Gurukiran, Sarojamma, V. Manohar', null, 'Naanu, who always speaks the truth, is married to Swathi. However, he is soon pursued by Rathi and is forced to accept her love but finds it difficult to let go of his obsession with Keerthi.', 'Naanu, who always speaks the truth, is married to Swathi. However, he is soon pursued by Rathi and is forced to accept her love but finds it difficult to let go of his obsession with Keerthi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZINEcYPJp8XOlsw2emyFuKgEOb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286110'),
  ('555765045343768859', 'Upgrade', 2018, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Leigh Whannell, Karen Mahood, Marina Bonofiglio', 'Leigh Whannell', 'Logan Marshall-Green, Betty Gabriel, Harrison Gilbertson, Melanie Vallejo, Benedict Hardie, Linda Cropper, Simon Maiden, Steve Danielsen', 'R', 'A brutal mugging leaves Grey Trace paralyzed in the hospital and his beloved wife dead. A billionaire inventor soon offers Trace a cure — an artificial intelligence implant called STEM that will enhance his body. Now able to walk, Grey finds that he also has superhuman strength and agility — skills he uses to seek revenge against the thugs who destroyed his life.', 'A brutal mugging leaves Grey Trace paralyzed in the hospital and his beloved wife dead. A billionaire inventor soon offers Trace a cure — an artificial intelligence implant called STEM that will enhance his body. Now able to walk, Grey finds that he also has superhuman strength and agility — skills he uses to seek revenge against the thugs who destroyed his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woLGROUdPWdBnLVFKYdGD3kFkPY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500664'),
  ('937257932806463912', 'Upgraded', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Carlson Young, Mike Stern Sterzyński, Richard Bevan', 'Christine Lenig, Justin Matthews, Luke Spencer Roberts', 'Camila Mendes, Archie Renaux, Marisa Tomei, Lena Olin, Anthony Stewart Head, Thomas Kretschmann, Grégory Montel, Rachel Matthews', 'R', 'Ana is an ambitious intern dreaming of a career in the art world while trying to impress her demanding boss Claire. When she''s upgraded to first class on a work trip, she meets handsome Will, and Ana pretends to be her boss– a white lie that sets off a glamorous chain of events, romance and opportunity, until her fib threatens to surface.', 'Ana is an ambitious intern dreaming of a career in the art world while trying to impress her demanding boss Claire. When she''s upgraded to first class on a work trip, she meets handsome Will, and Ana pretends to be her boss– a white lie that sets off a glamorous chain of events, romance and opportunity, until her fib threatens to surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhOXS17gRpTwA85WsZLlYFK3rz0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1014590'),
  ('690104215649899947', 'Upon Entry', 2023, 'Drama', 'Alejandro Rojas, Juan Sebastián Vásquez, Juan Sebastián Vásquez', 'Juan Sebastián Vásquez, Alejandro Rojas', 'Alberto Ammann, Bruna Cusí, Ben Temple, Laura Gómez, Colin Morgan, Gerard Oms, Nuris Blu, David Comrie', null, 'Diego, a Venezuelan urbanist, and Elena, a contemporary dancer from Barcelona, move to the United States with their approved visas to start a new life. Their intention is to boost their professional careers and start a family in ''the land of opportunities''. But upon entering New York airport''s immigration area, they are taken to the secondary inspection room, where border officers will subject them to an unpleasant inspection process and a psychologically grueling interrogation.', 'Diego, a Venezuelan urbanist, and Elena, a contemporary dancer from Barcelona, move to the United States with their approved visas to start a new life. Their intention is to boost their professional careers and start a family in ''the land of opportunities''. But upon entering New York airport''s immigration area, they are taken to the secondary inspection room, where border officers will subject them to an unpleasant inspection process and a psychologically grueling interrogation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpIoYLy0S3wIOKU8qbyYGa9Wg4h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1051547'),
  ('212030754607152696', 'Upon Open Sky', 2024, 'Drama', 'Julián Apezteguia, Mariana Arriaga, Santiago Arriaga', 'Guillermo Arriaga', 'Theo Goldin, Máximo Hollander, Federica Garcia, Julio Cesar Cedillo, Sergio Mayer Mori, Cecilia Suárez, Julio Bracho, Manolo Cardona', null, 'Two teen brothers and their newly-met stepsister take a road trip to the Mexico-U.S. border in a tense revenge journey to track down the man responsible for the accident that caused their father''s death.', 'Two teen brothers and their newly-met stepsister take a road trip to the Mexico-U.S. border in a tense revenge journey to track down the man responsible for the accident that caused their father''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KIHYn1ggV4m29QsThEpnSGOFph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1156151'),
  ('677859927938790313', 'Upon the Magic Roads', 2021, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Yakov Bashta, Nikita Esipov, Anna Zobova', 'Alexey Borodachev, Oleg Pogodin', 'Anton Shagin, Pavel Derevyanko, Mikhail Efremov, Paulina Andreeva, Yan Tsapnik, Oleg Taktarov, Lyaysan Utyasheva, Aleksandr Semchev', null, 'Romantic John the Fool and his friend Foal set out on a series of unpredictable adventures in different magical worlds. The two buddies will have to outsmart an evil tyrant king, catch the firebird, and find John’s true love.', 'Romantic John the Fool and his friend Foal set out on a series of unpredictable adventures in different magical worlds. The two buddies will have to outsmart an evil tyrant king, catch the firebird, and find John’s true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kY4tmwZaBZitnDRcWFp3Wy197Um.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576784'),
  ('54379739920692081', 'Upper Egyptian in the American University', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Saeed Hamed, Moustafa Ezz El Din, Ahmed Samir Farag', 'Medhat El Adl', 'Mohamed Henedi, Tarek Lotfy, Ahmed Al Saqqa, Mona Zaki, Ghada Adel, Hani Ramzy, Fathy Abdel Wahab, Amira Fathy', null, 'Khalaf, a bumpkin southern Egyptian wins a scholarship to study at the American University in Cairo where students - many from Cairo''s upper class - are known for their Americanized attitudes.', 'Khalaf, a bumpkin southern Egyptian wins a scholarship to study at the American University in Cairo where students - many from Cairo''s upper class - are known for their Americanized attitudes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oLdJ9SiQ6DgwXDh0a6aLfr7tGID.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183387'),
  ('725331944749967223', 'Uppercase Print', 2020, 'Drama, History', 'Cristina Iliescu, Radu Jude, Marius Panduru', 'Radu Jude, Gianina Cărbunariu', 'Bogdan Zamfir, Serban Lazarovici, Ioana Iacob, Șerban Pavlu, Alexandru Potocean, Silvian Vâlcu, Doru Catanescu, Constantin Dogioiu', null, 'In 1981, chalk slogans written in uppercase letters started appearing in public spaces in the Romanian city of Botoşani. They demanded freedom, alluded to the democratic developments taking place in Romania’s socialist sister countries or simply called for improvements in the food supply. Mugur Călinescu was behind them, who was still at school at the time and whose case is documented in the files of the Romanian secret police. Theatre director Gianina Cărbunariu created a documentary play based on this material.', 'In 1981, chalk slogans written in uppercase letters started appearing in public spaces in the Romanian city of Botoşani. They demanded freedom, alluded to the democratic developments taking place in Romania’s socialist sister countries or simply called for improvements in the food supply. Mugur Călinescu was behind them, who was still at school at the time and whose case is documented in the files of the Romanian secret police. Theatre director Gianina Cărbunariu created a documentary play based on this material.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/652ha5ZS65K5S31Llvohbcl5cIn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655368'),
  ('302168207717334232', 'Upperdog', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sara Johnsen, Lisa Marie Gamlem, Daniel Malmén', 'Sara Johnsen', 'Hermann Sabado, Agnieszka Grochowska, Mads Sjøgård Pettersen, Bang Chau, Magnus Bjørnstad, Yngvild Støen Grotmol, Ole Paus, Birgitte Victoria Svendsen', null, 'As young children, half-siblings Axel and Yanne are adopted to Norway. They are separated on arrival, him to material wealth on Oslo''s west side, her to an average family on the east side. In contrast to her younger brother, Yanne remembers their journey to Norway, but she has no idea where he might be now.', 'As young children, half-siblings Axel and Yanne are adopted to Norway. They are separated on arrival, him to material wealth on Oslo''s west side, her to an average family on the east side. In contrast to her younger brother, Yanne remembers their journey to Norway, but she has no idea where he might be now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KSp6EzRRpK6YTLk6aE17RgzC8w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30019'),
  ('911019090105722050', 'Uprising', 2001, 'Drama, History, War, TV Movie', 'Jon Avnet, Denis Lenoir', 'Paul Brickman, Jon Avnet', 'Leelee Sobieski, Hank Azaria, David Schwimmer, Jon Voight, Donald Sutherland, Stephen Moyer, Sadie Frost, Radha Mitchell', null, 'In the Warsaw ghetto in 1943, Jews rise against the Nazis.', 'In the Warsaw ghetto in 1943, Jews rise against the Nazis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Sl2XSNE4qW9rJ7zB80wqLxPfWf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31010'),
  ('673042311041517805', 'Uprising', 2024, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Kim Sang-man, Ju Sung-lim, Choi Jong-ha', 'Park Chan-wook, Shin Chul', 'Gang Dong-won, Park Jeong-min, Cha Seung-won, Kim Shin-rock, Jin Sun-kyu, Jung Sung-il, Jeon Bae-soo, Cho Han-cheul', 'R', 'In the Joseon Dynasty, two friends who grew up together — one the master and one the servant — reunite post-war as enemies on opposing sides.', 'In the Joseon Dynasty, two friends who grew up together — one the master and one the servant — reunite post-war as enemies on opposing sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hg9OeaCRSpazrfqYyEFr6BDaZW8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1075676'),
  ('401528488685388637', 'Uproar', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Paul Middleditch, Hamish Bennett, Maria Ines Manchego', 'Sonia Whiteman, Hamish Bennett', 'Julian Dennison, Minnie Driver, Rhys Darby, James Rolleston, Erana James, Ihaka Kelly, Mabelle Dennison, Jada Fa’atui', 'PG-13', 'A 17 year-old student is forced to get off the fence he has actively sat on all his life to stand up for himself, his whanau (family) and his future in this heartwarming story of identity.', 'A 17 year-old student is forced to get off the fence he has actively sat on all his life to stand up for himself, his whanau (family) and his future in this heartwarming story of identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEUXofAigr4I2qlt9PpLXIluQwD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1035253'),
  ('1056081260290047896', 'Ups ''n Downs', 1931, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Rudolf Ising, Hugh Harman', null, 'Johnny Murray, Carman Maxwell', null, 'Bosko runs a hot dog stand at an amusement park; but Bosko sneaks away to the racetrack to ride his mechanical horse.', 'Bosko runs a hot dog stand at an amusement park; but Bosko sneaks away to the racetrack to ride his mechanical horse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34Anh5XeADU46T9eXuTBjhC4H1N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162736'),
  ('1106037522807420959', 'Upside Down', 2012, 'Romance, Science Fiction, Drama, Fantasy', 'Juan Diego Solanas, Isabelle Guay, Pierre Gill', 'Juan Diego Solanas', 'Kirsten Dunst, Jim Sturgess, Timothy Spall, James Kidnie, Holly Uloth, Blu Mankuma, Nicholas Rose, Vlasta Vrana', 'PG-13', 'In an alternate universe where twinned worlds have opposite gravities, a young man battles interplanetary prejudice and the laws of physics in his quest to reunite with the long-lost girl of his dreams in this visually stunning romantic adventure that poses the question: what if love was stronger than gravity?', 'In an alternate universe where twinned worlds have opposite gravities, a young man battles interplanetary prejudice and the laws of physics in his quest to reunite with the long-lost girl of his dreams in this visually stunning romantic adventure that poses the question: what if love was stronger than gravity?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wImo0dC72HRoI5QO85dGavmxW6q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58244'),
  ('829189447274266224', 'Upside-Down Magic', 2020, 'Fantasy, Family, TV Movie', 'Angelique Christophorou, Joe Nussbaum', null, 'Izabela Rose, Siena Agudong, Kyle Howard, Max Torina, Elie Samouhi, Alison Fernández, Vicki Lewis, Cynthia Kaye McWilliams', 'G', 'Nory and her best friend Reina enter the Sage Academy for Magical Studies, where Nory’s unconventional powers land her in a class for those with wonky, or “upside-down,” magic. Undaunted, Nory sets out to prove that that upside-down magic can be just as powerful as right-side-up.', 'Nory and her best friend Reina enter the Sage Academy for Magical Studies, where Nory’s unconventional powers land her in a class for those with wonky, or “upside-down,” magic. Undaunted, Nory sets out to prove that that upside-down magic can be just as powerful as right-side-up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2MfnMmFzGvRvjGVLIuyx3R16a6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671583'),
  ('374665832348924685', 'Upstream', 2024, 'Drama', 'Xu Zheng, Zeng Jian, Zhao Nan', 'Xu Zheng, He Keke', 'Xu Zheng, Xin Zhilei, Wang Xiao, Jia Bing, Feng Bing, Ding Yongdai, Ding Jiali, Helen Chen', null, 'A moment of impulsiveness turns Gao Zhilei into a "stay-at-home" individual, but he never expected his life to take a turn in the opposite direction. A series of changes compel him to take on his responsibilities as the head of the family. When life''s burdens hit hard, he must confront himself and start anew.', 'A moment of impulsiveness turns Gao Zhilei into a "stay-at-home" individual, but he never expected his life to take a turn in the opposite direction. A series of changes compel him to take on his responsibilities as the head of the family. When life''s burdens hit hard, he must confront himself and start anew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxgOFXxwi2AkCEZbr795aQJYNKX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1274925'),
  ('371513225687063863', 'Upstream Color', 2013, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Shane Carruth', 'Shane Carruth', 'Amy Seimetz, Shane Carruth, Andrew Sensenig, Thiago Martins, Carolyn King, Mollie Milligan, Myles McGee, Ashton Miramontes', 'NR', 'A man and woman are drawn together, entangled in the lifecycle of an ageless organism. Identity becomes an illusion as they struggle to assemble the loose fragments of wrecked lives.', 'A man and woman are drawn together, entangled in the lifecycle of an ageless organism. Identity becomes an illusion as they struggle to assemble the loose fragments of wrecked lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQ4IWxSYIgZVWnQwLCG8r6sUraU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145197'),
