  ('81596903496346507', 'Uranus', 1990, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Claude Berri, Renato Berta', 'Arlette Langmann, Claude Berri', 'Michel Blanc, Gérard Depardieu, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Philippe Noiret, Michel Galabru, Gérard Desarthe, Danièle Lebrun, Fabrice Luchini', null, 'After World War II, a small French village struggles to put the war behind as the controlling Communist Party tries to flush out Petain loyalists. The local bar owner, a simple man who likes to write poetry, who only wants to be left alone to do his job, becomes a target for Communist harassment as they try and locate a particular loyalist, and he pushes back.', 'After World War II, a small French village struggles to put the war behind as the controlling Communist Party tries to flush out Petain loyalists. The local bar owner, a simple man who likes to write poetry, who only wants to be left alone to do his job, becomes a target for Communist harassment as they try and locate a particular loyalist, and he pushes back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7TQmoUsKYY7UP9rDfZiXyY4Fm6X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41930'),
  ('1094971371462992938', 'Uranus 2324', 2024, 'Romance, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Thanadol Nuansut, Arnon Chunprasert, Adirek Phothong', 'Thitipong Chaisati, Nut Nualpang, Thanadol Nuansut', 'Sarocha Chankimha, Becky Armstrong, Torfan Taweema, Siriam Pakdeedumrongrit, Amarin Nitipon, Ninnart Sinchai, So Takei, Usha Seamkhum', null, 'Bonded in their youth and separated by tragedy, an astronaut and a free diver bend the laws of space and time in their efforts to be together again.', 'Bonded in their youth and separated by tragedy, an astronaut and a free diver bend the laws of space and time in their efforts to be together again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTD9HytRG1nfP5pdOAYmPyXj05d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1167366'),
  ('145950981931557816', 'Uranya', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Costas Kapakas, Stefano Falivene', 'Costas Kapakas', 'Aris Tsapis, Maria Grazia Cucinotta, Dimitris Piatas, Manolis Mavromatakis, Dina Mihailidou, Taxiarhis Hanos, Tasos Palatzidis, Giorgos Souxes', null, 'A group of young boys must decide whether to buy a TV set to watch the launch of Apollo 11 or visit Uranya to learn about the secrets of love.', 'A group of young boys must decide whether to buy a TV set to watch the launch of Apollo 11 or visit Uranya to learn about the secrets of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/luktB4GWM4Pk9Q01uBRJjfk9EGO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47017'),
  ('305548226179253470', 'Urban Cowboy', 1980, 'Drama, Romance, Western', 'James Bridges, Reynaldo Villalobos, Ida Random', 'James Bridges, Aaron Latham', 'John Travolta, Debra Winger, Scott Glenn, Madolyn Smith Osborne, Barry Corbin, Brooke Alderson, Cooper Huckabee, James Gammon', 'PG', 'After moving to Pasadena, Texas, country boy Bud Davis starts hanging around a bar called Gilley''s, where he falls in love with Sissy, a cowgirl who believes the sexes are equal. They eventually marry, but their relationship is turbulent due to Bud''s traditional view of gender roles. Jealousy over his rival leads to their separation, but Bud attempts to win Sissy back by triumphing at Gilley''s mechanical bull-riding competition.', 'After moving to Pasadena, Texas, country boy Bud Davis starts hanging around a bar called Gilley''s, where he falls in love with Sissy, a cowgirl who believes the sexes are equal. They eventually marry, but their relationship is turbulent due to Bud''s traditional view of gender roles. Jealousy over his rival leads to their separation, but Bud attempts to win Sissy back by triumphing at Gilley''s mechanical bull-riding competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2uKWi1Hb6yqkmOixRgKVwrzxljA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17496'),
  ('685730689161659125', 'Urban Explorer', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Andy Fetscher, Peter Fuchs, Andy Fetscher', 'Martin Thau', 'Nathalie Kelley, Klaus Stiglmeier, Nick Eversman, Catherine de Léan, Max Riemelt, Brenda Koo, Adolfo Assor, Johannes Klaußner', null, 'Anxious to explore the mysterious hidden world under metropolitan Berlin, an international group of four urban explorers hires a local guide, Kris, who leads them into the maze of escape tunnels and subterranean fortifications under the city. When their guide has a bad fall, two of the girls in the group frantically set off to seek help while Denis, the young American, stays behind. Armin, a former East German border guard suddenly appears from nowhere. Out of sheer desperation, Denis allows Armin to lead them and their unconscious guide to safety and it is at this moment that Denis realizes he has just made the biggest mistake of his life!', 'Anxious to explore the mysterious hidden world under metropolitan Berlin, an international group of four urban explorers hires a local guide, Kris, who leads them into the maze of escape tunnels and subterranean fortifications under the city. When their guide has a bad fall, two of the girls in the group frantically set off to seek help while Denis, the young American, stays behind. Armin, a former East German border guard suddenly appears from nowhere. Out of sheer desperation, Denis allows Armin to lead them and their unconscious guide to safety and it is at this moment that Denis realizes he has just made the biggest mistake of his life!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mywIDBRM7nsd34IdYTPU9siwEB9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73290'),
  ('242659798316329794', 'Urban Justice', 2007, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Don E. FauntLeRoy', 'Gilmar Fortis II', 'Steven Seagal, Eddie Griffin, Kirk B.R. Woller, Carmen Serano, Liezl Carstens, Cory Hart, Jade Yorker, Jermaine Washington', 'R', 'Seagal plays a man with a dark and violent past, who seeks revenge for the murder of his son.', 'Seagal plays a man with a dark and violent past, who seeks revenge for the murder of his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owBmON7qbru3VvV6AaorgtXhMmF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17317'),
  ('651480245491434206', 'Urban Legend', 1998, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Jamie Blanks, James Chressanthis, John MacNeil', 'Silvio Horta', 'Alicia Witt, Jared Leto, Rebecca Gayheart, Michael Rosenbaum, Loretta Devine, Tara Reid, John Neville, Joshua Jackson', 'R', 'A college campus is plagued by a vicious serial killer murdering students in ways that correspond to various urban legends.', 'A college campus is plagued by a vicious serial killer murdering students in ways that correspond to various urban legends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUvZDNU9G0njhM628NA5phASntq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9877'),
  ('98423317421610121', 'Urban Legends: Bloody Mary', 2005, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Ian Fox, Mary Lambert, Sanford Hampton', 'Dan Harris, Michael Dougherty', 'Kate Mara, Robert Vito, Tina Lifford, Ed Marinaro, Michael Coe, Lillith Fields, Nancy Everhard, Audra Lea Keener', 'R', 'On a prom-night dare, a trio of high school friends chant an incantation, unleashing an evil spirit from the past with deadly consequences.', 'On a prom-night dare, a trio of high school friends chant an incantation, unleashing an evil spirit from the past with deadly consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Avlo5JZOBXWx4oymtkXfCaomV5Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10292'),
  ('988920407560512492', 'Urban Legends: Final Cut', 2000, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Brian Pearson, John Ottman, Michael Zenon', 'Paul Harris Boardman, Scott Derrickson', 'Jennifer Morrison, Matthew Davis, Hart Bochner, Loretta Devine, Joey Lawrence, Anson Mount, Jessica Cauffiel, Anthony Anderson', 'R', 'The making of a horror movie takes on a terrifying reality for students at the most prestigious film school in the country. At Alpine University, someone is determined to win the best film award at any cost - even if it means eliminating the competition. No one is safe and everyone is a suspect.', 'The making of a horror movie takes on a terrifying reality for students at the most prestigious film school in the country. At Alpine University, someone is determined to win the best film award at any cost - even if it means eliminating the competition. No one is safe and everyone is a suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kjGrnhMz37RYEd5BFcrU1qkPkl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12212'),
  ('1090279665837164655', 'Urban Menace', 1999, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Albert Pyun', 'Andrew Markell, Tim Story, Albert Pyun', 'Snoop Dogg, Big Pun, Ice-T, Fat Joe, T.J. Storm, Vincent Klyn, Romany Malco, Tahitia Hicks', 'R', 'An insane preacher seeks retribution from the local crime syndicate for the violent death of his family and the burning of his church in a horrendous ghetto crime spree.', 'An insane preacher seeks retribution from the local crime syndicate for the violent death of his family and the burning of his church in a horrendous ghetto crime spree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWYikMOOfGm2fMuEHJu5JbdTl3y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109466'),
  ('504269489865331245', 'Urban Myths', 2022, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Hong Won-ki', 'Kang Ji-yoon, Gyeong Min-seon', 'Kim Do-yoon, Lee Yul-eum, Lee Ho-won, ARIN, Lee Soo-min, Jung Won-chang, Exy, Seola', null, 'Deals with the vivid everyday life horrors that can be easily encountered in familiar places around subjects like noise between floors, secondhand furniture, mannequins, and social media.', 'Deals with the vivid everyday life horrors that can be easily encountered in familiar places around subjects like noise between floors, secondhand furniture, mannequins, and social media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kram9qbCVEe66ybYFIJgMYaWJ91.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957154'),
  ('1133245179210363233', 'Urbania', 2000, 'Drama, Romance, Mystery, Horror', 'Jon Matthews, Shane F. Kelly', 'Jon Matthews, Daniel Reitz', 'Dan Futterman, Sam Ball, Alan Cumming, Lothaire Bluteau, Josh Hamilton, Matt Keeslar, James Simon, Megan Dodds', 'R', 'A series of urban legends take place around the life of a troubled man who is searching New York City for a mysterious stranger.', 'A series of urban legends take place around the life of a troubled man who is searching New York City for a mysterious stranger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bl2RsU7kzOm1AjZhCBepCxuFToY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77332'),
  ('211907153319507502', 'Urbanized', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Gary Hustwit, Luke Geissbühler', null, 'Norman Foster, Jan Gehl, Ellen Dunham-Jones, Amanda M. Burden, Joshua David, Oscar Niemeyer, Sicelo Nkohla, Rem Koolhaas', 'NR', 'A documentary about the design of cities, which looks at the issues and strategies behind urban design and features some of the world''s foremost architects, planners, policymakers, builders, and thinkers.', 'A documentary about the design of cities, which looks at the issues and strategies behind urban design and features some of the world''s foremost architects, planners, policymakers, builders, and thinkers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AlgE2Xj02j2Bb75eYfgDuPCzev2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77269'),
  ('365299783901679934', 'Urchin', 2025, 'Drama', 'Harris Dickinson, Josée Deshaies, Toni Staples', 'Harris Dickinson', 'Frank Dillane, Megan Northam, Karyna Khymchuk, Shonagh Marie, Amr Waked, Claudia Jones, Shahzad Ali, Michael Quartey', 'NR', 'Mike, a rough sleeper in London, is trapped in a cycle of self-destruction as he attempts to turn his life around. Along the way, he encounters unexpected chances for a fresh start.', 'Mike, a rough sleeper in London, is trapped in a cycle of self-destruction as he attempts to turn his life around. Along the way, he encounters unexpected chances for a fresh start.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zc8n3hm3S2VxFxlNH1MNN28LVMa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1283320'),
  ('932099542742865703', 'Urge', 2016, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Lyle Vincent, Aaron Kaufman, Soren Miltich', 'Jerry Stahl', 'Pierce Brosnan, Justin Chatwin, Danny Masterson, Ashley Greene, Nick Thune, Alexis Knapp, Chris Geere, Bar Paly', 'R', 'A group of friends on holiday on an island experiment with a new designer drug that makes them lose their ability to control their urges.', 'A group of friends on holiday on an island experiment with a new designer drug that makes them lose their ability to control their urges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OxOFZcn1DRKeYrxtFoKUVGXIqk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353433'),
  ('108176736725287219', 'Urgence', 1985, 'Thriller', 'Gilles Béhat', null, 'Richard Berry, Fanny Bastien, Bernard-Pierre Donnadieu, Jean-François Balmer, Nathalie Courval, Thierry Carpentier, Catherine Allégret, Jean-Jacques Moreau', null, 'When a neo-Nazi group of terrorists is set to blow a pop concert off the face of the earth because it is an anti-racist benefit, they are faced with the intrepid Jean-Pierre Mougin, a macho sports reporter with zero tolerance for Nazi hate crimes. Going along with Mougin to stop the bombing is Lyza, whose brother was killed by this group of fascists, and so she is ardently seeking revenge. After Mougin gets his hands on a videotape that reveals the plot to blow up the concert and its audience, he and Lyza join forces. As the fuse gets shorter and shorter, Mougin is also joined by sympathetic street gangs. Thus reinforced, he faces his opposition (including crooked cops) in increasingly more desperate attempts to stop Murmeau, the leader of the Nazi gang, from carrying out his terrorist objective.', 'When a neo-Nazi group of terrorists is set to blow a pop concert off the face of the earth because it is an anti-racist benefit, they are faced with the intrepid Jean-Pierre Mougin, a macho sports reporter with zero tolerance for Nazi hate crimes. Going along with Mougin to stop the bombing is Lyza, whose brother was killed by this group of fascists, and so she is ardently seeking revenge. After Mougin gets his hands on a videotape that reveals the plot to blow up the concert and its audience, he and Lyza join forces. As the fuse gets shorter and shorter, Mougin is also joined by sympathetic street gangs. Thus reinforced, he faces his opposition (including crooked cops) in increasingly more desperate attempts to stop Murmeau, the leader of the Nazi gang, from carrying out his terrorist objective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlQc2r3h4hen7Iq1r4HZMprWZpS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217674'),
  ('410627208310368834', 'Urgences', 1988, 'Documentary', 'Raymond Depardon', null, null, null, 'A documentary filmed in the psychiatric ward of the Motel Dieu at a large hospital in Paris. The patients arrive on their own, or with considerable help from the police, but all of them are in need of medical attention.', 'A documentary filmed in the psychiatric ward of the Motel Dieu at a large hospital in Paris. The patients arrive on their own, or with considerable help from the police, but all of them are in need of medical attention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znKaghCTrUtRwM9nF8a6DilOaLU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37474'),
  ('348030440837134089', 'Urgh! A Music War', 1981, 'Music, Documentary', 'Derek Burbidge', null, 'Sting, Stewart Copeland, Andy Summers, Danny Elfman, Jello Biafra, Toyah Willcox, Stan Ridgway, John Cooper Clarke', 'R', 'Urgh! A Music War is a British film released in 1982 featuring performances by punk rock, new wave, and post-punk acts, filmed in 1980. Among the artists featured in the movie are Orchestral Manoeuvres in the Dark (OMD), Magazine, The Go-Go''s, Toyah Willcox, The Fleshtones, Joan Jett & the Blackhearts, X, XTC, Devo, The Cramps, Oingo Boingo, Dead Kennedys, Gary Numan, Klaus Nomi, Wall of Voodoo, Pere Ubu, Steel Pulse, Surf Punks, 999, UB40, Echo & the Bunnymen and The Police. These were many of the most popular groups on the New Wave scene; in keeping with the spirit of the scene, the film also features several less famous acts, and one completely obscure group, Invisible Sex, in what appears to be their only public performance.', 'Urgh! A Music War is a British film released in 1982 featuring performances by punk rock, new wave, and post-punk acts, filmed in 1980. Among the artists featured in the movie are Orchestral Manoeuvres in the Dark (OMD), Magazine, The Go-Go''s, Toyah Willcox, The Fleshtones, Joan Jett & the Blackhearts, X, XTC, Devo, The Cramps, Oingo Boingo, Dead Kennedys, Gary Numan, Klaus Nomi, Wall of Voodoo, Pere Ubu, Steel Pulse, Surf Punks, 999, UB40, Echo & the Bunnymen and The Police. These were many of the most popular groups on the New Wave scene; in keeping with the spirit of the scene, the film also features several less famous acts, and one completely obscure group, Invisible Sex, in what appears to be their only public performance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93k3sh03sjTLuX1av1yDqbuLtgO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34113'),
  ('287230105845421522', 'Uri: The Surgical Strike', 2019, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Aditya Dhar, Mitesh Mirchandani, Vicky Sidana', 'Aditya Dhar', 'Vicky Kaushal, Paresh Rawal, Yami Gautam Dhar, Mohit Raina, Kirti Kulhari, Dhairya Karwa, Manasi Parekh, Riva Arora', null, 'Following the roguish terrorist attacks at Uri Army Base camp in Kashmir, India takes the fight to the enemy, in its most successful covert operation till date with one and only one objective of avenging their fallen heroes.', 'Following the roguish terrorist attacks at Uri Army Base camp in Kashmir, India takes the fight to the enemy, in its most successful covert operation till date with one and only one objective of avenging their fallen heroes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNySAgpAnWmPpYinim9E0tUzJWG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554600'),
  ('256996257321637375', 'Uro', 2006, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Stefan Faldbakken, John Andreas Andersen', 'Harald Rosenløw-Eeg, Stefan Faldbakken', 'Nicolai Cleve Broch, Ane Dahl Torp, Ahmed Zeyan, Bjørn Floberg, Ingar Helge Gimle, Eivind Sander, Nicolas Bro, Thorsten Flinck', null, 'Turning his back on a delinquent past and joining the police force, HP is determined to start doing the right thing. Soon he finds himself trapped in a web of lies, stretching out from both sides of the law. HP soon realizes that his present mission is closely connected to his own past, and that everything he worked so hard to escape from, is coming back to haunt him.', 'Turning his back on a delinquent past and joining the police force, HP is determined to start doing the right thing. Soon he finds himself trapped in a web of lies, stretching out from both sides of the law. HP soon realizes that his present mission is closely connected to his own past, and that everything he worked so hard to escape from, is coming back to haunt him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1y62KpmX4HgyJlzB4eHXPTq8np0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37766'),
  ('251218865463265225', 'Ursa Minor Blue', 1993, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Shigeru Tamura', 'Shigeru Tamura', 'Ichiro Nagai, Shouhei Ayukawa, Isamu Tanonaka, Shinichi Tsuwa, Masaharu Sato', null, 'This adventurous story of a boy named Uri and an old man takes place in the cosmic Milky Way where the starfish live. This is the tale of their fantasy journey in search of the mysterious monster fish.', 'This adventurous story of a boy named Uri and an old man takes place in the cosmic Milky Way where the starfish live. This is the tale of their fantasy journey in search of the mysterious monster fish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVwfsi2LLxsDHuPYgSnVmKNR6M8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:305896'),
  ('154280764444605032', 'Ursula', 1961, 'Horror, Drama', 'Lloyd Michael Williams', null, 'Dorothea Griffin, Calvin Waters, Cathy Stewart, Barbara Moose, Brigitte Verbecq, Gérard Grégory', null, 'Young Ursula plays in a tree and ruins her fancy dress. Her elderly mother teaches her a cruel lesson about whether things can ever be mended; what Ursula learns about how to behave may not be what her mother intended.', 'Young Ursula plays in a tree and ruins her fancy dress. Her elderly mother teaches her a cruel lesson about whether things can ever be mended; what Ursula learns about how to behave may not be what her mother intended.', null, 'tmdb:movie:267587'),
  ('971115007364166147', 'Urusei Yatsura: Always My Darling', 1991, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Hitoshi Yamaguchi, Katsuhisa Yamada, Satoru Namekawa', 'Tomoko Konparu, Hideo Takayashiki', 'Toshio Furukawa, Fumi Hirano, Akira Kamiya, Shinnosuke Furumoto, Naoko Matsui, Noriko Ohara, Yuko Mita, Machiko Washio', null, 'Lupika, an alien princess, is in love with a tofu seller. To make him love her too (at least, announce his love. He obviously fears the social taboo of a tofu vendor marrying a princess), she needs to get a love potion, which is in a certain temple. Legend has it that the only person that can obtain this love potion is the most lecherous man in the universe. That man turns out to be Ataru Moroboshi. Lupika kidnaps Ataru to make him get the potion, and Lum and her friends go out to search for Ataru.', 'Lupika, an alien princess, is in love with a tofu seller. To make him love her too (at least, announce his love. He obviously fears the social taboo of a tofu vendor marrying a princess), she needs to get a love potion, which is in a certain temple. Legend has it that the only person that can obtain this love potion is the most lecherous man in the universe. That man turns out to be Ataru Moroboshi. Lupika kidnaps Ataru to make him get the potion, and Lum and her friends go out to search for Ataru.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2iJ4jd7nC7f4Y4aejTFJurklLPb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150028'),
  ('468171922572402901', 'Urusei Yatsura: Beautiful Dreamer', 1984, 'Animation, Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Mamoru Oshii, Akio Wakana, Yuji Moriyama', 'Mamoru Oshii', 'Toshio Furukawa, Fumi Hirano, Akira Kamiya, Kazuko Sugiyama, Saeko Shimazu, Akira Murayama, Shinji Nomura, Issei Futamata', 'NR', 'As the perpetually lecherous Ataru and his friends prepare for a carnival at Tomobiki High School, they gradually realize the days are literally repeating themselves. Any effort to break the pattern dumps them back where they started.', 'As the perpetually lecherous Ataru and his friends prepare for a carnival at Tomobiki High School, they gradually realize the days are literally repeating themselves. Any effort to break the pattern dumps them back where they started.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxSwZBgUquBIv61IkITmHJHGqu3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43967'),
  ('1089014298745439332', 'Urusei Yatsura: Inaba the Dreammaker', 1987, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Satoshi Dezaki', 'Toshiaki Imaizumi, Kazumi Koide', 'Fumi Hirano, Toshio Furukawa, Akira Kamiya, Saeko Shimazu, Kazuko Sugiyama, Machiko Washio, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Ichiro Nagai', null, 'It is summertime, and Shinobu laments not having a boyfriend. She then happens upon a young man weak from hunger, and wearing a rabbit costume. She gives him a carrot, he expresses his gratitude by hitting on her... and she hits back. The young man leaves behind a key to another dimension where everybody''s possible futures exist. Lum and Ataru join Shinobu to find the bunny boy, and happy futures for themselves.', 'It is summertime, and Shinobu laments not having a boyfriend. She then happens upon a young man weak from hunger, and wearing a rabbit costume. She gives him a carrot, he expresses his gratitude by hitting on her... and she hits back. The young man leaves behind a key to another dimension where everybody''s possible futures exist. Lum and Ataru join Shinobu to find the bunny boy, and happy futures for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuYHbY0X1GYdFtn6Pz7y0Qh6Fad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413470'),
  ('739865323090182464', 'Urusei Yatsura: Lum the Forever', 1986, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Romance', 'Kazuo Yamazaki, Tsukasa Dokite, Yoichi Shimizu', 'Kazuo Yamazaki, Toshiki Inoue', 'Toshio Furukawa, Fumi Hirano, Akira Kamiya, Issei Futamata, Shinji Nomura, Mugihito, Saeko Shimazu, Sumi Shimamoto', null, 'While performing in a student film, Ataru cuts down Tarozakura, a large, ancient cherry tree. Strange things begin to happen all across Tomobiki: a mountain appears out of nowhere, spring changes to winter, and Lum loses her powers, while those around her act as if she doesn''t exist.', 'While performing in a student film, Ataru cuts down Tarozakura, a large, ancient cherry tree. Strange things begin to happen all across Tomobiki: a mountain appears out of nowhere, spring changes to winter, and Lum loses her powers, while those around her act as if she doesn''t exist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2fZlzaBLwZRzqTnUgwXhjfArHS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150026'),
  ('956796896498318510', 'Urusei Yatsura: Only You', 1983, 'Animation, Romance, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Mamoru Oshii, Nobuo Koyama, Takashi Anno', 'Tomoko Konparu', 'Toshio Furukawa, Fumi Hirano, Saeko Shimazu, Akira Kamiya, Kazuko Sugiyama, Ichiro Nagai, Machiko Washio, Shigeru Chiba', null, 'Six-year-old Ataru steps on Elle''s shadow during an impromptu game of shadow-tag; in Elle''s culture, this is viewed as a marriage proposal. Eleven years later, Elle returns to Earth in order to marry Ataru — by which time not only had he forgotten the events of his childhood, but he was also going out with Lum. The rest of the plot focuses on Lum''s attempts to prevent the marriage.', 'Six-year-old Ataru steps on Elle''s shadow during an impromptu game of shadow-tag; in Elle''s culture, this is viewed as a marriage proposal. Eleven years later, Elle returns to Earth in order to marry Ataru — by which time not only had he forgotten the events of his childhood, but he was also going out with Lum. The rest of the plot focuses on Lum''s attempts to prevent the marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljvg1lHdN52yNgTTOw6rNwzr9rx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150023'),
  ('494504668931593153', 'Urusei Yatsura: Remember My Love', 1985, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Kazuo Yamazaki, Akio Wakana', 'Tomoko Konparu', 'Toshio Furukawa, Fumi Hirano, Akira Kamiya, Saeko Shimazu, Kazuko Sugiyama, Machiko Washio, Kazuteru Suzuki, Masako Sugaya', null, 'The third film finds Ataru transformed into a pink hippopotamus, which sends Lum chasing after the wicked magician responsible, with catastrophic results. With Lum gone, her friends decide that there is no reason to remain, and so Tomobiki slowly returns to normal. The highlight of the film is a high speed chase scene with an angry Lum flying after the mysterious Ruu through the city at night and into a hall of mirrors (and illusion ). Ataru''s true feelings for Lum are probably more obvious in this film than any of the others.', 'The third film finds Ataru transformed into a pink hippopotamus, which sends Lum chasing after the wicked magician responsible, with catastrophic results. With Lum gone, her friends decide that there is no reason to remain, and so Tomobiki slowly returns to normal. The highlight of the film is a high speed chase scene with an angry Lum flying after the mysterious Ruu through the city at night and into a hall of mirrors (and illusion ). Ataru''s true feelings for Lum are probably more obvious in this film than any of the others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVVqczwzMpeYH4wVsTUHcqpsNOh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150024'),
  ('436051502372658366', 'Urusei Yatsura: The Final Chapter', 1988, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Romance', 'Akitaro Daichi, Satoshi Dezaki, Kenichi Maejima', 'Tomoko Konparu', 'Toshio Furukawa, Fumi Hirano, Akira Kamiya, Yo Inoue, Saeko Shimazu, Kazuko Sugiyama, Machiko Washio, Ichiro Nagai', null, 'It seems that Lum''s grandfather made an agreement that should he have a daughter, she would be married to a traveling merchant that he met. Now, the merchant has come to collect due. Ataru is tricked into thinking that Lum wants to leave, and so, in a moment of anger, says he hates her. Arguments erupt, and Lum decides that she must know the truth of Atarus feelings. As for all the questions of importance for the Onis, a game of tag begins, one that Ataru can win simply by telling Lum I Love You. However, in the end his pride may end up dooming him. So begins the series of events that will at long last decide the future and fate of Ataru and Lum.', 'It seems that Lum''s grandfather made an agreement that should he have a daughter, she would be married to a traveling merchant that he met. Now, the merchant has come to collect due. Ataru is tricked into thinking that Lum wants to leave, and so, in a moment of anger, says he hates her. Arguments erupt, and Lum decides that she must know the truth of Atarus feelings. As for all the questions of importance for the Onis, a game of tag begins, one that Ataru can win simply by telling Lum I Love You. However, in the end his pride may end up dooming him. So begins the series of events that will at long last decide the future and fate of Ataru and Lum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3CXLL9BMNNAC7yHSwEiqD731r7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150027'),
  ('819841549793907333', 'Us', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Ram Paul Silbey, Gerard DiNardi, Jordan Peele', 'Jordan Peele', 'Lupita Nyong''o, Winston Duke, Elisabeth Moss, Tim Heidecker, Shahadi Wright Joseph, Evan Alex, Yahya Abdul-Mateen II, Anna Diop', 'R', 'Husband and wife Gabe and Adelaide Wilson take their kids to their beach house expecting to unplug and unwind with friends. But as night descends, their serenity turns to tension and chaos when some shocking visitors arrive uninvited.', 'Husband and wife Gabe and Adelaide Wilson take their kids to their beach house expecting to unplug and unwind with friends. But as night descends, their serenity turns to tension and chaos when some shocking visitors arrive uninvited.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ux2dU1jQ2ACIMShzB3yP93Udpzc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458723'),
  ('1066468462489105055', 'Us and Them', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'René Liu, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Yuan Yuan, Yu Pan, Shing-Ming Ho', 'Jing Boran, Zhou Dongyu, Tian Zhuangzhuang, Qu Zheming, Zhang Zixian, Liu Qiheng, Su Xiaoming, Li Dong', null, 'Ten years ago, on a train home during the busy Spring Festival travel period, fate brings Xiaoxiao and Jianqing together. Like many young couples, they meet, fall in love, and strive to make it work, but eventually, the harsh realities of life make them drift apart. Ten years later, they run into each other again. Will they make the most of this second chance and rekindle what they once lost?', 'Ten years ago, on a train home during the busy Spring Festival travel period, fate brings Xiaoxiao and Jianqing together. Like many young couples, they meet, fall in love, and strive to make it work, but eventually, the harsh realities of life make them drift apart. Ten years later, they run into each other again. Will they make the most of this second chance and rekindle what they once lost?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45tKwttzp8Ac47DbjtA6NV12F1r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508747'),
  ('487552823812383553', 'Us in the U.S.', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Lucidi', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina, Edoardo Falcone', 'Vincenzo Salemme, Ambra Angiolini, Ricky Memphis, Anna Foglietta, Giovanni Vernia, Maurizio Mattioli, Andrea Pittorino, Paolo Bessegato', null, 'Five people who never met are convened by a notary for the reading of a will, and learn they are all brothers and sisters, children of the same father. They’ll share a large inheritance if they can deliver the ashes to their father’s favorite lake in Arizona.', 'Five people who never met are convened by a notary for the reading of a will, and learn they are all brothers and sisters, children of the same father. They’ll share a large inheritance if they can deliver the ashes to their father’s favorite lake in Arizona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVYyqfYz77ZU3BciMdGG1DtpedD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156547'),
  ('244003165635890200', 'Us Real Men, We Hard Men', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Maurizio Ponzi, Alessandro D''Eva, Ferzan Özpetek', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Maurizio Ponzi, Piero De Bernardi', 'Renato Pozzetto, Enrico Montesano, Alessandra Mussolini, Novello Novelli, Francesco Brandinelli, Mariangela Giordano, Maria Pia Casilio, Isabel Russinova', null, 'Mario, a tram-driver, and Silvio, a banker, make friends in the group of participants in a survival training course.', 'Mario, a tram-driver, and Silvio, a banker, make friends in the group of participants in a survival training course.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHUWYpOCVxFNeJtPqMkWQ3f5ynT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58615'),
  ('313215800865366367', 'Us Two', 1979, 'Drama', 'Claude Lelouch, Bernard Zitzermann', 'Claude Lelouch', 'Catherine Deneuve, Jacques Dutronc, Jacques Villeret, Paul Préboist, Evelyne Ker, Jean-François Rémi, Monique Mélinand, Bernard Le Coq', null, 'Françoise has gone into business seducing men whose wives want to divorce them, and who need incriminating evidence against them. In addition, she has a little blackmail operation going on on the side with politicians who can''t afford a scandal. She got started on this business after she was raped, and hasn''t looked back since. Now the police are on her trail, and she avails herself of the services of a couple who make a profession of hiding wanted criminals. At the hideout, she meets Simon, a second-generation mobster. As the police close in, Françoise and Simon go on the run together, pulling off occasional heists for operating money. Before long, they have also fallen in love.', 'Françoise has gone into business seducing men whose wives want to divorce them, and who need incriminating evidence against them. In addition, she has a little blackmail operation going on on the side with politicians who can''t afford a scandal. She got started on this business after she was raped, and hasn''t looked back since. Now the police are on her trail, and she avails herself of the services of a couple who make a profession of hiding wanted criminals. At the hideout, she meets Simon, a second-generation mobster. As the police close in, Françoise and Simon go on the run together, pulling off occasional heists for operating money. Before long, they have also fallen in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brtJa4LvmyjjMHe2csyFXf0rKvj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76348'),
  ('1130895303085655638', 'Used Cars', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Robert Zemeckis, Donald M. Morgan, Bo Welch', 'Robert Zemeckis, Bob Gale', 'Kurt Russell, Jack Warden, Gerrit Graham, Frank McRae, Deborah Harmon, Joe Flaherty, David L. Lander, Michael McKean', 'R', 'When the owner of a struggling used car lot is killed, it''s up to the lot''s hot-shot salesman to save the property from falling into the hands of the owner''s ruthless brother and used-car rival.', 'When the owner of a struggling used car lot is killed, it''s up to the lot''s hot-shot salesman to save the property from falling into the hands of the owner''s ruthless brother and used-car rival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9hqesyEBaag8ZkgrBSaUGgGNFF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14475'),
  ('838490468127317841', 'Used Parts', 2007, null, 'Aarón Fernández Lesur', 'Aarón Fernández Lesur', 'Emery Eduardo Granados, Alan Chávez, Carlos Ceja, Pilar Padilla, Damayanti Quintanar, Mayra Batalla', null, 'Ivan, a 14-year old boy, lives with his uncle Jaime, a mediocre dealer of used car parts. Both of them dream with a better life and are stashing away their money in order to emigrate ilegally to Chicago shortly. When Jaime realizes that he needs much more money than he expected in order to pay the "Coyote" that will help them cross the border, he decides to introduce his nephew into the world of car-part theft. Ivan learns quickly the know-how of his new trade and convinces Efrain, his best friend, to help him. The kids enjoy themselves together and carry out Jaime''s orders skilfully until Ivan realizes that his uncle''s intentions for the trip have changed since they first made their plans.', 'Ivan, a 14-year old boy, lives with his uncle Jaime, a mediocre dealer of used car parts. Both of them dream with a better life and are stashing away their money in order to emigrate ilegally to Chicago shortly. When Jaime realizes that he needs much more money than he expected in order to pay the "Coyote" that will help them cross the border, he decides to introduce his nephew into the world of car-part theft. Ivan learns quickly the know-how of his new trade and convinces Efrain, his best friend, to help him. The kids enjoy themselves together and carry out Jaime''s orders skilfully until Ivan realizes that his uncle''s intentions for the trip have changed since they first made their plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96S6J98Zg40xx2LOaPSkgo4OszE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:312101'),
  ('730934309882082629', 'Used People', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Beeban Kidron, David Watkin', 'Todd Graff', 'Shirley MacLaine, Marcello Mastroianni, Bob Dishy, Jessica Tandy, Kathy Bates, Marcia Gay Harden, Sylvia Sidney, Doris Roberts', 'PG-13', 'At her husband''s funeral, Pearl, Jewish mother of two divorced and antagonistic daughters, meets an old Italian friend of her husband, whose advice years previously had stopped the husband leaving home. For 23 years he, now a widower, has secretly loved Pearl.', 'At her husband''s funeral, Pearl, Jewish mother of two divorced and antagonistic daughters, meets an old Italian friend of her husband, whose advice years previously had stopped the husband leaving home. For 23 years he, now a widower, has secretly loved Pearl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRMf2zYV46rM9DB5S54PGTPGi55.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41779'),
  ('303684590795319269', 'Ushijima the Loan Shark', 2012, 'Drama', 'Masatoshi Yamaguchi, Yasutaka Mori, Hiromitsu Nishimura', 'Masatoshi Yamaguchi, Masahiro Fukuma', 'Takayuki Yamada, Yuko Oshima, Kento Hayashi, Kyosuke Yabe, Hiromi Sakimoto, Nana Katase, Yoshinori Okada, Tsuyoshi Muro', null, 'Mirai Suzuki (Yuko Oshima) becomes responsible for her mother''s debt which is owed to loan shark Kaoru Ushijima (Takayuki Yamada). To begin paying off her mother''s debt, Mirai begins working at a dating cafe. Meanwhile, Jun (Kento Hayashi) is the ambitious and greedy company president for an event group. To borrow money, Jun visits Kaukau Finance owned by Kaoru Ushijima.', 'Mirai Suzuki (Yuko Oshima) becomes responsible for her mother''s debt which is owed to loan shark Kaoru Ushijima (Takayuki Yamada). To begin paying off her mother''s debt, Mirai begins working at a dating cafe. Meanwhile, Jun (Kento Hayashi) is the ambitious and greedy company president for an event group. To borrow money, Jun visits Kaukau Finance owned by Kaoru Ushijima.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQXOwWfiEVKLP07M1TPTDWrnyKb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293202'),
  ('16734341180483059', 'Ushijima the Loan Shark Part 2', 2014, 'Drama', 'Masatoshi Yamaguchi, Yasutaka Mori', 'Shohei Manabe', 'Takayuki Yamada, Go Ayano, Yuya Yagira, Masaki Suda, Masataka Kubota, Akiyoshi Nakao, Hiromi Sakimoto, Kyosuke Yabe', null, 'Ushijima runs Kaukau Fiance, a black market lending agency which scourges its clients with interest rates as high as 50% for 10 days. Ushijima chases down his debtors, who normally come from the bottom of society, with ruthless efficacy.', 'Ushijima runs Kaukau Fiance, a black market lending agency which scourges its clients with interest rates as high as 50% for 10 days. Ushijima chases down his debtors, who normally come from the bottom of society, with ruthless efficacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJG3uRqISemIk5F1EHiaXrX4dms.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308471'),
  ('860788609622600279', 'Ushijima the Loan Shark The Final', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Masatoshi Yamaguchi, Yosuke Toki', 'Masahiro Fukuma, Masatoshi Yamaguchi', 'Takayuki Yamada, Go Ayano, Hiromi Sakimoto, Kyosuke Yabe, Moga Mogami, Maryjun Takahashi, Makita Sports, Kento Nagayama', null, 'A classmate from Ushijima''s middle school days, Takemoto, shows up. He was a kind man, but now is jobless and without a home. Adrift and unable to borrow money from Ushijima, Takemoto heads for Seiai Home where he can stay while doing work.', 'A classmate from Ushijima''s middle school days, Takemoto, shows up. He was a kind man, but now is jobless and without a home. Adrift and unable to borrow money from Ushijima, Takemoto heads for Seiai Home where he can stay while doing work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8b7gkmNKEiD9IPzTyLapD0DJ0Fq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447523'),
  ('197403365657351976', 'Using', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Zhou Hao', null, null, null, 'Documentary filmmaker Zhou Hao examines the complicated relationship between two drug addicts who become dealers over the course of three years. Shot in the city of Guangzhou, the film offers a rare look into China''s unknown heroin subculture.', 'Documentary filmmaker Zhou Hao examines the complicated relationship between two drug addicts who become dealers over the course of three years. Shot in the city of Guangzhou, the film offers a rare look into China''s unknown heroin subculture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NwSg5kXxUy0Gqvae3jcxFj5da9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184635'),
  ('970311122609784390', 'Uski Roti', 1970, 'Drama', 'Mani Kaul, K.K. Mahajan, John Abraham', 'Mani Kaul', 'Garima, Gurdeep Singh, Richa Vyas, Lakhanapal, Savita Bajaj, Rochak Pandit, John Abraham', null, 'The film depicts the life of a truck driver Sucha Singh and his wife Balo. Balo has to get Sucha Singh''s food ready every day, walk a long distance through the fields and wait for him on the highway as he drives past the village. He leads an independent life, playing cards with his friends and spending time with his mistress, and comes home only once a week. However, he expects his wife to play the traditional role of a devoted wife. One day Balo gets late, trying to save her sister from the advances of a lecherous villager. Sucha Singh is angry, and drives away without his food. She decides to wait for him until nightfall.', 'The film depicts the life of a truck driver Sucha Singh and his wife Balo. Balo has to get Sucha Singh''s food ready every day, walk a long distance through the fields and wait for him on the highway as he drives past the village. He leads an independent life, playing cards with his friends and spending time with his mistress, and comes home only once a week. However, he expects his wife to play the traditional role of a devoted wife. One day Balo gets late, trying to save her sister from the advances of a lecherous villager. Sucha Singh is angry, and drives away without his food. She decides to wait for him until nightfall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIKrgqvEsGouv3zW4XuY05RoyvX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112053'),
  ('127301209468973746', 'Usogui', 2022, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Hideo Nakata, Takahiro Imai', 'Itaru Era, Tetsuya Oishi', 'Ryusei Yokohama, Hayato Sano, Mai Shiraishi, Kanata Hongo, Win Morisaki, Kaito Sakurai, Hiroaki Murakami, Shohei Miura', null, 'Madarame Baku is a mysterious gambler. His nickname is Usogui (literally The Lie Eater). Club Kakerou is the top illegal gambling den, where gamblers vie to become the best in their profession. Seeing through the lies of others, Madarame Baku challenges a variety of high stakes games at Club Kakerou.', 'Madarame Baku is a mysterious gambler. His nickname is Usogui (literally The Lie Eater). Club Kakerou is the top illegal gambling den, where gamblers vie to become the best in their profession. Seeing through the lies of others, Madarame Baku challenges a variety of high stakes games at Club Kakerou.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pA1S8w1bcjowzcu41re6bfZmsFx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846967'),
  ('621352585490919004', 'USS Christmas', 2020, 'TV Movie, Mystery', 'Michael P. May, Steven R. Monroe', 'Andrea Canning', 'Jen Lilley, Trevor Donovan, Barbara Niven, Stefanie Butler, Brett Rice, Valerie Sue Love, Amy LoCicero, Nick Basta', null, 'Maddie, a reporter for a Norfolk newspaper, embarks on a Tiger Cruise during Christmastime where she meets a handsome naval officer and stumbles upon a mystery in the ship’s archive room.', 'Maddie, a reporter for a Norfolk newspaper, embarks on a Tiger Cruise during Christmastime where she meets a handsome naval officer and stumbles upon a mystery in the ship’s archive room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kio6inuU0xXbtacJE5NgPYDedlf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746467'),
  ('776838876626822990', 'USS Indianapolis: Men of Courage', 2016, 'Action, War', 'Mario Van Peebles, Andrzej Sekula', 'Richard Rionda Del Castro, Cam Cannon', 'Nicolas Cage, Tom Sizemore, Matt Lanter, Thomas Jane, Emily Tennant, Craig Tate, Cody Walker, James Remar', 'R', 'The harrowing true story of the crew of the USS Indianapolis, who were stranded in the Philippine Sea for five days after delivering the atomic weapons that would eventually end WWII. As they awaited rescue, they endured extreme thirst, hunger, and relentless shark attacks.', 'The harrowing true story of the crew of the USS Indianapolis, who were stranded in the Philippine Sea for five days after delivering the atomic weapons that would eventually end WWII. As they awaited rescue, they endured extreme thirst, hunger, and relentless shark attacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aREeJV7avhlLnCicVG3fBjXiaW1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340945'),
  ('500291297669607895', 'USS VD: Ship of Shame', 1942, 'War, Drama', null, null, 'Keefe Brasselle, Cliff Clark, Dorothy Granger, Don Haggerty, Eddie Hall, William Hall, Earle Hodgins, Rory Mallinson', null, 'This film was made by the U.S. government during World War II to show its young servicemen the results of "fooling around" with "loose women" overseas. Actual victims of such sexually transmitted diseases as syphilis and gonorrhoea are shown, along with the physical deterioration that accompanies those diseases.', 'This film was made by the U.S. government during World War II to show its young servicemen the results of "fooling around" with "loose women" overseas. Actual victims of such sexually transmitted diseases as syphilis and gonorrhoea are shown, along with the physical deterioration that accompanies those diseases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2X6r80VUmNpnr7PEW2IzQr8hw4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409962'),
  ('1062931034631380106', 'Ustaad Bhagat Singh', 2026, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Harish Shankar, Ayananka Bose', 'Harish Shankar, Ramesh Reddy', 'Pawan Kalyan, Sreeleela, Raashii Khanna, R. Parthiban, Nawab Shah', null, 'Inspired by his teacher, who named him Bhagat Singh and shaped his values, a tribal boy grows up rooted in strong morals and unwavering courage. Standing firm against injustice, he takes on evil forces despite overwhelming odds.', 'Inspired by his teacher, who named him Bhagat Singh and shaped his values, a tribal boy grows up rooted in strong morals and unwavering courage. Standing firm against injustice, he takes on evil forces despite overwhelming odds.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F8n4ypYQWztEXlR8JxD0fctdKwfC.jpg', 'plex:movie:ustaad-bhagat-singh'),
  ('620135460104826018', 'Ustad Hotel', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Loganathan Srinivasan, Khalid Rahman, Anwar Rasheed', 'Anjali Menon', 'Dulquer Salmaan, Thilakan, Nithya Menen, Siddique, Mamukkoya, Jayaprakash, Praveena, Maniyanpilla Raju', null, 'When his father refuses to support his choice of a career, an aspiring chef tries to fulfil his dream by helping his grandfather run his small eatery.', 'When his father refuses to support his choice of a career, an aspiring chef tries to fulfil his dream by helping his grandfather run his small eatery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88QYspKRArRutF3t0Bzj0JYFlcI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117751'),
  ('447413916162388523', 'Ustedes deciden', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Esteban Rey Cazes, Federico Polleri', 'Mariano Marquevich, Gastón Soffritti, Esteban Rey Cazes', 'Gastón Soffritti, Luciano Leyrado, Bárbara Lombardo, Juan Santandreu, Mario Vera, Patricia Wolf, Ornella CaDaneo', null, 'Having had his fill of rejections in the acting business, Nico decides to pursue fame via another medium: social media. In a virtual world driven by influencers, likes, and celebrity obsessions, Nico stumbles into a series of hilarious and strange encounters that will test how far he’s willing to go for social media stardom.', 'Having had his fill of rejections in the acting business, Nico decides to pursue fame via another medium: social media. In a virtual world driven by influencers, likes, and celebrity obsessions, Nico stumbles into a series of hilarious and strange encounters that will test how far he’s willing to go for social media stardom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QhyBSSw9dsDlyNvsXLKpHsQgI9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1064841'),
  ('224590691195936919', 'Ustica: The Missing Paper', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Renzo Martinelli, Blasco Giurato, Sandro Scarmiglia', 'Renzo Martinelli', 'Marco Leonardi, Caterina Murino, Lubna Azabal, Tomas Arana, Federica Martinelli, Paco Reconti, Yassine Fadel, Jonis Bashir', null, 'On the evening of June 27, 1980, a DC9 of the private airline Itavia disappeared from radar screens without sending any emergency signal. The aircraft, stabilized in cruise at 7.600 meters above sea level, sank into the Tyrrhenian Trench, between Ponza and Ustica. 81 people lost their lives, including 14 children. There are three hypotheses about the disaster, but none has ever been proven, until the analysis of the findings and documentary material reveals a fourth, chilling possible cause of the disaster.', 'On the evening of June 27, 1980, a DC9 of the private airline Itavia disappeared from radar screens without sending any emergency signal. The aircraft, stabilized in cruise at 7.600 meters above sea level, sank into the Tyrrhenian Trench, between Ponza and Ustica. 81 people lost their lives, including 14 children. There are three hypotheses about the disaster, but none has ever been proven, until the analysis of the findings and documentary material reveals a fourth, chilling possible cause of the disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRw2DhiHLo770uXHIsQX8s1BU33.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390281'),
  ('1025369279229663252', 'Usury Academy', 2023, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Hwang Dong-seok, Choi Beom-su', 'Hwang Dong-seok', 'Yoo Seon-ho, Kang Mi-na, Lee Chan-hyeong, Yoo In-soo, Lee Il-jun, Shin Su-hyun, Seo Hye-won, Yoon Byung-hee', null, 'With each day feeling hopeless and bleak, Kang-jin''s life takes a dramatic turn when he stumbles upon a lost envelope of money belonging to Rang. Using this newfound wealth, he takes a stand against Nam-young''s girlfriend Da-young. But when Nam-young discovers Kang-jin''s actions, he strikes back by stealing his money and issuing dangerous threats. With nowhere to turn, Kang-jin confides in Rang, who reveals a secret knowledge of the debt-collecting world. Together, they embark on a thrilling journey of power and control, as Kang-jin takes his first steps into the world of loan sharks.', 'With each day feeling hopeless and bleak, Kang-jin''s life takes a dramatic turn when he stumbles upon a lost envelope of money belonging to Rang. Using this newfound wealth, he takes a stand against Nam-young''s girlfriend Da-young. But when Nam-young discovers Kang-jin''s actions, he strikes back by stealing his money and issuing dangerous threats. With nowhere to turn, Kang-jin confides in Rang, who reveals a secret knowledge of the debt-collecting world. Together, they embark on a thrilling journey of power and control, as Kang-jin takes his first steps into the world of loan sharks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9JHYiwuUQEGrQt7Hw10p87VvolL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1071662'),
  ('485617818329530485', 'Utama', 2022, 'Drama', 'Federico Moreira, Álvaro Manzano Zambrana, Alejandro Loayza Grisi', 'Alejandro Loayza Grisi', 'José Calcina, Luisa Quispe, Santos Choque, Félix Ticona, Placide Ali, Candelaria Quispe, René Calcina, René Pérez', null, 'In the Bolivian altiplano, Virginio and Sisa, an elderly Quechua couple who have lived a quiet life for years, face an impossible dilemma during an unusually long drought: resist or be defeated by the hostile environment and the relentless passage of time.', 'In the Bolivian altiplano, Virginio and Sisa, an elderly Quechua couple who have lived a quiet life for years, face an impossible dilemma during an unusually long drought: resist or be defeated by the hostile environment and the relentless passage of time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqqIIXR3f47PxOGYBFYOwAzBTWU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913820'),
  ('671031722333695473', 'Utamaro and His Five Women', 1946, 'Drama', 'Kenji Mizoguchi, Shigeto Miki', 'Yoshikata Yoda', 'Bandō Mitsugorō VIII, Kinuyo Tanaka, Kōtarō Bandō, Hiroko Kawasaki, Toshiko Iizuka, Kyōko Kusajima, Eiko Ohara, Shôtarô Nakamura', null, 'Utamaro, a great artist, lives to create portraits of beautiful women, and the Tokyo brothels provide his models. A world of passion swirls around him, as the women vie for lovers, and, occasionally, his art gets him into trouble.', 'Utamaro, a great artist, lives to create portraits of beautiful women, and the Tokyo brothels provide his models. A world of passion swirls around him, as the women vie for lovers, and, occasionally, his art gets him into trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1oRhyRvqNUAezLbxLxC4kNJV3FB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101382'),
  ('186985604102288822', 'Utopia', 1983, 'Drama', 'Dagmar Beiersdorf, Sohrab Shahid Saless, Ramin Reza Molai', 'Manfred Grunert, Sohrab Shahid Saless', 'Manfred Zapatka, Imke Barnstedt, Gundula Petrovska, Gabriele Fischer, Johanna Sofia, Birgit Anders', null, 'A treatise on love and desire tainted by harsh reality of capitalism, in which submission to the laws of lust-as-commerce is played out by five prostitutes and their pimp, who pits them against one another so that they are incapable of standing up to him collectively.', 'A treatise on love and desire tainted by harsh reality of capitalism, in which submission to the laws of lust-as-commerce is played out by five prostitutes and their pimp, who pits them against one another so that they are incapable of standing up to him collectively.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFKWzXpBqPXNBwAU9ISjmoCtHiz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253233'),
  ('57391862089057864', 'Utopia', 2003, 'Drama', 'María Ripoll', null, 'Leonardo Sbaraglia, Najwa Nimri, Tchéky Karyo, Fele Martínez, José Garcia, Emma Vilarasau, Rodrigo Taramona', null, 'Adrian (Leonardo Sbaraglia) is a young man who has spent years running away from himself, constantly changing city and work, looking for people to relate to the least possible and all for one reason: he has the ability to see things that have not yet occurred, is a precog. He learned it when he anticipated the death of his parents and could not do anything about it. Adrian tries, unsuccessfully, to flee from his gift', 'Adrian (Leonardo Sbaraglia) is a young man who has spent years running away from himself, constantly changing city and work, looking for people to relate to the least possible and all for one reason: he has the ability to see things that have not yet occurred, is a precog. He learned it when he anticipated the death of his parents and could not do anything about it. Adrian tries, unsuccessfully, to flee from his gift', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHHVYwcT0yaCBEYl9QWfeFXl6Bg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66098'),
  ('711063114532041379', 'Utopia', 2024, 'Mystery, Thriller, Action, Science Fiction', 'James Bamford', 'Ian Neligh, Steven Paul', 'Moe Dunford, Charlotte Vega, Michael D. Xavier, Daniel Bernhardt, Jason Flemyng, Wanda Banda, Lucy Akhurst, Maddy Ambus', 'R', 'A soldier searching for his missing wife breaks into a high-tech facility, believing she''s been caught in a human trafficking ring. But beyond its walls, he finds a surreal, futuristic fantasy park where reality and illusion blur. As he navigates this seductive and dangerous world, a shocking truth pulls him deeper into a deadly game where nothing is as it seems.', 'A soldier searching for his missing wife breaks into a high-tech facility, believing she''s been caught in a human trafficking ring. But beyond its walls, he finds a surreal, futuristic fantasy park where reality and illusion blur. As he navigates this seductive and dangerous world, a shocking truth pulls him deeper into a deadly game where nothing is as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yef0tY1Nw3BX8PJTfBLieqHj5Hw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1379587'),
  ('296089996921142748', 'Utopians', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Nathan Wong, Haze Leung, Calvin Mak', 'Scud', 'Adonis He, Jackie Chow, Chin Ching-Man, Wang Yuhong, Shui Jie, William Tang, Wong Hei, Yin-chi Wong', null, 'This visually stunning erotic drama follows a young man who finds himself unexpectedly attracted to his handsome, outspoken male professor. Despite — or perhaps because of — his conservative upbringing, Hins is intent on getting close enough to Ming to understand him. It’s an experience that transforms his life and comes to define his adult identity.', 'This visually stunning erotic drama follows a young man who finds himself unexpectedly attracted to his handsome, outspoken male professor. Despite — or perhaps because of — his conservative upbringing, Hins is intent on getting close enough to Ming to understand him. It’s an experience that transforms his life and comes to define his adult identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qiG7EOYYJfAEaL6AV7hhq1yR0uN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385879'),
  ('78300712852736810', 'Utøya: July 22', 2018, 'History, Drama', 'Erik Poppe, Martin Otterbeck', 'Siv Rajendram Eliassen, Anna Bache-Wiig', 'Andrea Berntzen, Aleksander Holmen, Brede Fristad, Elli Rhiannon Müller Osborne, Jenny Svennevig, Ingeborg Enes, Sorosh Sadat, Ada Eide', null, 'A teenage girl fights for survival and to locate her young sister during the 2011 terrorist attack at a political summer camp on the Norwegian island of Utøya.', 'A teenage girl fights for survival and to locate her young sister during the 2011 terrorist attack at a political summer camp on the Norwegian island of Utøya.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpa91Opnvl4XxUCycyNGvhwRWqC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500006'),
  ('146774158031493667', 'Utta Danella - Mit dir die Sterne sehen', 2008, 'Drama', 'Gloria Behrens', null, 'Mimi Fiedler, Roman Knižka, Sonja Kirchberger, Michael Brandner, Giulio Ricciarelli', null, 'Pretty Floriane does not believe in love anymore, since she has learned that her boyfriend is really married and does not even think about leaving his wife. Surprisingly, the charming townspeople Sebastian comes into their lives: The handsome contractor was actually just passing through - but after a car breakdown, he hired himself in Florianes small country inn. It does not take long for an intimate love to develop between the two. But then it turns out that Sebastian also has a girlfriend who is ready to fight him.', 'Pretty Floriane does not believe in love anymore, since she has learned that her boyfriend is really married and does not even think about leaving his wife. Surprisingly, the charming townspeople Sebastian comes into their lives: The handsome contractor was actually just passing through - but after a car breakdown, he hired himself in Florianes small country inn. It does not take long for an intimate love to develop between the two. But then it turns out that Sebastian also has a girlfriend who is ready to fight him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdTJw2NDy31gIRjshtrvOWz3nKe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339642'),
  ('455192881913403798', 'Uttutta Herolu', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Harsha Kodali, John K Joseph', 'Harsha Kodali', 'Thanu Konidela, Hara Srinivas, Walter Vinay, Ganga, Rahul Raj Vanam', null, '4 friends of the Cult Gang are chosen as heroes in a film,but shooting stops due to financial issues.To save their dream,they do kidnapping for money and get trapped in risky trouble involving faction leader Rami Reddy.Will they survive?', '4 friends of the Cult Gang are chosen as heroes in a film,but shooting stops due to financial issues.To save their dream,they do kidnapping for money and get trapped in risky trouble involving faction leader Rami Reddy.Will they survive?', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BNGI1MGVkMWMtM2M2Yy00NWUwLWI5OWYtNTZmNzM2NzFhOTUwXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:uttutta-herolu'),
  ('892528104121627001', 'Utu', 1984, 'War, Adventure, Drama, History', 'Geoff Murphy, Lee Tamahori, Jonothan Cullinane', 'Keith Aberdein, Geoff Murphy', 'Anzac Wallace, Bruno Lawrence, Tim Elliott, Kelly Johnson, Wi Kuki Kaa, Ilona Rodgers, Merata Mita, Faenza Reuben', null, 'In New Zealand in the 1860s the native Māori people fought the British colonials to keep the land guaranteed to them by treaty. The warrior Te Wheke fights for the British until betrayal leads him to seek utu (revenge). The settler Williamson in turn seeks revenge after Te Wheke attacks his homestead. Meanwhile Wiremu, an officer for the British, seems to think that resistance is futile.', 'In New Zealand in the 1860s the native Māori people fought the British colonials to keep the land guaranteed to them by treaty. The warrior Te Wheke fights for the British until betrayal leads him to seek utu (revenge). The settler Williamson in turn seeks revenge after Te Wheke attacks his homestead. Meanwhile Wiremu, an officer for the British, seems to think that resistance is futile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEi7Q7xP9b5yS5KeIEaYF6xGYKD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42123'),
  ('291928051707668545', 'Uunchai', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Sooraj Barjatya, Ishaan Rajesh Singh, Manoj Kumar Khatoi', 'Abhishek Dixit', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Anupam Kher, Boman Irani, Neena Gupta, Parineeti Chopra, Sarika, Danny Denzongpa, Nafisa Ali', null, 'Amit, Om, Javed and Bhupen - a group of four friends - have come a long way in life. Bhupen had a lifelong dream of going to Mount Everest with his three friends but the idea is quashed immediately as soon as he expresses it to them during a get-together. However, Bhupen''s sudden death leads the trio to leave their cozy Delhi lives and trek to Everest Base Camp as friendship was their only motivation.', 'Amit, Om, Javed and Bhupen - a group of four friends - have come a long way in life. Bhupen had a lifelong dream of going to Mount Everest with his three friends but the idea is quashed immediately as soon as he expresses it to them during a get-together. However, Bhupen''s sudden death leads the trio to leave their cozy Delhi lives and trek to Everest Base Camp as friendship was their only motivation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqDjg117q3M9lJ4nSQBAyL47M6N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1009432'),
  ('516695524095145095', 'Uuno Epsanjassa', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Ere Kokkonen, Martti Kakko', 'Ere Kokkonen', 'Vesa-Matti Loiri, Marjatta Raita, Tapio Hämäläinen, Marita Nordberg, Spede Pasanen, Simo Salminen, Satu Silvo, Ville-Veikko Salminen', null, 'Uuno Turhapuro is searching for a job and takes a correspondence course in tour guiding. Eventually he gets a job in a small travel agency and takes a group of Finnish tourists to Marbella, Spain. Unfortunately Uuno''s father-in-law Tuura is in the group, too, with his wife and daughter, Uuno''s wife Elisabet. Tuura tries to get a signature to an important paper from a minister who''s having a holiday in the area. Meanwhile, Uuno just relaxes and enjoys the sun.', 'Uuno Turhapuro is searching for a job and takes a correspondence course in tour guiding. Eventually he gets a job in a small travel agency and takes a group of Finnish tourists to Marbella, Spain. Unfortunately Uuno''s father-in-law Tuura is in the group, too, with his wife and daughter, Uuno''s wife Elisabet. Tuura tries to get a signature to an important paper from a minister who''s having a holiday in the area. Meanwhile, Uuno just relaxes and enjoys the sun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4EsFMtAKTJyrHDBmfvPkry09Eei.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36769'),
  ('700908723426139905', 'Uuno Turhapuro', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Ere Kokkonen, Antero Takala', 'Spede Pasanen', 'Vesa-Matti Loiri, Marjatta Raita, Spede Pasanen, Juhani Kumpulainen, Simo Salminen, Mirjam Himberg, Leila Itkonen, Anna-Liisa Ruotsi', null, 'Uuno Turhapuro is a lazy man who abhors manual labor, but has the ability to talk himself out of any sticky situation, usually with his long-suffering wife. In this, his first feature film appearance, Uuno embarrasses his wife in public, tricks his best friend, accidentally goes on a diet, and becomes a famous violinist.', 'Uuno Turhapuro is a lazy man who abhors manual labor, but has the ability to talk himself out of any sticky situation, usually with his long-suffering wife. In this, his first feature film appearance, Uuno embarrasses his wife in public, tricks his best friend, accidentally goes on a diet, and becomes a famous violinist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIz5rvmckDNDB1YqkU53HD8ehjh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36764'),
  ('875983879413804609', 'Uuno Turhapuro armeijan leivissä', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Ere Kokkonen, Martti Kakko', 'Ere Kokkonen', 'Vesa-Matti Loiri, Marjatta Raita, Tapio Hämäläinen, Marita Nordberg, Simo Salminen, Elli Castrén, Spede Pasanen, Jyrki Kovaleff', null, 'Uuno is forced to complete his mandatory military service when it is revealed that he only spent one day in the army in his youth. As is typical of the Turhapuro series his family and friends become closely tied in with these events. His friends Härski Hartikainen and Sörsselssön return to the army for a refresher course and by chance Uuno''s father-in-law, Councillor Tuura is made the Finnish Defence Minister. In one of the most memorable scenes, Uuno''s wife, Elisabeth, dresses as Uuno and substitutes him for a day as Uuno has an apparently urgent meeting (at a restaurant) and while becoming lost in the woods with a malfunctioning radio, Tuura accidentally declares war on Sweden.', 'Uuno is forced to complete his mandatory military service when it is revealed that he only spent one day in the army in his youth. As is typical of the Turhapuro series his family and friends become closely tied in with these events. His friends Härski Hartikainen and Sörsselssön return to the army for a refresher course and by chance Uuno''s father-in-law, Councillor Tuura is made the Finnish Defence Minister. In one of the most memorable scenes, Uuno''s wife, Elisabeth, dresses as Uuno and substitutes him for a day as Uuno has an apparently urgent meeting (at a restaurant) and while becoming lost in the woods with a malfunctioning radio, Tuura accidentally declares war on Sweden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLsT18nSTiCHLGiNc4LCWFad7rm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36768'),
  ('595017272221563688', 'Uuno Turhapuro herra Helsingin herra', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Ere Kokkonen, Juha Jalasti', 'Ere Kokkonen', 'Vesa-Matti Loiri, Tapio Hämäläinen, Marjatta Raita, Marita Nordberg, Matti Tuominen, Pirkka-Pekka Petelius, Elli Castrén, Hannele Lauri', null, 'Uuno is working as campaign manager of a president candidate but accidentally Uuno himself becomes the president of Finland.', 'Uuno is working as campaign manager of a president candidate but accidentally Uuno himself becomes the president of Finland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cN4kumW1UihnKKmrVr9nevPvvJd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62903'),
  ('675651866379684543', 'Uuno Turhapuro kaksoisagentti', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Spede Pasanen, Timo Jalasti, Juha Jalasti', 'Spede Pasanen', 'Vesa-Matti Loiri, Marjatta Raita, Tapio Hämäläinen, Simo Salminen, Marita Nordberg, Hannele Lauri, Riitta Väisänen, Heikki Kinnunen', null, 'Uuno Turhapuro reads guide books to learn how to be an orchestra conductor and a secret agent. Meanwhile, his father in law hatches a complicated scheme to finally get rid of Uuno.', 'Uuno Turhapuro reads guide books to learn how to be an orchestra conductor and a secret agent. Meanwhile, his father in law hatches a complicated scheme to finally get rid of Uuno.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92wDm6oXvHeZzjwbpuPr1pGb2Mb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55776'),
