  ('229240801789919823', 'Uzumasa Limelight', 2014, 'Drama, Action', 'Ken Ochiai, Chris Freilich, Yusuke Nakagawa', 'Hiroyuki Ono', 'Seizō Fukumoto, Chihiro Yamamoto, Hirotaro Honda, Masashi Goda, Rantaro Mine, Asahi Kurizuka, Michihiro Kinoshita, Yoshiyuki Shibata', null, 'Fewer samurai films are being made, and the Uzumasa studio has fallen on hard times. One day, veteran "kirareyaku" (whose job it is to be felled with a sword by a film''s star) actor Kamiyama is tasked with teaching sword action techniques to fledgling actress Satsuki. A few years later, the now-retired Kamiyama is visited by Satsuki, who has become a popular star.', 'Fewer samurai films are being made, and the Uzumasa studio has fallen on hard times. One day, veteran "kirareyaku" (whose job it is to be felled with a sword by a film''s star) actor Kamiyama is tasked with teaching sword action techniques to fledgling actress Satsuki. A few years later, the now-retired Kamiyama is visited by Satsuki, who has become a popular star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBx2Z4VwFpVzlM1nCSVbtIXFkOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274815'),
  ('553426530207497854', 'V', 2020, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'P. G. Vinda, Mohana Krishna Indraganti', 'Mohana Krishna Indraganti', 'Nani, Sudheer Babu, Nivetha Thomas, Aditi Rao Hydari, Vennela Kishore, Chakrapani Ananda, Srikanth Iyengar, Tanikella Bharani', null, 'A celebrated cop, DCP Aditya, faces his toughest challenge when a taunting serial killer begins targeting victims and leaving notes meant for him. Teaming with an aspiring crime novelist, he must stop four more murders to save his medals, career, and reputation while uncovering the killer''s past.', 'A celebrated cop, DCP Aditya, faces his toughest challenge when a taunting serial killer begins targeting victims and leaving notes meant for him. Teaming with an aspiring crime novelist, he must stop four more murders to save his medals, career, and reputation while uncovering the killer''s past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBVcwOVZNGNCNlOLFmcYJW83tTu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:683342'),
  ('72864523680603543', 'V for Vendetta', 2006, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Adrian Biddle, James McTeigue, Cornelia Ott', 'Lana Wachowski, Lilly Wachowski', 'Natalie Portman, Hugo Weaving, Stephen Rea, Stephen Fry, John Hurt, Tim Pigott-Smith, Rupert Graves, Roger Allam', 'R', 'In a world in which Great Britain has become a fascist state, a masked vigilante known only as “V” conducts guerrilla warfare against the oppressive British government. When V rescues a young woman from the secret police, he finds in her an ally with whom he can continue his fight to free the people of Britain.', 'In a world in which Great Britain has become a fascist state, a masked vigilante known only as “V” conducts guerrilla warfare against the oppressive British government. When V rescues a young woman from the secret police, he finds in her an ally with whom he can continue his fight to free the people of Britain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piZOwjyk1g51oPHonc7zaQY3WOv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:752'),
  ('233645393809580004', 'V for Vengeance', 2022, 'Horror, Action', 'Kelly Halihan, Mike Kam', 'Peter Moore Smith, Steven Paul', 'Jocelyn Hudon, Grace Van Dien, Sean Maguire, Pauline Dyer, Graham Greene, Alix Villaret, Michael P. Northey, Julie Lynn-Mortensen', 'R', 'After learning that their younger sibling escaped an earlier kidnapping attempt that also killed their parents, two estranged sisters must join forces to rescue her from a group of bloodthirsty vampires. Out for revenge and control of a vampirism vaccine, Thorn and his band of the undead soon learn that they messed with the wrong family.', 'After learning that their younger sibling escaped an earlier kidnapping attempt that also killed their parents, two estranged sisters must join forces to rescue her from a group of bloodthirsty vampires. Out for revenge and control of a vampirism vaccine, Thorn and his band of the undead soon learn that they messed with the wrong family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eor4CPp7YHYh3J01NgNkQwGW4IC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:982543'),
  ('569537582501843670', 'V for Victor', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Frank Ariza, Rafael Leyva', 'Frank Ariza, Marco Lagarde', 'Memo Villegas, Camila Nuñez, Gala Bichir, Adriana Montes de Oca, Jonathan Alonso, Joaquín Cosío, Danna García, Paco Rueda', null, 'A retired boxer will return to the ring to face his greatest rival, relying on his daughter, his friends and a famous trainer who will teach him to see the sport from new perspectives.', 'A retired boxer will return to the ring to face his greatest rival, relying on his daughter, his friends and a famous trainer who will teach him to see the sport from new perspectives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QKLoe7hSPkhILm8nsuyblvCmu7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1200978'),
  ('190263823265820981', 'V.C. Andrews'' Hidden Jewel', 2021, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'David Bercovici-Artieda, Michael Robison', 'Andy Cochran', 'Kristian Alfonso, Raechelle Banno, Evan Roderick, Ty Wood, Crystal R. Fox, Sam Duke, June Laporte, Karina Banno', 'PG-13', 'When Pearl''s younger brother becomes deathly ill, she travels back to the bayou to find Ruby and uncover the mysterious secrets of her past.', 'When Pearl''s younger brother becomes deathly ill, she travels back to the bayou to find Ruby and uncover the mysterious secrets of her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCy165IWrv73JW5GYQ3myLRLJaW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788263'),
  ('482424268009084876', 'V.C. Andrews'' Pearl in the Mist', 2021, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'David Bercovici-Artieda, David Bercovici-Artieda', 'Gregory Small, Richard Blaney', 'Raechelle Banno, Karina Banno, Richard Harmon, Ty Wood, Lauralee Bell, Glynis Davies, Darien Martin, Chad Willett', 'PG-13', 'Ruby is hopeful for a new start with her twin sister as they continue their education at an all-girl''s boarding school. However, she soon endures torturous punishments and public humiliation as her cruel headmistress and stepmother plot against her.', 'Ruby is hopeful for a new start with her twin sister as they continue their education at an all-girl''s boarding school. However, she soon endures torturous punishments and public humiliation as her cruel headmistress and stepmother plot against her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6EXF4IpBB7BiOYmmoFZTpwv08Wi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788210'),
  ('567790421616146701', 'V.I. Warshawski', 1991, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Jeff Kanew, Jan Kiesser, Glenn Randall Jr.', 'Edward Taylor, David Aaron Cohen, Nick Thiel', 'Kathleen Turner, Jay O. Sanders, Charles Durning, Angela Goethals, Nancy Paul, Frederick Coffin, Charles McCaughan, Stephen Meadows', 'R', 'Victoria "V.I" Warshawski is a Chicago based private detective who agrees to babysit for her new boyfriend; then he is murdered. Being the detective type, she makes the murder her next case. In doing so she befriends the victim''s daughter, Kat, and together they set out to crack the case.', 'Victoria "V.I" Warshawski is a Chicago based private detective who agrees to babysit for her new boyfriend; then he is murdered. Being the detective type, she makes the murder her next case. In doing so she befriends the victim''s daughter, Kat, and together they set out to crack the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0ykwLLDB8v1wT50wDpYaPnyac7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41805'),
  ('545893667437331955', 'V.I.P.', 2017, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Hwang Sun-wook, Park Hoon-jung, Kim Yeong-ho', 'Park Hoon-jung', 'Jang Dong-gun, Kim Myung-min, Park Hee-soon, Lee Jong-suk, Choi Jung-woo, Peter Stormare, Jo Woo-jin, Oh Dae-hwan', null, 'A son to a high-ranked official in North Korea commits a series of murders going across the countries around the world. The movie depicts the following events as South Korea, North Korea and Interpol start chasing down after him.', 'A son to a high-ranked official in North Korea commits a series of murders going across the countries around the world. The movie depicts the following events as South Korea, North Korea and Interpol start chasing down after him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUgzvnPOVMXjrqIq9LtXYXosf3S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435601'),
  ('277016970492211130', 'V.I.P. Cop: New Year''s Eve Mayhem', 2018, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Alexey Perevalov, Viktoriya Mayskaya, Roman Platonov', 'Ilya Kulikov', 'Alexander Petrov, Sergey Burunov, Aleksandra Bortich, Roman Popov, Tatiana Babenkova, Sofya Kashtanova, Rina Grishina, Irina Vilkova', null, 'On the eve of the new year, the Barvikha Severnoe police station is threatened with closure. To save his own department, a police officer from Rublyovka Grisha Izmailov is forced to go to extreme measures and, together with operatives, decides to rob a bank. He is counting on the fact that his colleagues, together with the head of the department, Yakovlev, will easily disclose this matter, the money will be returned back, and everyone will keep their work next year. But everything is not going the way Grisha planned ...', 'On the eve of the new year, the Barvikha Severnoe police station is threatened with closure. To save his own department, a police officer from Rublyovka Grisha Izmailov is forced to go to extreme measures and, together with operatives, decides to rob a bank. He is counting on the fact that his colleagues, together with the head of the department, Yakovlev, will easily disclose this matter, the money will be returned back, and everyone will keep their work next year. But everything is not going the way Grisha planned ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEAN1z8psoLXmCVMHD7n2jy64n8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565431'),
  ('311582552160812501', 'V/H/S', 2012, 'Thriller, Horror', 'David Bruckner, Chad Villella, Adam Wingard', 'David Bruckner, Ti West, Matt Bettinelli-Olpin', 'Calvin Lee Reeder, Lane Hughes, Kentucker Audley, Adam Wingard, Simon Barrett, Andrew Droz Palermo, Joe Swanberg, Sophia Takal', 'R', 'When a group of misfits is hired by an unknown third party to burglarize a desolate house and acquire one rare VHS tape, they discover more found footage than they had bargained for.', 'When a group of misfits is hired by an unknown third party to burglarize a desolate house and acquire one rare VHS tape, they discover more found footage than they had bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xVGfCaTwVdZt3lFqtOVhTDqmG58.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84348'),
  ('119944403920159020', 'V/H/S: Viral', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'David Lawson Jr., Isidro Carbajal, Vince Cupone', 'Todd Lincoln', 'Patrick Lawrie, Emilia Ares, Celia K. Milius, Steve Berens, Garrett Bales, Stephanie Silver, Charles Johnson, Ryan Staats', 'R', 'As the streets of Los Angeles overflow with camera-wielding gawkers seeking to capture images of a bizarre police pursuit, the same people who sought to exploit the suffering of others for amusement on the Internet become the stars of a gruesome viral video from which no one gets out alive.', 'As the streets of Los Angeles overflow with camera-wielding gawkers seeking to capture images of a bizarre police pursuit, the same people who sought to exploit the suffering of others for amusement on the Internet become the stars of a gruesome viral video from which no one gets out alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aiowPXtxPMTG1RBL03CX38cafrQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267806'),
  ('882299124143674504', 'V/H/S/2', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Simon Barrett, Adam Wingard, Eduardo Sánchez', 'Simon Barrett, Jason Eisener, Gareth Evans', 'Lawrence Michael Levine, Kelsy Abbott, L.C. Holt, Simon Barrett, Mindy Robinson, Adam Wingard, Hannah Hughes, John T. Woods', 'NR', 'Inside a darkened house looms a column of TVs littered with VHS tapes, a pagan shrine to forgotten analog gods. The screens crackle and pop endlessly with monochrome vistas of static white noise permeating the brain and fogging concentration. But you must fight the urge to relax: this is no mere movie night. Those obsolete spools contain more than just magnetic tape. They are imprinted with the very soul of evil.', 'Inside a darkened house looms a column of TVs littered with VHS tapes, a pagan shrine to forgotten analog gods. The screens crackle and pop endlessly with monochrome vistas of static white noise permeating the brain and fogging concentration. But you must fight the urge to relax: this is no mere movie night. Those obsolete spools contain more than just magnetic tape. They are imprinted with the very soul of evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4hcWsHaHaNQ9BBReOxLvYJNRhA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159117'),
  ('842258259043827047', 'V/H/S/85', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Scott Derrickson, Natasha Kermani, Gigi Saul Guerrero', 'Gigi Saul Guerrero', 'Alex Galick, Anna Sundberg, Chelsey Grant, Toussaint Morrison, Anna Hashizume, Tom Reed, Evie Bair, Renee Werbowski', 'NR', 'Unveiled through a made-for-TV documentary, five chilling tales of found footage horror emerge to take viewers on a gore-filled journey through the grim underbelly of the forgotten 1980s.', 'Unveiled through a made-for-TV documentary, five chilling tales of found footage horror emerge to take viewers on a gore-filled journey through the grim underbelly of the forgotten 1980s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aM3wnZTKEuPLDwxuMWcHDibOkiw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032948'),
  ('1139203357532383166', 'V/H/S/94', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jennifer Reeder, Ryan Prows, Benjamin Kitchens', 'Simon Barrett, Chloe Okuno, Ryan Prows', 'Anna Hopkins, Christian Potenza, Brian Paul, Tim Campbell, Gina Louise Phillips, Thiago Dos Santos, Kyle Durack, Demetri Kellesis', 'R', 'After the discovery of a mysterious VHS tape, a brutish police SWAT team launches a high-intensity raid on a remote warehouse, only to discover a sinister cult compound whose collection of pre-recorded material uncovers a nightmarish conspiracy.', 'After the discovery of a mysterious VHS tape, a brutish police SWAT team launches a high-intensity raid on a remote warehouse, only to discover a sinister cult compound whose collection of pre-recorded material uncovers a nightmarish conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fSogEkqDfJQTuGHsTFloQz3Tw8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:753453'),
  ('146056721293882386', 'V/H/S/99', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Joseph Winter, Vanessa Winter, Tyler MacIntyre', 'Flying Lotus, Joseph Winter, Vanessa Winter', 'Jackson Kelly, Jesse LaTourette, Keanush Tafreshi, Dashiell Derrickson, Tybee Diskin, Verona Blue, Aminah Nieves, Kelley Missal', 'NR', 'A thirsty teenager''s home video leads to a series of horrifying revelations, harkening back to the final punk rock analog days of VHS, while taking one giant leap forward into the hellish new millennium.', 'A thirsty teenager''s home video leads to a series of horrifying revelations, harkening back to the final punk rock analog days of VHS, while taking one giant leap forward into the hellish new millennium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bOMmFtnykBmvhFcx8zdXO6bCAa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005776'),
  ('1113231981594568858', 'V/H/S/Beyond', 2024, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Jordan Downey, Justin Martinez, Kate Siegel', 'Virat Pal, Christian Long, Mike Flanagan', 'Brian Baker, Trevor Dow, Gerry Eng, Sam Gorski, Mitch Horowitz, Niko Pueringer, Wren Weichman, Thom Hallum', 'NR', 'The infinite playground of forbidden worlds and dangerous lifeforms offered by the sci-fi horror genre will lead to the biggest, maddest, bloodiest V/H/S ever.', 'The infinite playground of forbidden worlds and dangerous lifeforms offered by the sci-fi horror genre will lead to the biggest, maddest, bloodiest V/H/S ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXaf6VGNHIGU7qivapGOF7o4o4N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1190868'),
  ('1130088010387872299', 'V/H/S/Halloween', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bryan M. Ferguson, Casper Kelly, Micheline Pitt-Norman', 'R.H. Norman, Micheline Pitt-Norman, Anna Zlokovic', 'Samantha Cochran, Natalia Montgomery Fernandez, Elena Musser, Adam Carr, Charlotte Mae Curtis, Charlie Gehrt, Samuel Charles, Brayon Cutrer', 'R', 'A collection of Halloween-themed videotapes unleashes a series of twisted, blood-soaked tales, turning trick-or-treat into a struggle for survival.', 'A collection of Halloween-themed videotapes unleashes a series of twisted, blood-soaked tales, turning trick-or-treat into a struggle for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvMKSZtN8KAdtlKoYbEi1Zhyaou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1373445'),
  ('19605447257751698', 'V2: Dead Angel', 2007, 'Crime, Action', 'Aleksi Mäkelä, Pini Hellstedt, Jouni Mutanen', 'Marko Leino', 'Juha Veijonen, Hannu-Pekka Björkman, Jussi Lampi, Johanna Kokko, Lotta Lindroos, Kari-Pekka Toivonen, Pekka Huotari, Kari Väänänen', null, 'The tough Detective Vares, get hired by a friend accused of murdering a girl. His job is to find the real killer, but people aren''t talking. Before he can get traction another homicide takes place- and things move toward a dire conclusion.', 'The tough Detective Vares, get hired by a friend accused of murdering a girl. His job is to find the real killer, but people aren''t talking. Before he can get traction another homicide takes place- and things move toward a dire conclusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgEhBCWTV4ezab7dr4mHmtLCi6A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29670'),
