  ('492939120444857624', 'Va Savoir (Who Knows?)', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Jacques Rivette, William Lubtchansky', 'Jacques Rivette, Pascal Bonitzer, Christine Laurent', 'Jeanne Balibar, Marianne Basler, Hélène de Fougerolles, Catherine Rouvel, Sergio Castellitto, Jacques Bonnaffé, Bruno Todeschini, Claude Berri', 'PG-13', 'After finding love and success in Italy, French actress Camille returns to Paris, the city she fled three years ago. She secretly dreads confronting her ex-boyfriend Pierre. Her new lover Ugo also has a secret, as he’s meeting with the intriguing Dominique while on his quest for an unpublished manuscript.', 'After finding love and success in Italy, French actress Camille returns to Paris, the city she fled three years ago. She secretly dreads confronting her ex-boyfriend Pierre. Her new lover Ugo also has a secret, as he’s meeting with the intriguing Dominique while on his quest for an unpublished manuscript.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZW85CU32SYme7MZjoD2d7KUgHO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55372'),
  ('606198215765890903', 'Vaada', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Satish Kaushik', 'Satish Kaushik', 'Arjun Rampal, Zayed Khan, Ameesha Patel, Alok Nath, Rakesh Bedi', null, 'Rahul and Puja are married and totally devoted to each other. One day they meet with a terrible accident and Rahul loses his eyesight. On a business trip abroad Rahul meets a friend Karan. Impressed by his dynamism and business acumen, Rahul asks him to join his business. They return to India and Puja is stunned to see her husband with her friend Karan. Rahul''s love for Puja is blind and unquestioning. Karan''s love for Puja is obsessive and uncontrollable. Puja is trapped between a blind husband and a sighted lover.', 'Rahul and Puja are married and totally devoted to each other. One day they meet with a terrible accident and Rahul loses his eyesight. On a business trip abroad Rahul meets a friend Karan. Impressed by his dynamism and business acumen, Rahul asks him to join his business. They return to India and Puja is stunned to see her husband with her friend Karan. Rahul''s love for Puja is blind and unquestioning. Karan''s love for Puja is obsessive and uncontrollable. Puja is trapped between a blind husband and a sighted lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bk0enIvemyRlYacoJYoS09Z25Gp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311142'),
  ('660598827372006387', 'Vaah! Life Ho Toh Aisi!', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Mahesh Manjrekar, Vijay Kumar Arora, Vineet Kumar Singh', 'Mahesh Manjrekar', 'Shahid Kapoor, Sanjay Dutt, Amrita Rao, Arshad Warsi, Prem Chopra, Adil Badshah, Shweta Basu Prasad, Vivek Shauq', null, 'As the only employed member of a large family, Aditya Singh a big-hearted mechanic, works hard to provide for his siblings, his grandmother and a bevy of nieces and nephews. But, when he is unexpectedly killed in a car accident, his family''s future becomes a murky prospect. Fearful for their safety and happiness, Aditya convinces Yamraj the Hindu god of death, to give him a chance to return -- as a ghost -- to carry out the unresolved business of his life.', 'As the only employed member of a large family, Aditya Singh a big-hearted mechanic, works hard to provide for his siblings, his grandmother and a bevy of nieces and nephews. But, when he is unexpectedly killed in a car accident, his family''s future becomes a murky prospect. Fearful for their safety and happiness, Aditya convinces Yamraj the Hindu god of death, to give him a chance to return -- as a ghost -- to carry out the unresolved business of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1f4PGH7PDRWlcr5xml3uZCZBobC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83903'),
