  ('646605404206019343', 'Vaazha II', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Action', 'Savin Sa, Akhil Lailasuran', 'Vipin Das', 'Hashir, Alan Bin Siraj, Ajin Joy, Vinayak V, Alphonse Puthren, Sudheesh, Vijay Babu, Vinod Kedamangalam', null, 'Four friends – Hashir, Alan, Ajin and Vinayak – are considered losers and troublemakers by parents, family and the school management. They face immense social pressure as they reach adulthood, embarking them on an emotional journey of self discovery and acceptance, where they finally learn to take up their responsibilities and find success', 'Four friends – Hashir, Alan, Ajin and Vinayak – are considered losers and troublemakers by parents, family and the school management. They face immense social pressure as they reach adulthood, embarking them on an emotional journey of self discovery and acceptance, where they finally learn to take up their responsibilities and find success', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yLZ7kExd0UGGbaZW4LxmYD4OIf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1336770'),
  ('98243184740935693', 'Vabank', 1981, 'Crime, Comedy, History', 'Juliusz Machulski, Jerzy Łukaszewicz', 'Juliusz Machulski', 'Jan Machulski, Leonard Pietraszak, Witold Pyrkosz, Jacek Chmielnik, Krzysztof Kiersznowski, Ewa Szykulska, Zdzisław Kuźniar, Józef Para', null, 'October 1934. Poland. Famous bank robber Kwinto decided to quit his dangerous criminal job, but after his friend''s death, he changed his mind and organized a burglary of famous and well protected bank which belonged to his former partner in crime, backstabbing and double-crossing Kramer. Kwinto designs a clever plan not to only rob the Kramer''s bank but to make it look like Kramer himself did it.', 'October 1934. Poland. Famous bank robber Kwinto decided to quit his dangerous criminal job, but after his friend''s death, he changed his mind and organized a burglary of famous and well protected bank which belonged to his former partner in crime, backstabbing and double-crossing Kramer. Kwinto designs a clever plan not to only rob the Kramer''s bank but to make it look like Kramer himself did it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7zfxMLCn3KK7sf2dPl43OKSbjQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22257'),
