  ('37007846808168942', 'Vacation at Your Own Expense', 1982, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Viktor Titov', 'Valentin Azernikov, András Polgár', 'Olga Melikhova, Igor Kostolevskiy, Miklós Kalocsay, Lyudmila Gurchenko, Yelena Romanova, Vladimir Basov, Marianna Strizhenova, Ella Nekrasova', null, 'A young girl from the Siberian province arrives in Moscow for her beloved, whom she met during his business trip. He is a test designer for buses and will be on a business trip to Hungary. It was at this point that Katya set her vacation time. But it seems that they didn’t really wait for her... However, a meeting with László changes all her plans...', 'A young girl from the Siberian province arrives in Moscow for her beloved, whom she met during his business trip. He is a test designer for buses and will be on a business trip to Hungary. It was at this point that Katya set her vacation time. But it seems that they didn’t really wait for her... However, a meeting with László changes all her plans...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvPrTMNTsNkb2nQ1QjFtmwIwZxC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72959'),
  ('931479621880783218', 'Vacation Friends', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Tim Suhrstedt, David Stickler, Mike Topoozian', 'Tim Mullen, Tom Mullen, Clay Tarver', 'Lil Rel Howery, Yvonne Orji, John Cena, Meredith Hagner, Robert Wisdom, Lynn Whitfield, Andrew Bachelor, Tawny Newsome', 'R', 'When a straight-laced couple that has fun with a rowdy couple on vacation in Mexico return to the States, they discover that the crazy couple they met in Mexico followed them back home and decide to play tricks on them.', 'When a straight-laced couple that has fun with a rowdy couple on vacation in Mexico return to the States, they discover that the crazy couple they met in Mexico followed them back home and decide to play tricks on them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCyJeTAct07ORPJPHyzxCrVtZzh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653349'),
  ('1101413220968437669', 'Vacation Friends 2', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Tim Suhrstedt, Clay Tarver, Eric Heffron', 'Clay Tarver', 'Lil Rel Howery, Yvonne Orji, John Cena, Meredith Hagner, Steve Buscemi, Carlos Santos, Ronny Chieng, Arnold Y. Kim', 'R', 'Newly married Marcus and Emily invite Ron and Kyla, who are also newly married with a baby, to join them at a Caribbean resort, where Marcus is meeting with the owners about a construction contract for a Chicago hotel. But when the party begins the couples'' relaxing vacation quickly becomes a wild adventure.', 'Newly married Marcus and Emily invite Ron and Kyla, who are also newly married with a baby, to join them at a Caribbean resort, where Marcus is meeting with the owners about a construction contract for a Chicago hotel. But when the party begins the couples'' relaxing vacation quickly becomes a wild adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmH3VaUbwwTO3vDJhWT35BOFgb3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:869641'),
  ('822564994162806065', 'Vacation of Petrov and Vasechkin, Usual and Incredible', 1984, 'Comedy, Family', 'Vladimir Alenikov, Igor Feldshtein', 'Vladimir Alenikov', 'Egor Druzhinin, Dmitri Barkov, Inga Ilm, Inna Alenikova, Sofiko Chiaureli, Boris Yanovskiy, Tamuna Beridze, Irakli Uchaneishvili', null, 'In the first part, the students complain that classic works of literature have no bearing on modern life - and find themselves in a situation strangely resembling something they''ve read... It''s Gogol''s "Inspector General" - but set in a summer camp... In the second part, after reading Don Quixote, the ever-adventurous Vasechkin convinces more cautious Petrov that he has found a game that they could play for life. No sooner they go off than Vasechkin, on a bike, brandishing an umbrella, attacks a giant... That is, a windmill...', 'In the first part, the students complain that classic works of literature have no bearing on modern life - and find themselves in a situation strangely resembling something they''ve read... It''s Gogol''s "Inspector General" - but set in a summer camp... In the second part, after reading Don Quixote, the ever-adventurous Vasechkin convinces more cautious Petrov that he has found a game that they could play for life. No sooner they go off than Vasechkin, on a bike, brandishing an umbrella, attacks a giant... That is, a windmill...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2lcaHeZMXtJRF0uncaPIQ20j2L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192305'),
  ('701824806168739774', 'Vacation of Terror', 1987, 'Horror', 'René Cardona III, Roberto Schlosser, Luis Medina', null, 'Pedro Fernández, Julio Alemán, Gabriela Hassel, Nuria Bages, Gianella Hassel Kus, Carlos East Jr., Ernesto East, Carlos East', null, 'After inheriting a new summer home from a deceased relative, Fernando brings his family along for a vacation. They quickly discover strange happenings on the property, but when young daughter Gaby falls into a well and returns with an old doll, things take a turn for the horrific.', 'After inheriting a new summer home from a deceased relative, Fernando brings his family along for a vacation. They quickly discover strange happenings on the property, but when young daughter Gaby falls into a well and returns with an old doll, things take a turn for the horrific.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/APtFjIHGkiX45BmjgfO3aoWSgy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87916'),
  ('791769016456141165', 'Vacation of Terror II: Diabolical Birthday', 1991, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Pedro Galindo III', 'Pedro Galindo III, Eduardo Galindo, Santiago Galindo', 'Pedro Fernández, Tatiana, Joaquín Cordero, Luis Camarena, Renata del Río, Alfredo Gutiérrez ''El Turco'', Ernesto Casillas, Ernesto Carregha', null, 'Julio is back, quietly running an antique shop, when a chance encounter with singer Mayra and her younger sister brings him face to face with the evil doll again!', 'Julio is back, quietly running an antique shop, when a chance encounter with singer Mayra and her younger sister brings him face to face with the evil doll again!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZj2UcBS9q2mTDreG3EFzJqn2xr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87917'),
