  ('209301823025181858', 'Vadh', 2022, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Jaspal Singh Sandhu, Rajeev Barnwal, Deepak Thaper', 'Jaspal Singh Sandhu, Rajeev Barnwal', 'Sanjay Mishra, Neena Gupta, Manav Vij, Saurabh Sachdeva, Umesh Kaushik, Tanya Lal, Pranjal Pateriya, Diwakar Kumar', null, 'Shambhunath Mishra, a retired middle school teacher is living a mundane middle-class life with his wife Manju Mishra in Gwalior. Life takes a complete turn for the Mishra family when a situation gets out of hand and it leads to a killing at the hands of Shambhunath Mishra. Mishra ji has very little time to plan cautiously to turn this into a “perfect murder” and leave no trace behind.', 'Shambhunath Mishra, a retired middle school teacher is living a mundane middle-class life with his wife Manju Mishra in Gwalior. Life takes a complete turn for the Mishra family when a situation gets out of hand and it leads to a killing at the hands of Shambhunath Mishra. Mishra ji has very little time to plan cautiously to turn this into a “perfect murder” and leave no trace behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgv1gGpX1Q9EjEiFYNJqC6nX1MF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1046991'),
  ('288971660954275418', 'Vadh 2', 2026, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Jaspal Singh Sandhu', 'Jaspal Singh Sandhu', 'Sanjay Mishra, Neena Gupta, Kumud Mishra, Amitt K Singh, Akshay Dogra, Shilpa Shukla, Yogita Bihani, Akanksha Ojha', null, 'A police officer''s pursuit of truth in a shocking prison crime intertwines with the lives of a widowed prison guard and a soon to be released inmate, unravelling a web of morality and redemption.', 'A police officer''s pursuit of truth in a shocking prison crime intertwines with the lives of a widowed prison guard and a soon to be released inmate, unravelling a web of morality and redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KFcPRcv7hNUhaxlCU14FybwkcP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1595507'),
  ('532235074910374094', 'Vagabond', 1985, 'Drama', 'Agnès Varda, Patrick Blossier', 'Agnès Varda', 'Sandrine Bonnaire, Macha Méril, Yolande Moreau, Stéphane Freiss, Setti Ramdane, Yahiaoui Assouna, Marthe Jarnias, Francis Balchère', null, 'Mona Bergeron is dead, her frozen body found in a ditch in the French countryside. From this, the film flashes back to the weeks leading up to her death. Through these flashbacks, Mona gradually declines as she travels from place to place, taking odd jobs and staying with whomever will offer her a place to sleep. Mona is fiercely independent, craving freedom over comfort, but it is this desire to be free that will eventually lead to her demise.', 'Mona Bergeron is dead, her frozen body found in a ditch in the French countryside. From this, the film flashes back to the weeks leading up to her death. Through these flashbacks, Mona gradually declines as she travels from place to place, taking odd jobs and staying with whomever will offer her a place to sleep. Mona is fiercely independent, craving freedom over comfort, but it is this desire to be free that will eventually lead to her demise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KFfwiPct1hwqi9dkKqoom0BenC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44018'),
  ('999593358501569106', 'Vai que Cola 2: O Começo', 2019, 'Comedy', 'André Horta, Leonardo Carvalho, César Rodrigues', 'João Paulo Horta, Renato Fagundes, Leandro Soares', 'Samantha Schmütz, Marcus Majella, Cacau Protásio, Catarina Abdala, Emiliano D''Ávila, Sílvio Guindane, Fiorella Mattheis, Érico Brás', null, 'Long before they socialized almost every day at Dona Jô''s pension, Jéssica, Ferdinando and Máicol didn''t even know each other. But when Terezinha decides to organize a big feijoada at Morro do Cerol, they all meet for the first time, in the most unusual way possible.', 'Long before they socialized almost every day at Dona Jô''s pension, Jéssica, Ferdinando and Máicol didn''t even know each other. But when Terezinha decides to organize a big feijoada at Morro do Cerol, they all meet for the first time, in the most unusual way possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekJG2dZMOzEbKGI4PW45vc52Go8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615275'),
  ('646011796662628279', 'Vai Que Cola: O Filme', 2015, 'Comedy', 'César Rodrigues, João Pádua, Carla Villa Lobos', 'Leandro Soares, Luiz Noronha, Fil Braz', 'Paulo Gustavo, Marcus Majella, Samantha Schmütz, Catarina Abdala, Fernando Caruso, Cacau Protásio, Emiliano D''Ávila, Fiorella Mattheis', null, 'Valdomiro gets involved in yet another scheme, this time involving the same people that tricked him into losing everything - and he brings everyone from Ms. Jô''s hostel along.', 'Valdomiro gets involved in yet another scheme, this time involving the same people that tricked him into losing everything - and he brings everyone from Ms. Jô''s hostel along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6XIIaDO8jOQKc39iGLzXLRgNN4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:303982'),
  ('983288346146513581', 'Vai Que Dá Certo', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Maurício Farias, Fabio Burtin, Uli Burtin', 'Bernardo Guilherme, Maurício Farias, Fábio Porchat', 'Danton Mello, Lúcio Mauro Filho, Fábio Porchat, Gregório Duvivier, Felipe Abib, Natália Lage, Bruno Mazzeo, Georgiana Góes', null, '5 friends have a plan to rob a transporter that can change their lives.', '5 friends have a plan to rob a transporter that can change their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q793L0YiI5kmGRpIYOYVCJWgiAE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180371'),
  ('158452692976559040', 'Vai Que Dá Certo 2', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Maurício Farias, Calvito Leal, Daniel Lentini', 'Bernardo Guilherme, Fábio Porchat, Marcelo Gonçalves', 'Danton Mello, Lúcio Mauro Filho, Fábio Porchat, Felipe Abib, Natália Lage, Vladimir Brichta, Verônica Debom, Felipe Rocha', null, 'After going through a failed heist, 5 friends, apparently back to their normal lives, are involved in an opportunity to pull off another one.', 'After going through a failed heist, 5 friends, apparently back to their normal lives, are involved in an opportunity to pull off another one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tiv6OTMgz3nhXkdg3cVe83VLhuW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337708'),
  ('118657955539237526', 'Vajont', 2001, 'Drama', 'Renzo Martinelli, Daniele Cascella, Antonio La Marra', 'Renzo Martinelli, Pietro Calderoni', 'Michel Serrault, Daniel Auteuil, Laura Morante, Jorge Perugorría, Leo Gullotta, Anita Caprioli, Mauro Corona, Philippe Leroy', null, 'On October 9th, 1963, at 10:39 pm, 260 million cubic meters of rock fell down from Mount Toc to the artificial lake formed by the Vajont dam, the higher dam in the world. The landslide formed a 250-meters wave and 50 million cubic meters of water completely destroied all the below towns, killing more than 2000 people. Planned by engineer Semenza, Vajont dam (263 meters) had to carry the electricity in all the houses of the country. Tina Merlin, a journalist from ''L''Unitá'', tried for years to denounce the danger to build a dam near the Mount Toc and expecially to denounce all the omissions by the corrupted politicians and workers in charge of the dam construction. They preferred to trust in old geologist Dal Piaz instead to hear engineer Semenza young son''s alarming analysis. No one seemed to understand the high danger until that October fatal night.', 'On October 9th, 1963, at 10:39 pm, 260 million cubic meters of rock fell down from Mount Toc to the artificial lake formed by the Vajont dam, the higher dam in the world. The landslide formed a 250-meters wave and 50 million cubic meters of water completely destroied all the below towns, killing more than 2000 people. Planned by engineer Semenza, Vajont dam (263 meters) had to carry the electricity in all the houses of the country. Tina Merlin, a journalist from ''L''Unitá'', tried for years to denounce the danger to build a dam near the Mount Toc and expecially to denounce all the omissions by the corrupted politicians and workers in charge of the dam construction. They preferred to trust in old geologist Dal Piaz instead to hear engineer Semenza young son''s alarming analysis. No one seemed to understand the high danger until that October fatal night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcCuGPLFOngKufrMK6aMwXMC9ze.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48941'),
  ('346058554979339110', 'Vajont 9 ottobre ''63', 1997, 'Documentary, History', null, null, 'Marco Paolini', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8AmxGjavIPByfJ3LjAAZ9P9ZxNy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292268'),
  ('1003516476647837329', 'Val', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Ting Poo, Leo Scott, Leila El hayani', null, 'Val Kilmer, Jack Kilmer, Mercedes Kilmer, Joanne Whalley', 'R', 'For over 40 years Val Kilmer, one of Hollywood’s most mercurial and/or misunderstood actors has been documenting his own life and craft through film and video. He has amassed thousands of hours of footage, from 16mm home movies made with his brothers, to time spent in iconic roles for blockbuster movies like Top Gun, The Doors, Tombstone, and Batman Forever. This raw, wildly original and unflinching documentary reveals a life lived to extremes and a heart-filled, sometimes hilarious look at what it means to be an artist and a complex man.', 'For over 40 years Val Kilmer, one of Hollywood’s most mercurial and/or misunderstood actors has been documenting his own life and craft through film and video. He has amassed thousands of hours of footage, from 16mm home movies made with his brothers, to time spent in iconic roles for blockbuster movies like Top Gun, The Doors, Tombstone, and Batman Forever. This raw, wildly original and unflinching documentary reveals a life lived to extremes and a heart-filled, sometimes hilarious look at what it means to be an artist and a complex man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWJKmfmjpkFeTbUGep6t7w5TexA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:834027'),
  ('796533468374498517', 'Valan: Valley of Angels', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Dániel Garas, Béla Bagota', 'Béla Bagota', 'Csaba Krisztik, András Hatházi, Júlia Nyakó, László Mátray, Tollas Gábor, Emõke Pál, Fekete-Lovas Zsolt', null, 'Peter returns to his Transilvanian hometown, Valan, where a dead body was found in the snow-capped mountains. The investigation about his 22 years missing sister leads him to the maze of grave sins of present and the past, where he has to fight not only with local criminals but his own demons too.', 'Peter returns to his Transilvanian hometown, Valan, where a dead body was found in the snow-capped mountains. The investigation about his 22 years missing sister leads him to the maze of grave sins of present and the past, where he has to fight not only with local criminals but his own demons too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tldKkvLFevOlavkadtPUCE6yPQc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:650264'),
  ('979036303084605325', 'Valavaara', 2026, 'Drama', 'Suthan Gowda, Manikanth Kadri', 'Sutan Gowda', 'Master Vedic Kushal, Abhay, Harshitha Gowda', null, 'Kundeshi, a young boy from a farming family, navigates love and loss while searching for a missing cow connected to his family''s struggles.', 'Kundeshi, a young boy from a farming family, navigates love and loss while searching for a missing cow connected to his family''s struggles.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F6LYNI7hsNWKzWHeihhNLxTcQXmP.jpg', 'plex:movie:valavaara'),
  ('729465286520150744', 'Valdez Is Coming', 1971, 'Western', 'Edwin Sherin, Gábor Pogány, Anthony Ray', 'David Rayfiel, Roland Kibbee', 'Burt Lancaster, Susan Clark, Frank Silvera, Jon Cypher, Richard Jordan, Barton Heyman, Héctor Elizondo, Phil Brown', 'PG-13', 'Old Mexican-American sheriff Bob Valdez has always been a haven of sanity in a land of madmen when it came to defending law and order. But the weapon smuggler Frank Tanner is greedy and impulsive. When Tanner provokes a shooting that causes the death of an innocent man and Valdez asks him to financially compensate the widow, Tanner refuses to do so and severely humiliates Valdez, who will do justice and avenge his honor, no matter what it takes.', 'Old Mexican-American sheriff Bob Valdez has always been a haven of sanity in a land of madmen when it came to defending law and order. But the weapon smuggler Frank Tanner is greedy and impulsive. When Tanner provokes a shooting that causes the death of an innocent man and Valdez asks him to financially compensate the widow, Tanner refuses to do so and severely humiliates Valdez, who will do justice and avenge his honor, no matter what it takes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OdjC3Q98UFDBrvlaUiqmu7vsoK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21242'),
  ('612907445779469983', 'Valentin', 2002, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Alejandro Agresti', 'Alejandro Agresti', 'Rodrigo Noya, Carmen Maura, Julieta Cardinali, Jean Pierre Noher, Mex Urtizberea, Lorenzo Quinteros, Alejandro Agresti, Carlos Roffé', 'PG-13', 'Valentin, an 8-year-old boy living with his grandmother in late-1960s Buenos Aires, is surrounded by problems in his family he finds only himself capable of solving.', 'Valentin, an 8-year-old boy living with his grandmother in late-1960s Buenos Aires, is surrounded by problems in his family he finds only himself capable of solving.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBLSZ8lXDBzXrkxKyGlCZ42WOU6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30125'),
  ('508581819972710466', 'Valentin and Valentina', 1985, 'Drama, Romance', 'Georgi Natanson, Viktor Yakushev', 'Mikhail Roshchin, Georgi Natanson', 'Marina Zudina, Nikolay Stotskiy, Tatyana Doronina, Nina Ruslanova, Zinaida Dekhtyaryova, Larisa Udovichenko, Boris Shcherbakov, Lyusyena Ovchinnikova', null, 'Valentin and Valentina love each other and want to marry. But their mothers are strongly against this marriage. So strong is their hate that they can use any possible means.', 'Valentin and Valentina love each other and want to marry. But their mothers are strongly against this marriage. So strong is their hate that they can use any possible means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSXZi1Hmg8PmibH6e2L5mdGuI7z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142757'),
  ('558519186064247176', 'Valentin de las Sierras', 1968, 'Music, Documentary', 'Bruce Baillie', null, null, null, 'Skin, eyes, knees, horses, hair, sun, earth. Old song of Mexican hero, Valentin, sung by blind Jose Santollo Nadiso en Santa Cruz de la Soledad.', 'Skin, eyes, knees, horses, hair, sun, earth. Old song of Mexican hero, Valentin, sung by blind Jose Santollo Nadiso en Santa Cruz de la Soledad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qp7MNkDFoFN9r1gZXmx6EThEYOs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128285'),
  ('723843309968819287', 'Valentin Valentin', 2015, 'Crime', 'Pascal Thomas, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'François Caviglioli, Nathalie Lafaurie, Pascal Bonitzer', 'Marilou Berry, Vincent Rottiers, Marie Gillain, Arielle Dombasle, Geraldine Chaplin, Alexandra Stewart, François Morel, Christine Citti', null, 'In a small Parisian building, a diverse group of people crosses paths, likes and observes each other, without always seeing each other.', 'In a small Parisian building, a diverse group of people crosses paths, likes and observes each other, without always seeing each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bICoJrvnH5IkjmjAEhBt3dCEZeo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316062'),
  ('254910808690262798', 'Valentina', 1982, 'Drama', 'Antonio José Betancor, Juan Ruiz Anchía', 'Lautaro Murúa, Antonio José Betancor, Carlos Escobedo', 'Anthony Quinn, Jorge Sanz, Paloma Gómez, María Rubio, Saturno Cerra, Concha Leza, Alfred Lucchetti, Marisa de Leza', null, 'In 1939, in a French prison camp, José Garcés of the defeated Spanish Republican army raises the spirits of his fellow prisoners by telling the story of the year he was 8 years old, 1911, in a small town in northeastern Spain. He was a rascal, baffling his father, always in trouble, and in love with Valentina, a neighbor girl. On his roof top at night he sends semaphore messages to her. He writes poems. He gets them into trouble, killing her father''s breeding pigeons. When the two families camp at a decaying castle, his tutor, a sympathetic priest, tells him about the most valiant men, the saints, the heroes, and the poets. Already a poet, he learns a lesson about being a hero.', 'In 1939, in a French prison camp, José Garcés of the defeated Spanish Republican army raises the spirits of his fellow prisoners by telling the story of the year he was 8 years old, 1911, in a small town in northeastern Spain. He was a rascal, baffling his father, always in trouble, and in love with Valentina, a neighbor girl. On his roof top at night he sends semaphore messages to her. He writes poems. He gets them into trouble, killing her father''s breeding pigeons. When the two families camp at a decaying castle, his tutor, a sympathetic priest, tells him about the most valiant men, the saints, the heroes, and the poets. Already a poet, he learns a lesson about being a hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sytD27oDHLHiOXEgW733imsP23Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80135'),
  ('473975067977291754', 'Valentina', 2020, 'Drama', 'Cássio Pereira dos Santos, Leonardo Feliciano', 'Cássio Pereira dos Santos, Pedro Diniz', 'Thiessa Woinbackk, Guta Stresser, Rômulo Braga, Ronaldo Bonafro, Letícia Franco, Paula Passos, Rodrigo Lelis, João Gott', null, 'A trans girl and her mother move to a new town in order to start fresh, but quickly face dilemmas when the local high school needs a second parental signature for enrollment.', 'A trans girl and her mother move to a new town in order to start fresh, but quickly face dilemmas when the local high school needs a second parental signature for enrollment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gMZIwZSjOY56koM2ly0d8wfAKq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:644444'),
  ('323429614527278802', 'Valentina... The Virgin Wife', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Marino Girolami, Mario Bianchi, Fausto Zuccoli', 'Marino Girolami, Carlo Veo', 'Renzo Montagnani, Edwige Fenech, Ray Lovelock, Antonio Guidi, Gabriella Giorgelli, Michele Gammino, Florence Barnes, Carroll Baker', 'R', 'Valentina and Giovannino have just got married, but the Honeymoon has gone by and nothing happened between the two. Tension grows and they are about to break up the marriage, until a French tourist satisfies Valentina, while Giovannino regains his virility with his mother in law.', 'Valentina and Giovannino have just got married, but the Honeymoon has gone by and nothing happened between the two. Tension grows and they are about to break up the marriage, until a French tourist satisfies Valentina, while Giovannino regains his virility with his mother in law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dvtGAZfvbsDIdmOeyVrcwII369J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138857'),
  ('127255244196923615', 'Valentina''s Wedding', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Marco Polo Constandse', null, 'Omar Chaparro, Kate Vernon, Ryan Carnes, Marimar Vega, Tony Dalton, María Rojo, Sabine Moussier, Jesús Zavala', null, 'Valentina''s seemingly idyllic life in the US is interrupted when planning a wedding means introducing her fiancé to her scandalous family in Mexico.', 'Valentina''s seemingly idyllic life in the US is interrupted when planning a wedding means introducing her fiancé to her scandalous family in Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sD6o09KA4KyxWvvB8rKn8bQuuD5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:498919'),
  ('1057904815086097944', 'Valentine', 2001, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jamie Blanks, Rick Bota, Don French', 'Donna Powers, Wayne Powers, Gretchen J. Berg', 'Denise Richards, David Boreanaz, Marley Shelton, Jessica Capshaw, Jessica Cauffiel, Katherine Heigl, Fulvio Cecere, Hedy Burress', 'R', 'Four friends start to receive morbid Valentine cards and realise they are being stalked by someone they had spurned 13 years ago. A masked killer is on the loose and Valentine''s day is soon approaching.', 'Four friends start to receive morbid Valentine cards and realise they are being stalked by someone they had spurned 13 years ago. A masked killer is on the loose and Valentine''s day is soon approaching.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMtWV4FixMGTgUjbr9NFVEANGYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10984'),
  ('793972214129709773', 'Valentine', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Agus H Mawardy, Taneri Indria, Izzal Peterson', 'Beby Hasibuan', 'Estelle Linden, Arie Dagienkz, Matthew Settle, Ahmad Affandy, Sasky Aisyahwara, Nabila Putri, Aliza Putri, Fendy Pradana', null, 'A cafe waitress with dreams of stardom becomes an unexpected vigilante, fighting to save Batavia City from rampant crime.', 'A cafe waitress with dreams of stardom becomes an unexpected vigilante, fighting to save Batavia City from rampant crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcoaZNyoN2l8G2RCTgcogaj525G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380764'),
  ('520543703779503878', 'Valentine Ever After', 2016, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Peter Benison, David Warry-Smith, Brandon Jourdin', null, 'Autumn Reeser, Vanessa Matsui, Eric Johnson, Damon Runyan, Ron Lea, Carolyn Scott, Andrea Senior, Jeff Clarke', null, 'Big city girls Julia and her best friend Sydney take a trip to a dude ranch in Wyoming for a fun weekend getaway, but after a brawl at the local bar, the girls are sentenced to stay in town and perform community service. Along the way, Julia finds love and her true calling in life.', 'Big city girls Julia and her best friend Sydney take a trip to a dude ranch in Wyoming for a fun weekend getaway, but after a brawl at the local bar, the girls are sentenced to stay in town and perform community service. Along the way, Julia finds love and her true calling in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zyRNgxw4pIeP5qGk1Cllcj8h2pE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377432'),
  ('1143044934896553567', 'Valentine''s Day', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Garry Marshall, Charles Minsky', 'Abby Kohn, Marc Silverstein, Katherine Fugate', 'Ashton Kutcher, Jamie Foxx, Jennifer Garner, Bradley Cooper, Julia Roberts, Topher Grace, Anne Hathaway, Jessica Biel', 'PG-13', 'Intertwining couples and singles in Los Angeles break-up and make-up based on the pressures and expectations of Valentine''s Day.', 'Intertwining couples and singles in Los Angeles break-up and make-up based on the pressures and expectations of Valentine''s Day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOTcfD2DdnOTmhH0r1TOE09VvNh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32856'),
  ('237114747822965303', 'Valentino', 1977, 'Drama, History', 'Ken Russell, Tim Hutchinson, Malcolm Middleton', 'Mardik Martin', 'Rudolf Nureyev, Leslie Caron, Michelle Phillips, Carol Kane, Felicity Kendal, Seymour Cassel, Peter Vaughan, Huntz Hall', 'R', 'The untimely death of silent screen star Rudolph Valentino prompts the many women in his past to reminisce about his troubled rise to superstardom.', 'The untimely death of silent screen star Rudolph Valentino prompts the many women in his past to reminisce about his troubled rise to superstardom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rp2TVs7UoDJwsy8hejhM78eGGWb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42603'),
  ('983038457349581145', 'Valentino: The Last Emperor', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Tom Hurwitz, Matt Tyrnauer', null, 'Giorgio Armani, Valentino, Giancarlo Giammetti, Doutzen Kroes, Nati Abascal, Jeannie Becker, Marisa Berenson, Matthew Broderick', 'PG-13', 'Film which travels inside the singular world of one of Italy''s most famous fashion designers, Valentino Garavani, documenting the colourful and dramatic closing act of his celebrated career and capturing the end of an era in global fashion. However, at the heart of the film is a love story - the unique relationship between Valentino and his business partner and companion of 50 years, Giancarlo Giammetti. Capturing intimate moments in the lives of two of Italy''s richest and most famous men, the film lifts the curtain on the final act of a nearly 50-year reign at the top of the glamorous and fiercely competitive world of fashion. (Storyville)', 'Film which travels inside the singular world of one of Italy''s most famous fashion designers, Valentino Garavani, documenting the colourful and dramatic closing act of his celebrated career and capturing the end of an era in global fashion. However, at the heart of the film is a love story - the unique relationship between Valentino and his business partner and companion of 50 years, Giancarlo Giammetti. Capturing intimate moments in the lives of two of Italy''s richest and most famous men, the film lifts the curtain on the final act of a nearly 50-year reign at the top of the glamorous and fiercely competitive world of fashion. (Storyville)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQP33BMBuRrDQwOTSdTVHvmOVnv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22774'),
  ('410502855374957066', 'Valerian and the City of a Thousand Planets', 2017, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Action', 'Luc Besson, Louise Molière, Jawahine Zentar', 'Luc Besson', 'Dane DeHaan, Cara Delevingne, Clive Owen, Rihanna, Ethan Hawke, Herbie Hancock, Kris Wu, Rutger Hauer', 'PG-13', 'In the 28th century, Valerian and Laureline are special operatives charged with keeping order throughout the human territories. On assignment from the Minister of Defense, the two undertake a mission to Alpha, an ever-expanding metropolis where species from across the universe have converged over centuries to share knowledge, intelligence, and cultures. At the center of Alpha is a mysterious dark force which threatens the peaceful existence of the City of a Thousand Planets, and Valerian and Laureline must race to identify the menace and safeguard not just Alpha, but the future of the universe.', 'In the 28th century, Valerian and Laureline are special operatives charged with keeping order throughout the human territories. On assignment from the Minister of Defense, the two undertake a mission to Alpha, an ever-expanding metropolis where species from across the universe have converged over centuries to share knowledge, intelligence, and cultures. At the center of Alpha is a mysterious dark force which threatens the peaceful existence of the City of a Thousand Planets, and Valerian and Laureline must race to identify the menace and safeguard not just Alpha, but the future of the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlc95gl3PtrjxSEuM8RhTtSm2xU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339964'),
  ('738409223565802330', 'Valerie', 1957, 'Western, Drama, Crime', 'Ernest Laszlo, Gerd Oswald', 'Leonard Heideman, Emmett Murphy', 'Sterling Hayden, Anita Ekberg, Anthony Steel, Peter Walker, Jered Barclay, Iphigenie Castiglioni, John Wengraf, Gage Clarke', 'NR', 'After the American Civil War, former Union Major John Garth marries pretty settler Valerie but tragedy strikes and the two spouses end up in court where they give two different conflicting accounts of their marriage.', 'After the American Civil War, former Union Major John Garth marries pretty settler Valerie but tragedy strikes and the two spouses end up in court where they give two different conflicting accounts of their marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLTeLtoNNHkuAXtQDlVMhBgKwKk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82963'),
  ('645701202420985389', 'Valerie and Her Week of Wonders', 1970, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Drama', 'Ota Koval, Jaromil Jireš, Eliška Štíbrová', 'Ester Krumbachová, Jaromil Jireš', 'Jaroslava Schallerová, Helena Anýžová, Petr Kopřiva, Jiří Prýmek, Jan Klusák, Libuše Komancová, Karel Engel, Alena Stojáková', null, 'Valerie, a Czechoslovakian teenager living with her grandmother, is blossoming into womanhood, but that transformation proves secondary to the effects she experiences when she puts on a pair of magic earrings. Now seeing the world around her in a different light, Valerie must endure her sexual awakening while attempting to discern reality from fantasy as she encounters lecherous priest Gracian, a vampire-like stranger and otherworldly carnival folk.', 'Valerie, a Czechoslovakian teenager living with her grandmother, is blossoming into womanhood, but that transformation proves secondary to the effects she experiences when she puts on a pair of magic earrings. Now seeing the world around her in a different light, Valerie must endure her sexual awakening while attempting to discern reality from fantasy as she encounters lecherous priest Gracian, a vampire-like stranger and otherworldly carnival folk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lY0IkdouazLBpPYot8dsPAsJqHK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46315'),
  ('226563260979616676', 'Valerie on the Stairs', 2006, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Mick Garris, Jon Joffin', 'Mick Garris', 'Christopher Lloyd, Tony Todd, Tyron Leitso, Nicola Lipman, Jonathan Watton, Christine Barrie, Clare Grant, Suki Kaiser', null, 'Taken from a Clive Barker original screen story, tells the tale of a novelist who discovers there are fates worse than literary anonymity in this sexually-charged tale of terror.', 'Taken from a Clive Barker original screen story, tells the tale of a novelist who discovers there are fates worse than literary anonymity in this sexually-charged tale of terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/idb6B3qe5x1XtNifjB62nuC1Ser.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288588'),
  ('997244580472670762', 'Valhalla', 1986, 'Adventure, Animation, Fantasy', 'Peter Madsen, Jeffrey James Varab, Niels Grønlykke', null, 'Dick Kaysø, Preben Kristensen, Laura Bro, Marie Ingerslev, Susse Wold, Radost Bokel, Hans Clarin, Allan Corduner', null, 'Two children in the Viking age find their way into the magical world of Norse mythology.', 'Two children in the Viking age find their way into the magical world of Norse mythology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9hNX29TfdNzMZMiYEQhkH3vDzI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12646'),
  ('533138421503654121', 'Valhalla', 2019, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Fenar Ahmad, Kasper Tuxen, Cecilia Hellner', 'Fenar Ahmad, Adam August', 'Roland Møller, Patricia Schumann, Jacob Lohmann, Salome R. Gunnarsdottir, Dulfi Al-Jabouri, Andreas Jessen, Sanne Salomonsen, Lára Jóhanna Jónsdóttir', 'NR', 'The Viking children Røskva and Tjalfe embark on an adventurous journey from Midgard to Valhalla with the gods Thor and Loki. Life in Valhalla, however, turns out to be threatened by the dreaded Fenrir wolf and the god''s barbaric archenemies, the Jotnar. Side by side with the gods the two children must fight to save Valhalla from the end of the world - Ragnarok.', 'The Viking children Røskva and Tjalfe embark on an adventurous journey from Midgard to Valhalla with the gods Thor and Loki. Life in Valhalla, however, turns out to be threatened by the dreaded Fenrir wolf and the god''s barbaric archenemies, the Jotnar. Side by side with the gods the two children must fight to save Valhalla from the end of the world - Ragnarok.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ylqYOGYJI2wsWlUq4qjFZ6muCMq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571655'),
  ('1151623368872445434', 'Valhalla Rising', 2009, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, Fantasy', 'Nicolas Winding Refn, Morten Søborg', 'Nicolas Winding Refn, Roy Jacobsen', 'Mads Mikkelsen, Gary Lewis, Jamie Sives, Ewan Stewart, Alexander Morton, Callum Mitchell, Andrew Flanagan, Douglas Russell', 'NR', 'Scandinavia, 1,000 AD. For years, One Eye, a mute warrior of supernatural strength, has been held prisoner by the Norse chieftain Barde. Aided by Are, a boy slave, One Eye slays his captor and together he and Are escape, beginning a journey into the heart of darkness. On their flight, One Eye and Are board a Viking vessel, but the ship is soon engulfed by an endless fog that clears only as the crew sights an unknown land. As the new world reveals its secrets and the Vikings confront their terrible and bloody fate, One Eye discovers his true self.', 'Scandinavia, 1,000 AD. For years, One Eye, a mute warrior of supernatural strength, has been held prisoner by the Norse chieftain Barde. Aided by Are, a boy slave, One Eye slays his captor and together he and Are escape, beginning a journey into the heart of darkness. On their flight, One Eye and Are board a Viking vessel, but the ship is soon engulfed by an endless fog that clears only as the crew sights an unknown land. As the new world reveals its secrets and the Vikings confront their terrible and bloody fate, One Eye discovers his true self.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LBMcAx6XHwEduIsBYipvUke9n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37861'),
  ('752969655900391014', 'Vali', 2009, 'History, Drama', 'Çağatay Tosun, Ferhan Akgün', 'Batur Emin Akyel, Çağatay Tosun', 'Erdal Beşikçioğlu, Şebnem Dönmez, Uğur Polat, İsmail Hacıoğlu, Ayşegül Ünsal, Şemsi İnkaya, Özgür Çevik, Hakan Gerçek', null, 'The suspicious deaths began with the information obtained by MTA engineer Ömer Uçar, who has been a friend of Governor Faruk Yazıcı since childhood, and his colleagues regarding the rich uranium deposit in the region. And the hidden and overt powers behind capital that want this system to continue…', 'The suspicious deaths began with the information obtained by MTA engineer Ömer Uçar, who has been a friend of Governor Faruk Yazıcı since childhood, and his colleagues regarding the rich uranium deposit in the region. And the hidden and overt powers behind capital that want this system to continue…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8H1gtrvLuIp7FlJvc6Llosy0yHo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37429'),
  ('195795154452688588', 'Valiant', 2005, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy, War', 'Gary Chapman, John Fenner', 'Jordan Katz, George Webster, George Melrod', 'Ewan McGregor, Ricky Gervais, Tim Curry, Jim Broadbent, Hugh Laurie, John Cleese, John Hurt, Pip Torrens', 'G', 'Set in 1944, Valiant is a woodland pigeon who wants to become a great hero someday. When he hears they are hiring recruits for the Royal Homing Pigeon Service, he immediately sets out for London. On the way, he meets a smelly but friendly pigeon named Bugsy, who joins him, mainly to get away from clients he cheated in a game of find-the pebble, and helps him sign up for the war.', 'Set in 1944, Valiant is a woodland pigeon who wants to become a great hero someday. When he hears they are hiring recruits for the Royal Homing Pigeon Service, he immediately sets out for London. On the way, he meets a smelly but friendly pigeon named Bugsy, who joins him, mainly to get away from clients he cheated in a game of find-the pebble, and helps him sign up for the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSRO8wukDlGMlrkmRpqL2nWhgPs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14175'),
  ('36977794367076454', 'Valiant Hearts', 2022, 'Drama', 'Mona Achache, Ísarr Eiríksson', 'Mona Achache, Christophe Offenstein, Valerie Zenatti', 'Camille Cottin, Swann Arlaud, Patrick d''Assumçao, Anne-Lise Heimburger, Maé Roudet-Rubens, Leo Riehl, Ferdinand Redouloux, Lila-Rose Gilberti', null, 'In August 1942, during the Second World War, Six Jewish children are trying to escape the Nazis. They are hidden by the resistance in the Chambord Castle, where paintings from Le Louvre are being stored as well. The Nazis are looking for paintings from private collections that would be hidden there as well.', 'In August 1942, during the Second World War, Six Jewish children are trying to escape the Nazis. They are hidden by the resistance in the Chambord Castle, where paintings from Le Louvre are being stored as well. The Nazis are looking for paintings from private collections that would be hidden there as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2r5rMqJxMqqlIqMiHXi0tLN5H9x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843427'),
  ('221839708217630700', 'Valiant One', 2025, 'War, Thriller, Action', 'Steve Barnett, Dan Stilling', 'Steve Barnett, Eric Tipton', 'Chase Stokes, Lana Condor, Desmin Borges, Callan Mulvey, Diana Tsoy, Daniel Jun, Jonathan Whitesell, Stephen Adekolu', 'R', 'With tensions between North and South Korea, a US helicopter crashes on the North side. The survivors must work together to protect a civilian tech specialist and find their way out without the help of US military support.', 'With tensions between North and South Korea, a US helicopter crashes on the North side. The survivors must work together to protect a civilian tech specialist and find their way out without the help of US military support.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sT8Z14RDCAd6szzxzWFAU4xcMwg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1009640'),
  ('665422240582024521', 'Validation', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kurt Kuenne, Kurt Kuenne', 'Kurt Kuenne', 'T.J. Thyne, Vicki Davis, Pam Cook, Manolo Travieso, Danielle Kaplowitz, Candace Weber, Logan Sparks, Andrea Lwin', null, 'A cheerful parking attendant considers it his job to do more than validate parking. He wants to validate the customers themselves, delivering compliments about their appearances and the inner qualities behind them. Everyone who comes up to him with a ticket walks away validated as a worthwhile human being. Soon, the parking attendant becomes so popular that people line up for validation...', 'A cheerful parking attendant considers it his job to do more than validate parking. He wants to validate the customers themselves, delivering compliments about their appearances and the inner qualities behind them. Everyone who comes up to him with a ticket walks away validated as a worthwhile human being. Soon, the parking attendant becomes so popular that people line up for validation...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWtMYoYcD89Qqx98SfydrnmE164.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53216'),
  ('864419342283373591', 'Valimai', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'H. Vinoth, Nirav Shah, Nambi', 'H. Vinoth', 'Ajith Kumar, Huma Qureshi, Kartikeya Gummakonda, Gurbani Judge, Sumithra, Achyuth Kumar, G. M. Sundar, Raj Aiyyappa', null, 'A honest cop tries to track down the brain behind a series of robberies and murders, but things turn personal when his family become pawns in the criminal''s game.', 'A honest cop tries to track down the brain behind a series of robberies and murders, but things turn personal when his family become pawns in the criminal''s game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlh80l4fmOZy8KL34QVBtVjqYFs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:640484'),
  ('1045437618957767961', 'Valkoiset ruusut', 1943, 'Romance, Drama', 'Hannu Leminen, Felix Forsman', 'Hannu Leminen, Ilmari Unho', 'Helena Kara, Tauno Palo, Aku Korhonen, Aino Lohikoski, Hugo Hytönen, Mervi Järventaus, Toppo Elonperä, Ester Toivonen', null, 'Set in turn of the century Helsinki, author Arvo Helavalla''s novel makes an indelible impression on adolescent Auli Ranta. She idolizes the author of a work that can never be forgotten.', 'Set in turn of the century Helsinki, author Arvo Helavalla''s novel makes an indelible impression on adolescent Auli Ranta. She idolizes the author of a work that can never be forgotten.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkxXfyQACe1PqID2n42obnhecjg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258360'),
  ('418265971847309451', 'Valkyrie', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller, War', 'Bryan Singer, Newton Thomas Sigel, John Warnke', 'Christopher McQuarrie, Nathan Alexander', 'Tom Cruise, Kenneth Branagh, Bill Nighy, Terence Stamp, Tom Wilkinson, Carice van Houten, Kenneth Cranham, Thomas Kretschmann', 'PG-13', 'Wounded in Africa during World War II, Nazi Col. Claus von Stauffenberg returns to his native Germany and joins the Resistance in a daring plan to create a shadow government and assassinate Adolf Hitler. When events unfold so that he becomes a central player, he finds himself tasked with both leading the coup and personally killing the Führer.', 'Wounded in Africa during World War II, Nazi Col. Claus von Stauffenberg returns to his native Germany and joins the Resistance in a daring plan to create a shadow government and assassinate Adolf Hitler. When events unfold so that he becomes a central player, he finds himself tasked with both leading the coup and personally killing the Führer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8eoRtXswC8IQDsqW7iJWO56NhAv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2253'),
  ('831593514588409581', 'Valley Girl', 1983, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Martha Coolidge, Frederick Elmes, Michael Hacker', 'Andrew Lane, Wayne Crawford', 'Nicolas Cage, Deborah Foreman, E. G. Daily, Michael Bowen, Cameron Dye, Heidi Holicker, Michelle Meyrink, Tina Theberge', 'R', 'Julie, a girl from the valley, meets Randy, a punk from the city. They are from different worlds and find love. Somehow they need to stay together in spite of her trendy, shallow friends.', 'Julie, a girl from the valley, meets Randy, a punk from the city. They are from different worlds and find love. Somehow they need to stay together in spite of her trendy, shallow friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQSrU9jerYSIOWeLBqFA1gcUU59.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19053'),
