  ('1024819687875789311', 'Valley of Flowers', 2006, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Pan Nalin, Michał Englert, Jampa Kalsang Tamang', 'Pan Nalin', 'Mylène Jampanoï, Milind Soman, Naseeruddin Shah, Jampa Kalsang Tamang, Anil Yadav, Reina Hara, Hiroshi Honjomaru, Go Ayano', null, 'A Himalayan legend of a love struggling against the inevitability of death, an astonishing tale spanning from the early 19th century mountain existence, to hectic, bustling modern day Tokyo.', 'A Himalayan legend of a love struggling against the inevitability of death, an astonishing tale spanning from the early 19th century mountain existence, to hectic, bustling modern day Tokyo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5E8fSf9UiAiL2An4sX3C4WVXlY4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8014'),
  ('133497367670986360', 'Valley of Love', 2015, 'Drama', 'Guillaume Nicloux, Christophe Offenstein', 'Guillaume Nicloux', 'Gérard Depardieu, Isabelle Huppert, Dan Warner, Dionne Houle, Aurélia Thiérrée, Derek Newman', null, 'A story of two famous actors who used to be a couple. They reunite after the son''s death and receive a letter asking them to visit five places at Death Valley, which will make the son reappear.', 'A story of two famous actors who used to be a couple. They reunite after the son''s death and receive a letter asking them to visit five places at Death Valley, which will make the son reappear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8Q1XxOdAsch0yEwuhTTasUnaqd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337107'),
  ('436656377363619368', 'Valley of Peace', 1956, 'War, Drama', 'France Štiglic, Rudi Vaupotič', 'Vladimir Koch, France Štiglic, Ivan Ribič', 'John Kitzmiller, Evelyne Wohlfeiler, Tugo Štiglic, Boris Kralj, Janez Čuk, Francek Drofenik, Maks Furijan, Anton Homar', null, 'When the planes bombed a Slovene town, a Slovene boy and a German girl set on a journey towards the valley, in which there is no war. On their way a black American pilot, who jumped of a shoot-down plane, joins them. Although American planes have killed the boy''s parents, he accepts the pilot with enthusiasm. The children communicate with him in German and the valley of peace seems like the last paradise place of refuge. The Slovene boy, the German girl, and the American pilot represent a symbolic triangle of peace in this adventure happening in the middle of the War of Liberation.', 'When the planes bombed a Slovene town, a Slovene boy and a German girl set on a journey towards the valley, in which there is no war. On their way a black American pilot, who jumped of a shoot-down plane, joins them. Although American planes have killed the boy''s parents, he accepts the pilot with enthusiasm. The children communicate with him in German and the valley of peace seems like the last paradise place of refuge. The Slovene boy, the German girl, and the American pilot represent a symbolic triangle of peace in this adventure happening in the middle of the War of Liberation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/de1q7qX3jtRVHNZI8hvVZPHLCf2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106765'),
  ('495609802530987730', 'Valley of Shadows', 2024, 'Adventure, Thriller, Drama', 'Salvador Calvo, Álex Catalán', 'Alejandro Hernández', 'Miguel Herrán, Susana Abaitua, Alexandra Masangkay, Iván Renedo, Stanzin Gombo, Morup Namgyal, Pavel Anton, Sonam Angchok', null, 'Quique, Clara and little Lucas are vacationing in northern India. One night, sleeping outside during a storm, they are brutally attacked. Hours later, Quique is rescued by a native and taken to a remote isolated village in the mountains.', 'Quique, Clara and little Lucas are vacationing in northern India. One night, sleeping outside during a storm, they are brutally attacked. Hours later, Quique is rescued by a native and taken to a remote isolated village in the mountains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxmHrv2dCSoULvkT3jfStNKJeOw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1145857'),
  ('96855417805430031', 'Valley of the Dead', 2020, 'Comedy, Horror, War', 'Javier Ruiz Caldera, Alberto de Toro, Kiko de la Rica', 'Alberto Fernández Arregui', 'Miki Esparbé, Aura Garrido, Luis Callejo, Álvaro Cervantes, Jesús Carroza, Dafnis Balduz, Sergio Torrico, Manel Llunell', 'R', 'During the Spanish Civil War, sworn enemies must work together when they encounter flesh-eating zombies created in a Nazi experiment.', 'During the Spanish Civil War, sworn enemies must work together when they encounter flesh-eating zombies created in a Nazi experiment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avokvOwhjVR9GgISsSSgb2A343G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613093'),
  ('1039595036071956050', 'Valley of the Dolls', 1967, 'Drama, Romance', 'William H. Daniels, Mark Robson', 'Helen Deutsch, Dorothy Kingsley', 'Barbara Parkins, Patty Duke, Sharon Tate, Paul Burke, Lee Grant, Susan Hayward, Martin Milner, Charles Drake', 'PG-13', 'Lured by their dreams of fame and fortune, three ambitious young women enter the world of show business and discover how easy it is to sink into a celebrity nightmare of ego, alcohol and pills — the beloved "dolls."', 'Lured by their dreams of fame and fortune, three ambitious young women enter the world of show business and discover how easy it is to sink into a celebrity nightmare of ego, alcohol and pills — the beloved "dolls."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQgsWkNTL8GJloJRzqonImIaIJb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3055'),
  ('566457150657935736', 'Valley of the Dragons', 1961, 'Science Fiction', 'Edward Bernds, Brydon Baker, George Rhein', 'Edward Bernds', 'Cesare Danova, Sean McClory, Joan Staley, Danielle De Metz, Gregg Martell, Gil Perkins, I. Stanford Jolley, Roger Til', null, 'In 1881 Algeria, an American soldier and a French aristocrat are about to have a duel over a woman when a comet hurtling past the Earth draws them into its gravitational pull. The men find themselves transported to the moon, where they discover a prehistoric civilization inhabited by reptiles and humans.', 'In 1881 Algeria, an American soldier and a French aristocrat are about to have a duel over a woman when a comet hurtling past the Earth draws them into its gravitational pull. The men find themselves transported to the moon, where they discover a prehistoric civilization inhabited by reptiles and humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbkRVUtS9NnrMuTqZsCEryfYYic.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87966'),
  ('103703367794292103', 'Valley of the Gods', 2020, 'Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Zbigniew Malecki, Paweł Tybora, Lech Majewski', 'Lech Majewski', 'Josh Hartnett, Bérénice Marlohe, John Malkovich, John Rhys-Davies, Charlotte Rampling, Jaime Ray Newman, Keir Dullea, Joseph Runningfox', null, 'A mix of fantasy and sci-fi, the film entwines Navajo lore with a reclusive trillionaire and his would-be biographer, creating a fascinating, mysterious and idiosyncratic vision of America.', 'A mix of fantasy and sci-fi, the film entwines Navajo lore with a reclusive trillionaire and his would-be biographer, creating a fascinating, mysterious and idiosyncratic vision of America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXs22e5IpoyiW3fodxkMG0J6lrE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331044'),
  ('67134886238153569', 'Valley of the Kings', 1954, 'Adventure', 'Robert Pirosh, William Shanks, André Smagghe', 'Karl Tunberg, Robert Pirosh', 'Robert Taylor, Eleanor Parker, Carlos Thompson, Kurt Kasznar, Victor Jory, Leon Askin, Aldo Silvani, Samia Gamal', null, 'Hard-boiled archeologist Mark Brandon is searching for ancient tombs in Egypt when he is approached by beautiful Ann Mercedes, who convinces him to help her fulfill her deceased father''s life''s ambition - to provide solid proof of the biblical Joseph''s travels in ancient Egypt. As an ex-pupil of Ann''s father, Mark accepts and the two embark on a search for the tomb of the Pharoah Ra Hotep, said to have had some connection with Joseph. The trail to the tomb is fraught with intrigue, betrayal, murder, and the possibility that the tomb itself has been emptied of all its artifacts by ancient looters.', 'Hard-boiled archeologist Mark Brandon is searching for ancient tombs in Egypt when he is approached by beautiful Ann Mercedes, who convinces him to help her fulfill her deceased father''s life''s ambition - to provide solid proof of the biblical Joseph''s travels in ancient Egypt. As an ex-pupil of Ann''s father, Mark accepts and the two embark on a search for the tomb of the Pharoah Ra Hotep, said to have had some connection with Joseph. The trail to the tomb is fraught with intrigue, betrayal, murder, and the possibility that the tomb itself has been emptied of all its artifacts by ancient looters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkSmyynUZ95g1ZVTESlHCBugWMT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118517'),
  ('422102787748504827', 'Valley of the Wolves Gladio', 2009, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Sadullah Şentürk, Selahattin Sancakli', 'Cüneyt Aysan, Bahadır Özdener, Raci Şaşmaz', 'Musa Uzunlar, Tuğrul Çetiner, Ayfer Dönmez, Sinan Pekinton, Sezai Aydın, Köksal Engür, Ali Başar, Hasan Şahintürk', null, 'Retired security intelligence agent Iskender Buyuk has kept his government''s secrets for years but when the men he has sworn to protect suddenly desert him, Iskender finds himself in the defendant''s chair with only young and inexperienced lawyer Ayse to represent his interests. Understandably angered by this turn of events, Iskender decides to strike back against his one-time employers by revealing all he knows about covert op missions.', 'Retired security intelligence agent Iskender Buyuk has kept his government''s secrets for years but when the men he has sworn to protect suddenly desert him, Iskender finds himself in the defendant''s chair with only young and inexperienced lawyer Ayse to represent his interests. Understandably angered by this turn of events, Iskender decides to strike back against his one-time employers by revealing all he knows about covert op missions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpqRSrnRt29PbHyetWlpHjQ8aVr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35747'),
  ('716321013059333733', 'Valley of the Wolves: Homeland', 2017, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Serdar Akar, Selahattin Sancakli', 'Necati Şaşmaz, Pana Film', 'Necati Şaşmaz, Cahit Kayaoğlu, Erhan Ufak, Sinem Öztürk, Nezih Işıtan, Ertuğrul Şakar, Yücel Erten, Zümre Ertürk', null, 'Polat Alemdar Erhan and Cahit are yet again on the front lines only to discover a military coup attempt in Turkey.', 'Polat Alemdar Erhan and Cahit are yet again on the front lines only to discover a military coup attempt in Turkey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ySkFLATDGH6ML0AA87QldiGQyB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469469'),
  ('1057332568413209002', 'Valley of the Wolves: Iraq', 2006, 'Action, War, Drama', 'Serdar Akar, Selahattin Sancakli', 'Raci Şaşmaz, Bahadır Özdener', 'Necati Şaşmaz, Gürkan Uygun, Kenan Çoban, Erhan Ufak, Bergüzar Korel, Billy Zane, Gary Busey, Diego Serrano', null, 'The film covers through fiction real-life events like the occupation of Iraq, the execution of Daniel Pearl, the Hood event and the Abu Ghraib torture scandal.', 'The film covers through fiction real-life events like the occupation of Iraq, the execution of Daniel Pearl, the Hood event and the Abu Ghraib torture scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7NOQ6u6elKB7KiZVd3uUY3igW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11818'),
  ('317988463240042655', 'Valley of the Wolves: Palestine', 2011, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Zübeyr Şaşmaz, Selahattin Sancakli', 'Raci Şaşmaz, Bahadır Özdener, Cüneyt Aysan', 'Necati Şaşmaz, Gürkan Uygun, Kenan Çoban, Nur Fettahoğlu, Erdal Beşikçioğlu, Erkan Sever, Mustafa Jašar, Ayten Uncuoğlu', null, 'After the Freedom Flotilla attempts to bring humanitarian assistance to Gaza refuses to turn back, it is attacked by the Israeli military. In a dramatic battle scene, activists resist and are killed by the Israeli soldiers. A Turkish commando team led by Polat Alemdar (Necati Şaşmaz) travels to West Bank in Palestine, where they launch a campaign against Israeli military personnel in an attempt to track down and eliminate an Israeli general, leader Moşe Ben Eliyezer (Erdal Beşikçioğlu), who is the responsible for the flotilla raid.', 'After the Freedom Flotilla attempts to bring humanitarian assistance to Gaza refuses to turn back, it is attacked by the Israeli military. In a dramatic battle scene, activists resist and are killed by the Israeli soldiers. A Turkish commando team led by Polat Alemdar (Necati Şaşmaz) travels to West Bank in Palestine, where they launch a campaign against Israeli military personnel in an attempt to track down and eliminate an Israeli general, leader Moşe Ben Eliyezer (Erdal Beşikçioğlu), who is the responsible for the flotilla raid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5B9mXAFQoE6n25z6GXO3qKoHHLG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58637'),
  ('144703963718635420', 'Valley of the Zombies', 1946, 'Horror', 'Philip Ford, Reggie Lanning, Richard Cherwin', 'Dorrell McGowan, Stuart E. McGowan', 'Robert Livingston, Lorna Gray, Ian Keith, Thomas E. Jackson, Charles Trowbridge, Earle Hodgins, Wilton Graff, LeRoy Mason', 'NR', 'A woman falls under the hypnotic spell of a resurrected madman.', 'A woman falls under the hypnotic spell of a resurrected madman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bLYCoVzXJxzEjYmRX7hdouPZfUf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122027'),
  ('219209611381129038', 'Valley Uprising', 2014, 'Adventure, Documentary, History', 'Nick Rosen, Josh Lowell, Nick Rosen', 'Nick Rosen, Kathleen McGlaughlin, Peter Mortimer', 'Peter Sarsgaard, Royal Robbins, Warren Harding, John Bachar, Ron Kauk, Jim Bridwell, Lynn Hill, John Long', 'NR', 'In the shady campgrounds of Yosemite valley, climbers carved out a counterculture lifestyle of dumpster-diving and wild parties that clashed with the conservative values of the National Park Service. And up on the walls, generation after generation has pushed the limits of climbing, vying amongst each other for supremacy on Yosemite''s cliffs. "Valley Uprising" is the riveting, unforgettable tale of this bold rock climbing tradition in Yosemite National Park: half a century of struggle against the laws of gravity -- and the laws of the land.', 'In the shady campgrounds of Yosemite valley, climbers carved out a counterculture lifestyle of dumpster-diving and wild parties that clashed with the conservative values of the National Park Service. And up on the walls, generation after generation has pushed the limits of climbing, vying amongst each other for supremacy on Yosemite''s cliffs. "Valley Uprising" is the riveting, unforgettable tale of this bold rock climbing tradition in Yosemite National Park: half a century of struggle against the laws of gravity -- and the laws of the land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wjZdG4K1zkKmlh5DS2xxiEEVPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294959'),
  ('469006177833084836', 'Valmont', 1989, 'Drama, Romance', 'Miloš Forman, Miroslav Ondříček, Pascal Baeumler', 'Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Colin Firth, Annette Bening, Meg Tilly, Fairuza Balk, Siân Phillips, Jeffrey Jones, Henry Thomas, Fabia Drake', 'R', 'Set in Baroque France, a scheming widow and her lover make a bet regarding the corruption of a recently married woman. The lover, Valmont, bets that he can seduce her, even though she is an honorable woman. If he wins, he can have his lover to do as he will. However, in the process of seducing the married woman, Valmont falls in love.', 'Set in Baroque France, a scheming widow and her lover make a bet regarding the corruption of a recently married woman. The lover, Valmont, bets that he can seduce her, even though she is an honorable woman. If he wins, he can have his lover to do as he will. However, in the process of seducing the married woman, Valmont falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AuCnhQII6ZNgRDrr2N5KyDCnhnj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37606'),
  ('841113358355047181', 'Valparaiso', 1964, 'Documentary', 'Sergio Bravo, Joris Ivens, Georges Strouvé', 'Chris Marker', 'Roger Pigaut', null, 'In 1962 Joris Ivens was invited to Chile for teaching and filmmaking. Together with students he made …A Valparaíso, one of his most poetic films. Contrasting the prestigious history of the seaport with the present the film sketches a portrait of the city, built on 42 hills, with its wealth and poverty, its daily life on the streets, the stairs, the rack railways and in the bars. Although the port has lost its importance, the rich past is still present in the impoverished city. The film echoes this ambiguous situation in its dialectical poetic style, interweaving the daily life reality (of 1963) with the history of the city and changing from black and white to colour, finally leaving us with hopeful perspective for the children who are playing on the stairs and hills of this beautiful town.', 'In 1962 Joris Ivens was invited to Chile for teaching and filmmaking. Together with students he made …A Valparaíso, one of his most poetic films. Contrasting the prestigious history of the seaport with the present the film sketches a portrait of the city, built on 42 hills, with its wealth and poverty, its daily life on the streets, the stairs, the rack railways and in the bars. Although the port has lost its importance, the rich past is still present in the impoverished city. The film echoes this ambiguous situation in its dialectical poetic style, interweaving the daily life reality (of 1963) with the history of the city and changing from black and white to colour, finally leaving us with hopeful perspective for the children who are playing on the stairs and hills of this beautiful town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/meaV1OEdBgFt0iQ3NVoGr9mv1cN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79423'),
  ('525157826967651853', 'Valparaiso My Love', 1969, 'Drama', 'Diego Bonacina, Aldo Francia', 'Aldo Francia, José Román', 'Hugo Cárcamo, Sara Astica, Liliana Cabrera, Rigoberto Rojo, Orlando Walter Muñoz', null, 'A story inspired by real events that took place in the port of Valparaiso. Four poor children have been abandoned because their father, who is out of work, steals cattle to feed them and the police have arrested him. The story takes up the children''s point of view and is structured in four episodes that describe their inevitable descent into the world of marginality and crime. Faced with life in a brutal way, from their problematic social situation, they head towards a marginality that is difficult to avoid.', 'A story inspired by real events that took place in the port of Valparaiso. Four poor children have been abandoned because their father, who is out of work, steals cattle to feed them and the police have arrested him. The story takes up the children''s point of view and is structured in four episodes that describe their inevitable descent into the world of marginality and crime. Faced with life in a brutal way, from their problematic social situation, they head towards a marginality that is difficult to avoid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRQdn5ciZlAR488vZchXxx7GQjp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73858'),
  ('537826138053701920', 'Valse Triste', 1977, 'Drama', 'Bruce Conner', null, null, null, 'With a similar dreamy mood like its predecessor "Take the 5:10 to Dreamland" (1976) this clip starts with a boy getting into his bed. The camera zooms in into the boy''s mind and a slow, sad waltz (i.e."Valse Triste") accompanies images of a locomotive, a miner, the globe, the sky, a sheep heard, etc. Disparate elements, but if one concentrates only at the movement of the figures, one can perceive a commotion, slowly livening up: The starting wheels of the heavy locomotive, the tired miner pushing the heavy cart of coal bricks, the globe smoothly turning around and around, the clouds imperceptibly floating in the sky, the sheep idly moving in the herd, etc. We reach the first climax when a mannequin opens her coat like a flower. The second big crescendo spurts out from a "water hose", after watching schoolgirls doing gymnastics for quite a while. A sad, but nostalgic aftertaste lingers in the end when funeral cars drive away through a flooded area…', 'With a similar dreamy mood like its predecessor "Take the 5:10 to Dreamland" (1976) this clip starts with a boy getting into his bed. The camera zooms in into the boy''s mind and a slow, sad waltz (i.e."Valse Triste") accompanies images of a locomotive, a miner, the globe, the sky, a sheep heard, etc. Disparate elements, but if one concentrates only at the movement of the figures, one can perceive a commotion, slowly livening up: The starting wheels of the heavy locomotive, the tired miner pushing the heavy cart of coal bricks, the globe smoothly turning around and around, the clouds imperceptibly floating in the sky, the sheep idly moving in the herd, etc. We reach the first climax when a mannequin opens her coat like a flower. The second big crescendo spurts out from a "water hose", after watching schoolgirls doing gymnastics for quite a while. A sad, but nostalgic aftertaste lingers in the end when funeral cars drive away through a flooded area…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDGRPrqWku5Q3JVFeAC7v3jnzzI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130838'),
  ('940466612752668426', 'Vamos a la Playa', 2023, 'Drama', 'Bettina Blümner', 'Daniel Nocke, Bettina Blümner', 'Leonard Scheicher, Victoria Schulz, Maya Unger, Jakub Gierszał, Eugenio Torroella Ramos, Lily Bergues, Niu Ventura', null, 'When backpacker millennials Benjamin, Judith and Katharina travel to Cuba to find Katharina’s missing brother Wanja, they become more and more entrapped within a maze of delusions, sincere feelings and sexual desires: It begins as an exciting adventure and turns into a passionate love triangle.', 'When backpacker millennials Benjamin, Judith and Katharina travel to Cuba to find Katharina’s missing brother Wanja, they become more and more entrapped within a maze of delusions, sincere feelings and sexual desires: It begins as an exciting adventure and turns into a passionate love triangle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2uDeb3Yl9UJgXMRmuGVh30jO0Wv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022166'),
  ('40463505718414120', 'Vamp', 1986, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Richard Wenk, Elliot Davis', 'Richard Wenk', 'Grace Jones, Chris Makepeace, Sandy Baron, Robert Rusler, Dedee Pfeiffer, Gedde Watanabe, Billy Drago, Brad Logan', 'R', 'Two fraternity pledges go to a sleazy bar in search of a stripper for their college friends, unaware it is occupied by vampires.', 'Two fraternity pledges go to a sleazy bar in search of a stripper for their college friends, unaware it is occupied by vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWXjESqmqU8QCrfWowVcdeC8Uij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34223'),
  ('688583379657541230', 'Vamp U', 2013, 'Action, Comedy, Horror', 'Matt Jespersen, Maclain Nelson', 'Matt Jespersen, Maclain Nelson', 'Julie Gonzalo, Adam Johnson, Gary Cole, Maclain Nelson, Matt Mattson, Bart Johnson, Alexis Knapp, Clare Niederpruem', 'NR', 'Wayne Gretzky is a vampire who can''t grow his teeth. His impotence began when he inadvertently killed Mary Lipinsky, the love of his life, 300 years ago. To take his mind off the pain, he teaches college history - who better? Attempting to regain his full power, he enlists help from his friend and colleague, Dr. Levine. Nothing works until a new semester brings freshman Chris Keller. She''s a dead ringer for Mary and they have a lurid affair, while rumors fly around the campus. But it all sours when he turns Chris into a vampire and her newfound bloodlust spins out of control in a bloody rampage, making the rumors a little too real.', 'Wayne Gretzky is a vampire who can''t grow his teeth. His impotence began when he inadvertently killed Mary Lipinsky, the love of his life, 300 years ago. To take his mind off the pain, he teaches college history - who better? Attempting to regain his full power, he enlists help from his friend and colleague, Dr. Levine. Nothing works until a new semester brings freshman Chris Keller. She''s a dead ringer for Mary and they have a lurid affair, while rumors fly around the campus. But it all sours when he turns Chris into a vampire and her newfound bloodlust spins out of control in a bloody rampage, making the rumors a little too real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQh9Qi8QG3QXMkzTMGp44siPvk1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167733'),
  ('247140468707724793', 'Vampir Cuadecuc', 1972, 'Documentary', 'Anne Settimó, Pere Portabella, Manuel Esteban Marquilles', 'Joan Brossa, Pere Portabella', 'Christopher Lee, Herbert Lom, Soledad Miranda, Jack Taylor, Maria Rohm, Fred Williams, Paul Müller, Jeannine Mestre', 'NR', 'An atmospheric essay, which is an alternative version of Count Dracula, a film directed by Jess Franco in 1970; a ghostly narration between fiction and reality.', 'An atmospheric essay, which is an alternative version of Count Dracula, a film directed by Jess Franco in 1970; a ghostly narration between fiction and reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDy9lPcqJCblNgceoaz2fnG0qDp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126278'),
  ('904647945255084460', 'Vampira', 1974, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Anthony B. Richmond, Clive Donner, Bert Batt', 'Jeremy Lloyd', 'David Niven, Teresa Graves, Peter Bayliss, Jennie Linden, Nicky Henson, Linda Hayden, Bernard Bresslaw, Cathie Shirriff', 'PG', 'In order to revive his long hibernating bride, Vampira, Count Dracula takes blood samples from several beautiful models, but during the transfusion, Vampira''s race turns from white to black.', 'In order to revive his long hibernating bride, Vampira, Count Dracula takes blood samples from several beautiful models, but during the transfusion, Vampira''s race turns from white to black.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3xnVtBdDlpNpo3qAseI4B4zUGG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86214'),
  ('779357235181026142', 'Vampiras: The Brides', 2024, 'Horror, Fantasy, Action', 'Iván Mulero', 'El Torres, Iván Mulero', 'Noel Gugliemi, Olga Aguilar, María Conchita Alonso, Anderson Ballesteros, Pedro Cayuela, Leonardo Daniel, Johanna Fadul, Milett Figueroa', null, 'After more than 300 years in hiding, Dracula''s brides, Luna, Adriana and his new apprentice Katya, must team up once again to stop the most diabolical threat from their past, his sister Mina.', 'After more than 300 years in hiding, Dracula''s brides, Luna, Adriana and his new apprentice Katya, must team up once again to stop the most diabolical threat from their past, his sister Mina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGl6JzSvwfTllfw4UZ9MD8nD42Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1034751'),
  ('579520758097660767', 'Vampire', 2011, 'Drama, Horror', 'Shunji Iwai, Shunji Iwai', 'Shunji Iwai', 'Kevin Zegers, Keisha Castle-Hughes, Yu Aoi, Adelaide Clemens, Trevor Morgan, Amanda Plummer, Kristin Kreuk, Rachael Leigh Cook', null, 'An outwardly normal schoolteacher preys on suicidal women to slake his overwhelming thirst for human blood.', 'An outwardly normal schoolteacher preys on suicidal women to slake his overwhelming thirst for human blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xFzHEJUFVEdqjlXGx4c329cV2Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116248'),
  ('45471919919861087', 'Vampire Academy', 2014, 'Comedy, Action, Fantasy', 'Mark Waters, Tony Pierce-Roberts, Toby Ford', 'Daniel Waters', 'Zoey Deutch, Lucy Fry, Danila Kozlovsky, Gabriel Byrne, Dominic Sherwood, Olga Kurylenko, Sarah Hyland, Cameron Monaghan', 'PG-13', 'Rose, a rebellious half-vampire/half-human guardian-in-training and her best friend, Lissa -- a mortal, royal vampire Princess - have been on the run when they are captured and returned to St. Vladamirs Academy, the very place where they believe their lives may be in most jeopardy. Rose will sacrifice everything to protect Lissa from those who intend to exploit her from within the Academy walls and the Strigoi (immortal, evil vampires) who hunt her kind from outside its sanctuary.', 'Rose, a rebellious half-vampire/half-human guardian-in-training and her best friend, Lissa -- a mortal, royal vampire Princess - have been on the run when they are captured and returned to St. Vladamirs Academy, the very place where they believe their lives may be in most jeopardy. Rose will sacrifice everything to protect Lissa from those who intend to exploit her from within the Academy walls and the Strigoi (immortal, evil vampires) who hunt her kind from outside its sanctuary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJZpKgiFfjDZ6L5aOJvbmDhsGqY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203739'),
  ('494322425107814252', 'Vampire at Midnight', 1988, 'Horror', 'Gregory McClatchy, Daniel Yarussi', null, 'Jason Williams, Gustav Vintas, Lesley Milne, Esther Elise, Jeanie Moore, Christopher Nee, Robert Random, Ted Hamaguchi', null, 'The "Vampire Killer" leaves his victims drained of blood, while a detective tries to catch him.', 'The "Vampire Killer" leaves his victims drained of blood, while a detective tries to catch him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/PSKhxezqvT0XXVTXLqS9TR1oOK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30317'),
  ('1115959137491836732', 'Vampire Bats', 2005, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie, Action, Adventure', 'Eric Bross', 'Doug Prochilo', 'Lucy Lawless, Timothy Bottoms, Brett Butler, Stephanie Honoré, Robin Hines, Jessica Stroup, Tony Plana, Arnie Pantoja', 'NR', 'A biology professor discovers a deadly species of vampire bats are responsible for a series of bizarre murders and now she must find a way to stop them before they are completely out of control.', 'A biology professor discovers a deadly species of vampire bats are responsible for a series of bizarre murders and now she must find a way to stop them before they are completely out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3PjNZMZ5BUyTSKUQATqNT1U7LB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96235'),
  ('713496780558693651', 'Vampire Blues', 1999, 'Horror', 'Jesús Franco, Pedro Temboury, Kevin Collins', 'Jesús Franco', 'Analía Ivars, Lina Romay, Rachel Sheppard, Jesús Franco, Pedro Temboury', null, 'A pretty American teenager from New Jersey goes on vacation in the south of Spain where she is unknowingly stalked by the vampire.', 'A pretty American teenager from New Jersey goes on vacation in the south of Spain where she is unknowingly stalked by the vampire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rK9TX71hAg71pARnSREz16pj0Tr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30455'),
  ('1091049380184530714', 'Vampire Circus', 1972, 'Horror', 'Robert Young, Moray Grant, Derek Whitehurst', 'Judson Kinberg', 'Adrienne Corri, Thorley Walters, Anthony Higgins, John Moulder-Brown, Laurence Payne, Richard Owens, Lynne Frederick, Skip Martin', 'PG', 'After a spate of murders, the villagers of Schtettel kill the depraved perpetrator, Count Mitterhouse. Fifteen years later the Circus of Nights appeared in the plague-ridden village and its performers include Mitterhouse''s mistress, children and cousins. They have come to Schtettel to fulfil the Count''s last words, an evil, vicious curse of death and destruction on those who participated in his impaling. The children of Schtettel become the targets for a brutal and devastating revenge as the Vampire Circus rehearses for its most deadly performance.', 'After a spate of murders, the villagers of Schtettel kill the depraved perpetrator, Count Mitterhouse. Fifteen years later the Circus of Nights appeared in the plague-ridden village and its performers include Mitterhouse''s mistress, children and cousins. They have come to Schtettel to fulfil the Count''s last words, an evil, vicious curse of death and destruction on those who participated in his impaling. The children of Schtettel become the targets for a brutal and devastating revenge as the Vampire Circus rehearses for its most deadly performance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbYsGpPy1JgHjlOb1Onc9xwqr8u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29960'),
  ('553265391378953742', 'Vampire Clan', 2002, 'Horror', 'John Webb, Thomas Kuk', 'Aaron Pope', 'Drew Fuller, Alexandra Breckenridge, Timothy Lee DePriest, Marina Black, Kelly Kruger, Richard Gilliland, Larry Dirk, Mimi Craven', null, 'Five friends welcome real life vampirism into their lives. They cut their own wrists and let their friends drink from them. Rod, the leader, and a very psychotic young guy, ends up killing Heathers parents and stealing their car to go on a crazy raod trip. His behaviour begins to frighten his friends, though they went along with it at first. All end up in prison except Heather.', 'Five friends welcome real life vampirism into their lives. They cut their own wrists and let their friends drink from them. Rod, the leader, and a very psychotic young guy, ends up killing Heathers parents and stealing their car to go on a crazy raod trip. His behaviour begins to frighten his friends, though they went along with it at first. All end up in prison except Heather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pavB2fIjISGWCjWXd4z1Z6f8xo5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55016'),
  ('198535408225209305', 'Vampire Clay', 2018, 'Horror', 'Sôichi Umezawa, Shintarô Kuriyama', 'Sôichi Umezawa', 'Ena Fujita, Asuka Kurosawa, Yuyu Makihara, Ryô Shinoda, Momoka Sugimoto, Kyôka Takeda, Kanji Tsuda, Keisaku Kimura', null, 'Absurdity and gore ensue as a possessed pile of clay begins terrorizing students at an art school.', 'Absurdity and gore ensue as a possessed pile of clay begins terrorizing students at an art school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CXTLmIwWmmkvIvbhslfBQ7zNiZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470821'),
  ('93311160999586291', 'Vampire Cop', 1990, 'Horror, Action', 'Donald Farmer', 'Donald Farmer', 'Ed Cannon, Mal Arnold, Melissa Moore, Morrow Faye, Ray McKinnon, Lucas', null, 'Police officer Lucas only works at night. He also knows how to take a bite out of crime – literally. But when the vampire cop bites the city''s reigning drug boss, he inadvertently creates a nemesis as powerful as himself.', 'Police officer Lucas only works at night. He also knows how to take a bite out of crime – literally. But when the vampire cop bites the city''s reigning drug boss, he inadvertently creates a nemesis as powerful as himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aWfnHSJtLjNbOoz6ssTSpV158tX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84635'),
  ('230808798272122885', 'Vampire Cop Ricky', 2006, 'Action, Comedy, Romance, Horror, Fantasy', 'Lee Si-myung, Jeon Dae-seong, Park Se-moon', 'Kim Se-gyeom', 'Kim Soo-ro, Cho Yeo-jeong, Oh Kwang-rok, Son Byung-ho, Cheon Ho-jin, Park Young-soo, Kim Koo-taek, Jo Hyun-wu', null, 'A mosquito from Transylvania finds its way to Seoul where it bites Na Do-yol, a corrupt police officer. Soon after he begins to develop a thirst for blood, and finds out that he has vampire super powers whenever he becomes sexually aroused. When Do-yol''s past misdeeds come back to threaten his partner and girlfriend, he decides to clean up his act and sets out for revenge.', 'A mosquito from Transylvania finds its way to Seoul where it bites Na Do-yol, a corrupt police officer. Soon after he begins to develop a thirst for blood, and finds out that he has vampire super powers whenever he becomes sexually aroused. When Do-yol''s past misdeeds come back to threaten his partner and girlfriend, he decides to clean up his act and sets out for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7b7o8jIleIttS96ykCbKVNmM9ga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69391'),
  ('811585212225980749', 'Vampire Girl vs. Frankenstein Girl', 2009, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Yoshihiro Nishimura, Naoyuki Tomomatsu, Takashi Matsuo', 'Naoyuki Tomomatsu, Daichi Nagisa', 'Yukie Kawamura, Takumi Saitoh, Elly Otoguro, Sayaka Kametani, Jiji Bû, Eihi Shiina, Kanji Tsuda, Cay Izumi', 'R', 'A reconstructed girl is created from the pieces of a vampire girl''s mini-butchery. Slaughter abounds as both of them pursue the same boy.', 'A reconstructed girl is created from the pieces of a vampire girl''s mini-butchery. Slaughter abounds as both of them pursue the same boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPtvA9lFvR5TyMGeIcxpI3lueGL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36577'),
  ('664183224966031755', 'Vampire Hookers', 1978, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Cirio H. Santiago, Herminio ''Butch'' Bautista, Leo Martinez', 'Howard R. Cohen', 'John Carradine, Bruce Fairbairn, Trey Wilson, Karen Stride, Lenka Novak, Katie Dolan, Lex Winter, Leo Martinez', 'R', 'A sinister vampire sends out a horde of undead beauties to bring back victims for his dinner.', 'A sinister vampire sends out a horde of undead beauties to bring back victims for his dinner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3IbXVjvGnfyEQbhjY4TrdeeX9Y9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119586'),
  ('715197693293282786', 'Vampire Hunter D', 1985, 'Animation, Fantasy, Horror', 'Toyoo Ashida, Kazushi Torigoe, Yukio Sugiyama', 'Yasushi Hirano', 'Kaneto Shiozawa, Michie Tomizawa, Seizo Kato, Ichiro Nagai, Kazuyuki Sogabe, Kan Tokumaru, Kazuko Yanaga, Kazumi Tanaka', 'NR', 'In a far-future time ruled by the supernatural, a young girl requests the help of a vampire hunter to kill the vampire who has bitten her and thus prevent her from becoming a vampire herself.', 'In a far-future time ruled by the supernatural, a young girl requests the help of a vampire hunter to kill the vampire who has bitten her and thus prevent her from becoming a vampire herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhKS0Wi6HNOHauWl0M3fr23hiB7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9463'),
  ('511959208852403379', 'Vampire Hunter D: Bloodlust', 2001, 'Animation, Fantasy, Horror, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Yoshiaki Kawajiri, Hitoshi Yamaguchi, Hiroshi Hamasaki', 'Yoshiaki Kawajiri', 'Andrew Philpot, John Rafter Lee, Pamela Adlon, Wendee Lee, Michael McShane, Julia Fletcher, Matt McKenzie, John DiMaggio', 'R', 'D, a legendary dhampir competes with a motley family of bounty hunters to track down Charlotte Elbourne, a young woman who has seemingly been abducted by vampire nobleman Meier Link.', 'D, a legendary dhampir competes with a motley family of bounty hunters to track down Charlotte Elbourne, a young woman who has seemingly been abducted by vampire nobleman Meier Link.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hJUWgdmoFsNpzyTN6QjoZcaivO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15999'),
  ('829126332657285101', 'Vampire Hunters', 2003, 'Horror, Fantasy, Action', 'Wellson Chin Sing-Wai, Sunny Tsang Tat-Sze, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung', 'Tsui Hark', 'Michael Chow Man-Kin, Ken Chang Tzu-Yao, Lam Suet, Danny Chan Kwok-Kwan, Yu Rongguang, Anya, Horace Lee, Ji Chunhua', 'R', 'In 17th century China, zombies and vampires roamed the lands, feeding on the unsuspecting. A group of martial artists / vampire hunters find themselves employed by a very rich - and very insane - old man who has kept everyone of his relatives preserved in wax and not buried. Apparently it is his family''s tradition. So, having generations of potential zombies in your cellar may not be the smartest idea ever, but it takes two to tango. In this case, a thief wants the old-man''s treasure and hires a zombie-wrangler to re-animate the waxed up relatives in order to sneak into the mansion and steal the treasure. It''s up to the kung-fu fighting vampire hunters to save the day (or night).', 'In 17th century China, zombies and vampires roamed the lands, feeding on the unsuspecting. A group of martial artists / vampire hunters find themselves employed by a very rich - and very insane - old man who has kept everyone of his relatives preserved in wax and not buried. Apparently it is his family''s tradition. So, having generations of potential zombies in your cellar may not be the smartest idea ever, but it takes two to tango. In this case, a thief wants the old-man''s treasure and hires a zombie-wrangler to re-animate the waxed up relatives in order to sneak into the mansion and steal the treasure. It''s up to the kung-fu fighting vampire hunters to save the day (or night).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JRsBS7fdBDRwGiq9c2hfpMAn7l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40226'),
  ('763589910435096151', 'Vampire in Brooklyn', 1995, 'Comedy, Horror, Romance, Fantasy', 'Wes Craven, Mark Irwin, Peter Chesney', 'Charlie Murphy, Chris Parker, Michael Lucker', 'Angela Bassett, Eddie Murphy, Allen Payne, Kadeem Hardison, John Witherspoon, Zakes Mokae, Joanna Cassidy, Jerry Hall', 'R', 'Detective Rita Veder is assigned to a baffling serial murder case. After examining the crime scene — a corpse-filled ship found adrift at sea — she meets Maximilian, a smooth-talking Caribbean playboy determined to romance her.', 'Detective Rita Veder is assigned to a baffling serial murder case. After examining the crime scene — a corpse-filled ship found adrift at sea — she meets Maximilian, a smooth-talking Caribbean playboy determined to romance her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fodPA5x3REtOwColG17CucreZqM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12158'),
  ('364681671869478964', 'Vampire in Love', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mai Suzuki, Katsuhito Motegi, Kensuke Sonomura', 'Mai Suzuki', 'Mirei Kiritani, Shota Totsuka, Seiichi Tanabe, Nene Otsuka, Natsume Mito, Choi Jin-hyuk, Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Akira Emoto', null, 'Kiira seems like an ordinary young girl, who likes to talk with her friends and to dress up. Her ultimate goal is to become the world''s best baker, but what differentiates her from others is that she is a vampire. She has never told anyone her secret, including her childhood friend Tetsu, whom she played with everyday and liked as a child. After her parents died when Kiira was only 12-years-old, she had to go live with her relatives and lost contact with Tetsu. Now, 8 years later, Tetsu appears at the bakery where Kiira is working part-time. Kiira is ecstatic to see her first love again. Soon, they are dating and Kiira dreams of having a family with Tetsu. Kiira also becomes filled with worries because she is vampire.', 'Kiira seems like an ordinary young girl, who likes to talk with her friends and to dress up. Her ultimate goal is to become the world''s best baker, but what differentiates her from others is that she is a vampire. She has never told anyone her secret, including her childhood friend Tetsu, whom she played with everyday and liked as a child. After her parents died when Kiira was only 12-years-old, she had to go live with her relatives and lost contact with Tetsu. Now, 8 years later, Tetsu appears at the bakery where Kiira is working part-time. Kiira is ecstatic to see her first love again. Soon, they are dating and Kiira dreams of having a family with Tetsu. Kiira also becomes filled with worries because she is vampire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdwqZ5dq06iyfCura3Sb0TM0BFF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341443'),
  ('927919206653982877', 'Vampire Island', 2009, 'Horror', 'Kim Tae-gyun', 'Tetsuya Oishi', 'Dai Watanabe, Terri Doty, Asami Mizukawa, Koji Yamamoto, Miori Takimoto, Hideo Ishiguro, Fumito Moriwaki, Tomohisa Yuge', null, 'Higanjima is an eerie island occupied by vampires, from where none has ever come back alive. When teenager Akira hears that his missing brother has been seen in the island, he decides to investigate with several friends.', 'Higanjima is an eerie island occupied by vampires, from where none has ever come back alive. When teenager Akira hears that his missing brother has been seen in the island, he decides to investigate with several friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbIhByf2J4QS90vDLpXMxDorf3t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50732'),
  ('87076954106289415', 'Vampire Journals', 1997, 'Horror, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Ted Nicolaou, Cătălin Ciutu, Cristian Ciurea', 'Ted Nicolaou', 'Jonathon Morris, David Gunn, Kirsten Cerre, Starr Andreeff, Ilinca Goia, Constantin Bărbulescu, Mihai Dinvale, Dan Condurache', 'R', 'A 19th century vampire stalks a more powerful vampire lord in his quest to gain revenge over the death of his mistress. In his search for the vampire lord in Eastern Europe he kills many of his servants and fellow vampires while cursing another to vampirism as well.', 'A 19th century vampire stalks a more powerful vampire lord in his quest to gain revenge over the death of his mistress. In his search for the vampire lord in Eastern Europe he kills many of his servants and fellow vampires while cursing another to vampirism as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1j65WMTXupjxmHatl7sFMqHStio.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34125'),
  ('542011906079048941', 'Vampire Killer Barbys', 1996, 'Horror, Music', 'Jesús Franco, Javier Pérez Zofio', 'Jesús Franco', 'Silvia Superstar, Billy King, Charlie S. Chaplin, Aldo Sambrell, Santiago Segura, Mariangela Giordano, Carlos Subterfuge, Los Angeles Barea', null, 'While driving on tour late night through a lonely road in the countryside of Spain, the van of the punk band "Killer Barbys" has an accident and breaks down. A creepy old man invites the group to spend the night in the castle of Countess Von Fledermaus and presents himself as her secretary Arkan. Arkan explains that the mechanic is located 62 km far from the location and he tells that the Countess loves youths. Flavia, Rafa and Mario accept the invitation but Billy and Sharon stay shagging in the van. When the musicians meet the Countess, they find that she is the ancient artist Olga Luchan and they question how she could keep so young. But sooner they discover that the Countess needs blood of young people to keep her beauty.', 'While driving on tour late night through a lonely road in the countryside of Spain, the van of the punk band "Killer Barbys" has an accident and breaks down. A creepy old man invites the group to spend the night in the castle of Countess Von Fledermaus and presents himself as her secretary Arkan. Arkan explains that the mechanic is located 62 km far from the location and he tells that the Countess loves youths. Flavia, Rafa and Mario accept the invitation but Billy and Sharon stay shagging in the van. When the musicians meet the Countess, they find that she is the ancient artist Olga Luchan and they question how she could keep so young. But sooner they discover that the Countess needs blood of young people to keep her beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqbjscKOUpJhGYTD7EV5oqskd4a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195191'),
  ('892098315192259685', 'Vampire Party', 2008, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Stephen Cafiero, Vincent Lobelle, Oliver Cocaul', 'Jean-Patrick Benes, Stephen Cafiero, Vincent Lobelle', 'Patrick Mille, Frédérique Bel, Julie Fournier, Vincent Desagnat, Sam Karmann, Hélène de Fougerolles, Antoine Duléry, Gilles Gaston-Dreyfus', null, 'Best friends and hardcore partiers Sam, Alice and Prune have scored invitations to ''Medici Night'', the legendary VIP bash held every year at a remote castle. But when they discover that this wild party is being thrown by an elite race of blood-crazed vampires, they''ll have to stake, stab, slice, bludgeon and blast their way out of a soiree where the hosts are thirsty and the bar is now open.', 'Best friends and hardcore partiers Sam, Alice and Prune have scored invitations to ''Medici Night'', the legendary VIP bash held every year at a remote castle. But when they discover that this wild party is being thrown by an elite race of blood-crazed vampires, they''ll have to stake, stab, slice, bludgeon and blast their way out of a soiree where the hosts are thirsty and the bar is now open.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMOSnoHLmAGHEzrwC8aHx1w6gD8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14409'),
  ('1108819249924712011', 'Vampire Princess Miyu', 1988, 'Fantasy, Animation, Horror', 'Toshiki Hirano', 'Noboro Aikawa, Sho Aikawa', 'Naoko Watanabe, Masato Kubota, Kaneto Shiozawa, Katsumi Toriumi, Mayumi Shou, Yuji Mitsuya', null, 'Its central characters are a vampire girl named Miyu and her demonic companion Larva. Miyu is the daughter of both a human and a shinma (demon) and as such she was awakened as the guardian whose destiny is to hunt down all stray shinma and send them back to the darkness.', 'Its central characters are a vampire girl named Miyu and her demonic companion Larva. Miyu is the daughter of both a human and a shinma (demon) and as such she was awakened as the guardian whose destiny is to hunt down all stray shinma and send them back to the darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9E1MuQIu4KCY8LbH1k5aw7GkrKG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31649'),
  ('508147203049937120', 'Vampire Sisters', 2012, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Wolfgang Groos', 'Ursula Gruber', 'Marta Martin, Stipe Erceg, Laura Roge, Jamie Bick, Christiane Paul, Richy Müller, Michael Kessler, Jonas Holdenrieder', null, 'Keeping secrets can be difficult, especially when you’re a twelve-year-old half-vampire moving from Transylvania to a new life in Germany. Going to school, making new friends and fitting in — it’s all tough when you can’t just be yourself. With a vampire father and a human mother, sisters Dakaria (Daka) and Silvania don’t live in your typical blended family. Each girl embraces a different side of her genetic makeup: Daka wishes she was 100% vampire; Silvania wishes she was 100% human; and both believe they can finally realize their hearts’ desires when the opportunity to change presents itself. Will Daka and Silvania realize that, sometimes, your uniqueness is your greatest strength?', 'Keeping secrets can be difficult, especially when you’re a twelve-year-old half-vampire moving from Transylvania to a new life in Germany. Going to school, making new friends and fitting in — it’s all tough when you can’t just be yourself. With a vampire father and a human mother, sisters Dakaria (Daka) and Silvania don’t live in your typical blended family. Each girl embraces a different side of her genetic makeup: Daka wishes she was 100% vampire; Silvania wishes she was 100% human; and both believe they can finally realize their hearts’ desires when the opportunity to change presents itself. Will Daka and Silvania realize that, sometimes, your uniqueness is your greatest strength?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygjHbvTM2pugSvGmy1oXZGQeqRq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151478'),
  ('977006934785554773', 'Vampire Sisters 2: Bats in the Belly', 2014, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Wolfgang Groos, Armin Golisano', 'Ursula Gruber', 'Laura Roge, Marta Martin, Christiane Paul, Stipe Erceg, Michael Kessler, Diana Amft, Georg Friedrich, Tim Oliver Schultz', null, 'Teen half vampire Dakaria falls in love with rock singer vampire Murdo. Dakaria, her friends and family have to face vampire Xantor who has dark plans.', 'Teen half vampire Dakaria falls in love with rock singer vampire Murdo. Dakaria, her friends and family have to face vampire Xantor who has dark plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kNSlxcLQu2kMYKcDzmLUJ4DKNK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298504'),
  ('87243262578309568', 'Vampire Sisters 3: Journey to Transylvania', 2016, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Tim Trachte, Fabian Rösler, Manuel Kreuzpaintner', 'Sigrun De Pascalis, Ursula Gruber', 'Laura Roge, Marta Martin, Christiane Paul, Stipe Erceg, Michael Kessler, Jana Pallaske, Senji Fütterer, Jonas Holdenrieder', null, 'Vampire sisters Silvania and Daka try to rescue their baby brother, a half-vampire, from the clutches of the evil vampire queen Antanasia, who wants to crown him as her heir.', 'Vampire sisters Silvania and Daka try to rescue their baby brother, a half-vampire, from the clutches of the evil vampire queen Antanasia, who wants to crown him as her heir.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qd5BxQlrjl3G7btZhT79wntbxSC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392476'),
  ('148125333647896958', 'Vampire Virus', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Charlie Steeds', 'Sam Ashurst, Charlie Steeds', 'Natalie Martins, Derek Nelson, Jéssica Alonso, Peter Lofsgard, Sam Ashurst, James Swanton, Barrington De La Roche, Dylan A. Young', null, 'A young woman contracts a deadly virus after an unusual sexual encounter, and soon develops a taste for human blood.', 'A young woman contracts a deadly virus after an unusual sexual encounter, and soon develops a taste for human blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xRyb5pjWdPSXvFpYUNibMPW91UE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:709642'),
  ('796689963187360992', 'Vampire Vixens from Venus', 1995, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Comedy', 'Ted A. Bohus', null, 'Michelle Bauer, Leon Head, Theresa Lynn, J.J. North, Leslie Glass, Charlie Callas, Joe Pallister, John Knox', 'R', 'Hideous in their original form, four alien drug smugglers transform into beautiful women on Earth. The drug is derived from draining the “life essence” from men. Hot on their trail are both the local police and intergalactic DEA. Packed with eye-popping state-of-the-art special effects and stereo sound, VAMPIRE VIXENS FROM VENUS is a sexy, funny, sci-fi thriller.', 'Hideous in their original form, four alien drug smugglers transform into beautiful women on Earth. The drug is derived from draining the “life essence” from men. Hot on their trail are both the local police and intergalactic DEA. Packed with eye-popping state-of-the-art special effects and stereo sound, VAMPIRE VIXENS FROM VENUS is a sexy, funny, sci-fi thriller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWBIrhq0wgpYI8PXGLOOpFHUUWf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58951'),
  ('149005060084221042', 'Vampire Vs. Vampire', 1989, 'Action, Comedy, Horror', 'Lam Ching-Ying, Cho On-Sun, Francis Nam', 'Sze Mei-Yee, Chan Ka-Cheong, Sam Chi-Leung', 'Lam Ching-Ying, Chin Siu-Ho, Lui Fong, Billy Lau Nam-Kwong, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Maria Cordero, Lam Jing-Wang, Tiffany Lau Yuk-Ting', null, 'Lam Ching-Ying returns as the famous "Vampire Buster," this time starring as the One-Eyebrow Priest. To save the village from paranormal menaces, he deals with and battles a host of mysterious creatures including: a little mischievous Chinese vampire; a lustful female ghost; the spirit of a woman murdered by a club owner and a European vampire and his blood-sucking pet bats.', 'Lam Ching-Ying returns as the famous "Vampire Buster," this time starring as the One-Eyebrow Priest. To save the village from paranormal menaces, he deals with and battles a host of mysterious creatures including: a little mischievous Chinese vampire; a lustful female ghost; the spirit of a woman murdered by a club owner and a European vampire and his blood-sucking pet bats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiBMFr8DPgbwbennRKHsuwKrNjv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67350'),
  ('264864749957218644', 'Vampire Wars', 1990, 'Animation, Action, Crime, Horror', 'Kazuhisa Takenouchi', 'Hiroyuki Hoshiyama', 'Masashi Sugawara, Yuka Koyama, Kaneto Shiozawa, Shuichi Ikeda, Kyoko Terase, Yuko Mita, Takeshi Aono, Toshiya Ueda', null, 'The rural American west is the setting for this OVA, in which a bizarre and brutal attack on a NASA base in Arizona attracts the attention of a French secret service agent, Monsieur Lassar, when a dead CIA agent is found floating on the Seine in Paris. Lassar is convinced that these two events are related, and sets out to prove it. His investigation leads him to film star Lamia Vindaw and a vampire cult that may be far more vicious and dangerous than its eccentric exterior makes it seem.', 'The rural American west is the setting for this OVA, in which a bizarre and brutal attack on a NASA base in Arizona attracts the attention of a French secret service agent, Monsieur Lassar, when a dead CIA agent is found floating on the Seine in Paris. Lassar is convinced that these two events are related, and sets out to prove it. His investigation leads him to film star Lamia Vindaw and a vampire cult that may be far more vicious and dangerous than its eccentric exterior makes it seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fAnDY95Tyv1LJwm3DYCQnsnGtxY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142356'),
  ('428595242352224800', 'Vampire''s Kiss', 1989, 'Comedy, Horror, Crime, Fantasy', 'Stefan Czapsky, Robert Bierman, Gary Sales', 'Joseph Minion', 'Nicolas Cage, María Conchita Alonso, Jennifer Beals, Elizabeth Ashley, Kasi Lemmons, Robert Lujan, Jessica Lundy, Johnny Walker', 'R', 'A publishing executive is visited and bitten by a vampire and starts exhibiting erratic behavior. He pushes his secretary to extremes as he tries to come to terms with his affliction.', 'A publishing executive is visited and bitten by a vampire and starts exhibiting erratic behavior. He pushes his secretary to extremes as he tries to come to terms with his affliction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEwvlXvvrVLPFwCOND5E38qly01.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7091'),
  ('963020008154040148', 'Vampirella', 1996, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Jim Wynorski, Andrea V. Rossotto', 'Gary Gerani', 'Talisa Soto, Roger Daltrey, Richard Joseph Paul, Brian Bloom, Corinna Harney, Rusty Meyers, Lee de Broux, Tom Deters', 'R', 'Dark, mysterious and sensual, Vampirella (Talisa Soto) is a princess from the Planet Drakulon. Like all vampires, she needs blood to live, but she will not kill to get it - a synthetic substitute keeps her alive. After journeying across space and time seeking vengeance for her father''s brutal murder, she now finds herself on Earth, in Las Vegas, where her enemy Vlad (Roger Daltry) has disguised himself as a rock star. In order to stop Vlad''s doomsday plan for world domination, Vampirella must make a dangerous alliance with a group of hi-tech vampire hunters. It''s a race to stop the apocalypse of humanity and our fate is in the hands of the fiery, dangerous and beautiful Vampirella.', 'Dark, mysterious and sensual, Vampirella (Talisa Soto) is a princess from the Planet Drakulon. Like all vampires, she needs blood to live, but she will not kill to get it - a synthetic substitute keeps her alive. After journeying across space and time seeking vengeance for her father''s brutal murder, she now finds herself on Earth, in Las Vegas, where her enemy Vlad (Roger Daltry) has disguised himself as a rock star. In order to stop Vlad''s doomsday plan for world domination, Vampirella must make a dangerous alliance with a group of hi-tech vampire hunters. It''s a race to stop the apocalypse of humanity and our fate is in the hands of the fiery, dangerous and beautiful Vampirella.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2NGVYgXXSK1IbXDQIvMOMWgWBK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55949'),
  ('438100450758484446', 'Vampires', 1998, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror', 'John Carpenter, Gary B. Kibbe, David M. Dunlap', 'Don Jakoby', 'James Woods, Daniel Baldwin, Sheryl Lee, Thomas Ian Griffith, Maximilian Schell, Tim Guinee, Mark Boone Junior, Gregory Sierra', 'R', 'The church enlists a team of vampire-hunters to hunt down and destroy a group of vampires searching for an ancient relic that will allow them to exist in sunlight.', 'The church enlists a team of vampire-hunters to hunt down and destroy a group of vampires searching for an ancient relic that will allow them to exist in sunlight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JhaFBPwyC5IM1rKaRR07Gzutse.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9945'),
  ('450980619900312303', 'Vampires', 2010, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Vincent Lannoo, Vincent Vangelder', 'Vincent Lannoo, Frédérique Broos', 'Carlo Ferrante, Vera Van Dooren, Pierre Lognay, Fleur Lise Heuet, Bénédicte Bantuelle, Baptiste Sornin, Selma Alaoui, Arnaud Maillard', null, 'Vincent Lannoo’s ‘mockumentary’ shows us a community of vampires in Belgium. The two ‘parents’ of the family are George and Bertha, who have two teenage children – or rather, they raise two former humans who they turned into vampires. Son Samson is a bit of a jack the lad: enjoying the sexual freedom of vampire life, with all the vigour of an irresponsible young adult regardless of consequences (even incest is not frowned upon in their world, where the word ‘wife’ is often synonymous with ‘mother’ or ‘sister’). Daughter Grace yearns for humanity in a different way: applying fake tan to get rid of her vampiric pallor, dressing in pink clothes, wishing she could feel emotion and even having a human boyfriend.', 'Vincent Lannoo’s ‘mockumentary’ shows us a community of vampires in Belgium. The two ‘parents’ of the family are George and Bertha, who have two teenage children – or rather, they raise two former humans who they turned into vampires. Son Samson is a bit of a jack the lad: enjoying the sexual freedom of vampire life, with all the vigour of an irresponsible young adult regardless of consequences (even incest is not frowned upon in their world, where the word ‘wife’ is often synonymous with ‘mother’ or ‘sister’). Daughter Grace yearns for humanity in a different way: applying fake tan to get rid of her vampiric pallor, dressing in pink clothes, wishing she could feel emotion and even having a human boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ee1oRcyW9LKT7rgYy24aIrV9b30.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65997'),
  ('179833954059684325', 'Vampires in Havana', 1985, 'Comedy, Animation, Horror', 'Juan Padrón', 'Ernesto Padrón, Juan Padrón', 'Frank González, Irela Bravo, Manuel Marín, Carlos González, Mirella Guillot, Carmen Solar, Juan Padrón, Margarita Aguero', 'NR', 'Professor Von Dracula, a vampire scientist, leaves Transylvania for Cuba, where he invents "Vampisol," a potion that allows vampires to survive in sunlight. When the professor announces his intention to donate the formula free-of-charge to vampires all over the world, the Vampire Mafia from Chicago and the European Group of Vampires from Düsseldorf try to muscle in and steal the formula. The action escalates crazily as an assortment of bad guys, police, vampires and other monsters, and our hero and his girlfriend are all caught up in the chase.', 'Professor Von Dracula, a vampire scientist, leaves Transylvania for Cuba, where he invents "Vampisol," a potion that allows vampires to survive in sunlight. When the professor announces his intention to donate the formula free-of-charge to vampires all over the world, the Vampire Mafia from Chicago and the European Group of Vampires from Düsseldorf try to muscle in and steal the formula. The action escalates crazily as an assortment of bad guys, police, vampires and other monsters, and our hero and his girlfriend are all caught up in the chase.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbmsBRzKKr08PwJixfcdqye7Fg1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90063'),
  ('139446471944025134', 'Vampires of Geona', 1991, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Gennady Tishchenko, Kabul Rasulov, T. Kamskaya', 'Gennady Tishchenko', 'Vsevolod Abdulov, Rogvold Sukhoverko, Gennady Tishchenko, Aleksandr Lushchik', null, 'Poisonous pterodactyl-like "vampire" creatures are preventing the GALAX Concern from harvesting planet Geona''s natural resources. A small GALAX crew, of which two are immobilized by "vampire" bites, do their best to eliminate the creatures. Inspector Yanin has been sent to Geona to assess the situation.', 'Poisonous pterodactyl-like "vampire" creatures are preventing the GALAX Concern from harvesting planet Geona''s natural resources. A small GALAX crew, of which two are immobilized by "vampire" bites, do their best to eliminate the creatures. Inspector Yanin has been sent to Geona to assess the situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8U7yPuSdS3dfQAhopQMsizKVfUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423403'),
  ('315026114622351033', 'Vampires of the Velvet Lounge', 2026, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Adam Sherman, David Newbert', 'Adam Sherman', 'Mena Suvari, Dichen Lachman, Stephen Dorff, Sarah Dumont, Will Redmond, Rosa Salazar, Lochlyn Munro, India Eisley', 'R', 'A group of vampires confronts the challenges of adapting to contemporary society while grappling with their own mortality, all while engaged in a conflict with a dangerous enemy.', 'A group of vampires confronts the challenges of adapting to contemporary society while grappling with their own mortality, all while engaged in a conflict with a dangerous enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doTL7vyk04xBmH140BNbPvGNxmW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1217931'),
  ('87113211516469636', 'Vampires on Bikini Beach', 1988, 'Horror', 'Mark Headley', 'Mark Headley', 'Jennifer Badham, Todd Kaufman, Stephen Mathews, Nancy Rogers, Amanda Hughes, Jennifer Jostyn, Ken Abraham', null, 'Two teenagers find a book called "The Book of the Dead," and soon they discover that a vampire cult, which needs the book to raise the dead so they can take over the world, is after them.', 'Two teenagers find a book called "The Book of the Dead," and soon they discover that a vampire cult, which needs the book to raise the dead so they can take over the world, is after them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/av7oY17kfPKe2GzPeEirdhDpdKT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147888'),
  ('63831702230262726', 'Vampires Suck', 2010, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Shawn Maurer, Jason Friedberg, Aaron Seltzer', 'Aaron Seltzer, Jason Friedberg', 'Jenn Proske, Matt Lanter, Chris Riggi, Diedrich Bader, Anneliese Van Der Pol, Ken Jeong, Arielle Kebbel, Kelsey Ledgin', 'PG-13', 'Becca, an anxious, non-vampire teen is torn between two boys. Before she can choose, Becca must get around her controlling father, who treats her like a child. Meanwhile, Becca''s friends contend with their own romantic issues – all of which collide at the prom.', 'Becca, an anxious, non-vampire teen is torn between two boys. Before she can choose, Becca must get around her controlling father, who treats her like a child. Meanwhile, Becca''s friends contend with their own romantic issues – all of which collide at the prom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksPKfoXovAiFnBktkCBefsRQ8a1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40264'),
  ('852200767076076053', 'Vampires vs. the Bronx', 2020, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Oz Rodríguez, Blake McClure', 'Blaise Hemingway, Oz Rodríguez', 'Jaden Michael, Gerald Jones, Gregory Díaz IV, Sarah Gadon, Method Man, Shea Whigham, Coco Jones, The Kid Mero', 'PG-13', 'Three gutsy kids from a rapidly gentrifying Bronx neighborhood stumble upon a sinister plot to suck all the life from their beloved community.', 'Three gutsy kids from a rapidly gentrifying Bronx neighborhood stumble upon a sinister plot to suck all the life from their beloved community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcdBUbbYNccz8q9LOuBEKC1avMA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567971'),
  ('894778318147082162', 'Vampires: Los Muertos', 2002, 'Horror, Thriller, Action', 'Tommy Lee Wallace', 'Tommy Lee Wallace', 'Jon Bon Jovi, Cristián de la Fuente, Diego Luna, Natasha Gregson Wagner, Antonio Muñiz, Darius McCrary, Anilú Pardo, Arly Jover', 'R', 'Tough-as-nails vampire hunter Derek Bliss is on the hunt for "suckers" in the heart of Mexico when he receives a new assignment from a mysterious client. Thrown together with a group of slayers, including sexy Zooey, who may or may not be one of the undead. Derek and company are up against a growing number of fast-moving, bloodthirsty vampires and their elusive and powerful leader.', 'Tough-as-nails vampire hunter Derek Bliss is on the hunt for "suckers" in the heart of Mexico when he receives a new assignment from a mysterious client. Thrown together with a group of slayers, including sexy Zooey, who may or may not be one of the undead. Derek and company are up against a growing number of fast-moving, bloodthirsty vampires and their elusive and powerful leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5kRjaLtYB7mf16FrTrixOWwuWA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10605'),
  ('468372513351221974', 'Vampires: Out for Blood', 2004, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Richard Brandes, M. David Mullen', 'Richard Brandes', 'Kevin Dillon, Vanessa Angel, Jodi Lyn O''Keefe, Lance Henriksen, Melissa Rivers, Kenneth Colom, Alex McArthur, Ismael Kanater', null, 'In the dark, throbbing world of underground raves, people are vanishing without a trace and Detective Hank Holten is the only one who knows the terrible truth. Vampires.', 'In the dark, throbbing world of underground raves, people are vanishing without a trace and Detective Hank Holten is the only one who knows the terrible truth. Vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euiarErHIrRZPxF1nzepTMR7tqg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65379'),
  ('710325853325618956', 'Vampires: The Turning', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Horror', 'Martin Jay Weiss, Geoffrey Hall, Sholto J. Roeg', 'D.B. Farmer, Andy Hurst', 'Colin Egglesfield, Stephanie Chao, Roger Yuan, Patrick Bauchau, Dom Hetrakul, Meredith Monroe, Nophand Boonyai, Jarun Petchjaren', 'R', 'An American kickboxer in Thailand joins a gang of vampire slayers to rescue his lover from a bloodsucking warlord.', 'An American kickboxer in Thailand joins a gang of vampire slayers to rescue his lover from a bloodsucking warlord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90sY8r0w8W3gwbP2PdkpD7qF2sT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49597'),
  ('1069098113417769035', 'Vamps', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance, Horror', 'Amy Heckerling, Tim Suhrstedt, Cathy Sandrich Gelfond', 'Amy Heckerling', 'Alicia Silverstone, Krysten Ritter, Dan Stevens, Richard Lewis, Wallace Shawn, Justin Kirk, Malcolm McDowell, Sigourney Weaver', 'PG-13', 'The modern-day story focuses on two beautiful young vampires who are living the good nightlife in New York until love enters the picture and each has to make a choice that will jeopardize their immortality.', 'The modern-day story focuses on two beautiful young vampires who are living the good nightlife in New York until love enters the picture and each has to make a choice that will jeopardize their immortality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sW4MFTfW88Ii8TyZVD7oprzzhOU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73935'),
  ('801254904360848642', 'Vamps', 2017, 'Horror, Action, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Andrey Gurkin, Sergey Ginzburg', 'Aleksei Timm, Tikhon Kornev, Aleksey Karaulov', 'Konstantin Kryukov, Mikhail Porechenkov, Aglaya Shilovskaya, Andrey Rudensky, Igor Khripunov, Konstantin Milovanov, Mikhail Zhigalov, Anna Arlanova', null, 'The story takes place in 18th century russia. empress elizabeth’s confessor, monk named Lavr, is exiled to a monastery in a haunted mountainous region, taking his secret ancient knowledge with him. Years later, the empress sends her godson Andrey to bring the monk back. Andrey travels to the ill-famed place and meets with Lavr, but before they can return to St. Petersburg they must face evil forces and creatures of the dark side.', 'The story takes place in 18th century russia. empress elizabeth’s confessor, monk named Lavr, is exiled to a monastery in a haunted mountainous region, taking his secret ancient knowledge with him. Years later, the empress sends her godson Andrey to bring the monk back. Andrey travels to the ill-famed place and meets with Lavr, but before they can return to St. Petersburg they must face evil forces and creatures of the dark side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mx2GQU6XdKAxSh6qbY7oJaFBpYv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430988'),
  ('1029082958118000204', 'Vampyr', 1932, 'Horror, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer, Rudolph Maté, Louis Née', 'Christen Jul, Carl Theodor Dreyer', 'Nicolas de Gunzburg, Maurice Schutz, Rena Mandel, Sybille Schmitz, Jan Hieronimko, Henriette Gérard, Albert Bras, N. Babanini', 'NR', 'Allan Gray, a young man fascinated by the supernatural, goes to a small village where he feels a sinister force descending upon him. There, Allan meets an old man who asks him to protect his two daughters, for one of them has been bitten by a vampire.', 'Allan Gray, a young man fascinated by the supernatural, goes to a small village where he feels a sinister force descending upon him. There, Allan meets an old man who asks him to protect his two daughters, for one of them has been bitten by a vampire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yt3JS5JSoZseSohYkhs6FLU9B0O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:779'),
  ('532465394301571872', 'Vampyres', 1974, 'Horror', 'José Ramón Larraz, Harry Waxman', 'Diana Daubeney, José Ramón Larraz', 'Marianne Morris, Anulka Dziubinska, Murray Brown, Brian Deacon, Sally Faulkner, Michael Byrne, Karl Lanchbury, Margaret Heald', 'R', 'A duo of bisexual female vampires prey on passing motorists, whom they seduce and murder in the English countryside.', 'A duo of bisexual female vampires prey on passing motorists, whom they seduce and murder in the English countryside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPA3n6HGiZccrkygDPq6tzeEDbU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30885'),
  ('72709998313721954', 'Vampyres', 2015, 'Horror', 'Víctor Matellano, Daniel Salas Alberola', 'Víctor Matellano, José Ramón Larraz', 'Almudena León, Alina Nastase, Fele Martínez, Verónica Polo, Anthony Rotsa, Víctor Vidal, Christian Stamm, Lone Fleming', 'R', 'Victor Matellano directs this tale set in a stately English manor inhabited by two older female vampires and with their only cohabitant being a man imprisoned in the basement. Their lives and lifestyle are upended when a trio of campers come upon their lair and seek to uncover their dark secrets, a decision that has sexual and blood-curdling consequences.', 'Victor Matellano directs this tale set in a stately English manor inhabited by two older female vampires and with their only cohabitant being a man imprisoned in the basement. Their lives and lifestyle are upended when a trio of campers come upon their lair and seek to uncover their dark secrets, a decision that has sexual and blood-curdling consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b41M28V6GcA94NAvn24SVz6qfvB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320678'),
  ('365433443312006997', 'Vampyros Lesbos', 1971, 'Horror', 'Manuel Merino, Jesús Franco, Nicole Guettard', 'Jesús Franco, Jaime Chávarri, Anne Settimó', 'Soledad Miranda, Ewa Strömberg, Dennis Price, Paul Müller, Heidrun Kussin, José Martínez Blanco, Michael Berling, Andrea Montchal', null, 'An erotic horror tale about a vixen vampiress seducing and killing women to appease her insatiable thirst for female blood.', 'An erotic horror tale about a vixen vampiress seducing and killing women to appease her insatiable thirst for female blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qaZc7veACx1vmq6tZtnIT6vLmxM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17343'),
  ('920372500238543563', 'Van Diemen''s Land', 2009, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Jonathan auf der Heide, Ellery Ryan, Ben Plazzer', 'Oscar Redding, Jonathan auf der Heide', 'Oscar Redding, Arthur Angel, Paul Ashcroft, Mark Leonard Winter, Torquil Neilson, Thomas M. Wright, Greg Stone, John Francis Howard', null, 'The true story of Australia’s most notorious convict, Alexander Pearce and his infamous journey into the beautiful yet brutal Tasmanian wilderness. A point of no return for convicts banished from their homeland, Van Diemen’s Land was a feared and dreaded penal settlement at the end of the earth.', 'The true story of Australia’s most notorious convict, Alexander Pearce and his infamous journey into the beautiful yet brutal Tasmanian wilderness. A point of no return for convicts banished from their homeland, Van Diemen’s Land was a feared and dreaded penal settlement at the end of the earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixnnUpKY2fFiFnjL9WUizIo0buS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22882'),
  ('1011985534064498762', 'Van Gogh', 1948, 'Documentary', 'Alain Resnais, Henry Ferrand', 'Robert Hessens, Gaston Diehl', 'Claude Dauphin', null, 'The biography of Dutch artist Van Gogh, illustrated only with images of his paintings and drawings, or details of those, and according dramatic musical score.', 'The biography of Dutch artist Van Gogh, illustrated only with images of his paintings and drawings, or details of those, and according dramatic musical score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvAkNz5b4Xu3YFuZR5yJmqjt2xl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162366'),
  ('181450058949570363', 'Van Gogh', 1991, 'Drama, History', 'Maurice Pialat, Gilles Henry, Emmanuel Machuel', 'Maurice Pialat', 'Jacques Dutronc, Alexandra London, Bernard Le Coq, Gérard Séty, Corinne Bourdon, Elsa Zylberstein, Julien Haurant, Leslie Azzoulai', null, 'After leaving the asylum, Vincent van Gogh settles in the home of Doctor Gachet, where he keeps painting amidst the torments of his failing mental health. He begins an affair with his host’s daughter, however, she soon realizes that he doesn’t love her and that his heart beats only for art.', 'After leaving the asylum, Vincent van Gogh settles in the home of Doctor Gachet, where he keeps painting amidst the torments of his failing mental health. He begins an affair with his host’s daughter, however, she soon realizes that he doesn’t love her and that his heart beats only for art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbyckO3FYAtFt3hDCunQG7FbIiu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4734'),
  ('770857707126580926', 'Van Gogh: Of Wheat Fields and Clouded Skies', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Giovanni Piscaglia, Lorenzo Giromini', 'Matteo Moneta', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi', null, 'A new look at Van Gogh, through the legacy of the largest private collector of artworks by the Dutch painter: Helene Kröller-Müller (1869-1939), who, in the early 20th Century, ended up buying nearly 300 of his works, paintings and drawings included.', 'A new look at Van Gogh, through the legacy of the largest private collector of artworks by the Dutch painter: Helene Kröller-Müller (1869-1939), who, in the early 20th Century, ended up buying nearly 300 of his works, paintings and drawings included.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pncw5d3U9OdvxwBUgjnJ1XIT7mO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517510'),
  ('716684501988679590', 'Van Gogh: Painted with Words', 2010, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Andrew Hutton', 'Theo van Gogh, Vincent van Gogh', 'Benedict Cumberbatch, Jamie Parker, Aidan McArdle, Christopher Good, Rowena Cooper, Daniel Weyman, Ferdinand Kingsley, David Baron', null, 'A drama-documentary presented by Alan Yentob, with Benedict Cumberbatch in the lead role. Every word spoken by the actors in this film is sourced from the letters that Van Gogh sent to his younger brother Theo, and of those around him. What emerges is a complex portrait of a sophisticated, civilised and yet tormented man.', 'A drama-documentary presented by Alan Yentob, with Benedict Cumberbatch in the lead role. Every word spoken by the actors in this film is sourced from the letters that Van Gogh sent to his younger brother Theo, and of those around him. What emerges is a complex portrait of a sophisticated, civilised and yet tormented man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/soGsCeYNpq2OcdUrB4th1h1wwd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258514'),
  ('855034316353910356', 'Van Helsing', 2004, 'Horror, Adventure, Action', 'Stephen Sommers, Alex Cameron, Christian Alzmann', 'Stephen Sommers', 'Hugh Jackman, Kate Beckinsale, Richard Roxburgh, Josie Maran, David Wenham, Shuler Hensley, Elena Anaya, Kevin J. O''Connor', 'PG-13', 'Famed monster slayer Gabriel Van Helsing is dispatched to Transylvania to assist the last of the Valerious bloodline in defeating Count Dracula. Anna Valerious reveals that Dracula has formed an unholy alliance with Dr. Frankenstein''s monster and is hell-bent on exacting a centuries-old curse on her family.', 'Famed monster slayer Gabriel Van Helsing is dispatched to Transylvania to assist the last of the Valerious bloodline in defeating Count Dracula. Anna Valerious reveals that Dracula has formed an unholy alliance with Dr. Frankenstein''s monster and is hell-bent on exacting a centuries-old curse on her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsFun8nATm52aGHeT8ueAel98nE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7131'),
  ('853273912734900219', 'Van Helsing: The London Assignment', 2004, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy, Horror', 'Sharon Bridgeman', 'Garfield Reeves-Stevens, Judith Reeves-Stevens', 'Hugh Jackman, Robbie Coltrane, David Wenham, Grey DeLisle, Dwight Schultz, John DiMaggio, Scott Mosenson, Alun Armstrong', 'PG-13', 'It tells of the events before the film, in which monster hunter Gabriel Van Helsing travels to London to investigate a series of horrific, and decidedly supernatural murders, being committed by the mad scientist Dr. Jekyll, in the form of his evil alter-ego, Mr. Hyde.', 'It tells of the events before the film, in which monster hunter Gabriel Van Helsing travels to London to investigate a series of horrific, and decidedly supernatural murders, being committed by the mad scientist Dr. Jekyll, in the form of his evil alter-ego, Mr. Hyde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MFdzeCL2YTqbbBgiZT8e51MUGO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7092'),
