  ('771945919997838664', 'Van Wilder: Freshman Year', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Harvey Glazer, Shawn Maurer', 'Todd McCullough', 'Jonathan Bennett, Kristin Cavallari, Kurt Fuller, Steve Talley, Nestor Aaron Absera, Nick Nicotera, Jerry Ray Shea, Meredith Giangrande', 'R', 'It is freshman year at Coolidge College and Van Wilder is ready to party. To his dismay, all the girls have taken a vow of chastity and the dean rules the school. Van embarks on a crusade to land the campus hottie, Kaitlin, and liberate his school from sexual oppression and party dysfunction.', 'It is freshman year at Coolidge College and Van Wilder is ready to party. To his dismay, all the girls have taken a vow of chastity and the dean rules the school. Van embarks on a crusade to land the campus hottie, Kaitlin, and liberate his school from sexual oppression and party dysfunction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjDH8REu8bqgW9zXDIOy6C8FNtH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19824'),
