  ('493707991783174217', 'Vanaveera', 2026, 'Action, Drama', null, null, 'Chammak Chandra, Simran Choudhary, Nandu Vijay Krishna', null, 'A descendant of the Vanara clan is pushed into conflict when a modern-day Ravana seizes his only bike for an election rally. What starts as a petty injustice soon erupts into a fierce fight for self-respect and dignity.', 'A descendant of the Vanara clan is pushed into conflict when a modern-day Ravana seizes his only bike for an election rally. What starts as a petty injustice soon erupts into a fierce fight for self-respect and dignity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBYExKI8E3bTzQjPkofhpV2EJon.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1634301'),
  ('853047051208655619', 'Vandal', 2013, 'Drama', 'Hélier Cisterne, Hichame Alaouié', 'Gilles Taurand, Hélier Cisterne, Katell Quillévéré', 'Zinedine Benchenine, Jean-Marc Barr, Marina Foïs, Ramzy Bedia, Brigitte Sy, Émile Berling, Kévin Azaïs, Corinne Masiero', null, '15-year-old Chérif feels like a million bucks behind the wheel of a stolen car. Placed under the guardianship of his Aunt and Uncle, he has to return to his apprenticeship as a mason. It''s his last chance. But every night graffiti artists descend upon the city''s walls. And with this, a whole new world opens up before him...', '15-year-old Chérif feels like a million bucks behind the wheel of a stolen car. Placed under the guardianship of his Aunt and Uncle, he has to return to his apprenticeship as a mason. It''s his last chance. But every night graffiti artists descend upon the city''s walls. And with this, a whole new world opens up before him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmzpY8Iho3elrvlU5rWP58KneBc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191458'),
  ('942428214518504963', 'Vandanam', 1989, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Priyadarshan, S. Kumar', 'V. R. Gopalakrishnan, Priyadarshan, Jagadish', 'Mohanlal, Girija Shettar, Nedumudi Venu, Mukesh, M G Soman, Jagadish, Kaviyoor Ponnamma, Sukumari', null, 'Professor Kurian Fernandez escapes from jail with his cellmate Raghu. Inspectors, Unnikrishnan and K.Purushothaman Nair are sent to track him down. They follow Kurian Fernadez''s daughter to track him.', 'Professor Kurian Fernandez escapes from jail with his cellmate Raghu. Inspectors, Unnikrishnan and K.Purushothaman Nair are sent to track him down. They follow Kurian Fernadez''s daughter to track him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxZZXplqO2Yc7sJGLmMo9kSHGcI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18149'),
