  ('821468535018011607', 'Vanessa da Mata: Caixinha de Música Ao Vivo', 2017, 'Music', 'Vanessa da Mata, Bruno Murtinho', 'Vanessa da Mata', 'Vanessa da Mata', 'G', 'Vanessa da Mata presents her newest project "Caixinha de Música". Recorded at the Teatro Natura in São Pualo, the project is the second DVD of her career and brings a new musical concept for the singer, in which she brings interference from electronic music incorporating the organic sound of a trio of musicians.', 'Vanessa da Mata presents her newest project "Caixinha de Música". Recorded at the Teatro Natura in São Pualo, the project is the second DVD of her career and brings a new musical concept for the singer, in which she brings interference from electronic music incorporating the organic sound of a trio of musicians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZI7cPUL74Vn3enkpC8MRYymhbJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501275'),
  ('905419160186906929', 'Vanguard', 2020, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Stanley Tong Gwai-Lai, Chris Lee Chi-Wa, Thomas Chow Wai-Kwan', 'Stanley Tong Gwai-Lai', 'Jackie Chan, Yang Yang, Allen, Miya Muqi, Xu Ruohan, Jackson Liu, Eyad Hourani, Zhu Zhengting', 'PG-13', 'Covert security company Vanguard is the last hope of survival for an accountant after he is targeted by the world''s deadliest mercenary organization.', 'Covert security company Vanguard is the last hope of survival for an accountant after he is targeted by the world''s deadliest mercenary organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKvw1Ic9enfFlCPBNJGiejRPMUO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:604822'),
  ('465210360695660012', 'Vaniglia e cioccolato', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ciro Ippolito, Fabio Cianchetti', 'Ciro Ippolito, Franco Ferrini', 'Maria Grazia Cucinotta, Alessandro Preziosi, Serra Ylmaz, Joaquín Cortés, Ilaria Stivali, Ernesto Mahieux, Pamela Saino, Daniele Protano', null, 'Penelope, a mother of three kids, gets tired by the infidelities of her husband and leaves him. She goes to live at her grandma''s house, while he has to take care of the children. His interest is awakened when he finds love letters held by his wife, indicating a past love affair. She, on the other hand, tries to find her past lover, a Spanish painter, with whom she had a short love affair, only to discover that he is terminally ill.', 'Penelope, a mother of three kids, gets tired by the infidelities of her husband and leaves him. She goes to live at her grandma''s house, while he has to take care of the children. His interest is awakened when he finds love letters held by his wife, indicating a past love affair. She, on the other hand, tries to find her past lover, a Spanish painter, with whom she had a short love affair, only to discover that he is terminally ill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sweyUUlVrrzmHeQmSWQljsDRABE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62295'),
  ('959278240042636780', 'Vanilla Sky', 2001, 'Mystery, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Cameron Crowe, John Toll, Buddy Joe Hooker', 'Alejandro Amenábar, Mateo Gil', 'Tom Cruise, Penélope Cruz, Cameron Diaz, Kurt Russell, Jason Lee, Noah Taylor, Timothy Spall, Tilda Swinton', 'R', 'David Aames has it all: wealth, good looks and gorgeous women on his arm. But just as he begins falling for the warmhearted Sofia, his face is horribly disfigured in a car accident. That''s just the beginning of his troubles as the lines between illusion and reality, between life and death, are blurred.', 'David Aames has it all: wealth, good looks and gorgeous women on his arm. But just as he begins falling for the warmhearted Sofia, his face is horribly disfigured in a car accident. That''s just the beginning of his troubles as the lines between illusion and reality, between life and death, are blurred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAh2pCiNPftsY3aSqJuIOde7uWr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1903'),
