  ('1036941299354967017', 'Vanished in an Instant', 2026, 'Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Marta Borowski', 'Al Kratina', 'Vinessa Antoine, Zachary Bennett, Natalie Lisinska, Aaron Poole, Agape Mngomezulu', 'TV-14', 'After her daughter disappears from a gas station, a mother''s race against time uncovers a chilling truth buried beneath a quiet town''s surface.', 'After her daughter disappears from a gas station, a mother''s race against time uncovers a chilling truth buried beneath a quiet town''s surface.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F7%2Fgracenote%2F748500d64e85dd50d244beabdf8d643d.jpg', 'plex:movie:vanished-in-an-instant'),
  ('791492129103301841', 'Vanished into the Night', 2024, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Renato De Maria, Francesco Vedovati, Daniele Massaccesi', 'Luca Infascelli, Francesca Marciano, Alejo Flah', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Annabelle Wallis, Massimiliano Gallo, Gaia Coletti, Lorenzo Ferrante, Giordano Agrusta, Arturo Alessandri, Martina Colaninno', null, 'A father, immersed in a difficult divorce process, embarks on a dangerous mission when his children disappear from their isolated country house.', 'A father, immersed in a difficult divorce process, embarks on a dangerous mission when his children disappear from their isolated country house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f83MF5KVFRs5zuFCPlb6UQV1Yo9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1039868'),
  ('854328677681506357', 'Vanishing', 2022, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Axel Cosnefroy, Denis Dercourt', 'Denis Dercourt', 'Yoo Yeon-seok, Olga Kurylenko, Ye Ji-won, Choi Moo-seong, Lee Seung-joon, Sung Ji-ru, Park Soi, Anupam Tripathi', null, 'When a series of gruesome murders hit Seoul, the Korean investigation police has no choice but to ask help from world-renowned French doctor Alice Launey who developed a revolutionary technique for recognizing bodies. With more corpses on the way and a mysterious organ trafficking ring uncovered, things are about to get more dangerous in the land of the morning calm…', 'When a series of gruesome murders hit Seoul, the Korean investigation police has no choice but to ask help from world-renowned French doctor Alice Launey who developed a revolutionary technique for recognizing bodies. With more corpses on the way and a mysterious organ trafficking ring uncovered, things are about to get more dangerous in the land of the morning calm…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNZPCP9oPaA4ycCV522qeP5wpAY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680071'),
  ('153746832642443922', 'Vanishing Act', 1986, 'Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'David Greene', null, 'Mike Farrell, Margot Kidder, Elliott Gould, Fred Gwynne, Graham Jarvis, Heather Ward, Wally McSween, John Bluethner', null, 'A man honeymooning with his new wife in the Rockies reports her disappearance to the police. A few days later, a woman escorted by the local priest claims to be his missing wife, despite the man''s failure to recognize her. Is a stranger impersonating her or is he delusional?', 'A man honeymooning with his new wife in the Rockies reports her disappearance to the police. A few days later, a woman escorted by the local priest claims to be his missing wife, despite the man''s failure to recognize her. Is a stranger impersonating her or is he delusional?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTAoDu9ZZmAvvzZndVaRC5G4iRj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219937'),
  ('723599148932304038', 'Vanishing of the Bees', 2009, 'Documentary', 'George Langworthy, Maryam Henein', null, 'Elliot Page', null, 'This documentary takes a piercing investigative look at the economic, political and ecological implications of the worldwide disappearance of the honeybee. The film examines our current agricultural landscape and celebrates the ancient and sacred connection between man and the honeybee. The story highlights the positive changes that have resulted due to the tragic phenomenon known as "Colony Collapse Disorder." To empower the audience, the documentary provides viewers with tangible solutions they can apply to their everyday lives. Vanishing of the Bees unfolds as a dramatic tale of science and mystery, illuminating this extraordinary crisis and its greater meaning about the relationship between humankind and Mother Earth. The bees have a message - but will we listen?', 'This documentary takes a piercing investigative look at the economic, political and ecological implications of the worldwide disappearance of the honeybee. The film examines our current agricultural landscape and celebrates the ancient and sacred connection between man and the honeybee. The story highlights the positive changes that have resulted due to the tragic phenomenon known as "Colony Collapse Disorder." To empower the audience, the documentary provides viewers with tangible solutions they can apply to their everyday lives. Vanishing of the Bees unfolds as a dramatic tale of science and mystery, illuminating this extraordinary crisis and its greater meaning about the relationship between humankind and Mother Earth. The bees have a message - but will we listen?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d19vTshdzXFJ3wHEy0FDO7U9g3X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62323'),
  ('182473370400025096', 'Vanishing on 7th Street', 2010, 'Mystery, Horror, Thriller', 'Brad Anderson, Uta Briesewitz', 'Anthony Jaswinski', 'Hayden Christensen, Thandiwe Newton, John Leguizamo, Neal Huff, Jacob Latimore, Taylor Groothuis, Jordan Trovillion, Hugh Maguire', 'R', 'A mysterious global blackout yields countless populations to simply vanish, leaving only their clothes and possessions behind. A small handful of survivors band together in a dimly-lit tavern on 7th Street, struggling to combat the apocalyptic horror. Realizing they may in fact be the last people on earth, a dark shadow hones in on them alone.', 'A mysterious global blackout yields countless populations to simply vanish, leaving only their clothes and possessions behind. A small handful of survivors band together in a dimly-lit tavern on 7th Street, struggling to combat the apocalyptic horror. Realizing they may in fact be the last people on earth, a dark shadow hones in on them alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LkZFmL2UHbmP7UnjlRP5gqvvqh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43552'),
  ('675214583522927086', 'Vanishing Point', 1971, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Richard C. Sarafian, John A. Alonzo, Richard Glassman', 'Guillermo Cabrera Infante', 'Barry Newman, Cleavon Little, Dean Jagger, Victoria Medlin, Gilda Texter, Lee Weaver, Timothy Scott, Robert Donner', 'R', 'Kowalski works for a car delivery service, and takes delivery of a 1970 Dodge Challenger to drive from Colorado to San Francisco. Shortly after pickup, he takes a bet to get the car there in less than 15 hours.', 'Kowalski works for a car delivery service, and takes delivery of a 1970 Dodge Challenger to drive from Colorado to San Francisco. Shortly after pickup, he takes a bet to get the car there in less than 15 hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ThnpFx2G2HPhecvODGFEQxfOpO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11951'),
  ('448638274527401781', 'Vanishing Point', 1997, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Charles Robert Carner, Daryn Okada, Jacqueline Alpers', 'Guillermo Cabrera Infante', 'Viggo Mortensen, Christine Elise, Jason Priestley, Steve Railsback, Peta Wilson, Rodney A. Grant, Peter Murnik, Paul Benjamin', 'NR', 'When his wife goes into a troubled labor while he is on the road over 1200 miles away James Kowalski, an ex race car driver and a former Army Ranger, attempts to elude police while trying to get home. After numerous chases he turns into a Native American reservation and reflects on his life, and his wife. He heads off to break through a police roadblock.', 'When his wife goes into a troubled labor while he is on the road over 1200 miles away James Kowalski, an ex race car driver and a former Army Ranger, attempts to elude police while trying to get home. After numerous chases he turns into a Native American reservation and reflects on his life, and his wife. He heads off to break through a police roadblock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiKDpr72gmML8mnKclllpEg4sZc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27312'),
  ('636782657559447051', 'Vanishing Time: A Boy Who Returned', 2016, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Um Tae-hwa, Go Rak-sun, Lee Seung-bin', 'Um Tae-hwa, Jo Seul-yeah', 'Gang Dong-won, Shin Eun-soo, Lee Hyo-je, Kim Hie-won, Kwon Hae-hyo, Kim Dan-yul, Um Tae-goo, Park Jong-hwan', null, 'Days after her friends disappear during a trip to a mysterious cave, a girl is approached by a grown man claiming to be one of her missing pals.', 'Days after her friends disappear during a trip to a mysterious cave, a girl is approached by a grown man claiming to be one of her missing pals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yqUrXgGOF3StwFc2d2buWe39vr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382217'),
  ('100608757745234654', 'Vanishing Waves', 2012, 'Romance, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Kristina Buožytė, Feliksas Abrukauskas, Platon Filimonov', 'Kristina Buožytė, Bruno Samper', 'Marius Jampolskis, Jurga Jutaitė, Rudolfas Jansonas, Vytautas Kaniušonis, Martina Jablonskytė, Darius Meškauskas, Šarūnas Bartas, Brice Fournier', 'PG-13', 'Lucas is a scientist who works near the European experimental project that focus on advanced ‘human neuron research’. The project is to transfer neuron information from one human mind to another. Lukas is chosen to connect his mind with a comatose woman he named Aurora.', 'Lucas is a scientist who works near the European experimental project that focus on advanced ‘human neuron research’. The project is to transfer neuron information from one human mind to another. Lukas is chosen to connect his mind with a comatose woman he named Aurora.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FDPjmAhKcVj0lLZRFjMRjQXV1D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133764'),
  ('247504241801020146', 'Vanity', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lionel Baier', 'Lionel Baier, Julien Bouissoux', 'Ivan Georgiev, Carmen Maura, Patrick Lapp, Adrien Barazzone, Nina Théron, Pierre-Isaie Duc, Monique Kramer, Stéphanie Blanchoud', null, 'David Miller wants to die and chooses assisted euthanasia. He planned everything: the place, the time and the manner. However, nothing goes right. With Esperanza, member of the association, and Tréplev, young prostitute, David embarks on his ultimate night with total strangers.', 'David Miller wants to die and chooses assisted euthanasia. He planned everything: the place, the time and the manner. However, nothing goes right. With Esperanza, member of the association, and Tréplev, young prostitute, David embarks on his ultimate night with total strangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e87SFyKcR4U7apV2FwuGc0rXuM6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343110'),
  ('1048900568992878528', 'Vanity Fair', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mira Nair, Declan Quinn', 'Matthew Faulk, Mark Skeet, Julian Fellowes', 'Reese Witherspoon, Eileen Atkins, Jim Broadbent, Gabriel Byrne, Romola Garai, Bob Hoskins, Rhys Ifans, Geraldine McEwan', 'PG-13', 'In early 19th century England, orphaned Becky Sharp defies her poverty-stricken background and ascends the social ladder alongside her best friend.', 'In early 19th century England, orphaned Becky Sharp defies her poverty-stricken background and ascends the social ladder alongside her best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6GCjrrd1XIl8VSwjKo8c94LTwtd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11632'),
  ('965162978442871363', 'Vanquish', 2021, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'George Gallo, Anastas N. Michos', 'Samuel Bartlett, George Gallo', 'Ruby Rose, Morgan Freeman, Patrick Muldoon, Julie Lott Gallo, Ekaterina Baker, Nick Vallelonga, Joel Michaely, Miles Doleac', 'R', 'Victoria is a young mother trying to put her dark past as a Russian drug courier behind her, but retired cop Damon forces Victoria to do his bidding by holding her daughter hostage. Now, Victoria must use guns, guts and a motorcycle to take out a series of violent gangsters—or she may never see her child again.', 'Victoria is a young mother trying to put her dark past as a Russian drug courier behind her, but retired cop Damon forces Victoria to do his bidding by holding her daughter hostage. Now, Victoria must use guns, guts and a motorcycle to take out a series of violent gangsters—or she may never see her child again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoWY1gkcNzabh229Icboa1Ff0BM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:804435'),
  ('197688004671199363', 'Vanquish or Die', 2023, 'History, Action, War', 'Paul Mignot, Vincent Mottez, Alexandre Jamin', 'Vincent Mottez', 'Hugo Becker, Rod Paradot, Gilles Cohen, Grégory Fitoussi, Constance Gay, Jean-Hugues Anglade, Francis Renaud, Dorcas Coppin', null, '1793, French Revolution. For three years now, Charette, a young man retired from the Royal Navy, has been back home. In the country, the anger of the peasants rumbles: they call on the young retiree to take command of the rebellion. In a few months, the idle sailor becomes a charismatic leader and a shrewd strategist, bringing in his wake peasants, deserters, women, old people and children, of which he makes a formidable army. The fight for freedom has only just begun.', '1793, French Revolution. For three years now, Charette, a young man retired from the Royal Navy, has been back home. In the country, the anger of the peasants rumbles: they call on the young retiree to take command of the rebellion. In a few months, the idle sailor becomes a charismatic leader and a shrewd strategist, bringing in his wake peasants, deserters, women, old people and children, of which he makes a formidable army. The fight for freedom has only just begun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehnONtmkk1zzBWr1HZHSnwpoYk7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:950792'),
  ('501114582362205166', 'Vantage Point', 2008, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Pete Travis, Amir Mokri', 'Barry Levy', 'Dennis Quaid, Matthew Fox, Forest Whitaker, Sigourney Weaver, William Hurt, Ayelet Zurer, Edgar Ramírez, Eduardo Noriega', 'PG-13', 'During an historic counter-terrorism summit in Spain, the President of the United States is struck down by an assassin''s bullet. Eight strangers have a perfect view of the kill, but what did they really see? As the minutes leading up to the fatal shot are replayed through the eyes of each eyewitness, the reality of the assassination takes shape.', 'During an historic counter-terrorism summit in Spain, the President of the United States is struck down by an assassin''s bullet. Eight strangers have a perfect view of the kill, but what did they really see? As the minutes leading up to the fatal shot are replayed through the eyes of each eyewitness, the reality of the assassination takes shape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xA1KaGoYQJveY3C87J41Au5Kkn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7461'),
  ('702133148059608962', 'Vanya on 42nd Street', 1994, 'Drama', 'Louis Malle, Declan Quinn, Gary Marcus', 'Andre Gregory, David Mamet', 'Wallace Shawn, Julianne Moore, Larry Pine, Brooke Smith, George Gaynes, Lynn Cohen, Phoebe Brand, Jerry Mayer', 'PG', 'An uninterrupted rehearsal of Chekhov''s ''Uncle Vanya'' plays out by a company of actors. The setting: their run-down theater with an unusable stage and crumbling ceiling. The play is shown act by act with the briefest of breaks to move props or for refreshments. The lack of costumes, real props and scenery is soon forgotten.', 'An uninterrupted rehearsal of Chekhov''s ''Uncle Vanya'' plays out by a company of actors. The setting: their run-down theater with an unusable stage and crumbling ceiling. The play is shown act by act with the briefest of breaks to move props or for refreshments. The lack of costumes, real props and scenery is soon forgotten.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYkkHsqXyUcFoLbXt4WNwnRRpT1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32636'),
  ('363399814320372041', 'Vapors', 1965, 'Drama', 'Andy Milligan, Andy Milligan', 'Hope Stansbury', 'Robert Dahdah, Gerald Jacuzzo, Hal Sherwood, Hal Borske, Richard Goldberger, Larry Ree, Larry Joels, Ron Keith', 'NR', 'Mr. Jaffee is a curious but closeted married man, who decides to take a walk on the wild side one night over to the local bath house located in Times Square, New York. When he is a approached by Thomas, a swinging regular who takes an interest in Mr. Jaffe as the new face "on the scene", a deep discussion about marriage, connection and loss begins to unexpectedly unfold. The two become emotionally intimate in a very short time, with no sexual contact of any sort, while everyone around them are screwing like rabbits.', 'Mr. Jaffee is a curious but closeted married man, who decides to take a walk on the wild side one night over to the local bath house located in Times Square, New York. When he is a approached by Thomas, a swinging regular who takes an interest in Mr. Jaffe as the new face "on the scene", a deep discussion about marriage, connection and loss begins to unexpectedly unfold. The two become emotionally intimate in a very short time, with no sexual contact of any sort, while everyone around them are screwing like rabbits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOWfStj18Go3NJSD4g5oKO3sA7N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232242'),
  ('1079030006757585523', 'Varan', 1958, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Ishirō Honda, Hajime Koizumi, Shuzaburo Araki', 'Shinichi Sekizawa', 'Kōzō Nomura, Ayumi Sonoda, Koreya Senda, Akihiko Hirata, Fuyuki Murakami, Yoshio Tsuchiya, Minosuke Yamada, Hisaya Ito', null, 'When a rare species of butterfly is found in a mysterious valley in Japan, a pair of entomologists go to investigate and find more. They discover Varan, a giant monster, who decides to leave the valley and head straight for Tokyo.', 'When a rare species of butterfly is found in a mysterious valley in Japan, a pair of entomologists go to investigate and find more. They discover Varan, a giant monster, who decides to leave the valley and head straight for Tokyo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPy9rvqp0I5ZUBuZ5yiRTjYn5tU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438604'),
  ('902680874269079160', 'Varan the Unbelievable', 1962, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jerry A. Baerwitz, Koji Kajita, Leonard Kunody', 'Sid Harris, Shinichi Sekizawa', 'Myron Healey, Tsuruko Kobayashi, Clifford Kawada, Derick Shimatsu, Koreya Senda, Kōzō Nomura, Ayumi Sonoda, Fumito Matsuo', null, 'In an effort to find an economic means of purifying salt water, a joint U.S.-Japanese military command is set up on an isolated Japanese island where an unusual salt water lake is situated. However, their purifying experiments arouse the prehistoric monster Obaki from hibernation at the lake''s bottom, and it proceeds to attack Japan. Although made by a U.S. independent film company, this film was based on a Japanese Toho monster film of 1958, "Daikaiju Varan", from which all of the monster effects scenes and a few incidental dramatic shots were edited into it.', 'In an effort to find an economic means of purifying salt water, a joint U.S.-Japanese military command is set up on an isolated Japanese island where an unusual salt water lake is situated. However, their purifying experiments arouse the prehistoric monster Obaki from hibernation at the lake''s bottom, and it proceeds to attack Japan. Although made by a U.S. independent film company, this film was based on a Japanese Toho monster film of 1958, "Daikaiju Varan", from which all of the monster effects scenes and a few incidental dramatic shots were edited into it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oCtKenU6gxKaJwBZWCWmdze31ys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43015'),
  ('260896804479003920', 'Varane Avashyamund', 2020, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Anoop Sathyan, Mukesh Muraleedhar', 'Anoop Sathyan', 'Suresh Gopi, Shobana, Dulquer Salmaan, Kalyani Priyadarshan, Urvashi, KPAC Lalitha, Lalu Alex, Sarvajith Santosh Sivan', null, 'A divorced woman trying to get hired as a French tutor and teaching classical dance, and she has a daughter. Her brother Manuel also resides in a flat in Chennai. Their next door neighbours are Unnikrishnan, a retired Major who has a pet dog, Prabhakaran and Bibeesh who lives with a serial-actress aunt (not related by blood) and his young school going brother. The story revolves around the divorced mother and daughter finding happiness of love in their own ways. The film explores commonality of romantic love in different stages of life.', 'A divorced woman trying to get hired as a French tutor and teaching classical dance, and she has a daughter. Her brother Manuel also resides in a flat in Chennai. Their next door neighbours are Unnikrishnan, a retired Major who has a pet dog, Prabhakaran and Bibeesh who lives with a serial-actress aunt (not related by blood) and his young school going brother. The story revolves around the divorced mother and daughter finding happiness of love in their own ways. The film explores commonality of romantic love in different stages of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5e6CpxariObsOsAZWQsc9o8EXJH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659731'),
  ('994704894309568533', 'Varavelpu', 1989, 'Drama', 'Sathyan Anthikad', 'Sreenivasan', 'Mohanlal, Revathi, Murali, Sreenivasan, Innocent, Krishnankutty Nair, Oduvil Unnikrishnan, Janardhanan', null, 'Murali returns to his home in Kerala after working in the Gulf for seven years. He decides to settle in his hometown, but things do not go as expected.', 'Murali returns to his home in Kerala after working in the Gulf for seven years. He decides to settle in his hometown, but things do not go as expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhOKBBs8Rbc73kV2LZWENiPVIi4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280297'),
  ('361441756648010539', 'Varda by Agnès', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Agnès Varda', 'Agnès Varda', 'Agnès Varda, Sandrine Bonnaire, Nurith Aviv', 'NR', 'An unpredictable documentary from a fascinating storyteller, Agnès Varda’s last film sheds light on her experience as a director, bringing a personal insight to what she calls "cine-writing," traveling from Rue Daguerre in Paris to Los Angeles and Beijing.', 'An unpredictable documentary from a fascinating storyteller, Agnès Varda’s last film sheds light on her experience as a director, bringing a personal insight to what she calls "cine-writing," traveling from Rue Daguerre in Paris to Los Angeles and Beijing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99xU63PePSbtffV5CUqPQYu84XY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554967'),
  ('1065971641727080136', 'Vares: Private Eye', 2004, 'Crime, Action', 'Aleksi Mäkelä, Pini Hellstedt, Lauri Nurkse', 'Pekka Lehtosaari', 'Juha Veijonen, Laura Malmivaara, Jari Halonen, Markku Peltola, Jorma Tommila, Minna Turunen, Samuli Edelmann, Pekka Valkeejärvi', null, 'On the trail of a woman, Vares finds himself caught up with underworld characters who are on the trail of hidden millions.', 'On the trail of a woman, Vares finds himself caught up with underworld characters who are on the trail of hidden millions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRsGGco3dL7f1OJAVOaR32gQokM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37988'),
  ('77217212315163438', 'Varg Veum - Bitter Flowers', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Ulrik Imtiaz Rolfsen, Gaute Gunnari', 'Thomas Moldestad', 'Trond Espen Seim, Bjørn Floberg, Endre Hellestveit, Kathrine Fagerland, Anders Dale, Øyvind Gran, Per Jansen, Trine Wiggen', null, 'Karsten Aslaksen, chief engineer of a large chemical company, disappears without trace. His married lover, a successful politician named Vibeke Farang, approaches private investigator Varg Veum to track him down discreetly.', 'Karsten Aslaksen, chief engineer of a large chemical company, disappears without trace. His married lover, a successful politician named Vibeke Farang, approaches private investigator Varg Veum to track him down discreetly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgSuKTdjdej79OFddifggwbqQSP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16686'),
  ('495882415921560590', 'Varg Veum - Buried Dogs', 2008, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Alexander Eik, Tore Vollan', 'Siv Rajendram Eliassen', 'Trond Espen Seim, Bjørn Floberg, Endre Hellestveit, Siv Klynderud, Kyrre Haugen Sydness, Kai Remlov, Robert Skjærstad, Rebekka Karijord', null, 'Racial tension is running high in Bergen after a young black asylum seeker dies at the hands of the Police. Shortly afterwards, a right-wing politician is targeted by a gunman at a public rally and his wife is fatally wounded. Another member of the right-wing party, Marit Holm, approaches private investigator Varg Veum, insisting she is being stalked.', 'Racial tension is running high in Bergen after a young black asylum seeker dies at the hands of the Police. Shortly afterwards, a right-wing politician is targeted by a gunman at a public rally and his wife is fatally wounded. Another member of the right-wing party, Marit Holm, approaches private investigator Varg Veum, insisting she is being stalked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQFDPngYL44gq3DJ6aOU0h5CEST.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18037'),
  ('549802009128276201', 'Varg Veum - Fallen Angels', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Morten Tyldum, John Andreas Andersen', 'Thomas Moldestad, Siv Rajendram Eliassen', 'Trond Espen Seim, Fridtjov Såheim, Pia Tjelta, Bjørn Floberg, Per Kjerstad, Nils Jørgen Kaalstad, Joachim Rafaelsen, Jesper Malm', null, 'Jakob Aasen has hired his old friend, private investigator Varg Veum, to spy on his wife Rebecca, whom he suspects of infidelity. Against his better judgement Varg accepts the job, and in an ironic twist he and Rebecca rekindle their former love. Meanwhile a serial killer is targeting members of Jacob''s band and their families...', 'Jakob Aasen has hired his old friend, private investigator Varg Veum, to spy on his wife Rebecca, whom he suspects of infidelity. Against his better judgement Varg accepts the job, and in an ironic twist he and Rebecca rekindle their former love. Meanwhile a serial killer is targeting members of Jacob''s band and their families...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAXdtZ3SqfJJL2uQVblGpOieRca.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15973'),
  ('540858452511531836', 'Varg Veum - Sleeping Beauty', 2008, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Erik Richter Strand, Johan-Fredrik Bødtker', 'Lars Skorpen', 'Trond Espen Seim, Bjørn Floberg, Endre Hellestveit, Kathrine Fagerland, Julie Rusti, Marianne Nielsen, Bjørn Willberg Andersen, Ågot Sendstad', null, 'After extricating 17-year-old Lisa Halle from a life of prostitution in Copenhagen, private investigator Varg Veum becomes ensnared in a tangle of parental neglect and bad love when he is hired to locate Lisa''s boyfriend, Peter Werner.', 'After extricating 17-year-old Lisa Halle from a life of prostitution in Copenhagen, private investigator Varg Veum becomes ensnared in a tangle of parental neglect and bad love when he is hired to locate Lisa''s boyfriend, Peter Werner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFEvcE2VtqQdhnOwHzNsf8yRvgb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16685'),
  ('137423585100995803', 'Varg Veum - Woman in the Fridge', 2008, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Alexander Eik, Tore Vollan', 'Lars Skorpen', 'Trond Espen Seim, Bjørn Floberg, Endre Hellestveit, Kathrine Fagerland, Dennis Storhøi, Christian Rubeck, Charlotte Grundt, Kjersti Elvik', null, 'An international oil drilling company hires private investigator Varg Veum to find their missing systems designer, Arne Samuelsen. Varg discovers the headless body of a woman jammed into the fridge in Arne''s apartment - and is promptly knocked unconscious. When he wakes up the body is gone and the Police has arrived.', 'An international oil drilling company hires private investigator Varg Veum to find their missing systems designer, Arne Samuelsen. Varg discovers the headless body of a woman jammed into the fridge in Arne''s apartment - and is promptly knocked unconscious. When he wakes up the body is gone and the Police has arrived.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1oSb04rHaCqvjxlIGTBlUfQDMx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20133'),
  ('249225511307092129', 'Varg Veum - Yours Until Death', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Erik Richter Strand, Johan-Fredrik Bødtker', 'Kjersti Helen Rasmussen', 'Trond Espen Seim, Bjørn Floberg, Endre Hellestveit, Kathrine Fagerland, Henrik Mestad, Sølje Bergman, Jon Ketil Johnsen, Ulrik Lullau', null, 'Private eye Varg Veum is on a routine mission searching for his client Jonas Andresen''s stolen car. The car is found having been used in a brutal robbery and not long after that the client himself turns up dead.', 'Private eye Varg Veum is on a routine mission searching for his client Jonas Andresen''s stolen car. The car is found having been used in a brutal robbery and not long after that the client himself turns up dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttiBAE4C3yH9IZKhfZLnud32Dex.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20134'),
  ('117520550583991993', 'Variações: Guardian Angel', 2019, 'Music, History, Drama', 'João Maia, André Szankowski, Teresa Amaral', 'Karen Sztajnberg, João Maia', 'Sérgio Praia, Victoria Guerra, Filipe Duarte, Augusto Madeira, Teresa Madruga, Afonso Lagarto, Diogo Branco, Nuno Casanovas', null, 'Film biography dwelling on the hectic artistic life of António Variações, a famous Portuguese pop rock singer from the 80s, who died from AIDS-related complications in 1984.', 'Film biography dwelling on the hectic artistic life of António Variações, a famous Portuguese pop rock singer from the 80s, who died from AIDS-related complications in 1984.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mK0kFykY6zHMIJvIQGIpC6mCabW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529459'),
  ('1078329615242080212', 'Variations on a Cellophane Wrapper', 1970, null, 'David Rimmer', null, null, null, 'David Rimmer''s avant-garde classic takes a single film fragment of a factory worker unraveling a sheet of cellophane, and alters it through a mesmerizing series of spectral apparitions and alchemical and sonic permutations. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2013.', 'David Rimmer''s avant-garde classic takes a single film fragment of a factory worker unraveling a sheet of cellophane, and alters it through a mesmerizing series of spectral apparitions and alchemical and sonic permutations. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2013.', null, 'tmdb:movie:219731'),
  ('645899352836385250', 'Variety', 1925, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'E.A. Dupont, Karl Freund, Carl Hoffmann', 'E.A. Dupont', 'Emil Jannings, Maly Delschaft, Lya De Putti, Warwick Ward, Alice Hechy, Georg John, Kurt Gerron, Paul Rehkopf', null, 'Murderer “Boss” Huller—after having spent ten years in prison—breaks his silence to tell the warden his story.', 'Murderer “Boss” Huller—after having spent ten years in prison—breaks his silence to tell the warden his story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcpMbxYrYLngdyQrt1lK4QkpV06.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94803'),
  ('1106807584803635102', 'Variety Girl', 1947, 'Music, Comedy', 'George Marshall, Stuart Thompson, Lionel Lindon', 'Monte Brice, Edmund L. Hartmann, Frank Tashlin', 'Bing Crosby, Bob Hope, Gary Cooper, Ray Milland, Alan Ladd, Barbara Stanwyck, Paulette Goddard, Dorothy Lamour', 'NR', 'Dozens of star and character-actor cameos and a message about the Variety Club (a show-business charity) are woven into a framework about two hopeful young ladies who come to Hollywood, exchange identities, and cause comic confusion (with slapstick interludes) throughout the Paramount studio.', 'Dozens of star and character-actor cameos and a message about the Variety Club (a show-business charity) are woven into a framework about two hopeful young ladies who come to Hollywood, exchange identities, and cause comic confusion (with slapstick interludes) throughout the Paramount studio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Yu6mGcov3k08DLlelcg7eF6zKO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113832'),
  ('423096468466255658', 'Variety Lights', 1950, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Federico Fellini, Alberto Lattuada, Augusto Carloni', 'Alberto Lattuada, Federico Fellini, Tullio Pinelli', 'Peppino De Filippo, Carla Del Poggio, Giulietta Masina, John Kitzmiller, Dante Maggio, Checco Durante, Gina Mascetti, Giulio Calì', 'NR', 'In Italy, Checco Dal Monte manages a troupe of traveling performers with plenty of heart but minimal talent. At a small town engagement, he encounters the starry-eyed, gorgeous Lily Antonelli, and hires her as a dancer on the show. Vivacious Lily quickly sells out crowds and earns the resentment of Checco''s mistress, Melina Amour, but the fledgling performer has far bigger ambitions and soon sets her sights on a higher-profile role.', 'In Italy, Checco Dal Monte manages a troupe of traveling performers with plenty of heart but minimal talent. At a small town engagement, he encounters the starry-eyed, gorgeous Lily Antonelli, and hires her as a dancer on the show. Vivacious Lily quickly sells out crowds and earns the resentment of Checco''s mistress, Melina Amour, but the fledgling performer has far bigger ambitions and soon sets her sights on a higher-profile role.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YIjVHxmNetC15MrRPu97OYdIOW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43389'),
  ('704617822985786537', 'Variola Vera', 1982, 'Drama, History, Horror', 'Goran Marković, Radoslav Vladić', 'Goran Marković, Milan Nikolić', 'Rade Šerbedžija, Erland Josephson, Dušica Žegarac, Varja Đukić, Rade Marković, Vladislava Milosavljević, Peter Carsten, Aleksandar Berček', null, 'An Albanian pilgrim, infected with an unknown disease, is on his way back to Belgrade from the Middle East. When doctors realize that it is a disease that has been considered eradicated, it is already too late - variola vera begins to languish and the hospital is quarantined.', 'An Albanian pilgrim, infected with an unknown disease, is on his way back to Belgrade from the Middle East. When doctors realize that it is a disease that has been considered eradicated, it is already too late - variola vera begins to languish and the hospital is quarantined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dibhRUd9Fm4DeFYFdlzDJ1ykwZO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129828'),
  ('931239730585548511', 'Varisu', 2023, 'Action, Adventure', 'Kharthik Palani, Vamshi Paidipally, Rambabu Kongarapi', 'Ahishor Solomon, Hari, Vamshi Paidipally', 'Vijay, R. Sarathkumar, Jayasudha, Srikanth, Shaam, Prakash Raj, Rashmika Mandanna, Sangeetha Krish', null, 'Vijay, The prodigal son of business tycoon Rajendran agrees to take over the reins of the business, much to the chagrin of his brothers. But can Vijay prove himself to be a worthy varisu and also reunite his now-broken family?', 'Vijay, The prodigal son of business tycoon Rajendran agrees to take over the reins of the business, much to the chagrin of his brothers. But can Vijay prove himself to be a worthy varisu and also reunite his now-broken family?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMUIsV6u0pPqfv1j8tGxbJw40sw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:835017'),
  ('780083467756331735', 'Varsity Blues', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Brian Robbins, Chuck Cohen', 'W. Peter Iliff', 'James Van Der Beek, Amy Smart, Jon Voight, Paul Walker, Ron Lester, Scott Caan, Ali Larter, Richard Lineback', 'R', 'In small-town Texas, high school football is a religion, 17-year-old schoolboys carry the hopes of an entire community onto the gridiron every Friday night. When star quarterback Lance Harbor suffers an injury, the Coyotes are forced to regroup under the questionable leadership of John Moxon, a second-string quarterback with a slightly irreverent approach to the game.', 'In small-town Texas, high school football is a religion, 17-year-old schoolboys carry the hopes of an entire community onto the gridiron every Friday night. When star quarterback Lance Harbor suffers an injury, the Coyotes are forced to regroup under the questionable leadership of John Moxon, a second-string quarterback with a slightly irreverent approach to the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g2jX2Xmx7drbc6J9MLJEBghR7Mg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14709'),
  ('453832020869908617', 'Varsity Playthings', 1975, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Walter Boos, Klaus Werner', 'Günther Hunold', 'Puppa Armbruster, Sandra Atia, Ulrich Beiger, Astrid Boner, Siggi Buchner, Kurt Bülau, Marianne Dupont, Florian Endlicher', null, 'Schoolgirls before high school graduation - By law they are of age, but despite their physical maturity, both innocent and experienced young women can get into big trouble. The 9th Schoolgirl Report reveals the sometimes grotesque transition from youthful rebellion to responsibility. Six different stories reveal tender confessions and sensational revelations that get to the heart of young adults'' desires and problems.', 'Schoolgirls before high school graduation - By law they are of age, but despite their physical maturity, both innocent and experienced young women can get into big trouble. The 9th Schoolgirl Report reveals the sometimes grotesque transition from youthful rebellion to responsibility. Six different stories reveal tender confessions and sensational revelations that get to the heart of young adults'' desires and problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qB7h2KXsMuxJh5fsa0lRvd9UlD6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70632'),
  ('873360222816733446', 'Varyemez', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Orhan Aksoy', 'Erdoğan Tünaş', 'Kemal Sunal, Yasemin Yalçın, Leman Çıdamlı, Kadir Savun, Kayhan Yıldızoğlu, Gamze Gözalan, Cem Davran, Bahadır Tok', null, 'Ragıp Elibol is a wealthy and stingy businessman. He separated from Melek, the mother of his children, and married Dürdane. His son Cengiz is studying at university, while his daughter Zeliha is at home waiting for a husband. One day, Ragıp is hit by a car while driving. Four young people, who have many things they want to do but cannot afford, kidnap Ragıp, thinking he can provide them with the means to do so. They claim to be a secret organization and demand a ransom. His wife Dürdane informs the police, explaining that she is being threatened for ransom. Everyone he knows, including his family and business partner, is delighted about the ransom. No one contributes to the demanded ransom. Ragıp learns that he has no one who loves him thanks to those who kidnapped him. When the young people lose hope of getting the money, they release Ragıp.', 'Ragıp Elibol is a wealthy and stingy businessman. He separated from Melek, the mother of his children, and married Dürdane. His son Cengiz is studying at university, while his daughter Zeliha is at home waiting for a husband. One day, Ragıp is hit by a car while driving. Four young people, who have many things they want to do but cannot afford, kidnap Ragıp, thinking he can provide them with the means to do so. They claim to be a secret organization and demand a ransom. His wife Dürdane informs the police, explaining that she is being threatened for ransom. Everyone he knows, including his family and business partner, is delighted about the ransom. No one contributes to the demanded ransom. Ragıp learns that he has no one who loves him thanks to those who kidnapped him. When the young people lose hope of getting the money, they release Ragıp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQqmGs6DIR4fl1XXgf82Tj3GQ3v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452917'),
