  ('263668674152689367', 'Vasfiye Is Her Name', 1985, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Atıf Yılmaz, Sadık Deveci, Leyla Özalp', 'Barış Pirhasan', 'Müjde Ar, Yılmaz Zafer, Aytaç Arman, Macit Koper, Erol Durak, Levend Yılmaz, Şahika Tekand, Ali Rıza Özbilgiç', null, 'The story of a provincial woman named Vasfiye, whose life passed changing hands and drifting between men in Aegean towns, is told by different narrators. The story changes every time the narrator changes. However, it is not known which story is the truth.', 'The story of a provincial woman named Vasfiye, whose life passed changing hands and drifting between men in Aegean towns, is told by different narrators. The story changes every time the narrator changes. However, it is not known which story is the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WkKjqTYW2CVUw7oycei1nfaOjq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141216'),
  ('563580183830691189', 'Vash Level 2', 2025, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Krishnadev Yagnik, Bhavesh Bhanu', 'Krishnadev Yagnik', 'Hitu Kanodia, Hiten Kumar, Janki Bodiwala, Monal Gajjar, Chetan Daiya, Prem Gadhvi, Kalpana Gagdekar, Pratik Rathod', null, 'Twelve years after saving his daughter Arya from a dark force, Atharva learns it never left her. When strange events begin again, he must fight to save her once more.', 'Twelve years after saving his daughter Arya from a dark force, Atharva learns it never left her. When strange events begin again, he must fight to save her once more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTZU5eG5Afs0CLO9DlYVDW5pnfS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1419390'),
  ('700114586557271281', 'Vasil', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Avelina Prat, Santiago Racaj', 'Avelina Prat', 'Ivan Barnev, Karra Elejalde, Alexandra Jiménez, Susi Sánchez, Sue Flack, Lorena López, Pepo Blasco, Pepa Juan', null, 'Vasil is a Bulgarian immigrant who lives on the street in Spain. Intelligent and charismatic, he has an amazing talent for chess and bridge, so much so, in fact, that despite being homeless, he manages to make a name for himself in an exclusive and prestigious club in the city.', 'Vasil is a Bulgarian immigrant who lives on the street in Spain. Intelligent and charismatic, he has an amazing talent for chess and bridge, so much so, in fact, that despite being homeless, he manages to make a name for himself in an exclusive and prestigious club in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOD1Mae72UN1POKvLybTjmamBKR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1030054'),
  ('608379334943919574', 'Vasool Raja MBBS', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Saran, A. Venkatesh', null, 'Kamal Haasan, Prakash Raj, Prabhu, Sneha, Nagesh, Rohini Hattangadi, Crazy Mohan, Karunas', null, 'A goon, Rajaraman, enrols himself in a medical college to fulfil his father''s dream. He defies the college rules and creates problems for Dr Vishwanathan.', 'A goon, Rajaraman, enrols himself in a medical college to fulfil his father''s dream. He defies the college rules and creates problems for Dr Vishwanathan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJwUMkSMHGhvJmGnbXhxL1goz9u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48760'),
  ('578846950486512743', 'Vassa', 1983, 'Drama', 'Gleb Panfilov, Leonid Kalashnikov', 'Gleb Panfilov', 'Inna Churikova, Vadim Medvedev, Nikolai Skorobogatov, Olga Mashnaya, Yana Poplavskaya, Valentina Yakunina, Ivan Panfilov, Valentina Telichkina', null, 'Screen adaptation of the play by Maxim Gorky "Vassa Zheleznova". Saga of the death of a merchant family. For many years, Vassa Zheleznova has been leading the family business and, despite the inconspicuous children, her dissolute husband, alcoholic brother, and revolutionary daughter-in-law, is trying to maintain at least the appearance of a normal family... 1913 is coming, and everything that was dedicated to her life is wrecked.', 'Screen adaptation of the play by Maxim Gorky "Vassa Zheleznova". Saga of the death of a merchant family. For many years, Vassa Zheleznova has been leading the family business and, despite the inconspicuous children, her dissolute husband, alcoholic brother, and revolutionary daughter-in-law, is trying to maintain at least the appearance of a normal family... 1913 is coming, and everything that was dedicated to her life is wrecked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIcRvPJYPrGGnGvZi6HLvDkkF9I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150225'),
  ('744949388255620282', 'Vassalord.', 2013, 'Animation, Action, Mystery, Fantasy, Comedy, Drama, Horror', 'Misaki Horiuchi, Kazuto Nakazawa', null, 'Keiji Fujiwara, Ryotaro Okiayu, Mai Kadowaki, Rina Sato, Misa Kobayashi', null, 'Charley, a cyborg vampire who does the Vatican''s dirty work, is the thrall of the local vampire playboy Johnny Rayflo. As the two fight crime—and each other—hilarity, violence and sacrilege ensue! But can Charley resist his own desperate cravings for blood? Find out as the devilish duo go up aginst a childlike vampire princess, a mysterious branch of the Unitarian Church...and one another.', 'Charley, a cyborg vampire who does the Vatican''s dirty work, is the thrall of the local vampire playboy Johnny Rayflo. As the two fight crime—and each other—hilarity, violence and sacrilege ensue! But can Charley resist his own desperate cravings for blood? Find out as the devilish duo go up aginst a childlike vampire princess, a mysterious branch of the Unitarian Church...and one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyzS55N83jgDtgMeyYJOD7ppYMz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444483'),
  ('726081802609223108', 'Vassilisa the Beautiful', 1940, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Aleksandr Rou, Ivan Gorchilin, L. Altsev', 'Vladimir Shveytser, Galina Vladychina, Olga Nechayeva', 'Valentina Sorogozhskaya, Sergey Stolyarov, Georgi Millyar, Lidiya Sukharevskaya, Mariya Barabanova, Lev Potyomkin, Nikita Kondratyev, Irina Zarubina', null, 'Based on a Russian folk tale, Vasilisa Prekrasnaya (Vasilisa the Beautiful) is about a father whose three sons go out to finds themselves brides. Two of the boys come home with perfectly normal girls, but the youngest brother, Ivanushka, brings home a frog from the marshes. His father finds this most curious, but what he does not know was that the frog was actually a beautiful girl named Vasilisa who was cursed by a magical serpent whom she refused to marry. Now Ivanushka must overcome tremendous obstacles to restore Vasilisa to her true form and free her from the serpent''s spell.', 'Based on a Russian folk tale, Vasilisa Prekrasnaya (Vasilisa the Beautiful) is about a father whose three sons go out to finds themselves brides. Two of the boys come home with perfectly normal girls, but the youngest brother, Ivanushka, brings home a frog from the marshes. His father finds this most curious, but what he does not know was that the frog was actually a beautiful girl named Vasilisa who was cursed by a magical serpent whom she refused to marry. Now Ivanushka must overcome tremendous obstacles to restore Vasilisa to her true form and free her from the serpent''s spell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45gD1bgNYrtsrrLSJlSxP45AsDl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72968'),
  ('810413857613063733', 'Vatel', 2000, 'History, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Fraisse, Roland Joffé', 'Jeanne Labrune', 'Gérard Depardieu, Uma Thurman, Tim Roth, Timothy Spall, Julian Glover, Julian Sands, Murray Lachlan Young, Hywel Bennett', null, 'In 1671, with war brewing with Holland, a penniless prince invites Louis XIV to three days of festivities at a chateau in Chantilly. The prince wants a commission as a general, so the extravagances are to impress the king. In charge of all is the steward, Vatel, a man of honor, talent, and low birth. The prince is craven in his longing for stature: no task is too menial or dishonorable for him to give Vatel. While Vatel tries to sustain dignity, he finds himself attracted to Anne de Montausier, the king''s newest mistress. In Vatel, she finds someone who''s authentic, living out his principles within the casual cruelties of court politics. Can the two of them escape unscathed?', 'In 1671, with war brewing with Holland, a penniless prince invites Louis XIV to three days of festivities at a chateau in Chantilly. The prince wants a commission as a general, so the extravagances are to impress the king. In charge of all is the steward, Vatel, a man of honor, talent, and low birth. The prince is craven in his longing for stature: no task is too menial or dishonorable for him to give Vatel. While Vatel tries to sustain dignity, he finds himself attracted to Anne de Montausier, the king''s newest mistress. In Vatel, she finds someone who''s authentic, living out his principles within the casual cruelties of court politics. Can the two of them escape unscathed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxtzOlO5FqFgSOGnNr0kFzo2Ho7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7093'),
