  ('41645489746705069', 'Veerana', 1988, 'Action, Drama, Horror', 'Shyam Ramsay, Tulsi Ramsay, Gangu Ramsay', 'Shyam Ramsay', 'Jasmin, Hemant Birje, Sahila Chaddha, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Satish Shah, Vijayendra Ghatge, Gulshan Grover, Rama Vij', null, 'A beautiful young girl, possessed from childhood by a vengeful spirit, wanders around lonely places to seduce and kill people and thus, gradually becomes lost in a dark world of revenge and lust.', 'A beautiful young girl, possessed from childhood by a vengeful spirit, wanders around lonely places to seduce and kill people and thus, gradually becomes lost in a dark world of revenge and lust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4XUTCxdi9YqYqqJ1cOoXNIMH1U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98122'),
  ('958766756953790770', 'Veere Di Wedding', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Shashanka Ghosh, Sudhakar Reddy Yakkanti', 'Nidhi Mehra, Mehul Suri', 'Kareena Kapoor Khan, Sonam Kapoor Ahuja, Swara Bhasker, Shikha Talsania, Sumeet Vyas, Ishwak Singh, Neena Gupta, Vivek Mushran', null, 'Kalindi, Avni, Sakshi and Meera are childhood friends. Kalindi and Rishabh are getting married, and the four gal pals come together for their veere’s wedding. But of course, there can be no shaadi without showsha and a lot of drama. This wedding celebration brings out skeletons from the closet, unspoken truths and some harsh realities as well.', 'Kalindi, Avni, Sakshi and Meera are childhood friends. Kalindi and Rishabh are getting married, and the four gal pals come together for their veere’s wedding. But of course, there can be no shaadi without showsha and a lot of drama. This wedding celebration brings out skeletons from the closet, unspoken truths and some harsh realities as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeXnYRRQE2MT7s04uUfKS696cqi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483189'),
