  ('687024191623215716', 'Velvet Hands', 1979, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Castellano, Pipolo, Alessandro Metz', 'Pipolo, Castellano', 'Adriano Celentano, Eleonora Giorgi, Pippo Santonastaso, Olga Karlatos, Memo Dittongo, Gino Santercole, John Sharp, Gianni Zullo', null, 'Engineer Quiller has become rich by selling his completely indestructible shop-window glass to jeweleries around the world. But this got him lots of enemies too: the insurance agencies, who''ve lost hundreds of customers, and the burglarers. When he temporarily looses his memory and voice in an accident, of all people, a family of thieves finds and cares for him - believing he''s a pocket-picker. Things get complicated when he falls in love with his host Tilli.', 'Engineer Quiller has become rich by selling his completely indestructible shop-window glass to jeweleries around the world. But this got him lots of enemies too: the insurance agencies, who''ve lost hundreds of customers, and the burglarers. When he temporarily looses his memory and voice in an accident, of all people, a family of thieves finds and cares for him - believing he''s a pocket-picker. Things get complicated when he falls in love with his host Tilli.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJ4u52KqLizBL0u9ufl4RJsKQDA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63274'),
  ('833516296783732890', 'Velvet Smooth', 1976, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Michael Fink, Jay Dubin', 'Jan Weber, Leonard Michaels', 'Johnnie Hill, Owen Watson, Emerson Boozer, René Van Clief, Elsie Roman, Moses Lyllia, Frank Ruiz, James Durrah', 'R', 'A crime lord hires Velvet Smooth, the head of a detective agency, to find out who is stealing his business.', 'A crime lord hires Velvet Smooth, the head of a detective agency, to find out who is stealing his business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jW87SqGMO67YjpJVIDdFd4DNvT2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80764'),
  ('143549998619210058', 'Velvicide', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Donte Muse, Kenneth Perkins', 'Kenneth Perkins', 'Gea Rose Henry, Jon Devlin, JD Starnes, Dorothy Hadley Joly, John Grove', 'R', 'The two lives of a suicide hotline operator and a recently kidnapped trauma survivor collide in this tale of botched suicide and unconventional redemption.', 'The two lives of a suicide hotline operator and a recently kidnapped trauma survivor collide in this tale of botched suicide and unconventional redemption.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FcZg2Hag2X4Gn9hx9JvFmU7iFyRf.jpg', 'plex:movie:velvicide'),
  ('925436678255628864', 'Vendetta', 1986, 'Action, Drama', 'Bruce Logan, Robert C. New', 'John K. Adams, Laura Cavestani', 'Karen Chase, Sandy Martin, Kin Shriner, Roberta Collins, Michelle Newkirk, Marshall R. Teague, Greg Bradford, Mark von Zech', 'R', 'A sexy stuntwoman gets herself thrown into prison to avenge the death of her sister.', 'A sexy stuntwoman gets herself thrown into prison to avenge the death of her sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6DbUO05o6b1Dh6swf2yqYGeP5lW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110165'),
  ('170511259841162924', 'Vendetta', 1995, 'Thriller, Action', 'Mikael Håfström, Erling Thurmann-Andersen', 'Thomas Borgström, Lars Bill Lundholm', 'Stefan Sauk, Ennio Fantastichini, Marika Lagercrantz, Per Graffman, Erland Josephson, Mats Långbacka, Roland Hedlund, Luigi Di Fiore', null, 'Two Swedish business men are kidnapped in Rome by the Mob, and moved to Sicily. Carl Hamilton is sent to Sicily on direct order from the Swedish Government. He is sent to negotiate for their release. Hamiltons partner and best friend, Lundwall, is murdered by the Mob. Hamilton is dragged into a bitter and brutal vendetta between himself and the Mob-leader Don Tommaso.', 'Two Swedish business men are kidnapped in Rome by the Mob, and moved to Sicily. Carl Hamilton is sent to Sicily on direct order from the Swedish Government. He is sent to negotiate for their release. Hamiltons partner and best friend, Lundwall, is murdered by the Mob. Hamilton is dragged into a bitter and brutal vendetta between himself and the Mob-leader Don Tommaso.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRx7jiNSN2dI503umJqHSDZG89m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101856'),
  ('853081804688117088', 'Vendetta', 1999, 'Drama, TV Movie, History', 'Nicholas Meyer, David Franco', 'Richard Gambino, Timothy Prager', 'Christopher Walken, Pierrino Mascarino, Luke Askew, Clancy Brown, Andrew Connolly, Alessandro Colla, Bruce Davison, Joaquim de Almeida', 'R', 'Based on a true story, Vendetta tells the shocking and tragic story of a group of Sicilian immigrants working on the New Orleans docks in the 1890''s. After the Chief of Police was brutally murdered, much of the city''s Sicilian population was rounded up and brought in for questioning. Eventually, thirteen were formally tried for murder and nine went to trial, and while they were acquitted, a series of brutal lynchings showed they had as much to fear from the city''s general populace as they did from the corrupt police force.', 'Based on a true story, Vendetta tells the shocking and tragic story of a group of Sicilian immigrants working on the New Orleans docks in the 1890''s. After the Chief of Police was brutally murdered, much of the city''s Sicilian population was rounded up and brought in for questioning. Eventually, thirteen were formally tried for murder and nine went to trial, and while they were acquitted, a series of brutal lynchings showed they had as much to fear from the city''s general populace as they did from the corrupt police force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ndP7ySPPYFvETowqA5HbG22hZm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105462'),
  ('300366087638616936', 'Vendetta', 2013, 'Action, Thriller', 'Stephen Reynolds, Haider Zafar, Phill Reeves', 'Stephen Reynolds', 'Danny Dyer, Roxanne McKee, Vincent Regan, Josef Altin, Bruce Payne, Emma Samms, Nick Nevern, Alistair Petrie', 'R', 'Special ops interrogation officer Jimmy Vickers tracks down a gang who slaughtered his parents while at the same time avoiding being tracked down by his old unit and the cops. With police closing in and his old unit on his trail, he has to evade capture long enough to complete his gruesome crusade.', 'Special ops interrogation officer Jimmy Vickers tracks down a gang who slaughtered his parents while at the same time avoiding being tracked down by his old unit and the cops. With police closing in and his old unit on his trail, he has to evade capture long enough to complete his gruesome crusade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Avmal6Ma8E4rluk2g3FxIlNVfMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225747'),
  ('658545459770575671', 'Vendetta', 2015, 'Action, Drama', 'Jen Soska, Sylvia Soska, Linda Crain', 'Justin Shady', 'Dean Cain, Kyra Zagorsky, Benjamin Hollingsworth, Paul Wight, Michael Eklund, Adrian Holmes, Matthew MacCaull, Aleks Paunovic', 'R', 'A hard-nosed detective deliberately commits a crime to get thrown in prison, allowing him the chance to seek vengeance on a criminal serving a life sentence for brutally murdering his wife.', 'A hard-nosed detective deliberately commits a crime to get thrown in prison, allowing him the chance to seek vengeance on a criminal serving a life sentence for brutally murdering his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7hfZbdtuxmbDbXZocYOVQNmUeXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332177'),
  ('387390686969744543', 'Vendetta', 2022, 'Action, Crime', 'Jared Cohn, Brandon Cox', 'Jared Cohn', 'Clive Standen, Theo Rossi, Thomas Jane, Kurt Yue, Bruce Willis, Mike Tyson, Jackie Moore, Lauren Buglioli', 'R', 'When his daughter is murdered, William Duncan takes the law into his own hands, setting out on a quest for retribution. After killing the street thug responsible for her death, he finds himself in the middle of a war with the thug''s brother, father, and their gang, who are equally hell-bent on getting even. What ensues is a tense back-and-forth game of vengeance. By the end, William comes to find that the quest for revenge never has a winner.', 'When his daughter is murdered, William Duncan takes the law into his own hands, setting out on a quest for retribution. After killing the street thug responsible for her death, he finds himself in the middle of a war with the thug''s brother, father, and their gang, who are equally hell-bent on getting even. What ensues is a tense back-and-forth game of vengeance. By the end, William comes to find that the quest for revenge never has a winner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvhmqU6GUkigo6SSYL3ttkBhNER.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:894169'),
  ('229085448997266120', 'Vendetta of a Samurai', 1952, 'Drama, Action, History', 'Kazuo Mori, Kazuo Yamasaki, Shigeaki Hidaka', 'Akira Kurosawa', 'Toshirō Mifune, Yuriko Hamada, Takashi Shimura, Akihiko Katayama, Minoru Chiaki, Daisuke Katō, Shin Tokudaiji, Kokuten Kōdō', null, 'Mataemon Araki, a renowned swordsman, helps a young man find vengeance.', 'Mataemon Araki, a renowned swordsman, helps a young man find vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjJ1jKrapfcbPSNbMMEU3RuIkWg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102282'),
  ('148648619996564563', 'Vendeur', 2016, 'Drama', 'Emmanuel Soyer, Sylvain Desclous', 'Olivier Lorelle, Sylvain Desclous', 'Gilbert Melki, Pio Marmaï, Sara Giraudeau, Clémentine Poidatz, Pascal Elso, Damien Bonnard, Serge Livrozet, Christian Hecq', null, 'Serge is a winner, he sells kitchen furniture like hot cakes. His son, Gérald, who has just lost his restaurant, applies for a job in his dad''s firm. It''s Gerald''s wish but it''s Serge''s reality and you do not become a top salesman overnight.', 'Serge is a winner, he sells kitchen furniture like hot cakes. His son, Gérald, who has just lost his restaurant, applies for a job in his dad''s firm. It''s Gerald''s wish but it''s Serge''s reality and you do not become a top salesman overnight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4NGBIWsWORNSiBqabZrIPQTeF2a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384586'),
  ('442042081283320293', 'Vendors'' Meeting', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Bedran Güzel, Gözde İkinci, Serkan Güler', 'İbrahim Büyükak', 'İbrahim Büyükak, Onur Buldu, Doğu Demirkol, Büşra Pekin, Safa Sarı, Deniz Hamzaoğlu, Çağla Demir, Rıza Akın', null, 'How much chaos can three white goods dealers who come to İstanbul from Anatolia get into in three days? The paths of Namık, Adem and Sadık, three men going through difficult periods in their lives, intersect at a dealer meeting. After a series of unexpected events, they find themselves caught in a crazy plan. To survive, the three dealers have no choice but trust each other and move fast.', 'How much chaos can three white goods dealers who come to İstanbul from Anatolia get into in three days? The paths of Namık, Adem and Sadık, three men going through difficult periods in their lives, intersect at a dealer meeting. After a series of unexpected events, they find themselves caught in a crazy plan. To survive, the three dealers have no choice but trust each other and move fast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NDdIO4LhCtYgYgF0iEiAwx2vOE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:674349'),
  ('82403956962232345', 'Veneciafrenia', 2022, 'Horror', 'Álex de la Iglesia, Pablo Rosso, Paco Bermúdez', 'Jorge Guerricaechevarría, Álex de la Iglesia', 'Ingrid García Jonsson, Silvia Alonso, Goize Blanco, Nicolás Illoro, Alberto Bang, Enrico Lo Verso, Cosimo Fusco, Caterina Murino', 'R', 'When a group of young Spanish tourists travel to Venice for a bachelorette party, they are met by angry locals who are not keen on foreigners and soon they find themselves fighting for their lives.', 'When a group of young Spanish tourists travel to Venice for a bachelorette party, they are met by angry locals who are not keen on foreigners and soon they find themselves fighting for their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90ZsEVSiZZABzO8bh1OcqguomIn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:756681'),
