  ('212212519040168940', 'Venom', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'K.C. Hodenfield, Michael Saunders, Nathan Krochmal', 'Todd McFarlane', 'Tom Hardy, Michelle Williams, Riz Ahmed, Scott Haze, Reid Scott, Jenny Slate, Melora Walters, Woody Harrelson', 'PG-13', 'Investigative journalist Eddie Brock attempts a comeback following a scandal, but accidentally becomes the host of Venom, a violent, super powerful alien symbiote. Soon, he must rely on his newfound powers to protect the world from a shadowy organization looking for a symbiote of their own.', 'Investigative journalist Eddie Brock attempts a comeback following a scandal, but accidentally becomes the host of Venom, a violent, super powerful alien symbiote. Soon, he must rely on his newfound powers to protect the world from a shadowy organization looking for a symbiote of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2uNW4WbgBXL25BAbXGLnLqX71Sw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335983'),
  ('849173802941921352', 'Venom and Eternity', 1952, 'Comedy', 'Isidore Isou, Nat Saufer', 'Isidore Isou', 'Isidore Isou, Jean Cocteau, Jean-Louis Barrault, Marcel Achard, Blaise Cendrars, Colette Marchand, Blanchette Brunoy, Danièle Delorme', null, 'In this experimental film, Isidore Isou, the leader of the lettrist movement, lashes out at conventional cinema and offers a revolutionary form of movie-making: through scratching and bleaching the film, through desynchronizing the soundtrack and the visual track, through deconstructing the story, he aims to renew the seventh art the same way he tried to revolutionize the literary world.', 'In this experimental film, Isidore Isou, the leader of the lettrist movement, lashes out at conventional cinema and offers a revolutionary form of movie-making: through scratching and bleaching the film, through desynchronizing the soundtrack and the visual track, through deconstructing the story, he aims to renew the seventh art the same way he tried to revolutionize the literary world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUc1nBIHKn5Y4soDaKf9JgcYCBP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63400'),
  ('363158875021798171', 'Venom: Let There Be Carnage', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Tom Brown, Troy Sizemore, Brian Smrz', 'Kelly Marcel', 'Tom Hardy, Woody Harrelson, Michelle Williams, Naomie Harris, Reid Scott, Stephen Graham, Peggy Lu, Sian Webber', 'PG-13', 'After finding a host body in investigative reporter Eddie Brock, the alien symbiote must face a new enemy, Carnage, the alter ego of serial killer Cletus Kasady.', 'After finding a host body in investigative reporter Eddie Brock, the alien symbiote must face a new enemy, Carnage, the alter ego of serial killer Cletus Kasady.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzKsRuKLFmYrW5Q0q8E8G78Tcgo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:580489'),
  ('542510945196117110', 'Venom: The Last Dance', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Kelly Marcel, Fabian Wagner, Andrew Palmer', 'Kelly Marcel', 'Tom Hardy, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Juno Temple, Rhys Ifans, Stephen Graham, Peggy Lu, Clark Backo, Alanna Ubach', 'PG-13', 'Eddie and Venom are on the run. Hunted by both of their worlds and with the net closing in, the duo are forced into a devastating decision that will bring the curtains down on Venom and Eddie''s last dance.', 'Eddie and Venom are on the run. Hunted by both of their worlds and with the net closing in, the duo are forced into a devastating decision that will bring the curtains down on Venom and Eddie''s last dance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGXptEdgZIhPg3cGlc7e8sNPC2e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:912649'),
  ('28791743005312296', 'Vent de panique', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Bernard Stora', null, 'Bernard Giraudeau, Caroline Cellier, Jean-Pierre Kalfon, Olivia Brunaux, Robert Manuel, Roch Leibovici, Lucky Blondo, Daniel Jégou', null, 'Roland and Martine, once child stars in a TV series, have sunk into a life of crime. Answering an ad from Isabelle, a young girl seeking work with children, they abduct her with the intention of selling her into prostitution. At the last moment, having become fond of her, they relent and set out to take her home. She rebels, insisting that she enjoys their exciting life of stolen cars, stolen cheques, hotels and restaurants left without paying the bill, and the threesome become a formidable team. Then Isabelle''s mood changes again and she disappears with a hitch-hiker. Worried over her future, Roland and Martine trace her to the town where she is about to get married and abduct her, this time from the church steps. Roaring off in a stolen ambulance, the three are happily on the run again.', 'Roland and Martine, once child stars in a TV series, have sunk into a life of crime. Answering an ad from Isabelle, a young girl seeking work with children, they abduct her with the intention of selling her into prostitution. At the last moment, having become fond of her, they relent and set out to take her home. She rebels, insisting that she enjoys their exciting life of stolen cars, stolen cheques, hotels and restaurants left without paying the bill, and the threesome become a formidable team. Then Isabelle''s mood changes again and she disappears with a hitch-hiker. Worried over her future, Roland and Martine trace her to the town where she is about to get married and abduct her, this time from the church steps. Roaring off in a stolen ambulance, the three are happily on the run again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWWvCTPaMvP4wxHHAH4ccrZq64d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73309'),
  ('441135916082825227', 'Vent mauvais', 2007, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Stéphane Allagnon, Yves Cape', 'Stéphane Allagnon', 'Jonathan Zaccaï, Aure Atika, Bernard Le Coq, Florence Thomassin, Guillaume Viry, Saïd Serrari, Jo Prestia, Axelle Abbadie', null, 'Sent to repair the computers at a supermarket in a town hit by a storm, a technician discovers some unusual things and is faced with difficult decisions.', 'Sent to repair the computers at a supermarket in a town hit by a storm, a technician discovers some unusual things and is faced with difficult decisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQWzw1YtoBGHxmPK55hhNKS96xa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74132'),
  ('1029312180311005595', 'Ventriloquist Cat', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Red Coffey, Tex Avery', 'G', 'A cat learns the art of ventriloquism in order to play a series of practical jokes on a slow-witted bulldog...', 'A cat learns the art of ventriloquism in order to play a series of practical jokes on a slow-witted bulldog...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCeKurAVeLp9A0uvi2JYkXJ91uD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87222'),
  ('829811384301644513', 'Venus', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Roger Michell, Sui Rajakaruna, Haris Zambarloukos', 'Hanif Kureishi', 'Peter O''Toole, Leslie Phillips, Jodie Whittaker, Vanessa Redgrave, Richard Griffiths, Cathryn Bradshaw, Beatrice Savoretti, Philip Fox', 'R', 'Maurice is an aging veteran actor who becomes taken with Jessie, the grandniece of his closest friend. When Maurice tries to soften the petulant and provincial young girl with the benefit of his wisdom and London culture, their give-and-take surprises both Maurice and Jessie as they discover what they don''t know about themselves.', 'Maurice is an aging veteran actor who becomes taken with Jessie, the grandniece of his closest friend. When Maurice tries to soften the petulant and provincial young girl with the benefit of his wisdom and London culture, their give-and-take surprises both Maurice and Jessie as they discover what they don''t know about themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pY1B5ipgUkxtBN3fkJWuKAeFL2G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13771'),
  ('230848133435201774', 'Venus', 2022, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Jaume Balagueró, Pablo Rosso, David de Barrio', 'Fernando Navarro, Jaume Balagueró', 'Ester Expósito, Ángela Cremonte, Inés Fernández, Magüi Mira, Aten Soria, María José Sarrate, Sofía Reyes, Fernando Valdivielso', 'R', 'Lucía, a club dancer on the run, takes refuge in a sinister building on the outskirts of Madrid where her sister Rocío lives with her daughter Alba.', 'Lucía, a club dancer on the run, takes refuge in a sinister building on the outskirts of Madrid where her sister Rocío lives with her daughter Alba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gA6Pn4h2ixCQeq4mLPi7nnMlxq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:931954'),
  ('739766652821876490', 'Venus & Fleur', 2004, 'Drama', 'Emmanuel Mouret, Djibril Glissant, Marie Fischer', 'Emmanuel Mouret', 'Isabelle Pirès, Veroushka Knoge, Julien Imbert, Frédéric Niedermayer, Gilbert Mouret, Eric Barbarit, Céline Bel, Marie Fischer', null, 'Fleur, a shy young Parisian in Marseilles, meets Vénus, a flamboyant but lost Russian girl. They have nothing in common, save for their wish to meet the ideal boy.', 'Fleur, a shy young Parisian in Marseilles, meets Vénus, a flamboyant but lost Russian girl. They have nothing in common, save for their wish to meet the ideal boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTndsK6tk9heOExusshElEyNiqk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78258'),
  ('778359596460028527', 'Venus Beauty Institute', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Tonie Marshall, Gérard de Battista', 'Jacques Audiard', 'Nathalie Baye, Bulle Ogier, Audrey Tautou, Mathilde Seigner, Samuel Le Bihan, Jacques Bonnaffé, Robert Hossein, Claire Nebout', null, 'Aging beautician Angèle, already wounded by a long-ago romance, gets awkwardly dumped at a train station. Witnessing how she turns around a humiliating situation, younger sculptor Antoine becomes so smitten that he breaks up with his fiancée and sets out to win Angèle''s heart. Meanwhile, Angèle attempts to quash the budding romance of her young co-worker, Marie, and a much older widowed client, despite their obvious rapport.', 'Aging beautician Angèle, already wounded by a long-ago romance, gets awkwardly dumped at a train station. Witnessing how she turns around a humiliating situation, younger sculptor Antoine becomes so smitten that he breaks up with his fiancée and sets out to win Angèle''s heart. Meanwhile, Angèle attempts to quash the budding romance of her young co-worker, Marie, and a much older widowed client, despite their obvious rapport.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQIv4yTGmjk3ZLnK9CWUiIu66R1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33491'),
  ('639462724617027674', 'Venus in Fur', 2013, 'Drama', 'Roman Polanski, Paweł Edelman', 'David Ives, Roman Polanski', 'Emmanuelle Seigner, Mathieu Amalric', 'NR', 'An enigmatic actress may have a hidden agenda when she auditions for a part in a misogynistic writer''s play.', 'An enigmatic actress may have a hidden agenda when she auditions for a part in a misogynistic writer''s play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9pCYixO3ZO7tB303efB3O4nkqC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197082'),
  ('934246050833306092', 'Venus in Furs', 1969, 'Drama', 'Massimo Dallamano, Sergio D''Offizi', 'Fabio Massimo', 'Laura Antonelli, Régis Vallée, Renate Kasché, Werner Pochath, Mady Rahl, Wolf Ackva, Peter Heeg, Josil Raquel', 'R', 'Based on the infamous novel by Leopold Sacher-Masoch this fine film follows the perverted passions of a young couple as Severin watches the beautiful Wanda writhing naked amongst furs. His disturbing peeping tomism triggers off a whirlpool of emotions due to a childhood episode which punishes voyeurism with pain.', 'Based on the infamous novel by Leopold Sacher-Masoch this fine film follows the perverted passions of a young couple as Severin watches the beautiful Wanda writhing naked amongst furs. His disturbing peeping tomism triggers off a whirlpool of emotions due to a childhood episode which punishes voyeurism with pain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrUNuLCnULntcqsDGEpZkuoPvUK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118390'),
  ('525362932432292973', 'Venus in Furs', 1994, 'Drama, Romance', 'Victor Nieuwenhuijs, Maartje Seyferth', 'Victor Nieuwenhuijs, Maartje Seyferth, Leopold von Sacher-Masoch', 'Anne van de Ven, André Arend van de Noord, Raymond Thiry, Claire Mijnals, Julia Braams, Rupert Degas, Hilt de Vos', null, 'Female mistress and male slave caught in a circle of tension.', 'Female mistress and male slave caught in a circle of tension.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/386OQnHej3OcvkhTBeKjbUEs8L2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162877'),
  ('1047895900436923249', 'Venus on the Half-Shell', 1975, 'Documentary', 'Noël Véry, Walerian Borowczyk', null, 'Bona Tibertelli de Pisis', null, 'Borowczyk’s portrait of the painter Bona Tibertelli de Pisis and her erotic fusions of men, women and molluscs.', 'Borowczyk’s portrait of the painter Bona Tibertelli de Pisis and her erotic fusions of men, women and molluscs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXU7FHmWNu3j629rtB29N5LSOnr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311012'),
  ('797624609164011168', 'Venus Talk', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yoon Yeong-soo, Kwon Chil-in, Lee Hyung-deok', 'Lee Su-a', 'Uhm Jung-hwa, Moon So-ri, Cho Min-soo, Lee Kyung-young, Lee Sung-min, Lee Jae-yoon, Jeon Hye-jin, Choi Moo-seong', null, 'Shin-hye, Mi-yeon, and Hae-young are three vivacious women who help each other through the tangles of their romantic lives, from tentative first dates to Viagra-taking husbands and one-night stands. Being 40 proves that they''re not past their prime.', 'Shin-hye, Mi-yeon, and Hae-young are three vivacious women who help each other through the tangles of their romantic lives, from tentative first dates to Viagra-taking husbands and one-night stands. Being 40 proves that they''re not past their prime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUjHxrTj9vEiMHOwmusrFvpEk8Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254012'),
  ('611985562451552192', 'Venus Wars', 1989, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Yoshikazu Yasuhiko, Sachiko Kamimura', 'Yuichi Sasamoto, Yoshikazu Yasuhiko', 'Katsuhide Uekusa, Eriko Hara, Yuko Mizutani, Yuko Sasaki, Hiroshi Kawaguchi, Kaneto Shiozawa, Shuichi Ikeda, Konami Yoshida', null, 'The new frontier of Venus has degenerated into a dystopia ravaged by the civil war between Ishtar and Aphrodia. Bubbly reporter Susan Sommers arrives in the capitol of Aphrodia just before it''s captured by Ishtar. She falls in with a bunch of teen-agers who live for a sort of motorcycle version of Roller Derby. Daredevil rider Hiro and his friends reluctantly join the struggle to free Aphrodia from the invaders. Not surprisingly, Hiro proves an ace at piloting the mono-cycles that are the Aphrodians'' secret weapon in the key battle.', 'The new frontier of Venus has degenerated into a dystopia ravaged by the civil war between Ishtar and Aphrodia. Bubbly reporter Susan Sommers arrives in the capitol of Aphrodia just before it''s captured by Ishtar. She falls in with a bunch of teen-agers who live for a sort of motorcycle version of Roller Derby. Daredevil rider Hiro and his friends reluctantly join the struggle to free Aphrodia from the invaders. Not surprisingly, Hiro proves an ace at piloting the mono-cycles that are the Aphrodians'' secret weapon in the key battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiinIVM64yRulfzxzZAfZKV9LmY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31769'),
  ('658185859104512313', 'Vera', 2019, 'Drama', 'Dante Iannetta', 'Wilder Carnes, Dante Iannetta', 'Sofya Nova, Tatyana Yassukovich, Timothy J. Cox', null, 'After a booze-fueled fling with an older American businessman, a young Russian woman, decides to follow him back to the States under the guise of starting a relationship.', 'After a booze-fueled fling with an older American businessman, a young Russian woman, decides to follow him back to the States under the guise of starting a relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOPOKewc6M8UMFHHCYH4LjlsBH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:670697'),
  ('804336710574992985', 'Vera', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Tizza Covi, Rainer Frimmel, Rainer Frimmel', 'Tizza Covi', 'Vera Gemma, Daniel de Palma, Sebastian Dascalu, Annamaria Ciancamerla, Walter Saabel, Gennaro Lillio, Alessandra Di Sanzo, Asia Argento', null, 'Vera lives in the shadow of her famous father. Tired of her superficial life and relationships, she drifts through Roman high society. When she injures a child in a traffic accident in the suburbs, she forms an intense relationship with an eight-year-old boy and his father. But soon she must realize that also in this world she is only an instrument for others.', 'Vera lives in the shadow of her famous father. Tired of her superficial life and relationships, she drifts through Roman high society. When she injures a child in a traffic accident in the suburbs, she forms an intense relationship with an eight-year-old boy and his father. But soon she must realize that also in this world she is only an instrument for others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ADr2tFpdJAIPHhHSDaBJSjDcHq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005279'),
  ('1135953601271020160', 'Vera and the Pleasure of Others', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lucas Pérez, Federico Actis, Romina Tamburello', 'Federico Actis, Romina Tamburello', 'Luciana Grasso, Inés Estévez, David Zoela, Estefanía Nicoló, Carlos Resta, Mariano Raimondi, Ofelia Castillo, Cecilia Li Causi', null, 'Seventeen-year-old Vera earns money by secretly renting out an apartment to teenagers seeking privacy, all while eavesdropping from behind a closed door. As she listens, her own desires awaken.', 'Seventeen-year-old Vera earns money by secretly renting out an apartment to teenagers seeking privacy, all while eavesdropping from behind a closed door. As she listens, her own desires awaken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0ESGyso9K95glbbnTRenFfCC7l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1086548'),
  ('344669752322306824', 'Vera Cruz', 1954, 'Western', 'Robert Aldrich, Ernest Laszlo, Jack R. Berne', 'Roland Kibbee, James R. Webb', 'Gary Cooper, Burt Lancaster, Denise Darcel, Cesar Romero, Sara Montiel, Ernest Borgnine, Charles Bronson, George Macready', 'NR', 'After the American Civil War, mercenaries travel to Mexico to fight in their revolution for money. The former soldier and gentleman Benjamin Trane meets the gunman and killer Joe Erin and his men, and together they are hired by the Emperor Maximillian and the Marquis Henri de Labordere to escort the Countess Marie Duvarre to the harbor of Vera Cruz.', 'After the American Civil War, mercenaries travel to Mexico to fight in their revolution for money. The former soldier and gentleman Benjamin Trane meets the gunman and killer Joe Erin and his men, and together they are hired by the Emperor Maximillian and the Marquis Henri de Labordere to escort the Countess Marie Duvarre to the harbor of Vera Cruz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sDTIHW0nG8CqzskwBJtmUnBwcK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12766'),
  ('232730793674267872', 'Vera Drake', 2004, 'Drama', 'Dick Pope, Mike Leigh, Tanya Clark', 'Mike Leigh', 'Imelda Staunton, Phil Davis, Sally Hawkins, Daniel Mays, Eddie Marsan, Alex Kelly, Ruth Sheen, Adrian Scarborough', 'R', 'Abortionist Vera Drake finds her beliefs and practices clash with the mores of 1950s Britain – a conflict that leads to tragedy for her family.', 'Abortionist Vera Drake finds her beliefs and practices clash with the mores of 1950s Britain – a conflict that leads to tragedy for her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/556fElboCLlEmP8UULaYosU45Bc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11109'),
  ('491552595275640050', 'Verbal Assault', 1999, 'Crime', 'Miguel Albaladejo', 'Miguel Albaladejo, Elvira Lindo', 'Antonia San Juan, Antonio Resines, Sergi López, Fedra Lorente, Adriana Ozores, Roberto Álvarez', null, 'A feature film composed of seven independent short films. Teo, a playwright, and Pepa are two friends in their thirties chatting against a spectacular backdrop. Jorge is a recently divorced executive who moves into an empty apartment. Ángel is recovering from a liver transplant. Benito and Jacinto are two Boy Scout leaders who share a tiny tent. Virgi, a very overweight and innocent 16-year-old girl, has been hit by a car and is covered in bandages. Rosario and Milagros are two street sweepers who find an abandoned baby in a garbage container. Elke is a lesbian who has returned to Cuba to find Cari, a beautiful Black woman she met two years earlier.', 'A feature film composed of seven independent short films. Teo, a playwright, and Pepa are two friends in their thirties chatting against a spectacular backdrop. Jorge is a recently divorced executive who moves into an empty apartment. Ángel is recovering from a liver transplant. Benito and Jacinto are two Boy Scout leaders who share a tiny tent. Virgi, a very overweight and innocent 16-year-old girl, has been hit by a car and is covered in bandages. Rosario and Milagros are two street sweepers who find an abandoned baby in a garbage container. Elke is a lesbian who has returned to Cuba to find Cari, a beautiful Black woman she met two years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bqR9iiYVMVIE1zctOUGR4GVJ15H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102344'),
  ('830125555813484750', 'Verbo', 2011, 'Fantasy, Drama, Adventure', 'Eduardo Chapero-Jackson, Juan Carlos Gómez', 'Eduardo Chapero-Jackson', 'Alba García, Miguel Ángel Silvestre, Najwa Nimri, Víctor Clavijo, Macarena Gómez, Miriam Martín, Verónica Echegui, Adam Jezierski', null, 'Sara is a young woman who fails to understand the world she lives in. Trying to find meaning in life she would come to a mysterious place to undertake an adventure: it is a parallel universe, dark and fantastic, where life and death hang in the balance.', 'Sara is a young woman who fails to understand the world she lives in. Trying to find meaning in life she would come to a mysterious place to undertake an adventure: it is a parallel universe, dark and fantastic, where life and death hang in the balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npH9w6AAWuq1UBAPrfl3Eya9Tr9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79754'),
  ('86248758074398735', 'Verboten!', 1959, 'War, Drama, Thriller', 'Samuel Fuller, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Samuel Fuller', 'James Best, Susan Cummings, Tom Pittman, Paul Dubov, Harold Daye, Dick Kallman, Stuart Randall, Steven Geray', 'NR', 'A young American serviceman stationed in Germany after the fall of the Third Reich, jeopardises his future after falling in love with a German woman.', 'A young American serviceman stationed in Germany after the fall of the Third Reich, jeopardises his future after falling in love with a German woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YWVa3tNmOyuCfUQSwxQBUixrbL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86244'),
  ('149341043290956659', 'Verführt - In den Armen eines Anderen', 2016, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Markus Herling', 'Hardi Sturm', 'Isabell Gerschke, Patrick Kalupa, Julian Weigend, Karolina Lodyga, Guntbert Warns, Annika Ernst, Tom Keune, Merle Collet', null, 'Since Nina met Daniel for the first time, she hasn''t been able to get him out of her mind: he''s smart, attractive and mysterious, and the two of them keep meeting again and again, seemingly by chance. Nina gets involved in an affair with him, experiences exciting erotic adventures, explores the limits of her desire - and risks her marriage to Sebastian. Then she finds out that the two men know each other. This knowledge ends up completely messing up their world...', 'Since Nina met Daniel for the first time, she hasn''t been able to get him out of her mind: he''s smart, attractive and mysterious, and the two of them keep meeting again and again, seemingly by chance. Nina gets involved in an affair with him, experiences exciting erotic adventures, explores the limits of her desire - and risks her marriage to Sebastian. Then she finds out that the two men know each other. This knowledge ends up completely messing up their world...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3fhV9J3qrnIQfHhnFCgV30Wl6Gs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427895'),
  ('457125248578472292', 'Vergel', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kris Niklison', 'Kris Niklison', 'Camila Morgado, Maricel Álvarez, Maria Alice Vergueiro, Daniel Fanego, Daniel Aráoz, André Caldas, Sang Min Lee, Silvina Bosco', null, 'A sudden mourning brings a woman to the edge of madness. Funeral procedures, heat and a neighbor that comes to water the plants, come together in an emotional journey where it is impossible to distinguish the real from the unreal.', 'A sudden mourning brings a woman to the edge of madness. Funeral procedures, heat and a neighbor that comes to water the plants, come together in an emotional journey where it is impossible to distinguish the real from the unreal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41JPFbohumXWN2CNkaf3zwvzg6v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470202'),
  ('1062717822108011580', 'Verity', 2026, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Michael Showalter, J. Alex Finch, Ivan J. Fonseca', 'Nick Antosca', 'Dakota Johnson, Anne Hathaway, Josh Hartnett, Ismael Cruz Cordova, Brady Wagner, Irina Dvorovenko, K.K. Moggie, Michael Abbott Jr.', null, 'Struggling writer Lowen Ashleigh is on the brink of financial ruin when she accepts the job offer of a lifetime: she''s been hired to complete the remaining books in a successful series that bestselling thriller author Verity Crawford is unable to finish after a mysterious accident. Upon arrival at the lavish Crawford estate, Ashleigh slowly learns that things are not exactly as they seem.', 'Struggling writer Lowen Ashleigh is on the brink of financial ruin when she accepts the job offer of a lifetime: she''s been hired to complete the remaining books in a successful series that bestselling thriller author Verity Crawford is unable to finish after a mysterious accident. Upon arrival at the lavish Crawford estate, Ashleigh slowly learns that things are not exactly as they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHI69tGRRvtOnomig59xwMO1YQI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1283515'),
  ('348820428598502258', 'Verliebte Jungs', 2001, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Christoph Schrewe, Mathias Neumann', 'Don Bohlinger, James Dutcher', 'Tom Wlaschiha, Christian Näthe, Alexandra Neldel, Axel Stein, Mathias Herrmann, Rolf Kanies', null, 'Oliver and Michael want to enjoy life, but the 20-year-olds don''t have enough money to do so, so when they are offered jobs in a trendy beer garden, they jump at the chance. There they learn from their colleagues that the waiters at the pub organize a competition every year. The winner is the one who can boast the most amorous adventures. There''s no question that Oliver and Michel want to be at the forefront.', 'Oliver and Michael want to enjoy life, but the 20-year-olds don''t have enough money to do so, so when they are offered jobs in a trendy beer garden, they jump at the chance. There they learn from their colleagues that the waiters at the pub organize a competition every year. The winner is the one who can boast the most amorous adventures. There''s no question that Oliver and Michel want to be at the forefront.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXgR0Ehp1sinw7fYUMXVKcPosfX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11201'),
  ('740203870611226115', 'Vermiglio', 2024, 'Drama', 'Mikhail Krichman, Giuseppe Tedeschi, Fabrizio Piergiovanni', 'Maura Delpero', 'Tommaso Ragno, Giuseppe De Domenico, Roberta Rovelli, Martina Scrinzi, Orietta Notari, Carlotta Gamba, Santiago Fondevila, Sara Serraiocco', 'NR', 'In the last days of the Second World War, a deserting soldier disrupts a tranquil and isolated mountain community. For one family, his arrival brings excitement and romance, but tragedy lies in wait.', 'In the last days of the Second World War, a deserting soldier disrupts a tranquil and isolated mountain community. For one family, his arrival brings excitement and romance, but tragedy lies in wait.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aeCwM7c1Y1IAu3Oqqj5A2tSziWR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1151244'),
  ('421016954394361964', 'Vermin', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Jordi Sánchez, Pep Antón Gómez, Juan Molina', 'Pep Antón Gómez, Jordi Sánchez', 'Jordi Sánchez, Carlos Areces, Loles León, Silvia Abril, Carmina Barrios, Pilar Bergés, Saturnino García, Mara Ballestero', null, 'The story of a mother who does not want to die and a pair of ruinous children who only think about inheriting.', 'The story of a mother who does not want to die and a pair of ruinous children who only think about inheriting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGQ9AAytrwR30dqSS0rgfcbzoEC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:816707'),
  ('1070784967880898174', 'Vernon, Florida', 1981, 'Documentary', 'Errol Morris, Ned Burgess', null, 'Albert Bitterling, Roscoe Collins, George Harris', null, 'Early Errol Morris documentary intersplices random chatter he captured on film of the genuinely eccentric residents of Vernon, Florida. A few examples? The preacher giving a sermon on the definition of the word "Therefore," and the obsessive turkey hunter who speaks reverentially of the "gobblers" he likes to track down and kill.', 'Early Errol Morris documentary intersplices random chatter he captured on film of the genuinely eccentric residents of Vernon, Florida. A few examples? The preacher giving a sermon on the definition of the word "Therefore," and the obsessive turkey hunter who speaks reverentially of the "gobblers" he likes to track down and kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqcUISuve7pUcGT75Kwa0E8Sz6H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30142'),
  ('614230358896089197', 'Veronica', 1972, 'Family, Fantasy, Music', 'Elisabeta Bostan', 'Elisabeta Bostan, Vasilica Istrate', 'Lulu Mihăescu, Margareta Pâslaru, Dem Rădulescu, Vasilica Tastaman, Angela Moldovan, George Mihăiță, Mihai Stan, Cornel Patrichi', null, 'Veronica (Lulu Mihăescu) is a flighty girl who lives in an orphanage. At the age of 5, a fairy godmother gives her a charmed bag, which can fulfill every wish.', 'Veronica (Lulu Mihăescu) is a flighty girl who lives in an orphanage. At the age of 5, a fairy godmother gives her a charmed bag, which can fulfill every wish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJOiQ48kO4Kmm4LIAz6WBK2Sn06.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179796'),
  ('677275612200748189', 'Veronica', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Alejandro Martínez Beltrán, Carlos Algara, David Treviño', 'Carlos Algara, Tomás Nepomuceno', 'Arcelia Ramírez, Olga Segura-Gall, Sofía Garza, Eugenia Morales Marín', null, 'A female Psychologist who has stopped practicing medicine, decides to take the case of Veronica de la Serna, a young woman whose previous therapist has mysteriously disappeared.', 'A female Psychologist who has stopped practicing medicine, decides to take the case of Veronica de la Serna, a young woman whose previous therapist has mysteriously disappeared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WMfFaYKoCtki0mkdqFqIUYB1hC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423611'),
  ('1147915595443760355', 'Verônica', 2009, 'Action, Crime', 'Maurício Farias', 'Maurício Farias, Bernardo Guilherme', 'Andréa Beltrão, Marco Ricca, Matheus de Sá, Giulio Lopes, Andréa Dantas, Patrícia Selonik, Jorge Lucas, Thogun Teixeira', null, 'When a teacher takes one of her students to his home in the slum, she discovers that drug traffickers have killed the child''s parents and are looking for the boy.', 'When a teacher takes one of her students to his home in the slum, she discovers that drug traffickers have killed the child''s parents and are looking for the boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95LdXgoElt33YANCPC5ztlVoFvf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46648'),
  ('663809053475258257', 'Veronica 2030', 1999, 'Science Fiction', 'Gary Graver, Brian O''Sullivan, Gary Graver', 'Earl Kenton, C. Courtney Joyner', 'Julia Ann, Everett Rodd, Stephanee LaFleur, E.R. Wolf, Nikki Fritz, Sandy Wasko, Wendy Davidson, Joseph Roth', null, 'Built for pleasure, Veronica 2030 is a love android from the future - but there''s a problem with the programming... The robot has discovered the delicious sensation of human passion. The insatiable android must be stopped before she has a sexual short circuit.', 'Built for pleasure, Veronica 2030 is a love android from the future - but there''s a problem with the programming... The robot has discovered the delicious sensation of human passion. The insatiable android must be stopped before she has a sexual short circuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DWLpoyQiXs5hq6AfrmaDKHxA12.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262825'),
  ('488661782940580994', 'Veronica Comes Back', 1973, 'Fantasy, Family, Music', 'Elisabeta Bostan, Iulius Druckmann', 'Vasilica Istrate, Elisabeta Bostan', 'Lulu Mihăescu, Margareta Pâslaru, Dem Rădulescu, George Mihăiță, Florian Pittiș', null, 'Fleeing into the woods to save duckling stolen by Madame Fox (Vasilica Tastaman), Veronica (Lulu Mihăescu) gives Cricket (Florian Pittiş), the queen ants (Margaret Pâslaru) and Danila dangerous cat (Dem Radulescu) who intones that all Popa Themistocles other choruses. Tudor Caranfil - 2002 (Dictionary of Romanian films)', 'Fleeing into the woods to save duckling stolen by Madame Fox (Vasilica Tastaman), Veronica (Lulu Mihăescu) gives Cricket (Florian Pittiş), the queen ants (Margaret Pâslaru) and Danila dangerous cat (Dem Radulescu) who intones that all Popa Themistocles other choruses. Tudor Caranfil - 2002 (Dictionary of Romanian films)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5cP1y1vOeE3hsFCLc85t2gygGI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191308'),
  ('500040351412799628', 'Veronica Guerin', 2003, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Brendan Galvin, Joel Schumacher, Tommy Gormley', 'Carol Doyle, Mary Agnes Donoghue', 'Cate Blanchett, Gerard McSorley, Ciarán Hinds, Brenda Fricker, Don Wycherley, Barry Barnes, Simon O''Driscoll, Emmet Bergin', 'R', 'In this true story, Veronica Guerin is an investigative reporter for an Irish newspaper. As the drug trade begins to bleed into the mainstream, Guerin decides to take on and expose those responsible. Beginning at the bottom with addicts, Guerin then gets in touch with John Traynor, a paranoid informant. Not without some prodding, Traynor leads her to John Gilligan, the ruthless head of the operation, who does not take kindly to Guerin''s nosing.', 'In this true story, Veronica Guerin is an investigative reporter for an Irish newspaper. As the drug trade begins to bleed into the mainstream, Guerin decides to take on and expose those responsible. Beginning at the bottom with addicts, Guerin then gets in touch with John Traynor, a paranoid informant. Not without some prodding, Traynor leads her to John Gilligan, the ruthless head of the operation, who does not take kindly to Guerin''s nosing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1aJYz1YjcZggKsTJhCcYJ3adtcm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10629'),
  ('492904538868945242', 'Veronica Mars', 2014, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Rob Thomas, Ben Kutchins, Rob Burgess', 'Diane Ruggiero', 'Kristen Bell, Jason Dohring, Enrico Colantoni, Chris Lowell, Percy Daggs III, Tina Majorino, Krysten Ritter, Martin Starr', 'PG-13', 'Years after walking away from her past as a teenage private eye, Veronica Mars gets pulled back to her hometown - just in time for her high school reunion - in order to help her old flame Logan Echolls, who''s embroiled in a murder mystery.', 'Years after walking away from her past as a teenage private eye, Veronica Mars gets pulled back to her hometown - just in time for her high school reunion - in order to help her old flame Logan Echolls, who''s embroiled in a murder mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWBAPJdew9MRUv8ApRPkXAM1feB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177494'),
  ('952709381183148444', 'Veronika Decides to Die', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Emily Young, Seamus Tierney, Shahrzad ''Sheri'' Davani', 'Larry Gross', 'Sarah Michelle Gellar, David Thewlis, Jonathan Tucker, Erika Christensen, Melissa Leo, Erica Gimpel, Waleed Zuaiter, Victor Slezak', 'R', 'After a frantic suicide attempt, Veronika awakens inside a mysterious mental asylum. Under the supervision of an unorthodox psychiatrist who specializes in controversial treatment, Veronika learns that she has only weeks to live.', 'After a frantic suicide attempt, Veronika awakens inside a mysterious mental asylum. Under the supervision of an unorthodox psychiatrist who specializes in controversial treatment, Veronika learns that she has only weeks to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUo9CNSKz4ELnxAh4l3BPcXcxKq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25968'),
  ('179909601153656016', 'Veronika Voss', 1982, 'Drama', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Xaver Schwarzenberger, Harry Baer', 'Pea Fröhlich, Peter Märthesheimer, Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Rosel Zech, Hilmar Thate, Cornelia Froboess, Annemarie Düringer, Doris Schade, Erik Schumann, Elisabeth Volkmann, Armin Mueller-Stahl', null, 'In Munich 1955, German film star Veronika Voss becomes a drug addict at the mercy of corrupt Dr. Marianne Katz, who keeps her supplied with morphine. After meeting sports writer Robert Krohn, Veronika begins to dream of a return to stardom. As the couple''s relationship escalates in intensity, Veronika begins seriously planning her return to the screen -- only to realize how debilitated she has become through her drug habit.', 'In Munich 1955, German film star Veronika Voss becomes a drug addict at the mercy of corrupt Dr. Marianne Katz, who keeps her supplied with morphine. After meeting sports writer Robert Krohn, Veronika begins to dream of a return to stardom. As the couple''s relationship escalates in intensity, Veronika begins seriously planning her return to the screen -- only to realize how debilitated she has become through her drug habit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A09gh5oWVfincs6BbRz91HL4Rgc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2262'),
  ('291734503228320131', 'Véronique and Her Dunce', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Éric Rohmer, Charles L. Bitsch', 'Éric Rohmer', 'Nicole Berger, Stella Dassas, Alain Delrieu', null, 'Véronique gives a mathematics lesson to a dunce who answers the prepared questions with disconcertingly sound answers.', 'Véronique gives a mathematics lesson to a dunce who answers the prepared questions with disconcertingly sound answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KBqocgkjrR7MohjvVbIxtoVbgR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47456'),
  ('269960598441543399', 'Verotika', 2019, 'Horror', 'David Newbert, Glenn Danzig', 'Bridgid Ryan, Glenn Danzig', 'Kayden Kross, Rachele Richey, Rachel Alig, Alice Tate, Scotch Hopkins, Natalia Borowsky, Sean Kanan, Kansas Bowling', 'R', 'An anthology in which the erotic and horrific combine to create multiple ghoulish tales of bloodlust, murder, the occult and the forbidden.', 'An anthology in which the erotic and horrific combine to create multiple ghoulish tales of bloodlust, murder, the occult and the forbidden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2djQ94iDkL91Ey3BrelyifQhrce.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601099'),
  ('1095646225393171455', 'Verpiss Dich, Schneewittchen', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Cüneyt Kaya, Tomas Erhart', 'Stefan Höh, Rainer Bender, Cüneyt Kaya', 'Bülent Ceylan, Josefine Preuß, Özgür Karadeniz, Franziska Wulf, Paul Faßnacht, Nilam Farooq, Eko Fresh, Sabrina Setlur', null, 'In his dreams Sammy is a rock star. But in reality he works and cleans in his brother Momo''s hammam. Suddenly, a music label gives him the chance to become famous in a casting show. On one condition: The solo musician must form a band. So Sammy, his sister Jessi, the old temporary masseur Wolle and fat Mahmut quickly become the group "Hamam Hardrock". The audience celebrates the original newcomers but label boss Thomaschewsky wants to prevent the multicultural rockers'' triumphant advance by any means necessary.', 'In his dreams Sammy is a rock star. But in reality he works and cleans in his brother Momo''s hammam. Suddenly, a music label gives him the chance to become famous in a casting show. On one condition: The solo musician must form a band. So Sammy, his sister Jessi, the old temporary masseur Wolle and fat Mahmut quickly become the group "Hamam Hardrock". The audience celebrates the original newcomers but label boss Thomaschewsky wants to prevent the multicultural rockers'' triumphant advance by any means necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yu8ICQ5Fpkhw658Otuysjdmet69.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427031'),
  ('232567878932218417', 'Versa', 2025, 'Animation, Family, Drama, Fantasy', 'Malcon Pierce', 'Malcon Pierce', null, 'PG', 'A young couple looking to start a family who experience emotions—from grief and loss to ultimate joy—as they embark on an ethereal, abstract, and imaginative cosmic dance of life.', 'A young couple looking to start a family who experience emotions—from grief and loss to ultimate joy—as they embark on an ethereal, abstract, and imaginative cosmic dance of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2zKN6Ic81C1UbLbnak4dZ2wABl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1500099'),
  ('159198155056846643', 'Versailles', 2008, 'Drama', 'Pierre Schoeller, Julien Hirsch, Gurgon Kyap', 'Pierre Schoeller', 'Guillaume Depardieu, Max Baissette de Malglaive, Judith Chemla, Aure Atika, Patrick Descamps, Matteo Giovannetti, Brigitte Sy, Franc Bruneau', null, 'A young mother Nina and her son Enzo find themselves sleeping on the streets of Paris. Eventually there lifestyle leads them to Versailles.', 'A young mother Nina and her son Enzo find themselves sleeping on the streets of Paris. Eventually there lifestyle leads them to Versailles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/llnHdBy38LTtO03J42KtFJAsnoQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8941'),
  ('290528457067901319', 'Versicherungsvertreter', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Klaus Stern', null, null, null, '"Those who don''t know their limits have none." This is the story of Mehmet Göker, 32, absolute ruler of a cult-like insurance empire. The film shows the rise and fall of the young entrepreneur of Turkish origin from Kassel. A story of greed and megalomania. But also an illuminating insight into the business practices of private health insurance companies.', '"Those who don''t know their limits have none." This is the story of Mehmet Göker, 32, absolute ruler of a cult-like insurance empire. The film shows the rise and fall of the young entrepreneur of Turkish origin from Kassel. A story of greed and megalomania. But also an illuminating insight into the business practices of private health insurance companies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isqdyo3Fg1pvgl9AwdRlarSgPaI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112843'),
  ('829033829222586512', 'Versus', 2000, 'Horror, Fantasy, Action, Thriller, Adventure', 'Ryuhei Kitamura, Takumi Furuya', 'Ryuhei Kitamura, Yudai Yamaguchi', 'Tak Sakaguchi, Hideo Sakaki, Kenji Matsuda, Minoru Matsumoto, Yuichiro Arai, Chieko Misaka, Kazuhito Ohba, Takehiro Katayama', null, 'A group of ruthless gangsters, an unknown woman and an escaped convict have met, in The Forest of Resurrection, the 444th portal to the other side. Their troubles start when those once killed and buried in the forest come back from the dead.', 'A group of ruthless gangsters, an unknown woman and an escaped convict have met, in The Forest of Resurrection, the 444th portal to the other side. Their troubles start when those once killed and buried in the forest come back from the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dEk6Fpm4lkEBQBVpzTOLau7qgR9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5842'),
  ('649546772848891107', 'Versus', 2019, 'Drama', 'François Valla', 'Nicolas Journet, François Valla, Erwan Augoyard', 'Jérémie Duvall, Jules Pelissier, Lola Le Lann, Karidja Touré, Victor Belmondo, Benjamin Baffie, Matilda Marty, Rani Bheemuck', null, 'Achille, a handsome Parisian teen from a well-off family, falls victim to a violent attack. After being sent to the seaside for a holiday to get himself back on track, he meets Brian, an angry young man. Their showdown will reveal their true nature, and their struggle will give rise to a killer…', 'Achille, a handsome Parisian teen from a well-off family, falls victim to a violent attack. After being sent to the seaside for a holiday to get himself back on track, he meets Brian, an angry young man. Their showdown will reveal their true nature, and their struggle will give rise to a killer…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLzKRNaj1xdRP0FFP6z1dN1Rkvo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483555'),
  ('1026246351884982055', 'Vertical', 1966, 'Action, Adventure, Romance', 'Stanislav Govorukhin, Boris Durov, Albert Osipov', 'Sergei Tarasov, Mykola Rasheiev', 'Margarita Koshelyova, Gennadi Voropayev, Aleksandr Fadeyev, Georgi Kulbush, Larisa Luzhina, Bukhuti Zakariadze, Vladimir Vysotsky', null, 'In the mountains, they stand alone against whatever will happen. For the several days they live in nature, they can rely only on themselves and each other. Elsewhere, there is always a fallback - here one is without a safety. This in itself can bring some to terror - the terror of having to rely on yourself - your own judgment, wits and fortitude. This is also the most incredible feeling of strength and independence. Knowing there is no safety means having to be one''s own safety.', 'In the mountains, they stand alone against whatever will happen. For the several days they live in nature, they can rely only on themselves and each other. Elsewhere, there is always a fallback - here one is without a safety. This in itself can bring some to terror - the terror of having to rely on yourself - your own judgment, wits and fortitude. This is also the most incredible feeling of strength and independence. Knowing there is no safety means having to be one''s own safety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPJCGjPIShVpA2k9D2ee0BUsO8A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74852'),
  ('459281155070693934', 'Vertical Features Remake', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Peter Greenaway, Peter Greenaway', 'Peter Greenaway', 'Colin Cantlie', null, 'Vertical Features Remake is a film by Peter Greenaway. It portrays the work of a fictional Institute of Reclamation and Restoration as they attempt to assemble raw footage taken by ornithologist Tulse Luper into a short film, in accordance with his notes and structuralist film theory. The footage consists mostly of vertical landscape features, such as trees and posts, shot in the English landscape.', 'Vertical Features Remake is a film by Peter Greenaway. It portrays the work of a fictional Institute of Reclamation and Restoration as they attempt to assemble raw footage taken by ornithologist Tulse Luper into a short film, in accordance with his notes and structuralist film theory. The footage consists mostly of vertical landscape features, such as trees and posts, shot in the English landscape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IB1sA01lyCQCYR3i4hXpL1jXNK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95243'),
  ('515714713390065993', 'Vertical Limit', 2000, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Martin Campbell, David Tattersall, Adam Dale', 'Robert King', 'Chris O''Donnell, Robin Tunney, Bill Paxton, Scott Glenn, Izabella Scorupco, Nicholas Lea, Temuera Morrison, Alexander Siddig', 'PG-13', 'Trapped near the summit of K2, the world''s second-highest mountain, Annie Garrett radios to base camp for help. Brother Peter hears Annie''s message and assembles a team to save her and her group before they succumb to K2''s unforgiving elements. But, as Annie lays injured in an icy cavern, the rescuers face several terrifying events that could end the rescue attempt -- and their lives.', 'Trapped near the summit of K2, the world''s second-highest mountain, Annie Garrett radios to base camp for help. Brother Peter hears Annie''s message and assembles a team to save her and her group before they succumb to K2''s unforgiving elements. But, as Annie lays injured in an icy cavern, the rescuers face several terrifying events that could end the rescue attempt -- and their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpqQUEi8eAyYHMDFACf6YlnPIu7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11678'),
  ('839537986500222351', 'Vertical Races', 1982, 'Mystery, Adventure, Crime, TV Movie', 'Oleksandr Muratov', 'Arkadiy Vayner, Georgiy Vayner', 'Andrey Myagkov, Valentin Gaft, Vladimir Salnikov, Nikolay Zasukhin, Galina Polskikh, Irina Brazgovka, Elena Kapitsa, Stanislav Chekan', null, 'A drama about a psychological duel between a police detective and career criminal.', 'A drama about a psychological duel between a police detective and career criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udZLdjcgYHx6zX6HXrrRke9f2Mm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127988'),
  ('126626121954488064', 'Vertigo', 1958, 'Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Robert Burks, Daniel McCauley, Alfred Hitchcock', 'Samuel A. Taylor, Alec Coppel', 'James Stewart, Kim Novak, Barbara Bel Geddes, Tom Helmore, Henry Jones, Raymond Bailey, Ellen Corby, Konstantin Shayne', 'PG', 'A retired San Francisco detective suffering from acrophobia investigates the strange activities of an old friend''s wife, all the while becoming dangerously obsessed with her.', 'A retired San Francisco detective suffering from acrophobia investigates the strange activities of an old friend''s wife, all the while becoming dangerously obsessed with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15uOEfqBNTVtDUT7hGBVCka0rZz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426'),
  ('42612597350625354', 'Vertigo', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lee Seong-eun, Jeon Gye-soo', 'Jeon Gye-soo', 'Chun Woo-hee, Teo Yoo, Jeong Jae-kwang, Park Ye-yeong, Jeon Guk-hyang, Kim Nina, Jung Ji-woo, Jeon Jin-oh', null, 'Haunted by past wounds from her parents, Seo-young suffers from tinnitus and vertigo which started when she had moved to her new office in the sky a few months ago. Seo-young and Jin-su, the manager of the development team, are secretly dating, but becomes vulnerable to an unexpected provocation. Saddened by the death of his only sister, Gwan-woo navigates around a 70-story high-rise on ropes. While cleaning windows on ropes at Landmark Tower one day, Gwan-woo becomes intrigued in Seo-young who watches him in awe from the other side.', 'Haunted by past wounds from her parents, Seo-young suffers from tinnitus and vertigo which started when she had moved to her new office in the sky a few months ago. Seo-young and Jin-su, the manager of the development team, are secretly dating, but becomes vulnerable to an unexpected provocation. Saddened by the death of his only sister, Gwan-woo navigates around a 70-story high-rise on ropes. While cleaning windows on ropes at Landmark Tower one day, Gwan-woo becomes intrigued in Seo-young who watches him in awe from the other side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aiEfZdOZvGyUwNv5LsrxJ7lxN3J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:598075'),
  ('586550686389594065', 'Very Annie Mary', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Sara Sugarman, Barry Ackroyd', 'Sara Sugarman', 'Rachel Griffiths, Jonathan Pryce, Ioan Gruffudd, Matthew Rhys, Kenneth Griffith, Ruth Madoc, Joanna Page, Donna Edwards', 'NR', 'Set in the fictional village of "Ogw" in the valleys of south-east Wales. After her father Jack suffers a stroke Annie Mary Pugh is forced to take care of him but uses the circumstances to emancipate herself and find the courage to sing once again.', 'Set in the fictional village of "Ogw" in the valleys of south-east Wales. After her father Jack suffers a stroke Annie Mary Pugh is forced to take care of him but uses the circumstances to emancipate herself and find the courage to sing once again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5YBT8oxc5zttmYArfiVtloQ6tz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62956'),
  ('954868980867419058', 'Very Bad Things', 1998, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'David Hennings, Peter Berg, Basti Van Der Woude', 'Peter Berg', 'Christian Slater, Cameron Diaz, Jon Favreau, Leland Orser, Jeremy Piven, Daniel Stern, Jeanne Tripplehorn, Rob Brownstein', 'R', 'Kyle Fisher has one last night to celebrate life as a single man before marrying Laura, so he sets out to Vegas with four of his best buddies. But a drug and alcohol filled night on the town with a stripper who goes all the way, turns into a cold night in the desert with shovels when the stripper goes all the way into a body bag after dying in their bathroom. And that''s just the first of the bodies to pile up before Kyle can walk down the aisle...', 'Kyle Fisher has one last night to celebrate life as a single man before marrying Laura, so he sets out to Vegas with four of his best buddies. But a drug and alcohol filled night on the town with a stripper who goes all the way, turns into a cold night in the desert with shovels when the stripper goes all the way into a body bag after dying in their bathroom. And that''s just the first of the bodies to pile up before Kyle can walk down the aisle...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYmyRxF5e9fBdgcQScKu0CUtMy5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10029'),
  ('349078141414818985', 'Very Good Girls', 2013, 'Drama', 'Naomi Foner, Bobby Bukowski', 'Naomi Foner', 'Dakota Fanning, Elizabeth Olsen, Boyd Holbrook, Demi Moore, Richard Dreyfuss, Ellen Barkin, Peter Sarsgaard, Clark Gregg', 'R', 'Two New York City girls make a pact to lose their virginity during their first summer out of high school. When they both fall for the same street artist, the friends find their connection tested for the first time.', 'Two New York City girls make a pact to lose their virginity during their first summer out of high school. When they both fall for the same street artist, the friends find their connection tested for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TmLzB5bEUUQbFqMgWQjkDC2mUN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70706'),
  ('1013647507989293937', 'Very Happy Alexander', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Yves Robert, René Mathelin', 'Yves Robert, Pierre Lévy-Corti', 'Philippe Noiret, Marlène Jobert, Françoise Brion, Paul Le Person, Tsilla Chelton, Léonce Corne, Pierre Richard, Jean Saudray', null, 'Alexandre, a young and honest farmer, is oppressed by an authoritarian wife, who makes him work like a dog. When she dies in a car crash, he decides to stay in bed, absolutely free and inactive. Just a dog is occupied to carry food and newspapers to him.', 'Alexandre, a young and honest farmer, is oppressed by an authoritarian wife, who makes him work like a dog. When she dies in a car crash, he decides to stay in bed, absolutely free and inactive. Just a dog is occupied to carry food and newspapers to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQkeFyDIm9f8Oj6MsmlIxShOfu2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18628'),
  ('723122559903223107', 'Very Important Person', 1961, 'War, Comedy', 'Ken Annakin, Jack Cardiff', 'David Ambrose', 'James Robertson Justice, Leslie Phillips, Stanley Baxter, Eric Sykes, Richard Wattis, Godfrey Winn, Colin Gordon, John Le Mesurier', 'G', 'Comedy set in World War Two, starring James Robertson-Justice and Leslie Phillips. Sir Ernest Pease (Robertson-Justice) is a self-important scientist who is sent undercover on a bombing mission to monitor the effectiveness of his latest invention, a new-fangled radar. When the plane is attacked, he parachutes to safety - only to be sent to a POW camp, where he takes on the alias of Lieutenant Farrow. There, the somewhat happy-go-lucky bunch of Brits suspect their acerbic new fellow prisoner of being a spy, and all sorts of culture clashes and misunderstandings ensue.', 'Comedy set in World War Two, starring James Robertson-Justice and Leslie Phillips. Sir Ernest Pease (Robertson-Justice) is a self-important scientist who is sent undercover on a bombing mission to monitor the effectiveness of his latest invention, a new-fangled radar. When the plane is attacked, he parachutes to safety - only to be sent to a POW camp, where he takes on the alias of Lieutenant Farrow. There, the somewhat happy-go-lucky bunch of Brits suspect their acerbic new fellow prisoner of being a spy, and all sorts of culture clashes and misunderstandings ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9hFEC0mNdCGJ81V5BQlL0n0WHT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120555'),
  ('779616761140000786', 'Very Nice, Very Nice', 1961, 'Documentary', 'Arthur Lipsett', null, null, 'NR', 'Arthur Lipsett''s first film is an avant-garde blend of photography and sound. It looks behind the business-as-usual face we put on life and shows anxieties we want to forget. It is made of dozens of pictures that seem familiar, with fragments of speech heard in passing and, between times, a voice saying, "Very nice, very nice." The film was nominated for an Oscar for Best Live Action Short Film.', 'Arthur Lipsett''s first film is an avant-garde blend of photography and sound. It looks behind the business-as-usual face we put on life and shows anxieties we want to forget. It is made of dozens of pictures that seem familiar, with fragments of speech heard in passing and, between times, a voice saying, "Very nice, very nice." The film was nominated for an Oscar for Best Live Action Short Film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXRhGRgIwjulrVJMPajv1SvuR6Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127835'),
  ('667477817700218632', 'Very Ordinary Couple', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Roh Deok, Park Jong-cheol', 'Roh Deok', 'Lee Min-ki, Kim Min-hee, Kim Kang-hyun, Ra Mi-ran, Choi Moo-seong, Park Byung-eun, Ha Yeon-soo, Shin Yeon-sook', null, 'After a trivial quarrel, co-workers Dong-hee and Young decide to take a break from their relationship. But they realise that they still love each other as their attempts to find new partners fail.', 'After a trivial quarrel, co-workers Dong-hee and Young decide to take a break from their relationship. But they realise that they still love each other as their attempts to find new partners fail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLdDMgoxq7xuDzkJ2wgjjJUdtXF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180252'),
  ('477101330975242149', 'Very Well, Thank You', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Emmanuelle Cuau , Bruno de Keyzer', 'Agnès Caffin, Emmanuelle Cuau', 'Gilbert Melki, Sandrine Kiberlain, Olivier Cruveiller, Christophe Odent, Grégory Gadebois, Frédéric Pierrot, Nathalie Akoun-Cruveiller', null, 'The tough lives of two ordinary individuals: Alex, an accountant and his wife Béatrice, a taxi driver.', 'The tough lives of two ordinary individuals: Alex, an accountant and his wife Béatrice, a taxi driver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34g7fxDSWHnerIccwUjU7EYsUzw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76272'),
  ('864799737640959381', 'Vesna', 1953, 'Comedy', 'František Čáp, Paul Grupp', 'Matej Bor, František Čáp', 'Metka Gabrijelčič, Franek Trefalt, Janez Čuk, Jure Furlan, Metka Bučar, Stane Sever, Elvira Kralj, Frane ''Ježek'' Milčinski', null, 'Samo, Sandi, and Krištof are preparing for their final exams. They come up with a plan to get hold of the math exam questions with the help of the professor''s daughter, nicknamed Hyperbola. Since they don''t know her real name, they call her Vesna (Spring). Unexpectedly, the professor''s real daughter, the attractive Janja, shows up on a date. Samo and Vesna fall in love and the story begins to unfold rapidly. Samo invites Vesna (Janja) for a ride in a glider. They have to make an emergency landing. Sandi, happy that they finally got their assignments, fights with Samo over them. Samo gets injured and can''t go on a date with Vesna. Sandi goes on the date instead, trying to win Vesna over. She scolds him and he reveals the truth that they drew lots for Vesna. Because of this, Vesna wants to kill herself. She jumps with a parachute, hoping it won''t open. Everything turns out fine, and the parachute opens.', 'Samo, Sandi, and Krištof are preparing for their final exams. They come up with a plan to get hold of the math exam questions with the help of the professor''s daughter, nicknamed Hyperbola. Since they don''t know her real name, they call her Vesna (Spring). Unexpectedly, the professor''s real daughter, the attractive Janja, shows up on a date. Samo and Vesna fall in love and the story begins to unfold rapidly. Samo invites Vesna (Janja) for a ride in a glider. They have to make an emergency landing. Sandi, happy that they finally got their assignments, fights with Samo over them. Samo gets injured and can''t go on a date with Vesna. Sandi goes on the date instead, trying to win Vesna over. She scolds him and he reveals the truth that they drew lots for Vesna. Because of this, Vesna wants to kill herself. She jumps with a parachute, hoping it won''t open. Everything turns out fine, and the parachute opens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ri9x3GoDLoJtq7lh26WStRyvINm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70525'),
  ('130369795032292228', 'Vesna Goes Fast', 1996, 'Drama', 'Carlo Mazzacurati, Alessandro Pesci, Edda Valentini', 'Carlo Mazzacurati, Sandro Petraglia, Stefano Rulli', 'Tereza Groszmannová, Antonio Albanese, Silvio Orlando, Antonio Catania, Roberto Citran, Ivano Marescotti, Marco Messeri, Roberto Nobile', null, 'Czech immigrant Vesna arrives in Italy and is forced into casual prostitution by poverty. The encounter with a kind construction worker could help change her situation.', 'Czech immigrant Vesna arrives in Italy and is forced into casual prostitution by poverty. The encounter with a kind construction worker could help change her situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7C2oeQf2rkUzuozdknxmIMNncZe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120122'),
  ('676670273492039027', 'Vesper', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Kristina Buožytė, Bruno Samper, Feliksas Abrukauskas', 'Bruno Samper, Kristina Buožytė, Brian Clark', 'Raffiella Chapman, Eddie Marsan, Rosy McEwen, Richard Brake, Edmund Dehn, Melanie Gaydos, Markas Eimontas, Matijus Adomavičius', null, 'After the collapse of Earth''s ecosystem, Vesper, a 13-year-old girl struggling to survive with her paralyzed Father, meets a mysterious Woman with a secret that forces Vesper to use her wits, strength and bio-hacking abilities to fight for the possibility of a future.', 'After the collapse of Earth''s ecosystem, Vesper, a 13-year-old girl struggling to survive with her paralyzed Father, meets a mysterious Woman with a secret that forces Vesper to use her wits, strength and bio-hacking abilities to fight for the possibility of a future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etvK8ni1adjXU8obDpdUxTTQT6n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:976720'),
  ('367225026755777461', 'Vessel of Wrath', 1938, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Erich Pommer, Jules Kruger', 'Bartlett Cormack', 'Charles Laughton, Elsa Lanchester, Robert Newton, Tyrone Guthrie, Eliot Makeham, Dolly Mollinger, D.A. Ward, J. Solomon', null, 'Ginger Ted, AKA Edward Claude Wilson, a drunkard and womanizer, and Miss Jones, a missionary, live in the Alas Islands. During a cholera epidemic, Ginger Ted and Miss Jones are sent to an outlying part of the islands to run a hospital; on their return, their motorboat breaks down, and they are marooned overnight on a small island.', 'Ginger Ted, AKA Edward Claude Wilson, a drunkard and womanizer, and Miss Jones, a missionary, live in the Alas Islands. During a cholera epidemic, Ginger Ted and Miss Jones are sent to an outlying part of the islands to run a hospital; on their return, their motorboat breaks down, and they are marooned overnight on a small island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MMiOGVPUDkEEKbIiXz9mFtvyCW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180954'),
  ('935026256051551227', 'Vestido nuevo', 2007, 'Drama', 'Sergi Pérez', 'Sergi Pérez', 'Ramon Novell, Sara Martín, Kevin Puertas, Mireia Prat, Jordi Gràcia, Montse Bernal, Enric Arquimbau', null, 'This is the story of Mario, an 8 year old boy, who comes to his class dressed as a girl.', 'This is the story of Mario, an 8 year old boy, who comes to his class dressed as a girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78xe5NUfvb63zZDeWKVVUbit0FF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471155'),
  ('847847347184061702', 'Veteran', 2015, 'Action, Crime, Comedy, Thriller', 'Ryoo Seung-wan, Choi Young-hwan, Kim Ho-sung', 'Ryoo Seung-wan', 'Hwang Jung-min, Yoo Ah-in, Yoo Hai-jin, Oh Dal-su, Jang Yoon-ju, Oh Dae-hwan, Kim Si-hoo, Jung Woong-in', 'NR', 'When an old collaborator gets severely injured, a veteran policeman tries to figure out the way to bring to justice the ultimately suspected aggressor, a spoiled young executive, heir to a mega corporation, who believes he is above the law.', 'When an old collaborator gets severely injured, a veteran policeman tries to figure out the way to bring to justice the ultimately suspected aggressor, a spoiled young executive, heir to a mega corporation, who believes he is above the law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59KtPlcr2GQIudEA6B5KNY5NnBf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346646'),
  ('935430826355195', 'Vettaikaaran', 2009, 'Action, Drama', 'Babusivan, Gopinath', 'Babusivan', 'Vijay, Anushka Shetty, Salim Ghouse, Sathyan Sivakumar, Sayaji Shinde, Srihari, Sanchita Padukone, Srinath', null, 'Police-Ravi is a student aspiring to become a police officer,becomes hunted when he helps his friend out of trouble.The hunted becomes the Hunter to secure his future.', 'Police-Ravi is a student aspiring to become a police officer,becomes hunted when he helps his friend out of trouble.The hunted becomes the Hunter to secure his future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Izeu2M0T0EMqtJWziKraltXvAU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63635'),
  ('910413296175236088', 'Vettaiyaadu Vilaiyaadu', 2006, 'Action, Thriller', 'Gautham Vasudev Menon, Ravi Varman', 'Gautham Vasudev Menon', 'Kamal Haasan, Jyothika, Kamalinee Mukherjee, Lev Gorn, Prakash Raj, Rajashree, Daniel Balaji, Yog Jappie', null, 'DCP Raghavan sets off on the trail of the killers of Rani, the daughter of a police officer. Following this, many more murders take place, leading him to New York to capture the maniac killer.', 'DCP Raghavan sets off on the trail of the killers of Rani, the daughter of a police officer. Following this, many more murders take place, leading him to New York to capture the maniac killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdFuSN7rz8dk61jFBR9zjqhcwzK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63670'),
  ('318874513752753981', 'Vettaiyan', 2024, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Kiruthika B, T. J. Gnanavel, S. R. Kathir', 'Kiruthika B', 'Rajinikanth, Amitabh Bachchan, Fahadh Faasil, Rana Daggubati, Manju Warrier, Ritika Singh, Kishore, Dushara Vijayan', null, 'A sought-after Supercop gets caught in a series of unexpected events when he encounters a suspect who is accused of being involved in a murder case.', 'A sought-after Supercop gets caught in a series of unexpected events when he encounters a suspect who is accused of being involved in a murder case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEEyhQaW7cEb0IDJstoMBmEtPND.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1093966'),
  ('758396327958596551', 'Vexille', 2007, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Fumihiko Sori', 'Fumihiko Sori, Haruka Handa', 'Meisa Kuroki, Shosuke Tanihara, Yasuko Matsuyuki, Akio Otsuka, Romi Park, Takahiro Sakurai, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Tetsuya Kakihara', 'PG-13', '2067: Isolation: Japan seals herself off from the eyes of the world in the face of unilateral international policy setting strict limits on the use of robotic technology. The island nation exists only behind a veil of seclusion. No soul shall enter. No soul shall leave. 2077: Revelation: The veil is breached. Japan is infiltrated by agents of the organization S.W.O.R.D., a fighting force operating outside of the protection of the United States and her allies. Their mission: Determine if the Japanese are developing banned robotic bio-technology, forbidden due to its threat to humankind. In the battle between machine and man, humanity stands to suffer most.', '2067: Isolation: Japan seals herself off from the eyes of the world in the face of unilateral international policy setting strict limits on the use of robotic technology. The island nation exists only behind a veil of seclusion. No soul shall enter. No soul shall leave. 2077: Revelation: The veil is breached. Japan is infiltrated by agents of the organization S.W.O.R.D., a fighting force operating outside of the protection of the United States and her allies. Their mission: Determine if the Japanese are developing banned robotic bio-technology, forbidden due to its threat to humankind. In the battle between machine and man, humanity stands to suffer most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xF5je4N99eoh94Zahus2Nhm45Yl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13391'),
  ('651661584924626438', 'Vezir Parmağı', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mahsun Kırmızıgül', 'Mahsun Kırmızıgül', 'Ali Sürmeli, Yasemin Yalçın, Ece Uslu, Peker Açıkalın, Gülben Ergen, Selim Bayraktar, Mahsun Kırmızıgül, Derya Şensoy', null, 'In this story set in ancient times, 31 women who lost their husbands, fathers, and children in war rise up against their lack of men after many years and demand that the state send them men to marry and have children. Five single men from different regions and cultures are selected at a porter market in Istanbul to marry these 31 women. The selected men, unaware of what awaits them, believe they are going to war. However, the porters, referred to as "human donkeys," find themselves in a completely different adventure instead of the front lines.', 'In this story set in ancient times, 31 women who lost their husbands, fathers, and children in war rise up against their lack of men after many years and demand that the state send them men to marry and have children. Five single men from different regions and cultures are selected at a porter market in Istanbul to marry these 31 women. The selected men, unaware of what awaits them, believe they are going to war. However, the porters, referred to as "human donkeys," find themselves in a completely different adventure instead of the front lines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQUByrwG9TZUJ5o0DNirUfXrjMm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:443041'),
  ('476369649409738017', 'VFW', 2019, 'Action, Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Matthew Spellings, Joe Begos, Meg Beatty', 'Max Brallier, Matthew McArdle', 'Stephen Lang, Martin Kove, William Sadler, David Patrick Kelly, Dora Madison, Sierra McCormick, George Wendt, Fred Williamson', 'NR', 'A typical night for veterans at a VFW turns into an all-out battle for survival when a desperate teen runs into the bar with a bag of stolen drugs. When a gang of violent punks come looking for her, the vets use every weapon at their disposal to protect the girl and themselves from an unrelenting attack.', 'A typical night for veterans at a VFW turns into an all-out battle for survival when a desperate teen runs into the bar with a bag of stolen drugs. When a gang of violent punks come looking for her, the vets use every weapon at their disposal to protect the girl and themselves from an unrelenting attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnVD7Gn14uOTQhcc5xYZGQ9DRvS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:624779'),
  ('946066778127320379', 'VG4', 2015, 'Horror', 'Lucifer Valentine', 'Lucifer Valentine', 'Sister S, Chalice, Heather Cage, Yesenia Black, Jayne Gloom, Hank Skinny', 'NR', 'In this demonic labyrinth we experience the satanic ritual which spawns endless incarnations of Angela Aberdeen, as she is doomed to live out her haunted existence of the eternal “Lost Girl”. One dark, cold christmas night, we enter Angela’s kingdom of Hell, and witness her tortured mutations as we descend deeper into her Satanic netherworld of the Black Mass of the Nazi Sex Wizard.', 'In this demonic labyrinth we experience the satanic ritual which spawns endless incarnations of Angela Aberdeen, as she is doomed to live out her haunted existence of the eternal “Lost Girl”. One dark, cold christmas night, we enter Angela’s kingdom of Hell, and witness her tortured mutations as we descend deeper into her Satanic netherworld of the Black Mass of the Nazi Sex Wizard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48LhUdGOmRalmvrMj9JXhrWJgtU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348523'),
  ('608338030283649040', 'VH1: Divas Live', 1998, 'Music, TV Movie', 'Michael Simon', null, 'Aretha Franklin, Mariah Carey, Carole King, Céline Dion, Gloria Estefan, Shania Twain, Jennifer Aniston, Joan Osborne', 'PG', 'The queen of soul, Aretha Franklin, and four of the biggest female hitmakers in contemporary pop, Mariah Carey, Celine Dion, Gloria Estefan, and Shania Twain, join forces for this once-in-a-lifetime concert event where they sing their hits and team up for a variety of ensemble performances. The night also includes an appearance by legendary songwriter Carole King.', 'The queen of soul, Aretha Franklin, and four of the biggest female hitmakers in contemporary pop, Mariah Carey, Celine Dion, Gloria Estefan, and Shania Twain, join forces for this once-in-a-lifetime concert event where they sing their hits and team up for a variety of ensemble performances. The night also includes an appearance by legendary songwriter Carole King.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5VOJ0DUZL3XQDYQLJLumGsmYx0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20195'),
  ('31754739462770712', 'VHS Revolution', 2017, 'Documentary, History', 'Julie Meigniez, Ada Grudzinski, Alexey Blagutin', 'Dimitri Kourtchine', 'Sarah-Jane Sauvegrain, Ray Glasser, Marc Wielage, Stephen Kroft, Joshua Greenberg, Daniel Herbert, Michael L. Raso, Donovan Brandt', null, 'Using testimonies by pioneers and witnesses of the times, delve into the feverish visual culture the media generated – with far-fetched examples of canine television games, seduction manuals, aerobics class while holding a baby, among others.', 'Using testimonies by pioneers and witnesses of the times, delve into the feverish visual culture the media generated – with far-fetched examples of canine television games, seduction manuals, aerobics class while holding a baby, among others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sq9wkyVTtAel6A4avg9Xiq4No6E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472703'),
  ('935854195696204429', 'VHYes', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Jack Henry Robbins, David Geiger, Ed Licht', 'Jack Henry Robbins, Nunzio Randazzo', 'Jake Head, Christopher Marble, Christian Drerup, Mason McNulty, Roy Abramsohn, Helen Kennedy, Amos Vernon, William Frederick Knight', 'NR', 'This bizarre retro comedy, shot entirely on VHS and Beta, takes us back to when 12-year-old Ralph, over one formative week, mistakenly records home videos and his favorite late night shows over his parents’ wedding tape.', 'This bizarre retro comedy, shot entirely on VHS and Beta, takes us back to when 12-year-old Ralph, over one formative week, mistakenly records home videos and his favorite late night shows over his parents’ wedding tape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNT4LauReqsJioV01sffGpho1UI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:624782'),
  ('318272455568526274', 'Vi er allesammen tossede', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Sven Methling', 'Aage Stentoft, Arvid Müller', 'Kjeld Petersen, Jessie Rindom, Dirch Passer, Birgitte Reimer, Buster Larsen, Bjørn Puggaard-Müller, Emil Hass Christensen, Preben Mahrt', null, 'After a gruesome meeting with the tax authorities Alex Alexander takes a drive in the countryside to calm down. While driving, he accidentally runs into an elephant from a circus. When he is stopped by the police and tells them about the elephant they think he is crazy. He is committed to an asylum by the very authorities his taxes are funding. The doctor tries to convince him that the elephants were not really there, but he gets more help from manic fellow patient Knudsen who makes him realize that everybody in the world is crazy in some way.', 'After a gruesome meeting with the tax authorities Alex Alexander takes a drive in the countryside to calm down. While driving, he accidentally runs into an elephant from a circus. When he is stopped by the police and tells them about the elephant they think he is crazy. He is committed to an asylum by the very authorities his taxes are funding. The doctor tries to convince him that the elephants were not really there, but he gets more help from manic fellow patient Knudsen who makes him realize that everybody in the world is crazy in some way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jm1Exap0eLuUjFACApwUzHBSudQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56888'),
  ('1083821703082539218', 'Vi var the Ark', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Martin Sandin', null, 'Mikael Jepson, Ola Salo', null, 'Vi var the Ark (2026) released on February 27, 2026 starring Mikael Jepson, Ola Salo and directed by Martin Sandin. Get notified when Vi var the Ark is available to stream!', 'Vi var the Ark (2026) released on February 27, 2026 starring Mikael Jepson, Ola Salo and directed by Martin Sandin. Get notified when Vi var the Ark is available to stream!', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BNzMxNzdlY2UtNzU1OC00ZGQyLWE2M2MtNWI4NmE1YWY2YjQyXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:vi-var-the-ark'),
  ('499597964775373417', 'Via Montenapoleone', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Luigi Kuveiller, Miro Viglianesi', 'Enrico Vanzina, Jaja Fiastri, Carlo Vanzina', 'Carol Alt, Renée Simonsen, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Luca Barbareschi, Marisa Berenson, Corinne Cléry, Valentina Cortese, Daniel Gélin', null, 'Via Montenapoleone in Milan is the ritziest street in the city and here the destinies of several characters, playboys, models and gays cross and diverge.', 'Via Montenapoleone in Milan is the ritziest street in the city and here the destinies of several characters, playboys, models and gays cross and diverge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2K6nlPVMMTvEp2s3zO9LksmrZ3G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59049'),
  ('1134685041252526574', 'Via Panisperna Boys', 1989, 'Drama', 'Gianni Amelio', 'Alessandro Sermoneta, Vincenzo Cerami, Gianni Amelio', 'Andrea Prodan, Mario Adorf, Ennio Fantastichini, Laura Morante, Virna Lisi, Alberto Gimignani, Michele Melega, Stefano Antoci', null, 'The enthusiasms, fears, joys and disappointments of the (private and professional) life of a well-known group of boys fond of physics and mathematics, who just made history as the Via Panisperna boys.', 'The enthusiasms, fears, joys and disappointments of the (private and professional) life of a well-known group of boys fond of physics and mathematics, who just made history as the Via Panisperna boys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5eeU75vijLfPramTMGLnsvLK9Fr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101470'),
  ('400666742050353020', 'Vibes', 1988, 'Romance, Action, Comedy', 'Ken Kwapis, Alan B. Curtiss, John Bailey', 'Lowell Ganz, Babaloo Mandel', 'Jeff Goldblum, Cyndi Lauper, Peter Falk, Googy Gress, Julian Sands, Darryl Henriques, Ramon Bieri, Michael Lerner', 'PG', 'Medium Sylvia Pickel and psychometrist Nick Deezy meet at a psychic research facility in New York. Not long after, they''re contacted by Harry Buscafusco, who offers them $50,000 to find his lost son in South America, in the heart of Incan territory where they discover an ancient mystical secret, and each other.', 'Medium Sylvia Pickel and psychometrist Nick Deezy meet at a psychic research facility in New York. Not long after, they''re contacted by Harry Buscafusco, who offers them $50,000 to find his lost son in South America, in the heart of Incan territory where they discover an ancient mystical secret, and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAT8QJquco2dGBEwqQJBLfP7wtM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21185'),
  ('135028486231399109', 'Vibration', 1975, null, 'Jane Arden, Jack Bond', null, 'Jane Arden, Cherif Abderahman Jah, Sebastian Saville, Penny Slinger, Jack Bond', null, 'Uses two young western people as the mediators between the new gestalt initiated by Jung, Reich and Frederick Perles, and the magnetic chain of a Sufic master, finding that the East and the West, the scientific and the mystical, begin to hold together in a truly organic way.', 'Uses two young western people as the mediators between the new gestalt initiated by Jung, Reich and Frederick Perles, and the magnetic chain of a Sufic master, finding that the East and the West, the scientific and the mystical, begin to hold together in a truly organic way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vRLZzqfiKchH15bYjXJ2JpDbES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141493'),
