  ('774970585779381920', 'Vibrator', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ryuichi Hiroki, Kazuhiro Suzuki', 'Haruhiko Arai', 'Shinobu Terajima, Nao Omori, Tomorowo Taguchi, Riho Makise, Miki Sakajou, Eriko Takayanagi, Masahiro Toda, Eugene Nomura', null, 'Rei is a freelance writer embattled by personal demons. She hears voices in her head, and has sleeping problems, eating disorders and drinks excessively. On Valentine''s Day, she meets truck driver Takatoshi. She joins him on a journey in his bumpy and shaky truck - which vibrates in tune with her uneasy soul.', 'Rei is a freelance writer embattled by personal demons. She hears voices in her head, and has sleeping problems, eating disorders and drinks excessively. On Valentine''s Day, she meets truck driver Takatoshi. She joins him on a journey in his bumpy and shaky truck - which vibrates in tune with her uneasy soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOclGLBQG80xorgZQByoIikpc5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81792'),
