  ('1129514534595029056', 'Vice', 2008, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Raul Sanchez Inglis, Richard Martin, Andrzej Sekula', 'Raul Sanchez Inglis', 'Michael Madsen, Daryl Hannah, Mykelti Williamson, Mark Boone Junior, John Cassini, Nicholas Lea, Martin Cummins, Aaron Pearl', 'R', 'Max Walker, a down-and-out cop, becomes the target of a bloodthirsty drug cartel after he leads a narcotics bust to intercept a large shipment of heroin. When someone starts picking off his team members - and the drugs seized in the raid suddenly disappear - Walker pairs up with one of his detectives to uncover a conspiracy that may go straight up the chain of command.', 'Max Walker, a down-and-out cop, becomes the target of a bloodthirsty drug cartel after he leads a narcotics bust to intercept a large shipment of heroin. When someone starts picking off his team members - and the drugs seized in the raid suddenly disappear - Walker pairs up with one of his detectives to uncover a conspiracy that may go straight up the chain of command.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gS0oeZhZhW8SIDkh0MV94Zc2GX0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14252'),
  ('762363077882770763', 'Vice', 2015, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Brian A. Miller, Yaron Levy', 'Andre Fabrizio, Jeremy Passmore', 'Ambyr Childers, Thomas Jane, Bryan Greenberg, Bruce Willis, Johnathon Schaech, Charlotte Kirk, Brett Granstaff, Ryan O''Nan', 'R', 'Julian Michaels has designed the ultimate resort: VICE, where anything goes and the customers can play out their wildest fantasies with artificial inhabitants who look, think and feel like humans. When an artificial becomes self-aware and escapes, she finds herself caught in the crossfire between Julian''s mercenaries and a cop who is hell-bent on shutting down Vice, and stopping the violence once and for all.', 'Julian Michaels has designed the ultimate resort: VICE, where anything goes and the customers can play out their wildest fantasies with artificial inhabitants who look, think and feel like humans. When an artificial becomes self-aware and escapes, she finds herself caught in the crossfire between Julian''s mercenaries and a cop who is hell-bent on shutting down Vice, and stopping the violence once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBwZIq1QFasmsC9Wi3HvyEljfYN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:307663'),
  ('49586422220895307', 'Vice', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Joann Connolly, Matt Rebenkoff, Gary McMonnies', 'Adam McKay', 'Christian Bale, Amy Adams, Steve Carell, Sam Rockwell, Alison Pill, Eddie Marsan, Justin Kirk, LisaGay Hamilton', 'R', 'George W. Bush picks Dick Cheney, the CEO of Halliburton Co., to be his Republican running mate in the 2000 presidential election. No stranger to politics, Cheney''s impressive résumé includes stints as White House chief of staff, House Minority Whip and Defense Secretary. When Bush wins by a narrow margin, Cheney begins to use his newfound power to help reshape the country and the world.', 'George W. Bush picks Dick Cheney, the CEO of Halliburton Co., to be his Republican running mate in the 2000 presidential election. No stranger to politics, Cheney''s impressive résumé includes stints as White House chief of staff, House Minority Whip and Defense Secretary. When Bush wins by a narrow margin, Cheney begins to use his newfound power to help reshape the country and the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gCab6rNv1r6V64cwsU4oEr649Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429197'),
  ('889142704017894695', 'Vice Academy', 1989, 'Action, Comedy', 'Rick Sloane, Stephen Ashley Blake', 'Rick Sloane', 'Linnea Quigley, Ginger Lynn, Karen Russell, Jayne Hamil, Ken Abraham, Stephen Steward, Jean Carol, Tamara Clatterbuck', 'R', 'A band of female police cadets train to join the Hollywood vice squad. The toothsome rookies are assigned to infiltrate a kiddy porn operation, then must go undercover and join a prostitution ring run by Queen Bee.', 'A band of female police cadets train to join the Hollywood vice squad. The toothsome rookies are assigned to infiltrate a kiddy porn operation, then must go undercover and join a prostitution ring run by Queen Bee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DuCF5lMjRGsxgNQfOldRJ4TKnL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28495'),
