  ('1140300724576761104', 'Vice Academy Part 3', 1991, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Rick Sloane, Robert Hayes', 'Rick Sloane', 'Ginger Lynn, Elizabeth Kaitan, Julia Parton, John Henry Richardson, Jordana Capra, Steve Mateo, Dee Hengstler, Kari French', 'R', 'Female inmates escape from prison and go on a series of robberies, and it''s up to the incompetent vice squad rookies to stop them.', 'Female inmates escape from prison and go on a series of robberies, and it''s up to the incompetent vice squad rookies to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDIv3gxEOsoE2R0CFUylWDtrOsc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127936'),
  ('309648551505927134', 'Vice Academy Part 4', 1995, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Rick Sloane, Honey Lauren, T.L. Lankford', 'Rick Sloane', 'Elizabeth Kaitan, Julia Parton, Jayne Hamil, John Henry Richardson, Rebecca Rocheford Davies, Steve Mateo, Chad Gabbert, Melanie Noble', 'R', 'A policewoman and her partner must stop a green-haired prison escapee intent on ruining the commissioner''s wedding.', 'A policewoman and her partner must stop a green-haired prison escapee intent on ruining the commissioner''s wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOIRGAFZigenJJc2j2WwcKYBh47.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251449'),
  ('29476019203500990', 'Vice Academy Part 5', 1996, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Rick Sloane, Stephen Crawford', 'Rick Sloane', 'Elizabeth Kaitan, Raelyn Saalman, Jayne Hamil, John Henry Richardson, J.J. North, Chad Gabbert, Michael Kayem, Tane McClure', null, 'What starts as a dirty computer game, becomes a hilarious series of crimes, when the commissioner''s son, Irwin, accidentally unleashes a Virtual Reality Hooker from his computer. Vice Academy''s officers Candy and Traci have to stop the spreading of sexually transmitted computer viruses. Meanwhile, poor Ms Devonshire will do anything to save her marriage. Even if it means comically appearing on a sleazy talk show and airing out the Commissioner''s dirty laundry!', 'What starts as a dirty computer game, becomes a hilarious series of crimes, when the commissioner''s son, Irwin, accidentally unleashes a Virtual Reality Hooker from his computer. Vice Academy''s officers Candy and Traci have to stop the spreading of sexually transmitted computer viruses. Meanwhile, poor Ms Devonshire will do anything to save her marriage. Even if it means comically appearing on a sleazy talk show and airing out the Commissioner''s dirty laundry!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrrUkWvryEsQ2t8greXEm5Jxd2S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251453'),
  ('1148860322054089030', 'Vice Academy Part 6', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Rick Sloane, Stephen Crawford, Blain Brown', 'Rick Sloane', 'Elizabeth Kaitan, Raelyn Saalman, John Henry Richardson, Jayne Hamil, Karen Knotts, Brad Blumenthal, Chad Gabbert, Honey Lauren', 'R', 'Vice cops Candy and Traci accidentally meet the bikini robbers who are armed with assault weapons in a bank. The thieves escape with loot after a wild shoot-out. The commissioner and the instructor enlist Internal Affairs detective to solve the case. He suspects the Vice cops and sends them to prison. However, a robber plants a bomb in the police station. Vice cops are quickly reinstated with a new mission.', 'Vice cops Candy and Traci accidentally meet the bikini robbers who are armed with assault weapons in a bank. The thieves escape with loot after a wild shoot-out. The commissioner and the instructor enlist Internal Affairs detective to solve the case. He suspects the Vice cops and sends them to prison. However, a robber plants a bomb in the police station. Vice cops are quickly reinstated with a new mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1FUByFfATVJ7T9HtvEGnr0hWqw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314591'),
  ('264971340478712830', 'Vice and Virtue', 1963, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Roger Vadim, Jean Gitton, Marcel Grignon', 'Roger Vadim, Roger Vailland', 'Annie Girardot, Catherine Deneuve, Robert Hossein, O.E. Hasse, Philippe Lemaire, Luciana Paluzzi, Valeria Ciangottini, Paul Gégauff', null, '1944 : Occupied France. Juliette (Vice) is Wehrmacht General Bamberg''s mistress and enjoys a privileged life. Her younger sister Justine (Virtue) is about to marry Jean who is in the Resistance and come to Juliette for help. Both sisters end up at "la Commanderie", where Juliette becomes SS Colonel Schonberg''s mistress and Justine is detained with other pretty girls who must satisfy the sexual needs of high-ranking nazi officials. Inspired by "Justine ou les infortunes de la vertu" by the marquis de Sade', '1944 : Occupied France. Juliette (Vice) is Wehrmacht General Bamberg''s mistress and enjoys a privileged life. Her younger sister Justine (Virtue) is about to marry Jean who is in the Resistance and come to Juliette for help. Both sisters end up at "la Commanderie", where Juliette becomes SS Colonel Schonberg''s mistress and Justine is detained with other pretty girls who must satisfy the sexual needs of high-ranking nazi officials. Inspired by "Justine ou les infortunes de la vertu" by the marquis de Sade', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trTexHaRtfZQB4OvYqRsD3rzSY2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277296'),
