  ('691102519476599540', 'Vicky and Her Mystery', 2021, 'Adventure, Family, Drama', 'Tarik Rebeihi, Denis Imbert', 'Denis Imbert, Stéphane Vasseur, Rémi Sappe', 'Vincent Elbaz, Shanna Keil, Marie Gillain, Éric Elmosnino, Tchéky Karyo, Éric Savin, Romain Lancry, Vincent Deniard', null, 'Stéphane decides to move to the beautiful mountains of Cantal in order to reconnect with his 8-year-old daughter, Victoria, who has been silent since her mother''s disappearance. During a walk in the forest, a shepherd gives Victoria a puppy named "Mystery" who will gradually give her a taste for life. But very quickly, Stéphane discovers that the animal is in reality a wolf… Despite the warnings and the danger of this situation, he cannot bring himself to separate his daughter from this seemingly harmless ball of hair.', 'Stéphane decides to move to the beautiful mountains of Cantal in order to reconnect with his 8-year-old daughter, Victoria, who has been silent since her mother''s disappearance. During a walk in the forest, a shepherd gives Victoria a puppy named "Mystery" who will gradually give her a taste for life. But very quickly, Stéphane discovers that the animal is in reality a wolf… Despite the warnings and the danger of this situation, he cannot bring himself to separate his daughter from this seemingly harmless ball of hair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXZ4yhyss7DGrp7a1EVHaAStfwr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:754067'),
