  ('497269461613661322', 'Victor Young Perez', 2013, 'Drama, History', 'Pierre-Yves Bastard, Jacques Ouaniche, Rumyan Dimitrov', 'Yoni Darmon, Jacques Ouaniche', 'Brahim Asloum, Steve Suissa, Isabella Orsini, Patrick Bouchitey, Davy Sardou, Bruce Payne, Pierre-Henri Toubas, Romain Canonne', null, 'Victor Perez was a Jewish boxer who became world flyweight champion in 1931 and 1932, but was transported to Auschwitz concentration camp when Paris fell to the Nazi s in 1943. While there he was forced into slave labour and made to participate in violent boxing matches for the amusement of the Nazi guards. Surviving Auschwitz tells Victors astonishing, harrowing, brutal and incredibly moving true story.', 'Victor Perez was a Jewish boxer who became world flyweight champion in 1931 and 1932, but was transported to Auschwitz concentration camp when Paris fell to the Nazi s in 1943. While there he was forced into slave labour and made to participate in violent boxing matches for the amusement of the Nazi guards. Surviving Auschwitz tells Victors astonishing, harrowing, brutal and incredibly moving true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cieSt4qkgfTJD8SAoMRzYmExr0E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260646'),
  ('644222644814825151', 'Victor/Victoria', 1982, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Dick Bush, Blake Edwards', 'Reinhold Schünzel', 'Julie Andrews, James Garner, Robert Preston, Lesley Ann Warren, Alex Karras, John Rhys-Davies, Graham Stark, Peter Arne', 'PG', 'A struggling female soprano finds work playing a male female impersonator, but it complicates her personal life.', 'A struggling female soprano finds work playing a male female impersonator, but it complicates her personal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCjXcPRM3Rc7gOCGeVrBdPvF2bk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12614'),
