  ('339387508823292510', 'Video Games: The Movie', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Jeremy Snead, Jeremy Snead', 'Jeremy Snead', 'Sean Astin, Al Alcorn, Peter Armstrong, Cliff Bleszinski, Zach Braff, Jim Brown, Nolan Bushnell, Louis Castle', 'PG', 'From executive producer Zach Braff and director Jeremy Snead, "Video Games: The Movie" is an epic feature length documentary chronicling the meteoric rise of video games from nerd niche to multi-billion dollar industry. Narrated by Sean Astin and featuring in-depth interviews with the godfathers who started it all, the icons of game design, and the geek gurus who are leading us into the future, "Video Games: The Movie" is a celebration of gaming from Atari to Xbox and an eye-opening look at what lies ahead.', 'From executive producer Zach Braff and director Jeremy Snead, "Video Games: The Movie" is an epic feature length documentary chronicling the meteoric rise of video games from nerd niche to multi-billion dollar industry. Narrated by Sean Astin and featuring in-depth interviews with the godfathers who started it all, the icons of game design, and the geek gurus who are leading us into the future, "Video Games: The Movie" is a celebration of gaming from Atari to Xbox and an eye-opening look at what lies ahead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5lIK1sM5UeCE2IozXdgv1oOSlA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269100'),
  ('480435990427850104', 'Video Violence', 1987, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Gary P. Cohen', 'Paul Kaye', 'Gary Schwartz, Chick Kaplan, Robin Leeds, Paige Price, Kevin Haver, Art Neill, Bill Biach, Uke', null, 'A couple open a video store in a new town, and come to find out that the locals only rent horror films and the "occasional triple X''er", and make their own snuff videos.', 'A couple open a video store in a new town, and come to find out that the locals only rent horror films and the "occasional triple X''er", and make their own snuff videos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8328suB1HFXTnkapArF38vlwCQt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28851'),
  ('1045336023520562094', 'Video Violence Part 2', 1988, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Gary P. Cohen', 'Gary P. Cohen', 'David Christopher, Mavis Harris, Neil Cerbone, Gary P. Cohen, Uke, Bart Sumner, Elizabeth Lee Miller, Gordon Ovsiew', null, 'The killers are back and now hosting their own TV show broadcast secretly from their basement. They examine the fine art of murder, letting other aspiring psychos send in videos of their handiwork for the world to enjoy.', 'The killers are back and now hosting their own TV show broadcast secretly from their basement. They examine the fine art of murder, letting other aspiring psychos send in videos of their handiwork for the world to enjoy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BcQ8rWUn3fFBwDk3IyvVsADKzS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64768'),
  ('379928683601742668', 'Videocracy', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Erik Gandini', 'Erik Gandini', 'Silvio Berlusconi, Flavio Briatore, Fabrizio Corona, Lele Mora, Simona Ventura, Marella Giovannelli, Rick Canelli', 'NR', 'In a country where bella figura is a national pastime, Prime Minister Silvio Berlusconi is the maestro of media manipulation. Having risen to political primacy with the aid of his Mediaset empire, he now controls 90% of the bel paese’s television channels including the state-run RAI network. Quantity, it seems, does not equal quality. Fed on a diet of semi-naked dancing girls, inane competitions and rickety reality shows built around the most ridiculous of premises, is it any wonder that Italians are becoming a nation of fame-hungry wannabes?', 'In a country where bella figura is a national pastime, Prime Minister Silvio Berlusconi is the maestro of media manipulation. Having risen to political primacy with the aid of his Mediaset empire, he now controls 90% of the bel paese’s television channels including the state-run RAI network. Quantity, it seems, does not equal quality. Fed on a diet of semi-naked dancing girls, inane competitions and rickety reality shows built around the most ridiculous of premises, is it any wonder that Italians are becoming a nation of fame-hungry wannabes?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5osEufK4eDePSuFIhHr0ez5Bv3n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23451'),
  ('609210255886825743', 'Videodrome', 1983, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'David Cronenberg, Mark Irwin, John Board', 'David Cronenberg', 'James Woods, Debbie Harry, Sonja Smits, Peter Dvorsky, Leslie Carlson, Jack Creley, Lynne Gorman, Julie Khaner', 'R', 'As the president of a trashy TV channel, Max Renn is desperate for new programming to attract viewers. When he happens upon "Videodrome," a TV show dedicated to gratuitous torture and punishment, Max sees a potential hit and broadcasts the show on his channel. However, after his girlfriend auditions for the show and never returns, Max investigates the truth behind Videodrome and discovers that the graphic violence may not be as fake as he thought.', 'As the president of a trashy TV channel, Max Renn is desperate for new programming to attract viewers. When he happens upon "Videodrome," a TV show dedicated to gratuitous torture and punishment, Max sees a potential hit and broadcasts the show on his channel. However, after his girlfriend auditions for the show and never returns, Max investigates the truth behind Videodrome and discovers that the graphic violence may not be as fake as he thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqqkiZSU9EBGZ1KiDmfn07S7qvv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:837'),
  ('356898261049909444', 'Videograms of a Revolution', 1992, 'Documentary', 'Harun Farocki, Andrei Ujică, Velvet Moraru', 'Andrei Ujică, Harun Farocki', 'Ion Caramitru, Elena Ceaușescu, Nicolae Ceaușescu, Mircea Dinescu, Thomas Schultz, Alexa Visarion, Mircea Diaconu', null, 'A minute-by-minute chronology of the Romanian revolution in December 1989 in Bucharest. This cinematic montage of live footage from the state television company TVR and video taken by numerous amateurs becomes a new media-based form of historiography.', 'A minute-by-minute chronology of the Romanian revolution in December 1989 in Bucharest. This cinematic montage of live footage from the state television company TVR and video taken by numerous amateurs becomes a new media-based form of historiography.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0thKXkmhiZDSpRW8gyciAdMi9f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185476'),
  ('525728645790140270', 'Videophobia', 2020, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Daisuke Miyazaki, Yasutaka Watanabe', 'Daisuke Miyazaki, Naoto Akiyama', 'Tomona Hirota, Sumire Ashina, Shugo Oshinari, Sahel Rosa, Aki Morita, Masahiro Umeda, Daisuke Miyazaki', null, 'A young woman discovers that a sex tape made without her knowledge is circulating online. Paranoia takes over, along with a sense of injustice. Her sudden terror of video triggers a downward spiral where she loses all social bearings.', 'A young woman discovers that a sex tape made without her knowledge is circulating online. Paranoia takes over, along with a sense of injustice. Her sudden terror of video triggers a downward spiral where she loses all social bearings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tQTGI99JWkQeCntAV84yJq2RF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637961'),
  ('454004764452350968', 'Vidheyan', 1994, 'Drama', 'Adoor Gopalakrishnan, Mankada Ravi Varma', 'Adoor Gopalakrishnan', 'M R Gopakumar, Mammootty, Sabitha Anand, Tanvi Azmi, Babu Namboothiri, K. P. A. C. Azeez, K.V. Thampi, Krishnankutty Nair', null, 'Thommy is the loyal servant of Bhaskara Pattelar, a ruthless tyrant. He struggles between obedience and morality.', 'Thommy is the loyal servant of Bhaskara Pattelar, a ruthless tyrant. He struggles between obedience and morality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/joWXgPgCi6y172IxcYaowO6zAIo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256212'),
  ('807472136707602127', 'Vidocq', 2001, 'Fantasy, Action, Thriller, Crime, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Jean-Pierre Sauvaire, Pitof, Jean-Claude Thibaut', 'Pitof, Jean-Christophe Grangé', 'Gérard Depardieu, Guillaume Canet, Inés Sastre, André Dussollier, Édith Scob, Moussa Maaskri, Jean-Pierre Gos, Isabelle Renauld', 'R', 'Paris, 1830. In the heart of the town, Vidocq, a famous detective, disappears as he fights the Alchemist, an assassin that he has been pursuing for a few months. His young biographer, Etienne Boisset, decides to avenge Vidocq''s death and takes the investigation on...', 'Paris, 1830. In the heart of the town, Vidocq, a famous detective, disappears as he fights the Alchemist, an assassin that he has been pursuing for a few months. His young biographer, Etienne Boisset, decides to avenge Vidocq''s death and takes the investigation on...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xeoj8AOHjW1muVQRUPCvnOVxSfj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9597'),
  ('428516426629613022', 'Viduthalai: Part I', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'R. Velraj, Still Robert, Manimaran', 'Mathimaran Pugazhendhi, R. S. Durai Senthilkumar', 'Soori, Bhavani Sre, Chetan, Gautham Vasudev Menon, Rajiv Menon, Ilavarasu, Munnar Ramesh, Tamizh', null, 'Kumaresan, a police constable, gets recruited for an operation implanted to capture Perumal Vaathiyar, who leads a separatist group dedicated to fighting against the authorities for committing atrocities against innocent village women in the name of police interrogations.', 'Kumaresan, a police constable, gets recruited for an operation implanted to capture Perumal Vaathiyar, who leads a separatist group dedicated to fighting against the authorities for committing atrocities against innocent village women in the name of police interrogations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTxPji8PY3PL0SK9e4mkt2laJKg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:786345'),
  ('460615147212584302', 'Vielmachglas', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Florian Ross, Jonas David', 'Finn Christoph Stroeks', 'Jella Haase, Matthias Schweighöfer, Marc Benjamin, Uwe Ochsenknecht, Juliane Köhler, Emma Nova, Gerdy Zint, Jasmin Gassmann', null, 'Marleen is in her early 20s, works in a movie theater, still lives at home and is somehow aimless. Her parents torment her with questions about her future and her brother is a high-flyer who has already traveled halfway around the world. When a tragic accident plunges her into sheer endless grief, Marleen just wants to get away. Equipped with the bare essentials, she sets off on a journey into the unknown.', 'Marleen is in her early 20s, works in a movie theater, still lives at home and is somehow aimless. Her parents torment her with questions about her future and her brother is a high-flyer who has already traveled halfway around the world. When a tragic accident plunges her into sheer endless grief, Marleen just wants to get away. Equipped with the bare essentials, she sets off on a journey into the unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcRnKAseE1cmeov7pzjtVAumj2y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492024'),
  ('51208760087973920', 'Viena and the Fantomes', 2020, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Jennifer Truelove, Gerardo Naranjo', 'Gerardo Naranjo', 'Dakota Fanning, Jeremy Allen White, Caleb Landry Jones, Frank Dillane, Zoë Kravitz, Evan Rachel Wood, Ryan LeBoeuf, Jon Bernthal', null, 'In the 80s, a roadie named Viena travels with the Fantomes, a post punk band on tour through the American west. When the band has the possibility of sudden success, Viena finds herself involved in a love triangle that will test all of her convictions.', 'In the 80s, a roadie named Viena travels with the Fantomes, a post punk band on tour through the American west. When the band has the possibility of sudden success, Viena finds herself involved in a love triangle that will test all of her convictions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1c4GhelRi8VF6M51CIgkMPKH90O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340971'),
  ('46488542315062080', 'Vieni a vivere a Napoli!', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Edoardo De Angelis, Francesco Prisco, Daria D''Antonio', 'Giorgio Caruso, Marco Gianfreda, Edoardo De Angelis', 'Miriam Candurro, Antonio Casagrande, Giovanni Esposito, Massimiliano Gallo, Gianfelice Imparato, Yuliya Mayarchuk, Valentina Lapushova, Franco Javarone', null, 'Three different stories pay homage to the city of Naples, seen as a capital of hospitality and multiethnic integration. In the first, a Sri Lankan waiter on his first day at work is tasked with delivering coffee to a well-known radio station, but encounters many unexpected challenges. In the second, a former Ukrainian TV presenter, wife of an imprisoned politician, is forced to come to Italy and adapt to the role of carer to a grumpy old man. In the third, a Neapolitan nanny, caring for a young Chinese boy, asks her brother to look after the child while she is away on a prize trip.', 'Three different stories pay homage to the city of Naples, seen as a capital of hospitality and multiethnic integration. In the first, a Sri Lankan waiter on his first day at work is tasked with delivering coffee to a well-known radio station, but encounters many unexpected challenges. In the second, a former Ukrainian TV presenter, wife of an imprisoned politician, is forced to come to Italy and adapt to the role of carer to a grumpy old man. In the third, a Neapolitan nanny, caring for a young Chinese boy, asks her brother to look after the child while she is away on a prize trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfjCsbCOaC82slbtnyymzma9IEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448920'),
  ('747511088243986228', 'Vieni avanti cretino', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Luciano Salce, Erico Menczer, Roberto Palmerini', 'Lino Banfi', 'Lino Banfi, Franco Bracardi, Gigi Reder, Adriana Russo, Anita Bartolucci, Ramona Dell''Abate, Annabella Schiavone, Dada Gallotti', null, 'Pasquale Baudaffi, on amnesty, comes out of prison and starts looking for a job with the help of his cousin Gaetano. But first he goes to what was once a brothel, but, unbeknownst to our hapless hero, has been taken over and rented as a dental office. Pasquale finds himself at the center of endless misunderstandings. He tries to be a gamekeeper but that''s not okay, he tries to be a waiter in a bar: he immediately gets his orders wrong and he is fired. His performance as a garage keeper was negative. The very latest experience is in an electronics company but its insertion into the futuristic mechanism triggers the craziest complications. The encounter with a lost dog allows him to get to know his mistress and thus discover the woman of his life.', 'Pasquale Baudaffi, on amnesty, comes out of prison and starts looking for a job with the help of his cousin Gaetano. But first he goes to what was once a brothel, but, unbeknownst to our hapless hero, has been taken over and rented as a dental office. Pasquale finds himself at the center of endless misunderstandings. He tries to be a gamekeeper but that''s not okay, he tries to be a waiter in a bar: he immediately gets his orders wrong and he is fired. His performance as a garage keeper was negative. The very latest experience is in an electronics company but its insertion into the futuristic mechanism triggers the craziest complications. The encounter with a lost dog allows him to get to know his mistress and thus discover the woman of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h29az0oBHbYlf1MpHVPnjrEB2S7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37501'),
  ('4604116908705064', 'Vier', 2022, 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Marie Kreutzer, Leena Koppe', 'Marie Kreutzer', 'Julia Franz Richter, Regina Fritsch, Laurence Rupp, Manuel Rubey, Oliver Rosskopf, Susanne Michel, Rainer Wöss, Rainer Doppler', null, 'Flooding in Krumau am Kamp: three infant bodies, two girls and a boy, are found in the basement of the Trummler family''s farm, which has long been uninhabited. The children were suffocated immediately after birth and buried on the spot. A dark reputation precedes the Trummlers – the word "cursed" is used more than once, after the daughter''s disappearance without a trace...', 'Flooding in Krumau am Kamp: three infant bodies, two girls and a boy, are found in the basement of the Trummler family''s farm, which has long been uninhabited. The children were suffocated immediately after birth and buried on the spot. A dark reputation precedes the Trummlers – the word "cursed" is used more than once, after the daughter''s disappearance without a trace...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7COUQP7HWcQgnrFdg99JNAsZ7D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:939849'),
  ('12143410464049261', 'Vietnam Colony', 1992, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Siddique, Lal, Venu', 'Siddique, Lal', 'Mohanlal, Innocent, Kanaka, Devan, KPAC Lalitha, Nedumudi Venu, Bheeman Raghu, Vijaya Rangaraju', null, 'Krishnamurthy is appointed by a real estate company to vacate Vietnam Colony, a place buzzing with illegal and antisocial elements.', 'Krishnamurthy is appointed by a real estate company to vacate Vietnam Colony, a place buzzing with illegal and antisocial elements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/go9hS8HP6TIi2mySsmfjLNALhDZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240213'),
  ('273001008753265536', 'View from the Top', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Bruno Barreto, Affonso Beato, Chitra F. Mojtabai', 'Eric Wald', 'Gwyneth Paltrow, Christina Applegate, Mark Ruffalo, Candice Bergen, Joshua Malina, Mike Myers, Kelly Preston, Stacey Dash', 'PG-13', 'No one thought Donna would go very far. But when she sets her sights on becoming a first-class international flight attendant, Donna throws caution to the wind and takes off in pursuit of her dream. The ride is anything but smooth, however, and Donna''s laugh-packed journey of a lifetime is rocked by more turbulence than she bargained for.', 'No one thought Donna would go very far. But when she sets her sights on becoming a first-class international flight attendant, Donna throws caution to the wind and takes off in pursuit of her dream. The ride is anything but smooth, however, and Donna''s laugh-packed journey of a lifetime is rocked by more turbulence than she bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjKloEexvZcJBbkoX9XKx83B40z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11523'),
  ('742197917809985214', 'Vigil', 1984, 'Drama', 'Vincent Ward, Alun Bollinger', 'Fiona Lindsay, Vincent Ward, Graeme Tetley', 'Penelope Stewart, Frank Whitten, Bill Kerr, Fiona Kay, Gordon Shields', 'PG', 'Toss lives on a sheep farm with her father in New Zealand. When Toss''s father dies in an accident, Ethan, an itinerant hunter, wanders onto the family farm and is given a job by her grandfather. Toss''s fairly innocent relationship with Ethan is severed when he forms a relationship with her mother.', 'Toss lives on a sheep farm with her father in New Zealand. When Toss''s father dies in an accident, Ethan, an itinerant hunter, wanders onto the family farm and is given a job by her grandfather. Toss''s fairly innocent relationship with Ethan is severed when he forms a relationship with her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSXfpAZDBecleCuz1xfwNRDp5sh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27811'),
  ('504251980656381045', 'Vigil in the Night', 1940, 'Drama', 'George Stevens, Robert De Grasse, Sydney M. Fogel', 'Fred Guiol, Rowland Leigh, P.J. Wolfson', 'Carole Lombard, Brian Aherne, Anne Shirley, Julien Mitchell, Robert Coote, Brenda Forbes, Peter Cushing, Rita Page', 'NR', 'A good nurse ruins her career by covering up for her sister''s careless mistake.', 'A good nurse ruins her career by covering up for her sister''s careless mistake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfSkEdrRc6uEXxWPafudNhAdzpc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200862'),
  ('681317395599814994', 'Vigilante', 1983, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'William Lustig, James Lemmo', 'Richard Vetere', 'Robert Forster, Fred Williamson, Richard Bright, Rutanya Alda, Don Blakely, Joseph Carberry, Willie Colón, Joe Spinell', 'R', 'New York City factory worker Eddie Marino is a solid citizen and regular guy, until the day a sadistic street gang brutally assaults his wife and murders his child. When a corrupt judge sets the thugs free, he goes berserk and vows revenge.', 'New York City factory worker Eddie Marino is a solid citizen and regular guy, until the day a sadistic street gang brutally assaults his wife and murders his child. When a corrupt judge sets the thugs free, he goes berserk and vows revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zq1VG3UtUb5nRwumWmZQuWz8ik5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23587'),
  ('11951095865570226', 'Vigilante Diaries', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Christian Sesma, Lysandra Petersson, Allan Aguilar', 'Christian Sesma, Paul Sloan', 'Paul Sloan, Jessica Uberuaga, Michael Jai White, Quinton ''Rampage'' Jackson, Michael Madsen, Jason Mewes, Danny Trejo, Kevin L. Walker', 'R', 'The Vigilante Diaries is a high octane action-adventure film featuring 90''s movie heroes, explosive action, and international espionage. The film revolves around a team of black-ops agents turned crime-fighters, led by a brooding anti-hero, known only as "The Vigilante." These jam-packed missions of rescue and revenge take us from the mega-mansions and underbelly of Los Angeles to far away places like Iraq, Armenia, Russia, and The United Kingdom to introduce us to a cast of colorful, dangerous, and hilarious characters. From Beverly Hills filmmaker Mike Hanover, to a trio of Asian femme fatales, to ruthless Armenian mobsters, and at the top, a pair of deep cover super spies hell bent on throwing the world into chaos.', 'The Vigilante Diaries is a high octane action-adventure film featuring 90''s movie heroes, explosive action, and international espionage. The film revolves around a team of black-ops agents turned crime-fighters, led by a brooding anti-hero, known only as "The Vigilante." These jam-packed missions of rescue and revenge take us from the mega-mansions and underbelly of Los Angeles to far away places like Iraq, Armenia, Russia, and The United Kingdom to introduce us to a cast of colorful, dangerous, and hilarious characters. From Beverly Hills filmmaker Mike Hanover, to a trio of Asian femme fatales, to ruthless Armenian mobsters, and at the top, a pair of deep cover super spies hell bent on throwing the world into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3Cvy8zoa1GIvin213cAvPaXlHw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403232'),
  ('1111633964495641943', 'Vigilante Force', 1976, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Donald Heitzer, Arne Schmidt, George Armitage', 'George Armitage', 'Kris Kristofferson, Jan-Michael Vincent, Victoria Principal, Bernadette Peters, Brad Dexter, Judson Pratt, David Doyle, Antony Carbone', 'PG', 'In a small town in California, the quiet citizens find their lives disrupted by boisterous, lawless oil-field workers who have infested their community. One resident, Ben Arnold, enlists his brother Aaron, a Vietnam veteran, to assemble a group of men to restore law and order to the town. Though Aaron''s crew succeeds, the newfound power goes to some of their heads, and Aaron and Ben must again reclaim the town for the citizens.', 'In a small town in California, the quiet citizens find their lives disrupted by boisterous, lawless oil-field workers who have infested their community. One resident, Ben Arnold, enlists his brother Aaron, a Vietnam veteran, to assemble a group of men to restore law and order to the town. Though Aaron''s crew succeeds, the newfound power goes to some of their heads, and Aaron and Ben must again reclaim the town for the citizens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boeL3TQ1UWm58ze3vUzZTBUv3nc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93018'),
  ('449430720944425965', 'Vihta', 2018, 'Comedy', 'François Bierry, Fiona Braillon, Julie Carrière', 'François Bierry', 'Wim Willaert, Jean-Benoît Ugeux, Olivier Bonjour, Sophia Leboutte, Jérémie Petrus, Dinara Drukarova, Sylvia Dierckx, Morgane Choupay', null, 'Serge and his four colleagues work in a small company that has just been brought out by a large corporation. As a welcoming gift, they are invited by their new employer to spend a day of relaxation at a spa.', 'Serge and his four colleagues work in a small company that has just been brought out by a large corporation. As a welcoming gift, they are invited by their new employer to spend a day of relaxation at a spa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62N3RXBZ7Fb94aYtmGHBy6fCNfe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504278'),
  ('310210637800578121', 'Viimeinen savotta', 1977, 'Drama', 'Olavi Tuomi, Edvin Laine, Olavi Tuomi', 'Edvin Laine, Kalle Päätalo, Juha Nevalainen', 'Matti Pellonpää, Jyrki Kovaleff, Olavi Ahonen, Leni Katajakoski, Jussi Jurkka, Kauko Helovirta, Martti Kuningas, Helge Herala', null, 'Follows the life of a pauper child Vike Nilonpoika from the early 1900''s to the 1960s. During this time he works as a lumberjack in Lapland after running away from the despotic master. He soon becomes familiar with hookers, card hustlers and alcohol.', 'Follows the life of a pauper child Vike Nilonpoika from the early 1900''s to the 1960s. During this time he works as a lumberjack in Lapland after running away from the despotic master. He soon becomes familiar with hookers, card hustlers and alcohol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sWkD1gRRYztBtV6iMBsZAmrgFs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:572331'),
  ('178218394101675325', 'Vijay 69', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Akshay Roy, Sahil Bhardwaj, Shanoo Sharma', 'Akshay Roy', 'Anupam Kher, Chunky Panday, Mihir Ahuja, Guddi Maruti, Vrajesh Hirjee, Kunal Vijaykar, Sulagna Panigrahi, Ravish Desai', 'PG-13', 'An adventurous, foul-mouthed former swimming coach reaches for record-breaking glory when he attempts a triathlon at 69 years old.', 'An adventurous, foul-mouthed former swimming coach reaches for record-breaking glory when he attempts a triathlon at 69 years old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSQzRaYyKEjM8gEyhqayU4rhbdU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1252457'),
  ('473719448794707592', 'Vijay and I', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Alain Duplantier, Sam Garbarski, Patrick Blocman', 'Sam Garbarski, Matthew Robbins, Philippe Blasband', 'Moritz Bleibtreu, Patricia Arquette, Danny Pudi, Michael Imperioli, Jeannie Berlin, Moni Moshonov, Hanna Schygulla, Michael Gwisdek', null, 'Wilhelm Wilder (Will) is a talented actor stuck on a New York City children''s TV show where he portrays Bad Luck Bunny, a hapless green rabbit. Feeling a failure, he bears his fate with touching self-irony, but grows sulky and petulant when he thinks that his wife, daughter and all his friends have forgotten his 40th birthday. In the confusion following a road accident, all the world believes he is dead. Instead of rectifying the situation, he decides to fulfill a fantasy and attend his own funeral. Here he will learn what everyone really thinks of him. With the aid of his best friend Rad, an Indian restaurant-owner, Will becomes Vijay Singh, a handsome and gentlemanly Sikh, complete with turban and beard. Will confronts a unique problem: everyone likes Vijay, and most of all, he likes Vijay, more than he ever liked himself.', 'Wilhelm Wilder (Will) is a talented actor stuck on a New York City children''s TV show where he portrays Bad Luck Bunny, a hapless green rabbit. Feeling a failure, he bears his fate with touching self-irony, but grows sulky and petulant when he thinks that his wife, daughter and all his friends have forgotten his 40th birthday. In the confusion following a road accident, all the world believes he is dead. Instead of rectifying the situation, he decides to fulfill a fantasy and attend his own funeral. Here he will learn what everyone really thinks of him. With the aid of his best friend Rad, an Indian restaurant-owner, Will becomes Vijay Singh, a handsome and gentlemanly Sikh, complete with turban and beard. Will confronts a unique problem: everyone likes Vijay, and most of all, he likes Vijay, more than he ever liked himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hilv6GqaGk5Es2OHeCdCfnvmj5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207257'),
  ('194058511499997079', 'Vijaynagar''er Hirey', 2026, 'Action, Adventure, Mystery, Thriller', 'Chandrasish Ray, Indranath Marick', 'Sunil Gangopadhyay, Rohit Dey, Soumya Nandy', 'Aryann Bhowmick, Pushan Dasgupta, Satyam Bhattacharya, Sreya Bhattacharya, Anujoy Chattopadhyay', null, 'Kakababu hunts for legendary treasure while solving ancient mysteries and facing dangerous foes. His quest is filled with peril as he pursues secrets that could bring triumph or disaster.', 'Kakababu hunts for legendary treasure while solving ancient mysteries and facing dangerous foes. His quest is filled with peril as he pursues secrets that could bring triumph or disaster.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FgasVnEUAFByENiAMUOdiI5CyH4Z.jpg', 'plex:movie:vijaynagarer-hirey-2026'),
  ('809843640076266085', 'Vikalpa', 2026, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Pruthviraj Patil', 'Pruthviraj Patil', 'Master Ayush, Pooja Butch, Swaroop Butch, Nagashree Hebbar, Gode Narayana Hegde', null, 'A corporate leader loses his grip as hallucinations and trauma resurface. Truth and illusion blur in Vikalpa''s psychological mystery.', 'A corporate leader loses his grip as hallucinations and trauma resurface. Truth and illusion blur in Vikalpa''s psychological mystery.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BNTQ5ZGUxZjAtN2JhMy00ODUyLTliMmMtYWUzOTI5ODUzOGU3XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:vikalpa-2026'),
  ('554269991069860424', 'Viking', 2016, 'History, Action, Drama', 'Andrey Kravchuk, Maxim Zhukov, Pavel Yaroshenko', 'Andrey Rubanov, Andrey Kravchuk', 'Svetlana Khodchenkova, Aleksandra Bortich, Danila Kozlovsky, Paweł Deląg, Aleksandr Armer, Anton Adasinsky, Rostislav Bershauer, John DeSantis', null, 'The early Middle Ages. A time of heavy swords and dark blood law. The ruling clan is in discord. The guilt for the accidental death of the brother has fallen on the Grand Duke. According to the law, revenge must be taken by the younger brother, a bastard. For the refusal to kill, he has to pay with eve- rything he had, because “for peace you need more swords than for a war”...', 'The early Middle Ages. A time of heavy swords and dark blood law. The ruling clan is in discord. The guilt for the accidental death of the brother has fallen on the Grand Duke. According to the law, revenge must be taken by the younger brother, a bastard. For the refusal to kill, he has to pay with eve- rything he had, because “for peace you need more swords than for a war”...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxl0YHkYHHCetgnG2fgezUaQiHc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369698'),
  ('240437127444954104', 'Viking', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Stéphane Lafleur, Sara Mishara', 'Eric K. Boulianne, Stéphane Lafleur', 'Steve Laplante, Larissa Corriveau, Fabiola N. Aladin, Hamza Haq, Denis Houle, Marie Brassard, Martin David Peters, Marie-Laurence Moreau', null, 'Five people are recruited by the Viking Society to collaborate on the first manned mission to Mars. They were chosen because of the psychological similarities they share with the five astronauts who will travel to the red planet. These volunteers therefore form a B-team of alter egos who will experience the adventure in parallel, behind closed doors on Earth.', 'Five people are recruited by the Viking Society to collaborate on the first manned mission to Mars. They were chosen because of the psychological similarities they share with the five astronauts who will travel to the red planet. These volunteers therefore form a B-team of alter egos who will experience the adventure in parallel, behind closed doors on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkbG9xXZwwXAG8Bb8WXJweOlF1M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:911345'),
  ('580978755692307961', 'Viking Wolf', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Laurie Mahon, Bjørn Erik Søberg Myran, Joachim Jørgensen', 'Stig Svendsen, Espen Aukan', 'Elli Rhiannon Müller Osborne, Liv Mjönes, Vidar Magnussen, Mia Fosshaug Laubacher, Arthur Hakalahti, Sjur Vatne Brean, Øyvind Brandtzæg, Ståle Bjørnhaug', 'R', 'After witnessing a grotesque murder at a party in her new town, a teenager starts having strange visions and bizarre desires.', 'After witnessing a grotesque murder at a party in her new town, a teenager starts having strange visions and bizarre desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sJgljCEHQxuHbCJK6p15zM9vVM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788752'),
