  ('486947120184299425', 'Vikingdom', 2013, 'Adventure', 'Yusry Abdul Halim, Eric Oh', 'James Coyne', 'Dominic Purcell, Natassia Malthe, Craig Fairbrass, Conan Stevens, Jesse Moss, Jonathan Patrick Foo, Judd Wild, Byron Gibson', 'NR', 'A warrior fleeing the violence of his past must take up the sword and risk everything to face a god of incalculable power.', 'A warrior fleeing the violence of his past must take up the sword and risk everything to face a god of incalculable power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mllJZUdy0LVD7MabX1bHlDDIqI6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100542'),
  ('543593799048548549', 'Vikings: Battle of Heirs', 2023, 'Action', 'Robin Keane', 'Tom Jolliffe', 'Amber Doig-Thorne, Iris Papas, Gaston Alexander, Christabel Clark, Nazeku, Andrew Wheeler, Jamie Littlewood', 'PG', 'A young Viking must come to terms with the realization that he may be the King''s son, who was switched at birth, but not before others try to take his rightful place.', 'A young Viking must come to terms with the realization that he may be the King''s son, who was switched at birth, but not before others try to take his rightful place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/87goLbbqrJqAxqDS5cBsik1zKT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1049948'),
  ('198864063835518451', 'Vikram', 1986, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Rajashekar, V. Ranga', 'Kamal Haasan, Sujatha Rangarajan', 'Kamal Haasan, Sathyaraj, Amjad Khan, Dimple Kapadia, Lissy, Ambika, Charu Haasan, Janagaraj', null, 'Vikram, a cop who is mourning the death of his wife, is assigned to retrieve a missile. He is aided by a highly educated engineer Preethi, who holds the knowledge to disarm the weapon, in his mission.', 'Vikram, a cop who is mourning the death of his wife, is assigned to retrieve a missile. He is aided by a highly educated engineer Preethi, who holds the knowledge to disarm the weapon, in his mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMgY2Cbu6KZBNOh3QSm5yY2hkgA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66373'),
  ('551048438049417332', 'Vikram', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Girish Gangadharan, Anbumani, Arivumani', 'Lokesh Kanagaraj, Rathna Kumar', 'Kamal Haasan, Fahadh Faasil, Vijay Sethupathi, Narain, Chemban Vinod Jose, Santhana Bharathi, Elango Kumaravel, Vasanthi Guru', 'PG-13', 'Amar is assigned to investigate a case of serial killings. When Amar investigates the case, he realizes it is not what it seems to be and following down this path will lead to nothing but war between everyone involved.', 'Amar is assigned to investigate a case of serial killings. When Amar investigates the case, he realizes it is not what it seems to be and following down this path will lead to nothing but war between everyone involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/774UV1aCURb4s4JfEFg3IEMu5Zj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743563'),
  ('174133436405757411', 'Vikram Vedha', 2017, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Adventure', 'Pushkar, P. S. Vinod, Gayathri', 'Pushkar, Gayathri', 'R. Madhavan, Vijay Sethupathi, Shraddha Srinath, Kathir, Varalaxmi Sarathkumar, Prem, Hareesh Peradi, Achyuth Kumar', null, 'A notorious gangster Vedha surrenders himself to encounter specialist Vikram whom he challenges every step of the way by narrating his life events in the form of riddles that needs to be solved in order to capture him.', 'A notorious gangster Vedha surrenders himself to encounter specialist Vikram whom he challenges every step of the way by narrating his life events in the form of riddles that needs to be solved in order to capture him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ob9YxdzRu5lfKgz0PNrlL45dorf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432139'),
  ('180503792873122438', 'Vikram Vedha', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Gayathri, Pushkar, P. S. Vinod', 'Pushkar, Gayathri', 'Saif Ali Khan, Hrithik Roshan, Radhika Apte, Rohit Saraf, Yogita Bihani, Sharib Hashmi, Satyadeep Misra, Sudhanva Deshpande', null, 'Vikram, an honest officer with the Lucknow police, is on a mission to find and eliminate gangster Vedha. However, when Vedha surrenders himself to the police and starts narrating stories to Vikram, it blurs the lines between good and evil. Vedha questions Vikram''s righteousness while the latter believes he is fair and just. But is he?', 'Vikram, an honest officer with the Lucknow police, is on a mission to find and eliminate gangster Vedha. However, when Vedha surrenders himself to the police and starts narrating stories to Vikram, it blurs the lines between good and evil. Vedha questions Vikram''s righteousness while the latter believes he is fair and just. But is he?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkTxPGsWI9QC8ahnShQmMOIXbIg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:851783'),
  ('131762265552633691', 'Vikramarkudu', 2006, 'Action, Drama', 'S. S. Rajamouli, Sarvesh Murari', 'Kannan DS', 'Ravi Teja, Baby Neha, Anushka Shetty, Ajay, Vineet Kumar, Brahmanandam, Rajiv Kanakala, Ruthika', null, 'A thief''s life changes after he discovers a little girl who claims he is her father, and what follows is violence after a gang hunting for his lookalike closes in on him.', 'A thief''s life changes after he discovers a little girl who claims he is her father, and what follows is violence after a gang hunting for his lookalike closes in on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0yLhLXvlPS5uwyacBVNnR4KoOZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40909'),
  ('222358680910476670', 'Vikrant Rona', 2022, 'Thriller, Action, Mystery', 'Anup Bhandari, William David', 'Anup Bhandari', 'Sudeepa, Nirup Bhandari, Jacqueline Fernandez, Neetha Ashok, Ravishanker Gowda, Madhusudhan Rao, Vasuki Vaibhav, Siddu Moolimani', null, 'Almost half a century ago, a remote village in the middle of a tropical rain forest starts witnessing a series of unexplainable events which they attribute to the supernatural. Vikrant Rona, An eccentric police officer, is assigned to solve the mystery. A mysterious game unfolds where everyone in the village is a potential victim and everyone is a suspect.', 'Almost half a century ago, a remote village in the middle of a tropical rain forest starts witnessing a series of unexplainable events which they attribute to the supernatural. Vikrant Rona, An eccentric police officer, is assigned to solve the mystery. A mysterious game unfolds where everyone in the village is a potential victim and everyone is a suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jq1yH1pT8VMZONLMTgOFUDgitNh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680334'),
  ('711614426793011285', 'Vile', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Stewart Yost, Taylor Sheridan', 'Eric Jay Beck, Rob Kowsaluk', 'Eric Jay Beck, April Matson, Akeem Smith, Greg Cipes, Elisha Skorman, Heidi Mueller, Maya Hazen, Rob Kirkland', 'R', 'A group of people awaken to find themselves prisoners in a mysterious house with no means of escape. They are each outfitted with electronic devices attached to the base of their skulls. The chemicals that the brain produces when in pain are collected by the devices, and when it collects a predetermined amount, the doors will be opened. In order to escape, they must hurt themselves and each other.', 'A group of people awaken to find themselves prisoners in a mysterious house with no means of escape. They are each outfitted with electronic devices attached to the base of their skulls. The chemicals that the brain produces when in pain are collected by the devices, and when it collects a predetermined amount, the doors will be opened. In order to escape, they must hurt themselves and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHxVSKv4plCpllQpBt4tOftKJ12.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132064'),
  ('255774141881659178', 'Villa Amalia', 2009, 'Drama', 'Benoît Jacquot, Caroline Champetier', 'Benoît Jacquot', 'Isabelle Huppert, Jean-Hugues Anglade, Xavier Beauvois, Clara Bindi, Viviana Aliberti, Michelle Marquais, Maya Sansa, Peter Arens', null, 'Ann leaves Thomas and everything else behind when she catches him kissing another woman. With her music and help from Georges, she begins a journey to find herself.', 'Ann leaves Thomas and everything else behind when she catches him kissing another woman. With her music and help from Georges, she begins a journey to find herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWXsL5c5ge6eYyw4LYbr5MQN9b2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44527'),
  ('556729279263574389', 'Villa Caprice', 2021, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Thomas Hardmeier, Bernard Stora, Jérôme Brière', 'Bernard Stora, Pascale Robert-Diard', 'Niels Arestrup, Patrick Bruel, Irène Jacob, Paul Hamy, Michel Bouquet, Laurent Stocker, Claude Perron, Alaa Safi', null, 'Famous lawyer, Luc Germon adds Gilles Fontaine, one of the most powerful bosses in France, to his clients. He is suspected of having acquired a magnificent property, Villa Caprice, under questionable conditions.', 'Famous lawyer, Luc Germon adds Gilles Fontaine, one of the most powerful bosses in France, to his clients. He is suspected of having acquired a magnificent property, Villa Caprice, under questionable conditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ka3xS8EVSEYtESJnROIxHKgwa2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:745589'),
  ('177056343767222757', 'Villa Maids', 2021, 'Drama', 'Pae Kon', null, 'Joo Ah, Rika, Kim Ji-ah, Sae Bom, Seung Ha, Lim Ji-yeong, Kang Min-woo, Min Do-yoon', null, 'The second generation of a chaebol was exiled to a rural villa because of a mistake. However, it only brought fun and excitement to another world that unfolds there.', 'The second generation of a chaebol was exiled to a rural villa because of a mistake. However, it only brought fun and excitement to another world that unfolds there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spHKXWKJg6nTo13lP0O8Gp2v2gl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:853376'),
  ('644240491041914372', 'Villa Rides', 1968, 'Western', 'José María Tapiador, Anthony Squire, Gil Carretero', 'Robert Towne, Sam Peckinpah', 'Yul Brynner, Robert Mitchum, Maria Grazia Buccella, Charles Bronson, Herbert Lom, Robert Viharo, Frank Wolff, Alexander Knox', null, 'Pulled into the Mexican Revolution by his own greed, Texas gunrunner and pilot Lee Arnold joins bandit-turned-patriot Pancho Villa and his band of dedicated men in a march across Mexico battling the Colorados and stealing women''s hearts as they go. But each has a nemesis among his friends: Arnold is tormented by Fierro, Villa''s right-hand-man; and Villa must face possible betrayal by his own president''s naiveté', 'Pulled into the Mexican Revolution by his own greed, Texas gunrunner and pilot Lee Arnold joins bandit-turned-patriot Pancho Villa and his band of dedicated men in a march across Mexico battling the Colorados and stealing women''s hearts as they go. But each has a nemesis among his friends: Arnold is tormented by Fierro, Villa''s right-hand-man; and Villa must face possible betrayal by his own president''s naiveté', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8I8sOWEC2I1l3rdOQGvAHvPc6O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48564'),
  ('436263546963249087', 'Villa-Lobos: A Life of Passion', 2000, 'Drama, History', 'Zelito Viana, Walter Carvalho', 'Joaquim Assis', 'Antônio Fagundes, Marcos Palmeira, Leticia Spiller, Ana Beatriz Nogueira, Marieta Severo, José Wilker, André Ricardo, Othon Bastos', null, 'The film tells the story of an intuitive, adventurous man who loved his country and being Brazilian. This man fought to be loyal to himself. His music is a transparent portrait of his genius, intuition, freedom, adventure and passion for Brazil.', 'The film tells the story of an intuitive, adventurous man who loved his country and being Brazilian. This man fought to be loyal to himself. His music is a transparent portrait of his genius, intuition, freedom, adventure and passion for Brazil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKl6FvyUAWnQl3hA9X8O9INGTsy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250224'),
  ('289491045259259787', 'Village by the River', 1958, 'Drama', 'Fons Rademakers, Eduard van der Enden', 'Fons Rademakers, Hugo Claus', 'Max Croiset, Mary Dresselhuys, Bernard Droog, Jan Retèl, Jan Teulings, Jan Lemaire Sr., Hans Kaart, Dick Swidde', null, 'An independent-thinking doctor in a rural community with his own ideas of how medicine should be practiced begins to find himself ostracized from the community after one of his patients commits suicide.', 'An independent-thinking doctor in a rural community with his own ideas of how medicine should be practiced begins to find himself ostracized from the community after one of his patients commits suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teJwZG1Y1N6uLIC3mmGZPCs9MmS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85752'),
  ('986102923425017702', 'Village of Doom', 1983, 'Horror, Crime, Drama', 'Noboru Tanaka, Keiji Maruyama', 'Takuya Nishioka', 'Masato Furuoya, Misako Tanaka, Shino Ikenami, Izumi Hara, Renji Ishibashi, Hatsuo Yamaya, Yasuhiro Arai, Isao Natsuyagi', null, 'An emotionally distraught young man goes on a violent killing spree after his tuberculosis keeps him from serving in World War II and is frowned upon by his fellow villagers.', 'An emotionally distraught young man goes on a violent killing spree after his tuberculosis keeps him from serving in World War II and is frowned upon by his fellow villagers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sDD1vx2Ks3FBzxKibcfHHAbg7i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:303146'),
  ('293211615434394596', 'Village of Dreams', 1996, 'Family, Drama', 'Yōichi Higashi, Yoshio Shimizu', 'Takehiro Nakajima, Yōichi Higashi', 'Mieko Harada, Keigo Matsuyama, Shogo Matsuyama, Kyōzō Nagatsuka, Kaneko Iwasaki, Hōsei Komatsu, Tokuko Sugiyama, Koichi Ueda', null, 'Tells of the childhood of two nine-year-old twins in a rural village in Japan after World War 2. Includes the boys relationships with their schoolteacher mother, civil servant father, elderly landlord, a rough new boy at the school, and three mysterious spirits in the form of old women.', 'Tells of the childhood of two nine-year-old twins in a rural village in Japan after World War 2. Includes the boys relationships with their schoolteacher mother, civil servant father, elderly landlord, a rough new boy at the school, and three mysterious spirits in the form of old women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7nPVS5uwwswo17XepACQ4eiEkZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36304'),
  ('291775634218841295', 'Village of the Damned', 1960, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Geoffrey Faithfull, Wolf Rilla, Michael Stevenson', 'Wolf Rilla, Stirling Silliphant, Ronald Kinnoch', 'George Sanders, Barbara Shelley, Martin Stephens, Michael Gwynn, Laurence Naismith, Richard Warner, Jenny Laird, Sarah Long', 'NR', 'In a small English village everyone suddenly falls unconscious. When they awake every woman of child bearing age is pregnant. The resulting children have the same strange blond hair, eyes and a strong connection to each other.', 'In a small English village everyone suddenly falls unconscious. When they awake every woman of child bearing age is pregnant. The resulting children have the same strange blond hair, eyes and a strong connection to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcpXud1UjQzlSe9A062w8Wqgira.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11773'),
  ('857806826364453692', 'Village of the Damned', 1995, 'Thriller, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Gary B. Kibbe, John Carpenter, Artist W. Robinson', 'David Himmelstein', 'Christopher Reeve, Kirstie Alley, Linda Kozlowski, Michael Paré, Meredith Salenger, Mark Hamill, Pippa Pearthree, Peter Jason', 'R', 'An American village is visited by some unknown life form which leaves the women of the village pregnant. Nine months later, the babies are born, and they all look normal, but it doesn''t take the "parents" long to realize that the kids are not human or humane.', 'An American village is visited by some unknown life form which leaves the women of the village pregnant. Nine months later, the babies are born, and they all look normal, but it doesn''t take the "parents" long to realize that the kids are not human or humane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXXNmSVqkvSMoMitsdjK0V8Dkna.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12122'),
  ('784186561599762899', 'Village of the Dead', 2025, 'Adventure, Horror, Mystery', 'Rizal Mantovani, Enggar Budiono', 'Riheam Junianti', 'Amanda Manopo, Ersya Aurelia, Fahad Haydra, Randy Martin, Anya Zen, Bambang Gundul, Yessi Kenyang, Rafly', null, 'Four hikers become trapped in a mysterious village after getting lost in a mountain foot market said to be an interdimensional gateway. There, the world turns strange—graveyards with no headstones, grinning bald figures, puppets with no puppeteer, and cult rituals dancing atop corpses. It all leads to one chilling truth: those who are trapped can never leave. The village is preparing a dark ritual to fill the hamlet with the dead. Faced with harrowing choices, can they survive—and make it home alive?', 'Four hikers become trapped in a mysterious village after getting lost in a mountain foot market said to be an interdimensional gateway. There, the world turns strange—graveyards with no headstones, grinning bald figures, puppets with no puppeteer, and cult rituals dancing atop corpses. It all leads to one chilling truth: those who are trapped can never leave. The village is preparing a dark ritual to fill the hamlet with the dead. Faced with harrowing choices, can they survive—and make it home alive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRdt7gbicDBKmbRY3XN2r5yWoQ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1505183'),
  ('539917920355227427', 'Village of the Giants', 1965, 'Science Fiction', 'Bert I. Gordon, Paul Vogel', 'Alan Caillou', 'Tommy Kirk, Johnny Crawford, Beau Bridges, Joy Harmon, Robert Random, Gail Gilmore, Tisha Sterling, Tim Rooney', null, '"Genius" accidentally invents "goo" which causes living things to rapidly grow to an enormous size. Seeing an opportunity to get rich, some delinquent teenagers steal the "goo" and, as a result of a sophomoric dare, consume it themselves and become thirty feet tall. They then take over control of the town by kidnapping the sheriff''s daughter and dancing suggestively.', '"Genius" accidentally invents "goo" which causes living things to rapidly grow to an enormous size. Seeing an opportunity to get rich, some delinquent teenagers steal the "goo" and, as a result of a sophomoric dare, consume it themselves and become thirty feet tall. They then take over control of the town by kidnapping the sheriff''s daughter and dancing suggestively.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7K3s6cl7tfws2dCq3j5vHDxBksJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42780'),
  ('1027439485388647630', 'Village Of The Vampire', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Stefano Pollastro, Roberto D''Antona, Daniele Ciceri', 'Roberto D''Antona', 'Annamaria Lorusso, Roberto D''Antona, Francesco Emulo, Alex D''Antona, Natalia Moro, Erica Verzotti, Susanna Tregnaghi, Mirko D''Antona', null, 'Rebecca is on the trail of her sister, a young journalist who disappeared while investigating a series of unfortunate events. Her research leads her to Timere, a remote place far from the noise of everyday life, a place where there is the rigor of silence and the fear of something dark. Here Rebecca will meet an extravagant writer and the caretaker of the town church, but above all she will meet Caleb, a charming, rich and elegant man whose dark gaze hides a chilling secret. And it is precisely in this place, where time seems to move between the shadows and the threat is always alert, that Rebecca will soon learn of a terrifying truth and the struggle between good and evil will begin.', 'Rebecca is on the trail of her sister, a young journalist who disappeared while investigating a series of unfortunate events. Her research leads her to Timere, a remote place far from the noise of everyday life, a place where there is the rigor of silence and the fear of something dark. Here Rebecca will meet an extravagant writer and the caretaker of the town church, but above all she will meet Caleb, a charming, rich and elegant man whose dark gaze hides a chilling secret. And it is precisely in this place, where time seems to move between the shadows and the threat is always alert, that Rebecca will soon learn of a terrifying truth and the struggle between good and evil will begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzdLYNQQxWSqWglSUTcR45FGGFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728450'),
  ('302224977076411200', 'Village of Tigers', 1974, 'Action, Drama', 'Wong Ping, Griffin Yueh Feng, Kuang Han-Lu', 'Yip Yat-Fong', 'Elliot Ngok Wah, Shu Pei-Pei, Karen Yeh, Tung Lin, Wang Hsieh, Tang Ti, Chan Shen, Ng Wai', null, 'The Village of Tigers is known as the home of all evil doers throughout the land, ruled by their leader, Lord Hu Jiao. When the famed swordsman known as the Sword of the Southern Sky, Luo Hong-Xun ends up in said village, he will teach the bandits a lesson.', 'The Village of Tigers is known as the home of all evil doers throughout the land, ruled by their leader, Lord Hu Jiao. When the famed swordsman known as the Sword of the Southern Sky, Luo Hong-Xun ends up in said village, he will teach the bandits a lesson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtBQ2Uofc85PGprPfkl4KgW4sCI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187473'),
  ('955060934682307529', 'Villain', 1971, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Tuchner, Christopher Challis, Kip Gowans', 'Ian La Frenais, Dick Clement', 'Richard Burton, Ian McShane, Nigel Davenport, Donald Sinden, Fiona Lewis, T. P. McKenna, Joss Ackland, Cathleen Nesbitt', 'R', 'In 1970s London, Scotland Yard orchestrates the downfall of mob boss Vic Dakin after he crosses the line by blackmailing Members of Parliament.', 'In 1970s London, Scotland Yard orchestrates the downfall of mob boss Vic Dakin after he crosses the line by blackmailing Members of Parliament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45iFu2qhIDrRHfwEPRUsZUaqJlz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30341'),
  ('960616735796063904', 'Villain', 2010, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sang-il Lee, Norimichi Kasamatsu, Shinji Kuma', 'Sang-il Lee, Shuichi Yoshida', 'Eri Fukatsu, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Masaki Okada, Hikari Mitsushima, Sansei Shiomi, Mansaku Ikeuchi, Ken Mitsuishi, Kimiko Yo', null, 'Shimizu Yuichi is a shy and lonely day laborer looking for love. He aimlessly spends time corresponding with girls via telephone dating services and going on random encounters with girls looking for spending cash. His world is shattered one day when he is involved in the murder of one of his former encounters, the sweet-faced Ishibashi Yoshino who, after being jilted by playboy Masuo Keijo, berates and mocks the troubled loner.', 'Shimizu Yuichi is a shy and lonely day laborer looking for love. He aimlessly spends time corresponding with girls via telephone dating services and going on random encounters with girls looking for spending cash. His world is shattered one day when he is involved in the murder of one of his former encounters, the sweet-faced Ishibashi Yoshino who, after being jilted by playboy Masuo Keijo, berates and mocks the troubled loner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tCpSellyteA45C7ijwZI1AZan0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61888'),
  ('679502495002241539', 'Villain', 2020, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Philip Barantini, Matthew Lewis, Jamie Hetherington', 'George Russo, Greg Hall', 'Craig Fairbrass, Robert Glenister, Nicholas Aaron, Izuka Hoyle, Jade Asha, Tomi May, Mark Monero, Lee Nicholas Harris', null, 'After 10 years, Eddie Franks is out of prison and trying to stay on the straight and narrow, but his drug-mule brother, Sean has other ideas. Rival gangster brothers demand Sean repay his debt to them, causing Eddie to get tangled in the crossfire, and he ends up using his life savings to calling in favours with mobster friends to try and help.', 'After 10 years, Eddie Franks is out of prison and trying to stay on the straight and narrow, but his drug-mule brother, Sean has other ideas. Rival gangster brothers demand Sean repay his debt to them, causing Eddie to get tangled in the crossfire, and he ends up using his life savings to calling in favours with mobster friends to try and help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kc5AdZ0DJqrnAye8xGbXgtABh4E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660549'),
  ('134042973419864151', 'Villain & Widow', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Son Jae-gon, Lee Byeong-hoon, Choi Sang-ho', 'Son Jae-gon', 'Kim Hye-soo, Han Suk-kyu, Ji Woo, Kim Ki-cheon, Lee Yong-nyeo, Dong Ho, Lee Jang-woo, Uhm Ki-joon', null, 'Struggling to support herself and teenage daughter, a widow rents out the second floor of her home to a man who claims to be a novelist working on a new book.', 'Struggling to support herself and teenage daughter, a widow rents out the second floor of her home to a man who claims to be a novelist working on a new book.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ayhEHdCNd747iNJwUhJ4gSvDpeX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55641'),
  ('518164102543107408', 'Villains', 2019, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Robert Olsen, Dan Berk, Matt Mitchell', 'Dan Berk, Robert Olsen', 'Bill Skarsgård, Maika Monroe, Kyra Sedgwick, Jeffrey Donovan, Blake Baumgartner, Noah Robbins, Nikolas Kontomanolis, Danny Johnson', 'R', 'When their car breaks down, a couple on the run headed southbound for a fresh start in the Sunshine State break into a nearby house looking for a new set of wheels. What they find instead is a dark secret, and a sweet-as-pie pair of homeowners who will do anything to keep it from getting out.', 'When their car breaks down, a couple on the run headed southbound for a fresh start in the Sunshine State break into a nearby house looking for a new set of wheels. What they find instead is a dark secret, and a sweet-as-pie pair of homeowners who will do anything to keep it from getting out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Arefq9eI1z94Jtrbbuqzg9p5mf8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510388'),
  ('726539098754790684', 'Ville-Marie', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Guy Édoin, Serge Desrosiers', 'Guy Édoin, Jean-Simon DesRochers', 'Monica Bellucci, Pascale Bussières, Aliocha Schneider, Patrick Hivon, Louis Champagne, Stéphanie Labbé, Frédéric Gilles, Larissa Corriveau', null, 'Celebrated European actor Sophie Bernard is in Montreal shooting a movie, and she''s taking the opportunity to visit her gay son Thomas in the hope of bridging the rift that''s grown between them. But Thomas has his own agenda for their time together; he intends to finally get some answers as to the identity of his father. Meanwhile, at Ville-Marie Hospital, paramedic Pierre struggles with PTSD, and though he has support in Marie, a nurse who keeps the overflowing emergency room running, it''s uncertain whether he''ll remain able to cope with the high intensity of his work. Each of these four characters is dealing with emotional damage — and on one dark Montreal night, their lives will all intersect in a fateful occurrence at Ville-Marie.', 'Celebrated European actor Sophie Bernard is in Montreal shooting a movie, and she''s taking the opportunity to visit her gay son Thomas in the hope of bridging the rift that''s grown between them. But Thomas has his own agenda for their time together; he intends to finally get some answers as to the identity of his father. Meanwhile, at Ville-Marie Hospital, paramedic Pierre struggles with PTSD, and though he has support in Marie, a nurse who keeps the overflowing emergency room running, it''s uncertain whether he''ll remain able to cope with the high intensity of his work. Each of these four characters is dealing with emotional damage — and on one dark Montreal night, their lives will all intersect in a fateful occurrence at Ville-Marie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0saRPwVtw4FQmh9FmyaXsF7h11.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353463'),
  ('971237393565013416', 'Villon''s Wife', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kichitaro Negishi, Takahide Shibanushi, Masaya Takahashi', 'Yōzō Tanaka', 'Tadanobu Asano, Takako Matsu, Shigeru Muroi, Masatô Ibu, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Shinichi Tsutsumi, Hirosue Ryoko, Ken Mitsuishi', null, 'This enticing period melodrama depicts a long-suffering woman''s relationship with her brilliant but self-destructive writer husband in postwar Tokyo. Based on a semi-autobiographical 1947 novel by Osamu Dazai, the story centers less on the womanizing, heavy-drinking, suicidal hero than on the wife who loves him. Written by Palm Springs International Film Festival', 'This enticing period melodrama depicts a long-suffering woman''s relationship with her brilliant but self-destructive writer husband in postwar Tokyo. Based on a semi-autobiographical 1947 novel by Osamu Dazai, the story centers less on the womanizing, heavy-drinking, suicidal hero than on the wife who loves him. Written by Palm Springs International Film Festival', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opVBtRldjHa108eJwmKHMKAHClZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72136'),
  ('616751332266911699', 'Villu', 2009, 'Drama, Action, Comedy', 'Prabhu Deva, Ravi Varman', 'A. C. Mugil', 'Vijay, Nayanthara, Vadivelu, Prakash Raj, Ranjitha, Manoj K Jayan, Devaraj, Adithya Menon', null, 'A son decides to avenge his father, an army officer, who was falsely framed and killed by three corrupt officers. Fatefully, he also ends up falling in love with the daughter of one of the killers.', 'A son decides to avenge his father, an army officer, who was falsely framed and killed by three corrupt officers. Fatefully, he also ends up falling in love with the daughter of one of the killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rya0ivrIeTy6EzgJpoFrbNxyZam.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24383'),
  ('326294444127435586', 'Vincent', 2014, 'Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Thomas Salvador, Alexis Kavyrchine, Mathilde Cukierman', 'Thomas Salvador', 'Thomas Salvador, Vimala Pons, Youssef Hajdi, Nicolas Jaillet, Nina Meurisse, Rémy Ventura, Philippe Xiberras, Claude Maurice', null, 'Vincent has an extraordinary ability: his strength and reflexes increase tenfold when in contact with water. To make full use of this gift, he settles in a region with many lakes and rivers, which is isolated enough to allow him to live a peaceful life. Then, one day, during an aquatic escapade, he encounters Lucie.', 'Vincent has an extraordinary ability: his strength and reflexes increase tenfold when in contact with water. To make full use of this gift, he settles in a region with many lakes and rivers, which is isolated enough to allow him to live a peaceful life. Then, one day, during an aquatic escapade, he encounters Lucie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43yGjp14maMeeHzPP6JSVJ5bCaa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294458'),
  ('337729593424817910', 'Vincent', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Christophe Van Rompaey, David Williamson', 'Jean-Claude Van Rijckeghem', 'Spencer Bogaert, Alexandra Lamy, Barbara Sarafian, Geert Van Rampelberg, Emma Reynaert, Kimke Desart, Catherine Aymerie, Ilona Bachelier', null, 'Vincent is a 17-year old ecologist who drives his family crazy with his attempts to reduce their carbon footprint. Vincent‘s giddy French aunt Nikki takes him on a trip to France, convinced that the boy‘s obsession is related to his suffocating mother. But on their road-trip, Vincent proves to be much more than Nikki can handle.', 'Vincent is a 17-year old ecologist who drives his family crazy with his attempts to reduce their carbon footprint. Vincent‘s giddy French aunt Nikki takes him on a trip to France, convinced that the boy‘s obsession is related to his suffocating mother. But on their road-trip, Vincent proves to be much more than Nikki can handle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLEK4fWYYkiBQs4Afaasy0fjToN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406511'),
  ('475044251835810793', 'Vincent & Theo', 1990, 'Drama', 'Robert Altman, Jean Lépine', 'Julian Mitchell', 'Tim Roth, Paul Rhys, Adrian Brine, Jean-François Perrier, Yves Dangerfield, Hans Kesting, Peter Tuinman, Marie-Louise Stheins', null, 'The tragic story of Vincent van Gogh broadened by focusing as well on his brother Theodore, who helped support Vincent. Based on the letters written between the two.', 'The tragic story of Vincent van Gogh broadened by focusing as well on his brother Theodore, who helped support Vincent. Based on the letters written between the two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKsYwJoncAf42hqzCVbp1LBwUxv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55309'),
