  ('1110710542287578428', 'Vincent Must Die', 2023, 'Drama, Fantasy, Thriller, Horror', 'Stéphan Castang, Sophie Lixon, Manuel Dacosse', 'Mathieu Naert, Stéphan Castang', 'Karim Leklou, Vimala Pons, François Chattot, Jean-Rémi Chaize, Karoline Rose Sun, Ulysse Genevrey, Emmanuel Vérité, Benoît Lambert', null, 'Vincent finds himself under attack for no apparent reason overnight. When the phenomenon intensifies, he must run and change his way of life completely.', 'Vincent finds himself under attack for no apparent reason overnight. When the phenomenon intensifies, he must run and change his way of life completely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztghAnb7nuhZ6q11cx1F9gBAJ6m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:965890'),
  ('355677241403356957', 'Vincent N Roxxy', 2016, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Gary Michael Schultz, Alex Disenhof', 'Gary Michael Schultz', 'Emile Hirsch, Zoë Kravitz, Emory Cohen, Zoey Deutch, Kid Cudi, Beau Knapp, Jason Mitchell, Jeff Gum', 'R', 'A small town loner and a rebellious punk rocker unexpectedly fall in love as they are forced on the run and soon discover violence follows them everywhere.', 'A small town loner and a rebellious punk rocker unexpectedly fall in love as they are forced on the run and soon discover violence follows them everywhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pK5pEto2thTo8fRcSQIJc63IbSK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300672'),
  ('965421098107764462', 'Vincent Wants to Sea', 2010, 'Drama', 'Ralf Huettner, Andreas Berger', 'Florian David Fitz', 'Florian David Fitz, Karoline Herfurth, Johannes Allmayer, Katharina Müller-Elmau, Heino Ferch, Karin Thaler, Tim Seyfi, Christoph Zrenner', null, 'Vincent, a young man who suffers from Tourette''s syndrome, has just lost his mother. His father, a successful politician, does not want to take care of him and therefore places him into a mental institution. He is put into a room with Alexander, a guy with a compulsive disorder, and is shown around by Marie, an anorectic girl.', 'Vincent, a young man who suffers from Tourette''s syndrome, has just lost his mother. His father, a successful politician, does not want to take care of him and therefore places him into a mental institution. He is put into a room with Alexander, a guy with a compulsive disorder, and is shown around by Marie, an anorectic girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGJUOYiOLrhk4p9SmQNT6qIX155.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47979'),
  ('423850044319448403', 'Vincent, Francois, Paul and the Others', 1974, 'Drama', 'Jean Boffety, Ralph Baum, Claude Sautet', 'Claude Sautet, Jean-Loup Dabadie', 'Yves Montand, Michel Piccoli, Serge Reggiani, Gérard Depardieu, Umberto Orsini, Stéphane Audran, Antonella Lualdi, Marie Dubois', null, 'Three friends navigate mid-life crises: a blocked writer, a disillusioned doctor, and a charming man facing bankruptcy and divorce. As their struggles strain friendships, a younger man captures the attention of one friend''s wife, complicating their lives further.', 'Three friends navigate mid-life crises: a blocked writer, a disillusioned doctor, and a charming man facing bankruptcy and divorce. As their struggles strain friendships, a younger man captures the attention of one friend''s wife, complicating their lives further.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrffQNHaEKdD7ZTFlQqhxjxeFlx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42454'),
  ('916112210923500517', 'Vincere', 2009, 'Drama, History', 'Marco Bellocchio, Daniele Ciprì, Francesca Polic Greco', 'Marco Bellocchio, Daniela Ceselli', 'Giovanna Mezzogiorno, Filippo Timi, Fausto Russo Alesi, Michela Cescon, Pier Giorgio Bellocchio, Corrado Invernizzi, Paolo Pierobon, Bruno Cariello', null, 'The story of the descent into madness of Mussolini''s secret first wife, Ida Dasler, who was seduced by his passion and vigor but blind to the fascist dictator''s many flaws.', 'The story of the descent into madness of Mussolini''s secret first wife, Ida Dasler, who was seduced by his passion and vigor but blind to the fascist dictator''s many flaws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zt9yAFfkOia3NltkhjMT5WaPlcV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30239'),
  ('992840886138220795', 'Vinci', 2004, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Juliusz Machulski', 'Juliusz Machulski', 'Robert Więckiewicz, Borys Szyc, Marcin Dorociński, Kamilla Baar, Jan Machulski, Jacek Król, Mieczysław Grąbka, Łukasz Simlat', null, 'The sophisticated thief of art Robert "Cuma" Cuminski is released on probation from the local prison by the corrupt Doctor Wiaderny to organize the theft of the famous Leonardo Da Vinci painting "Lady with Ermine" for the dealer Gruby. Three years ago, Cuma was accidentally arrested by the snoopy detective Wilk after a successful heist in the house of the collector Lehman, but he has not ratted his comrade Julian.', 'The sophisticated thief of art Robert "Cuma" Cuminski is released on probation from the local prison by the corrupt Doctor Wiaderny to organize the theft of the famous Leonardo Da Vinci painting "Lady with Ermine" for the dealer Gruby. Three years ago, Cuma was accidentally arrested by the snoopy detective Wilk after a successful heist in the house of the collector Lehman, but he has not ratted his comrade Julian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ng7FrjExaJJzE1Y4v1TEmn9NZZG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39788'),
  ('257898431396109922', 'Vinci 2', 2025, 'Crime, Comedy, Action', 'Juliusz Machulski, Piotr Uznański', 'Juliusz Machulski, Robert Więckiewicz', 'Robert Więckiewicz, Borys Szyc, Łukasz Simlat, Kamilla Baar, Jacek Król, Mirosław Haniszewski, Zofia Jastrzębska, Piotr Witkowski', null, 'Cuma, a retired master thief living peacefully on Spain’s Andalusian coast, rejects one last job, until rival Chudy, Cuma’s former partner turned adversary, plots a massive heist in Kraków with a ruthless new crew and no place for him. Driven by pride and the need to reclaim his title as the world’s greatest burglar, Cuma returns, reunites old allies, assembles a fresh team, and prepares to face Chudy on his own terms.', 'Cuma, a retired master thief living peacefully on Spain’s Andalusian coast, rejects one last job, until rival Chudy, Cuma’s former partner turned adversary, plots a massive heist in Kraków with a ruthless new crew and no place for him. Driven by pride and the need to reclaim his title as the world’s greatest burglar, Cuma returns, reunites old allies, assembles a fresh team, and prepares to face Chudy on his own terms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1g09C1ftgtqJRnMENgNftPtZ0Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1339552'),
  ('565382840993650219', 'Vindicta', 2023, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Sean McNamara', 'Ian Neligh, Steven Paul', 'Michasha Armstrong, Sean Astin, Jaime M. Callica, Karolina Cubitt, Daniel Cudmore, Elena Kampouris, Travis Nelson, Adam Pateman', 'R', 'When a city is terrorized by a sadistic serial killer, a seasoned detective and a newly recruited paramedic discover the key to stopping the bloodshed lies in unlocking the truth of their own haunted pasts.', 'When a city is terrorized by a sadistic serial killer, a seasoned detective and a newly recruited paramedic discover the key to stopping the bloodshed lies in unlocking the truth of their own haunted pasts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeopyZbtwX0sgsndJU6vQj1uxrb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1175873'),
  ('296134682348961004', 'Vini Jr.', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Andrucha Waddington, Emílio Domingos, Douglonez', 'Sérgio Mekler, Emílio Domingos, Carolina Albuquerque', 'Vini Jr., Fernanda Nascimento, Luana Paixão, Nilza Paixão, Ulysses Paixão, Vinicius Paixão, Douglonez, Julien Laurens', null, 'Vini Jr. has it all: talent, resilience and boldness. Follow his dancing, unpredictable feet on his inspiring journey to becoming a global soccer star.', 'Vini Jr. has it all: talent, resilience and boldness. Follow his dancing, unpredictable feet on his inspiring journey to becoming a global soccer star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ImGMcwpy4k2zmcXBSFYNK6kRr9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1390394'),
  ('744586775130252702', 'Vinicius de Moraes', 2005, 'Documentary, Music', 'Miguel Faria Jr.', 'Eucanaã Ferraz, Miguel Faria Jr., Diana Vasconcellos', 'Camila Morgado, Ricardo Blat, Vinicius de Moraes, Yamandu Costa, Ferreira Gullar, Antônio Cândido, Chico Buarque, Caetano Veloso', null, 'To celebrate the life and the work of a multifaceted creator – playwright, poet, partner of the most important names of Brazilian pop music and, above all, an enlightened character of the Brazilian cultural history - director Miguel Faria Jr. gathered an incomparable cast of partners, singers, friends and rare images from the archives recalling Vinícius’ genial simplicity, with the spontaneity, the humor, and the freedom of a person chatting over a bar table, exactly how the eternal Vinícius would enjoy.', 'To celebrate the life and the work of a multifaceted creator – playwright, poet, partner of the most important names of Brazilian pop music and, above all, an enlightened character of the Brazilian cultural history - director Miguel Faria Jr. gathered an incomparable cast of partners, singers, friends and rare images from the archives recalling Vinícius’ genial simplicity, with the spontaneity, the humor, and the freedom of a person chatting over a bar table, exactly how the eternal Vinícius would enjoy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pdf0u3K0kL4u45sjCuf8UP9WXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74482'),
  ('574741272894208316', 'Vinnaithaandi Varuvaayaa', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gautham Vasudev Menon, Mani Nagaraj, Manoj Paramahamsa', 'Gautham Vasudev Menon', 'Silambarasan, Trisha Krishnan, VTV Ganesh, Babu Antony, Lakshmi Ramakrishnan, Kitty, Uma Padmanabhan, Pradeep Kottayam', null, 'A young, aspiring filmmaker falls in love with a girl who moves into the house above his, but her sophisticated nature does more harm than good to him.', 'A young, aspiring filmmaker falls in love with a girl who moves into the house above his, but her sophisticated nature does more harm than good to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icWUNL2GxDgWmI5PQN2RYA2CEbv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37941'),
  ('408592963450667541', 'Vinodentro', 2013, 'Thriller, Crime, Comedy, Mystery, Drama', 'Ferdinando Vicentini Orgnani, Dante Spinotti, Giovanni Vaccarelli', 'Ferdinando Vicentini Orgnani', 'Giovanna Mezzogiorno, Vincenzo Amato, Pietro Sermonti, Erika Blanc, Gioele Dix, Lambert Wilson, Daniela Virgilio, Paolo Giovannucci', null, 'For John Cuttin it all started with the first sip of the wine of her life. A "Marzemino", a typical wine of the province of Trento, quoted by Lorenzo Da Ponte in his libretto for "Don Giovanni" by Mozart. The instant he tasted the blood-red drop of nectar John felt a sort of pleasant and mysterious explosion of the senses, and from that moment on, his nature is transformed. In just three years, from shy bank clerk and faithful husband became director, tombeur de femmes and the most revered and respected expert on wine in Italy. Just as he had predicted the enigmatic "Professor" who had convinced him to taste his first glass of wine. The only event that the "Professor" with his accent and his piercing blue eyes, had not predicted was that he would soon be charged with the murder of his wife Adele. While being put under pressure by the Commissioner Sanfelice, John is to reflect on the last three years of his life, dominated by a single and mad passion: wine.', 'For John Cuttin it all started with the first sip of the wine of her life. A "Marzemino", a typical wine of the province of Trento, quoted by Lorenzo Da Ponte in his libretto for "Don Giovanni" by Mozart. The instant he tasted the blood-red drop of nectar John felt a sort of pleasant and mysterious explosion of the senses, and from that moment on, his nature is transformed. In just three years, from shy bank clerk and faithful husband became director, tombeur de femmes and the most revered and respected expert on wine in Italy. Just as he had predicted the enigmatic "Professor" who had convinced him to taste his first glass of wine. The only event that the "Professor" with his accent and his piercing blue eyes, had not predicted was that he would soon be charged with the murder of his wife Adele. While being put under pressure by the Commissioner Sanfelice, John is to reflect on the last three years of his life, dominated by a single and mad passion: wine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fyhN9qiWuxV7PUcAEo1WtfNmi38.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287719'),
  ('346276570206560310', 'Vinski 2', 2026, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Juha Wuolijoki, Mika Orasmaa', 'Juha Wuolijoki, Jari Rantala', 'Kuura Rossi, Martti Suosalo, Pirjo Heikkilä, Pihla Viitala, Jussi Vatanen', null, 'The town of Hömpstad is once again under threat from criminals and Vinski''s help is needed. When the criminals manage to steal the invisibility powder for themselves, Vinski has a real showdown on his hands.', 'The town of Hömpstad is once again under threat from criminals and Vinski''s help is needed. When the criminals manage to steal the invisibility powder for themselves, Vinski has a real showdown on his hands.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fw9yhs9mZrYEqGIykM9RKzG5Cqev.jpg', 'plex:movie:vinski-2'),
  ('478104330068174785', 'Vinterviken', 1996, 'Crime, Drama', 'Harald Hamrell, Roland Sterner', 'Harald Hamrell, Sara Heldt', 'David Tainton, Lina Englund, Martin Lindqvist, Peter Haber, Anki Lidén, Jeanette Eklinder, Kjell Bergqvist, Maria Weisby', null, 'John-John is young and black, growing up with his mother and stepfather in a boring suburb south of Stockholm. On one of the last days of the summer vacation, they rescue 10-year old Patricia from drowning at a public bath in Vinterviken in Lake Mälaren. Her father shows his gratitude by taking them home to the wealthy neighborhood, Bromma, where he and his family lives. John-John meets his daughter Elisabeth, and instantly fall in love with her. But it''s a long way to go before he wins her love and her father''s consent.', 'John-John is young and black, growing up with his mother and stepfather in a boring suburb south of Stockholm. On one of the last days of the summer vacation, they rescue 10-year old Patricia from drowning at a public bath in Vinterviken in Lake Mälaren. Her father shows his gratitude by taking them home to the wealthy neighborhood, Bromma, where he and his family lives. John-John meets his daughter Elisabeth, and instantly fall in love with her. But it''s a long way to go before he wins her love and her father''s consent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTwr3rGDNmQIqsAqx16vXi7YQ82.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39502'),
  ('798090322718883930', 'Vinyan', 2008, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Fabrice Du Welz, Benoît Debie, Paul-Henri Belin', 'Fabrice Du Welz', 'Emmanuelle Béart, Rufus Sewell, Petch Osathanugrah, Julie Dreyfus, Amporn Pankratok, Josse De Pauw, Omm, Apisit Opasaimlikit', 'R', 'Six months after losing her only child in the Southeast Asia tsunami, Jeanne is convinced she sees him in a film about orphans living in the jungles.', 'Six months after losing her only child in the Southeast Asia tsunami, Jeanne is convinced she sees him in a film about orphans living in the jungles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzFmPTbLiOOciDS0MzfZw0hJGxy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16350'),
