  ('546258309682298182', 'Virgin Rose', 2006, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'Manuel Gutiérrez Aragón', 'Manuel Gutiérrez Aragón, Senel Paz', 'Jorge Perugorría, Álex González, Ana de Armas, Broselianda Hernández, Roxana Montenegro, Yoraisi Gómez, Mariam Curbelo', null, 'Simón transports illegal immigrants to New York, leaving them to their fate. When he is discovered by the coastguard, a young sailor, named Andrés saves his life. But when Andrés falls for Marie—a young protegée of Simón''s—conflict erupts.', 'Simón transports illegal immigrants to New York, leaving them to their fate. When he is discovered by the coastguard, a young sailor, named Andrés saves his life. But when Andrés falls for Marie—a young protegée of Simón''s—conflict erupts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whedbvYntJ6iy57Mf7LiB7vKtjQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176707'),
  ('401156525082854480', 'Virgin Snow', 2007, 'Romance', 'Han Sang-hee, Masanori Inoue, Hye-sung Oh', 'Kazuhiko Ban', 'Lee Joon-gi, Aoi Miyazaki, Kimiko Yo, Shun Shioya, Ayaka Morita, Miyu Yagyu, Satoru Matsuo, Otoha', null, 'Min, a Korean boy, moves to Japan with his father who is a potter. One day at a local shrine, he meets Nanae, a beautiful Japanese girl with stunning eyes who is aspiring to be a painter. Min falls in love at first sight and finds out that Nanae attends the school to which he has just transferred. Their friendship develops fast despite their cultural and language difference. When Min''s grandmother falls ill, Min returns to Korea and Nanae is nowhere to be found. Had his true feelings for Nanae not been apparent to her? Why has Nanae disappeared without a word?', 'Min, a Korean boy, moves to Japan with his father who is a potter. One day at a local shrine, he meets Nanae, a beautiful Japanese girl with stunning eyes who is aspiring to be a painter. Min falls in love at first sight and finds out that Nanae attends the school to which he has just transferred. Their friendship develops fast despite their cultural and language difference. When Min''s grandmother falls ill, Min returns to Korea and Nanae is nowhere to be found. Had his true feelings for Nanae not been apparent to her? Why has Nanae disappeared without a word?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQmJF65ZXA1ATp055jWlKy96Lio.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52592'),
  ('280997623193055277', 'Virgin Stripped Bare by Her Bachelors', 2000, 'Romance, Drama', 'Hong Sang-soo, Choi Yeong-taek, Choi Seok-jae', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Lee Eun-ju, Moon Sung-keun, Jung Bo-seog, Lee Hwang-eui, Kim Young-dae, Park Mi-hyeon, Cho Won-hee, Jeong Ho bung', null, 'When filmmaker Young-soo introduces writer Soo-jung to his friend Jae-hoon, he unintentionally creates a love triangle. While Jae-hoon pursues Soo-jung, Young-soo clashes with his crew. Yet, just as the story appears to end, it starts all over again, this time with plenty of variations.', 'When filmmaker Young-soo introduces writer Soo-jung to his friend Jae-hoon, he unintentionally creates a love triangle. While Jae-hoon pursues Soo-jung, Young-soo clashes with his crew. Yet, just as the story appears to end, it starts all over again, this time with plenty of variations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hV0kpO5WZGtBR9jmGd33IfY0P8a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54690'),
  ('75484662504600764', 'Virgin Territory', 2007, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy, Romance', 'David Leland, Ben Davis', 'David Leland', 'Hayden Christensen, Mischa Barton, Kate Groombridge, Rosalind Halstead, Tim Roth, Matthew Rhys, Ryan Cartwright, Christopher Egan', 'R', 'In Black Death era Tuscany, as in the Decameron, ten young Florentines take refuge from the plague. But instead of telling stories, they have lusty adventures, bawdy exchanges, romance, swordplay, randy nuns, Saracen pirates, and a sexy cow.', 'In Black Death era Tuscany, as in the Decameron, ten young Florentines take refuge from the plague. But instead of telling stories, they have lusty adventures, bawdy exchanges, romance, swordplay, randy nuns, Saracen pirates, and a sexy cow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zofWP7ZKhoVTh2VUltaDo4LRQXc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14324'),
