  ('794769440801860004', 'Vlad the Impaler', 2018, 'Drama, History, War', 'Osman Kaya, Sami Saydan, Tuncer Sentürk', 'İbrahim Ethem Arslan, Mustafa Burak Doğu, Esra Vesu Ozcelik', 'Cem Uçan, Erkan Petekkaya, Nur Fettahoğlu, Yetkin Dikinciler, Gülşah Şahin, İsmail Filiz, Gökçe Özyol, Hakan Yufkacıgil', 'R', 'The true story of 7 oddly dressed fearless men of ottoman army fight against cruel Vlad.', 'The true story of 7 oddly dressed fearless men of ottoman army fight against cruel Vlad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSCuvcNM4SvMK5hUNDD94V0NjRP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540841'),
  ('116045527166085702', 'Vlad the Impaler: The True Life of Dracula', 1979, 'History, Drama', 'Doru Năstase, Aurel Kostrachievici', 'Mircea Mohor', 'Ștefan Sileanu, Ernest Maftei, Emanoil Petruţ, Teofil Vâlcu, Alexandru Repan, Constantin Codrescu, George Constantin, Constantin Bărbulescu', null, 'Vlad Țepeş, otherwise known as Vlad the Impaler and Dracula, fights the Ottoman Turks on the battlefield and the Hungarian Boyars in his court.', 'Vlad Țepeş, otherwise known as Vlad the Impaler and Dracula, fights the Ottoman Turks on the battlefield and the Hungarian Boyars in his court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yseuxcrMyT523a00mnv3mdioSTM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92096'),
  ('28345569015054252', 'Vladimir and Rosa', 1971, 'Drama', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Jean-Pierre Gorin, Jean-Pierre Gorin', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Jean-Pierre Gorin', 'Yves Afonso, Juliet Berto, Frankie Dymon, Jean-Luc Godard, Jean-Pierre Gorin, Ernest Menzer, Claude Nedjar, Anne Wiazemsky', 'NR', 'Jean-Luc Godard''s and Jean-Pierre Gorin''s interpretation of the Chicago Eight / Chicago Seven trial, which followed the 1968 Democratic National Convention protest activities. Judge Hoffman becomes the character Judge Himmler (played by Ernest Menzer) and the defendants become a microcosms of the French Revolution.', 'Jean-Luc Godard''s and Jean-Pierre Gorin''s interpretation of the Chicago Eight / Chicago Seven trial, which followed the 1968 Democratic National Convention protest activities. Judge Hoffman becomes the character Judge Himmler (played by Ernest Menzer) and the defendants become a microcosms of the French Revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4p3QjbypwTE02FTdrNALwOE0LtY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89494'),
  ('262275208444652874', 'Voce del verbo amore', 2007, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Simone Frattari, Massimo Pau, Andrea Manni', 'Maurizio Costanzo, Andrea Manni, Silvia Ranfagni', 'Giorgio Pasotti, Stefania Rocca, Aurora Manni, Niccolò Perito, Cecilia Dazzi, Magdalena Grochowska, Tony Kendall, Eros Pagni', null, 'Ugo and Francesca have been married for ten years, but mutually decide to break up in a graceful way. They start singles'' life again, having to deal with their children, their jobs and social relationships alone. They even both start seeing someone else, until jealousy arises. Perhaps their love is not over yet...', 'Ugo and Francesca have been married for ten years, but mutually decide to break up in a graceful way. They start singles'' life again, having to deal with their children, their jobs and social relationships alone. They even both start seeing someone else, until jealousy arises. Perhaps their love is not over yet...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3EKBLTpVuiIb6lbPffPDhfcJAT0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157212'),
