  ('339981281273433054', 'Vodka Diaries', 2018, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Kushal Srivastava, Maneesh Chandra Bhatt', 'Vaibhav Bajpai, Kushal Srivastava', 'Kay Kay Menon, Raima Sen, Mandira Bedi, Sharib Hashmi, Rishi Bhutani, Swati Rajput, Vaishnavi Dhanraj, Mohommed Ali Shah', null, 'In the misty town of Manali, ACP Ashwini Dixit attempts to solve a series of mysterious murders happening in a single night, which might be connected to the night club, Vodka Diaries.', 'In the misty town of Manali, ACP Ashwini Dixit attempts to solve a series of mysterious murders happening in a single night, which might be connected to the night club, Vodka Diaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkwFas8xTRbCuGdWJxk3KfXOZQN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:498479'),
  ('199258720671304516', 'Vodka Lemon', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Hiner Saleem, Christophe Pollock', 'Lei Dinety, Hiner Saleem', 'Romen Avinian, Lala Sarkissian, Ivan Franěk, Ruzan Mesropyan, Zahal Karielachvili, Astrik Avaguian, Armen Marutyan, Svetlana Babelyan', null, 'In a remote, isolated Yazidi Kurdish village in post-Soviet Armenia, Hamo, a widower with a pitiful pension and three worthless sons, travels daily to his wife''s grave. There he meets the lovely Nina, who is communing with her late husband. The two are penniless--she works in a local bar that is about to close down, while he has been forced to start selling his meager possessions. All seems hopelessly bleak, yet when Hamo begins to court Nina, their unexpected love revitalizes them.', 'In a remote, isolated Yazidi Kurdish village in post-Soviet Armenia, Hamo, a widower with a pitiful pension and three worthless sons, travels daily to his wife''s grave. There he meets the lovely Nina, who is communing with her late husband. The two are penniless--she works in a local bar that is about to close down, while he has been forced to start selling his meager possessions. All seems hopelessly bleak, yet when Hamo begins to court Nina, their unexpected love revitalizes them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTGBdlBAthuBIIkzSBAyXl3m0P6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56946'),
  ('471828105304834225', 'Vodkaa, komisario Palmu', 1969, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Georg Korkman, Matti Kassila, Esko Nevalainen', 'Matti Kassila, Georg Korkman', 'Joel Rinne, Leo Jokela, Matti Ranin, Anna-Leena Mäki-Penttilä, Inga Sulin, Lilga Kovanko, Marjatta Lindahl, Viktor Klimenko', null, 'A TV reporter is murdered when he is eavesdropping on a secret Finnish-Soviet conference. The National Broadcasting Corporation enlists the help of police lieutenant Palmu, who comes out of retirement for this case. However, some have their doubts about the loyalities of Palmu, seeing that he was spotted in a diplomatic soiree in Moscow just a few weeks before the murder.', 'A TV reporter is murdered when he is eavesdropping on a secret Finnish-Soviet conference. The National Broadcasting Corporation enlists the help of police lieutenant Palmu, who comes out of retirement for this case. However, some have their doubts about the loyalities of Palmu, seeing that he was spotted in a diplomatic soiree in Moscow just a few weeks before the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDY1KuoUEX5mA77w9cICigmw1sO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144724'),
  ('902110599732831811', 'Vogues of 1938', 1937, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Irving Cummings', 'Sam Spewack, Bella Spewack', 'Warner Baxter, Joan Bennett, Helen Vinson, Mischa Auer, Alan Mowbray, Jerome Cowan, Alma Kruger, Marjorie Gateson', 'NR', 'An early Technicolor musical that concentrates on the fashions of the late 1930s, this film was reissued under the title All This and Glamour Too. The top models of the era, including several who are advertising household products, are in the cast. The plot centers around a chic boutique, whose owner, George Curson (Warner Baxter), tries hard to please his customers while keeping peace with his unhappy wife. A wealthy young woman, Wendy Van Klettering (Joan Bennett), decides to take a job as a model at the fashion house, just to amuse herself, but her presence annoys Curson, who must put together the best possible show to compete with rival fashion houses at the Seven Arts Ball. The film includes several hit songs, including the Oscar-nominated "That Old Feeling" by Sammy Fain and Lew Brown.', 'An early Technicolor musical that concentrates on the fashions of the late 1930s, this film was reissued under the title All This and Glamour Too. The top models of the era, including several who are advertising household products, are in the cast. The plot centers around a chic boutique, whose owner, George Curson (Warner Baxter), tries hard to please his customers while keeping peace with his unhappy wife. A wealthy young woman, Wendy Van Klettering (Joan Bennett), decides to take a job as a model at the fashion house, just to amuse herself, but her presence annoys Curson, who must put together the best possible show to compete with rival fashion houses at the Seven Arts Ball. The film includes several hit songs, including the Oscar-nominated "That Old Feeling" by Sammy Fain and Lew Brown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhrOyXnf3k1Vz4UQxMWmk3cYIx6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151914'),
  ('182044789266590415', 'Voice', 2005, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Choi Equan, Choi Jin-young, Kim Yong-heung', 'Joon-Seok Sol, Choi Equan', 'Kim Ok-bin, Seo Ji-hye, Cha Ye-ryun, Kim Seo-hyung, Lim Hyun-kyung, Jeon Yeo-jin, Eun-kyeong Na', null, 'While practicing after hours in her high school, an aspiring singer is mysteriously killed and her body vanishes. Her invisible ghost is trapped in the school, but her best friend is able to hear her voice.', 'While practicing after hours in her high school, an aspiring singer is mysteriously killed and her body vanishes. Her invisible ghost is trapped in the school, but her best friend is able to hear her voice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6YDFXt6TIq4k1SmwNxCbagTtZiN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32170'),
  ('272796561763753408', 'Voice from the Stone', 2017, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Eric D. Howell, Roy Bava, Luca John Rosati', 'Andrew Shaw', 'Emilia Clarke, Marton Csokas, Caterina Murino, Remo Girone, Lisa Gastoni, Edward Dring, Duccio Camerini, Nicole Cadeddu', 'R', 'Verena is a nurse who arrives at an old mansion in Italy to help a young boy who has fallen silent since the sudden passing of his mother.', 'Verena is a nurse who arrives at an old mansion in Italy to help a young boy who has fallen silent since the sudden passing of his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pJseCfsd90nA26Jz1HTSuyRzGz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301372'),
