  ('994931688871675865', 'Volcano', 1950, 'Drama', 'William Dieterle, Fosco Maraini, Arturo Gallea', 'Erskine Caldwell, Piero Tellini, Victor Stoloff', 'Anna Magnani, Rossano Brazzi, Geraldine Brooks, Eduardo Ciannelli, Adriano Ambrogi, Lucia Belfadel, Cesare Giuffrè, Rosina Galli', null, 'An exiled Italian prostitute shields her sister from a deep-sea diver on an island volcano.', 'An exiled Italian prostitute shields her sister from a deep-sea diver on an island volcano.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/640i1dwQrOcPFqd4cDQzcC1HUTk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142926'),
  ('828735510735831098', 'Volcano', 1997, 'Science Fiction, Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Theo van de Sande, Mick Jackson, Michele Panelli-Venetis', 'Billy Ray, Jerome Armstrong', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Anne Heche, Gaby Hoffmann, Don Cheadle, Jacqueline Kim, Keith David, John Corbett, Michael Rispoli', 'PG-13', 'An earthquake shatters a peaceful Los Angeles morning and opens a fissure deep into the earth, causing lava to start bubbling up. As a volcano begins forming in the La Brea Tar Pits, the director of the city''s emergency management service, working with a geologist, must then use every resource in the city to try and stop the volcano from consuming LA.', 'An earthquake shatters a peaceful Los Angeles morning and opens a fissure deep into the earth, causing lava to start bubbling up. As a volcano begins forming in the La Brea Tar Pits, the director of the city''s emergency management service, working with a geologist, must then use every resource in the city to try and stop the volcano from consuming LA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xIjktjXuro7anZ6AR58t5ZYWjQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10357'),
  ('709166930085134362', 'Volcano', 2009, 'Drama, Action, TV Movie', 'Uwe Janson', null, 'Yvonne Catterfeld, Katharina Wackernagel, Matthias Koeberlin, Heiner Lauterbach, Pasquale Aleardi, Peter Benedict, Antonia Bergman, Christian Bischop', null, 'When a dormant volcano suddenly erupts into activity beneath Laach Lake in the Eiffel mountains, panic breaks out among the 500.000 residents.', 'When a dormant volcano suddenly erupts into activity beneath Laach Lake in the Eiffel mountains, panic breaks out among the 500.000 residents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqeXFmrni2WXlgP9h6rUyXpR3OD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55224'),
  ('983457248808410134', 'Volcano High', 2001, 'Action, Comedy', 'Kim Tae-gyun, Choi Yeong-taek, Jung Young-min', 'Seo Dong-heon, Kim Tae-gyun, Park Hun-soo', 'Jang Hyuk, Shin Min-a, Kim Hyeong-jong, Byun Hee-bong, Huh Joon-ho, Gong Hyo-jin, Kim Soo-ro, Kwon Sang-woo', null, 'Kim is expelled from his eighth school and finds himself at Volcano High where students fight to possess a treasured ancient document. Kim, who must resist from using his Chi, is caught in the middle.', 'Kim is expelled from his eighth school and finds himself at Volcano High where students fight to possess a treasured ancient document. Kim, who must resist from using his Chi, is caught in the middle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9ItiEc0OlFcxvQtKITxwU6o8tJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23834'),
  ('29198346017734736', 'Volcano: An Inquiry into the Life and Death of Malcolm Lowry', 1976, 'Documentary', 'Donald Brittain, John Kramer', 'Donald Brittain', 'Richard Burton, Donald Brittain, Marjorie Bonner, Arthur Calder-Marshall, Albert Russel Erskine, John Buchan', null, 'This feature-length Oscar®-nominated documentary focuses on Malcolm Lowry, author of one of the major novels of the 20th century, Under the Volcano. But while Lowry fought a winning battle with words, he lost his battle with alcohol. Shot on location in four countries, the film combines photographs, readings by Richard Burton from the novel and interviews with the people who loved and hated Lowry, to create a vivid portrait of the man.', 'This feature-length Oscar®-nominated documentary focuses on Malcolm Lowry, author of one of the major novels of the 20th century, Under the Volcano. But while Lowry fought a winning battle with words, he lost his battle with alcohol. Shot on location in four countries, the film combines photographs, readings by Richard Burton from the novel and interviews with the people who loved and hated Lowry, to create a vivid portrait of the man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stXw1nWAUmmdoELqe4GADiHAzoR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149348'),
  ('504300728384447580', 'Volcano: Fire on the Mountain', 1997, 'Drama, Action', 'Tobias A. Schliessler, Graeme Campbell', null, 'Dan Cortese, Cynthia Gibb, Brian Kerwin, Don S. Davis, Lynda Boyd, Colin Cunningham, Micah Gardener, Kendall Cross', null, 'Angel Falls is a mountain ski resort where a nearby volcano is about to erupt. Volcanic scientist Peter Slater must convince his boss and the local population of the danger and begin the town evacuation before it’s too late.', 'Angel Falls is a mountain ski resort where a nearby volcano is about to erupt. Volcanic scientist Peter Slater must convince his boss and the local population of the danger and begin the town evacuation before it’s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GpkluFatauLmCD2nKzMtUwkJSv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65388'),
  ('622859047857854041', 'Volesse il cielo!', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Vincenzo Salemme, Franco Di Giacomo, Alexia Marconi', 'Vincenzo Salemme', 'Vincenzo Salemme, Maurizio Casagrande, Tosca D''Aquino, Biagio Izzo, Rocco Papaleo, Armando Pugliese, Guia Jelo, Biancamaria Lelli', null, 'A police inspector has to help an eccentric stranger who seems to have lost his memory.', 'A police inspector has to help an eccentric stranger who seems to have lost his memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRVHIAnMtdF26mYrvKfGfZ7Tc07.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68060'),
