  ('615184627203152912', 'Volga - Volga', 1938, 'Comedy, Music', 'Grigori Aleksandrov, Vladimir Nilsen, Boris Petrov', 'Grigori Aleksandrov, Mikhail Volpin, Nikolay Erdman', 'Lyubov Orlova, Igor Ilyinsky, Vladimir Volodin, Pavel Olenev, Sergei Antimonov, Andrei Tutyshkin, Mariya Mironova, Vsevolod Sanayev', null, 'Widely claimed to be Joseph Stalin''s favorite movie, this classic musical comedy is a must-see. The action takes place on a steamboat on the iconic Volga River, as two groups of performers travel to Moscow to perform in the Moscow Musical Olympiad.', 'Widely claimed to be Joseph Stalin''s favorite movie, this classic musical comedy is a must-see. The action takes place on a steamboat on the iconic Volga River, as two groups of performers travel to Moscow to perform in the Moscow Musical Olympiad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDunXhmYjX7yjG4q3exMewj6zZw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37133'),
  ('278030789751519163', 'Volition', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Byron Kopman, Tony Dean Smith', 'Tony Dean Smith, Ryan W. Smith', 'Adrian Glynn McMorran, Magda Apanowicz, John Cassini, Frank Cassini, Aleks Paunovic, Bill Marchant, Darcy Hinds, Blu Mankuma', null, 'A man afflicted with clairvoyance tries to change his fate when a series of events leads to a vision of his own imminent murder.', 'A man afflicted with clairvoyance tries to change his fate when a series of events leads to a vision of his own imminent murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cttGxFQt5nRROFZYC3nJbs3dPE1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:600348'),
  ('534218579654847052', 'Volkov Origin', 2022, 'Thriller, Crime', 'George Dibble', 'Wes Johnson, Wes Lee, George Dibble', 'Gina Jun, Wes Johnson, Dominique M. Mancini, Jake Chua, Richard Siegelman, Gemma McIlhenny, Michael J. Patterson, Charles D. Clark', null, 'In the late evening hours, Dr. Angela Perkins finds that she has a new assignment. To dive into the mind of Horton House Penitentiary''s newest and most mysterious tenant, Andre Volkov . No one can anticipate the impact that her visit will have on both of their lives as she begins her quest for the truth within his answers.', 'In the late evening hours, Dr. Angela Perkins finds that she has a new assignment. To dive into the mind of Horton House Penitentiary''s newest and most mysterious tenant, Andre Volkov . No one can anticipate the impact that her visit will have on both of their lives as she begins her quest for the truth within his answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rn3ydgeGFQbvnFq5jKofcXJgMBA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:900410'),
  ('763165579639387437', 'Voll Normaaal', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Ralf Huettner, Diethard Prengel, Holger Barthel', 'Tom Gerhardt', 'Tom Gerhardt, Hilmi Sözer, Uwe Fellensiek, Veronica Ferres, Dolly Buster, Rolf Zacher, Renate Dissel, Katja Flint', null, 'Tommie is the absolute loser in his home district of Cologne-Kalk: no money, no apartment of his own, no girlfriend. In the exhaust workshop where he toils, the foreman is constantly angry with him. But Tommie is in a great mood: The video freak dreams enthusiastically through the fantasy world of film art, preferably with the bust sex star Gianna S. in the leading role. Tommie collects exhaust pipes. When he steals a particularly capital specimen from Jupp''s swank Mercedes, he gets into real trouble. He has no choice but to return the exhaust to Jupp, but his deadly ultimatum of procuring a case of the rare beer brand "Ramsdorfer Kölsch" by seven o''clock in the evening proves to be insanely difficult. Because at the very same time, "Gianna S." is expected in town...', 'Tommie is the absolute loser in his home district of Cologne-Kalk: no money, no apartment of his own, no girlfriend. In the exhaust workshop where he toils, the foreman is constantly angry with him. But Tommie is in a great mood: The video freak dreams enthusiastically through the fantasy world of film art, preferably with the bust sex star Gianna S. in the leading role. Tommie collects exhaust pipes. When he steals a particularly capital specimen from Jupp''s swank Mercedes, he gets into real trouble. He has no choice but to return the exhaust to Jupp, but his deadly ultimatum of procuring a case of the rare beer brand "Ramsdorfer Kölsch" by seven o''clock in the evening proves to be insanely difficult. Because at the very same time, "Gianna S." is expected in town...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4rz8OqfbvvScPpv9uKM7ieUcXbh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9673'),
  ('1064986545732332210', 'Volley', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Julián Ledesma, Fernando Alcalde, Martín Piroyansky', 'Martín Piroyansky', 'Martín Piroyansky, Violeta Urtizberea, Inés Efrón, Chino Darín, Vera Spinetta, Justina Bustos', null, 'While spending New Year''s Eve with a group of friends at his grandfather''s cabin, a flirtatious young man unexpectedly falls for one of his guests.', 'While spending New Year''s Eve with a group of friends at his grandfather''s cabin, a flirtatious young man unexpectedly falls for one of his guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bm8UHjLE8Spvsr1tsV8oiRtirnW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331424'),
  ('218186306415015006', 'Vollidiot', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tobi Baumann, Jo Heim', 'Tommy Jaud, Christian Zübert', 'Oliver Pocher, Oliver Fleischer, Tanja Wenzel, Tomas Spencer, Anke Engelke, Adriana Altaras, Ellenie Salvo González, Friederike Kempter', null, 'Based on Tommy Jaud''s bestselling novel, this comedy focuses on a dispassionate clerk and his set-backs in life. 29-year-old Simon works in a phone shop, but his thoughts just circle around finding a new girl-friend after being left by his last one year ago. While his Croatian cleaner tries to procure him, his efforts to chat up women in clubs also fail. However, he finds the woman of his dreams (and mother of their future children) in his most hated coffee shop, although not having a clue how to win her heart...', 'Based on Tommy Jaud''s bestselling novel, this comedy focuses on a dispassionate clerk and his set-backs in life. 29-year-old Simon works in a phone shop, but his thoughts just circle around finding a new girl-friend after being left by his last one year ago. While his Croatian cleaner tries to procure him, his efforts to chat up women in clubs also fail. However, he finds the woman of his dreams (and mother of their future children) in his most hated coffee shop, although not having a clue how to win her heart...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbtlSUOiNLEV1JvS99WtwKpBtE5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1419'),
  ('598276950585126996', 'Volontaire', 2018, 'Drama', 'Thibaud Ponce, Clemence Rafin, Joseph Rapp', 'Hélène Fillières, Mathias Gavarry', 'Diane Rouxel, Lambert Wilson, Corentin Fila, Alex Descas, Jonathan Couzinié, Hélène Fillières, André Marcon, Josiane Balasko', null, 'The story revolves around 22-year-old Laure, who is trying to find her feet. After performing brilliantly in her literature studies, she enrols as a communications officer in the Naval Fusiliers. She will quickly have to adapt to and assimilate the rules that apply within the institution. But Laure is a determined woman, and she has a thirst for knowledge – still. A thirst to learn to get to know and be comfortable with herself, and to find her place.', 'The story revolves around 22-year-old Laure, who is trying to find her feet. After performing brilliantly in her literature studies, she enrols as a communications officer in the Naval Fusiliers. She will quickly have to adapt to and assimilate the rules that apply within the institution. But Laure is a determined woman, and she has a thirst for knowledge – still. A thirst to learn to get to know and be comfortable with herself, and to find her place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mirZZ4pD21bzeBRwQhWzW6ydNER.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466703'),
  ('549103450454550794', 'Volpone', 1941, 'Comedy', 'Maurice Tourneur, Jacques de Baroncelli', 'Jules Romains', 'Harry Baur, Louis Jouvet, Charles Dullin, Fernand Ledoux, Marion Dorian, Alexandre Rignault, Jean Témerson, Jacqueline Delubac', null, 'Volpone, an elderly Venetian, connives with his money-crazed servant to convince his greedy friends that he is dying, knowing that each will try to curry favor with him in order to be named his heir. He is inundated with valuable gifts, and soon finds himself entangled deeper and deeper in a web of lies.', 'Volpone, an elderly Venetian, connives with his money-crazed servant to convince his greedy friends that he is dying, knowing that each will try to curry favor with him in order to be named his heir. He is inundated with valuable gifts, and soon finds himself entangled deeper and deeper in a web of lies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ax3lAzmIt7bL4ljNZCS1gHikRr3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64243'),
  ('1034565061359599807', 'Volt', 2016, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Tarek Ehlail, Mathias Prause', 'Tarek Ehlail', 'Benno Fürmann, Sascha Alexander Geršak, Ayo, Anna Bederke, Surho Sugaipov, Kida Khodr Ramadan, Stipe Erceg, Denis Moschitto', null, 'Germany in the not-too-distant future: The borders are closed, refugees are collected in camps and turned away or accepted. The mood is charged, a police detachment is responsible for keeping the crowd in check. Volt is one of the cops. He accidentally kills a French refugee. The violence spirals out of control. Volt starts up a relationship with the sister of the man he killed and winds up between the fronts.', 'Germany in the not-too-distant future: The borders are closed, refugees are collected in camps and turned away or accepted. The mood is charged, a police detachment is responsible for keeping the crowd in check. Volt is one of the cops. He accidentally kills a French refugee. The violence spirals out of control. Volt starts up a relationship with the sister of the man he killed and winds up between the fronts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dd5kjkg1cRkaZwQeRSz9p6ltDud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402993'),
  ('35805373302487197', 'Voltati Eugenio', 1980, 'Drama', 'Luigi Comencini, Carlo Carlini, Elio Saroli', 'Massimo Patrizi, Luigi Comencini', 'Francesco Bonelli, Saverio Marconi, Dalila Di Lazzaro, Carole André, Bernard Blier, Alessandro Bruzzese, José Luis de Vilallonga, Dina Sassoli', null, 'The film begins when Eugenio, a 14 year old child, is conduced from his grandparents home outside Rome, to Giancarlo (his father) in the city, by Giancarlo''s friend (called "Moustache"). As Eugenio is bothering Moustache, he threatens Eugenio with leaving him in the middle of the country. He finally does it. When Giancarlo finds out, they return for Eugenio, but he is now lost. Meanwhile we''re told the story of the child and his relation with the family, and why he feels unwanted.', 'The film begins when Eugenio, a 14 year old child, is conduced from his grandparents home outside Rome, to Giancarlo (his father) in the city, by Giancarlo''s friend (called "Moustache"). As Eugenio is bothering Moustache, he threatens Eugenio with leaving him in the middle of the country. He finally does it. When Giancarlo finds out, they return for Eugenio, but he is now lost. Meanwhile we''re told the story of the child and his relation with the family, and why he feels unwanted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f5ws901aCxEk8LLpBQrYQHVH1y6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56970'),
  ('1151633492067530225', 'Volume 7', 2026, 'Science Fiction', 'Despina Charalampous, Panos Pappas', 'Despina Charalampous', 'Stella Fyrogeni, Kristel Kaperoni, Kostis Mpountas', null, 'The future is just another past. In an isolated City-Building marked 7, where human knowledge is preserved in the minds of the gifted and time moves in endless loops, a young man reappears again and again, confronting love, rebellion, and the elusive promise of escape. A woman, who meets him each time, becomes the mirror of this repetition, keeping alive the fragile hope that something might finally change.', 'The future is just another past. In an isolated City-Building marked 7, where human knowledge is preserved in the minds of the gifted and time moves in endless loops, a young man reappears again and again, confronting love, rebellion, and the elusive promise of escape. A woman, who meets him each time, becomes the mirror of this repetition, keeping alive the fragile hope that something might finally change.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BMGZhZDJlNjYtY2ZmMS00OTBkLTliNGItMDhmNjU5MjNlOTA2XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:volume-7-2026'),
  ('753796204423010384', 'Volunteers', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Nicholas Meyer, Elie Cohn, Jorge Sainz', 'David Isaacs, Ken Levine', 'Tom Hanks, John Candy, Rita Wilson, Tim Thomerson, Gedde Watanabe, George Plimpton, Ernest Harada, Allan Arbus', 'R', 'After graduating from Yale in 1962, womanizing Lawrence flees a gambling debt that his rich dad won''t pay and takes his roomie''s place as a Peace Corps Volunteer in the Thai Golden Triangle with two other PCVs. Will he survive two years?', 'After graduating from Yale in 1962, womanizing Lawrence flees a gambling debt that his rich dad won''t pay and takes his roomie''s place as a Peace Corps Volunteer in the Thai Golden Triangle with two other PCVs. Will he survive two years?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tua28Wyv9uGBtPTBGCP7GsN3Znu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19259'),
  ('108398210091023023', 'Volver', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Pedro Almodóvar, José Luis Alcaine, Mari Franç Torres', 'Pedro Almodóvar', 'Penélope Cruz, Carmen Maura, Lola Dueñas, Blanca Portillo, Yohana Cobo, Chus Lampreave, Antonio de la Torre, Carlos Blanco', 'R', 'Three generations of women deal with family secrets while surviving the east wind, fire, insanity, superstition, lies and even death.', 'Three generations of women deal with family secrets while surviving the east wind, fire, insanity, superstition, lies and even death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1ZUDGTFtVGE3zjTvF8OiQ9um5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219'),
  ('701313602749025542', 'Volverte a ver', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Gustavo Adrián Garzón, Stephanie Beauchef, Diego Edgar Arias Gutiérrez', 'Christopher Hool, Carlos Muciño, Alfredo Harp', 'Alfonso Herrera, Ximena Herrera, Mónica Huarte, Eduardo Manzano, Luis Calvillo, Andrea Damián, Alejandra Toussaint, Juan Carlos Martín del Campo', null, 'Pablo falls in love with two women without knowing that she is the same one…. Sofia', 'Pablo falls in love with two women without knowing that she is the same one…. Sofia', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Frx9aBktM4UQ4Jtye4Y7dOrvPu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136515'),
  ('1136771023177269121', 'Vomit-Action', 1969, null, 'Otmar Bauer', null, null, null, 'A man is drinking wine, pukes it up, and eats it. He repeats it for a while, until he starts to rub the vomit all over himself.', 'A man is drinking wine, pukes it up, and eats it. He repeats it for a while, until he starts to rub the vomit all over himself.', null, 'tmdb:movie:147612'),
  ('149526152825393113', 'Von Richthofen and Brown', 1971, 'War, Drama, Action', 'Roger Corman', 'John William Corrington, Joyce Hooper Corrington', 'John Phillip Law, Don Stroud, Barry Primus, Corin Redgrave, Karen Ericson, Hurd Hatfield, Stephen McHattie, Brian Foley', 'PG-13', 'Spend time on both sides of World War I, partly with German flying ace Baron Manfred Von Richthofen (John Phillip Law), aka "The Red Baron," and his colorful "flying circus" of Fokker fighter planes, during the time from his arrival at the war front to his death in combat. On the other side is Roy Brown of the Royal Air Force, sometimes credited with shooting Richthofen down.', 'Spend time on both sides of World War I, partly with German flying ace Baron Manfred Von Richthofen (John Phillip Law), aka "The Red Baron," and his colorful "flying circus" of Fokker fighter planes, during the time from his arrival at the war front to his death in combat. On the other side is Roy Brown of the Royal Air Force, sometimes credited with shooting Richthofen down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slorcURQhOTyMFQAtav5XZAKnlk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84285'),
  ('41230082313269659', 'Von Ryan''s Express', 1965, 'War, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Mark Robson, William H. Daniels, Ed Graves', 'Joseph Landon, Wendell Mayes', 'Frank Sinatra, Trevor Howard, Raffaella Carrà, Brad Dexter, Sergio Fantoni, John Leyton, Edward Mulhare, Wolfgang Preiss', 'NR', 'Von Ryan''s Express stars Frank Sinatra as a POW colonel who leads a daring escape from WWII Italy by taking over a freight train, but he has to win over the British soldiers he finds himself commanding.', 'Von Ryan''s Express stars Frank Sinatra as a POW colonel who leads a daring escape from WWII Italy by taking over a freight train, but he has to win over the British soldiers he finds himself commanding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNIpEa4fe0RvgTqjkRrHFuSW8lz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21876'),
  ('538371718278108213', 'Voodoo', 1995, 'Horror', 'René Eram', null, 'Corey Feldman, Joel J. Edwards, Diane Nadeau, Ron Melendez, Sarah Douglas, Jack Nance, Amy Raasch, Christopher Kriesa', 'R', 'Andy comes to campus in order to be close to his girlfriend Rebecca. Since he needs a place to stay he joins one of the college fraternities. However, a strange looking man warns him that the fraternity is just a cover-up for the weird voodoo cult.', 'Andy comes to campus in order to be close to his girlfriend Rebecca. Since he needs a place to stay he joins one of the college fraternities. However, a strange looking man warns him that the fraternity is just a cover-up for the weird voodoo cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BKfYNJAfizwRhUXrMkD6QwQsVP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69853'),
  ('402632606482584105', 'Voodoo Apocalypse', 2018, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Vasni Ramos, Gabriel García', 'José J. Ramallo, Sergio G. Ramos, Vasni Ramos', 'José J. Ramallo, Sergio G. Ramos, Jorge Galván, Carla Boricó, Victor Hubara, Raquel Rial, José Luis de Madariaga, Armando Buika', null, 'After disappearing for five years, detective Charlie Vargas returns to Los Angeles to avenge the death of his former partner. Along with White Chocolate, a young detective with a chip on his shoulder, the two enter a world of Black Magic, Zombies and Mexican Wrestling, in search of the infamous drug trafficker and murderer, Jimmy Vanilla.', 'After disappearing for five years, detective Charlie Vargas returns to Los Angeles to avenge the death of his former partner. Along with White Chocolate, a young detective with a chip on his shoulder, the two enter a world of Black Magic, Zombies and Mexican Wrestling, in search of the infamous drug trafficker and murderer, Jimmy Vanilla.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUUSxJA7iuJK3sXpbRclkfaaniK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519471'),
  ('515597358176813237', 'Voodoo Black Exorcist', 1974, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Manuel Caño, Roberto Ochoa', 'Santiago Moncada', 'Aldo Sambrell, Tanyeka Stadler, Alexander Abrahan, Fernando Sancho, Alfredo Mayo, Eva León, Ricardo Rodríguez, Enrique del Río', null, 'The mummy of long dormant, but powerful Caribbean voodoo priest Gatanebo gets revived on a luxury South Seas ocean liner as a big buff bald guy and proceeds to terrorize the passengers. Gatanebo beheads several folks, occasionally reverts back to his prune-faced mummified state, and falls for the ravishing Sylvia, who reminds him of his old flame Kenya.', 'The mummy of long dormant, but powerful Caribbean voodoo priest Gatanebo gets revived on a luxury South Seas ocean liner as a big buff bald guy and proceeds to terrorize the passengers. Gatanebo beheads several folks, occasionally reverts back to his prune-faced mummified state, and falls for the ravishing Sylvia, who reminds him of his old flame Kenya.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wtONiYoUeschOrkRjWUQnKHdlO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85983'),
  ('76193920266596758', 'Voodoo Island', 1957, 'Horror', 'Reginald Le Borg, William Margulies, Les Baxter', 'Richard H. Landau', 'Boris Karloff, Beverly Tyler, Murvyn Vye, Elisha Cook Jr., Rhodes Reason, Jean Engstrom, Friedrich von Ledebur, Glenn Dixon', 'NR', 'A wealthy industrialist hires the renowned hoax-buster Phillip Knight to prove that an island he plans to develop isn''t voodoo cursed. However, arriving on the island, Knight soon realizes that voodoo does exist when he discovers man-eating plants and a tribe of natives with bizarre powers.', 'A wealthy industrialist hires the renowned hoax-buster Phillip Knight to prove that an island he plans to develop isn''t voodoo cursed. However, arriving on the island, Knight soon realizes that voodoo does exist when he discovers man-eating plants and a tribe of natives with bizarre powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/puv15xvMfJW6I7rQiDNcZ3x8NTz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38260'),
  ('1084854662956039703', 'Voodoo Man', 1944, 'Horror, Mystery', 'William Beaudine', 'Robert Charles', 'Bela Lugosi, George Zucco, Tod Andrews, Wanda McKay, Louise Currie, John Carradine, Pat McKee, Mici Goty', null, 'A mad doctor (Bela Lugosi) and his helpers (John Carradine, George Zucco) lure girls to his lab for brain work, to help his wife.', 'A mad doctor (Bela Lugosi) and his helpers (John Carradine, George Zucco) lure girls to his lab for brain work, to help his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RF1T9PwnDeqawATpGt05l3wQCE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28359'),
  ('784883736797364132', 'Voodoo Woman', 1957, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Edward L. Cahn, Frederick E. West, Bartlett A. Carré', 'Russ Bender, V.I. Voss', 'Marla English, Tom Conway, Mike Connors, Lance Fuller, Mary Ellen Kay, Paul Dubov, Martin Wilkins, Norman Willis', null, 'Deep in the jungles a mad scientist is using the natives'' voodoo for his experiments to create an indestructible being to serve his will. When a party of gold seekers stumbles upon his village, the scientist realizes that Marilyn the expedition''s evil leader is the perfect subject for his work.', 'Deep in the jungles a mad scientist is using the natives'' voodoo for his experiments to create an indestructible being to serve his will. When a party of gold seekers stumbles upon his village, the scientist realizes that Marilyn the expedition''s evil leader is the perfect subject for his work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4c0pehs24WCkhtoMrryBIIe1ZCm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38261'),
  ('609712695202010220', 'Vore Gore', 2021, 'Horror', 'Emanuele Marchetto, Domiziano Cristopharo, Dario Almerighi', null, 'Irene Baruffetti, Lorenzo Fedele, Cher Nevin, Steve Swadda, Gabriele Zanoni', null, 'Made up of nine shorts, Vore Gore (2021) is an anthology that explores the links between sex and violence, consumption and capitalism all under the umbrella theme of voraphilia.', 'Made up of nine shorts, Vore Gore (2021) is an anthology that explores the links between sex and violence, consumption and capitalism all under the umbrella theme of voraphilia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHbT7FxEMWjFN0Mmv7Z6eBa0pui.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:883034'),
