  ('494834070738156186', 'Vortex', 1982, 'Thriller', 'Scott B, Beth B, Steven Fierberg', 'Beth B, Scott B', 'James Russo, Lydia Lunch, William Rice, Ann Magnuson, Brent Collins, Bill Corsair, Tom Webber, Haoui Montaug', 'NR', 'A film noirish atmosphere is created to show detective Lunch (a popular underground musician and poet) plow her way through the plans of a corporate businessman who seeks government defense contracts through real "corporate wars" and the manipulation of politicians.', 'A film noirish atmosphere is created to show detective Lunch (a popular underground musician and poet) plow her way through the plans of a corporate businessman who seeks government defense contracts through real "corporate wars" and the manipulation of politicians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4SE131XiVB66BD4EqdgjJeh3Wj8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56158'),
  ('1132631332648946302', 'Vortex', 2019, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Jacky Gan', 'Li Meng, Jacky Gan', 'Dong Chengpeng, Ou Hao, Li Meng, Cao Bingkun, Sha Baoliang, Cao Weiyu, Zhang Ningjiang, Xia En', null, 'The story revolves around a "surprise" kidnapping case. Liu Xiaojun (Dapeng), the owner of the car dealership, was involved in a kidnapping case for the accident of reselling a black car. He was surrounded by the kidnapped little girl Kiki (Ulanto Yaduo), the dereliant brother Xia Xi (Ou Hao) Several seemingly irrelevant people, such as Xia Tao (Sha Baoliang), dancers (Li Meng ), and second-hand car dealers (Cao Bingyu), have also fallen into the abyss of eternal annihilation.', 'The story revolves around a "surprise" kidnapping case. Liu Xiaojun (Dapeng), the owner of the car dealership, was involved in a kidnapping case for the accident of reselling a black car. He was surrounded by the kidnapped little girl Kiki (Ulanto Yaduo), the dereliant brother Xia Xi (Ou Hao) Several seemingly irrelevant people, such as Xia Tao (Sha Baoliang), dancers (Li Meng ), and second-hand car dealers (Cao Bingyu), have also fallen into the abyss of eternal annihilation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCrcb0v75ryLGsV3sA1zcdtPnr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606225'),
  ('621937987490261710', 'Vortex', 2021, 'Drama', 'Gaspar Noé, Benoît Debie, Nina Doré', 'Gaspar Noé', 'Dario Argento, Françoise Lebrun, Alex Lutz, Kamel Benchemekh, Corinne Bruand, Nathalie Roubaud, Kylian Dheret, Philippe Rouyer', 'NR', 'Lui, a struggling author with a heart condition, and his wife Elle, a retired psychiatrist, find their idyllic life shattered when Elle begins to succumb to the effects of dementia.', 'Lui, a struggling author with a heart condition, and his wife Elle, a retired psychiatrist, find their idyllic life shattered when Elle begins to succumb to the effects of dementia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okyVOselOriFXctq86U8Jol7Rls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:807070'),
  ('1129186193426292773', 'Votez Bougon', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Jean-François Pouliot', 'Louis Morissette, Jean-François Mercier, François Avard', 'Rémy Girard, Louison Danis, Hélène Bourgeois Leclerc, Antoine Bertrand, Claude Laroche, Laurence Barrette, Valérie Gagnon Laniel, Vincent Bilodeau', null, 'Paul Bougon ignites social media networks and public opinion after his brief participation in a television program. Having become an instant celebrity thanks to his outspokenness, he decides to go into politics and founds his own party. With the help of his devoted entourage and at the head of the PEN (Parti de l’Écœurement National) [National Disgust Party], he wins the elections and becomes Premier. The challenges of his new career place him in front of heartbreaking choices.', 'Paul Bougon ignites social media networks and public opinion after his brief participation in a television program. Having become an instant celebrity thanks to his outspokenness, he decides to go into politics and founds his own party. With the help of his devoted entourage and at the head of the PEN (Parti de l’Écœurement National) [National Disgust Party], he wins the elections and becomes Premier. The challenges of his new career place him in front of heartbreaking choices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tYPSmIozyQQMSlFE2HHgEnpsO7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430058'),
