  ('81959648322710271', 'Vovka in the Kingdom of Far Far Away', 1965, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Boris Stepantsev, Mikhail Druyan, Boris Filchikov', 'Vadim Korostylyov', 'Rina Zelyonaya, Klara Rumyanova, Mikhail Yanshin, Elena Ponsova, Emma Treyvas', null, 'A schoolboy gets into a fairy tale with the help of a librarian and DIY book. But life in the magical land is not as easy as it seems.', 'A schoolboy gets into a fairy tale with the help of a librarian and DIY book. But life in the magical land is not as easy as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85j8tvZDQbew6D1qBrRcLj4FmO1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160046'),
  ('1094605311249686054', 'Vowels', 2026, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jagan Rajendran, Santhosh Ravi, Sangeeth, Hemanth Kumar, Dhilip Kumar, Sandeep Aluri, Keerthan Poojaary', 'Jagan Rajendran, Santhosh Ravi, Sangeeth, Hemanth Kumar, Dhilip Kumar', 'Yugi Sethu, Ashik, Sam George, Mahesh Thogata, Chinni Jayanth', null, 'A romantic anthology of five love stories exploring different dimensions: Attraction, Emotion, Intimacy, Obsession, and Unconditional love, each reflecting diverse emotional experiences.', 'A romantic anthology of five love stories exploring different dimensions: Attraction, Emotion, Intimacy, Obsession, and Unconditional love, each reflecting diverse emotional experiences.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FBqHup9TCZtCJfHx5AmYNuOjMCM.jpg', 'plex:movie:vowels-2026'),
  ('119562488425217621', 'Vox Lux', 2018, 'Drama, Music', 'Brady Corbet, Lol Crawley, Ivan J. Fonseca', 'Brady Corbet', 'Natalie Portman, Raffey Cassidy, Jude Law, Stacy Martin, Jennifer Ehle, Christopher Abbott, Logan Riley Bruner, Maria Dizzia', 'R', 'In 1999, teenage sisters Celeste and Eleanor survive a seismic, violent tragedy. The sisters compose and perform a song about their experience, making something lovely and cathartic out of catastrophe — while also catapulting Celeste to stardom. By 2017, the now 31-year-old Celeste is mother to a teenage daughter of her own and struggling to navigate a career fraught with scandals when another act of terrifying violence demands her attention.', 'In 1999, teenage sisters Celeste and Eleanor survive a seismic, violent tragedy. The sisters compose and perform a song about their experience, making something lovely and cathartic out of catastrophe — while also catapulting Celeste to stardom. By 2017, the now 31-year-old Celeste is mother to a teenage daughter of her own and struggling to navigate a career fraught with scandals when another act of terrifying violence demands her attention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmFOjB5bGvFqNzsX5TbIWzdvpGd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429202'),
  ('906941232309872217', 'Voy a pasármelo bien', 2022, 'Music, Romance, Comedy', 'David Serrano, Zaira Zanguitu, Luis M. Cordero', 'Luz Cipriota, David Serrano', 'Raúl Arévalo, Karla Souza, Dani Rovira, Raúl Jiménez, Jorge Usón, Teresa Hurtado de Ory, Izan Fernández, Renata Hermida Richards', null, 'Valladolid, 1989. David and Layla are 13 years old, they love "Hombres G" and they fall madly in love with each other. Together, they get into trouble, sing and dance to the songs of their favorite group. Valladolid, 2022. After 30 years without a verse, David and Layla finally have the chance to reunite. In both eras, our protagonists fight to keep their first love alive.', 'Valladolid, 1989. David and Layla are 13 years old, they love "Hombres G" and they fall madly in love with each other. Together, they get into trouble, sing and dance to the songs of their favorite group. Valladolid, 2022. After 30 years without a verse, David and Layla finally have the chance to reunite. In both eras, our protagonists fight to keep their first love alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcThPhR67aaPEu5s8EGrkcL0w3m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888311'),
  ('242684034781589026', 'Voy a Pasármelo Mejor', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Ana de Alva, Susana González, Joan Bordera', 'David Serrano, Luz Cipriota', 'Izan Fernández, Raúl Arévalo, Renata Hermida Richards, Karla Souza, Rodrigo Gibaja, Rodrigo Díaz, Alba Planas, Michel Herráiz', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ov5cLaFO8toC7HBDl6T0Vg8pQo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1358831'),
  ('944847464140513429', 'Voyage', 1993, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Clive Tickner, John Mackenzie', null, 'Rutger Hauer, Eric Roberts, Connie Nielsen, Karen Allen, Hazel Ellerby, Larry Powell, Peter Baldacchino, Martin J. Corrado', 'R', 'Morgan and Catherine Norvell have their future plans ready. In Monte Carlo, their sailboat is stocked. From there they are going to sail to Malta and live on the boat for a year. They have bought some real estate with an old ruin of a hotel on it, which they are going to rebuild. A few days before they are about to start, they meet Gil and Ronnie Freeland. They would give anything to join them for a couple of days on the sea, and no sooner said than done, all four of them are enjoying the sweet life on the boat. The Norvells soon discover that it was a big mistake to invite them on board...', 'Morgan and Catherine Norvell have their future plans ready. In Monte Carlo, their sailboat is stocked. From there they are going to sail to Malta and live on the boat for a year. They have bought some real estate with an old ruin of a hotel on it, which they are going to rebuild. A few days before they are about to start, they meet Gil and Ronnie Freeland. They would give anything to join them for a couple of days on the sea, and no sooner said than done, all four of them are enjoying the sweet life on the boat. The Norvells soon discover that it was a big mistake to invite them on board...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6wKuVGtl0HnB9OCjFto1IdVzln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180802'),
  ('683612511216112679', 'Voyage autour d’une étoile', 1906, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Gaston Velle', null, null, null, 'An old astronomer has been transfixed by a star for a long time. He had but one thought: to travel to it, to declare his love for it! But how? A simple but ingenious solution-- A giant bubble. Velle remade the film for Italian studio Cines in the same year.', 'An old astronomer has been transfixed by a star for a long time. He had but one thought: to travel to it, to declare his love for it! But how? A simple but ingenious solution-- A giant bubble. Velle remade the film for Italian studio Cines in the same year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhR6JMomscBSch7Y5pXGTLxz2p1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232308'),
  ('1011332800970025603', 'Voyage en Boscavie', 1958, null, 'Jean Herman, Claude Choublier', null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQVAoeYY82sVBM9wVKzHZCggZlN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147971'),
  ('748459257907792899', 'Voyage in Time', 1990, 'Documentary', 'Tonino Guerra, Andrei Tarkovsky, Luciano Tovoli', 'Andrei Tarkovsky, Tonino Guerra', 'Tonino Guerra, Andrei Tarkovsky', null, 'Andrei Tarkovsky and screenwriter Tonino Guerra journey across Italy in preparation for "Nostalghia." Their location scouting unfolds into a wide-ranging conversation about filmmaking, artistic simplicity, and cultural identity, with Tarkovsky articulating his creative philosophy while confronting the emotional weight of working far from his homeland.', 'Andrei Tarkovsky and screenwriter Tonino Guerra journey across Italy in preparation for "Nostalghia." Their location scouting unfolds into a wide-ranging conversation about filmmaking, artistic simplicity, and cultural identity, with Tarkovsky articulating his creative philosophy while confronting the emotional weight of working far from his homeland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8SKuLuaM7CO4wvvU4vm6dQFmjYK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47011'),
  ('272414960429347325', 'Voyage of Terror', 1998, 'Thriller, Drama, TV Movie, Action', 'Gordon Verheul, Brian Trenchard-Smith', 'Mel Frohman', 'Lindsay Wagner, Michael Ironside, Martin Sheen, Horst Buchholz, William B. Davis, Katharine Isabelle, Nathaniel DeVeaux, David James Lewis', null, 'An infectious disease researcher is on a cruise with her daughter when an ebola-type virus attacks the ship''s passengers and crew.', 'An infectious disease researcher is on a cruise with her daughter when an ebola-type virus attacks the ship''s passengers and crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6DRsXI0bQxGWM3rLECltbjLr0FH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291924'),
  ('460918568307639062', 'Voyage of the Damned', 1976, 'Drama, War', 'Stuart Rosenberg, Billy Williams, Michael Stevenson', 'Steve Shagan, David Butler', 'Faye Dunaway, Oskar Werner, Lee Grant, Sam Wanamaker, Lynne Frederick, David de Keyser, Luther Adler, Wendy Hiller', null, 'A luxury liner carries Jewish refugees from Hitler''s Germany in a desperate fight for survival.', 'A luxury liner carries Jewish refugees from Hitler''s Germany in a desperate fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXIAI4nLLHyFzLJz3fTmtd4yErF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75641'),
  ('855245843583670287', 'Voyage of the Rock Aliens', 1984, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'James Fargo, Conrad Irving, Gilbert Taylor', 'Edward Gold, S. James Guidotti, Charles Hairston', 'Pia Zadora, Craig Sheffer, Ruth Gordon, Tom Nolan, Michael Berryman, Alison La Placa, Gregory Bond, Craig Quiter', 'PG', 'Aliens land in the mythical town of "Speelburgh, U.S.A" searching for the source of rock & roll. What they find is a gang of teenagers, led by Dee Dee and Frankie, along with Frankie''s posse/rock band, the Pack. The leader of the aliens takes a shine to Dee Dee and all sorts of trouble breaks out.', 'Aliens land in the mythical town of "Speelburgh, U.S.A" searching for the source of rock & roll. What they find is a gang of teenagers, led by Dee Dee and Frankie, along with Frankie''s posse/rock band, the Pack. The leader of the aliens takes a shine to Dee Dee and all sorts of trouble breaks out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLcacYupUbApAZyCeouGd5pLJB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38265'),
  ('155267555975977563', 'Voyage of the Unicorn', 2001, 'Adventure, Fantasy, TV Movie, Action, Family', 'Philip Spink', 'Dan Levine', 'Beau Bridges, Chantal Conlin, Heather McEwen, Mackenzie Gray, John DeSantis, Adrien Dorval, Kira Clavell, Mark Gibbon', 'NR', 'One day the Aislings find themselves magically transported to a ship called the Unicorn. Here, they discover that they''ve been chosen to fulfill an incredible quest! They undergo an incredible journey of discovery in strange lands with enchanted creatures, but find their voyage is really one of the spirit, as they each learn faith and the power of love.', 'One day the Aislings find themselves magically transported to a ship called the Unicorn. Here, they discover that they''ve been chosen to fulfill an incredible quest! They undergo an incredible journey of discovery in strange lands with enchanted creatures, but find their voyage is really one of the spirit, as they each learn faith and the power of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vhRO0oqfezZXXM57jK9CDEONRVx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21533'),
  ('25049800716585202', 'Voyage of Time: Life''s Journey', 2017, 'Documentary, Drama, History', 'Terrence Malick, Paul Atkins', 'Terrence Malick', 'Cate Blanchett, Jamal Cavil, Maisha Diatta, Yagazie Emezi, Daryl James Harris II, Sebastian Jackson, Keitha Johnson, Abraham Kosgei', null, 'A celebration of the universe, displaying the whole of time, from its start to its final collapse. This film examines all that occurred to prepare the world that stands before us now: science and spirit, birth and death, the grand cosmos and the minute life systems of our planet.', 'A celebration of the universe, displaying the whole of time, from its start to its final collapse. This film examines all that occurred to prepare the world that stands before us now: science and spirit, birth and death, the grand cosmos and the minute life systems of our planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/by2hTbppbkyhQ2ddALHzXlUq8LM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86822'),
  ('958479832785952404', 'Voyage of Time: The IMAX Experience', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Paul Atkins, Terrence Malick, Tom Debenham', 'Terrence Malick', 'Brad Pitt, Jamal Cavil, Maisha Diatta, Yagazie Emezi, Daryl James Harris II, Sebastian Jackson, Abraham Kosgei, Runa Lucienne', 'G', 'A celebration of the universe, displaying the whole of time, from its start to its final collapse. This film examines all that occurred to prepare the world that stands before us now: science and spirit, birth and death, the grand cosmos and the minute life systems of our planet.', 'A celebration of the universe, displaying the whole of time, from its start to its final collapse. This film examines all that occurred to prepare the world that stands before us now: science and spirit, birth and death, the grand cosmos and the minute life systems of our planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ScetO35rdhBIdYPXvhPJdXPUVm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417198'),
  ('999933125637930018', 'Voyage to Agatis', 2010, 'Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Marian Dora, Marian Dora', 'Marian Dora', 'Janna Lisa Dombrowsky, Thomas Goersch, Tatjana Mueller', 'NR', 'A seemingly innocent and pleasant yachting cruise under the sun will entice a young prostitute to a dreamy vacation, however, before the end of the day, she will run for her life, hoping to wake up from a demented nightmare.', 'A seemingly innocent and pleasant yachting cruise under the sun will entice a young prostitute to a dreamy vacation, however, before the end of the day, she will run for her life, hoping to wake up from a demented nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcHzvlN8ep6roNVu81wgeV9Bv6W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212043'),
  ('442859236088348025', 'Voyage to Cythera', 1984, 'Drama', 'Theo Angelopoulos, Giorgos Arvanitis', 'Theo Angelopoulos, Tonino Guerra, Thanasis Valtinos', 'Manos Katrakis, Mairi Hronopoulou, Dionysis Papagiannopoulos, Dora Volanaki, Giulio Brogi, Giorgos Nezos, Athinodoros Prousalis, Mihalis Giannatos', null, 'An old communist returning to Greece after 32 years in the Soviet Union is disillusioned with the state of things.', 'An old communist returning to Greece after 32 years in the Soviet Union is disillusioned with the state of things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAcvV1WnZ7xk5gvvSOt2eyhGdjz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47792'),
  ('328611217981491522', 'Voyage to Nowhere', 1986, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez', 'José Sacristán, Laura del Sol, Juan Diego, María Luisa Ponte, Gabino Diego, Nuria Gallardo, Fernando Fernán Gómez, Queta Claver', null, 'The Iniesta-Galván family is a theatre company that goes from town to town offering its performances. Over the years, its members will have to adapt to changes and make decisions, like that of whether or not to continue performing. One day, unexpectedly, a son that he has fathered on his travels presents himself to Carlos Galván.', 'The Iniesta-Galván family is a theatre company that goes from town to town offering its performances. Over the years, its members will have to adapt to changes and make decisions, like that of whether or not to continue performing. One day, unexpectedly, a son that he has fathered on his travels presents himself to Carlos Galván.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzYqYZHiZYDuPk4akpLhbWBxZHl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156453'),
  ('698721577228822435', 'Voyage to the Beginning of the World', 1997, 'Drama', 'Manoel de Oliveira, Renato Berta, João Milagre', 'Manoel de Oliveira', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Jean-Yves Gautier, Leonor Silveira, Diogo Dória, Isabel de Castro, Cécile Sanz de Alba, José Pinto, Adelaide Teixeira', null, 'Manoel is an aging film director who travels with the film crew through Portugal in search of the origins of Afonso, a famous French actor whose father emigrated from Portugal to France and in process remembers his own youth.', 'Manoel is an aging film director who travels with the film crew through Portugal in search of the origins of Afonso, a famous French actor whose father emigrated from Portugal to France and in process remembers his own youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euRxVGm8A3Y1y2rUafr5vKi027g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108548'),
  ('322078264016904184', 'Voyage to the Bottom of the Sea', 1961, 'Adventure, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Irwin Allen, Winton C. Hoch, Ad Schaumer', 'Irwin Allen, Charles Bennett', 'Walter Pidgeon, Robert Sterling, Barbara Eden, Peter Lorre, Joan Fontaine, Michael Ansara, Frankie Avalon, Regis Toomey', 'PG', 'The crew of an atomic submarine battle to save the world from global destruction.', 'The crew of an atomic submarine battle to save the world from global destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBm2BUvRwGwxr3hfAaOJ8kVuuhw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2160'),
  ('92582093498095263', 'Voyage to the Planet of Prehistoric Women', 1968, 'Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Flemming Olsen, Peter Bogdanovich', 'Henry Ney', 'Mamie Van Doren, Mary Marr, Paige Lee, Margot Hartman, Irene Orton, Pam Helton, Frankie Smith, Judy Cowart', 'NR', 'Astronauts crash-land on Venus and find themselves in trouble when they kill a monster that is worshipped by a group of Venusian women. Re-edited version of Soviet sci-fi Planet of Storms (1962) by Pavel Klushantsev, dubbed into English with additional scenes.', 'Astronauts crash-land on Venus and find themselves in trouble when they kill a monster that is worshipped by a group of Venusian women. Re-edited version of Soviet sci-fi Planet of Storms (1962) by Pavel Klushantsev, dubbed into English with additional scenes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTZHuHghiEpB3WYM93V1FtYyJ4B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36530'),
  ('775625850314549872', 'Voyage to the Prehistoric Planet', 1965, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Curtis Harrington, Vilis Lapenieks', 'Curtis Harrington', 'Basil Rathbone, Faith Domergue, John Bix, Marc Shannon, Christopher Brand, Lewis Keane', null, 'In 2020, after the colonization of the moon, the spaceships Vega, Sirius and Capella are launched from Lunar Station 7. They are to explore Venus under the command of Professor Hartman, but an asteroid collides and explodes Capella. The leader ship Vega stays orbiting and sends the astronauts Kern and Sherman with the robot John to the surface of Venus, but they have problems with communication with Dr. Marsha Evans in Vega. The Sirius lands in Venus and Commander Brendan Lockhart, Andre Ferneau and Hans Walter explore the planet and are attacked by prehistoric animals. They use a vehicle to seek Kern and Sherman while collecting samples from the planet. Meanwhile John helps the two cosmonauts to survive in the hostile land. Re-edited version of Soviet sci-fi Planet of Storms (1962) by Pavel Klushantsev, dubbed into English with additional scenes.', 'In 2020, after the colonization of the moon, the spaceships Vega, Sirius and Capella are launched from Lunar Station 7. They are to explore Venus under the command of Professor Hartman, but an asteroid collides and explodes Capella. The leader ship Vega stays orbiting and sends the astronauts Kern and Sherman with the robot John to the surface of Venus, but they have problems with communication with Dr. Marsha Evans in Vega. The Sirius lands in Venus and Commander Brendan Lockhart, Andre Ferneau and Hans Walter explore the planet and are attacked by prehistoric animals. They use a vehicle to seek Kern and Sherman while collecting samples from the planet. Meanwhile John helps the two cosmonauts to survive in the hostile land. Re-edited version of Soviet sci-fi Planet of Storms (1962) by Pavel Klushantsev, dubbed into English with additional scenes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Zpax52NVEyf8nIcKlaWgGa6kb8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72091'),
  ('57474070738279282', 'Voyage to the Sky', 1937, 'Documentary, Science Fiction', 'Jean Painlevé', null, null, null, 'We begin on planet Earth, with a demonstration of measuring distances using triangulation. Then, an imaginary voyage begins from earth to the moon, on to Mars, Saturn, the closest star (besides the sun), and beyond to the edge of our universe. The film depicts imagined landscapes, and it speculates on universes beyond ours. It ends with philosophical musings about the significance of Earth.', 'We begin on planet Earth, with a demonstration of measuring distances using triangulation. Then, an imaginary voyage begins from earth to the moon, on to Mars, Saturn, the closest star (besides the sun), and beyond to the edge of our universe. The film depicts imagined landscapes, and it speculates on universes beyond ours. It ends with philosophical musings about the significance of Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mGKLzMuyAo3X1gBvcUFaHByLEY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162686'),
  ('329386380751355800', 'Voyager', 1991, 'Romance, Drama', 'Giorgos Arvanitis, Volker Schlöndorff, Pierre Lhomme', 'Rudy Wurlitzer, Volker Schlöndorff', 'Sam Shepard, Julie Delpy, Barbara Sukowa, Traci Lind, Deborra-Lee Furness, Dieter Kirchlechner, August Zirner, Thomas Heinze', null, 'April 1957: Rational engineer Faber''s plane crashes in Mexico, where he learns that he became a father in 1938. He takes a ship from NYC to France and meets cute, young Sabeth. Is it fate?', 'April 1957: Rational engineer Faber''s plane crashes in Mexico, where he learns that he became a father in 1938. He takes a ship from NYC to France and meets cute, young Sabeth. Is it fate?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66owNDcoVmqMpQ0dEbgqtDhP1MC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10171'),
  ('380319987469377565', 'Voyagers', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Oana Ene, Kevin Houlihan, Neil Burger', 'Neil Burger', 'Tye Sheridan, Lily-Rose Depp, Fionn Whitehead, Colin Farrell, Chanté Adams, Viveik Kalra, Archie Madekwe, Quintessa Swindell', 'PG-13', 'With the future of the human race at stake, a group of young men and women -- bred for intelligence and obedience -- embark on an expedition to colonize a distant planet. When they uncover disturbing secrets about the mission, they defy their training and begin to explore their most primitive natures. As life on the ship descends into chaos, they soon become consumed by fear, lust and an insatiable hunger for power.', 'With the future of the human race at stake, a group of young men and women -- bred for intelligence and obedience -- embark on an expedition to colonize a distant planet. When they uncover disturbing secrets about the mission, they defy their training and begin to explore their most primitive natures. As life on the ship descends into chaos, they soon become consumed by fear, lust and an insatiable hunger for power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gn2vCmWO7jQBBto9SYuBHYZARaU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597890'),
  ('1028837519664243056', 'Voyages', 1999, 'Drama', 'Emmanuel Finkiel', 'Emmanuel Finkiel', 'Shulamit Adar, Liliane Rovère, Esther Gorintin, Natan Cogan, Mosko Alkalai, Vladimir Friedman', null, 'In the first of the three linked episodes of French writer-director Emmanuel Finkiel’s delicate, poignant Voyages, a bus tour of Poland, by present-day French survivors of the Holocaust, suffers a mishap: en route to Auschwitz from a Jewish cemetery, the bus breaks down. In the second episode, one of them confronts the possibility that her father, long presumed to be among the Six Million, in fact survived; but is he her father?', 'In the first of the three linked episodes of French writer-director Emmanuel Finkiel’s delicate, poignant Voyages, a bus tour of Poland, by present-day French survivors of the Holocaust, suffers a mishap: en route to Auschwitz from a Jewish cemetery, the bus breaks down. In the second episode, one of them confronts the possibility that her father, long presumed to be among the Six Million, in fact survived; but is he her father?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeCWn9FK7EvOLRjsNirLK7LcydZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125552'),
  ('437571032404458980', 'Voyages en Italie', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Sophie Letourneur, Jonathan Ricquebourg', 'Jean-Christophe Hym', 'Philippe Katerine, Sophie Letourneur, Guillemette Coutellier, Mahault Mollaret, Philippe Letourneur, François Labarthe, Jonathan Ricquebourg, Charlotte Comte', null, 'A French couple burnt out by the routine of their daily family life decides after much hesitation to travel to Sicily for a short holiday.', 'A French couple burnt out by the routine of their daily family life decides after much hesitation to travel to Sicily for a short holiday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdwFlQ3C5UkDCqa5woNg4qqsNZI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000559'),
  ('830483258644949688', 'Voyeur', 2017, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Myles Kane, Josh Koury, Cristobal Moris', null, 'Gay Talese, Gerald Foos', 'R', 'Legendary journalist Gay Talese unmasks a motel owner who spied on his guests for decades. But his bombshell story soon becomes a scandal of its own.', 'Legendary journalist Gay Talese unmasks a motel owner who spied on his guests for decades. But his bombshell story soon becomes a scandal of its own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agHt57rWI2MvteLhuCXAJtWcKYL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473415'),
  ('872845778946169323', 'Vuelve', 2012, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Iván Noel, Iván Noel, Pablo Dana', 'Iván Noel', 'Renzo Sabelli, Guillermo Tassara, Romina Pinto, Ana Juárez, Rodrigo López, Dardo Leal, Leticia Vota, Juan Carrasco', null, 'A visual incursion into the troubled psyche of a young boy whose unstable and manipulative mother committed suicide in front of him.', 'A visual incursion into the troubled psyche of a young boy whose unstable and manipulative mother committed suicide in front of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uran7G4ThpNK9qopfN5qsG50L0p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153333'),
  ('136782824536168066', 'Vuelve el ojo de vidrio', 1970, null, 'René Cardona Jr., Fernando Durán Rojas, Fernando Durán Rojas', 'Alfredo Varela', 'Antonio Aguilar, Flor Silvestre, Manuel Capetillo, Eleazar García, Alejandro Reyna, Guillermo Rivas, Yuyú, Alfredo Varela', null, 'Upon hearing the news of Madero''s death, Porfirio Alcalá and his four cousins interrupt their peaceful lives as farmers to again join the Mexican Revolution.', 'Upon hearing the news of Madero''s death, Porfirio Alcalá and his four cousins interrupt their peaceful lives as farmers to again join the Mexican Revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8MYgGKZwMvGRcv9kfZhspgImci.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137307'),
  ('158097940694699080', 'Vuelven los García', 1947, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ismael Rodríguez, Ross Fisher, Jorge Cardeña', 'Carlos González Dueñas, Pedro de Urdimalas, Carlos Orellana', 'Pedro Infante, Abel Salazar, Víctor Manuel Mendoza, Sara García, Marga López, Carlos Orellana, Clifford Carr, Fernando Soto', null, 'Ruled by a tough grandma, the Garcías are three charro cousins who fall in love with young American-born Lupita and fight for her love until grandma quiets them.', 'Ruled by a tough grandma, the Garcías are three charro cousins who fall in love with young American-born Lupita and fight for her love until grandma quiets them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UYtgKqkB7sOdOqyYSn2RmcoxiR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101271'),
  ('364262552164040808', 'Vulgar', 2002, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller, Crime', 'Bryan Johnson, David Klein', 'Bryan Johnson', 'Brian O''Halloran, Bryan Johnson, Jerry Lewkowitz, Ethan Suplee, Matthew Maher, Debra Karr, Kevin Smith, Scott Mosier', 'R', 'Vulgar is about a man who is a children''s clown but has not been getting much luck lately. He lives in a cheap apartment which he can''t even afford. Bums are constantly sleeping in his run down car and crashing on his lawn. He has a nagging mother who lives in a nursing home, and his best friend is a moocher. One day he comes up with the idea to become a bachelor clown.', 'Vulgar is about a man who is a children''s clown but has not been getting much luck lately. He lives in a cheap apartment which he can''t even afford. Bums are constantly sleeping in his run down car and crashing on his lawn. He has a nagging mother who lives in a nursing home, and his best friend is a moocher. One day he comes up with the idea to become a bachelor clown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLdezroGbHDP0w0jOLwxXjgrgma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19085'),
  ('832875812395903864', 'Vulgaria', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Edmond Pang, Jason Kwan, Yip Shiu-Kei', 'Lam Chiu-Wing, Luk Yee-Sum, Edmond Pang', 'Chapman To Man-Chat, Dada Chan Ching, Ronald Cheng Chung-Kei, Kristal Tin Yui-Nei, Fiona Sit Hoi-Kei, Susan Shaw Yam-Yam, Matt Chow Hoi-Kwong, Hiro Hayama', 'NR', 'Struggling movie producer To Wai-chen needs money for child support, so he reluctantly agrees to film a softcore remake of a Chinese classic.', 'Struggling movie producer To Wai-chen needs money for child support, so he reluctantly agrees to film a softcore remake of a Chinese classic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/asExdrfMK1LcLn3kA0jBVHGGJ6K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123797'),
  ('291074289591502796', 'Vultures', 2025, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Peter Dourountzis, Victor Seguin, Juliette Denis', 'Peter Dourountzis, Fabianny Deschamps, Christophe Cousin', 'Sami Bouajila, Mallory Wanecque, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Valérie Donzelli, Stefan Crepon, Andréa Bescond, Gilles Cohen, Samuel Jouy', null, 'Samuel, a journalist, and Ava, his intern and daughter, cover the murder of a young girl for their magazine. Through their investigation, they discover disturbing similarities with the murder of another woman.', 'Samuel, a journalist, and Ava, his intern and daughter, cover the murder of a young girl for their magazine. Through their investigation, they discover disturbing similarities with the murder of another woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXkKQ6OZFsistB2cn8KDOaCuTfY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1002158'),
