  ('584354801658268829', 'Waiting for Happiness', 2002, 'Drama', 'Abderrahmane Sissako, Philippe Tourret, Jacques Besse', 'Abderrahmane Sissako', 'Khatra Ould Abder Kader, Maata Ould Mohamed Abeid, Mohamed Mahmoud Ould, Nana Diakité, Fatimetou Mint Ahmeda, Makanfing Dabo, Santha Leng, Baba Ould Mini', null, 'Before immigrating to the West, Abdallah travels to the coastal city of Nouadhibou, Mauritania, to visit his mother. Although he grew up there, Abdallah feels anything but at home in his old neighborhood: he can no longer speak the local dialect and he wears western clothes that immediately cast him as an outsider. But, as Abdallah spends time with a young boy and an elderly electrician, he can''t help but feel a sense of loss for the life he''s abandoning.', 'Before immigrating to the West, Abdallah travels to the coastal city of Nouadhibou, Mauritania, to visit his mother. Although he grew up there, Abdallah feels anything but at home in his old neighborhood: he can no longer speak the local dialect and he wears western clothes that immediately cast him as an outsider. But, as Abdallah spends time with a young boy and an elderly electrician, he can''t help but feel a sense of loss for the life he''s abandoning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmGW0vR7yaiyo9dAaxD26PuY33n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47226'),
  ('366224229912715174', 'Waiting For Spring', 2018, 'Romance', 'Yuichiro Hirakawa, Takashi Komatsu, Hiroto Takahashi', 'Satoko Okazaki', 'Tao Tsuchiya, Takumi Kitamura, Yuta Koseki, Hayato Isomura, Yosuke Sugino, Yu Inaba, Rika Izumi, Yuki Saso', null, 'Mitsuki is shy and rather isolated at school. Towa is on the basketball team and Mitsuki''s class-mate. Due to circumstances, Mitsuki soon begins to socialize with four jocks of the basketball team, which affects her self-esteem, her social status, her loneliness and her life. She finds a new lease in her school life.', 'Mitsuki is shy and rather isolated at school. Towa is on the basketball team and Mitsuki''s class-mate. Due to circumstances, Mitsuki soon begins to socialize with four jocks of the basketball team, which affects her self-esteem, her social status, her loneliness and her life. She finds a new lease in her school life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fK2wWX0EF8molaJIjuhKyv4SD6f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539076'),
  ('1023841097086457703', 'Waiting for the Barbarians', 2019, 'Drama, History', 'Ciro Guerra, Chris Menges, Domenico Sica', 'Ciro Guerra', 'Mark Rylance, Johnny Depp, Robert Pattinson, Gana Bayarsaikhan, Greta Scacchi, David Dencik, Sam Reid, Harry Melling', 'R', 'At an isolated frontier outpost, a colonial magistrate suffers a crisis of conscience when an army colonel arrives looking to interrogate the locals about an impending uprising, using cruel tactics that horrify the magistrate.', 'At an isolated frontier outpost, a colonial magistrate suffers a crisis of conscience when an army colonel arrives looking to interrogate the locals about an impending uprising, using cruel tactics that horrify the magistrate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k50gYFDfpAyxcIGjWjnXAaOM81e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505707'),
