  ('859475042413942169', 'Waiting for the Clouds', 2003, 'Drama', 'Yeşim Ustaoğlu, Jacek Petrycki', 'Petros Markaris', 'Rüçhan Çalışkur, Ridvan Yagci, Ismail Baysan, Dimitris Kamberidis, Feride Karaman, Suna Selen, Oktar Durukan, Jannis Georgiadis', null, 'A member of a Greek family in Turkey is forced to immigrate from Trabzon to Mersin in her youth. However, events cause her to face her own past.', 'A member of a Greek family in Turkey is forced to immigrate from Trabzon to Mersin in her youth. However, events cause her to face her own past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3zRfLeQnBXYYhx88s3mTMKaBie.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61848'),
