  ('1018132707202357105', 'Wake Island', 1942, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Theodor Sparkuhl, William C. Mellor, John Farrow', 'Frank Butler, W.R. Burnett', 'Brian Donlevy, Macdonald Carey, Robert Preston, William Bendix, Albert Dekker, Walter Abel, Mikhail Rasumny, Rod Cameron', 'NR', 'In late 1941, with no hope of relief or re-supply, a small band of United States Marines tries to keep the Japanese Navy from capturing their island base.', 'In late 1941, with no hope of relief or re-supply, a small band of United States Marines tries to keep the Japanese Navy from capturing their island base.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ytAmQG8E03niY1lqSCHd0w1ghI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43786'),
