  ('54957040799513163', 'Wake of the Red Witch', 1948, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Edward Ludwig, Reggie Lanning', 'Kenneth Gamet, Harry Brown', 'John Wayne, Gail Russell, Gig Young, Adele Mara, Luther Adler, Eduard Franz, Grant Withers, Henry Daniell', 'NR', 'Captain Ralls fights Dutch shipping magnate Mayrant Sidneye for the woman he loves, Angelique Desaix, and for a fortune in gold aboard the Red Witch.', 'Captain Ralls fights Dutch shipping magnate Mayrant Sidneye for the woman he loves, Angelique Desaix, and for a fortune in gold aboard the Red Witch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ln7zx4wFEtnA3AhoZRR1Z1tgPxw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40718'),
  ('660347167840071618', 'Wake Up', 2020, 'Drama', 'Olivia Wilde, Zachary Citarella, David Webb', 'Garrett Combs, Chase Hilton', 'Margaret Qualley, Alwyn Robinson, Judy Bruno Bennett, John Pirkis, Celia Rocha, Sam Stillman', null, 'A woman is forced to rediscover her humanity in an increasingly digital world.', 'A woman is forced to rediscover her humanity in an increasingly digital world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5ZJciqFih3saTrBEa9b5RUNDia.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:666175'),
  ('580787009889484219', 'Wake Up', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller, Action', 'François Simard, Anouk Whissell, Yoann-Karl Whissell', 'Alberto Marini', 'Turlough Convery, Benny O. Arthur, Jacqueline Moré, Thomas Gould, Alessia Yoko Fontana, Kyle Scudder, Charlotte Stoiber, Aidan O''Hare', null, 'A group of young activists set out to make an environmental statement by vandalizing a home superstore as it closes. But their plan goes terribly wrong when they become trapped inside and must face a deranged security guard with a gruesome passion for primitive hunting. As the night fills with violence and terror, the teenagers find themselves in a desperate fight for their lives.', 'A group of young activists set out to make an environmental statement by vandalizing a home superstore as it closes. But their plan goes terribly wrong when they become trapped inside and must face a deranged security guard with a gruesome passion for primitive hunting. As the night fills with violence and terror, the teenagers find themselves in a desperate fight for their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/erEAU7ygq2XFjziI3FpAdMajJFZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1165466'),
  ('485218210532404686', 'Wake Up and Die', 1966, 'Crime, Drama', 'Carlo Lizzani, Armando Nannuzzi', 'Ugo Pirro', 'Robert Hoffmann, Lisa Gastoni, Gian Maria Volonté, Claudio Camaso, Renato Niccolai, Ottavio Fanfani, Pupo De Luca, Corrado Olmi', null, 'A petty hoodlum pulls jewellery store heists in broad daylight. The cop on his tail knows he has accomplices and focuses on the gangster''s girl friend is his attempt to catch him.', 'A petty hoodlum pulls jewellery store heists in broad daylight. The cop on his tail knows he has accomplices and focuses on the gangster''s girl friend is his attempt to catch him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cE3z898CSiww20E9JDMZMUfD2Qw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107929'),
  ('246160723659754227', 'Wake Up and Die', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Miguel Urrutia', 'Miguel Urrutia', 'Andrea Montenegro, Luis Fernando Bohórquez', null, 'A woman wakes up next to a mysterious man she''s never seen before. Wondering what happened, she is seduced by the man and brutally killed later on in a moment of passion. As she awakes over and over again and to the same fate, she must dig into her fading memories to learn about the killer''s true identity in order to save her own life.', 'A woman wakes up next to a mysterious man she''s never seen before. Wondering what happened, she is seduced by the man and brutally killed later on in a moment of passion. As she awakes over and over again and to the same fate, she must dig into her fading memories to learn about the killer''s true identity in order to save her own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNTYIYZElxQQPavVK9NhUWFZ9e8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200047'),
  ('761128989068617832', 'Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery', 2025, 'Thriller, Mystery, Comedy', 'Rian Johnson, Steve Yedlin, Jaron Presant', 'Rian Johnson', 'Daniel Craig, Josh O''Connor, Glenn Close, Josh Brolin, Mila Kunis, Jeremy Renner, Kerry Washington, Andrew Scott', 'PG-13', 'When young priest Jud Duplenticy is sent to assist charismatic firebrand Monsignor Jefferson Wicks, it’s clear that all is not well in the pews. After a sudden and seemingly impossible murder rocks the town, the lack of an obvious suspect prompts local police chief Geraldine Scott to join forces with renowned detective Benoit Blanc to unravel a mystery that defies all logic.', 'When young priest Jud Duplenticy is sent to assist charismatic firebrand Monsignor Jefferson Wicks, it’s clear that all is not well in the pews. After a sudden and seemingly impossible murder rocks the town, the lack of an obvious suspect prompts local police chief Geraldine Scott to join forces with renowned detective Benoit Blanc to unravel a mystery that defies all logic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCOGGi8JBVEZMc3DVby8rUivyXz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:812583'),
  ('834007076748745373', 'Wake Up Love', 1996, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Eliseo Subiela, Aldo Romero, Carola Jalife', 'Eliseo Subiela', 'Juan Leyrado, Darío Grandinetti, Soledad Silveyra, Laura Azcurra, Luciano Leyrado, Marilyn Solaya, Gustavo Garzón, Emilia Mazer', null, 'Ernesto is a journalist in his 40''s who comes from a generation which encountered much political persecution and exile; between the memories and unhealed wounds of his past, stands Ernesto. When his good friend Ricardo calls him one day and proposes to get together after 25 years, they decide to gather all the members of the “old gang” in order to revive those old feelings the best way they know how, through some good old rock n'' roll. Amongst one of Ernesto''s encounters is Ana, an old love who will bring a twisting unexpected turn into his life. The old gang is comprised of Ricardo''s depressive, hypochondriac wife Ana and her socially-conscious former lover Ernesto, a journalist who left Ana years ago to pursue his political ideologies in socialist Cuba.', 'Ernesto is a journalist in his 40''s who comes from a generation which encountered much political persecution and exile; between the memories and unhealed wounds of his past, stands Ernesto. When his good friend Ricardo calls him one day and proposes to get together after 25 years, they decide to gather all the members of the “old gang” in order to revive those old feelings the best way they know how, through some good old rock n'' roll. Amongst one of Ernesto''s encounters is Ana, an old love who will bring a twisting unexpected turn into his life. The old gang is comprised of Ricardo''s depressive, hypochondriac wife Ana and her socially-conscious former lover Ernesto, a journalist who left Ana years ago to pursue his political ideologies in socialist Cuba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ebFg7BwWNWt7YS7n9XbRJW7FBe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167022'),
  ('679148600026522853', 'Wake Up Sid', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ayan Mukerji, Manjari Makijany, Anil Mehta', 'Ayan Mukerji', 'Ranbir Kapoor, Konkona Sen Sharma, Rahul Khanna, Anupam Kher, Supriya Pathak, Namit Das, Shikha Talsania, Kashmera Shah', null, 'Wake Up Sid! is the story of a lazy Mumbai college student who does absolutely nothing, with a turn of events will Sid realize his potential in this world and become a success in the fast-paced life of Mumbai.', 'Wake Up Sid! is the story of a lazy Mumbai college student who does absolutely nothing, with a turn of events will Sid realize his potential in this world and become a success in the fast-paced life of Mumbai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UpgW67W6Do0xizTuE26bMQFLdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21297'),
  ('317277435610490046', 'Wake up Vassili', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Giannis Dalianidis, Michalis Papanikolaou', 'Giannis Dalianidis', 'Giorgos Konstantinou, Elena Nathanail, Alekos Alexandrakis, Giorgos Mihalakopoulos, Eleni Zafeiriou, Tasso Kavadia, Giorgos Tsitsopoulos, Dimitris Koukis', null, 'Vasilis is a poor conservative man who works in a company and tends to buy the lottery very often - but with no luck. His life will turn upside down when his younger sister turns out to be an anarchist and gets involved with a leftist rebellious man he already knows and hates. Eventually, in an ironic twist of faith, the two of them will earn millions and gain the exact lifestyle they used to fight against and Vasilis will lose his mind.', 'Vasilis is a poor conservative man who works in a company and tends to buy the lottery very often - but with no luck. His life will turn upside down when his younger sister turns out to be an anarchist and gets involved with a leftist rebellious man he already knows and hates. Eventually, in an ironic twist of faith, the two of them will earn millions and gain the exact lifestyle they used to fight against and Vasilis will lose his mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vD5vsWgRCPuhf6X7mKDGkc7Y64t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288881'),
  ('572561456648282486', 'Wake Up, Girls! - Seven Idols', 2014, 'Animation, Music, Comedy, Drama', 'Yutaka Yamamoto, Haruhide Ishiguro, Keisuke Gotou', 'Touko Machida', 'Airi Eino, Kaya Okuno, Mayu Yoshioka, Minami Tanaka, Miyu Takagi, Nanami Yamashita, Yoshino Aoyama, Shintaro Asanuma', null, 'Green Leaves Entertainment is a tiny production company on the verge of going out of business in Sendai, Japan. The agency once managed the careers of magicians, photo idols, fortune-tellers, and other entertainers, but its last remaining client finally quit. Faced with having absolutely no one to represent, agency president Tange thinks up a plan to produce an idol group, forming the seven-girl group known as the "Wake Up, Girls".', 'Green Leaves Entertainment is a tiny production company on the verge of going out of business in Sendai, Japan. The agency once managed the careers of magicians, photo idols, fortune-tellers, and other entertainers, but its last remaining client finally quit. Faced with having absolutely no one to represent, agency president Tange thinks up a plan to produce an idol group, forming the seven-girl group known as the "Wake Up, Girls".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4y39alsdWQlKeBkwSODc51xulY8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249766'),
  ('177929926504095808', 'Wake Up, Ron Burgundy: The Lost Movie', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Adam McKay, Thomas E. Ackerman', 'Will Ferrell, Adam McKay', 'Will Ferrell, Christina Applegate, Paul Rudd, Steve Carell, David Koechner, Kevin Corrigan, Fred Willard, Chris Parnell', 'NR', 'While Ron Burgundy''s rivalry with Veronica Corningstone escalates quickly, a group of unprofessional thieves better known as ''The Alarm Clock'' try to make the truth known, whatever that may mean...', 'While Ron Burgundy''s rivalry with Veronica Corningstone escalates quickly, a group of unprofessional thieves better known as ''The Alarm Clock'' try to make the truth known, whatever that may mean...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6M4YGhWZWRYQgwkPhfwgvrq52xk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9965'),
  ('763082204019828899', 'Wake Wood', 2011, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'David Keating, Chris Maris, Nick McCarthy', 'David Keating, Brendan McCarthy', 'Aidan Gillen, Eva Birthistle, Timothy Spall, Ella Connolly, Amelia Crowley, Brian Gleeson, Ruth McCabe, Dan Gordon', 'R', 'The parents of a girl who was killed by a savage dog are granted the opportunity to spend three days with their deceased daughter.', 'The parents of a girl who was killed by a savage dog are granted the opportunity to spend three days with their deceased daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MyqqrjE8MmjPoHEs93apxhSsBe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59726'),
  ('306549337130617111', 'Wakefield', 2017, 'Drama', 'Robin Swicord, Andrei Schwartz', 'Robin Swicord', 'Bryan Cranston, Jennifer Garner, Jason O''Mara, Beverly D''Angelo, Ian Anthony Dale, Pippa Bennett-Warner, Ellery Sprayberry, Victoria Bruno', 'R', 'A man''s nervous breakdown causes him to leave his wife and live in his attic for several months.', 'A man''s nervous breakdown causes him to leave his wife and live in his attic for several months.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SOw7s1g429ZnbJyKxGIXalSywR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369894'),
  ('950403733652939548', 'Waking Life', 2001, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Richard Linklater, Tommy Pallotta, Richard Linklater', 'Richard Linklater', 'Ethan Hawke, Julie Delpy, Wiley Wiggins, Bill Wise, Alex E. Jones, Steven Soderbergh, Ken Webster, Charles Gunning', 'R', 'Waking Life is about a young man in a persistent lucid dream-like state. The film follows its protagonist as he initially observes and later participates in philosophical discussions that weave together issues like reality, free will, our relationships with others, and the meaning of life.', 'Waking Life is about a young man in a persistent lucid dream-like state. The film follows its protagonist as he initially observes and later participates in philosophical discussions that weave together issues like reality, free will, our relationships with others, and the meaning of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MRM4PL6H7yraAkwyUEe2EqoQH3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9081'),
  ('234526548643401061', 'Waking Ned', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Kirk Jones, Henry Braham, MJ Bassett', 'Kirk Jones', 'Ian Bannen, David Kelly, Fionnula Flanagan, Susan Lynch, Brendan Dempsey, James Nesbitt, Paul Vaughan, Maura O''Malley', 'PG', 'When a lottery winner dies of shock, his fellow townsfolk attempt to claim the money.', 'When a lottery winner dies of shock, his fellow townsfolk attempt to claim the money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsxiOOKC40HlhdIJYCUE2BkpJv0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10162'),
  ('247528054111771608', 'Waking Sleeping Beauty', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Don Hahn', 'Patrick Pacheco', 'Don Hahn, Roy Edward Disney, Michael Eisner, Jeffrey Katzenberg, Peter Schneider, Rob Minkoff, Glen Keane, Ron Clements', 'PG', 'By the mid-1980s, the fabled animation studios of Walt Disney had fallen on hard times. The artists were polarized between newcomers hungry to innovate and old timers not yet ready to relinquish control. These conditions produced a series of box-office flops and pessimistic forecasts: maybe the best days of animation were over. Maybe the public didn''t care. Only a miracle or a magic spell could produce a happy ending. Waking Sleeping Beauty is no fairy tale. It''s the true story of how Disney regained its magic with a staggering output of hits - "Little Mermaid," "Beauty and the Beast ," "Aladdin," "The Lion King," and more - over a 10-year period.', 'By the mid-1980s, the fabled animation studios of Walt Disney had fallen on hard times. The artists were polarized between newcomers hungry to innovate and old timers not yet ready to relinquish control. These conditions produced a series of box-office flops and pessimistic forecasts: maybe the best days of animation were over. Maybe the public didn''t care. Only a miracle or a magic spell could produce a happy ending. Waking Sleeping Beauty is no fairy tale. It''s the true story of how Disney regained its magic with a staggering output of hits - "Little Mermaid," "Beauty and the Beast ," "Aladdin," "The Lion King," and more - over a 10-year period.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hywGLq5tMOuKwXfOhYUzoqNNAnU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47813'),
  ('478916691286243415', 'Waking the Dead', 2000, 'Mystery, Drama, Romance', 'Keith Gordon, Tom Richmond', 'Robert Dillon', 'Billy Crudup, Jennifer Connelly, Paul Hipp, Hal Holbrook, Ivonne Coll, Lawrence Dane, Ed Harris, Janet McTeer', 'R', 'A congressional candidate questions his sanity after seeing the love of his life, presumed dead, suddenly emerge.', 'A congressional candidate questions his sanity after seeing the love of his life, presumed dead, suddenly emerge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wC4MSw7MYYDIhkcgw1lZui0kzur.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37722'),
  ('1124494426226589130', 'Waking Up in Reno', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jordan Brady, William A. Fraker', 'Brent Briscoe, Mark Fauser', 'Natasha Richardson, Charlize Theron, Billy Bob Thornton, Patrick Swayze, David Koechner, Penélope Cruz, Holmes Osborne, Chelcie Ross', 'R', 'Candy and Lonnie Earl are just crazy about each other. The problem: she''s married to Roy and he''s married to Darlene. So far it''s been a secret affair. But that''s about to change, because this foursome is driving cross-country and headed for some big surprises.', 'Candy and Lonnie Earl are just crazy about each other. The problem: she''s married to Roy and he''s married to Darlene. So far it''s been a secret affair. But that''s about to change, because this foursome is driving cross-country and headed for some big surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXLmDc7KoaXqglHsqgJ2Zh2YFRx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21118'),
  ('881583400925918306', 'Wal-Mart: The High Cost of Low Price', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Kristy Tully, Robert Greenwald, John Blair', null, 'Lee Scott, Don Hunter, Jon Hunter, Jeremy Hunter, Matt Hunter, Johnny Faenza, Frank Mormino, John Bruening', null, 'This documentary takes the viewer on a deeply personal journey into the everyday lives of families struggling to fight Goliath. From a family business owner in the Midwest to a preacher in California, from workers in Florida to a poet in Mexico, dozens of film crews on three continents bring the intensely personal stories of an assault on families and American values.', 'This documentary takes the viewer on a deeply personal journey into the everyday lives of families struggling to fight Goliath. From a family business owner in the Midwest to a preacher in California, from workers in Florida to a poet in Mexico, dozens of film crews on three continents bring the intensely personal stories of an assault on families and American values.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PYx4HEbczd9QUCex5Wspkhjef5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29595'),
  ('476786450379184036', 'Walden', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Mick Davis, Viorel Sergovici', 'Mick Davis', 'Emile Hirsch, Shane West, Kelli Garner, Tania Raymonde, David Keith, Steve Coulter, Seth Michaels, Sunny Mabrey', null, 'Walden Dean is a stenographer, whose mind witnessed all types of injustices in the courtroom. After discovering he has a terminal illness, repressed anger deep within him surfaces -- taking justice into his own hands in the most gruesome ways imaginable.', 'Walden Dean is a stenographer, whose mind witnessed all types of injustices in the courtroom. After discovering he has a terminal illness, repressed anger deep within him surfaces -- taking justice into his own hands in the most gruesome ways imaginable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWjEwRi63GOy54wUorErkNU05X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1193341'),
  ('589550035218180257', 'Wałesa: Man of Hope', 2013, 'Drama, History', 'Andrzej Wajda, Paweł Edelman', 'Janusz Głowacki', 'Robert Więckiewicz, Agnieszka Grochowska, Maria Rosaria Omaggio, Katarzyna Ankudowicz, Barbara Babilińska, Mirosław Baka, Waldemar Barwiński, Iwona Bielska', null, 'How was it possible that a single man influenced contemporary world so significantly? This film is an attempt to capture the phenomenon of a common man’s metamorphosis into a charismatic leader — an attempt to see how a Gdansk shipyard electrician fighting for workers’ rights awakened a hidden desire for freedom in millions of people.', 'How was it possible that a single man influenced contemporary world so significantly? This film is an attempt to capture the phenomenon of a common man’s metamorphosis into a charismatic leader — an attempt to see how a Gdansk shipyard electrician fighting for workers’ rights awakened a hidden desire for freedom in millions of people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcMdwmlWbtTKEjIGEu3IuSZ7x61.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209385'),
  ('96502086704687627', 'Walk a Crooked Mile', 1948, 'Crime, Drama', 'Gordon Douglas, George Robinson, Ridgeway Callow', 'George Bruce', 'Louis Hayward, Dennis O''Keefe, Louise Allbritton, Carl Esmond, Onslow Stevens, Raymond Burr, Art Baker, Lowell Gilmore', 'NR', 'A security leak is found at a Southern California atomic plant. The authorities stand in fear that the information leaked would go to a hostile nation. To investigate the case more efficiently, Dan O''Hara, an FBI agent, and Philip Grayson, a Scotland Yard sleuth, join forces. Will they manage to stop the spy ring from achieving their aim?', 'A security leak is found at a Southern California atomic plant. The authorities stand in fear that the information leaked would go to a hostile nation. To investigate the case more efficiently, Dan O''Hara, an FBI agent, and Philip Grayson, a Scotland Yard sleuth, join forces. Will they manage to stop the spy ring from achieving their aim?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZ9DYpscD0bTOo9hm02LrsDcQ7f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26385'),
  ('588887643356780516', 'Walk All Over Me', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Comedy', 'Norayr Kasper, Robert Cuffley', 'Robert Cuffley, Jason Long', 'Leelee Sobieski, Tricia Helfer, Lothaire Bluteau, Michael Eklund, Jacob Tierney, Michael Adamthwaite, Ross McMillan, Sarah Constible', null, 'Alberta, a mousy young woman with the survival skills of a snail, loses cash that isn''t hers, so she runs from her small town to Seattle where her old babysitter, Celene, lives - a dominatrix with a classy apartment and a life plan. She lets Alberta stay. Alberta gets a job as a checker at a supermarket and becomes fascinated with Celene''s work.', 'Alberta, a mousy young woman with the survival skills of a snail, loses cash that isn''t hers, so she runs from her small town to Seattle where her old babysitter, Celene, lives - a dominatrix with a classy apartment and a life plan. She lets Alberta stay. Alberta gets a job as a checker at a supermarket and becomes fascinated with Celene''s work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uaidDfupjHRmAKsEFPTjPxJtAq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13412'),
  ('475273494162363596', 'Walk Cheerfully', 1930, 'Romance, Crime, Drama', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Hideo Shigehara, Jirō Ogawa', 'Lex Neal', 'Minoru Takada, Hiroko Kawasaki, Satoko Date, Takeshi Sakamoto, Nobuko Matsuzono, Teruo Môri, Hisao Yoshitani, Kanji Kawara', null, 'Kenji is a small-time thief who likes drinking and fighting. When he falls in love with sweet and simple Yazue, and she finds out what kind of guy he really is, she leaves him "until he becomes an honest person." Kenji soon finds it''s not easy to get rid of one''s past.', 'Kenji is a small-time thief who likes drinking and fighting. When he falls in love with sweet and simple Yazue, and she finds out what kind of guy he really is, she leaves him "until he becomes an honest person." Kenji soon finds it''s not easy to get rid of one''s past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WfPju3Z1WUWoG0tpqSDvo8cyn4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162954'),
  ('381121072406330895', 'Walk Don''t Run', 1966, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Charles Walters, Jim Myers, Harry Stradling Sr.', 'Sol Saks', 'Cary Grant, Samantha Eggar, Jim Hutton, John Standing, Miiko Taka, Ted Hartley, Ben Astar, George Takei', 'NR', 'During the housing shortage of the 1964 Summer Olympic Games, two men and a woman share a small apartment in Tokyo, and the older man soon starts playing Cupid to the younger pair.', 'During the housing shortage of the 1964 Summer Olympic Games, two men and a woman share a small apartment in Tokyo, and the older man soon starts playing Cupid to the younger pair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdgTjp6blLr4AR48a6fT2q3dN2e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38720'),
  ('828925746116219680', 'Walk East on Beacon', 1952, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Alfred L. Werker, Joseph C. Brun, Shirlee Weingarten', 'Leo Rosten', 'George Murphy, Finlay Currie, Virginia Gilmore, Karl Stepanek, Louisa Horton, Peter Capell, Bruno Wick, Vilma Kurer', 'NR', 'An FBI agent works with a refugee scientist and the Coast Guard to crack a Soviet spy ring in Boston.', 'An FBI agent works with a refugee scientist and the Coast Guard to crack a Soviet spy ring in Boston.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLcqWrBWDHeETduRqz13H3FbFJp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87381'),
  ('45147285858724982', 'Walk Hard: The Dewey Cox Story', 2007, 'Comedy, Music', 'Steven Samanen, Ruby Stillwater, Kristina M. Peterson', 'Judd Apatow, Jake Kasdan', 'John C. Reilly, Jenna Fischer, Raymond J. Barry, Kristen Wiig, Tim Meadows, Harold Ramis, Margo Martindale, Chris Parnell', 'R', 'Following a childhood tragedy, Dewey Cox follows a long and winding road to music stardom. Dewey perseveres through changing musical styles, an addiction to nearly every drug known and bouts of uncontrollable rage.', 'Following a childhood tragedy, Dewey Cox follows a long and winding road to music stardom. Dewey perseveres through changing musical styles, an addiction to nearly every drug known and bouts of uncontrollable rage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aa1IQ4Cuin3d7qIahvPheMmR4E5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6575'),
  ('549755922109599543', 'Walk Like a Man', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Melvin Frank, Victor J. Kemper, Roger Joseph Pugliese', 'Robert Klane', 'Howie Mandel, Christopher Lloyd, Cloris Leachman, Colleen Camp, Amy Steel, Stephen Elliott, George DiCenzo, John McLiam', 'PG', 'Bobo, a feral man raised by wolves, is reunited with his family by a researcher. However, this disappoints his brother, Reggie, who has no intentions of sharing the family inheritance with him.', 'Bobo, a feral man raised by wolves, is reunited with his family by a researcher. However, this disappoints his brother, Reggie, who has no intentions of sharing the family inheritance with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CiceN03UnHLx1QzkTWGMjsNbU4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40752'),
  ('1104191057511983991', 'Walk of Shame', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Steven Brill, Jonathan Brown, Darrin Prescott', 'Steven Brill', 'Elizabeth Banks, James Marsden, Gillian Jacobs, Sarah Wright, Ethan Suplee, Bill Burr, Ken Davitian, Lawrence Gilliard Jr.', 'R', 'A reporter''s dream of becoming a news anchor is compromised after a one-night stand leaves her stranded in downtown L.A. without a phone, car, ID or money - and only 8 hours to make it to the most important job interview of her life.', 'A reporter''s dream of becoming a news anchor is compromised after a one-night stand leaves her stranded in downtown L.A. without a phone, car, ID or money - and only 8 hours to make it to the most important job interview of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zMS66gtw8ccvy1BWD6thJ67jgX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187596'),
  ('1109371150889402357', 'Walk on the Wild Side', 1962, 'Drama', 'Edward Dmytryk, Joseph MacDonald, Blake Edwards', 'Ben Hecht, Raphael Hayes', 'Laurence Harvey, Capucine, Barbara Stanwyck, Jane Fonda, Anne Baxter, Joanna Moore, Richard Rust, Karl Swenson', 'NR', 'At a 1930s New Orleans bordello, Hallie is the main attraction for both clients and the shrewd madam. The arrival of Dove Linkhorn, her lovesick sweetheart from three years ago, disrupts the normal and triggers a chain of events involving a number of people, including the young woman he travelled with, who is now the Doll House''s newest employee.', 'At a 1930s New Orleans bordello, Hallie is the main attraction for both clients and the shrewd madam. The arrival of Dove Linkhorn, her lovesick sweetheart from three years ago, disrupts the normal and triggers a chain of events involving a number of people, including the young woman he travelled with, who is now the Doll House''s newest employee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1fPzQlKpk06an9Akme1LJX2MjU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60792'),
  ('316942310460588855', 'Walk on Water', 2004, 'Drama', 'Eytan Fox, Tobias Hochstein', null, 'Lior Ashkenazi, Knut Berger, Caroline Peters, Gideon Shemer, Carola Regnier, Hanns Zischler, Ernest Lenart', null, 'Eyal, an Israeli Mossad agent, is given the mission to track down and kill the very old Alfred Himmelman, an ex-Nazi officer, who might still be alive. Pretending to be a tourist guide, he befriends his grandson Axel, in Israel to visit his sister Pia. The two men set out on a tour of the country, during which Axel challenges Eyal''s values.', 'Eyal, an Israeli Mossad agent, is given the mission to track down and kill the very old Alfred Himmelman, an ex-Nazi officer, who might still be alive. Pretending to be a tourist guide, he befriends his grandson Axel, in Israel to visit his sister Pia. The two men set out on a tour of the country, during which Axel challenges Eyal''s values.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVWFN3RaBFLuJRtRLPebatX9qPq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26'),
  ('370728528553619943', 'Walk Softly, Stranger', 1950, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'Robert Stevenson, Harry J. Wild', 'Frank Fenton', 'Joseph Cotten, Alida Valli, Spring Byington, Paul Stewart, Jack Paar, Jeff Donnell, John McIntire, Howard Petrie', 'NR', 'Fugitive Chris Hale starts over in a small Midwestern town in Ohio, where he befriends Elaine Corelli, a kind-hearted heiress left disabled after a skiing accident. As love blossoms, Hale vows to change his ways, but escaping his past may mean one last job.', 'Fugitive Chris Hale starts over in a small Midwestern town in Ohio, where he befriends Elaine Corelli, a kind-hearted heiress left disabled after a skiing accident. As love blossoms, Hale vows to change his ways, but escaping his past may mean one last job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWA8WTamFe1JYvlmIav0TRDI7Sw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88075'),
  ('531155255327193853', 'Walk the Line', 2005, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'James Mangold, Phedon Papamichael, John R. Saunders', 'Gill Dennis, James Mangold', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Reese Witherspoon, Ginnifer Goodwin, Robert Patrick, Dallas Roberts, Dan John Miller, Larry Bagby, Shelby Lynne', 'PG-13', 'A chronicle of country music legend Johnny Cash''s life, from his early days on an Arkansas cotton farm to his rise to fame with Sun Records in Memphis, where he recorded alongside Elvis Presley, Jerry Lee Lewis and Carl Perkins.', 'A chronicle of country music legend Johnny Cash''s life, from his early days on an Arkansas cotton farm to his rise to fame with Sun Records in Memphis, where he recorded alongside Elvis Presley, Jerry Lee Lewis and Carl Perkins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8lPTjvjOjTfvC1E9pmMwcF9vkn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69'),
  ('18118692386715878', 'Walk the Line', 2024, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Guo Shubo, Lai Yiu-Fai, 黄健', 'Xu Su, Xiangyun Xu, Chuanlin Wang', 'Xiao Yang, Yu Ailei, Adam Fan, Li Chengru, Geng Le, Yang Haoyu, Jiao Gang, Shi Zhaoqi', null, 'In Kui Zhou, an anti-gang operation uncovers corruption as various forces target the Public Security Bureau. Amid the chaos, an unlikely duo stumbles upon a key criminal, triggering a high-stakes investigation into a web of crime and conspiracy.', 'In Kui Zhou, an anti-gang operation uncovers corruption as various forces target the Public Security Bureau. Amid the chaos, an unlikely duo stumbles upon a key criminal, triggering a high-stakes investigation into a web of crime and conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueXENDy9LyeyNShOnbSwo9qzokm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022149'),
  ('465158650563441730', 'Walk the Proud Land', 1956, 'Western', 'Phil Bowles, Jesse Hibbs, Harold Lipstein', 'Jack Sher, Gil Doud', 'Audie Murphy, Anne Bancroft, Pat Crowley, Charles Drake, Tommy Rall, Robert Warwick, Jay Silverheels, Eugene Mazzola', 'NR', 'Indian Agent sent to try new approach to peace with Apache based on respect for autonomy rather than submission to Army. Wins over reservation chiefs and the Indian widow given to him as housekeeper. Through use of diplomacy and demonstrations of faith in Apache leaders, reservation is put on the road to autonomy. Conflicts arise between Apache widow and Eastern wife but latter has a lot to learn.', 'Indian Agent sent to try new approach to peace with Apache based on respect for autonomy rather than submission to Army. Wins over reservation chiefs and the Indian widow given to him as housekeeper. Through use of diplomacy and demonstrations of faith in Apache leaders, reservation is put on the road to autonomy. Conflicts arise between Apache widow and Eastern wife but latter has a lot to learn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7JtlEV1AywMXA3iqPH9kuOUiJL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225958'),
  ('788504409324558087', 'Walk Up', 2022, 'Drama', 'Hong Sang-soo, Hong Sang-soo', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Kwon Hae-hyo, Lee Hye-young, Song Sun-mi, Cho Yun-hee, Park Mi-so, Shin Seok-ho', 'NR', 'A series of interactions take place between an established film director, his estranged daughter interested in interior design, an interior designer, and others inside a multi-story commercial and residential building.', 'A series of interactions take place between an established film director, his estranged daughter interested in interior design, an interior designer, and others inside a multi-story commercial and residential building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1B9kkZyasISUWMkDMNfKTuO7Iso.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1002470'),
  ('174472402526540957', 'Walk. Ride. Rodeo.', 2019, 'Drama', 'Conor Allyn, Thomas L. Callaway', 'Sean Dwyer, Greg Cope White', 'Spencer Locke, Missi Pyle, Alyvia Alyn Lind, Bailey Chase, Kathleen Rose Perkins, Sherri Shepherd, Barbara Alyn Woods, Max Ehrich', null, 'Tells the incredible true story of Amberley Snyder, a nationally ranked rodeo barrel racer who defies the odds after barely surviving a car accident that leaves her paralyzed from the waist down.', 'Tells the incredible true story of Amberley Snyder, a nationally ranked rodeo barrel racer who defies the odds after barely surviving a car accident that leaves her paralyzed from the waist down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUQyvpTtirjQRYi4gVRsVrDvf6T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581420'),
  ('305660055021859328', 'Walkabout', 1971, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Nicolas Roeg, Kevin Kavanagh, Nicolas Roeg', 'Edward Bond', 'Jenny Agutter, Luc Roeg, David Gulpilil, John Meillon, Robert McDarra, Peter Carver, John Illingsworth, Hilary Bamberger', 'PG', 'Under the pretense of having a picnic, a geologist takes his teenage daughter and 6-year-old son into the Australian outback and attempts to shoot them. When he fails, he turns the gun on himself, and the two city-bred children must contend with harsh wilderness alone. They are saved by a chance encounter with an Aboriginal boy who shows them how to survive, and in the process underscores the disharmony between nature and modern life.', 'Under the pretense of having a picnic, a geologist takes his teenage daughter and 6-year-old son into the Australian outback and attempts to shoot them. When he fails, he turns the gun on himself, and the two city-bred children must contend with harsh wilderness alone. They are saved by a chance encounter with an Aboriginal boy who shows them how to survive, and in the process underscores the disharmony between nature and modern life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24vooYt5StgtgcQObVr1GHuM5gy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36040'),
  ('896261149228282387', 'Walkaway Joe', 2020, 'Drama, Action', 'Steven Bernstein, Tom Wright', 'Michael Milillo', 'David Strathairn, Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Julie Ann Emery, Julian Feder, David Jensen, Susan Gallagher, Kim Baptiste, Chip Carriere', 'PG-13', 'A young boy named Dallas goes on a search for his pool-hustling father after he abandons their family. Dallas is determined to bring his father home when he meets Joe Haley, a drifter wrestling with a past he''d rather forget, who feels responsible for Dallas'' safety and reluctantly takes him in.', 'A young boy named Dallas goes on a search for his pool-hustling father after he abandons their family. Dallas is determined to bring his father home when he meets Joe Haley, a drifter wrestling with a past he''d rather forget, who feels responsible for Dallas'' safety and reluctantly takes him in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRbh3zYElDge6UTdobkozAD1gzN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553593'),
  ('749014244615978273', 'Walker', 1987, 'Drama, History, Western', 'Alex Cox, David Bridges, Mary Ellen Woods', 'Rudy Wurlitzer', 'Ed Harris, Richard Masur, René Auberjonois, Keith Szarabajka, Sy Richardson, Xander Berkeley, John Diehl, Peter Boyle', 'R', 'William Walker and his mercenary corps enter Nicaragua in the middle of the 19th century in order to install a new government by a coup d''etat.', 'William Walker and his mercenary corps enter Nicaragua in the middle of the 19th century in order to install a new government by a coup d''etat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1C0oYAeNjIBLuj7CVWz3HTIUdeP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28448'),
  ('1037067561993163537', 'Walker', 2012, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Tsai Ming-liang, Tsai Ming-liang, Peng Fei', 'Tsai Ming-liang', 'Lee Kang-sheng', null, 'In 2012, the Hong Kong International Film Festival invited Tsai Ming-Ling to make the opening short film. Having grown up with Hong Kong''s popular culture, Tsai Ming-Liang decided to pay homage by making a "Walker" film, contrasting the Walker''s slowness with the frenzied pace of Hong Kong''s cosmopolitan life. The film ends with a song by Hong Kong actor and singer Samuel Hui, who was Tsai Ming-Liang''s idol during his youth. The film was invited to be the closing short film for the Cannes Film Festival in 2012.', 'In 2012, the Hong Kong International Film Festival invited Tsai Ming-Ling to make the opening short film. Having grown up with Hong Kong''s popular culture, Tsai Ming-Liang decided to pay homage by making a "Walker" film, contrasting the Walker''s slowness with the frenzied pace of Hong Kong''s cosmopolitan life. The film ends with a song by Hong Kong actor and singer Samuel Hui, who was Tsai Ming-Liang''s idol during his youth. The film was invited to be the closing short film for the Cannes Film Festival in 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mAnyPmrHM9I9FSL9fX1lFtUEQKh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142724'),
  ('960358440714522613', 'Walker, Texas Ranger: Trial by Fire', 2005, 'Action, Thriller, TV Movie, Crime', 'Fernando Argüelles, Aaron Norris', 'Bruce Cervi, Albert S. Ruddy, Leslie Greif', 'Chuck Norris, Sheree J. Wilson, Clarence Gilyard Jr., Judson Mills, Andre Kristoff, Bret Loehr, Steven Williams, Bruce Locke', null, 'Walker investigates a murder connected with a missing government weapon. In addition, he tries to track down a teen on the run from a crime syndicate.', 'Walker investigates a murder connected with a missing government weapon. In addition, he tries to track down a teen on the run from a crime syndicate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebaCtQ4Bz7FYazWYjBb9k1BEOxJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6958'),
