  ('928001080531271964', 'Walking Vengeance', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Agustín Díaz Yanes, Paco Femenía', 'Agustín Díaz Yanes', 'Diego Luna, Victoria Abril, Ariadna Gil, Pilar López de Ayala, Elena Anaya, José María Yázpik, Dagoberto Gama, Everardo Arzate', 'NR', 'A woman and her three partners-in-crime plan a revenge heist against her violent narco husband in order to get rid of him and steal his money.', 'A woman and her three partners-in-crime plan a revenge heist against her violent narco husband in order to get rid of him and steal his money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5XgSslUhaEhs8LPefLUlja3tob.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32695'),
  ('16497766739958334', 'Walking with Dinosaurs', 2013, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Neil Nightingale, Barry Cook, John Brooks', 'John Collee, Richard Dale', 'Karl Urban, Charlie Rowe, Angourie Rice, Justin Long, John Leguizamo, Tiya Sircar, Skyler Stone, Clay Savage', 'PG', 'In a time when dinosaurs rule the Earth, the smallest dinosaur of the herd, a playful Pachyrhinosaurus named Patchi, embarks on the biggest adventure of his life. As he tries to find his place in a spectacular world filled with fun-loving friends and a few dangerous foes, Patchi will discover the courage he needs to become the leader of the herd and a hero for the ages.', 'In a time when dinosaurs rule the Earth, the smallest dinosaur of the herd, a playful Pachyrhinosaurus named Patchi, embarks on the biggest adventure of his life. As he tries to find his place in a spectacular world filled with fun-loving friends and a few dangerous foes, Patchi will discover the courage he needs to become the leader of the herd and a hero for the ages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkElT9HpOUIjIL20Hwy3LZqgXWc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77951'),
  ('672062789914323521', 'Walking with Monsters', 2005, 'Documentary, Animation', 'Chloë Leland, Tim Haines, Peter Thorn', 'Michael Olmert', 'Kenneth Branagh', 'G', 'Many people think of the dinosaurs as the first inhabitants of the earth, but this prequel to the acclaimed "Walking with Dinosaurs" puts viewers in the midst of a host of strange creatures that inhabited the earth millions of years before the dinosaurs ever existed.Starting from the Cambrian Period (530 MYA) and ending at the Early Triassic Period (248 MYA), Walking With Monsters shows the life and death struggles of the fantastic creatures that existed before the dinosaurs.', 'Many people think of the dinosaurs as the first inhabitants of the earth, but this prequel to the acclaimed "Walking with Dinosaurs" puts viewers in the midst of a host of strange creatures that inhabited the earth millions of years before the dinosaurs ever existed.Starting from the Cambrian Period (530 MYA) and ending at the Early Triassic Period (248 MYA), Walking With Monsters shows the life and death struggles of the fantastic creatures that existed before the dinosaurs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZoIWwA8Am0E4gjpcRRdoZVRLdJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28500'),
  ('98138622458124302', 'Walking with the Enemy', 2014, 'Action, Drama, History, War', 'Mark Schmidt, Dean Cundey, Gavin Struthers', 'Kenny Golde', 'Jonas Armstrong, Hannah Tointon, Ben Kingsley, Simon Dutton, Burn Gorman, Shane Taylor, Charles Hubbell, Simon Hepworth', null, 'Regent Horthy is the leader of Hungary and a German ally, but his favorable standing with Hitler changes as the war comes to an end. Forced to cede Hungary’s power or else witness the execution of his son, Regent Horthy gives up control of his country to the Nazis, who quickly move Hungarians to ghettos and death camps, with no hope in sight. But the despair changes when a young man named Elek emerges. Separated from his family during the relocations and aided by the woman he loves , Elek defies the enemy by becoming one of them. In a race against time, disguised as a Nazi Officer he embarks on a mission to save his family and thousands of his countrymen.', 'Regent Horthy is the leader of Hungary and a German ally, but his favorable standing with Hitler changes as the war comes to an end. Forced to cede Hungary’s power or else witness the execution of his son, Regent Horthy gives up control of his country to the Nazis, who quickly move Hungarians to ghettos and death camps, with no hope in sight. But the despair changes when a young man named Elek emerges. Separated from his family during the relocations and aided by the woman he loves , Elek defies the enemy by becoming one of them. In a race against time, disguised as a Nazi Officer he embarks on a mission to save his family and thousands of his countrymen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csYgiUFoZ82OO9CfeqJd8g7e56K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256476'),
  ('391132517095271512', 'Walkover', 1965, 'Drama', 'Jerzy Skolimowski, Henryk Kluba, Daniel Szylit', 'Jerzy Skolimowski', 'Aleksandra Zawieruszanka, Jerzy Skolimowski, Krzysztof Chamiec, Elżbieta Czyżewska, Andrzej Herder, Joanna Jedlewska, Janusz Kłosiński, Tadeusz Kondrat', null, 'An extraordinarily stylized tale of a prizefighter who ducks a fight to romance a beautiful blonde.', 'An extraordinarily stylized tale of a prizefighter who ducks a fight to romance a beautiful blonde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pY7jCuLFPKwMvvaLddjfnYnsqML.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163863'),
  ('155302202910493845', 'Walky Talky Hawky', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Young Henery Hawk''s father regretfully admits their family''s shame: they hunt and eat chickens. Henery set off to find one, and comes across Foghorn Leghorn, where the loudmouth rooster is engaged in his favorite pastime, playing tricks on grumpy Barnyard Dog.', 'Young Henery Hawk''s father regretfully admits their family''s shame: they hunt and eat chickens. Henery set off to find one, and comes across Foghorn Leghorn, where the loudmouth rooster is engaged in his favorite pastime, playing tricks on grumpy Barnyard Dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQNUp6XekpcC7p7VC90BYnMfPp9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100388'),
  ('325998571334290699', 'Wall Engravings', 1968, 'Drama, Romance', 'Guy Gilles, Willy Kurant, Jean-Marc Ripert', 'Guy Gilles', 'Macha Méril, Patrick Jouané, Bernard Verley, Frédéric Ditis, Lili Bontemps, Élina Labourdette, Orane Demazis, Paula Valmond', null, 'Jeanne looks back on her love for Jean. The melancholic young man wouldn''t accept the world as it was, always wishing to depart. She doesn''t know that he''s dead.', 'Jeanne looks back on her love for Jean. The melancholic young man wouldn''t accept the world as it was, always wishing to depart. She doesn''t know that he''s dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgOg2SI8Cb8XSBfb64mIhyqsXOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298621'),
  ('81847437759641587', 'Wall Street', 1987, 'Crime, Drama', 'Oliver Stone, Robert Richardson, Newton Thomas Sigel', 'Oliver Stone, Stanley Weiser', 'Michael Douglas, Charlie Sheen, Martin Sheen, Daryl Hannah, John C. McGinley, Hal Holbrook, Sean Young, Terence Stamp', 'R', 'A young and impatient stockbroker is willing to do anything to get to the top, including trading on illegal inside information taken through a ruthless and greedy corporate raider, whom takes the youth under his wing.', 'A young and impatient stockbroker is willing to do anything to get to the top, including trading on illegal inside information taken through a ruthless and greedy corporate raider, whom takes the youth under his wing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tQYq9ntzn2dEwDIGLBSipYPenv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10673'),
  ('519049961719522722', 'Wall Street: Money Never Sleeps', 2010, 'Drama, Crime', 'Oliver Stone, Rodrigo Prieto', 'Allan Loeb, Stephen Schiff, Stanley Weiser', 'Michael Douglas, Shia LaBeouf, Josh Brolin, Carey Mulligan, Frank Langella, Susan Sarandon, Eli Wallach, Vanessa Ferlito', 'PG-13', 'As the global economy teeters on the brink of disaster, a young Wall Street trader partners with disgraced former Wall Street corporate raider Gordon Gekko on a two tiered mission: To alert the financial community to the coming doom, and to find out who was responsible for the death of the young trader''s mentor.', 'As the global economy teeters on the brink of disaster, a young Wall Street trader partners with disgraced former Wall Street corporate raider Gordon Gekko on a two tiered mission: To alert the financial community to the coming doom, and to find out who was responsible for the death of the young trader''s mentor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtonVdZZMWES6GyhasAX0xhUdrF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33909'),
  ('286670960136039057', 'Wall to Wall', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Kim Tae-joon, Jung Gwi-ho, Jun Young-seok', 'Kim Tae-joon', 'Kang Ha-neul, Yeom Hye-ran, Seo Hyun-woo, Kim Hyun-jeong, Jeon Jin-oh, Park Seong-il, Yoon Jeong-il, Lee Jong-gu', 'R', 'A man who poured his life savings into a new apartment discovers its walls are full of disturbing noises, hostile neighbors and unsettling secrets.', 'A man who poured his life savings into a new apartment discovers its walls are full of disturbing noises, hostile neighbors and unsettling secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hlNv3Kd9xovvSgrslWhMriGpZ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1269208'),
  ('79122290151994142', 'Wallace & Gromit: The Curse of the Were-Rabbit', 2005, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Steve Box, Nick Park, Marnie Paxton', 'Nick Park, Bob Baker, Steve Box', 'Peter Sallis, Ralph Fiennes, Helena Bonham Carter, Peter Kay, Nicholas Smith, Liz Smith, John Thomson, Mark Gatiss', 'G', 'Cheese-loving eccentric Wallace and his cunning canine pal Gromit run a business ridding the town of garden pests. Using only humane methods, which turns their home into a halfway house for evicted vermin, the pair stumble upon a mystery involving a voracious vegetarian monster that threatens to ruin the annual veggie-growing contest.', 'Cheese-loving eccentric Wallace and his cunning canine pal Gromit run a business ridding the town of garden pests. Using only humane methods, which turns their home into a halfway house for evicted vermin, the pair stumble upon a mystery involving a voracious vegetarian monster that threatens to ruin the annual veggie-growing contest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cMQ2lNd7sBe6PCf6zF5QxrKzbRG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:533'),
  ('141603293756928284', 'Wallace & Gromit: Vengeance Most Fowl', 2024, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation', 'Nick Park, Merlin Crossingham, Lucy Rands', 'Mark Burton', 'Ben Whitehead, Peter Kay, Lauren Patel, Reece Shearsmith, Diane Morgan, Adjoa Andoh, Muzz Khan, Lenny Henry', 'PG', 'Gromit’s concern that Wallace is becoming too dependent on his inventions proves justified, when Wallace invents a “smart” gnome that seems to develop a mind of its own. When it emerges that a vengeful figure from the past might be masterminding things, it falls to Gromit to battle sinister forces and save his master… or Wallace may never be able to invent again!', 'Gromit’s concern that Wallace is becoming too dependent on his inventions proves justified, when Wallace invents a “smart” gnome that seems to develop a mind of its own. When it emerges that a vengeful figure from the past might be masterminding things, it falls to Gromit to battle sinister forces and save his master… or Wallace may never be able to invent again!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUWFSBxTOiCinPdTOh3IDUXVemZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:929204'),
  ('171709900033276728', 'Wallander: Before the Frost', 2005, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Kjell-Åke Andersson, Olof Johnson, Anna Zackrisson', 'Per Berglund, Stefan Ahnhem', 'Krister Henriksson, Johanna Sällström, Ola Rapace, Ellen Jelinek, Niklas Falk, Angela Kovács, Fredrik Gunnarsson, Mats Bergman', null, 'A fanatical sect is suspected to be behind some horrific violent crimes in Ystad. Henning Mankell''s sharp-eyed commissioner receives assistance from her daughter Linda, a newly-graduated police officer, and criminal inspector Stefan Lindman. The first of 32 films with Krister Henriksson as the popular commissioner Kurt Wallander.', 'A fanatical sect is suspected to be behind some horrific violent crimes in Ystad. Henning Mankell''s sharp-eyed commissioner receives assistance from her daughter Linda, a newly-graduated police officer, and criminal inspector Stefan Lindman. The first of 32 films with Krister Henriksson as the popular commissioner Kurt Wallander.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nE5RQ3C5kqH4gXXKvC7nftB8jWo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221868'),
  ('349349704246944363', 'Wallander: Mastermind', 2005, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Peter Flinth, Eric Kress, Mikael Hansson', 'Stefan Ahnhem', 'Krister Henriksson, Johanna Sällström, Ola Rapace, Douglas Johansson, Angela Kovács, Mats Bergman, Fredrik Gunnarsson, Michael Nyqvist', null, 'Kurt Wallander and the other police officers try to find the connection between a horrible murder that took place in Ystad and the kidnapping of one of the police force''s daughters. It also seems someone has infiltrated the police and controls every move the police make.', 'Kurt Wallander and the other police officers try to find the connection between a horrible murder that took place in Ystad and the kidnapping of one of the police force''s daughters. It also seems someone has infiltrated the police and controls every move the police make.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xuAAh7Ey2GvalPeQ57Ol278h0VV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227246'),
  ('1097641401293858176', 'Wallay', 2017, 'Drama', 'Berni Goldblat', 'David Bouchet', 'Makan Nathan Diarra, Ibrahim Koma, Hamadoun Kassogué, Joséphine Kaboré, Mounira Kankolé', null, 'Ady, a 13 years old boy, no longer listens to his father who raises him alone. The latter, running out of resources, decides to entrust Ady to his uncle Amadou for the summer. Uncle Amadou and his family live on the other side of the Mediterranean sea... in Burkina Faso! There, at 13 years, one must become a man but Ady, persuaded to go on holidays, understands things differently.', 'Ady, a 13 years old boy, no longer listens to his father who raises him alone. The latter, running out of resources, decides to entrust Ady to his uncle Amadou for the summer. Uncle Amadou and his family live on the other side of the Mediterranean sea... in Burkina Faso! There, at 13 years, one must become a man but Ady, persuaded to go on holidays, understands things differently.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbA4NmqiIEP1FaPO6wYMgtG471F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442718'),
  ('558315266427565373', 'WALL·E', 2008, 'Animation, Family, Science Fiction', 'Andrew Stanton, Jeremy Lasky, Danielle Feinberg', 'Andrew Stanton, Jim Reardon', 'Ben Burtt, Elissa Knight, Jeff Garlin, Fred Willard, John Ratzenberger, Kathy Najimy, Sigourney Weaver, Lori Alan', 'G', 'After hundreds of years doing what he was built for, WALL•E— a robot designed to clean up the earth—discovers a new purpose in life when he meets a sleek search robot named EVE. EVE comes to realize that WALL•E has inadvertently stumbled upon the key to the planet''s future, and races back to space to report to the humans. Meanwhile, WALL•E chases EVE across the galaxy and sets into motion one of the most imaginative adventures ever brought to the big screen.', 'After hundreds of years doing what he was built for, WALL•E— a robot designed to clean up the earth—discovers a new purpose in life when he meets a sleek search robot named EVE. EVE comes to realize that WALL•E has inadvertently stumbled upon the key to the planet''s future, and races back to space to report to the humans. Meanwhile, WALL•E chases EVE across the galaxy and sets into motion one of the most imaginative adventures ever brought to the big screen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbhFnRzzg6ZDmm8YAmxBnQpQIPh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10681'),
  ('881228627505071777', 'Walled In', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Gilles Paquet-Brenner, Karim Hussain, Mark Dobrescu', 'Rodolphe Tissot, Gilles Paquet-Brenner, Olivier Volpi', 'Mischa Barton, Cameron Bright, Deborah Kara Unger, Noam Jenkins, Eugene Clark, Pascal Greggory, Mark D. Claxton, Sophi Knight', 'R', 'Having finally secured her first assignment from her family''s demolition business, Sam Walczak is sent to supervise the destruction of an apartment house, only to discover a group of tenants still living in the condemned building. One such tenant, Jimmy, tells Sam an urban legend about a serial murderer who used to live in the building and entomb his victims in the walls. What''s worse, the dead are believed to still harass the residents to this day.', 'Having finally secured her first assignment from her family''s demolition business, Sam Walczak is sent to supervise the destruction of an apartment house, only to discover a group of tenants still living in the condemned building. One such tenant, Jimmy, tells Sam an urban legend about a serial murderer who used to live in the building and entomb his victims in the walls. What''s worse, the dead are believed to still harass the residents to this day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWDZAGHjsIk2Aezakk783cBIas5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16335'),
  ('852423687428478195', 'Walls', 1988, 'Animation', 'Grzegorz Świetlikowski, Małgorzata Pilichowska, Piotr Dumała', 'Piotr Dumała', null, null, 'An animated short film from 1987 that deals with the incarceration of a man in a dark cell from where there is no escape.', 'An animated short film from 1987 that deals with the incarceration of a man in a dark cell from where there is no escape.', null, 'tmdb:movie:246971'),
  ('1103985274559948302', 'Walnut Bread', 1977, 'Romance', 'Arūnas Žebriūnas, Algimantas Mockus', 'Saulius Šaltenis', 'Leonid Obolensky, Saulius Sipaitis, Doloresa Kazragytė, Algirdas Latėnas, Stasys Jonynas, Antanas Šurna, Regina Arbačiauskaitė, Elvyra Piškinaitė', null, 'Lithuania, 1977. Memories of childhood, adolescence, and first love in a small provincial town, shown through complexity of human relations at this periodical film.', 'Lithuania, 1977. Memories of childhood, adolescence, and first love in a small provincial town, shown through complexity of human relations at this periodical film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cu9MFiDVLaWzChnsPg7l1JgmoSU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171174'),
  ('267410662455043179', 'Walt Before Mickey', 2015, 'Drama', 'Khoa Le, Ian Dudley, Frank Licari', 'Arthur L. Bernstein, Armando Gutierrez', 'Thomas Ian Nicholas, Jon Heder, David Henrie, Jodie Sweetin, Arthur L. Bernstein, Ayla Kell, Hunter Gomez, Taylor Gray', 'PG', 'Based on the book "Walt Before Mickey" covers the early years of Walt Disney''s career. The legendary Walt Disney had a tumultuous childhood, yet he was determined to overcome obstacles in his path, before the creation of his first iconic character: Mickey Mouse.', 'Based on the book "Walt Before Mickey" covers the early years of Walt Disney''s career. The legendary Walt Disney had a tumultuous childhood, yet he was determined to overcome obstacles in his path, before the creation of his first iconic character: Mickey Mouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1JYnewI5WTDAUAAlZdgnAzDdPs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278247'),
  ('1062628048143456399', 'Waltair Veerayya', 2023, 'Action, Drama', 'Bobby Kolli, Arthur Wilson, V Kranthi Chakravarthi', 'Bobby Kolli, Kona Venkat, K. Chakravarthy Reddy', 'Chiranjeevi, Shruti Haasan, Ravi Teja, Catherine Tresa, Bobby Simha, Prakash Raj, Rajendra Prasad, Vennela Kishore', null, 'A notorious smuggler Waltair Veerayya is hired by a CI Seethapathi, reaches Malaysia with the ostensible mission of kidnapping a drug mafia leader named Solomon, who escaped India after wreaking havoc on the RAW agents and local policemen. Veerayya manages to pummel Solomon, who is fiercely protected by his ruthless gang-lord brother Kaala. Tables are turned, when Veerayya reveals that he shares a turbulent past with Kaala & an ACP Vikram Sagar who is hell-bent on ending his smuggling activities.', 'A notorious smuggler Waltair Veerayya is hired by a CI Seethapathi, reaches Malaysia with the ostensible mission of kidnapping a drug mafia leader named Solomon, who escaped India after wreaking havoc on the RAW agents and local policemen. Veerayya manages to pummel Solomon, who is fiercely protected by his ruthless gang-lord brother Kaala. Tables are turned, when Veerayya reveals that he shares a turbulent past with Kaala & an ACP Vikram Sagar who is hell-bent on ending his smuggling activities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4mx225pbBH5i0KSjc3t1pO5hIy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:989017'),
  ('553957262573530491', 'Walter', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Anna Mastro, Steven Capitano Calitri', 'Paul Shoulberg', 'Andrew J. West, Justin Kirk, Virginia Madsen, William H. Macy, Milo Ventimiglia, Neve Campbell, Leven Rambin, Peter Facinelli', null, 'A ticket-taker at the local cinema believes he is the son of God. He has agreed to decide the eternal fate of everyone he comes in to contact with.', 'A ticket-taker at the local cinema believes he is the son of God. He has agreed to decide the eternal fate of everyone he comes in to contact with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwwL3zfVNpVsLrRr35U4QQVXmeG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323967'),
  ('732151524148169286', 'Walter', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Varante Soudjian', 'Thomas Nlend', 'Alban Ivanov, Issaka Sawadogo, Judith El Zein, David Salles, Alexandre Antonio, Karim Jebli, Nordine Salhi, Samuel Dijan', null, 'For Goran and his team of amateur shooters, the plan was almost perfect: to enter a hypermarket at night to rob a jeweler. But these "broken arms" had not anticipated the arrival of a vigil like no other: Walter, a former African warlord who will send them to hell .', 'For Goran and his team of amateur shooters, the plan was almost perfect: to enter a hypermarket at night to rob a jeweler. But these "broken arms" had not anticipated the arrival of a vigil like no other: Walter, a former African warlord who will send them to hell .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUrsX3QO8kxiOo8ZU2vmMwjIC1H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579298'),
  ('1100045487007156696', 'Walter and Carlo - Up on Daddy''s Hat', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Per Holst, Peter Roos, John Hilbard', 'Jarl Friis-Mikkelsen, Ole Stephensen, Per Holst', 'Ole Stephensen, Jarl Friis-Mikkelsen, Kirsten Rolffes, Kai Løvring, Lisbet Dahl, Paul Hagen, Poul Bundgaard, Tommy Kenter', null, 'Walter''s a handsome airline steward who catches the eye of Inge, winner of Malaga''s Miss Moonlight contest. Carlo is a motor-mouthed goof who has a "heel bar" (a combination shoe shop and tavern); his companion, Elly, is shooting a video of him. Inge discovers she''s an unwitting smuggler, bringing diamonds into Denmark in the heel of a sandal she''s won at the beauty contest.', 'Walter''s a handsome airline steward who catches the eye of Inge, winner of Malaga''s Miss Moonlight contest. Carlo is a motor-mouthed goof who has a "heel bar" (a combination shoe shop and tavern); his companion, Elly, is shooting a video of him. Inge discovers she''s an unwitting smuggler, bringing diamonds into Denmark in the heel of a sandal she''s won at the beauty contest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l43vqDb9r2H2WOjCrVJDt5tjyz0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24454'),
  ('41151979525187194', 'Walter Defends Sarajevo', 1972, 'Thriller, War, Action', 'Hajrudin ''Šiba'' Krvavac, Miroljub Dikosavljević', 'Đorđe Lebović', 'Velimir Živojinović, Rade Marković, Ljubiša Samardžić, Neda Spasojević, Dragomir ''Gidra'' Bojanić, Slobodan Dimitrijević, Hannjo Hasse, Rolf Römer', null, 'Sarajevo 1944. The German armies desperately need fuel in the retreat. Walter, the enigmatic and charismatic leader of the resistance movement, can endanger their supplies. The Germans are taking a cunning plan to remove that obstacle.', 'Sarajevo 1944. The German armies desperately need fuel in the retreat. Walter, the enigmatic and charismatic leader of the resistance movement, can endanger their supplies. The Germans are taking a cunning plan to remove that obstacle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7Ce3RDTXlXsSom14vRykQRqEbS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90617'),
  ('1025710504348661086', 'Waltz of the Toreadors', 1962, 'Comedy', 'John Guillermin, John Wilcox, René Dupont', 'Wolf Mankowitz', 'Peter Sellers, Dany Robin, Margaret Leighton, John Fraser, Cyril Cusack, Prunella Scales, Denise Coffey, Jean Anderson', null, 'General Fitzhugh, an ageing Lothario has an over-active eye for a pretty woman. Despite a long and satisfying career as a seducer extraordinaire, something always seems to get in the way of his bedding the breathtakingly lovely Ghislaine, a more-than-willing town local.', 'General Fitzhugh, an ageing Lothario has an over-active eye for a pretty woman. Despite a long and satisfying career as a seducer extraordinaire, something always seems to get in the way of his bedding the breathtakingly lovely Ghislaine, a more-than-willing town local.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AlnxKr85KeHjZ8S4euPrv73N2Ht.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43016'),
  ('1141152184220023942', 'Waltz with Bashir', 2008, 'Animation, Documentary, Drama, War', 'Ari Folman', 'Ari Folman', 'Ari Folman, Mickey Leon, Ori Sivan, Yehezkel Lazarov, Ronny Dayag, Shmuel Frenkel, Zahava Solomon, Ron Ben-Yishai', 'R', 'An Israeli film director interviews fellow veterans of the 1982 invasion of Lebanon to reconstruct his own memories of his term of service in that conflict.', 'An Israeli film director interviews fellow veterans of the 1982 invasion of Lebanon to reconstruct his own memories of his term of service in that conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQaCv7lKwHsh0YSHkt1QNjIOZ1c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8885'),
  ('343060687891550467', 'Waltzes from Vienna', 1934, 'History, Romance, Music', 'Alfred Hitchcock', 'Claude Allain, Heinz Reichert, Guy Bolton', 'Edmund Gwenn, Esmond Knight, Jessie Matthews, Fay Compton, Frank Vosper, Robert Hale, Charles Heslop, Hindle Edgar', null, 'In Vienna, aspiring composer Johann Strauss Jr. clashes with his domineering father, who wants him to abandon music for a steady job in a bakery. Torn between his love for the baker’s daughter, Resi, and the encouragement of a wealthy countess, Strauss finds inspiration that leads to the creation of "The Blue Danube."', 'In Vienna, aspiring composer Johann Strauss Jr. clashes with his domineering father, who wants him to abandon music for a steady job in a bakery. Torn between his love for the baker’s daughter, Resi, and the encouragement of a wealthy countess, Strauss finds inspiration that leads to the creation of "The Blue Danube."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34AL66MN44fJKiFjaHNPdqftqsY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52907'),
  ('542977746381647787', 'Wanda', 1970, 'Drama, Crime', 'Barbara Loden, Nicholas T. Proferes', 'Barbara Loden', 'Barbara Loden, Michael Higgins, Dorothy Shupenes, Peter Shupenes, Jerome Thier, Marian Thier, Valerie Mamches, Anthony Rotell', 'PG', 'After a string of abusive relationships, Wanda abandons her family and seeks solace in the company of a petty criminal.', 'After a string of abusive relationships, Wanda abandons her family and seeks solace in the company of a petty criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izuJ7cUhcihFnTpfsdSnkMCHsRQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80560'),
  ('842451790208186932', 'Wanda Nevada', 1979, 'Drama, Western', 'Peter Fonda, Michael C. Butler', 'Dennis Hackin', 'Peter Fonda, Brooke Shields, Fiona Lewis, Luke Askew, Ted Markland, Severn Darden, Paul Fix, Henry Fonda', 'PG', 'In the American Southwest of the 1950s, middle-aged vagabond Beaudray Demerille survives as a cardsharp who moves from town to town. But his latest victory brings him unwanted spoils in the form of Wanda Nevada, a fiery 13-year-old. At first Beaudray does everything he can to ditch Wanda -- until the girl chances upon a treasure map. But Wanda and Beaudray aren''t the only ones after the loot, and they must contend with a ruthless pair of crooks.', 'In the American Southwest of the 1950s, middle-aged vagabond Beaudray Demerille survives as a cardsharp who moves from town to town. But his latest victory brings him unwanted spoils in the form of Wanda Nevada, a fiery 13-year-old. At first Beaudray does everything he can to ditch Wanda -- until the girl chances upon a treasure map. But Wanda and Beaudray aren''t the only ones after the loot, and they must contend with a ruthless pair of crooks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEwdIkXKKcGWYSpEms7T0GyJF66.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46460'),
  ('59479623018285883', 'Wanda Sykes: I''m an Entertainer', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Linda Mendoza', 'Wanda Sykes', 'Wanda Sykes', 'R', 'The comedy icon sounds off on parenting with her French wife, the perils of public bathrooms and why she''s tired of going high when others go low.', 'The comedy icon sounds off on parenting with her French wife, the perils of public bathrooms and why she''s tired of going high when others go low.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXglM0xLh0chzmbxRiglcQk6w8G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1118425'),
  ('344104963609433395', 'Wanda Sykes: Not Normal', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Linda Mendoza, Jay Lafayette', 'Wanda Sykes', 'Wanda Sykes', null, 'Wanda Sykes tackles politics, reality TV, racism and the secret she''d take to the grave in this rollicking, no-holds-barred stand-up special.', 'Wanda Sykes tackles politics, reality TV, racism and the secret she''d take to the grave in this rollicking, no-holds-barred stand-up special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgP8ZrffMCWZE3XKf5NpTuO5YX7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573915'),
  ('33264994392730577', 'Wander', 2020, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Jeremy Doiron, April Mullen, Russ De Jong', 'Tim Doiron', 'Aaron Eckhart, Katheryn Winnick, Heather Graham, Tommy Lee Jones, Raymond Cruz, Brendan Fehr, Roger Dorman, Nicole Steinwedell', 'R', 'After getting hired to probe a suspicious death in the small town of Wander, a mentally unstable private investigator becomes convinced the case is linked to the same ''conspiracy cover up'' that caused the death of his daughter.', 'After getting hired to probe a suspicious death in the small town of Wander, a mentally unstable private investigator becomes convinced the case is linked to the same ''conspiracy cover up'' that caused the death of his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2AwPvNHphpZBJDqjZKVuMAbvS0v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:646593'),
  ('233399867118452458', 'Wander Darkly', 2020, 'Romance, Drama', 'Brett Juskalian, Randin Brown, Rachel Jensen', 'Tara Miele', 'Sienna Miller, Diego Luna, Beth Grant, Brett Rice, Vanessa Bayer, Aimee Carrero, James Landry Hébert, Dan Gill', 'R', 'New parents Adrienne and Matteo are forced to reckon with trauma amidst their troubled relationship. They must revisit the memories of their past and unravel haunting truths in order to face their uncertain future.', 'New parents Adrienne and Matteo are forced to reckon with trauma amidst their troubled relationship. They must revisit the memories of their past and unravel haunting truths in order to face their uncertain future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96snLzPYifC4FyL2uOnzo4DPgCv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540023'),
  ('347705726057637322', 'Wander to Wonder', 2024, 'Animation', 'Nina Gantz, Steven Frederickx', 'Nina Gantz, Stienette Bosklopper, Simon Cartwright', 'Neil Salvage, Toby Jones, Amanda Lawrence, Terence Dunn', null, 'In the 1980s, Mary, Billybud, and Fumbleton starred in the children''s television program Wander to Wonder. They are left alone in the studio after the show''s originator passed away.', 'In the 1980s, Mary, Billybud, and Fumbleton starred in the children''s television program Wander to Wonder. They are left alone in the studio after the show''s originator passed away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qT12PqjrTfw6iyVhRtzSwhOQ1D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1156605'),
  ('335120777582700416', 'Wanderers', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Animation', 'Erik Wernquist', null, 'Carl Sagan, Anna Nerman, Camilla Hammarström, Hanna Mellin', null, 'Wanderers is a vision of humanity''s expansion into the Solar System, based on scientific ideas and concepts of what our future in space might look like, if it ever happens. The locations depicted in the film are digital recreations of actual places in the Solar System, built from real photos and map data where available. Without any apparent story, other than what you may fill in by yourself, the idea with the film is primarily to show a glimpse of the fantastic and beautiful nature that surrounds us on our neighboring worlds - and above all, how it might appear to us if we were there.', 'Wanderers is a vision of humanity''s expansion into the Solar System, based on scientific ideas and concepts of what our future in space might look like, if it ever happens. The locations depicted in the film are digital recreations of actual places in the Solar System, built from real photos and map data where available. Without any apparent story, other than what you may fill in by yourself, the idea with the film is primarily to show a glimpse of the fantastic and beautiful nature that surrounds us on our neighboring worlds - and above all, how it might appear to us if we were there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kcXVaGY4xQbvKQqmsvLHThGa1ec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306963'),
  ('83263398394643933', 'Wanderers of the Desert', 1986, 'Drama', 'Nacer Khemir', 'Nacer Khemir', 'Nacer Khemir, Soufiane Makni, Noureddine Kasbaoui, Sonia Ichti, Hedi Daoud, Hassen Khalsi, Jamila Ourabi, Abdel Azim Abdel Haqq', null, 'A young teacher arrives to take over a village school isolated in the shimmering desert. Legendary figures materialize out of wells and the desert itself, groups of children hurry through a labyrinth of underground corridors, and the teacher is whisked away to a mysterious rendezvous and never returns.', 'A young teacher arrives to take over a village school isolated in the shimmering desert. Legendary figures materialize out of wells and the desert itself, groups of children hurry through a labyrinth of underground corridors, and the teacher is whisked away to a mysterious rendezvous and never returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCBbYcQVwc718OVcDhkwx7Vu6Fn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51047'),
  ('12238746835519067', 'Wandering', 2022, 'Drama', 'Hong Kyung-pyo, Sang-il Lee, Masunobu Motokawa', 'Sang-il Lee', 'Suzu Hirose, Tori Matsuzaka, Ryusei Yokohama, Mikako Tabe, Shuri, Takahiro Miura, Tamaki Shiratori, Yayako Uchida', null, 'In a park on a rainy evening, a 19-year-old university student, Fumi, offers an umbrella to a soaking wet 10-year-old girl, Sarasa. Realizing her reluctance to go home, Fumi lets her stay in his place, where she spends the next two months in peace.', 'In a park on a rainy evening, a 19-year-old university student, Fumi, offers an umbrella to a soaking wet 10-year-old girl, Sarasa. Realizing her reluctance to go home, Fumi lets her stay in his place, where she spends the next two months in peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4m1ih1Tl1LwSDyRewTsLwu6LSzz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:849786'),
  ('599464874065088934', 'Wandering Clouds', 2014, 'Romance', 'Alejandro Cantú, Julián Hernández', 'Julián Hernández, Sergio Loo', 'Ignacio Pereda, Alan Ramírez, Mauricio Rico', null, 'They dance in the water. They are like wandering clouds. But not for a homophobic spectator.', 'They dance in the water. They are like wandering clouds. But not for a homophobic spectator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsUIqBBwUtdXmQFzGCFPJVHmXdv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444161'),
  ('768458374508384869', 'Wandering Ginza Butterfly', 1972, 'Action, Thriller', 'Kazuhiko Yamaguchi, Hanjirō Nakazawa', 'Isao Matsumoto, Kazuhiko Yamaguchi', 'Meiko Kaji, Tsunehiko Watase, Akiko Koyama, Mieko Aoyagi, Flower Meg, Tomiko Ishii, Yayoi Watanabe, Chie Kobayashi', null, 'Gang leader Nami (cult film legend Meiko Kaji) kills a member of a yakuza group and goes away to prison. Upon her release three years later, she’s a shamed woman confined to living in the shadowy world of sex clubs and street gangs. She returns to the city to live with her uncle, a billiard-hall owner, and after befriending pimp and ne’er-do-well Ryuji (Tsunehiko Watase), she gets a job working at a hostess club in the chic Ginza neighborhood, where the expensive shops and neon lights conceal a dark world of crime and sexual slavery. But when a rival gang attempts to muscle in on the club, Nami becomes enmeshed in a violent struggle that forces her to wield a skilled pool cue to defend her uncle’s business, and eventually a short sword to wreak bloody vengeance upon her enemies.', 'Gang leader Nami (cult film legend Meiko Kaji) kills a member of a yakuza group and goes away to prison. Upon her release three years later, she’s a shamed woman confined to living in the shadowy world of sex clubs and street gangs. She returns to the city to live with her uncle, a billiard-hall owner, and after befriending pimp and ne’er-do-well Ryuji (Tsunehiko Watase), she gets a job working at a hostess club in the chic Ginza neighborhood, where the expensive shops and neon lights conceal a dark world of crime and sexual slavery. But when a rival gang attempts to muscle in on the club, Nami becomes enmeshed in a violent struggle that forces her to wield a skilled pool cue to defend her uncle’s business, and eventually a short sword to wreak bloody vengeance upon her enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Q37LgFbGLTkuGqDxncXYHdRrGi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31861'),
  ('287661142113105681', 'Wandering Girl', 2018, 'Drama', 'Natalia Imery Almario, Rubén Mendoza, Sofia Oggioni', 'Rubén Mendoza', 'Loren Sofia, Carolina Ramírez, Lina Marcela Calderón, María Camila Mejía, Juan Carlos Romero, Martha Lopez, Mary Vidal, Martha Leticia Espinoza', null, 'Teenager Ángela meets her three adult step-sisters for the first time when their father dies. Fearing that Ángela will end up in state custody, the sisters embark on a 900-mile journey across Colombia to leave the young girl with an aunt she doesn''t even know. During this journey, Ángela will discover what it means to be a woman.', 'Teenager Ángela meets her three adult step-sisters for the first time when their father dies. Fearing that Ángela will end up in state custody, the sisters embark on a 900-mile journey across Colombia to leave the young girl with an aunt she doesn''t even know. During this journey, Ángela will discover what it means to be a woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/refUc2J81fjutiUEz7q1XAWbdIf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560709'),
  ('216320492553205586', 'Wandering Heart', 2021, 'Drama', 'Pedro Sotero, Leonardo Brzezicki', 'Leonardo Brzezicki', 'Leonardo Sbaraglia, Miranda de la Serna, Eva Llorach, Iván González, Alberto Ajaka, Thalita Carauta, Tuca Andrada, Beatriz Rajland', 'NR', 'Santiago, gay single father, has reached a tipping point in his life. Reeling from a bitter breakup, he is facing the impending departure of his daughter Laila, with whom he shares a close yet emotionally charged relationship. As the fear of being alone threatens to swallow him whole, his behavior becomes increasingly erratic. Over the course of a chaotic summer divided between Argentina and Brazil, Santiago must learn to let go of Laila so each can find their own freedoms.', 'Santiago, gay single father, has reached a tipping point in his life. Reeling from a bitter breakup, he is facing the impending departure of his daughter Laila, with whom he shares a close yet emotionally charged relationship. As the fear of being alone threatens to swallow him whole, his behavior becomes increasingly erratic. Over the course of a chaotic summer divided between Argentina and Brazil, Santiago must learn to let go of Laila so each can find their own freedoms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bB0WO3TCjbyVcVM8yTpdMAn3Uy1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743048'),
  ('667502690843662800', 'Wandering Shadows', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ciro Guerra, Emanuel Rojas', 'Ciro Guerra', 'Lowin Allende, César Badillo, Julián Díaz, Andrés Gaitán, Diego Manzano, Ignacio Prieto, Inés Prieto, Daniel Rocha', null, 'Two men meet in downtown Bogotá: one is missing a leg, the other is a "silletero", a man who carries people around for money. Each character bears the burden of a bitter past life.', 'Two men meet in downtown Bogotá: one is missing a leg, the other is a "silletero", a man who carries people around for money. Each character bears the burden of a bitter past life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4McAHvn5kQ2uAX0iDonSpc4lU1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311036'),
  ('573069609175805059', 'Wandering Stars', 2019, 'Documentary, Music', 'Mahdi Lepart, Xavier Dolléans, Syrine Boulanouar', null, 'Nekfeu, Alpha Oumar Wann, Damso, Diabi, Trombone Shorty, Doums, Clément Loubensky, Damso', null, 'This film follows the making of Nekfeu''s 3rd album, between Paris, Japan, Greece and the United States.', 'This film follows the making of Nekfeu''s 3rd album, between Paris, Japan, Greece and the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9fp9guKgImiJPhkeZL6cBRLH5z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:609797'),
  ('519941757495818375', 'Wandering Streams', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pascal Rabaté, Benoît Chamaillard', 'Pascal Rabaté', 'Daniel Prévost, Bulle Ogier, Hélène Vincent, Philippe Nahon, Julie-Marie Parmentier, Bruno Lochet, Charles Schneider, Vincent Martin', null, 'Emile is a 70-ish former horticulturalist who once raised bonsai trees "because they don''t take up too much room." Indeed, his whole existence is safe and uneventful to a fault, somewhat juiced by friendship with raucous fishing companion Edmond. Still, they trade pleasantries rather than confidences -- so Emile is shocked when it turns out his elderly pal watches porn, paints nudes and shags women who are his contemporaries that he meets online.', 'Emile is a 70-ish former horticulturalist who once raised bonsai trees "because they don''t take up too much room." Indeed, his whole existence is safe and uneventful to a fault, somewhat juiced by friendship with raucous fishing companion Edmond. Still, they trade pleasantries rather than confidences -- so Emile is shocked when it turns out his elderly pal watches porn, paints nudes and shags women who are his contemporaries that he meets online.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHUQrpWB6GPuwW8ePZT74LD5Oxh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52350'),
  ('948535712898456003', 'Wanderlust', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Wain, Michael Bonvillain, Jack Gill', 'Ken Marino, David Wain', 'Jennifer Aniston, Paul Rudd, Justin Theroux, Malin Åkerman, Kathryn Hahn, Lauren Ambrose, Alan Alda, Joe Lo Truglio', 'R', 'Rattled by sudden unemployment, a Manhattan couple surveys alternative living options, ultimately deciding to experiment with living on a rural commune where free love rules.', 'Rattled by sudden unemployment, a Manhattan couple surveys alternative living options, ultimately deciding to experiment with living on a rural commune where free love rules.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hH1Bla0W4YIn9sdd9NwODzDCcE4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50647'),
  ('13303485820258531', 'Wanee & Junah', 2001, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kim Yong-gyun, Hwang Ki-suk, Shin Kyung-man', 'Kim Yong-gyun', 'Kim Hee-seon, Ju Jin-mo, Choi Kang-hee, Cho Seung-woo, Park Ho-san, Kim Hong-pa, Lee Jung-eun, Hyun Sook-hee', null, 'Wanee an animator and Junah a scriptwriter are lovers living together when one day an old friend of Wanee''s drops in and brings to fore, all supressed memories of Wanee''s love for her step brother.', 'Wanee an animator and Junah a scriptwriter are lovers living together when one day an old friend of Wanee''s drops in and brings to fore, all supressed memories of Wanee''s love for her step brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOi1JSH59sCvXGLkKAHtqTdzHC5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33548'),
  ('1073639539746106744', 'Wang Mao', 2016, 'Comedy, War', 'Zhao Xiaoxi, Yan Wang, Jigou Peng', 'Li Haijiang', 'Wang Dazhi, Guo Jinjie, Ge Xiao-Feng, Luo Jingmin, Liu Jiang, Wang Yunfan, Minowa Yasufumi, Zhang Haidong', null, 'Wang Mao joins the army in order to earn money to marry his favorite girl. He struggled his life through the whole war against Janpanese invaders.', 'Wang Mao joins the army in order to earn money to marry his favorite girl. He struggled his life through the whole war against Janpanese invaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bEZoSAldsJIVMxEBrEuXsWMtF0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390841'),
  ('806790376053213236', 'Wangan Midnight: The Movie', 2009, 'Action, Drama', 'Atsushi Muroga, Jirô Nagae', 'Atsushi Muroga', 'Yuichi Nakamura, Ryoko Kobayashi, Kazuki Kato, Kosuke Yonehara, Maimi Okuwa, Masaki Sata, Shun Sugata, Shin Ishikawa', null, 'After losing a street race to Tatsuya Shima''s legendary "Blackbird" Porsche 911 Turbo, high school student Akio Asakura purchases a heavily-modified first-generation Datsun S30 Fairlady Z from a junkyard. The car has a dark history of accidents, leading some to believe it''s cursed; hence its nickname "Devil Z." Akio also discovers that the Z''s first owner shared his first and last name, and was killed in the car during a race with the Blackbird. Meanwhile, fashion model Reina Akikawa joins the rivalry between Akio and Tatsuya with her modified Nissan Skyline GT-R R32.', 'After losing a street race to Tatsuya Shima''s legendary "Blackbird" Porsche 911 Turbo, high school student Akio Asakura purchases a heavily-modified first-generation Datsun S30 Fairlady Z from a junkyard. The car has a dark history of accidents, leading some to believe it''s cursed; hence its nickname "Devil Z." Akio also discovers that the Z''s first owner shared his first and last name, and was killed in the car during a race with the Blackbird. Meanwhile, fashion model Reina Akikawa joins the rivalry between Akio and Tatsuya with her modified Nissan Skyline GT-R R32.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEfh5EWN2HJTULE9TTbnJcLECfQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63251'),
  ('18701252574397611', 'Wanna See My Beautiful Navel?', 1978, 'Drama, Romance', 'Søren Kragh-Jacobsen', 'Hans Hansen', 'Jesper Christensen, Birger Larsen, Lise-Lotte Rao, Henning Palner, Helle Borup, Maria Keller, Lars Jesper Nielsen, Lise-Lotte Henriksen', null, 'Coming of age, summer camp and first love... Shy 15-year-old Claus is in 8th grade and is going on a school camp in Sweden. His classmate Lene, who is braver and more outgoing than Claus, is also going on the trip. During the trip, Claus gets the opportunity to get to know Lene better and gets his first taste of what adult life has to offer.', 'Coming of age, summer camp and first love... Shy 15-year-old Claus is in 8th grade and is going on a school camp in Sweden. His classmate Lene, who is braver and more outgoing than Claus, is also going on the trip. During the trip, Claus gets the opportunity to get to know Lene better and gets his first taste of what adult life has to offer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfodvb9E9MFcpKNSy9OxritUZyO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56889'),
  ('1123890088685103755', 'Wannabe', 2024, 'Thriller', 'Yoo Young-seon, Yun Jong-ho, Seo Ho-yeong', 'Yoo Young-seon', 'Park Ji-yeon, Song Ji-eun, Kim Nu-ri, Kim He-sang, Seo Jin-won, Lee Ji-hoon, Jo Min-ah', null, 'Once the shining star of the silver screen, award-winning actress Su-yeon crashes and burns after a notorious DUI incident. Attempting a dazzling comeback through a heartfelt essay, she finds the world''s reception icy. Battling depression, Su-yeon engages in a heated argument with Ga-yeong, with whom she lives, and resorts to binge drinking to relieve stress. In a drunken stupor, Su-yeon wakes up to discover Ga-yeong stabbed to death with a knife. With no recollection of the situation, Su-yeon receives a letter asking, "Do you deserve to be an actress?" Determined to cover up everything, she embarks on an adventurous journey risking her life, realizing that someone is watching her.', 'Once the shining star of the silver screen, award-winning actress Su-yeon crashes and burns after a notorious DUI incident. Attempting a dazzling comeback through a heartfelt essay, she finds the world''s reception icy. Battling depression, Su-yeon engages in a heated argument with Ga-yeong, with whom she lives, and resorts to binge drinking to relieve stress. In a drunken stupor, Su-yeon wakes up to discover Ga-yeong stabbed to death with a knife. With no recollection of the situation, Su-yeon receives a letter asking, "Do you deserve to be an actress?" Determined to cover up everything, she embarks on an adventurous journey risking her life, realizing that someone is watching her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZb4TYcRWlUDiHhspcfORWneyyQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977470'),
  ('728365242953788865', 'Wanted', 1967, 'Drama, Western, Romance, Action', 'Giorgio Ferroni', 'Augusto Finocchi, Fernando Di Leo, Remigio Del Grosso', 'Giuliano Gemma, Teresa Gimpera, Serge Marquand, Germán Cobos, Daniele Vargas, Gia Sandri, Nello Pazzafini, Tullio Altamura', null, 'A local sheriff is unjustly accused of murder in a small town and forced to flee. He gets rid of his enemies one by one and tries to prove his innocence.', 'A local sheriff is unjustly accused of murder in a small town and forced to flee. He gets rid of his enemies one by one and tries to prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iTOIgLNaSccOj4v0sf7DNXszSu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112570'),
  ('873058857485293161', 'Wanted', 1999, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Harald Sicheritz, Helmut Pirnat', 'Alfred Dorfer', 'Alfred Dorfer, John Phillip Law, Thomas Koziol, Gerhard Rühmkorf, Reinhard Nowak, Beatrice Frey, Max Lenz, Johann Hartweger', null, 'Trauma surgeon Thomas Reiter voluntarily withdraws into a secure institution because he no longer wants to face everyday life. He solves his problems in his imagination – a Western fantasy. A priest is commissioned by his worried parents to bring their son back to reality. When Thomas invites him to follow him into his Western world, the priest realizes that this escape from reality is not without its fascination...', 'Trauma surgeon Thomas Reiter voluntarily withdraws into a secure institution because he no longer wants to face everyday life. He solves his problems in his imagination – a Western fantasy. A priest is commissioned by his worried parents to bring their son back to reality. When Thomas invites him to follow him into his Western world, the priest realizes that this escape from reality is not without its fascination...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ea2VirXPcKKhcFAQ3TWsWqi8Me8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56333'),
  ('156542166315619476', 'Wanted', 2008, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Timur Bekmambetov, Mitchell Amundsen, Luc Etienne', 'Michael Brandt, Derek Haas, Chris Morgan', 'James McAvoy, Angelina Jolie, Morgan Freeman, Terence Stamp, Thomas Kretschmann, Common, Kristen Hager, Marc Warren', 'R', 'Doormat Wesley Gibson is an office worker whose life is going nowhere. He meets an attractive woman named Fox and discovers that his recently murdered father - whom Wesley never knew - belonged to the Fraternity, a secret society of assassins which takes its orders from Fate itself. Fox and Sloan, the Fraternity''s leader, teach Wesley, through intense training, to tap into dormant powers and hone his innate killing skills. Though he enjoys his newfound abilities, he begins to suspect that there is more to the Fraternity than meets the eye.', 'Doormat Wesley Gibson is an office worker whose life is going nowhere. He meets an attractive woman named Fox and discovers that his recently murdered father - whom Wesley never knew - belonged to the Fraternity, a secret society of assassins which takes its orders from Fate itself. Fox and Sloan, the Fraternity''s leader, teach Wesley, through intense training, to tap into dormant powers and hone his innate killing skills. Though he enjoys his newfound abilities, he begins to suspect that there is more to the Fraternity than meets the eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njy7Pz7ZHZceO7lNfGIHKphY8Hd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8909'),
  ('1037332939744763047', 'Wanted', 2009, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Prabhu Deva, Sethu Sriram, Nirav Shah', 'Shiraz Ahmed', 'Salman Khan, Vinod Khanna, Ayesha Takia, Mahesh Manjrekar, Prakash Raj, Manoj Pahwa, Inder Kumar, Govind Namdeo', null, 'Radhe is a hardcore gangster. A sharpshooter with a sharp brain, he works for Gani Bhai, the dreaded Mafioso, but on his own terms. Totally fearless, Radhe single handedly eliminates Gani Bhai''s enemies one by one; making more enemies than he bargained for.', 'Radhe is a hardcore gangster. A sharpshooter with a sharp brain, he works for Gani Bhai, the dreaded Mafioso, but on his own terms. Totally fearless, Radhe single handedly eliminates Gani Bhai''s enemies one by one; making more enemies than he bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nymzAr2uEWxnDTfoIjUbh7a1UuB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22717'),
  ('320096692012721227', 'Wanted for Murder', 1946, 'Crime, Drama', 'Mutz Greenbaum, Lawrence Huntington, Gerry Mitchell', 'Percy Robinson, Terence de Marney', 'Eric Portman, Dulcie Gray, Derek Farr, Roland Culver, Stanley Holloway, Barbara Everest, Bonar Colleano, Jenny Laird', 'NR', 'The son of a notorious hangman is gradually becoming insane and he finds himself unable to resist the urge to strangle women to death.', 'The son of a notorious hangman is gradually becoming insane and he finds himself unable to resist the urge to strangle women to death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kCUPk8MTJR1loMmCGTDU7ObygtC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81741'),
  ('62670054791864061', 'Wanted Man', 2024, 'Action', 'Kevin Leslie, Dolph Lundgren, Joe M. Han', 'Dolph Lundgren, Michael Worth, Hank Hughes', 'Dolph Lundgren, Christina Villa, Kelsey Grammer, Michael Paré, Roger Cross, Aaron McPherson, Rocko Reyes, James Joseph Pulido', null, 'Follows a police officer who must retrieve an eyewitness and escort her after a cartel shooting leaves several DEA agents dead, but then he must decide who to trust when they discover that the attack was executed by American forces.', 'Follows a police officer who must retrieve an eyewitness and escort her after a cartel shooting leaves several DEA agents dead, but then he must decide who to trust when they discover that the attack was executed by American forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pmdgdb8biQLLzTjySZLPdK13KwM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:666035'),
  ('878730595792344834', 'Wanted Santa', 2025, 'Comedy, Family', 'James Huth', 'James Huth, Laurent Tirard, Benjamin Dupas', 'Patrick Timsit, Isabelle Nanty, Antoine Gouy, Eugenie Anselin, Théa De Boeck', null, 'Zoé, an 8-year-old girl, wants to get a BB gun from Santa Claus to get revenge on Timothée, a classmate who annoys her by playing with his Lego robot. Her mother, Nadia, works for Timothée''s parents, which complicates her quest for revenge. When she discovers that her Christmas wish hasn''t been granted, Zoé is determined to find Santa and force him to grant her wish. And her luck changes when she hears an advertisement revealing that Santa Claus, in person, is on parade every day at Parc Enchanté, the famous amusement park...', 'Zoé, an 8-year-old girl, wants to get a BB gun from Santa Claus to get revenge on Timothée, a classmate who annoys her by playing with his Lego robot. Her mother, Nadia, works for Timothée''s parents, which complicates her quest for revenge. When she discovers that her Christmas wish hasn''t been granted, Zoé is determined to find Santa and force him to grant her wish. And her luck changes when she hears an advertisement revealing that Santa Claus, in person, is on parade every day at Parc Enchanté, the famous amusement park...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqDooVZxeUCoF9avNpZBrlbv9gZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1432812'),
  ('1094180732876834185', 'Wanted: Dead or Alive', 1987, 'Action, Crime', 'Gary Sherman, Alex Nepomniaschy', 'Gary Sherman, Michael Patrick Goodman, Brian Taggert', 'Rutger Hauer, Gene Simmons, Eli Danker, Nick Faltas, Robert Guillaume, Dennis Burkley, Mel Harris, Hugh Gillin', 'R', 'Nick Randall is a Los Angeles-based bounty hunter and an ex-CIA operative who is asked by a former co-worker to help track down terrorist Malak Al Rahim. However, Malak Al Rahim is also looking for Randall, forcing a showdown on the waterfront.', 'Nick Randall is a Los Angeles-based bounty hunter and an ex-CIA operative who is asked by a former co-worker to help track down terrorist Malak Al Rahim. However, Malak Al Rahim is also looking for Randall, forcing a showdown on the waterfront.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aW1EJYJ7C3ZLLF1KlvCE5PS3U1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23599'),
  ('371706178294824912', 'Wanted: Girlfriend', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rember Gelera', null, 'Shiena Yu, Yuki Sakamoto, Reina Castillo, Allan Villafuerte, Erica Dales, Jericho Ponce, Lau Apostol, Anica Paljapay', null, 'Sheina Yu and Reina Castillo date a man who likes to have sex anytime and anywhere. See who can keep up with his strong sexual appetite and be his girlfriend.', 'Sheina Yu and Reina Castillo date a man who likes to have sex anytime and anywhere. See who can keep up with his strong sexual appetite and be his girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecadxev4EzvZpJrEgLksiBIXHy7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1264854'),
  ('392464121422531342', 'Waqt', 1965, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Dharam Chopra, Yash Chopra, Ravi', null, 'Balraj Sahni, Sunil Dutt, Raaj Kumar, Shashi Kapoor, Sharmila Tagore, Rehman, Madan Puri, Manmohan Krishna', null, 'A businessman''s family is torn apart by an earthquake and reunited years later in a courtroom where father and sons stand opposed in the roles of accused, lawyer, and witness.', 'A businessman''s family is torn apart by an earthquake and reunited years later in a courtroom where father and sons stand opposed in the roles of accused, lawyer, and witness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bOvDhkmqvbWWfxE82fAvU4wZVXO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71299'),
  ('593909379381021720', 'Waqt', 2005, 'Drama', 'Vipul Amrutlal Shah, Ashok Mehta, Santosh Thundiyil', 'Aatish Kapadia', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Akshay Kumar, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Shefali Shah, Boman Irani, Rajpal Yadav, Asawari Joshi, Rajeev Mehta', null, 'A chronic illness leaves Ishwar with only a few months to live. His son Aditya is extremely reckless. To make him realise his responsibilities, Ishwar throws his son out of the house.', 'A chronic illness leaves Ishwar with only a few months to live. His son Aditya is extremely reckless. To make him realise his responsibilities, Ishwar throws his son out of the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6bor6Zkuj5FVt9B7YyztbeKOJ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31364'),
  ('700119968701006526', 'War', 2002, 'War, Drama', 'Aleksei Balabanov, Sergey Astakhov, Valery Revich', 'Aleksei Balabanov', 'Aleksey Chadov, Ian Kelly, Ingeborga Dapkūnaitė, Sergei Bodrov Jr., Yuri Stepanov, Evklid Kyurdzidis, Vladimir Gostyukhin, Irina Sokolova', null, 'During the bloody war in Chechnya, a British couple and two Russian soldiers are taken hostage by Chechen rebels. Two of the hostages are then released to bring the money for the British woman who is forced to wait for the ransom.', 'During the bloody war in Chechnya, a British couple and two Russian soldiers are taken hostage by Chechen rebels. Two of the hostages are then released to bring the money for the British woman who is forced to wait for the ransom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uj1vANvuVgWGUwbuNwaTP215dHm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82737'),
  ('1010482743390643412', 'War', 2005, null, null, null, null, null, 'Poor Boyz Productions declares "War" with this ski world in a battle to produce the best ski film for the 2005 season.', 'Poor Boyz Productions declares "War" with this ski world in a battle to produce the best ski film for the 2005 season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1fMBbAlUU96Ao1xeHyvkmfywY2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537041'),
  ('1120830408819655056', 'War', 2007, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Philip G. Atwell, Pierre Morel, Oliver Lee', 'Lee Anthony Smith, Gregory J. Bradley', 'Jet Li, Jason Statham, John Lone, Ryo Ishibashi, Devon Aoki, Mark Cheng Ho-Nam, Luis Guzmán, Saul Rubinek', 'R', 'FBI agent Jack Crawford is out for revenge when his partner is killed and all clues point to the mysterious assassin Rogue. But when Rogue turns up years later to take care of some unfinished business, he triggers a violent clash of rival gangs. Will the truth come out before it''s too late? And when the dust settles, who will remain standing?', 'FBI agent Jack Crawford is out for revenge when his partner is killed and all clues point to the mysterious assassin Rogue. But when Rogue turns up years later to take care of some unfinished business, he triggers a violent clash of rival gangs. Will the truth come out before it''s too late? And when the dust settles, who will remain standing?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scFc8RD4sFxB2x0eIOaymphMnYh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10431'),
  ('691476382124042196', 'War', 2014, 'Drama', 'Simon Jaquemet, Lorenz Merz', 'Simon Jaquemet', 'Benjamin Lutzke, Sascha Gisler, Ella Rumpf, Ste, Livia S. Reinhard', null, 'Fifteen-year-old Matteo is attractive, albeit somewhat effeminate. The whole world is against him. He has no friends and his parents seem to live in a different universe. The pressure increases as his awkward attempts to win his father’s respect fail. One night two men carry him off: his parents send him to a remote alp, where he is forced to spend the summer working hard on a family farm. When Matteo arrives on the alp, a surprise awaits him.', 'Fifteen-year-old Matteo is attractive, albeit somewhat effeminate. The whole world is against him. He has no friends and his parents seem to live in a different universe. The pressure increases as his awkward attempts to win his father’s respect fail. One night two men carry him off: his parents send him to a remote alp, where he is forced to spend the summer working hard on a family farm. When Matteo arrives on the alp, a surprise awaits him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2ZLuyj2O3npj2lxBUmzP7uxr10.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295111'),
  ('557538549091678746', 'War', 2019, 'Action, Thriller, Adventure', 'Benjamin Jasper, Siddharth Anand, Abhishek Anil Tiwari', 'Shridhar Raghavan, Siddharth Anand', 'Hrithik Roshan, Tiger Shroff, Vaani Kapoor, Ashutosh Rana, Anupriya Goenka, Soni Razdan, Yash Raaj Singh, Dishita Sehgal', null, 'Khalid, entrusted with the task of eliminating former soldier turned rogue Kabir, engages in an epic battle with his mentor who taught him everything.', 'Khalid, entrusted with the task of eliminating former soldier turned rogue Kabir, engages in an epic battle with his mentor who taught him everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUtaHkL2SDIAZhRApZAyQrAXygn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585268'),
  ('59539412527607476', 'WAR', 2023, 'Thriller, War, Drama, Animation, Mystery', 'Miklós Horváth Milán', 'Miklós Horváth Milán', 'AI voice, AI voice', null, 'A war veteran tells his personal experience in “The War” to a psychiatrist, as a part of a social experiment. But nothing is as it seems…', 'A war veteran tells his personal experience in “The War” to a psychiatrist, as a part of a social experiment. But nothing is as it seems…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pMoMd8l7PoTbn1Ut8j2S1LsXj2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1377716'),
  ('28060229284568765', 'War 2', 2025, 'Action, Thriller', 'Ayan Mukerji, Benjamin Jasper, Shanoo Sharma', 'Shridhar Raghavan', 'N.T. Rama Rao Jr., Hrithik Roshan, Kiara Advani, Ashutosh Rana, Anil Kapoor, Bobby Deol, K.C. Shankar, Varun Badola', 'NR', 'Years ago Agent Kabir went rogue, became India’s greatest villain ever. As he descends further into the deepest shadows... India sends its deadliest, most lethal agent after him, Agent Vikram A Special Units Officer who is more than Kabir’s equal and a relentless Terminator driven by his own demons, determined to put a bullet into Kabir’s skull.', 'Years ago Agent Kabir went rogue, became India’s greatest villain ever. As he descends further into the deepest shadows... India sends its deadliest, most lethal agent after him, Agent Vikram A Special Units Officer who is more than Kabir’s equal and a relentless Terminator driven by his own demons, determined to put a bullet into Kabir’s skull.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxxVbjhIOl8ZPS69dH8xeeuxvmh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1109086'),
  ('607122995177614822', 'War and Peace', 1956, 'War, Romance, Drama, History', 'King Vidor, Jack Cardiff, Gianni Polidori', 'King Vidor, Mario Camerini, Robert Westerby', 'Audrey Hepburn, Henry Fonda, Mel Ferrer, Vittorio Gassman, Herbert Lom, Oskar Homolka, Anita Ekberg, Barry Jones', 'PG', 'The love story of young Countess Natasha Rostova and Count Pierre Bezukhov is interwoven with the Great Patriotic War of 1812 against Napoleon''s invading army.', 'The love story of young Countess Natasha Rostova and Count Pierre Bezukhov is interwoven with the Great Patriotic War of 1812 against Napoleon''s invading army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3a1MyH12PSl3LFDahnooGy6mv8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11706'),
  ('1143720846185499041', 'War and Peace', 1968, 'History, Drama, War, Romance', 'Yu-Lan Chen, Anatoly Petritsky, Aleksandr Shelenkov', 'Vasiliy Solovyov, Sergey Bondarchuk', 'Ludmila Savelyeva, Sergey Bondarchuk, Vyacheslav Tikhonov, Viktor Stanitsyn, Kira Golovko, Oleg Tabakov, Sergei Yermilov, Irina Gubanova', null, 'The love story of young Countess Natasha Rostova and Count Pierre Bezukhov is interwoven with the Great Patriotic War of 1812 against Napoleon''s invading army.', 'The love story of young Countess Natasha Rostova and Count Pierre Bezukhov is interwoven with the Great Patriotic War of 1812 against Napoleon''s invading army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvMJ84g2lx2XusA29wvOeaanwWZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29266'),
  ('75160885222766834', 'War and Peace, Part I: Andrei Bolkonsky', 1966, 'History, Romance, War, Drama', 'Sergey Bondarchuk, Anatoly Petritsky, Yuri Mikhailov', 'Sergey Bondarchuk, Vasiliy Solovyov', 'Ludmila Savelyeva, Sergey Bondarchuk, Vyacheslav Tikhonov, Viktor Stanitsyn, Kira Golovko, Oleg Tabakov, Nikolay Kodin, Sergei Yermilov', null, 'In 1805 St. Petersburg, Pierre Bezukhov, illegitimate son of a rich nobleman, is introduced to high society. His friend, Prince Andrei Bolkonsky, joins the Imperial Russian Army as aide-de-camp of General Mikhail Kutuzov in the War of the Third Coalition against General Napoleon Bonaparte. Part one of the four-part adaptation of Leo Tolstoy''s 1869 novel.', 'In 1805 St. Petersburg, Pierre Bezukhov, illegitimate son of a rich nobleman, is introduced to high society. His friend, Prince Andrei Bolkonsky, joins the Imperial Russian Army as aide-de-camp of General Mikhail Kutuzov in the War of the Third Coalition against General Napoleon Bonaparte. Part one of the four-part adaptation of Leo Tolstoy''s 1869 novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykqdYsRl6AU54R4tNQ3cERwsP00.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147371'),
  ('840945299848040735', 'War and Peace, Part II: Natasha Rostova', 1966, 'History, Romance, War, Drama', 'Sergey Bondarchuk, Anatoly Petritsky, Yuri Mikhailov', 'Sergey Bondarchuk, Vasiliy Solovyov', 'Ludmila Savelyeva, Sergey Bondarchuk, Vyacheslav Tikhonov, Viktor Stanitsyn, Kira Golovko, Oleg Tabakov, Sergei Yermilov, Irina Gubanova', null, 'As 1809 nears its end, Natasha attends her first ball, where Andrei falls in love with her with the intent of marriage. However, as her father demands they wait, the prince travels abroad, leaving Natasha in desperate longing. But she meets Anatol Kuragin and forgets Andrei. Part two of the four-part adaptation of Leo Tolstoy''s 1869 novel.', 'As 1809 nears its end, Natasha attends her first ball, where Andrei falls in love with her with the intent of marriage. However, as her father demands they wait, the prince travels abroad, leaving Natasha in desperate longing. But she meets Anatol Kuragin and forgets Andrei. Part two of the four-part adaptation of Leo Tolstoy''s 1869 novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YM92mP27fIyIG4KlngEvZRZPXk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149465'),
  ('267566269287499900', 'War and Peace, Part III: The Year 1812', 1967, 'History, Romance, War, Drama', 'Sergey Bondarchuk, Anatoly Petritsky, V. Nikolskaya', 'Vasiliy Solovyov, Sergey Bondarchuk', 'Ludmila Savelyeva, Sergey Bondarchuk, Vyacheslav Tikhonov, Boris Zakhava, Viktor Stanitsyn, Kira Golovko, Sergei Yermilov, Irina Gubanova', null, 'In 1812, as Napoleon''s army invades Russia, Kutuzov asks Bolkonsky to join him as a staff officer, yet the prince requests a command in the field. Pierre sets out to watch the armies'' impending confrontation. As the Battle of Borodino rages, he volunteers to assist in an artillery battery. Part three of the four-part adaptation of Leo Tolstoy''s 1869 novel.', 'In 1812, as Napoleon''s army invades Russia, Kutuzov asks Bolkonsky to join him as a staff officer, yet the prince requests a command in the field. Pierre sets out to watch the armies'' impending confrontation. As the Battle of Borodino rages, he volunteers to assist in an artillery battery. Part three of the four-part adaptation of Leo Tolstoy''s 1869 novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IoHDaPpoa344ggOqYJ1UI7sWhZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149467'),
  ('128435383255309659', 'War and Peace, Part IV: Pierre Bezukhov', 1967, 'History, Romance, War, Drama', 'Sergey Bondarchuk, Anatoly Petritsky, Yuri Mikhailov', 'Sergey Bondarchuk, Vasiliy Solovyov', 'Sergey Bondarchuk, Ludmila Savelyeva, Vyacheslav Tikhonov, Viktor Stanitsyn, Kira Golovko, Sergei Yermilov, Irina Gubanova, Antonina Shuranova', null, 'As Moscow is set ablaze by the retreating Russians, the Rostovs flee their estate, taking wounded soldiers with them, and unbeknownst to them, also Andrei. Pierre, dressed as a peasant, tries to assassinate Napoleon but is taken prisoner. As the French are forced to retreat, he''s marched for months with the Grande Armée, until being freed by a raiding party. Part four of the four-part adaptation of Leo Tolstoy''s 1869 novel.', 'As Moscow is set ablaze by the retreating Russians, the Rostovs flee their estate, taking wounded soldiers with them, and unbeknownst to them, also Andrei. Pierre, dressed as a peasant, tries to assassinate Napoleon but is taken prisoner. As the French are forced to retreat, he''s marched for months with the Grande Armée, until being freed by a raiding party. Part four of the four-part adaptation of Leo Tolstoy''s 1869 novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZsw2D6OMuoXjpPCae5wZ3Bv3YS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149468'),
  ('1115612911509873447', 'War and Pieces', 1964, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', null, null, null, 'After another failed series of attempts to catch the ever-elusive Road Runner with a grenade, a bow, a rope, invisible paint, and a gun disguised as a peep show, Wile E. Coyote uses a rocket to chase after the bird. The rocket goes off course, crashes through the earth and sends Wile E. to China where a Chinese Road Runner greets him.', 'After another failed series of attempts to catch the ever-elusive Road Runner with a grenade, a bow, a rope, invisible paint, and a gun disguised as a peep show, Wile E. Coyote uses a rocket to chase after the bird. The rocket goes off course, crashes through the earth and sends Wile E. to China where a Chinese Road Runner greets him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quVlVeDpDMopqqQgTe2OYoCqQW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234430'),
  ('49955741027958186', 'War Arrow', 1953, 'Western', 'George Sherman, William H. Daniels, Joseph Gershenson', 'John Michael Hayes', 'Maureen O''Hara, Jeff Chandler, John McIntire, Suzan Ball, Noah Beery Jr., Charles Drake, Henry Brandon, Dennis Weaver', 'NR', 'A thrilling Cavalry-versus-Indians adventure starring Jeff Chandler as an Army official recruiting Seminole allies, against his superior''s wishes, to stop a planned Kiowa attack.', 'A thrilling Cavalry-versus-Indians adventure starring Jeff Chandler as an Army official recruiting Seminole allies, against his superior''s wishes, to stop a planned Kiowa attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbEFnB6HAYcODwgUe7FW2xUHkcF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60551'),
  ('576397562386141566', 'War Babies', 1932, 'Comedy', 'Charles Lamont', null, 'Shirley Temple, Georgie Billings, Eugene Butler, Philip Hurlic, Georgie Smith', null, 'A group of soldiers in a café watch a dancer as she entertains them, but later two of them become rivals over her.', 'A group of soldiers in a café watch a dancer as she entertains them, but later two of them become rivals over her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urToJMFPoQLr5XXTPbVFvJh7cPX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156412'),
  ('388710932532614807', 'War Between the Planets', 1966, 'Science Fiction', 'Antonio Margheriti', 'Ivan Reiner, Renato Moretti', 'Giacomo Rossi Stuart, Ombretta Colli, Enzo Fiermonte, Halina Zalewska, Goffredo Unger, Pietro Martellanza, John Bartha, Marco Bogliani', null, 'Scientists try to prevent a collision between Earth and a planet that is heading for it.', 'Scientists try to prevent a collision between Earth and a planet that is heading for it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTHAhaBlZfRpJ9ngjZy5gM02dgO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28539'),
  ('781317424319928780', 'War Comes to America', 1945, 'Documentary, War', 'Frank Capra, Anatole Litvak', null, 'Walter Huston, Lloyd Nolan', null, 'The seventh and final film of Frank Capra''s Why We Fight World War II propaganda film series. This entry attempts to describe the factors leading up to America''s entry into the Second World War.', 'The seventh and final film of Frank Capra''s Why We Fight World War II propaganda film series. This entry attempts to describe the factors leading up to America''s entry into the Second World War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2zocBTXIsYfp0DSNydcvzdNgxy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162865'),
  ('348619131754873743', 'War Dogs', 2016, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Lawrence Sher, Todd Phillips, Desma Murphy', 'Stephen Chin, Jason Smilovic, Todd Phillips', 'Miles Teller, Jonah Hill, Ana de Armas, Bradley Cooper, Kevin Pollak, Patrick St. Esprit, Shaun Toub, JB Blanc', 'R', 'Based on the true story of two young men, David Packouz and Efraim Diveroli, who won a $300 million contract from the Pentagon to arm America''s allies in Afghanistan.', 'Based on the true story of two young men, David Packouz and Efraim Diveroli, who won a $300 million contract from the Pentagon to arm America''s allies in Afghanistan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDcPRjZC1bb6LavFU3gwsWdVfCM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308266'),
  ('468164502030915612', 'War Drums', 1957, 'Western', 'William Margulies, Reginald Le Borg', 'Gerald Drayson Adams', 'Lex Barker, Joan Taylor, Ben Johnson, Larry Chance, Richard H. Cutting, John Pickard, James Parnell, John Colicos', 'PG', 'The friendship between a white man &amp; an Apache chief is tested when they fall in love with the same woman', 'The friendship between a white man &amp; an Apache chief is tested when they fall in love with the same woman', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3MgyodmJ45w3spAPQdt6TYj7le.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191583'),
  ('1103446295913483734', 'War for the Planet of the Apes', 2017, 'Drama, Science Fiction, War', 'Matt Reeves, Michael Seresin, Maya Shimoguchi', 'Mark Bomback, Matt Reeves', 'Andy Serkis, Woody Harrelson, Karin Konoval, Terry Notary, Steve Zahn, Amiah Miller, Ty Olsson, Michael Adamthwaite', 'PG-13', 'Caesar and his apes are forced into a deadly conflict with an army of humans led by a ruthless Colonel. After the apes suffer unimaginable losses, Caesar wrestles with his darker instincts and begins his own mythic quest to avenge his kind. As the journey finally brings them face to face, Caesar and the Colonel are pitted against each other in an epic battle that will determine the fate of both their species and the future of the planet.', 'Caesar and his apes are forced into a deadly conflict with an army of humans led by a ruthless Colonel. After the apes suffer unimaginable losses, Caesar wrestles with his darker instincts and begins his own mythic quest to avenge his kind. As the journey finally brings them face to face, Caesar and the Colonel are pitted against each other in an epic battle that will determine the fate of both their species and the future of the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vYhLLxrTtZLysXtIWktmd57Snv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281338'),
  ('913173610522144106', 'War Games: At the End of the Day', 2011, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Cosimo Alemà, Federico Sponsilli, Marco Bassano', 'Romana Meggiolaro, Cosimo Alemà, Daniele Persica', 'Stephanie Chapman Baker, Sam Cohan, Valene Kane, Neil Linpow, Lutz Michael, Andrew Harwood Mills, Monica Mirga, Michael Schermi', null, 'A game of paintball turns deadly when three unhinged and deranged ex-soldiers play a twisted mind game of catch and release with their unsuspecting victims. This quickly leads to a bloody man hunt where everyone is a target and no one is safe.', 'A game of paintball turns deadly when three unhinged and deranged ex-soldiers play a twisted mind game of catch and release with their unsuspecting victims. This quickly leads to a bloody man hunt where everyone is a target and no one is safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8MvtZfCrVUY0yCMokEs8F85CnxF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78352'),
  ('1108864239229629525', 'War Goddess', 1973, 'Action, Adventure', 'Terence Young, Alejandro Ulloa, Aldo Tonti', 'Antonio Recoder, Charles Spaak', 'Alena Johnston, Sabine Sun, Rosanna Yanni, Helga Liné, Malisa Longo, Luciana Paluzzi, Rebecca Potok, Lucy Tiller', 'R', 'Alena Johnston is Antione, the War Goddess of the Amazons, who must mate with the Greek king Theseus to propogate her race. Traditionally this is done only out of duty, but this time she falls in love with her "boy toy"... a definite no-no for an Amazon queen. Helmed by James Bond director Terence Young and based on a story co-authored by Robert Graves, this sexy and spectacular entry in the sword-and-sandal genre features an incredible bevy of Euro-cult starlets including Rosanna Yanni, Helga Line and Luciana Paluzzi, plus a lyrical score by Academy Award-winner Riz Ortolani.', 'Alena Johnston is Antione, the War Goddess of the Amazons, who must mate with the Greek king Theseus to propogate her race. Traditionally this is done only out of duty, but this time she falls in love with her "boy toy"... a definite no-no for an Amazon queen. Helmed by James Bond director Terence Young and based on a story co-authored by Robert Graves, this sexy and spectacular entry in the sword-and-sandal genre features an incredible bevy of Euro-cult starlets including Rosanna Yanni, Helga Line and Luciana Paluzzi, plus a lyrical score by Academy Award-winner Riz Ortolani.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLk6OxYjkQi5003bCmiZAB9vcy2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68865'),
  ('344308892704642631', 'War Horse', 2011, 'War, History, Adventure', 'Steven Spielberg, Janusz Kamiński, Carmen Ruiz de Huidobro', 'Richard Curtis', 'Jeremy Irvine, Peter Mullan, Emily Watson, Niels Arestrup, David Thewlis, Tom Hiddleston, Benedict Cumberbatch, Céline Buckens', 'PG-13', 'On the brink of the First World War, Albert''s beloved horse Joey is sold to the Cavalry by his father. Against the backdrop of the Great War, Joey begins an odyssey full of danger, joy, and sorrow, and he transforms everyone he meets along the way. Meanwhile, Albert, unable to forget his equine friend, searches the battlefields of France to find Joey and bring him home.', 'On the brink of the First World War, Albert''s beloved horse Joey is sold to the Cavalry by his father. Against the backdrop of the Great War, Joey begins an odyssey full of danger, joy, and sorrow, and he transforms everyone he meets along the way. Meanwhile, Albert, unable to forget his equine friend, searches the battlefields of France to find Joey and bring him home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aRHhvvngFPJFy5uAjo7GVr3PhL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57212'),
  ('285230874682648524', 'War Hunt', 1962, 'Drama, War', 'Denis Sanders, Ted D. McCord, Jack Bohrer', 'Stanford Whitmore', 'John Saxon, Charles Aidman, Sydney Pollack, Tommy Matsuda, Gavin MacLeod, Robert Redford, Anthony Ray, Tom Skerritt', null, 'Dispatched to the front lines during the Korean War, an idealistic American soldier discovers the horrors of combat and comes at odds with a psychopathic member of his platoon.', 'Dispatched to the front lines during the Korean War, an idealistic American soldier discovers the horrors of combat and comes at odds with a psychopathic member of his platoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31b3W1v8MOeOpYuk3dBSXFNpiHG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32071'),
  ('1107293715726044716', 'WAR IS OVER! Inspired by the Music of John & Yoko', 2023, 'Animation, Music, War', 'Dave Mullins, Antonio Riestra', 'Dave Mullins', null, null, 'Set in an alternate WWI reality where a senseless war rages on, two soldiers on opposite sides of the conflict play a joyful game of chess. A heroic carrier pigeon delivers the soldiers'' chess moves over the battlefield as the fighting escalates. Neither soldier knows his opponent as the game and the war builds to its climatic final move. Whoever wins the game, one thing is for certain: there are no winners in war.', 'Set in an alternate WWI reality where a senseless war rages on, two soldiers on opposite sides of the conflict play a joyful game of chess. A heroic carrier pigeon delivers the soldiers'' chess moves over the battlefield as the fighting escalates. Neither soldier knows his opponent as the game and the war builds to its climatic final move. Whoever wins the game, one thing is for certain: there are no winners in war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8HG8jpjVa44hgMkVN91ZQ0Iw5B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214020'),
  ('671106023516843204', 'War Italian Style', 1965, 'War, Comedy', 'Luigi Scattini, Fausto Zuccoli, Mauro Sacripanti', 'Castellano, Pipolo', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Buster Keaton, Fred Clark, Martha Hyer, Franco Ressel, Tommaso Alvieri, Barbara Loy', null, 'It''s May 1943, and two Italian American soldiers, Joe and Frank, are searching the North African desert for a Nazi general called Von Kassler. Von Kassler''s aide captures them, and arranges for them to escape with fake war plans. But, things don''t go exactly as planned for either side.', 'It''s May 1943, and two Italian American soldiers, Joe and Frank, are searching the North African desert for a Nazi general called Von Kassler. Von Kassler''s aide captures them, and arranges for them to escape with fake war plans. But, things don''t go exactly as planned for either side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKtCVbuEnhjbaUJ29u7LB4SDpXu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53623'),
  ('722785779531518103', 'War Machine', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'David Michôd, Dariusz Wolski, Matthew Gray', 'David Michôd', 'Brad Pitt, Anthony Michael Hall, Emory Cohen, John Magaro, Topher Grace, Tilda Swinton, Daniel Betts, Aymen Hamdouchi', 'R', 'A rock star general bent on winning the “impossible” war in Afghanistan takes us inside the complex machinery of modern war. Inspired by the true story of General Stanley McChrystal.', 'A rock star general bent on winning the “impossible” war in Afghanistan takes us inside the complex machinery of modern war. Inspired by the true story of General Stanley McChrystal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bU2Q2rCH5VFrJNKSyx6wSmQZFsX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354287'),
  ('59326702604315053', 'War Machine', 2026, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Patrick Hughes, Nick Satriano, Gelareh Kiazand', 'Patrick Hughes, James Beaufort', 'Alan Ritchson, Dennis Quaid, Stephan James, Jai Courtney, Esai Morales, Blake Richardson, Keiynan Lonsdale, Jack Patten', 'R', 'On one last grueling mission during Army Ranger training, a combat engineer must lead his unit in a fight against a giant otherworldly killing machine.', 'On one last grueling mission during Army Ranger training, a combat engineer must lead his unit in a fight against a giant otherworldly killing machine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlPgDzwIE7VYYIIAGCTUOnN4wI1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1265609'),
  ('1134887097293564326', 'War Made Easy', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Loretta Alper, Jeremy Earp', 'Jeremy Earp, Loretta Alper', 'Sean Penn', null, 'War Made Easy reaches into the Orwellian memory hole to expose a 50-year pattern of government deception and media spin that has dragged the United States into one war after another from Vietnam to Iraq. revealing in stunning detail how the American news media have uncritically disseminated the pro-war messages of successive presidential administrations.', 'War Made Easy reaches into the Orwellian memory hole to expose a 50-year pattern of government deception and media spin that has dragged the United States into one war after another from Vietnam to Iraq. revealing in stunning detail how the American news media have uncritically disseminated the pro-war messages of successive presidential administrations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yH7cCg7gR7p5cpwKhefz2TZCRM5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22911'),
  ('992567603697230707', 'War of Likes', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Isi Sarfati, María Ripoll', 'Eduardo Cisneros, Jason Shuman', 'Regina Blandón, Ludwika Paleta, José Sefami, Pablo Cruz Guerrero, Michelle Rodríguez, Patricia Bernal, Paulette Hernández, Loreto Peralta', null, 'In order to advance her career in the dynamic world of publicity in Mexico City, Raquel tries to reunite with her high school friend Cecy who has become the queen of social media. But unlike followers, friendships do not come instantly.', 'In order to advance her career in the dynamic world of publicity in Mexico City, Raquel tries to reunite with her high school friend Cecy who has become the queen of social media. But unlike followers, friendships do not come instantly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpdWHOu6EJbYnLXLCA52h82nLEz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:709629'),
  ('904477367370832846', 'War of the Arrows', 2011, 'Drama, Action, History', 'Park Jong-cheol, Kim Han-min, Kim Tae-sung', 'Kim Han-min', 'Park Hae-il, Moon Chae-won, Kim Moo-yul, Ryu Seung-ryong, Park Ki-woong, Ryohei Otani, David Lee, Lee Han-wi', 'NR', 'After the death of their father, two siblings are raised by their father''s best friend. However, when one gets kidnapped just before her wedding, the other rises against the Manchus.', 'After the death of their father, two siblings are raised by their father''s best friend. However, when one gets kidnapped just before her wedding, the other rises against the Manchus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOTRRHt9GNbUfQhV3MhMCznjrPI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79224'),
  ('456422788684907913', 'War of the Birds', 1990, 'Family, Animation', 'Jannik Hastrup', 'Bent Haller', 'Sofie Bredesen, Vigga Bro, Lisbet Dahl, Pernille Hansen, Anne Marie Helger, Tommy Kenter, Per Pallesen, Claus Ryskjær', null, 'Fagin is the bad bird of an otherwise idyllic forest. He assaults the nest of two wrens and destroys all their eggs except one that, when hatched, is adopted by an owl (patterned on W. C. Fields). A counter-offensive against Fagin is launched with help enlisted from a seagull named Armstrong, two nice mice and a sparrow. There is romance, too, and a jazzy score goes with this animated ornithology extravaganza.', 'Fagin is the bad bird of an otherwise idyllic forest. He assaults the nest of two wrens and destroys all their eggs except one that, when hatched, is adopted by an owl (patterned on W. C. Fields). A counter-offensive against Fagin is launched with help enlisted from a seagull named Armstrong, two nice mice and a sparrow. There is romance, too, and a jazzy score goes with this animated ornithology extravaganza.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BR71a0ZmaMoLKoRxMR49NW4sXu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43953'),
  ('322021876950971121', 'War of the Buttons', 1962, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'André Bac, Yves Robert, Régis Forissier', 'Yves Robert, François Boyer', 'Jacques Dufilho, Yvette Etiévant, Michel Galabru, Michèle Méritz, Jean Richard, Pierre Tchernia, Pierre Trabaud, Claude Confortès', null, 'For generations, two rival French villages, Longueverne and Velrans, have been at war. But this is no ordinary conflict, for the on-going hostilities are between two armies of young schoolboys. When he is beaten by his father for having lost his buttons, the leader of the Longueverne army, Lebrac, has an idea which will give his side the advantage: next time, he and his brave soldiers will go in battle without their clothes...', 'For generations, two rival French villages, Longueverne and Velrans, have been at war. But this is no ordinary conflict, for the on-going hostilities are between two armies of young schoolboys. When he is beaten by his father for having lost his buttons, the leader of the Longueverne army, Lebrac, has an idea which will give his side the advantage: next time, he and his brave soldiers will go in battle without their clothes...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tg3RwUclgnW3hM1ExHkMd71YQ0n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10421'),
  ('286676694470132908', 'War of the Buttons', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Adventure, Family', 'John Roberts, Bruno de Keyzer, Phil Harvey', 'Colin Welland', 'Liam Cunningham, Colm Meaney, Ger Ryan, Gregg Fitzgerald, Gerard Kearney, Darragh Naughton, Brendan McNamara, Kevin O''Malley', 'PG', 'War between two Irish youth gangs consists of removing and retrieving buttons from each other''s clothing.', 'War between two Irish youth gangs consists of removing and retrieving buttons from each other''s clothing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqsNLBj1MKzq2uqvegAgoE0gG1M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38348'),
  ('1045416259045785615', 'War of the Buttons', 2011, 'Adventure, Family', 'Christophe Barratier', 'Stéphane Keller, Christophe Barratier', 'Jean Texier, Clément Godefroy, Théophile Baquet, Louis Dussol, Harold Werner, Nathan Parent, Ilona Bachelier, Thomas Goldberg', null, 'Occupied France; Lebrac leads a play war between two rival kid gangs, but a girl he likes, who''s Jewish, is in danger of being discovered by local Nazi sympathisers. Lebrac and the village must now respond to the reality of what''s happening.', 'Occupied France; Lebrac leads a play war between two rival kid gangs, but a girl he likes, who''s Jewish, is in danger of being discovered by local Nazi sympathisers. Lebrac and the village must now respond to the reality of what''s happening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbHA54dGwlgJ1Fu3fNW3Y9qIOCU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74945'),
  ('998895162912935029', 'War of the Colossal Beast', 1958, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Bert I. Gordon, Jack A. Marta, Herbert E. Mendelson', 'George Worthing Yates', 'Sally Fraser, Roger Pace, Duncan ''Dean'' Parkin, Russ Bender, Rico Alaniz, George Becwar, Roberto Hernández, Charles Stewart', 'NR', 'Glenn Manning, "The Amazing Colossal Man," believed dead after falling from the Hoover Dam, reemerges in rural Mexico, brain damaged, disfigured, and very angry.', 'Glenn Manning, "The Amazing Colossal Man," believed dead after falling from the Hoover Dam, reemerges in rural Mexico, brain damaged, disfigured, and very angry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIQI3aN8zHZAmrCCm74EgwLcuVt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38269'),
  ('400436199573104568', 'War of the Dead', 2011, 'Horror, Action, Adventure', 'Marko Mäkilaakso', 'Marko Mäkilaakso, Barr B. Potter', 'Andrew Tiernan, Mikko Leppilampi, Jouko Ahola, Samuli Vauramo, Andrius Paulavičius, Andreas Wilson, Antti Reini, Magdalena Górska', null, 'Captain Martin Stone is leading a finely-trained, elite platoon of Allied soldiers as they attack an enemy bunker. Underestimating their enemy''s strength, they are quickly beaten back into the forest. As they try to regroup, they are suddenly attacked by the same soldiers they had just killed a few minutes earlier. Forced to flee deeper into Russian territory, they discover one of war''s most terrifying secrets and realize they have woken up a far more deadlier enemy.', 'Captain Martin Stone is leading a finely-trained, elite platoon of Allied soldiers as they attack an enemy bunker. Underestimating their enemy''s strength, they are quickly beaten back into the forest. As they try to regroup, they are suddenly attacked by the same soldiers they had just killed a few minutes earlier. Forced to flee deeper into Russian territory, they discover one of war''s most terrifying secrets and realize they have woken up a far more deadlier enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYT0qHKT4b9GQ5AKgzErq9k7ZL7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77068'),
  ('457125347617616694', 'War of the Planets', 1966, 'Science Fiction', 'Antonio Margheriti, Riccardo Pallottini', 'Renato Moretti, Ivan Reiner', 'Tony Russel, Lisa Gastoni, Franco Nero, Carlo Giustini, Enzo Fiermonte, Linda Sini, Nando Angelini, Corinne Fontaine', null, 'In the 21st century, aliens with mind-control powers attempt to take over the earth.', 'In the 21st century, aliens with mind-control powers attempt to take over the earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpPsnVpEplmD9kLHS2wL0Oc73cU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79364'),
  ('684908788221501872', 'War of the Planets', 1977, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Alfonso Brescia, Silvio Fraschetti, Max Carr', 'Alfonso Brescia, Aldo Crudo', 'John Richardson, Yanti Somer, West Buchanan, Katia Christine, Vassili Karis, Eleonora King, Percy Hogan, Giuseppe Fortis', 'PG', 'A strange signal arrives on the Earth disturbing all communications, while an UFO appears above the Antarctic sea. Captain Alex Hamilton is sent with his spaceship and crew to the space outside the Solar System to find the origin of that signal. They reach an unknown planet where a giant robot enslaved a whole population of humanoids by taking their psychic energies.', 'A strange signal arrives on the Earth disturbing all communications, while an UFO appears above the Antarctic sea. Captain Alex Hamilton is sent with his spaceship and crew to the space outside the Solar System to find the origin of that signal. They reach an unknown planet where a giant robot enslaved a whole population of humanoids by taking their psychic energies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hLYmiAEMDVoWplR8wWiaIgPuYN2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47605'),
  ('371320254858235378', 'War of the Satellites', 1958, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Roger Corman, Floyd Crosby', 'Lawrence L. Goldman', 'Dick Miller, Susan Cabot, Richard Devon, Robert Shayne, Michael Fox, Eric Sinclair, Jered Barclay, John Brinkley', null, 'An "unknown force" declares war against planet Earth when the United Nations disobeys warnings to cease and desist in its attempts at assembling the first satellite in the atmosphere.', 'An "unknown force" declares war against planet Earth when the United Nations disobeys warnings to cease and desist in its attempts at assembling the first satellite in the atmosphere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMVAUWyl3JDtzYmwmlTPOOiJa2g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29065'),
  ('30059515404364907', 'War of the Underworld', 1996, 'Action, Crime', 'Herman Yau', 'Wong Jing, Cheng Man-Fai', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Carman Lee Yeuk-Tung, Simon Lui Yu-Yeung, Michael Lam Wai-Leung, Frankie Ng Chi-Hung, Collin Chou, Allen Ting Chi-Chun', null, 'When the son of a gang leader manages to insult the son of a rival gang leader, total war erupts between the rival gangs, and the young hero is forced to do terrible things in order to maintain order and honor.', 'When the son of a gang leader manages to insult the son of a rival gang leader, total war erupts between the rival gangs, and the young hero is forced to do terrible things in order to maintain order and honor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZVfE76gC24TJ7QsswI66cfpfGt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118416'),
  ('143423796715025819', 'War of the Worlds', 2005, 'Adventure, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Janusz Kamiński, Steven Spielberg, Tony Fanning', 'David Koepp, Josh Friedman', 'Tom Cruise, Dakota Fanning, Justin Chatwin, Miranda Otto, Tim Robbins, Rick Gonzalez, Yul Vazquez, Lenny Venito', 'PG-13', 'Ray Ferrier is a divorced dockworker and less-than-perfect father. Soon after his ex-wife and her new husband drop off his teenage son and young daughter for a rare weekend visit, a strange and powerful lightning storm touches down.', 'Ray Ferrier is a divorced dockworker and less-than-perfect father. Soon after his ex-wife and her new husband drop off his teenage son and young daughter for a rare weekend visit, a strange and powerful lightning storm touches down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Biy7R9LfumYshur3YKhpj56MpB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74'),
