  ('536171606607575397', 'War of the Worlds 2: The Next Wave', 2008, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'C. Thomas Howell', 'David Michael Latt, Eric Forsberg', 'C. Thomas Howell, Fred Griffith, Zack Beseda, Christopher Reid, Kim Little, Jonathan Levit, Danna Brady, Darren Dalton', 'R', 'Two years after the Martian invasion, George Herbert''s worst fears are realized: The Aliens have returned. As a second wave of Martian walkers lay waste to what''s left of Earth, an alliance of military forces prepares a daring attack on the Red Planet itself. Once again, the future of mankind hangs in the balance.', 'Two years after the Martian invasion, George Herbert''s worst fears are realized: The Aliens have returned. As a second wave of Martian walkers lay waste to what''s left of Earth, an alliance of military forces prepares a daring attack on the Red Planet itself. Once again, the future of mankind hangs in the balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgvjzr1Ce6jTjmg4Z3Qt0hxCaYA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16268'),
  ('580205688963888996', 'War of the Worlds: Annihilation', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Maximilian Elfeldt, Michael Su', 'Conor Dowling', 'Arie Thompson, William Baldwin, Noel Gugliemi, Rashod Freelove, Kennedy Porter, Emree Franklin, Michael Marcel, Joseph Michael Harris', 'PG-13', 'A mother and son find themselves faced with a brutal alien invasion where survival will depend on discovering the unthinkable truth about the enemy.', 'A mother and son find themselves faced with a brutal alien invasion where survival will depend on discovering the unthinkable truth about the enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkkyb7uayYSKfjYGjLtRL8o0nmK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:919689'),
  ('85107300192543039', 'War of the Worlds: The Attack', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Mystery, Thriller', 'Junaid Syed, Hayley Medwell, Kate Hartnoll', 'Junaid Syed, Tom Jolliffe, Ritesh Rai', 'Sam Gittins, Leo Staar, Vincent Regan, Alhaji Fofana, Lara Lemon, Kathi deCouto, Frances Mather, Fredi ''Kruga'' Nwaka', null, 'Three young astronomers fight to survive a deadly Martian invasion.', 'Three young astronomers fight to survive a deadly Martian invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtar1NytLPRnd8hlwspeRRW5NVm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1103825'),
  ('610599921033145462', 'War on Everyone', 2016, 'Action, Comedy, Mystery', 'John Michael McDonagh, Bobby Bukowski', 'John Michael McDonagh', 'Michael Peña, Alexander Skarsgård, Theo James, Tessa Thompson, Caleb Landry Jones, Stephanie Sigman, David Wilmot, Malcolm Barrett', 'R', 'Two corrupt cops in New Mexico set out to blackmail and frame every criminal unfortunate enough to cross their path. Things take a sinister turn, however, when they try to intimidate someone who is more dangerous than they are. Or is he?', 'Two corrupt cops in New Mexico set out to blackmail and frame every criminal unfortunate enough to cross their path. Things take a sinister turn, however, when they try to intimidate someone who is more dangerous than they are. Or is he?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJAe5fBN90JbFj7AhZpyorY2W7i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333663'),
