  ('1068781017663114310', 'War Pigs', 2015, 'War, Action', 'Ryan Little, Ty Arnold, Michael L. Schaertl', 'Adam Emerson, Andrew Kightlinger', 'Luke Goss, Dolph Lundgren, Chuck Liddell, Noah Segan, Steven Luke, Mickey Rourke, Ryan Kelley, Angie Papanikolas', 'R', 'A rag tag unit of misfits known as the War Pigs must go behind enemy lines to exterminate Nazis by any means necessary.', 'A rag tag unit of misfits known as the War Pigs must go behind enemy lines to exterminate Nazis by any means necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKTFCdZjocd4kFwVkhBoKFokWzY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348811'),
  ('34097033527082157', 'War Pony', 2023, 'Drama', 'David Gallego, Gina Gammell, Riley Keough', 'Gina Gammell, Franklin Sioux Bob, Bill Reddy', 'Jojo Bapteise Whiting, LaDainian Crazy Thunder, Robert Stover, Ashley Shelton, Iona Red Bear, Ta-Yamni Long Black Cat, Wilma Colhof, Jeremy Corbin Cottier', 'R', 'The interlocking stories of two Lakota boys growing up on Pine Ridge Reservation. At 23, Bill just wants to make something of himself. Meanwhile, 12-year-old Matho can’t wait to become a man. Bound by their shared search for belonging, each of the boys grapple with identity, family, and loss, as they navigate their unique paths to manhood.', 'The interlocking stories of two Lakota boys growing up on Pine Ridge Reservation. At 23, Bill just wants to make something of himself. Meanwhile, 12-year-old Matho can’t wait to become a man. Bound by their shared search for belonging, each of the boys grapple with identity, family, and loss, as they navigate their unique paths to manhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oN2NCnVq0FTHvvIxKBEEJy8dhrr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:962566'),
  ('145821078840427977', 'War Requiem', 1989, 'War, Drama', 'Derek Jarman, Richard Greatrex', 'Derek Jarman', 'Nathaniel Parker, Tilda Swinton, Laurence Olivier, Patricia Hayes, Rohan McCullough, Nigel Terry, Owen Teale, Sean Bean', null, 'During World War I, British soldier Owen is mortified by the examples of cruelty that surround him in the trenches. He combats these terrifying images by maintaining hope in his love for an army nurse. But he also begins to accept his fate as another battlefield sacrifice.', 'During World War I, British soldier Owen is mortified by the examples of cruelty that surround him in the trenches. He combats these terrifying images by maintaining hope in his love for an army nurse. But he also begins to accept his fate as another battlefield sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2DvcGnf4eQs5bfttuNQLm35UtQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41947'),
  ('198925052955750400', 'War Sailor', 2022, 'Drama, War, History', 'Sturla Brandth Grøvlen, Gunnar Vikene, Roar Fjørtoft', 'Gunnar Vikene', 'Kristoffer Joner, Pål Sverre Hagen, Ine Marie Wilmann, Henrikke Lund Olsen, Armand Hannestad, Alexandra Gjerpen, Florian Schmidtke, Tina Rizzo', null, 'War Sailor is a magnificent drama that tells the story of the more than 30,000 Norwegian war sailors and their families'' fate during and after the Second World War.', 'War Sailor is a magnificent drama that tells the story of the more than 30,000 Norwegian war sailors and their families'' fate during and after the Second World War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dcPepf0zLwAB10aW7BlU7YwZCWa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:924154'),
  ('451879440953237851', 'War Story', 1989, 'Documentary, War, Animation, Comedy', 'Peter Lord', null, 'Bill Perry, Peter Lawrence', null, 'This claymation short film uses a real interview for dialogue. Bill Perry relates stories about his youth, his tilted house, and adventures during WWII in Bristol, England during the blitz. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive.', 'This claymation short film uses a real interview for dialogue. Bill Perry relates stories about his youth, his tilted house, and adventures during WWII in Bristol, England during the blitz. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDDSfUiaZLu3KtupBHQMmqMNerW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167662'),
  ('949761801045336931', 'War Witch', 2012, 'Drama, War', 'Kim Nguyen, Nicolas Bolduc', 'Kim Nguyen', 'Rachel Mwanza, Alain Lino Mic Eli Bastien, Serge Kanyinda, Ralph Prosper, Mizinga Mwinga, Diane Uwamahoro, Jean Kabuya, Jupiter Bokondji', 'NR', 'Somewhere in Sub-Saharan Africa, Komona a 14-year-old girl tells her unborn child growing inside her the story of her life since she has been at war. Everything started when she was abducted by the rebel army at the age of 12.', 'Somewhere in Sub-Saharan Africa, Komona a 14-year-old girl tells her unborn child growing inside her the story of her life since she has been at war. Everything started when she was abducted by the rebel army at the age of 12.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78Yi8mzd1S04ANbdlxI1FkMl4Vx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98205'),
  ('481603198181458310', 'War-Gods of the Deep', 1965, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Jacques Tourneur, Stephen Dade', 'Charles Bennett, Louis M. Heyward', 'Vincent Price, David Tomlinson, Tab Hunter, Susan Hart, John Le Mesurier, Henry Oscar, Derek Newark, Roy Patrick', 'NR', 'A chance discovery leads American mining engineer Ben Harris and acquaintance Harold to discover a lost city under the sea while searching for their kidnapped friend Jill. Held captive in the underwater city by the tyrannical Captain (Vincent Price), and his crew of former smugglers, the three plot to escape...', 'A chance discovery leads American mining engineer Ben Harris and acquaintance Harold to discover a lost city under the sea while searching for their kidnapped friend Jill. Held captive in the underwater city by the tyrannical Captain (Vincent Price), and his crew of former smugglers, the three plot to escape...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8zFBSOpblP7XoTfRkftqhYyAFp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38267'),
  ('983239902329151376', 'War-Time Romance', 1983, 'Drama, Romance', 'Valeri Blinov, Pyotr Todorovskiy, Eduard Goncharenko', 'Pyotr Todorovskiy', 'Nikolay Burlyaev, Natalya Andreychenko, Inna Churikova, Zinoviy Gerdt, Viktor Proskurin, Yelena Kozelkova, Yekaterina Yudina, Aleksandr Martynov', null, 'This melodrama revolves around the post-war meeting reunion an intelligent front-line officer, now happily married, and a woman street vendor. This encounter reawakens in them submerged feelings of gratitude and tenderness as the officer recalls how they met during the war and what she used to mean to him. Now he learns that she is alone with a small daughter, the girl''s father having been killed at the front.', 'This melodrama revolves around the post-war meeting reunion an intelligent front-line officer, now happily married, and a woman street vendor. This encounter reawakens in them submerged feelings of gratitude and tenderness as the officer recalls how they met during the war and what she used to mean to him. Now he learns that she is alone with a small daughter, the girl''s father having been killed at the front.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNrnQUGb7OETIBQ1i2hSrXH4AZ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197366'),
  ('124461269306216417', 'War, Inc.', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Thriller', 'Joshua Seftel, Zoran Popović', 'Jeremy Pikser, Mark Leyner, John Cusack', 'John Cusack, Hilary Duff, Marisa Tomei, Joan Cusack, Dan Aykroyd, Sergej Trifunović, Ned Bellamy, John McLaughlin', 'R', 'In the future, the desert country of Turaqistan is torn by a riot after private corporation Tamerlane, owned by the former Vice President of the United States, has taken over. Brand Hauser, a hitman who suppresses his emotions by gobbling down hot sauce, is hired by the corporation''s head to kill the CEO of their competitors.', 'In the future, the desert country of Turaqistan is torn by a riot after private corporation Tamerlane, owned by the former Vice President of the United States, has taken over. Brand Hauser, a hitman who suppresses his emotions by gobbling down hot sauce, is hired by the corporation''s head to kill the CEO of their competitors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlGsWWYC9n4lkbIoTXmI42dkJqb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13191'),
  ('63284177808991156', 'Wara Wara', 1930, 'Drama, Romance', 'José María Velasco Maidana', 'José María Velasco Maidana', 'Juanita Tallansier, Martha de Velasco, Arturo Borda, Emmo Reyes, Eduardo Camacho', null, 'Set in the 16th century, a peaceful Inca community is massacred by a group of conquistadors, and the survivors including Wara Wara flee into the mountains. Later, Wara Wara is assaulted by two Spanish soldiers, and rescued by a conquistador with a noble heart. The two fall in love, but are confronted with the mutual hatred between their peoples. Sentenced to death, they escape, and live happily ever after.', 'Set in the 16th century, a peaceful Inca community is massacred by a group of conquistadors, and the survivors including Wara Wara flee into the mountains. Later, Wara Wara is assaulted by two Spanish soldiers, and rescued by a conquistador with a noble heart. The two fall in love, but are confronted with the mutual hatred between their peoples. Sentenced to death, they escape, and live happily ever after.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fZtMr4plRgIjhS8NmjKEx9tFy1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396280'),
  ('128440061722112109', 'Warat', 2026, 'Drama, Action', 'Christian Paolo Lat', null, 'Margaret Diaz, Itan Magnaye, Marco Gomez, Christy Imperial, Marcus Madrigal, Tabs Sumulong', null, 'A young woman enters a complicated relationship with a wealthy, influential man, drawn by promises of security and desire. What starts as passion slowly exposes manipulation, control, and the dark cost of power.', 'A young woman enters a complicated relationship with a wealthy, influential man, drawn by promises of security and desire. What starts as passion slowly exposes manipulation, control, and the dark cost of power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8kvh7cV84Z2BBOo6kuSKIRJWnCa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1635518'),
  ('297068915993070045', 'Warbirds', 2008, 'Horror', 'Kevin Gendreau, Katey Wheelhouse, Jason Oertling', 'Kevin Gendreau', 'Jamie Elle Mann, Stephanie Honoré, Shauna Rappold, Brian Krause, Tohoru Masamune, Lucy Faust, David Jensen, Gizza Elizondo', 'PG', 'In the midst of World War 2, a OSS officer leads a group of female pilots on a mission to deliver a secret weapon, only to crash land on an island in the Pacific after an encounter with a deadly storm. On the island, they must not only contend with a small band of Japanese soldiers but the native inhabitants of the island as well - vicious prehistoric Pterodons.', 'In the midst of World War 2, a OSS officer leads a group of female pilots on a mission to deliver a secret weapon, only to crash land on an island in the Pacific after an encounter with a deadly storm. On the island, they must not only contend with a small band of Japanese soldiers but the native inhabitants of the island as well - vicious prehistoric Pterodons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msheSQvDIDCGEPd8D7SrcGAp0F6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42280'),
  ('395062646866738375', 'Warchief', 2024, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 'Stuart Brennan, Douglas Milsome', 'Stuart Brennan', 'Rosanna Miles, Stuart Brennan, Suzanne Packer, Mark Paul Wake, Michael Lambourne, Andrea Vasiliou, Steven Elliot, Johanna Allitt', 'R', 'A band of guardians are tasked with protecting a messenger who must urgently deliver vital information to their king. On their deadly quest across an ancient land, they face incredible danger as they battle against plague-ridden outcasts, dark magic, and vile monsters.', 'A band of guardians are tasked with protecting a messenger who must urgently deliver vital information to their king. On their deadly quest across an ancient land, they face incredible danger as they battle against plague-ridden outcasts, dark magic, and vile monsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFGOcPh7qzkNhTVH2ER0rTz4mfi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1067341'),
  ('607577469082783398', 'Warcraft', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Duncan Jones, Simon Duggan, Stewart Whelan', 'Charles Leavitt, Duncan Jones', 'Travis Fimmel, Paula Patton, Ben Foster, Dominic Cooper, Ben Schnetzer, Toby Kebbell, Robert Kazinsky, Clancy Brown', 'PG-13', 'The peaceful realm of Azeroth stands on the brink of war as its civilization faces a fearsome race of invaders: orc warriors fleeing their dying home to colonize another. As a portal opens to connect the two worlds, one army faces destruction and the other faces extinction. From opposing sides, two heroes are set on a collision course that will decide the fate of their family, their people, and their home.', 'The peaceful realm of Azeroth stands on the brink of war as its civilization faces a fearsome race of invaders: orc warriors fleeing their dying home to colonize another. As a portal opens to connect the two worlds, one army faces destruction and the other faces extinction. From opposing sides, two heroes are set on a collision course that will decide the fate of their family, their people, and their home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZIIOs06YigBnvmlJ2hxZeA8eTO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68735'),
  ('977749573254720004', 'Ward', 1973, 'Horror, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Đorđe Kadijević', 'Filip David, Đorđe Kadijević', 'Milan ''Caci'' Mihailović, Branko Pleša, Dušan Janićijević, Toma Kuruzović, Ljubomir Ćipranić, Svetlana Blagojević, Nadežda Vukićević, Damjan Klašnja', null, 'A terrified young man is being pursued by a mysterious man in black. He hides out in a nearby mental hospital, but can he escape his fate?', 'A terrified young man is being pursued by a mysterious man in black. He hides out in a nearby mental hospital, but can he escape his fate?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVzSrr5cx1t8tB7xRLcUJxcHfKM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173905'),
  ('580270881808562206', 'Wardriver', 2026, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Rebecca Thomas', 'Daniel Casey', 'Dane DeHaan, Sasha Calle, Mamoudou Athie, Jeffrey Donovan, William Belleau, Luz Ozuna', 'R', 'He’s a Wardriver: a hacker who steals from banks, not people—until he’s noticed. Now the money turns violent, and the woman caught in it could save him or kill them both.', 'He’s a Wardriver: a hacker who steals from banks, not people—until he’s noticed. Now the money turns violent, and the woman caught in it could save him or kill them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipTXhWCJgeg5RN0CpmFZYDzOzQi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:938150'),
  ('249255737011930666', 'Warehoused', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jack Zagha Kababie, Claudio Rocha', 'David Desola', 'Hoze Meléndez, José Carlos Ruiz, Fernando M. Briones, Jade Luna Castillo, Antonio Miranda', null, 'An employee about to retire and the young man who is to take over, share five journeys in the work place, an enormous empty warehouse where apparently nothing ever happens.', 'An employee about to retire and the young man who is to take over, share five journeys in the work place, an enormous empty warehouse where apparently nothing ever happens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4w3il1Ftu2PjWdwrojj1BXrMqrz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363289'),
  ('1025223529790212703', 'Warfare', 2025, 'War, Action', 'Ray Mendoza, Alex Garland, David J. Thompson', 'Alex Garland, Ray Mendoza', 'D''Pharaoh Woon-A-Tai, Will Poulter, Cosmo Jarvis, Kit Connor, Finn Bennett, Taylor John Smith, Michael Gandolfini, Adain Bradley', 'R', 'A platoon of Navy SEALs embarks on a dangerous mission in Ramadi, Iraq, with the chaos and brotherhood of war retold through their memories of the event.', 'A platoon of Navy SEALs embarks on a dangerous mission in Ramadi, Iraq, with the chaos and brotherhood of war retold through their memories of the event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l39TlELomwysfsr37vrvCV6rmaQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1241436'),
  ('790378576744271098', 'WarGames', 1983, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Drama', 'William A. Fraker, John Badham, Robert J. Doherty', 'Lawrence Lasker, Walter F. Parkes', 'Matthew Broderick, Dabney Coleman, John Wood, Ally Sheedy, Barry Corbin, Juanin Clay, Kent Williams, Dennis Lipscomb', 'PG', 'High school student David Lightman has a talent for hacking. But while trying to hack into a computer system to play unreleased video games, he unwittingly taps into the Department of Defense''s war computer and initiates a confrontation of global proportions. Together with his friend and a wizardly computer genius, David must race against time to outwit his opponent and prevent a nuclear Armageddon.', 'High school student David Lightman has a talent for hacking. But while trying to hack into a computer system to play unreleased video games, he unwittingly taps into the Department of Defense''s war computer and initiates a confrontation of global proportions. Together with his friend and a wizardly computer genius, David must race against time to outwit his opponent and prevent a nuclear Armageddon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZ1rN4LoPxKNfAp67Xl300WxVeD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:860'),
  ('8666584729561892', 'WarGames: The Dead Code', 2008, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller', 'Stuart Gillard, Angèle Gagnon, Michael A. Williams', 'Randall M. Badat', 'Matt Lanter, Amanda Walsh, Colm Feore, Chuck Shamata, Maxim Roy, Nicolas Wright, Gary Reineke, Susan Glover', 'PG-13', 'Computer hacker Will Farmer engages a government super-computer named Ripley in an online terrorist-attack simulation game. Little does Farmer know that Ripley has been designed to appeal to potential terrorists, and certain software glitches have in turn made him become paranoid.', 'Computer hacker Will Farmer engages a government super-computer named Ripley in an online terrorist-attack simulation game. Little does Farmer know that Ripley has been designed to appeal to potential terrorists, and certain software glitches have in turn made him become paranoid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwLR2K4CjRISMAER0Vy2xzhZ0W8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14154'),
  ('612214458311390540', 'Warhead', 1996, 'Action, Thriller', 'Rod Stewart, Mark Roper', 'Jeff Albert', 'Frank Zagarino, Joe Lara, Elizabeth Giordano, Brian O''Shaughnessy, Todd Jensen, Michael McCabe, Ian Yule, Ross Preller', null, 'Terrorists seize an American nuclear missile site and threaten to launch the missiles at Washington unless the President resigns immediately and $1 billion is placed in a Swiss account in 8 hours.', 'Terrorists seize an American nuclear missile site and threaten to launch the missiles at Washington unless the President resigns immediately and $1 billion is placed in a Swiss account in 8 hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urzmGYCCOUgHwdNzPZskf0VLS4b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69227'),
  ('885590403473498485', 'Warhorse One', 2023, 'Action, War, Drama', 'Johnny Strong, William Kaufman', 'Johnny Strong, William Kaufman', 'Johnny Strong, Athena Durner, Raj Kala, James Sherrill, Siya Rostami, Danny Augustus, Michael Sauers, Xander Gòmez', 'R', 'A gunned down Navy SEAL Master Chief must guide a child to safety through a gauntlet of hostile Taliban insurgents and survive the brutal Afghanistan wilderness.', 'A gunned down Navy SEAL Master Chief must guide a child to safety through a gauntlet of hostile Taliban insurgents and survive the brutal Afghanistan wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WYSPpjZ0zKr65yQes03QTPCrUh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1076487'),
  ('875135111868103479', 'WarHunt', 2022, 'Action, Horror, Thriller, War, Fantasy', 'Mauro Borrelli, Ruslan Fradkin, Svetlana Punte', 'Scott Svatos, Mauro Borrelli, Reggie Keyohara III', 'Robert Knepper, Jackson Rathbone, Mickey Rourke, Aglaya Tarasova, Anna Paliga, Lou Stassen, Fredrik Wagner, Lorenzo de Moor', 'R', '1945. A U.S. military cargo plane loses control and violently crashes behind enemy lines in the middle of the German black forest. Major Johnson sends a squad of his bravest soldiers on a rescue mission to retrieve the top-secret material the plane was carrying, led by Sergeants Brewer and Walsh. They soon discover hanged Nazi soldiers and other dead bodies bearing ancient, magical symbols. Suddenly their compasses fail, their perceptions twist and straying from the group leads to profound horrors as they are attacked by a powerful, supernatural force.', '1945. A U.S. military cargo plane loses control and violently crashes behind enemy lines in the middle of the German black forest. Major Johnson sends a squad of his bravest soldiers on a rescue mission to retrieve the top-secret material the plane was carrying, led by Sergeants Brewer and Walsh. They soon discover hanged Nazi soldiers and other dead bodies bearing ancient, magical symbols. Suddenly their compasses fail, their perceptions twist and straying from the group leads to profound horrors as they are attacked by a powerful, supernatural force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HFFwZOTBB7IPFmn9E0MXdWave3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:697799'),
  ('357046965098488571', 'Warlock', 1959, 'Western', 'Edward Dmytryk, Joseph MacDonald, Jack Gertsman', 'Robert Alan Aurthur', 'Richard Widmark, Henry Fonda, Anthony Quinn, Dorothy Malone, Dolores Michaels, Wallace Ford, Tom Drake, Richard Arlen', 'NR', 'A band of murderous cowboys has imposed a reign of terror on the town of Warlock. With the sheriff humiliatingly run out of town, the residents hire the services of Clay Blaisedell as de facto town marshal. He arrives along with his friend, Tom Morgan, and sets about restoring law and order on his own terms whilst also overseeing the establishment of a gambling house and saloon.', 'A band of murderous cowboys has imposed a reign of terror on the town of Warlock. With the sheriff humiliatingly run out of town, the residents hire the services of Clay Blaisedell as de facto town marshal. He arrives along with his friend, Tom Morgan, and sets about restoring law and order on his own terms whilst also overseeing the establishment of a gambling house and saloon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3E5PnM2KQvZEYC7LlzlaBZl7NS9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37412'),
  ('97816205940399594', 'Warlock', 1989, 'Horror, Fantasy, Action', 'Steve Miner, David Eggby, Matt Earl Beesley', 'David Twohy', 'Julian Sands, Lori Singer, Richard E. Grant, Mary Woronov, Kevin O''Brien, Richard Kuss, Allan Miller, Anna Thomson', 'R', 'In 17th century New England, witch hunter Giles Redferne captures an evil warlock, but the conjurer eludes death with supernatural help. Flung into the future, the warlock winds up in the 1980s and plans to bring about the end of the world. Redferne follows the enchanter into the modern era and continues his mission, but runs into trouble in such unfamiliar surroundings. With the help of a young woman, can Redferne finally defeat the warlock?', 'In 17th century New England, witch hunter Giles Redferne captures an evil warlock, but the conjurer eludes death with supernatural help. Flung into the future, the warlock winds up in the 1980s and plans to bring about the end of the world. Redferne follows the enchanter into the modern era and continues his mission, but runs into trouble in such unfamiliar surroundings. With the help of a young woman, can Redferne finally defeat the warlock?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QHjr4lBd3vBN4kEqdDFlnJbsa7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11342'),
  ('1089011686011057650', 'Warlock III: The End of Innocence', 1999, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Eric Freiser, Ivan McMahon, Michelle Fennessy', 'Bruce David Eisen, Eric Freiser', 'Bruce Payne, Ashley Laurence, Paul Francis, Jan Schwieterman, Angel Boris Reed, Rick Hearst, Boti Bliss, Eamonn Draper', 'R', 'A college student unexpectedly finds that she has inherited a derelict house. Accompanied by a group of friends, she goes there to clear it of heirlooms before the structure is demolished. Almost immediately, she and her friends are targeted by a powerful warlock who is very interested in her bloodline.', 'A college student unexpectedly finds that she has inherited a derelict house. Accompanied by a group of friends, she goes there to clear it of heirlooms before the structure is demolished. Almost immediately, she and her friends are targeted by a powerful warlock who is very interested in her bloodline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQ7XUn0cxdA5EUh59yk4J6Nr87C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26042'),
  ('830137906252613795', 'Warlock Moon', 1973, 'Horror, Thriller', 'William Herbert, Larry Secrist', 'William Herbert', 'Laurie Walters, Joe Spano, Edna MacAfee, Harry Bauer, Charles Raino, Ray K. Goman, Steve Solinsky, Richard Vielle', 'PG', 'Young lovers John and Jenny decide to go for a drive in the countryside one day when they happen upon the remains of a long-abandoned resort spa. After doing some exploring, they find that an elderly woman, Agnes Abercrombie, is living in the crumbling building. As they learn the gruesome history of the place, involving cannibalism and a ghost bride, Jenny becomes the victim of violent attacks and supernatural visions. But no one will believe her and now she''s stuck in the dilapidated resort overnight. Will she survive until morning?', 'Young lovers John and Jenny decide to go for a drive in the countryside one day when they happen upon the remains of a long-abandoned resort spa. After doing some exploring, they find that an elderly woman, Agnes Abercrombie, is living in the crumbling building. As they learn the gruesome history of the place, involving cannibalism and a ghost bride, Jenny becomes the victim of violent attacks and supernatural visions. But no one will believe her and now she''s stuck in the dilapidated resort overnight. Will she survive until morning?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4PsObpG3HsfPaOm3szBE03XPv4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78252'),
  ('682496451812070636', 'Warlock: The Armageddon', 1993, 'Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Anthony Hickox, Phil Robinson, Gerry Lively', 'Kevin Rock, Sam Bernard', 'Julian Sands, Chris Young, Paula Marshall, Joanna Pacula, Steve Kahan, R.G. Armstrong, Charles Hallahan, Bruce Glover', 'R', 'Every six hundred years, a great evil has the opportunity to escape and unleash Armageddon. A group of five stones has the power to either free the evil, or banish it for another six hundred years. An order of Druids battles with a Warlock determined to unleash his father upon the world.', 'Every six hundred years, a great evil has the opportunity to escape and unleash Armageddon. A group of five stones has the power to either free the evil, or banish it for another six hundred years. An order of Druids battles with a Warlock determined to unleash his father upon the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpRtxbnLb0qFP93db5vwDDXvWz2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24126'),
  ('889082335065581759', 'Warlords', 1989, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Fred Olen Ray, László Regos, Sid Haig', 'Scott Andrew Ressler', 'David Carradine, Dawn Wildsmith, Sid Haig, Ross Hagen, Fox Harris, Robert Quarry, Brinke Stevens, Cleve Hall', null, 'In a brutal, radioactive future, fearless warrior Dow is humanity''s last hope against the Warlord and his mutant hordes. With the gorgeous, deadly Danny and the strange Ammo at his side, Dow makes desperate war on the fierce desert savages who threaten to overrun the world. Courage and resourcefulness on an heroic scale lead to a final, bitter triumph in this epic action lead to a final, bitter triumph in this epic action adventure in future tense.', 'In a brutal, radioactive future, fearless warrior Dow is humanity''s last hope against the Warlord and his mutant hordes. With the gorgeous, deadly Danny and the strange Ammo at his side, Dow makes desperate war on the fierce desert savages who threaten to overrun the world. Courage and resourcefulness on an heroic scale lead to a final, bitter triumph in this epic action lead to a final, bitter triumph in this epic action adventure in future tense.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwyrwPpfQPZizGKNKafxHjql9JI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29901'),
  ('344284775949004939', 'Warlords of Atlantis', 1978, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Kevin Connor, Alan Hume, Ray Frift', 'Brian Hayles', 'Doug McClure, Peter Gilmore, Shane Rimmer, Lea Brodie, Michael Gothard, Hal Galili, John Ratzenberger, Derry Power', 'PG', 'Searching for the lost world of Atlantis, Prof. Aitken, his son Charles and Greg Collinson are betrayed by the crew of their expedition''s ship, attracted by the fabulous treasures of Atlantis. The diving bell disabled, a deep sea monster attacks the boat. They are all dragged to the bottom of the sea where they meet the inhabitants of the lost continent, an advanced alien race that makes sailors their slaves.', 'Searching for the lost world of Atlantis, Prof. Aitken, his son Charles and Greg Collinson are betrayed by the crew of their expedition''s ship, attracted by the fabulous treasures of Atlantis. The diving bell disabled, a deep sea monster attacks the boat. They are all dragged to the bottom of the sea where they meet the inhabitants of the lost continent, an advanced alien race that makes sailors their slaves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3NqnqdTxkN1GxpgEwlw6GTDq7g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30117'),
  ('652580946002893155', 'Warm Bodies', 2013, 'Horror, Comedy, Romance', 'Jonathan Levine, Javier Aguirresarobe, Gilles Aird', 'Jonathan Levine', 'Nicholas Hoult, Teresa Palmer, Lio Tipton, John Malkovich, Dave Franco, Rob Corddry, Cory Hardrict, Vincent Leclerc', 'PG-13', 'After a zombie becomes involved with the girlfriend of one of his victims, their romance sets in motion a sequence of events that might transform the entire lifeless world.', 'After a zombie becomes involved with the girlfriend of one of his victims, their romance sets in motion a sequence of events that might transform the entire lifeless world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8vCO3uszvlfBJVEyuIZVUDlt60.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82654'),
  ('464640542202743887', 'Warm Hug', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Chang Yuan', 'Chang Yuan', 'Chang Yuan, Li Qin, Teng Shen, Qiao Shan, Ma Li, Wang Chengsi, Chen Haoming, Allen', null, 'About a boy with an OCD, who originally thought he was an insulator of friendship and love, but after meeting a unique doctor and a careless girl, staged a love story about the healing of yin and yang.', 'About a boy with an OCD, who originally thought he was an insulator of friendship and love, but after meeting a unique doctor and a careless girl, staged a love story about the healing of yin and yang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNBX0gZJFSGGuoHcnjHhFTr3iSL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743413'),
  ('119467788156933178', 'Warm Springs', 2005, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Joseph Sargent', 'Margaret Nagle', 'Kenneth Branagh, Cynthia Nixon, David Paymer, Tim Blake Nelson, Matt O''Leary, Matt Malloy, Andy Davoli, Nelsan Ellis', null, 'Franklin Roosevelt, left a paraplegic from polio at 39 years of age, seeks out a miracle cure in the backwoods of Georgia.', 'Franklin Roosevelt, left a paraplegic from polio at 39 years of age, seeks out a miracle cure in the backwoods of Georgia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8tOtXpn4SeXqgaLpfocsRddSqBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46661'),
  ('377531504903438851', 'Warm Summer Rain', 1989, 'Drama, Romance', 'Joe Gayton', null, 'Kelly Lynch, Barry Tubb, Ron Sloan, Larry Poindexter, Lupe Amador, Peter MacPherson, Vanessa Conti, Dianne Turley Travis', 'R', 'Kate, a depressed thirty-something who unsuccessfully attempts suicide by slitting her wrists. Reflecting briefly upon her circumstance in the hospital, she realizes that nothing has been solved, whereupon she vacates the premises, wearing nothing but a hospital gown, a black coat, and flimsy sandals. Shortly thereafter, at a bus station, she requests from the attendant a bus ticket to wherever, with consideration to the limited funds she has to spare. The attendant insists on a destination, or even a direction - Kate spins about, points, and says, "that way". The story then evolves to include Barry Tubb, her love interest, who rekindles her will to live.', 'Kate, a depressed thirty-something who unsuccessfully attempts suicide by slitting her wrists. Reflecting briefly upon her circumstance in the hospital, she realizes that nothing has been solved, whereupon she vacates the premises, wearing nothing but a hospital gown, a black coat, and flimsy sandals. Shortly thereafter, at a bus station, she requests from the attendant a bus ticket to wherever, with consideration to the limited funds she has to spare. The attendant insists on a destination, or even a direction - Kate spins about, points, and says, "that way". The story then evolves to include Barry Tubb, her love interest, who rekindles her will to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5aXFUyR6LMdFNPYshS7HiZpclMb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71209'),
  ('115106293209108946', 'Warm Water Under a Red Bridge', 2001, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Shōhei Imamura, Shigeru Komatsubara, Masayuki Taniguchi', 'Motofumi Tomikawa, Shōhei Imamura, Daisuke Tengan', 'Koji Yakusho, Misa Shimizu, Mitsuko Baisho, Mansaku Fuwa, Isao Natsuyagi, Yukiya Kitamura, Hijiri Kojima, Toshie Negishi', null, 'A down-and-out businessman travels to a seaside town, where he meets a woman with unusual sexual powers.', 'A down-and-out businessman travels to a seaside town, where he meets a woman with unusual sexual powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brUlHtuwXvHCmRUyDPKCRwH8xYY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44768'),
