  ('650045166752455932', 'Warning from Space', 1956, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Kōji Shima, Kimio Watanabe, Kenmei Yuasa', 'Hideo Oguni', 'Keizō Kawasaki, Toyomi Karita, Jutarō Hōjō, Shōzō Nanbu, Bontarō Miake, Mieko Nagai, Kiyoko Hirai, Isao Yamagata', null, 'Large star-shaped aliens travel to earth in hopes of warning them about an oncoming catastrophe. To prevent panic about their appearance, one alien takes the form of a popular singer.', 'Large star-shaped aliens travel to earth in hopes of warning them about an oncoming catastrophe. To prevent panic about their appearance, one alien takes the form of a popular singer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxK1qXaZS7S4JtMgrKWha80UuT9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70872'),
  ('829410061559028370', 'Warning Shadows', 1923, 'Thriller, Fantasy, Drama, Horror', 'Arthur Robison, Fritz Arno Wagner', 'Arthur Robison, Rudolf Schneider', 'Alexander Granach, Fritz Kortner, Ruth Weyher, Gustav von Wangenheim, Eugen Rex, Lilli Herder, Fritz Rasp, Karl Platen', null, 'During a dinner given by a wealthy baron and his wife, attended by four of her suitors in a 19th century German manor, a shadow-player rescues the marriage by giving all the guests a vision what might happen tonight if the baron stays jealous and the suitors do not reduce their advances towards his beautiful wife. Or was it a vision?', 'During a dinner given by a wealthy baron and his wife, attended by four of her suitors in a 19th century German manor, a shadow-player rescues the marriage by giving all the guests a vision what might happen tonight if the baron stays jealous and the suitors do not reduce their advances towards his beautiful wife. Or was it a vision?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSQRXcGKVuvNmvAeJZj3Sw42FWi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84956'),
  ('86965892042431288', 'Warning Shot', 1967, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Joseph F. Biroc, Buzz Kulik', 'Mann Rubin', 'David Janssen, Ed Begley, Keenan Wynn, Sam Wanamaker, Lillian Gish, Stefanie Powers, Eleanor Parker, George Grizzard', 'NR', 'Hounded by the press for shooting a doctor, an ousted Los Angeles policeman works his own case.', 'Hounded by the press for shooting a doctor, an ousted Los Angeles policeman works his own case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4AffH6eOUQEdJeIcP2sRscaC9yZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88356'),
