  ('388298471548720513', 'Warpath', 1951, 'Western', 'Ray Rennahan, Byron Haskin, James Paisley', 'Frank Gruber', 'Edmond O''Brien, Dean Jagger, Forrest Tucker, Polly Bergen, Harry Carey, Jr., James Millican, Douglas Spencer, Wallace Ford', 'NR', 'John Vickers has spent eight years hunting for the three men who murdered the woman he loved. He finds one, Woodson, and kills him in a gunfight, but not before learning that the other two men have joined the U.S. Cavalry.', 'John Vickers has spent eight years hunting for the three men who murdered the woman he loved. He finds one, Woodson, and kills him in a gunfight, but not before learning that the other two men have joined the U.S. Cavalry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5FTEEILozSP1v7W65hWButBHhe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170492'),
  ('623774580657823007', 'Warrendale', 1967, 'Documentary', 'Allan King', null, 'Martin Fischer', null, 'Filmed over five weeks at the Warrendale residential treatment center near Toronto, "Warrendale" observes twelve emotionally disturbed children and the staff who care for them. Working without narration, interviews, or direction, Allan King records daily life as it unfolds, establishing what he later described as “actuality drama.”', 'Filmed over five weeks at the Warrendale residential treatment center near Toronto, "Warrendale" observes twelve emotionally disturbed children and the staff who care for them. Working without narration, interviews, or direction, Allan King records daily life as it unfolds, establishing what he later described as “actuality drama.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpgMTmfpE8EpqJZzUIfhXuOj6QC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86750'),
  ('1015403532200697009', 'Warring Clans', 1963, 'Action, Comedy', 'Kihachi Okamoto, Michio Yamamoto, Yuzuru Aizawa', 'Kihachi Okamoto, Shinichi Sekizawa, Ken Sano', 'Yūzō Kayama, Yuriko Hoshi, Makoto Satō, Ichirō Nakatani, Tatsuyoshi Ehara, Kumi Mizuno, Tadao Nakamaru, Jun Tazaki', null, 'A brave, highly principled warrior resigns his post as a body guard to the head of a powerful clan after he learns that his employers have been smuggling arms to the enemy. The remaining samurai try in vain to coerce him back, but their efforts are thwarted by crooked warriors who launch an attack...', 'A brave, highly principled warrior resigns his post as a body guard to the head of a powerful clan after he learns that his employers have been smuggling arms to the enemy. The remaining samurai try in vain to coerce him back, but their efforts are thwarted by crooked warriors who launch an attack...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qp2UsJDgMKCUIkVYxbjkFletEGZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339349'),
  ('767944547222556274', 'Warrior', 2011, 'Drama, Action', 'Masanobu Takayanagi, Gavin O''Connor, J.J. Perry', 'Gavin O''Connor, Anthony Tambakis, Cliff Dorfman', 'Joel Edgerton, Tom Hardy, Nick Nolte, Jennifer Morrison, Frank Grillo, Kevin Dunn, Maximiliano Hernández, Bryan Callen', 'PG-13', 'The youngest son of an alcoholic former boxer returns home, where he''s trained by his father for competition in a mixed martial arts tournament – a path that puts the fighter on a collision course with his estranged, older brother.', 'The youngest son of an alcoholic former boxer returns home, where he''s trained by his father for competition in a mixed martial arts tournament – a path that puts the fighter on a collision course with his estranged, older brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iM8n4nZJPR2abpnyZ36FUgHiRjr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59440'),
