  ('590047563493843444', 'Warrior Queen', 1987, 'Action, History, Adventure', 'Chuck Vincent, Gianlorenzo Battaglia', 'Rick Marx', 'Sybil Danning, Donald Pleasence, Rick Hill, Josephine Jacqueline Jones, Tally Chanel, Samantha Fox, Suzanna Smith, David Brandon', null, 'In ancient Pompeii, slaves are bought and sold for household chores and sex. A mysterious queen moves among the elite, meantime secretly helping the slaves to escape. Eventually her life is also in jeopardy, and as the volcano erupts she and the slaves attempt to escape while being chased by the military.', 'In ancient Pompeii, slaves are bought and sold for household chores and sex. A mysterious queen moves among the elite, meantime secretly helping the slaves to escape. Eventually her life is also in jeopardy, and as the volcano erupts she and the slaves attempt to escape while being chased by the military.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/P0j17mJRpSIZOglbtPkakHSD1S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30484'),
  ('1094780022462152367', 'Warriors', 1994, 'Drama, Action', 'Shimon Dotan', 'Alex Epstein, Benjamin Gold', 'Gary Busey, Michael Paré, Wendii Fulford, Catherine MacKenzie, Liz MacRae, Griffith Brewer, Christopher Heyerdahl', null, 'A government-trained killing machine must turn his lethal skills against his top-secret squad''s AWOL leader', 'A government-trained killing machine must turn his lethal skills against his top-secret squad''s AWOL leader', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdoeu0sWbeF8DISlPHOTIbvlBOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179165'),
  ('1016446747908807643', 'Warriors', 1999, 'TV Movie, Drama, War', 'Peter Kosminsky, Richard Greatrex', 'Leigh Jackson', 'Matthew Macfadyen, Darren Morfitt, Cal MacAninch, Ioan Gruffudd, Joe Renton, Steve Chaplin, Damian Lewis, Jodhi May', null, 'If the conflict in Bosnia has become something of a forgotten war, it''s not for the want of trying from the immensely powerful BBC film Warriors, the story of five young soldiers and their harrowing experiences in the region.', 'If the conflict in Bosnia has become something of a forgotten war, it''s not for the want of trying from the immensely powerful BBC film Warriors, the story of five young soldiers and their harrowing experiences in the region.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqENfL9QIfjyLK6A2G532KNJSJa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30968'),
  ('238722283398464453', 'Warriors', 2002, 'Drama, War', 'Daniel Calparsoro, Hosen M. Sivit, Javier Arsuaga Lekuona', 'Juan Cavestany', 'Eloy Azorín, Eduardo Noriega, Rubén Ochandiano, Carla Pérez, Jordi Vilches, Roger Casamajor, Iñaki Font, Arsenio Luna', 'NR', 'Kosovo, winter 1999. KFOR forces perform their humanitarian task while trying to maintain a difficult neutrality between Kosovo Albanians and Serbs. A platoon of Spanish Army engineers becomes unwittingly caught up in the spiral of violence between the two sides.', 'Kosovo, winter 1999. KFOR forces perform their humanitarian task while trying to maintain a difficult neutrality between Kosovo Albanians and Serbs. A platoon of Spanish Army engineers becomes unwittingly caught up in the spiral of violence between the two sides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZFCtoQQrnM5xhB91zyQBIssWiL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89482'),
  ('567498656984401426', 'Warriors of Future', 2022, 'Drama, Action, Science Fiction', 'Ng Man-Ching, Ng Yuen-Fai, Sindy Wong Sin Yi', 'Lau Ho-Leung, Mak Tin-Shu', 'Louis Koo, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Carina Lau, Philip Keung Ho-Man, Gardner Tse Kwan-Ho, Janice Wu, Wan Guopeng, Nick Cheung Ka-Fai', 'PG-13', 'When a meteor carrying a destructive plant strikes the world, a suicide squad is given hours to save their post-apocalyptic city from total collapse.', 'When a meteor carrying a destructive plant strikes the world, a suicide squad is given hours to save their post-apocalyptic city from total collapse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2l9LbxBSkJseoxYcIJjclnmxyq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518896'),
  ('481438465335443778', 'Warriors of Heaven and Earth', 2003, 'Drama, Action, Adventure', 'He Ping, Zhao Fei', 'He Ping, Rui Zhang', 'Jiang Wen, Kiichi Nakai, Wang Xueqi, Vicky Zhao, Bagen Hasi, Tao Ho, Linian Lu, Wang Deshun', null, 'A Chinese emissary is sent to the Gobi desert to execute a renegade soldier. When a caravan transporting a Buddhist monk and a valuable treasure is threatened by thieves, however, the two warriors might unite to protect the travelers.', 'A Chinese emissary is sent to the Gobi desert to execute a renegade soldier. When a caravan transporting a Buddhist monk and a valuable treasure is threatened by thieves, however, the two warriors might unite to protect the travelers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gvf2IHzIpiAMEv09pdlsniFpsm0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14797'),
  ('747667657543398613', 'Warriors of the Apocalypse', 1985, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Bobby A. Suarez', 'Bobby A. Suarez, Ken Metcalfe', 'Michael James, Deborah Moore, Ken Metcalfe, Franco Guerrero, Mike Cohen, Robert Marius, David Brass, Charlotte Cain', 'R', 'After a nuclear war with civilization''s death as a result leads an adventurer, a group of hikers on their search for the Mountain of Life. On their way they meet pygmy tribes, brutal gangs and amazon women.', 'After a nuclear war with civilization''s death as a result leads an adventurer, a group of hikers on their search for the Mountain of Life. On their way they meet pygmy tribes, brutal gangs and amazon women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzvqhH1Rl5sFppwmEeW5eHjGtnb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104316'),
  ('480377778283032873', 'Warriors of the Dawn', 2017, 'War, Adventure, Action', 'Chung Yoon-chul, Byun Bong-sun, Song Hyun-suk', 'Chung Yoon-chul', 'Lee Jung-jae, Yeo Jin-goo, Kim Moo-yul, Kim Myung-gon, Park Won-sang, Oh Kwang-rok, Bae Soo-bin, Esom', null, 'A crown prince emerges as a leader during the war between Korea and Japan in 1592.', 'A crown prince emerges as a leader during the war between Korea and Japan in 1592.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxLhHLXouZ8IMdYjFLaoxuQecK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435880'),
  ('874898616684456999', 'Warriors of the Rainbow: Seediq Bale - Part 1: The Sun Flag', 2011, 'Drama, Action, History', 'Wei Te-sheng', 'Wei Te-sheng', 'Nolay Piho, Umin Boya, Masanobu Ando, Sabu Kawahara, Vivian Hsu, Irene Luo, Landy Wen, Da-Ching', null, 'An indigenous clan-based people living in harmony with nature find their way of life threatened when violent interlopers from another culture arrive, intent on seizing their natural resources and enslaving them. Warriors of the Rainbow: Seediq Bale - Part 1: The Sun Flag is Part one of the two-part, four-hour Taiwanese edition of the film Warriors of the Rainbow.', 'An indigenous clan-based people living in harmony with nature find their way of life threatened when violent interlopers from another culture arrive, intent on seizing their natural resources and enslaving them. Warriors of the Rainbow: Seediq Bale - Part 1: The Sun Flag is Part one of the two-part, four-hour Taiwanese edition of the film Warriors of the Rainbow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDgmCasmrbzPDyJO4Ngg01YsIIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98344'),
  ('540125216599159660', 'Warriors of the Rainbow: Seediq Bale - Part 2: The Rainbow Bridge', 2011, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Wei Te-sheng', 'Wei Te-sheng', 'Nolay Piho, Umin Boya, Masanobu Ando, Sabu Kawahara, Vivian Hsu, Irene Luo, Landy Wen, Da-Ching', null, 'After the uprising at Wushe, Mona Rudao faces a guerrilla war against the militarily superior Japanese and Seediq clans. He and his followers must fight for their dignity and honor so that they can truly be "Seediq Bale" or "real men." Warriors of the Rainbow: Seediq Bale - Part 2: The Rainbow Bridge is Part two of the two-part, four-hour Taiwanese edition of the film Warriors of the Rainbow.', 'After the uprising at Wushe, Mona Rudao faces a guerrilla war against the militarily superior Japanese and Seediq clans. He and his followers must fight for their dignity and honor so that they can truly be "Seediq Bale" or "real men." Warriors of the Rainbow: Seediq Bale - Part 2: The Rainbow Bridge is Part two of the two-part, four-hour Taiwanese edition of the film Warriors of the Rainbow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrgpoEhfgptkYGtIxEaYqlxChv8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313230'),
  ('221618817842162569', 'Warriors of the Year 2072', 1984, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Lucio Fulci, Giuseppe Pinori', 'Lucio Fulci, Elisa Briganti, Cesare Frugoni', 'Jared Martin, Fred Williamson, Howard Ross, Eleonora Brigliadori, Cosimo Cinieri, Claudio Cassinelli, Valéria Cavalli, Donald O''Brien', null, 'In the future, two television networks compete for ratings by producing violent game shows. One network produces a modern day version of the Roman gladiators, only on motorcycles instead of chariots, and uses convicted murderers as the participants, The network decides it needs a champion for this sport, so they frame a constant winner from another game for murder, and place him on the show.', 'In the future, two television networks compete for ratings by producing violent game shows. One network produces a modern day version of the Roman gladiators, only on motorcycles instead of chariots, and uses convicted murderers as the participants, The network decides it needs a champion for this sport, so they frame a constant winner from another game for murder, and place him on the show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJXmfSrZEGH6WP2IBh012esfd5P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40352'),
  ('865564997784224486', 'Warriors of Virtue', 1997, 'Fantasy, Family, Action', 'Ronny Yu, Peter Pau Tak-Hai, Joseph P. Lucky', 'Michael Vickerman, Hugh Kelley, Li Lianyi', 'Angus Macfadyen, Mario Yedidia, Marley Shelton, Chao-Li Chi, Jack Tate, Doug Jones, Don Lewis, J. Todd Adams', 'PG', 'A young boy is whisked away to the mythical land of Tao where he becomes the center of a conflict between an evil lord and a group of animal warriors.', 'A young boy is whisked away to the mythical land of Tao where he becomes the center of a conflict between an evil lord and a group of animal warriors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fT8cttGyXx36P24W0tum2QxsLf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49478'),
  ('969919747143680042', 'Warriors Two', 1978, 'Action, Drama, Comedy', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Chu Yat-Hung, Ricky Lau', 'Szeto On', 'Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Casanova Wong, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Dean Shek Tin, Fung Hak-On, Lee Hoi-Sang, Tiger Yang Cheong-Woo, Yeung Wai', null, 'In an attempt to save his village from being taken over by brutes, Wah is beaten to a pulp and his mother brutally murdered. Determined to take revenge, Wah learns the art of Wing Chun and enters into a showdown with the nasty villains.', 'In an attempt to save his village from being taken over by brutes, Wah is beaten to a pulp and his mother brutally murdered. Determined to take revenge, Wah learns the art of Wing Chun and enters into a showdown with the nasty villains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6FQj0cKN8cITTAEOJCPMStxlbM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64316'),
  ('234013886520518310', 'Warsaw 44', 2014, 'Drama, History, War', 'Jan Komasa, Marian Prokop, Radek Ładczuk', 'Jan Komasa', 'Józef Pawłowski, Zofia Wichłacz, Anna Próchniak, Antoni Królikowski, Maurycy Popiel, Filip Gurłacz, Michał Mikołajczak, Karolina Staniec', null, 'City of Warsaw, Poland, August 1st, 1944. Citizens have experienced inhuman acts of terror and violence during five long years of Nazi occupation. As the Soviet Army relentlessly approaches, the youngest and bravest among them rise up as one and face tyranny fighting street by street, but the price to pay will be high and hard the way to freedom…', 'City of Warsaw, Poland, August 1st, 1944. Citizens have experienced inhuman acts of terror and violence during five long years of Nazi occupation. As the Soviet Army relentlessly approaches, the youngest and bravest among them rise up as one and face tyranny fighting street by street, but the price to pay will be high and hard the way to freedom…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9WOOkVur2Gwo93wuiKzJDm2mUK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293982'),
  ('67800425561765430', 'Warsaw Bridge', 1990, 'Drama', 'Pere Portabella, Licio Marcos de Oliveira', 'Octavi Pellissa, Pere Portabella, Carles Santos', 'Carme Elias, Francisco Guijar, Jordi Dauder, Ona Planas, Josep Maria Pou, Francesc Orella, Pep Ferrer, Ricard Borràs', null, 'A female professor, a writer, and an orchestra conductor--three characters, two couples--attend a grand literary cocktail party. The writer has just won the prize for his book "Warsaw Bridge." The winner answers the journalist''s questions one after another, but he is unable to come up with a synthesis of the plot of his book. They will simply have to read it.', 'A female professor, a writer, and an orchestra conductor--three characters, two couples--attend a grand literary cocktail party. The writer has just won the prize for his book "Warsaw Bridge." The winner answers the journalist''s questions one after another, but he is unable to come up with a synthesis of the plot of his book. They will simply have to read it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdMKXfNQiiyXs3Ps26k0Ij1RRXD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84028'),
