  ('1038175276441314424', 'Warszawa 1956', 1956, 'Documentary', 'Jerzy Bossak, Jarosław Brzozowski', null, 'Andrzej Łapicki', null, 'Over a decade after the almost total wartime destruction, Warsaw still looks bruised and battered. Ruined houses are nevertheless inhabited which can be dangerous for the local population.', 'Over a decade after the almost total wartime destruction, Warsaw still looks bruised and battered. Ruined houses are nevertheless inhabited which can be dangerous for the local population.', null, 'tmdb:movie:153229'),
  ('568466813126522789', 'Waru', 2006, 'Crime', 'Takashi Miike, Kazushige Tanaka', 'Hisao Maki', 'Show Aikawa, Hisao Maki, Atsuko Sakuraba, Ryo Ishibashi, Nagare Hagiwara, Yoshihiko Hakamada, Keiko Matsuzaka, Kimika Yoshino', null, 'A former gangster gets released from prison and goes to work for a group of people. The leader of this group becomes his mentor and the fight to combat criminals and for world peace. The whole resulting in the wanted and are chased of all families mob in Japan. They may however be a little unexpected help from the police.', 'A former gangster gets released from prison and goes to work for a group of people. The leader of this group becomes his mentor and the fight to combat criminals and for world peace. The whole resulting in the wanted and are chased of all families mob in Japan. They may however be a little unexpected help from the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9z9utfcrswvLV8pfllCGJD08wwB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104372'),
  ('1031524993234190448', 'Was ist denn bloß mit Willi los?', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Werner Jacobs, Karl Löb', 'Eckart Hachfeld, Wilhelm Lichtenberg', 'Heinz Erhardt, Ralf Wolter, Ruth Stephan, Stella Mooney, Rex Gildo, Helen Vita, Willy Reichert, Wolfgang Lukschy', null, 'Willi Winzig is a small tax officer with a big heart. He sometimes lets the tax files of his insolvent fellow citizens disappear into the air shaft. But shortly before his retirement, the shaft is so full that Willi has to dispose of the file of a penniless taxpayer in the wastepaper basket. The scam is promptly discovered and Willi is threatened with a hefty fine - even dishonorable dismissal from the civil service. Fortunately, friend and colleague Felix Klein knows what to do.', 'Willi Winzig is a small tax officer with a big heart. He sometimes lets the tax files of his insolvent fellow citizens disappear into the air shaft. But shortly before his retirement, the shaft is so full that Willi has to dispose of the file of a penniless taxpayer in the wastepaper basket. The scam is promptly discovered and Willi is threatened with a hefty fine - even dishonorable dismissal from the civil service. Fortunately, friend and colleague Felix Klein knows what to do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z07O6LsTnSg2TAHql6nW3QrxUhO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6960'),
  ('227327776998333230', 'Was There Karotin?', 1990, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Genri Abramyan, Gennadi Poloka', 'Vladimir Ishimov, Viktor Dyomin, Gennadi Poloka', 'Boris Sokolov, Vasiliy Mishchenko, Yuriy Popovich, Ivan Bortnik, Lyudmila Gurchenko, Igor Kvasha, Elena Mayorova, Lyubov Malinovskaya', null, 'The beginning of the 30s of the last century. A leak of classified information was found at the Soviet shipbuilding plant. Arriving under the guise of a scientist, the legendary chekist Karotin begins to unravel the threads of the conspiracy of the fascist spy organization. He is helped by inexperienced but active local detectives. Mastering the basics of the counterintelligence, they fall into a situation the other one funnier.', 'The beginning of the 30s of the last century. A leak of classified information was found at the Soviet shipbuilding plant. Arriving under the guise of a scientist, the legendary chekist Karotin begins to unravel the threads of the conspiracy of the fascist spy organization. He is helped by inexperienced but active local detectives. Mastering the basics of the counterintelligence, they fall into a situation the other one funnier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNpJwN8SqOy6JuV1DG66vf1Ldei.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211460'),
  ('660134219888782452', 'Wasabi', 2001, 'Drama, Action, Comedy', 'Gérard Sterin, Gérard Krawczyk, Fabien Vergez', 'Luc Besson', 'Jean Reno, Hirosue Ryoko, Michel Muller, Carole Bouquet, Yoshi Oida, Christian Sinniger, Alexandre Brik, Jean-Marc Montalto', 'R', 'Hubert is a French policeman with very sharp methods. After being forced to take 2 months off by his boss, who doesn''t share his view on working methods, he goes back to Japan, where he used to work 19 years ago, to settle the probate of his girlfriend who left him shortly after marriage without a trace.', 'Hubert is a French policeman with very sharp methods. After being forced to take 2 months off by his boss, who doesn''t share his view on working methods, he goes back to Japan, where he used to work 19 years ago, to settle the probate of his girlfriend who left him shortly after marriage without a trace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uo3MBDwn3o32GJzFyClm7r1ierb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2110'),
  ('491539176203163648', 'Wash-''em-Clean', 1954, 'Animation, Family', 'Ivan Ivanov-Vano, Nikolay Voinov, V. Sveshnikova', 'Ivan Ivanov-Vano', 'Mikhail Ryba, Yuri Khrzhanovsky', null, 'Based on the poem by Korney Chukovskiy, about a boy who would not clean himself, so all his belongings ran away from him.', 'Based on the poem by Korney Chukovskiy, about a boy who would not clean himself, so all his belongings ran away from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKrrfPBkaF5iFzdAJaairimZJMQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90521'),
