  ('255420124517571052', 'Washington Square', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Agnieszka Holland, Jerzy Zieliński, Mary-Jane April', 'Carol Doyle', 'Jennifer Jason Leigh, Albert Finney, Maggie Smith, Ben Chaplin, Judith Ivey, Arthur Laupus, Jennifer Garner, Robert Stanton', 'PG', 'In 1870s New York, spinster heiress Catherine Sloper is courted by the much younger, penniless Morris Townsend, much to the chagrin of her overprotective father. Catherine must decide whether to spend the rest of her life alone, or marry a man interested in her solely for her inheritence.', 'In 1870s New York, spinster heiress Catherine Sloper is courted by the much younger, penniless Morris Townsend, much to the chagrin of her overprotective father. Catherine must decide whether to spend the rest of her life alone, or marry a man interested in her solely for her inheritence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LIn7bskDwsmyxMWTNWRIPSCm2X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45019'),
  ('913662745644811309', 'Washington Wolves', 1999, 'Action, Thriller', 'Mariano Barroso, Néstor Calvo', 'Juan Cavestany', 'Javier Bardem, Eduard Fernández, Ernesto Alterio, José Sancho, Alberto San Juan, Vicenta N''Dongo, Pep Cortés, Alicia Cifredo', null, 'Alberto and Miguel have a bar, but things are not going very well. They need to get out of this black hole and they need money to do it. Alberto is divorced and alcoholic, Miguel has a big secret... Their old friend Claudio is very rich. Why not steal some of his money? Troubles grow when Claudio''s wife is planning to steal this money too... The Washington wolfs, in a circus near all this, are the silent witnesses of all that happens that night.', 'Alberto and Miguel have a bar, but things are not going very well. They need to get out of this black hole and they need money to do it. Alberto is divorced and alcoholic, Miguel has a big secret... Their old friend Claudio is very rich. Why not steal some of his money? Troubles grow when Claudio''s wife is planning to steal this money too... The Washington wolfs, in a circus near all this, are the silent witnesses of all that happens that night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doQ251AoO4h9Xf8Yc1G7SAV3WC8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102513'),
  ('157960894878882469', 'Wasp', 2003, 'Drama', 'Kate Brasier, Paul Monaghan, Josh Hyams', 'Andrea Arnold', 'Natalie Press, Jodie Mitchell, Molly Griffiths, Kaitlyn Raynor, Danny Dyer, Danny Daley, Lizzie Colbert, Ashley Routledge', null, 'Zoë is a single mother who lives with her four children in Dartford. She is poor and can''t afford to buy food. One day her old flame drives by and asks her to go on a date with him. Scared that he doesn''t want to go out with her, she lies and tells him that she is just babysitting the kids. This will be her first date in years.', 'Zoë is a single mother who lives with her four children in Dartford. She is poor and can''t afford to buy food. One day her old flame drives by and asks her to go on a date with him. Scared that he doesn''t want to go out with her, she lies and tells him that she is just babysitting the kids. This will be her first date in years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9W6dKmIYyrw3clcwTT9VIUero9X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44472'),
  ('451177056149105369', 'Wasp Network', 2020, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Olivier Assayas, Yorick Le Saux, Denis Lenoir', 'Olivier Assayas', 'Penélope Cruz, Edgar Ramírez, Gael García Bernal, Ana de Armas, Wagner Moura, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Nolan Guerra Fernández, Osdeymi Pastrana Miranda', 'R', 'Havana, Cuba, 1990. René González, an airplane pilot, unexpectedly flees the country, leaving behind his wife Olga and his daughter Irma, and begins a new life in Miami, where he becomes a member of an anti-Castro organization.', 'Havana, Cuba, 1990. René González, an airplane pilot, unexpectedly flees the country, leaving behind his wife Olga and his daughter Irma, and begins a new life in Miami, where he becomes a member of an anti-Castro organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fzjbeyEwmlpxu5CMzmFz8IDVELm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451184'),
  ('219717330757140448', 'Wassup Rockers', 2005, 'Drama', 'Steve Gainer, Larry Clark', 'Larry Clark', 'Jonathan Velasquez, Francisco Pedrasa, Milton Velasquez, Usvaldo Panameno, Eddie Velasquez, Luis Rojas-Salgado, Carlos Ramirez, Iris Zelaya', null, 'Instead of adhering to the norms of their South Central neighborhood, a group of skater boys opt to bus into Hollywood and Beverly Hills, where they attract local rich girls - and plenty of trouble with the police, jealous boyfriends, and nervous parents.', 'Instead of adhering to the norms of their South Central neighborhood, a group of skater boys opt to bus into Hollywood and Beverly Hills, where they attract local rich girls - and plenty of trouble with the police, jealous boyfriends, and nervous parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mABP5REdreZ4ZMhP0jUgyQlQBqB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18484'),
  ('79067220371875392', 'Waste Land', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Lucy Walker, Dudu Miranda, Heloísa Passos', 'Lucy Walker', 'Vik Muniz', null, 'An uplifting feature documentary highlighting the transformative power of art and the beauty of the human spirit. Top-selling contemporary artist Vik Muniz takes us on an emotional journey from Jardim Gramacho, the world''s largest landfill on the outskirts of Rio de Janeiro, to the heights of international art stardom. Vik collaborates with the brilliant catadores, pickers of recyclable materials, true Shakespearean characters who live and work in the garbage quoting Machiavelli and showing us how to recycle ourselves.', 'An uplifting feature documentary highlighting the transformative power of art and the beauty of the human spirit. Top-selling contemporary artist Vik Muniz takes us on an emotional journey from Jardim Gramacho, the world''s largest landfill on the outskirts of Rio de Janeiro, to the heights of international art stardom. Vik collaborates with the brilliant catadores, pickers of recyclable materials, true Shakespearean characters who live and work in the garbage quoting Machiavelli and showing us how to recycle ourselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJf0LR1nxvtePFnKtp4TKXnryRl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46689'),
  ('391330073479186928', 'Wasted on the Young', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Ben C. Lucas, Dan Freene, David Le May', 'Ben C. Lucas', 'Adelaide Clemens, Alex Russell, Geraldine Hakewill, Georgina Haig, Lisa Bennett, Oliver Ackland, Patrick Cullen, Kevin Lefebvre', 'R', 'When a high school party goes dangerously off the rails, one teenager finds that revenge is just a computer click away.', 'When a high school party goes dangerously off the rails, one teenager finds that revenge is just a computer click away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eblIhVMsJM4StACQsodtF2joawe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70418'),
  ('465395503803712900', 'Wasted Youth', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'David Schultz, Georgia Packard, Benjamin Quabeck', null, 'Tom Schilling, Robert Stadlober, Jessica Schwarz, Marlon Kittel, Nadja Bobyleva, Denis Moschitto, Josef Heynert, Dieter Landuris', null, 'The year is 1981, the German New Wave is at the peak. Harry, otherwise Sparkasse trainee, wants to make it big as a manager of the band of his friends, Apollo Schwabing. He has booked the band as the opening act for a concert where the group DAF are the headliners.', 'The year is 1981, the German New Wave is at the peak. Harry, otherwise Sparkasse trainee, wants to make it big as a manager of the band of his friends, Apollo Schwabing. He has booked the band as the opening act for a concert where the group DAF are the headliners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNNqCB4p8Gzgr2pa1j8cx5x7nKl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9690'),
  ('23787668236661305', 'Wasted!', 1996, 'Crime, Drama', 'Aryan Kaganof, Joost van Gelder', 'Aryan Kaganof, Ton Van Der Lee', 'Fem van der Elzen, Tygo Gernandt, Thom Hoffman, Hugo Metsers, Mike Libanon, Skip Goeree, Jorinde Moll, Afke Reijenga', null, 'Twentysomething innocents Jacqui and Martijn move to Amsterdam and immerse themselves in the intense and drug-laden underground club scene. Life turns out to be far more complicated, difficult, and dangerous than they bargained for. Their relationship is tested - repeatedly.', 'Twentysomething innocents Jacqui and Martijn move to Amsterdam and immerse themselves in the intense and drug-laden underground club scene. Life turns out to be far more complicated, difficult, and dangerous than they bargained for. Their relationship is tested - repeatedly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khKoxn50wWC1LKlxHbUKnfLitkL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70657'),
