  ('79195245888545258', 'Watch Out for Perestroika', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Castellano, Pipolo, Emilio Loffredo', 'Jerry Calà, Stefano Sudriè', 'Jerry Calà, Ezio Greggio, Rodolfo Laganà, Corinne Cléry, Marina Giulia Cavalli, Guido Nicheli, Pippo Santonastaso, Mattia Sbragia', null, 'Three Italian womanizers in Bulgaria smooth-talk three local girls to bed and then vanish back to their country. But when the iron curtain suddenly falls, they fear that the girls might come to Italy to have them fulfill the promises made.', 'Three Italian womanizers in Bulgaria smooth-talk three local girls to bed and then vanish back to their country. But when the iron curtain suddenly falls, they fear that the girls might come to Italy to have them fulfill the promises made.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCvd8s84gkMChIiiU1LA1Z4kCGk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82069'),
