  ('245533906828321686', 'Watchdog', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jake Kopronica, L.C. Holt, L C Holt', 'L.C. Holt, L C Holt', 'Mark Patton, Wes Robinson, Celeste Blandon, Lucas Dunaway, Danny Langston', null, 'After narrowly surviving a violent mugging, Travis Wilkes invites the drifter who saved him back to the isolated home where he and his girlfriend resides, not realizing that he''s opened the door to a night of terror and bloody revenge.', 'After narrowly surviving a violent mugging, Travis Wilkes invites the drifter who saved him back to the isolated home where he and his girlfriend resides, not realizing that he''s opened the door to a night of terror and bloody revenge.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FhMhsnOCqztBOqbkN93vM2Z43IRh.jpg', 'plex:movie:watchdog-2026'),
  ('102767554686560309', 'Watcher', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Chloe Okuno, Romeo Magda, Benjamin Kirk Nielsen', 'Chloe Okuno', 'Maika Monroe, Karl Glusman, Burn Gorman, Mãdãlina Anea, Gabriela Butuc, Cristina Deleanu, Ștefan Iancu, Florian Ghimpu', 'R', 'As a serial killer stalks the city, Julia — a young actress who just moved to town with her husband — notices a mysterious stranger watching her from across the street.', 'As a serial killer stalks the city, Julia — a young actress who just moved to town with her husband — notices a mysterious stranger watching her from across the street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXCjoI3jdtBrwPHgVsyNLkl8Rvs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:807356'),
  ('893636730625828875', 'Watchers', 1988, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Jon Hess, Richard Leiterman, Lee Knippelberg', 'Damian Lee, Bill Freed', 'Corey Haim, Michael Ironside, Barbara Williams, Lala Sloatman, Dale Wilson, Blu Mankuma, Duncan Fraser, Colleen Winton', 'R', 'A boy takes in a stray dog, later finding out that it''s an ultra-intelligent runaway from a genetic research lab. Unbeknownst to him, the dog is being stalked by another escaped creature that''s not quite so friendly.', 'A boy takes in a stray dog, later finding out that it''s an ultra-intelligent runaway from a genetic research lab. Unbeknownst to him, the dog is being stalked by another escaped creature that''s not quite so friendly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOOsMzORvtoQbFzKEXcPWpJsUm7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33172'),
  ('1004650417003128754', 'Watchers II', 1990, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Thierry Notz', 'John Brancato, Michael Ferris', 'Marc Singer, Tracy Scoggins, Mary Woronov, Irene Miracle, Jonathan Farwell, Tom Poster, Don Pugsley, Joseph Hardin', 'R', 'A genetically re-engineered dog develops a psychic link with a monster created in a lab experiment which goes awry.', 'A genetically re-engineered dog develops a psychic link with a monster created in a lab experiment which goes awry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iU7Yy5dRIaoFvmgv40Fb2feSISt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70247'),
  ('980949908006489574', 'Watchers III', 1994, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jeremy Stanford, Juan Durán', 'Michael Palmer', 'Wings Hauser, Gregory Scott Cummins, Daryl Keith Roach, Frank Novak, Christian Meier, John Linton, Lolita Ronalds, Ider Cifuentes Martin', null, 'A top-secret experiment spawns two highly intelligent life-forms: Einstein, a golden retriever with an IQ of 175; and The Outsider, a deformed monstrosity that exists to kill... and avenge its creators. When the Outsider escapes into the jungles of South America, the government sends in some ex-military convicts to catch the beast. But what starts out as a high-speed chase ends up in bloody carnage. Only Einstein knows the Outsider''s motives, and only the canine can outsmart the creature. Now, it''s a battle of beasts as man''s best friend confronts man''s worst nightmare.', 'A top-secret experiment spawns two highly intelligent life-forms: Einstein, a golden retriever with an IQ of 175; and The Outsider, a deformed monstrosity that exists to kill... and avenge its creators. When the Outsider escapes into the jungles of South America, the government sends in some ex-military convicts to catch the beast. But what starts out as a high-speed chase ends up in bloody carnage. Only Einstein knows the Outsider''s motives, and only the canine can outsmart the creature. Now, it''s a battle of beasts as man''s best friend confronts man''s worst nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvTELe32dAquzKECcISG77wha5c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70249'),
