  ('455369906342682646', 'Watching the Detectives', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Paul Soter, Christophe Lanzenberg, Mariela Comitini', 'Paul Soter', 'Cillian Murphy, Lucy Liu, Jason Sudeikis, Michael Panes, Callie Thorne, Michael Yurchak, Heather Burns, Mark Harelik', 'NR', 'Neil, a self-proclaimed film geek and owner of Gumshoe video, has always been content to live vicariously through his favorite films noir. But when he meets Violet, a real-life femme fatale, his mundane world gets turned upside down and the line between reality and the movies quickly begins to blur.', 'Neil, a self-proclaimed film geek and owner of Gumshoe video, has always been content to live vicariously through his favorite films noir. But when he meets Violet, a real-life femme fatale, his mundane world gets turned upside down and the line between reality and the movies quickly begins to blur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wm2TaGTXpy30WNLuZaqagIMbf1K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22100'),
  ('664102569596408249', 'Watchmen', 2009, 'Mystery, Action, Science Fiction', 'Zack Snyder, Larry Fong, François Audouy', 'David Hayter, Alex Tse', 'Malin Åkerman, Patrick Wilson, Billy Crudup, Matthew Goode, Jackie Earle Haley, Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Carla Gugino, Laura Mennell', 'R', 'In a gritty and alternate 1985, the glory days of costumed vigilantes have been brought to a close by a government crackdown. But after one of the masked veterans is brutally murdered, an investigation into the killer is initiated. The reunited heroes set out to prevent their own destruction, but in doing so they uncover a sinister plot that puts all of humanity in grave danger.', 'In a gritty and alternate 1985, the glory days of costumed vigilantes have been brought to a close by a government crackdown. But after one of the masked veterans is brutally murdered, an investigation into the killer is initiated. The reunited heroes set out to prevent their own destruction, but in doing so they uncover a sinister plot that puts all of humanity in grave danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u0ROjy3KPzMDTipqCrwD8LwkKSQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13183'),
  ('1072376987705082634', 'Watchmen: Chapter I', 2024, 'Animation, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Brandon Vietti, Matthew Girardi', null, 'Troy Baker, Adrienne Barbeau, Corey Burton, Michael Cerveris, Jeffrey Combs, Grey DeLisle, Kelly Hu, John Marshall Jones', 'R', 'In 1985, the murder of a government-sponsored superhero draws his outlawed colleagues out of retirement and into a mystery that threatens to upend their personal lives and the world itself.', 'In 1985, the murder of a government-sponsored superhero draws his outlawed colleagues out of retirement and into a mystery that threatens to upend their personal lives and the world itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tE2vZ6HdlmKaBh0wpsvHCf7HJKo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1155058'),
  ('739117682249226653', 'Watchmen: Chapter II', 2024, 'Animation, Mystery, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Brandon Vietti, Vinton Heuck, Matthew Girardi', null, 'Troy Baker, Adrienne Barbeau, Michael Cerveris, Zehra Fazal, Phil Fondacaro, Grey DeLisle, John Marshall Jones, Max Koch', 'R', 'Suspicious of the events ensnaring their former colleagues, Nite Owl and Silk Spectre are spurred out of retirement to investigate. As they grapple with personal ethics, inner demons and a society turned against them, they race the clock to uncover a deepening plot that might trigger global nuclear war.', 'Suspicious of the events ensnaring their former colleagues, Nite Owl and Silk Spectre are spurred out of retirement to investigate. As they grapple with personal ethics, inner demons and a society turned against them, they race the clock to uncover a deepening plot that might trigger global nuclear war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apzbE0pcmKz4RTWFVP7XXdg3VCZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1299652'),
  ('951198255584918644', 'Watchtower', 2012, 'Drama', 'Pelin Esmer', 'Pelin Esmer', 'Olgun Şimşek, Nilay Erdönmez, Menderes Samancılar, Kadir Çermik, Laçin Ceylan, Rıza Akın, Mehmet Bozdoğan, Mehmet Mola', null, 'Haunted by his dark past, a man takes a job as a fire warden in a remote tower in the wilderness, and is inexorably drawn towards a young woman with a terrible secret of her own.', 'Haunted by his dark past, a man takes a job as a fire warden in a remote tower in the wilderness, and is inexorably drawn towards a young woman with a terrible secret of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGr2VXyGezWtol9vnOoS7JYWFvK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128244'),
  ('550280285354934988', 'Water', 1985, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Dick Clement, Garth Thomas, Bob Smith', 'Bill Persky, Ian La Frenais, Dick Clement', 'Michael Caine, Valerie Perrine, Brenda Vaccaro, Leonard Rossiter, Billy Connolly, Dennis Dugan, Fulton Mackay, Oscar James', 'PG-13', 'The British governor of a tiny island nation in the Caribbean Commonwealth finds his idyllic existence thrown into chaos when an American drilling company finds a huge source of natural mineral water there.', 'The British governor of a tiny island nation in the Caribbean Commonwealth finds his idyllic existence thrown into chaos when an American drilling company finds a huge source of natural mineral water there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBwZRLoNjvzplQ5bForJ2dEC0QH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19127'),
  ('1136350979020734632', 'Water', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Deepa Mehta, Giles Nuttgens, Jack Boem', 'Deepa Mehta', 'Lisa Ray, Sarala, John Abraham, Seema Biswas, Waheeda Rehman, Vinay Pathak, Rishma Malik Scott, Manorama', null, 'The year is 1938, and Mahatma Gandhi''s groundbreaking philosophies are sweeping across India, but 8-year-old Chuyia, newly widowed, must go to live with other outcast widows on an ashram. Her presence transforms the ashram as she befriends two of her compatriots.', 'The year is 1938, and Mahatma Gandhi''s groundbreaking philosophies are sweeping across India, but 8-year-old Chuyia, newly widowed, must go to live with other outcast widows on an ashram. Her presence transforms the ashram as she befriends two of her compatriots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdg6JKcqjS7szenmabGAbe5RGdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7509'),
  ('61120891903637281', 'Water and Fire', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Özcan Deniz', 'Avni Tuna Dilligil', 'Özcan Deniz, Yasemin Kay Allen, Kaan Çakır, Pelin Akil, Yusuf Akgün, Cem Uçan, Barış Yalçın, Burcu Kiratli', null, 'A pretty young girl falls for an enigmatic, shy man who sweeps her off her feet. She becomes pregnant but is not allowed to tell him. His advisers are adamant. Back home, they have set up a wedding with the daughter of an antagonistic family and marriage will put an end to the blood feud between them.', 'A pretty young girl falls for an enigmatic, shy man who sweeps her off her feet. She becomes pregnant but is not allowed to tell him. His advisers are adamant. Back home, they have set up a wedding with the daughter of an antagonistic family and marriage will put an end to the blood feud between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Q91NanJYGIUljUM7STDLECllyq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271954'),
