  ('515026795603020332', 'Water Birds', 1952, 'Documentary, Family', 'Ben Sharpsteen', 'Winston Hibler, Ted Sears, William Otis', 'Winston Hibler', null, 'Water Birds is a 1952 short documentary film directed by Ben Sharpsteen. The film delves into the still waters of lagoons and marshes to the wild blue wilderness of the vast oceans, to experience the beauty and variety of their majestic birds, each perfectly designed for its habitat. It won the Oscar for Best Short Subject, Two-Reel.', 'Water Birds is a 1952 short documentary film directed by Ben Sharpsteen. The film delves into the still waters of lagoons and marshes to the wild blue wilderness of the vast oceans, to experience the beauty and variety of their majestic birds, each perfectly designed for its habitat. It won the Oscar for Best Short Subject, Two-Reel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDMwlcVjJ004KHBsvuqYqk7PHIT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179184'),
  ('798734639530487292', 'Water Drops on Burning Rocks', 2000, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Jeanne Lapoirie, François Ozon', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Bernard Giraudeau, Malik Zidi, Ludivine Sagnier, Anna Thomson', null, 'In 1970s Germany, Léopold, a 50-year-old businessman, picks up and seduces 20-year-old Franz, who swiftly moves into his apartment. The dynamic between them intensifies with the sudden arrival of their ex-girlfriends.', 'In 1970s Germany, Léopold, a 50-year-old businessman, picks up and seduces 20-year-old Franz, who swiftly moves into his apartment. The dynamic between them intensifies with the sudden arrival of their ex-girlfriends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hw1WwUyMTV5DmqTvAiC0w3PRjA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12480'),
