  ('824465657015040398', 'Water Lilies', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Céline Sciamma, Crystel Fournier, Delphine Daull', 'Céline Sciamma', 'Pauline Acquart, Louise Blachère, Adèle Haenel, Warren Jacquin, Christel Baras, Marie Gili-Pierre, Alice de Lencquesaing, Claire Pierrat', 'NR', 'Set during a sultry summer in a French suburb, Marie is desperate to join the local pool''s synchronized swimming team, but is her interest solely for the sake of sport or for a chance to get close to Floriane, the bad girl of the team? Sciamma, and the two leads, capture the uncertainty of teenage sexuality with a sympathetic eye in this delicate drama of the angst of coming-of-age.', 'Set during a sultry summer in a French suburb, Marie is desperate to join the local pool''s synchronized swimming team, but is her interest solely for the sake of sport or for a chance to get close to Floriane, the bad girl of the team? Sciamma, and the two leads, capture the uncertainty of teenage sexuality with a sympathetic eye in this delicate drama of the angst of coming-of-age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNrs9disgGDtOORToDt5dIqYFBi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10818'),
  ('930239175122684055', 'Water Lilies by Monet', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Giovanni Troilo', 'Giorgio D''Introno, Marco Pisoni, Giovanni Troilo', 'Elisa Lasowski, Georges Clemenceau, Claude Monet', null, 'A journey through the masterpieces and obsessions of the Genius of the Impressionism, down the River Seine, from Le Havre to Paris and then up the river towards Argenteuil, Poissy, Vétheuil, Giverny – ending in Paris. A tour of the Museums displaying Monet''s masterpieces: the Orangerie Museum, the Marmottan Museum, the Orsay Museum, ending in Monet''s house and gardens at Giverny.', 'A journey through the masterpieces and obsessions of the Genius of the Impressionism, down the River Seine, from Le Havre to Paris and then up the river towards Argenteuil, Poissy, Vétheuil, Giverny – ending in Paris. A tour of the Museums displaying Monet''s masterpieces: the Orangerie Museum, the Marmottan Museum, the Orsay Museum, ending in Monet''s house and gardens at Giverny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23bgXfvgJakcvXpXTnZD2VWI1Ej.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:563774'),
