  ('167431875676007108', 'Waterhole #3', 1967, 'Western, Comedy', 'William A. Graham, Daniel McCauley, Robert Burks', 'Robert R. Young, Joseph T. Steck', 'James Coburn, Carroll O''Connor, Margaret Blye, Claude Akins, Timothy Carey, Bruce Dern, Joan Blondell, James Whitmore', null, 'After a professional gambler kills a Confederate soldier, he finds a map pinpointing the location in the desert where stolen army gold bullion is buried. He plans to retrieve it, but others are searching for it too.', 'After a professional gambler kills a Confederate soldier, he finds a map pinpointing the location in the desert where stolen army gold bullion is buried. He plans to retrieve it, but others are searching for it too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avVCDiBjLrggNEkqEFZkOWAbz2L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54011'),
  ('1070495642383982068', 'Waterland', 1992, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Stephen Gyllenhaal, Robert Elswit, David Brown', 'Peter Prince', 'Jeremy Irons, Sinéad Cusack, Grant Warnock, Lena Headey, Callum Dixon, Ethan Hawke, Pete Postlethwaite, Sean Maguire', 'R', 'The story of a mentally anguished high school history teacher going through a complete reassessment of his life. His method for reassessing his life is to narrate it to his class and interweave in it three generations of his family''s history.', 'The story of a mentally anguished high school history teacher going through a complete reassessment of his life. His method for reassessing his life is to narrate it to his class and interweave in it three generations of his family''s history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zduHkpRTyFI2RrxLUAdk0SAsLr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145066'),
  ('77123700171314699', 'Waterloo', 1970, 'History, Drama, War', 'Sergey Bondarchuk, Armando Nannuzzi, Vladimir Dostal', 'H.A.L. Craig, Sergey Bondarchuk, Vittorio Bonicelli', 'Rod Steiger, Christopher Plummer, Orson Welles, Jack Hawkins, Virginia McKenna, Dan O''Herlihy, Rupert Davies, Philippe Forquet', null, 'After defeating France and imprisoning Napoleon on Elba, ending two decades of war, Europe is shocked to find Napoleon has escaped and has caused the French Army to defect from the King back to him. The best of the British generals, the Duke of Wellington, beat Napolean''s best generals in Spain and Portugal, but now must beat Napoleon himself with an Anglo Allied army.', 'After defeating France and imprisoning Napoleon on Elba, ending two decades of war, Europe is shocked to find Napoleon has escaped and has caused the French Army to defect from the King back to him. The best of the British generals, the Duke of Wellington, beat Napolean''s best generals in Spain and Portugal, but now must beat Napoleon himself with an Anglo Allied army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zd4SV3qs5Xg7Yl8kqshU2fxTT0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33157'),
  ('897885346574390689', 'Waterloo Bridge', 1931, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'James Whale, Joseph A. McDonough, Arthur Edeson', 'Richard Schayer', 'Mae Clarke, Douglass Montgomery, Doris Lloyd, Frederick Kerr, Enid Bennett, Bette Davis, Ethel Griffies, Rita Carlyle', null, 'In World War I London, Myra is an American out-of-work chorus girl making ends meet by picking up men on Waterloo Bridge. During a Zeppelin air raid she meets Roy, a naive young American who enlisted in the Canadian army. After they fall for each other, Roy tricks Myra into visiting his family, who live in a country estate outside London, his mother having remarried to a retired British Major. Myra is reluctant to continue the relationship with Roy, he not aware of her past.', 'In World War I London, Myra is an American out-of-work chorus girl making ends meet by picking up men on Waterloo Bridge. During a Zeppelin air raid she meets Roy, a naive young American who enlisted in the Canadian army. After they fall for each other, Roy tricks Myra into visiting his family, who live in a country estate outside London, his mother having remarried to a retired British Major. Myra is reluctant to continue the relationship with Roy, he not aware of her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHzA3gHKl63gkwOqghlcZQMwrhL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95797'),
  ('171103719516148928', 'Waterloo Bridge', 1940, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Joseph Ruttenberg, Douglas Shearer', 'S. N. Behrman, George Froeschel, Hans Rameau', 'Vivien Leigh, Robert Taylor, Lucile Watson, Virginia Field, Maria Ouspenskaya, C. Aubrey Smith, Janet Shaw, Janet Waldo', null, 'On the eve of World War II, a British officer revisits Waterloo Bridge and recalls the young man he was at the beginning of World War I and the young ballerina he met just before he left for the front.', 'On the eve of World War II, a British officer revisits Waterloo Bridge and recalls the young man he was at the beginning of World War I and the young ballerina he met just before he left for the front.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2XgYKd5tr5b9W5Yfq80yTZqf3hy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43824'),
  ('1040595071535176778', 'Waterloo Road', 1945, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Sidney Gilliat, Arthur Crabtree', 'Sidney Gilliat', 'John Mills, Stewart Granger, Alastair Sim, Joy Shelton, Alison Leggatt, Jean Kent, Beatrice Varley, George Carney', null, 'During WW2 a former railway employee who had been drafted, goes AWOL to hunt down the spiv and draft dodger who is having an affair with his wife.', 'During WW2 a former railway employee who had been drafted, goes AWOL to hunt down the spiv and draft dodger who is having an affair with his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGecK6H68XUEe5wjouBBQ9l529I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47810'),
  ('654723111393519641', 'Watermelon Man', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Melvin Van Peebles, Sheldon Schrager, W. Wallace Kelley', 'Herman Raucher', 'Godfrey Cambridge, Estelle Parsons, Howard Caine, D''Urville Martin, Mantan Moreland, Erin Moran, Scott Garrett, Paul Williams', 'R', 'A racist insurance agent lives in a typical suburban neighborhood, but his bigoted world of taunting and harassing black people on and off the job is turned upside down when his skin inexplicably turns dark overnight.', 'A racist insurance agent lives in a typical suburban neighborhood, but his bigoted world of taunting and harassing black people on and off the job is turned upside down when his skin inexplicably turns dark overnight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jKQ7goaKwlpDz40ZrgoXWHg26n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42600'),
  ('416217474610415570', 'Watership Down', 1978, 'Adventure, Animation, Drama', 'Martin Rosen', 'John Hubley', 'John Hurt, Richard Briers, Michael Graham Cox, John Bennett, Ralph Richardson, Simon Cadell, Terence Rigby, Roy Kinnear', 'PG', 'When the warren belonging to a community of rabbits is threatened, a brave group led by Fiver, Bigwig, Blackberry and Hazel leave their homeland in a search of a safe new haven.', 'When the warren belonging to a community of rabbits is threatened, a brave group led by Fiver, Bigwig, Blackberry and Hazel leave their homeland in a search of a safe new haven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9ZcNxfquJbMTd6UfhAlJbmLBts.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11837'),
  ('220672223927923064', 'Waterworld', 1995, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'Dean Semler, Kevin Reynolds, Steve Burg', 'Peter Rader, David Twohy', 'Kevin Costner, Dennis Hopper, Jeanne Tripplehorn, Tina Majorino, R. D. Call, Gerard Murphy, Michael Jeter, Rick Aviles', 'PG-13', 'In a futuristic world where the polar ice caps have melted and made Earth a liquid planet, a beautiful barmaid rescues a mutant seafarer from a floating island prison. They escape, along with her young charge, Enola, and sail off aboard his ship. But the trio soon becomes the target of a menacing pirate who covets the map to ''Dryland''—which is tattooed on Enola''s back.', 'In a futuristic world where the polar ice caps have melted and made Earth a liquid planet, a beautiful barmaid rescues a mutant seafarer from a floating island prison. They escape, along with her young charge, Enola, and sail off aboard his ship. But the trio soon becomes the target of a menacing pirate who covets the map to ''Dryland''—which is tattooed on Enola''s back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/X4UyUO5jgzs3c5YafnmYKLKKYw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9804'),
  ('98691911722400189', 'Wattstax', 1973, 'Music, Documentary', 'Mel Stuart, Larry Clark, John A. Alonzo', null, 'Richard Pryor, Rufus Thomas, Isaac Hayes, Melvin Van Peebles, Kim Weston, William Bell, Albert King, Eddie Floyd', 'R', 'A documentary film about the Afro-American Woodstock concert held in Los Angeles seven years after the Watts riots. Director Mel Stuart mixes footage from the concert with footage of the living conditions in the current-day Watts neighborhood.', 'A documentary film about the Afro-American Woodstock concert held in Los Angeles seven years after the Watts riots. Director Mel Stuart mixes footage from the concert with footage of the living conditions in the current-day Watts neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVPZCtlPDLTyEk4rDY1O7mXjqYv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2261'),
  ('208520803560565168', 'Wavelength', 1967, 'Drama', 'Michael Snow, Michael Snow', 'Michael Snow', 'Hollis Frampton, Amy Taubin, Lyne Grossman, Naoto Nakazawa, Roswell Rudd, Joyce Wieland, Amy Yadrin', null, 'Wavelength consists of almost no action, and what action does occur is largely elided. If the film could be said to have a conventional plot, this would presumably refer to the three “character” scenes. In the first scene two people enter a room, chat briefly, and listen to “Strawberry Fields Forever” on the radio. Later, a man (played by filmmaker Hollis Frampton) enters inexplicably and dies on the floor. And last, the female owner of the apartment is heard and seen on the phone, speaking, with strange calm, about the dead man in her apartment whom she has never seen before.', 'Wavelength consists of almost no action, and what action does occur is largely elided. If the film could be said to have a conventional plot, this would presumably refer to the three “character” scenes. In the first scene two people enter a room, chat briefly, and listen to “Strawberry Fields Forever” on the radio. Later, a man (played by filmmaker Hollis Frampton) enters inexplicably and dies on the floor. And last, the female owner of the apartment is heard and seen on the phone, speaking, with strange calm, about the dead man in her apartment whom she has never seen before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/EJrUlzZ7kTrCP3czxqtb5dfS5i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88421'),
  ('1085953474910491173', 'Wavelength', 1983, 'Science Fiction', 'Mike Gray, Paul Goldsmith', 'Mike Gray', 'Robert Carradine, Cherie Currie, Keenan Wynn, Cal Bowman, James Hess, Terry Burns, Eric Morris, Bob McLean', 'PG', 'Two young lovers learn that a small group of child-like space aliens are marooned on Earth and are being held prisoner at a top secret military facility. The couple then decide to liberate the extraterrestrial castaways and help them make a rendezvous with a rescue ship sent from the alien home planet.', 'Two young lovers learn that a small group of child-like space aliens are marooned on Earth and are being held prisoner at a top secret military facility. The couple then decide to liberate the extraterrestrial castaways and help them make a rendezvous with a rescue ship sent from the alien home planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNfHQtlB5cBqo8xsGDqJN50FlUE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41452'),
  ('933718675200694978', 'Waves', 2019, 'Romance, Drama', 'John Navarro Jr., Drew Daniels, Eric LaFranchi', 'Trey Edward Shults', 'Kelvin Harrison Jr., Taylor Russell, Renée Elise Goldsberry, Sterling K. Brown, Lucas Hedges, Alexa Demie, Neal Huff, Clifton Collins Jr.', 'R', 'A controlling father’s attempts to ensure that his two children succeed in high school backfire after his son experiences a career-ending sports injury. Their familial bonds are eventually placed under severe strain by an unexpected tragedy.', 'A controlling father’s attempts to ensure that his two children succeed in high school backfire after his son experiences a career-ending sports injury. Their familial bonds are eventually placed under severe strain by an unexpected tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xbjL0z8iH8e8L3USyeKGQrBfuZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:533444'),
  ('262272256517567726', 'Waves', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama, History', 'Jiří Mádl, Martin Žiaran', 'Jiří Mádl', 'Vojtěch Vodochodský, Ondřej Stupka, Tatiana Pauhofová, Stanislav Majer, Vojtěch Kotek, Marika Šoposká, Petr Lněnička, Martin Hofmann', null, 'At the end of the 1960s, when the air is filled with rock-and-roll and student rebellions are changing the world, the older of two brothers joins a prestigious newsroom of the public radio broadcaster. Not long after, he finds himself in the middle of a dangerous conflict between journalists and the secret service.', 'At the end of the 1960s, when the air is filled with rock-and-roll and student rebellions are changing the world, the older of two brothers joins a prestigious newsroom of the public radio broadcaster. Not long after, he finds himself in the middle of a dangerous conflict between journalists and the secret service.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXxvWOBdWDJwWXmX4nKgQsWLLKC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1251621'),
  ('798971161756552185', 'Waves of Lust', 1975, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Ruggero Deodato, Mario Capriotti', 'Fabio Pittorru, Franco Bottari', 'Al Cliver, Silvia Dionisio, John Steiner, Elizabeth Turner, Saverio Deodato', null, 'A young couple become embroiled with the personal problems of another couple on a yacht moored off Sicily during a turbulent weekend of fun, games, sex games, betrayal, spouse abuse, and murder.', 'A young couple become embroiled with the personal problems of another couple on a yacht moored off Sicily during a turbulent weekend of fun, games, sex games, betrayal, spouse abuse, and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4tUrnUT3FW2lcw2Na5AdoEWsLN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29175'),
  ('463181476088972973', 'Wax Experiments', 1927, 'Animation', 'Oskar Fischinger', null, null, null, 'For the production of this film, Oskar Fischinger tinted various layers of hot wax. After cooling, the resulting lump of wax resembled a marble cake. Fischinger then began to cut off slices from the lump, photographing each step.', 'For the production of this film, Oskar Fischinger tinted various layers of hot wax. After cooling, the resulting lump of wax resembled a marble cake. Fischinger then began to cut off slices from the lump, photographing each step.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yE8l1OyzMJyLD9KQ1iREthNrRw5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189727'),
  ('329833595191849526', 'Wax-Scented Women', 1996, 'Drama', 'İrfan Tözüm, Aytekin Çakmakçı, Ardahan Uzunatagan', 'Mete Özgencil', 'Selma Güneri, Halil Ergün, Sevtap Parman, Yasemin Alkaya, Hande Ataizi, Ceren Erginsoy, Murat Coşkuner, Hülya Karakaş', null, 'The movie is about the troubles of a group of people living in the same neighborhood. Ihsan has turned in upon himself by the death of his lover and he is waiting for the day when he will die in the mansion where he lives. Fatma sometimes goes to help Ihsan, and she can’t stand against her husband who abuses her daughter. Gulizar lives in the same neighborhood, and she has also become obsessed with her virginity. Gül is also accidentally pregnant and cheated on by her husband. She is also preoccupied with her own problems. The story of these five people struggling with their own problems will intersect around a murder case.', 'The movie is about the troubles of a group of people living in the same neighborhood. Ihsan has turned in upon himself by the death of his lover and he is waiting for the day when he will die in the mansion where he lives. Fatma sometimes goes to help Ihsan, and she can’t stand against her husband who abuses her daughter. Gulizar lives in the same neighborhood, and she has also become obsessed with her virginity. Gül is also accidentally pregnant and cheated on by her husband. She is also preoccupied with her own problems. The story of these five people struggling with their own problems will intersect around a murder case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3tLVWlKMqSLNNKnjln4pw3RyHG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332881'),
  ('701018082545089844', 'Wax, or The Discovery of Television Among the Bees', 1991, 'Science Fiction', 'David Blair, Mark Kaplan, Leighton Edmondson', 'David Blair', 'David Blair, Father Bessarion, William S. Burroughs, Florence Ormezzano, Meg Savlov, Meg Savlov, Dr. Clyde Tombaugh', null, 'Computer programmer/beekeeper Jacob gets a "television" implanted in his brain by a race of telekinetic bees, which causes him to experience severe hallucinations.', 'Computer programmer/beekeeper Jacob gets a "television" implanted in his brain by a race of telekinetic bees, which causes him to experience severe hallucinations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxJeg0K5KmtZeTkJtX2pAqli7Sj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54400'),
  ('493512911411211357', 'Waxwork', 1988, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Gerry Lively, Anthony Hickox, Gary Bettman', 'Anthony Hickox', 'Zach Galligan, Jennifer Bassey, Joe Baker, Deborah Foreman, Michelle Johnson, David Warner, Eric Brown, Clare Carey', 'R', 'Wealthy slacker college student Mark, his new girlfriend Sarah, and their friends are invited to a special showing at a mysterious wax museum which displays 18 of the most evil men of all time. After his ex-girlfriend and another friend disappear, Mark becomes suspicious.', 'Wealthy slacker college student Mark, his new girlfriend Sarah, and their friends are invited to a special showing at a mysterious wax museum which displays 18 of the most evil men of all time. After his ex-girlfriend and another friend disappear, Mark becomes suspicious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48RXt1Zu8iNL0mgCojydmqBsjsC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29095'),
  ('1036532909476794238', 'Waxwork II: Lost in Time', 1992, 'Horror, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Anthony Hickox, Gerry Lively, Phil Robinson', 'Anthony Hickox', 'Zach Galligan, Monika Schnarre, Martin Kemp, Bruce Campbell, Michael Des Barres, Jim Metzler, Sophie Ward, Marina Sirtis', 'R', 'The survivors of the first Waxwork must use a portal through time to defeat the evil that has followed them and turned their lives upside down.', 'The survivors of the first Waxwork must use a portal through time to defeat the evil that has followed them and turned their lives upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dT2V9pZNVGOpzH17LJKg62wl3Pc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28762'),
  ('395005312753728281', 'Waxworks', 1924, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Leo Birinski, Paul Leni, Fritz Maurischat', 'Henrik Galeen', 'Emil Jannings, Conrad Veidt, William Dieterle, Werner Krauss, Olga Belajeff, John Gottowt, Georg John, Ernst Legal', 'NR', 'A poet is hired by the owner of a wax museum in a circus to write tales about Harun al Raschid, Ivan the Terrible and Jack the Ripper. While writing, the poet and the daughter of the owner, Eva, fantasize the fantastic stories and fall in love for each other.', 'A poet is hired by the owner of a wax museum in a circus to write tales about Harun al Raschid, Ivan the Terrible and Jack the Ripper. While writing, the poet and the daughter of the owner, Eva, fantasize the fantastic stories and fall in love for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6n8hkbMUiY3ETNNoQspHwotvHkA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27522'),
  ('1013807581622462434', 'way', 2012, null, 'Konrad Steiner', null, null, null, 'San Francisco filmmaker Konrad Steiner took 12 years to complete a montage cycle set to the late Leslie Scalapino’s most celebrated poem, way—a sprawling book-length odyssey of shardlike urban impressions, fraught with obliquely felt social and sexual tensions. Six stylistically distinctive films for each section of way, using sources ranging from Kodachrome footage of sun-kissed S.F. street scenes to internet clips of the Iraq war to a fragmented Fred Astaire dance number.', 'San Francisco filmmaker Konrad Steiner took 12 years to complete a montage cycle set to the late Leslie Scalapino’s most celebrated poem, way—a sprawling book-length odyssey of shardlike urban impressions, fraught with obliquely felt social and sexual tensions. Six stylistically distinctive films for each section of way, using sources ranging from Kodachrome footage of sun-kissed S.F. street scenes to internet clips of the Iraq war to a fragmented Fred Astaire dance number.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDTprBIAlqwY6fnf04W3idQ1zXv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:840127'),
  ('845626746410108887', 'Way Back Home', 2013, 'Drama', 'Lee Seong-hwan, Kim Sung-han, Gwon Hui-cheol', 'Yoon Jin-ho', 'Jeon Do-yeon, Go Soo, Kang Ji-woo, Choi Min-chul, Lee Dong-hwi, Park Ji-hwan, Seo Jin-won, Choi Gwi-hwa', null, 'Jeong-yoon and Jong-bae own a car body repair shop together that gets in financial trouble. To help cover the losses and take care of her family, Jeong-yoon decides to smuggle thirty kilograms of cocaine.', 'Jeong-yoon and Jong-bae own a car body repair shop together that gets in financial trouble. To help cover the losses and take care of her family, Jeong-yoon decides to smuggle thirty kilograms of cocaine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbfFH5T2Xm48AzbiWOBuIL90z1y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242458'),
  ('321473713281411395', 'Way Down East', 1920, 'Drama, Romance', 'D.W. Griffith, Hendrik Sartov, Billy Bitzer', 'Anthony Paul Kelly, D.W. Griffith', 'Lillian Gish, Richard Barthelmess, Lowell Sherman, Burr McIntosh, Kate Bruce, Mrs. David Landau, Josephine Bernard, Mrs. Morgan Belmont', 'NR', 'A naive country girl is tricked into a sham marriage by a wealthy womanizer, then must rebuild her life despite the taint of having borne a child out of wedlock.', 'A naive country girl is tricked into a sham marriage by a wealthy womanizer, then must rebuild her life despite the taint of having borne a child out of wedlock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzrSiQuiSb5hKePkU9AFuCcgRxE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31509'),
  ('693050771664705808', 'Way Home', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Charlotte Sieling, Erik Horn', 'Charlotte Sieling, Jesper Fink, Nagieb Khaja', 'Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Albert Rudbeck Lindhardt, Arian Kashef, Besir Zeciri, Harki Bhambra, Tom Austen, Majd Eid, Ahmad Al-Sukar', null, 'How far are you willing to go to save the people you love? This is the question Christian is forced to answer when he is smuggled into Syria in a desperate search for his son Adam. It''s a deadly and soul-searching journey into a brutal, war-torn country. Gradually, Christian realises that he must be willing to sacrifice everything he believes in to be reunited with his son.', 'How far are you willing to go to save the people you love? This is the question Christian is forced to answer when he is smuggled into Syria in a desperate search for his son Adam. It''s a deadly and soul-searching journey into a brutal, war-torn country. Gradually, Christian realises that he must be willing to sacrifice everything he believes in to be reunited with his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iC0sFXBZuWPipYtye4dIf5U5E9k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1317159'),
  ('306391346462424627', 'Way of a Gaucho', 1952, 'Western, Adventure', 'Jacques Tourneur, Harry Jackson', 'Philip Dunne', 'Rory Calhoun, Gene Tierney, Richard Boone, Hugh Marlowe, Everett Sloane, Enrique Chaico, Jorge Villoldo, Hugo Mancini', 'NR', 'In 1875 Argentina, after killing a man, a gaucho is sentenced to harsh army duty but he deserts the army and becomes a bandit leader.', 'In 1875 Argentina, after killing a man, a gaucho is sentenced to harsh army duty but he deserts the army and becomes a bandit leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwfHr6RIpRVGcjVfTILmmd6FEwH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131473'),
  ('295139720037080147', 'Way of the Vampire', 2005, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Eduardo Durão, Sarah Nean Bruce, Zack Richard', 'Karrie Melendrez, Sherri Strain', 'Rhett Giles, Paul Logan, Andreas Beckett, Denise Boutte, Brent Falco, Alix Henning, Jared Cohn, James Ashby', 'R', 'Dr. Abraham Van Helsing is granted immortality by the Catholic Church until he can hunt down the last vampire prince.', 'Dr. Abraham Van Helsing is granted immortality by the Catholic Church until he can hunt down the last vampire prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hB2Fzh6owoJPijSYwEJAmBDb5Jo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28516'),
  ('490609503482914934', 'Way of Youth', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Michel Boisrond', 'Pierre Bost, Jean Aurenche', 'Françoise Arnoul, Bourvil, Lino Ventura, Alain Delon, Pierre Mondy, Paulette Dubost, Sandra Milo, Jean-Claude Brialy', null, 'This movie is a Marcel Aymé adaptation and it deals with the not-so-glorious side of the Occupation: black market, war profiteers, cracking open bottles of Champagne while most of the Parisians are almost starving.', 'This movie is a Marcel Aymé adaptation and it deals with the not-so-glorious side of the Occupation: black market, war profiteers, cracking open bottles of Champagne while most of the Parisians are almost starving.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipn6OzDN61dgSowMvw4IKfVUGnL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34060'),
  ('1107052342291464808', 'Way Out West', 1937, 'Action, Comedy, Western', 'James W. Horne, Chet Brandenburg, Art Lloyd', 'James W. Horne, Arthur V. Jones, Stan Laurel', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Rosina Lawrence, James Finlayson, Sharon Lynn, Chill Wills, Stanley Fields, Vivien Oakland', 'NR', 'Stan and Ollie try to deliver the deed to a valuable gold mine to the daughter of a dead prospector. Unfortunately, the daughter''s evil guardian is determined to have the gold mine for himself and his saloon-singer wife.', 'Stan and Ollie try to deliver the deed to a valuable gold mine to the daughter of a dead prospector. Unfortunately, the daughter''s evil guardian is determined to have the gold mine for himself and his saloon-singer wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTYnwvsD4j5chX8MFgiwx9AzSXj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25599'),
  ('62566066229623917', 'Way... Way Out', 1966, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Gordon Douglas, William H. Clothier, Joseph E. Rickards', 'William Bowers, László Vadnay', 'Jerry Lewis, Connie Stevens, Robert Morley, Dennis Weaver, Howard Morris, Brian Keith, Dick Shawn, Anita Ekberg', 'NR', 'A platonically wed American couple run a lunar weather station near an unwed Soviet couple.', 'A platonically wed American couple run a lunar weather station near an unwed Soviet couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcFXDl8AZ6q3Ctf5YalYQko517J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102195'),
  ('514233639003162288', 'Waydowntown', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gary Burns, Patrick McLaughlin', 'Patrick McLaughlin, Gary Burns, James Martin', 'Fab Filippo, Don McKellar, Marya Delver, Gordon Currie, Tammy Isbell, Tobias Godson, Jennifer Clement, James McBurney', null, 'Four young office workers have a bet going to see who can last the longest without going outside. In the maze that is the downtown core of a large city, glass skywalks connect apartment buildings, office towers and shopping malls. Its day 28 of the bet and over the lunch hour, as the office prepares for the company founder''s retirement party, things start to seriously unravel.', 'Four young office workers have a bet going to see who can last the longest without going outside. In the maze that is the downtown core of a large city, glass skywalks connect apartment buildings, office towers and shopping malls. Its day 28 of the bet and over the lunch hour, as the office prepares for the company founder''s retirement party, things start to seriously unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2gFxNSAYZEqXXzT2chV7ezrl0Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13915'),
  ('848119648061367552', 'Wayne''s World', 1992, 'Comedy, Music', 'Penelope Spheeris, Theo van de Sande, John G. Scotti', 'Mike Myers, Bonnie Turner, Terry Turner', 'Mike Myers, Dana Carvey, Rob Lowe, Tia Carrere, Lara Flynn Boyle, Donna Dixon, Chris Farley, Brian Doyle-Murray', 'PG-13', 'The adventures of two amiably aimless metal-head friends, Wayne and Garth. From Wayne''s basement, the pair broadcast a talk-show called "Wayne''s World" on local public access television. The show comes to the attention of a sleazy network executive who wants to produce a big-budget version of "Wayne''s World"—and he also wants Wayne''s girlfriend, a rock singer named Cassandra. Wayne and Garth have to battle the executive not only to save their show, but also Cassandra.', 'The adventures of two amiably aimless metal-head friends, Wayne and Garth. From Wayne''s basement, the pair broadcast a talk-show called "Wayne''s World" on local public access television. The show comes to the attention of a sleazy network executive who wants to produce a big-budget version of "Wayne''s World"—and he also wants Wayne''s girlfriend, a rock singer named Cassandra. Wayne and Garth have to battle the executive not only to save their show, but also Cassandra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHwZnFNWR7PaS9t5EBwTvGPeoYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8872'),
  ('1064745173810852709', 'Wayne''s World 2', 1993, 'Comedy, Music', 'Stephen Surjik, Francis Kenny, Matt Earl Beesley', 'Bonnie Turner, Terry Turner, Mike Myers', 'Mike Myers, Dana Carvey, Christopher Walken, Tia Carrere, Chris Farley, James Hong, Rip Taylor, Steven Tyler', 'PG-13', 'A message from Jim Morrison in a dream prompts cable access TV stars Wayne and Garth to put on a rock concert, "Waynestock," with Aerosmith as headliners. But amid the preparations, Wayne frets that a record producer is putting the moves on his girlfriend, Cassandra, while Garth handles the advances of mega-babe Honey Hornée.', 'A message from Jim Morrison in a dream prompts cable access TV stars Wayne and Garth to put on a rock concert, "Waynestock," with Aerosmith as headliners. But amid the preparations, Wayne frets that a record producer is putting the moves on his girlfriend, Cassandra, while Garth handles the advances of mega-babe Honey Hornée.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/72TBNPN06oo1myHqihwcCQVDl48.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8873'),
  ('1093511222697004442', 'Wazir', 2016, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Bejoy Nambiar, Sanu John Varghese, Tushar Kunder', 'Vikram Chandra, Suketu Mehta, Supriya Kelkar', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Farhan Akhtar, Aditi Rao Hydari, John Abraham, Neil Nitin Mukesh, Manav Kaul, Prakash Belawadi, Murali Sharma', 'PG-13', '''Wazir'' is a tale of two unlikely friends, a wheelchair-bound chess grandmaster and a brave ATS officer. Brought together by grief and a strange twist of fate, the two men decide to help each other win the biggest games of their lives. But there''s a mysterious, dangerous opponent lurking in the shadows, who is all set to checkmate them.', '''Wazir'' is a tale of two unlikely friends, a wheelchair-bound chess grandmaster and a brave ATS officer. Brought together by grief and a strange twist of fate, the two men decide to help each other win the biggest games of their lives. But there''s a mysterious, dangerous opponent lurking in the shadows, who is all set to checkmate them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wo5ASV73rrLr9z22P4nfqwPQPRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275269'),
  ('954621465870431250', 'We', 1969, 'Documentary', 'Artavazd Peleshian', 'Artavazd Peleshian', null, null, 'Monumental picture exploring the identity and fate of the Armenian nation.', 'Monumental picture exploring the identity and fate of the Armenian nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rO1UB9nYaAgv7MoAwiNmjRa4EH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183725'),
  ('209606124731271401', 'We', 1982, 'Science Fiction, Romance, Drama', 'Gudrun Vöge, Vojtěch Jasný, Norbert Zinkand', 'Claus Hubalek', 'Dieter Laser, Sabine von Maydell, Gert Haucke, Dietmar Mues, Susanne Altschul, Giovanni Früh, Wolfgang Kaven, Dieter G. Knichel', null, 'In the 26th century the inhabitants of Utopia have so lost their individuality, which varies in number. They live in glass houses (this was written before the invention of television), which allows the political police, called “Keepers” can easily supervise them. They all wear the same uniform and usually turn to each other or as a ”cipher-so” or "UNIFEM" (uniform). They feed on artificial food and rest hour marching in fours in a row the anthem of the One State, pouring out of the loudspeakers. As they are allowed to put a break on the hour (known as the ”sexy time“), draw the curtains of their glass houses. At the head of the One State is one called The Benefactor, which are replaced every year the whole population, usually unanimously. The guiding principle of the State is that happiness and freedom are incompatible.', 'In the 26th century the inhabitants of Utopia have so lost their individuality, which varies in number. They live in glass houses (this was written before the invention of television), which allows the political police, called “Keepers” can easily supervise them. They all wear the same uniform and usually turn to each other or as a ”cipher-so” or "UNIFEM" (uniform). They feed on artificial food and rest hour marching in fours in a row the anthem of the One State, pouring out of the loudspeakers. As they are allowed to put a break on the hour (known as the ”sexy time“), draw the curtains of their glass houses. At the head of the One State is one called The Benefactor, which are replaced every year the whole population, usually unanimously. The guiding principle of the State is that happiness and freedom are incompatible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/es6EghZYgkeMhO7gHOeSmBvWBNr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255656'),
  ('881635266057636638', 'We', 1990, null, 'Shelly Silver', 'Shelly Silver', null, null, 'A short, graphically dynamic work contrasting contradictory views of perception and interpretation, by way of society''s assumptions vis-a-vis phallocentrism and fetishism.', 'A short, graphically dynamic work contrasting contradictory views of perception and interpretation, by way of society''s assumptions vis-a-vis phallocentrism and fetishism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ex8deNcwY7FOxCV5hmY7H8O87Fg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:805307'),
  ('94462219551399227', 'We', 2018, 'Drama', 'Maxime Desmet, Rene Eller, Esgo Groenendijk', 'Rene Eller', 'Pauline Casteleyn, Aimé Claeys, Gaia Sofia Cozijn, Axel Daeseleire, Salomé van Grunsven, Laura Drosopoulos, Friso van der Werf, Lieselot Siddiki', null, 'During a scorching summer in a Belgian-Dutch border village, eight teenagers play games of discovery to break the listless monotony. They challenge each other and themselves and pretty soon, their sexual curiosity starts to blur the lines between right and wrong. As innocence is crushed in depraved games and sexual exploitation, the teenagers soon turn into ruthless predators.', 'During a scorching summer in a Belgian-Dutch border village, eight teenagers play games of discovery to break the listless monotony. They challenge each other and themselves and pretty soon, their sexual curiosity starts to blur the lines between right and wrong. As innocence is crushed in depraved games and sexual exploitation, the teenagers soon turn into ruthless predators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwTKiJF57VknDuNCWgoHaJamm82.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499546'),
  ('929837341808066039', 'We', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mani Nasry', 'Alejandro Leopardi', 'Humberly González, Shiva Negar, A.C. Peterson, Lara Daans, Joan Gregson, Marcia Bennett, Cory Lee, Anita La Selva', 'PG', 'Dating within different cultures and being open to all religions, Ethan must deal with constant roadblocks. From First Nations to South American, his journey to find love in Toronto is nothing but complex. He faces discrimination and depression but always remains optimistic.', 'Dating within different cultures and being open to all religions, Ethan must deal with constant roadblocks. From First Nations to South American, his journey to find love in Toronto is nothing but complex. He faces discrimination and depression but always remains optimistic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDl36RTXJW1GhCqz6FOYRl7sCt7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:658854'),
  ('49433379925385717', 'We', 2021, 'Drama, Family', 'Aco Tenriyagelli, Raflat Arya', 'Abdi Karya', 'Rachel Amanda, Teuku Rifnu Wikana, Riny Hamid, Alda Puspitasari, Alma Mauvi, Fuad Maulana', null, 'Tells about Adin with his father and mother who are waiting for the announcement for Adin to go to the next level of education. Although enthusiastic, the worries of Mr and Mrs were mixed with the prayers and hopes that were held for Adin in the future.', 'Tells about Adin with his father and mother who are waiting for the announcement for Adin to go to the next level of education. Although enthusiastic, the worries of Mr and Mrs were mixed with the prayers and hopes that were held for Adin in the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnn0KKtfS1TyA1y2LAHhQMBIDVG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848466'),
  ('910558150914979204', 'We', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Sylvain Verdet, Clément Alline, Sarah Blum', 'Alice Diop', 'Marcel Balnoas, Ethan Balnoas, Florence Roche, Ismael Soumaïla Sissoko, Bamba Sibi, N''deye Sighane Diop, Pierre Bergounioux, Hawa Camara', null, 'An urban train link, the RER B, crosses Paris and its outskirts from north to south. A journey within indistinct spaces known as inner cities and suburbs. Several portraits, all individual pieces that form a whole. We.', 'An urban train link, the RER B, crosses Paris and its outskirts from north to south. A journey within indistinct spaces known as inner cities and suburbs. Several portraits, all individual pieces that form a whole. We.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPBr19UzviA44WbQe74vezFNM91.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795760'),
  ('917476387360335020', 'WE', 2011, 'Drama', 'Benjamin Hameury, Jonathan Vinel', 'Jonathan Vinel, Benjamin Hameury', 'Robin Laplace-Claverie, Luc Renauld, Benjamin Hameury, Jonathan Vinel', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qDXCzHPklci1NTFzILQ7v6QPeX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1029933'),
  ('1002081104731797654', 'We 3', 2011, 'Drama', 'Nando Olival', 'Thiago Dottori, Nando Olival', 'Juliana Schalch, Gabriel Godoy, Victor Mendes, Sophia Reis, Cecília Homem de Mello, Alceu Nunes', null, 'Three young people arrive from different parts of the country to go to college in Sao Paulo. On their first day there, a strange and intense attraction unites them. Together, they rent an apartment and begin living together, in close quarters. Sharing kisses and fond embraces. They exchange words of endearment with the naturalness of ordering a sandwich at a diner. They threaten to break up and the next moment they are all laughing together again. College days however soon come to an end and, with each having different paths to trail, separation is imminent. And consequently, their gestures, words and attitudes take on a new weight. Touching each other now takes on a new significance. Words of love are weighed down by consequences.', 'Three young people arrive from different parts of the country to go to college in Sao Paulo. On their first day there, a strange and intense attraction unites them. Together, they rent an apartment and begin living together, in close quarters. Sharing kisses and fond embraces. They exchange words of endearment with the naturalness of ordering a sandwich at a diner. They threaten to break up and the next moment they are all laughing together again. College days however soon come to an end and, with each having different paths to trail, separation is imminent. And consequently, their gestures, words and attitudes take on a new weight. Touching each other now takes on a new significance. Words of love are weighed down by consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11E05W5qTGr1pZDsDnqvqCZZfKt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84914'),
  ('229194778061873150', 'We Accept Miracles', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Roy Bava, Luca John Rosati, Paolo Carnera', 'Tito Buffolini, Alessandro Siani, Gianluca Ansanelli', 'Alessandro Siani, Fabio De Luigi, Ana Caterina Morariu, Serena Autieri, Giovanni Esposito, Maria Del Monte, Paolo Triestino, Benedetto Casillo', null, 'Fired from his HR job in the big city, Fulvio returns home and sees a leaky pipe in his brother''s church as the way to save the crumbling town.', 'Fired from his HR job in the big city, Fulvio returns home and sees a leaky pipe in his brother''s church as the way to save the crumbling town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzqQ8SydpHp4tSwwWMtBuGkR6wB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315319'),
  ('476865949870915909', 'We All Fall Down', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Enrico Verra, Giuseppe Caliandro, Chiara Cremaschi', 'Davide Ferrario', 'Valerio Mastandrea, Carlo Monni, Adriana Rinaldi, Caterina Caselli, Alessandro Partexano, Raffaele Vannoli, Luciana Littizzetto, Gianluca Gobbi', null, 'Having just moved back in with his working-class parents, twentysomething on-and-off philosophy undergrad Walter navigates turn-of-the-millennium Turin and Gen-X ennui.', 'Having just moved back in with his working-class parents, twentysomething on-and-off philosophy undergrad Walter navigates turn-of-the-millennium Turin and Gen-X ennui.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHMCAkc3hBoEVt6HHx5e9KL5zkS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56783'),
  ('481877824145601141', 'We All Scream for Ice Cream', 2007, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Tom Holland', 'David J. Schow, John Farris', 'William Forsythe, Lee Tergesen, Brent Sheppard, Maxwell Neck, Tim Henry, Laura Drummond, Colin Cunningham, Ingrid Tesch', null, 'Years ago, they pulled a disastrous childhood prank on the neighborhood ice cream delivery man that got him killed, but now as they''ve become adults with families of their own, the last thing anyone expected was for that man to come back in the form of a vengeful, bloodthirsty spirit.', 'Years ago, they pulled a disastrous childhood prank on the neighborhood ice cream delivery man that got him killed, but now as they''ve become adults with families of their own, the last thing anyone expected was for that man to come back in the form of a vengeful, bloodthirsty spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gbWafG60MwuFJYUAKW0H4gwOP9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233885'),
  ('398170239329028241', 'We Are 18 Years Old', 1959, 'Comedy', 'Jesús Franco', 'Jesús Franco', 'Isana Medel, Terele Pávez, Carmen Lozano, Luis Peña, Licia Calderón, Javier García, María Luisa Ponte, Pablo Sanz', null, 'Comedy about the surreal holiday of two teenage Spanish girls, where they meet a bizarre assortment of villains and new friends.', 'Comedy about the surreal holiday of two teenage Spanish girls, where they meet a bizarre assortment of villains and new friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSl3PHm37qI222SeecXHaRyRfXr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190806'),
  ('739736927036119023', 'We Are All Murderers', 1952, 'Crime, Drama', 'André Cayatte, Jean Bourgoin, Pierre Léaud', 'André Cayatte, Charles Spaak', 'Marcel Mouloudji, Raymond Pellegrin, Antoine Balpêtré, Julien Verdier, Claude Laydu, Georges Poujouly, Jacqueline Pierreux, Lucien Nat', null, 'Originally titled Nous Sommes Tout des Assassins, We Are All Murderers was directed by Andre Cayette, a former lawyer who detested France''s execution system. Charles Spaak''s screenplay makes no attempt to launder the four principal characters (Marcel Mouloudji, Raymond Pellegrin, Antoinine Balpetre, Julien Verdeir): never mind the motivations, these are all hardened murderers. Still, the film condemns the sadistic ritual through which these four men are brought to the guillotine. In France, the policy is to never tell the condemned man when the execution will occur--and then to show up without warning and drag the victim kicking and screaming to his doom, without any opportunity to make peace with himself or his Maker. By the end of this harrowing film, the audience feels as dehumanized as the four "protagonists." We Are All Murderers was roundly roasted by the French law enforcement establishment, but it won a special jury prize at the 1952 Cannes Film Festival.', 'Originally titled Nous Sommes Tout des Assassins, We Are All Murderers was directed by Andre Cayette, a former lawyer who detested France''s execution system. Charles Spaak''s screenplay makes no attempt to launder the four principal characters (Marcel Mouloudji, Raymond Pellegrin, Antoinine Balpetre, Julien Verdeir): never mind the motivations, these are all hardened murderers. Still, the film condemns the sadistic ritual through which these four men are brought to the guillotine. In France, the policy is to never tell the condemned man when the execution will occur--and then to show up without warning and drag the victim kicking and screaming to his doom, without any opportunity to make peace with himself or his Maker. By the end of this harrowing film, the audience feels as dehumanized as the four "protagonists." We Are All Murderers was roundly roasted by the French law enforcement establishment, but it won a special jury prize at the 1952 Cannes Film Festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cA0zWVlOJaHBKpxfiIgCRYR10cm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199503'),
  ('712090447094158418', 'We Are All Strangers', 2026, 'Drama, Family', 'Anthony Chen, Teoh Gay Hian', 'Anthony Chen', 'Yeo Yann Yann, Koh Jia Ler, Andi Lim, Regene Lim, Ting Li Lim', null, 'In bustling Singapore, three families from different social classes navigate their intertwined lives, challenging traditional values and exploring the bonds that connect people beyond blood relations.', 'In bustling Singapore, three families from different social classes navigate their intertwined lives, challenging traditional values and exploring the bonds that connect people beyond blood relations.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FaFs5h73L9BS4Q4UItDhWC5sw4Z9.jpg', 'plex:movie:we-are-all-strangers'),
  ('248247521831419', 'We Are Brothers', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jang Jin, Kim Sung-an, Park Cheong-woo', 'Jang Jin, Bae Se-young', 'Cho Jin-woong, Kim Sung-kyun, Kim Young-ae, Yoon Jin-yi, Lee Hae-yeong, Jung Min-jin, Jo Bok-rae, Choi Tae-won', null, 'Two brothers were separated in childhood at an orphanage, only to find each other as adults 30 years later. But right after their reunion, their birth mother, who suffers from Alzheimer''s disease, suddenly disappears. So Sang-yeon and Ha-yeon team up together and go on a road trip to search for her.', 'Two brothers were separated in childhood at an orphanage, only to find each other as adults 30 years later. But right after their reunion, their birth mother, who suffers from Alzheimer''s disease, suddenly disappears. So Sang-yeon and Ha-yeon team up together and go on a road trip to search for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kO2adrR3Upb6cuvivGKaFnQ4CLg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:307217'),
  ('23990872483826437', 'We Are Family', 2010, 'Drama, Family', 'Siddharth P. Malhotra', null, 'Arjun Rampal, Kajol, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Aanchal Munjal, Diya Sonecha, Nominath Ginsburg', 'PG', 'Maya is the perfect mother. Her life revolves around her three children, Aleya, Ankush, and Anjali. Who thinks nothing much then the world of her. Despite being divorced from her husband, Aman. Maya has ensured that everything runs smoothly in her house, under her watch, and that they continue to remain a happy family unit. However, when Aman introduces his girlfriend, Shreya a career oriented woman, who has a lot to learn about children''s, to the family, the situation immediately takes an unexpected turn. When an incident changes their lives drastically, bringing the two women under the same roof, they find themselves putting to test an unusual situation; can two mothers make a home?', 'Maya is the perfect mother. Her life revolves around her three children, Aleya, Ankush, and Anjali. Who thinks nothing much then the world of her. Despite being divorced from her husband, Aman. Maya has ensured that everything runs smoothly in her house, under her watch, and that they continue to remain a happy family unit. However, when Aman introduces his girlfriend, Shreya a career oriented woman, who has a lot to learn about children''s, to the family, the situation immediately takes an unexpected turn. When an incident changes their lives drastically, bringing the two women under the same roof, they find themselves putting to test an unusual situation; can two mothers make a home?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dy2qAtTqe83zCCB55sqVK2g7i1m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44972'),
  ('932471810737795741', 'We Are Family', 2016, 'Comedy, Family', 'Cyrill Renaud, Gabriel Julien-Laferrière', 'Camille Moreau, Olivier Treiner', 'Julie Gayet, Thierry Neuvic, Julie Depardieu, Lucien Jean-Baptiste, Claudia Tagbo, Philippe Katerine, Chantal Ladesou, Arié Elmaleh', null, 'Thirteen-year-old Bastien is the center of a reconstructed family: six half-brothers and sisters, eight "parents," and as many houses. His tasks within the family are far more complex than what he has to do at school. But enough''s enough: the children decide to wage a revolution and turn the rules upside down. All together, they squat a large apartment and now it''ll be up to the parents to come to them!', 'Thirteen-year-old Bastien is the center of a reconstructed family: six half-brothers and sisters, eight "parents," and as many houses. His tasks within the family are far more complex than what he has to do at school. But enough''s enough: the children decide to wage a revolution and turn the rules upside down. All together, they squat a large apartment and now it''ll be up to the parents to come to them!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnsEJOMcO2NLaoCVqIDJOLMMMh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391700'),
  ('913587642659242133', 'We Are from Kronstadt', 1936, 'Drama, History, War', 'Efim Dzigan, Naum Naumov-Strazh, Georgiy Beryozko', 'Vsevolod Vishnevsky', 'Vasiliy Zaychikov, Oleg Zhakov, Georgi Bushuyev, Raisa Yesipova, Nikolay Ivakin, Pyotr Kirillov, Mikhail Gurinenko, Fyodor Seleznyov', null, 'In 1919, during the post-revolution Russian Civil War, a naval detachment (made up of communist Reds) defends the strategic city of Petrograd from the White Russian counterrevolutionary forces', 'In 1919, during the post-revolution Russian Civil War, a naval detachment (made up of communist Reds) defends the strategic city of Petrograd from the White Russian counterrevolutionary forces', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mlloQtnnJvHrvtJ54j446gb35w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245874'),
  ('194454637948155642', 'We Are from the Future', 2008, 'War, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Vladimir Sporyshkov, Olga Livinskaya, Andrey Malyukov', 'Alexandr Shevtsov, Eduard Volodarskiy, Kirill Belevich', 'Danila Kozlovsky, Andrey Terentyev, Vladimir Yaglych, Dmitriy Volkostrelov, Ekaterina Klimova, Boris Galkin, Daniil Strakhov, Sergey Makhovikov', null, 'Four present-day Russian men dig for Nazi memorabilia at a WWII battlefield. A wormhole lake sends them back to a battle in 1942 USSR.', 'Four present-day Russian men dig for Nazi memorabilia at a WWII battlefield. A wormhole lake sends them back to a battle in 1942 USSR.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZCPCdmZQI0GmoJPzyraqtLaarc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40709'),
  ('627931068775904891', 'We Are from the Future 2', 2010, 'War, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Dmitri Voronkov, Ilya Dyomin', 'Chermen Khadikov, Alexandr Shevtsov', 'Vladimir Yaglych, Ekaterina Klimova, Igor Petrenko, Dmytro Stupka, Vladislav Reznik, Mikhail Lukashov, Aleksey Barabash, Kirill Poluhin', null, 'Two young Russian historians are going to Ukraine to take part in the reconstruction of the Lvov-Sandomierz operation in July 1944. On sight they fall into conflict with Ukrainian nationalists, and some magical twist of fate, move into the middle of real warfare from more than 60 years. Miraculously avoiding death at the hands of Ukrainian nationalists, caught in the middle of fighting between the Red Army and the Nazis.', 'Two young Russian historians are going to Ukraine to take part in the reconstruction of the Lvov-Sandomierz operation in July 1944. On sight they fall into conflict with Ukrainian nationalists, and some magical twist of fate, move into the middle of real warfare from more than 60 years. Miraculously avoiding death at the hands of Ukrainian nationalists, caught in the middle of fighting between the Red Army and the Nazis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dEyBlKaQZGb1ZNwRScKOYWoFRD3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36699'),
  ('143126334025606250', 'We Are Legion: The Story of the Hacktivists', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Brian Knappenberger, Lincoln Else', 'Brian Knappenberger', 'Anon2World, Anonyops, Julian Assange, Aaron Barr, Barrett Brown, Adrian Chen, Steven Levy, Quinn Norton', 'PG', 'Takes us inside the world of Anonymous, the radical "hacktivist" collective that has redefined civil disobedience for the digital age. The film explores early hacktivist groups like Cult of the Dead Cow and Electronic Disturbance Theater, then moves to Anonymous'' raucous beginnings on the website 4chan. Through interviews with current members, people recently returned from prison or facing trial, writers, academics, activists and major players in various "raids," the documentary traces Anonymous’ evolution from merry pranksters to a full-blown movement with a global reach, the most transformative civil disobedience of our time.', 'Takes us inside the world of Anonymous, the radical "hacktivist" collective that has redefined civil disobedience for the digital age. The film explores early hacktivist groups like Cult of the Dead Cow and Electronic Disturbance Theater, then moves to Anonymous'' raucous beginnings on the website 4chan. Through interviews with current members, people recently returned from prison or facing trial, writers, academics, activists and major players in various "raids," the documentary traces Anonymous’ evolution from merry pranksters to a full-blown movement with a global reach, the most transformative civil disobedience of our time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6h3KVwIyPCh1pzS4mchjuUBgZ17.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97690'),
  ('139852833370567928', 'We Are Little Zombies', 2019, 'Drama, Music', 'Atsushi Hirai, Makoto Nagahisa, Yuki Maeshima', 'Makoto Nagahisa', 'Keita Ninomiya, Satoshi Mizuno, Mondo Okumura, Sena Nakajima, Kuranosuke Sasaki, Youki Kudoh, Sosuke Ikematsu, Eriko Hatsune', 'NR', 'Their parents are dead. They should be sad, but they can''t cry. So they form a kick-ass band. This is the story of four 13-year-olds in search of their emotions.', 'Their parents are dead. They should be sad, but they can''t cry. So they form a kick-ass band. This is the story of four 13-year-olds in search of their emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdeVGrB2hc7wg4F36oG1CBQt2hU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565357'),
  ('162723609135689335', 'We Are Mari Pepa', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Samuel Kishi', 'Samuel Kishi, Sofía Gómez Córdova', 'Alejandro Gallardo, Arnold Ramírez, Rafael Andrade Muñoz, Moisés Galindo, Jaime Miranda, Petra Iñiguez, Eduardo Covarrubias', null, 'The story of Alex, a 16 year old teenager living with his grandma.He has various plans for the summer: writing a new song with his rock band, finding a job and having his first sexual experience. He also becomes aware that his grandma is increasingly dependent on him. As summer draws on, Alex realizes that things are going to change forever and that he will have to grow up and learn to say goodbye.', 'The story of Alex, a 16 year old teenager living with his grandma.He has various plans for the summer: writing a new song with his rock band, finding a job and having his first sexual experience. He also becomes aware that his grandma is increasingly dependent on him. As summer draws on, Alex realizes that things are going to change forever and that he will have to grow up and learn to say goodbye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oonUq9qk61eoC5YmjVndZXi4gd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217364'),
  ('10630493223066773', 'We Are Marshall', 2006, 'Drama, History', 'Shane Hurlbut, McG', 'Cory Helms', 'Matthew McConaughey, Matthew Fox, Anthony Mackie, David Strathairn, Ian McShane, Kate Mara, January Jones, Kate Kneeland', 'PG', 'When a plane crash claims the lives of members of the Marshall University football team and some of its fans, the team''s new coach and his surviving players try to keep the football program alive.', 'When a plane crash claims the lives of members of the Marshall University football team and some of its fans, the team''s new coach and his surviving players try to keep the football program alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5PSiExbg6Fm8MiPJOikBCOcZFnd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11170'),
  ('751122665698376723', 'We Are Next of Kin', 2022, 'Drama', 'Julian Krubasik, Hans-Christian Schmid', 'Michael Gutmann, Hans-Christian Schmid', 'Claude Heinrich, Adina Vetter, Theresa Berlage, Yorck Dippe, Hans Löw, Enno Trebs, Justus von Dohnányi, Ingmar Grapenbrade', null, 'On March 25, 1996, the publicist Jan Philipp Reemtsma is kidnapped. His son Johann and his wife Ann Kathrin witness how their home is transformed overnight into a police control center. Two police officers, the family’s lawyer and a close friend form a community of fate, united by their common goal of bringing Johann’s father home as quickly and unharmed as possible.', 'On March 25, 1996, the publicist Jan Philipp Reemtsma is kidnapped. His son Johann and his wife Ann Kathrin witness how their home is transformed overnight into a police control center. Two police officers, the family’s lawyer and a close friend form a community of fate, united by their common goal of bringing Johann’s father home as quickly and unharmed as possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubjz3ekcweQY41HkP4WgJXSZt9V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:915983'),
  ('1113465087036276220', 'We Are Not Alone', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Daniel Rodríguez Risco, Julián Estrada', 'Daniel Rodríguez Risco, Gonzalo Rodríguez Risco', 'Fiorella Díaz, Marco Zunino, Zoe Arévalo, Lucho Cáceres', null, 'A family, Mateo, Monica and eight year old Sofia, move into a house on the outskirts of Lima. From the first night, the girl is haunted by a terrifying being. These harassments become every time more violent and disturbing, and soon enough will require the presence of a priest, who will try to help without imagining the consequences.', 'A family, Mateo, Monica and eight year old Sofia, move into a house on the outskirts of Lima. From the first night, the girl is haunted by a terrifying being. These harassments become every time more violent and disturbing, and soon enough will require the presence of a priest, who will try to help without imagining the consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzQPQH7s0LZbSNluMnzFVTfezSu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408268'),
  ('1028405750287202262', 'We Are Not Angels', 1992, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Srđan Dragojević', 'Srđan Dragojević', 'Nikola Kojo, Milena Pavlović Čučilović, Branka Katić, Srđan ''Žika'' Todorović, Uroš Đurić, Sonja Savić, Zoran Cvijanović, Predrag Laković', null, 'Angel and the devil fight for the soul of a Belgrade playboy who made a young girl pregnant.', 'Angel and the devil fight for the soul of a Belgrade playboy who made a young girl pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptm7a3VNssm99wKbcx3vuo8oKZf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33604'),
  ('1090217774246681778', 'We Are Not Angels 2', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Srđan Dragojević, Dušan Joksimović', 'Srđan Dragojević', 'Nikola Kojo, Mirka Vasiljević, Uroš Đurić, Srđan ''Žika'' Todorović, Milena Pavlović Čučilović, Vesna Trivalić, Zoran Cvijanović, Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović', null, 'In this sequel of "We Are Not Angels", a highly successful Yugoslavian comedy, a former playboy must cope with his daughter''s adolescence, as well as numerous boys that keep knocking at her doors. A worried father thinks she may get in type of troubles he used to cause when he was just the age of her wooers.', 'In this sequel of "We Are Not Angels", a highly successful Yugoslavian comedy, a former playboy must cope with his daughter''s adolescence, as well as numerous boys that keep knocking at her doors. A worried father thinks she may get in type of troubles he used to cause when he was just the age of her wooers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVrubShARhIdW3bzKM4HpfUjyWF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33606'),
  ('995769599851662684', 'We Are Nothing', 2021, 'Documentary, Music', 'Javier Corcuera', null, 'Evaristo Paramos', null, 'La Polla Records, one of the most legendary punk bands, returns to bid its farewell. To celebrate the group''s last tour, its singer, Evaristo Páramos, revives 40 years of history from his town in the Basque Country. This is the extraordinary tale of villagers who revolutionised incensed music with songs turned into hymns by their thousands of followers.', 'La Polla Records, one of the most legendary punk bands, returns to bid its farewell. To celebrate the group''s last tour, its singer, Evaristo Páramos, revives 40 years of history from his town in the Basque Country. This is the extraordinary tale of villagers who revolutionised incensed music with songs turned into hymns by their thousands of followers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDFT3YwY2lfxrjfL7UOO6CEWvE7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874043'),
  ('395638965746491038', 'We Are Pregnant', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Juana Macías, Guillermo Sempere', 'Juan Moreno, Juana Macías, Anna R. Costa', 'Alexandra Jiménez, Paco León, Elisa Mouliaá, Karra Elejalde, Ingrid García Jonsson, Ernesto Sevilla, Eva Ugarte, Iñaki Font', null, 'It seems simple: an egg + sperm = one embryo. But if your sperm is "few, vague and abnormal" and your woman is premenopausal at age 37, things start to get complicated.', 'It seems simple: an egg + sperm = one embryo. But if your sperm is "few, vague and abnormal" and your woman is premenopausal at age 37, things start to get complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtd8RHsn2I1zhZUhZwzE3EssVn4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336435'),
  ('525828172499005813', 'We Are Still Here', 2015, 'Horror', 'Ted Geoghegan, Karim Hussain', 'Ted Geoghegan', 'Barbara Crampton, Andrew Sensenig, Lisa Marie, Larry Fessenden, Monte Markham, Susan Gibney, Michael Patrick Nicholson, Kelsea Dakota', 'NR', 'After the death of their college age son, Anne and Paul Sacchetti relocate to the snowswept New England hamlet of Aylesbury, a sleepy village where all is most certainly not as it seems. When strange sounds and eerie feelings convince Anne that her son''s spirit is still with them, they invite an eccentric, New Age couple to help them get to the bottom of the mystery.', 'After the death of their college age son, Anne and Paul Sacchetti relocate to the snowswept New England hamlet of Aylesbury, a sleepy village where all is most certainly not as it seems. When strange sounds and eerie feelings convince Anne that her son''s spirit is still with them, they invite an eccentric, New Age couple to help them get to the bottom of the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8Btwn93gNycI1tFo29Gy1zB5kv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291272'),
  ('1082665345248238191', 'We Are the Best!', 2013, 'Drama, Music', 'Lukas Moodysson, Ulf Brantås, Fanni Metelius', 'Lukas Moodysson', 'Mira Barkhammar, Mira Grosin, Liv LeMoyne, David Dencik, Johan Liljemark, Mattias Wiberg, Jonathan Salomonsson, Alvin Strollo', null, 'Three girls in 1980s Stockholm decide to form a punk band—despite not having any instruments, and being told by everyone that punk is dead.', 'Three girls in 1980s Stockholm decide to form a punk band—despite not having any instruments, and being told by everyone that punk is dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KzhURCHxpVtpMk4oMerB4vn48b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191294'),
  ('747588328946067948', 'We Are the Bus People', 1979, 'Drama', 'Mohsen Nasr, Hussein Kamal', 'Galal El Hamamsy, Farouk Sabry', 'Adel Emam, Abdel Moneim Madbouly, Younes Shalaby, Moshira Ismail, Aqeila Rateb, Saeed Abdel Ghani, Esaad Younes, Gamal Ismail', null, 'Adel Imam and neighbour Abdel Moneim Madbouly are taken to a Police station after an altercation with a bus conductor. They are mistakenly arrested with a group of suspected terrorists and taken to a maximum security jail.', 'Adel Imam and neighbour Abdel Moneim Madbouly are taken to a Police station after an altercation with a bus conductor. They are mistakenly arrested with a group of suspected terrorists and taken to a maximum security jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1oPJ0rY7olDE92t6rEHSd2LWLNJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86601'),
  ('181753402896258667', 'We Are the Flesh', 2016, 'Drama, Horror, Fantasy', 'Emiliano Rocha Minter, Yollótl Alvarado, Nadia Ayala Tabachnik', 'Emiliano Rocha Minter', 'María Evoli, Noé Hernández, María Cid, Diego Gamaliel, Gabino Rodríguez, Jonathan Miralda, Andrés Villalobos, Claudette Maillé', null, 'After wandering a ruined city for years in search of food and shelter, two siblings find their way into one of the last remaining buildings. Inside, they find a man who will make them a dangerous offer to survive the outside world.', 'After wandering a ruined city for years in search of food and shelter, two siblings find their way into one of the last remaining buildings. Inside, they find a man who will make them a dangerous offer to survive the outside world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4vLIUysOqY16XPiaZ1W9oeXBc1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378485'),
  ('617190777894619180', 'We Are the Heat', 2018, 'Drama', 'Jorge Navas', 'Diego Vivanco, Steven Grisales', 'Duván Arizala, Heidy Carolina Mina, Rosa Esther Mosquera Aramburo, Miguel Ángel Banguela, Yeison Chaverra, Ariel Nuñez Di Croce', null, 'In the crime filled city of Buenaventura, Colombia, a group of friends prepares for a dance competition that might change their lives forever. In this rough world, talent might be your only way out.', 'In the crime filled city of Buenaventura, Colombia, a group of friends prepares for a dance competition that might change their lives forever. In this rough world, talent might be your only way out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXSOfF7qmRyuEjGAalJLN8XmRWO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548756'),
  ('316242110901208173', 'We Are the Lambeth Boys', 1959, 'Documentary', 'Walter Lassally, Karel Reisz', null, 'Jon Rollason', null, 'Seminal piece of documentary filmmaking by New Wave director Karel Reisz following the daily activities of members of the Lambeth Youth club in late-1950s London.', 'Seminal piece of documentary filmmaking by New Wave director Karel Reisz following the daily activities of members of the Lambeth Youth club in late-1950s London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cqsvNSA0V8rFOtXEYqPYSC30HZb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117484'),
  ('935479841610948533', 'We Are the Night', 2010, 'Fantasy, Drama, Horror, Romance', 'Dennis Gansel, Torsten Breuer', 'Jan Berger, Dennis Gansel', 'Karoline Herfurth, Nina Hoss, Jennifer Ulrich, Anna Fischer, Max Riemelt, Arved Birnbaum, Steffi Kühnert, Jochen Nickel', 'NR', 'One night, 18 year old Lena is bitten by Louise, leader of a female vampire trio that are as deadly as they are beautiful. Her newfound vampiric lifestyle is a blessing and a curse at the same time. At first, she enjoys the limitless freedom, the luxury, the parties. But soon the murderous blood lust of her comrades in arms proves too much for her, and she falls dangerously in love with Tom, a young undercover cop.', 'One night, 18 year old Lena is bitten by Louise, leader of a female vampire trio that are as deadly as they are beautiful. Her newfound vampiric lifestyle is a blessing and a curse at the same time. At first, she enjoys the limitless freedom, the luxury, the parties. But soon the murderous blood lust of her comrades in arms proves too much for her, and she falls dangerously in love with Tom, a young undercover cop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNESCcM2PbynPPdzlEPUUHMaxqI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52587'),
  ('1038274355557112847', 'We Are The Tide', 2016, 'Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Sebastian Hilger, Simon Vu', 'Nadine Gottmann', 'Max Mauff, Lana Cooper, Gro Swantje Kohlhof, Roland Koch, Max Herbrechter, Waldemar Hooge, Michael Epp, Ulrike Hübschmann', null, '15 years ago the sea at the coast of Windholm just vanished. Now two young physicists try to find out, why it happened...', '15 years ago the sea at the coast of Windholm just vanished. Now two young physicists try to find out, why it happened...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uc5QvoS1I4ZoBCRcZMS16wibxAq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381449'),
  ('324141997691682874', 'We Are the World: The Story Behind the Song', 1985, 'Music, Documentary', 'Tom Trbovich', 'Mikal Gilmore', 'Jane Fonda, Quincy Jones, Bob Dylan, Lionel Richie, Dan Aykroyd, Bruce Springsteen, Michael Jackson, Stevie Wonder', null, 'We Are the World: The Story Behind the Song is a documentary which examines how the song was written, how producer Quincy Jones and songwriters Michael Jackson and Lionel Richie persuaded some of the most popular performers in America to donate their services to the project, and offers a behind-the-scenes look at the marathon recording session that produced the single.', 'We Are the World: The Story Behind the Song is a documentary which examines how the song was written, how producer Quincy Jones and songwriters Michael Jackson and Lionel Richie persuaded some of the most popular performers in America to donate their services to the project, and offers a behind-the-scenes look at the marathon recording session that produced the single.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqPXZGpDoeR8tdoqmhGSJSN2TYv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359120'),
  ('1024968329348706056', 'We Are Thr3e', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marcelo Briem Stamm', 'Marcelo Briem Stamm', 'Juan Manuel Martino, Charly Etchévers, Flor Dragonetti', null, 'Nacho is an accountant, an average guy. At a party he meets Ana, a recently divorced young woman. Then they meet the charismatic bartender Sebastian, who starts flirting with both of them and they accept his invitation to spend the night at his place. A few days later, they decide to go on a weekend trip to a secluded farm. It seems like it will be a fun one-night-stand, until Sebastian confesses that he desires a long-term relationship with a man and a woman together. Sweet love story for those who believe in (unconventional) romance.', 'Nacho is an accountant, an average guy. At a party he meets Ana, a recently divorced young woman. Then they meet the charismatic bartender Sebastian, who starts flirting with both of them and they accept his invitation to spend the night at his place. A few days later, they decide to go on a weekend trip to a secluded farm. It seems like it will be a fun one-night-stand, until Sebastian confesses that he desires a long-term relationship with a man and a woman together. Sweet love story for those who believe in (unconventional) romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTJeJ4MD9IZyFizMpzFKbVIm64a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511365'),
  ('554222451039551407', 'We Are Twisted Fucking Sister!', 2016, 'Music, Documentary', 'Andrew Horn, Mark Daniels', 'Andrew Horn', 'Dee Snider, Jay Jay French, Eddie ''Fingers'' Ojeda, Mark Mendoza, A.J. Pero', 'NR', 'In 1984, American heavy metal band Twisted Sister became a global sensation. For 30 years, they been synonymous with hairspray, women''s clothing and tasteless album covers. Until now. Ten years ago, director Andrew Horn was granted access to the archives of Twisted Sister founder Jay French and he explores the decade that preceded their breakthrough.', 'In 1984, American heavy metal band Twisted Sister became a global sensation. For 30 years, they been synonymous with hairspray, women''s clothing and tasteless album covers. Until now. Ten years ago, director Andrew Horn was granted access to the archives of Twisted Sister founder Jay French and he explores the decade that preceded their breakthrough.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRGTIjrb1vbvkWGocq4beKcdvzY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324421'),
  ('883878471205412395', 'We Are What We Are', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jorge Michel Grau, Santiago Sánchez, Erik Baeza', 'Jorge Michel Grau', 'Paulina Gaitán, Francisco Barreiro, Alan Chávez, Carmen Beato, Adrián Aguirre, Miriam Balderas, Jorge Zárate, Esteban Soberanes', null, 'After the death of a patriarch, a family must try to continue on with a disturbing, ritualistic tradition.', 'After the death of a patriarch, a family must try to continue on with a disturbing, ritualistic tradition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35M8uaZaNdOYPF8YFEeVfAFCn1e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50272'),
  ('1013341927697082479', 'We Are What We Are', 2013, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Jim Mickle, Ryan Samul, Joseph Ciccarella', 'Nick Damici, Jim Mickle', 'Bill Sage, Ambyr Childers, Julia Garner, Michael Parks, Wyatt Russell, Kelly McGillis, Nick Damici, Jack Gore', 'R', 'The Parkers, reclusive people who cling to ancient customs, find their secret lives threatened when a torrential downpour and the death of the family matriarch forces daughters Iris and Rose to assume special responsibilities.', 'The Parkers, reclusive people who cling to ancient customs, find their secret lives threatened when a torrential downpour and the death of the family matriarch forces daughters Iris and Rose to assume special responsibilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Q0rtUfNHFOEnVoRv1pmKaAbZEV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159128'),
  ('1109210535619544262', 'We Are Young. We Are Strong.', 2014, 'Drama', 'Burhan Qurbani, Yoshi Heimrath', 'Burhan Qurbani, Martin Behnke', 'Devid Striesow, Jonas Nay, Trang Le Hong, Joel Basman, Saskia Rosendahl, Thorsten Merten, Paul Gäbler, David Schütter', null, 'On 24th August 1992 in the eastern German city of Rostock, a rampaging mob, to the applause and cheering of more than 3,000 bystanders, besieged and set fire to a residential building containing, among others, more than 120 Vietnamese men, women, and children on what has since become known as "The Night of the Fire." The riots became a symbol of xenophobia in the just-reunited Germany. This film recounts the incident from the perspectives of three very different characters.', 'On 24th August 1992 in the eastern German city of Rostock, a rampaging mob, to the applause and cheering of more than 3,000 bystanders, besieged and set fire to a residential building containing, among others, more than 120 Vietnamese men, women, and children on what has since become known as "The Night of the Fire." The riots became a symbol of xenophobia in the just-reunited Germany. This film recounts the incident from the perspectives of three very different characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4x4AZaukJLCkHiY8p9UXyjNiH2U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302376'),
  ('244909681446377574', 'We Are Your Friends', 2015, 'Drama, Music, Romance, Comedy', 'Max Joseph, Brett Pawlak', 'Max Joseph, Meaghan Oppenheimer', 'Zac Efron, Wes Bentley, Emily Ratajkowski, Jonny Weston, Shiloh Fernandez, Alex Shaffer, Jon Bernthal, Alicia Coppola', 'R', 'Young Cole Carter dreams of hitting the big time as a Hollywood disc jockey, spending his days and nights hanging with buddies and working on the one track that will set the world on fire. Opportunity comes knocking when he meets James Reed, a charismatic DJ who takes the 23-year-old under his wing. Soon, his seemingly clear path to success gets complicated when he starts falling for his mentor''s girlfriend, jeopardizing his new friendship and the future he seems destined to fulfill.', 'Young Cole Carter dreams of hitting the big time as a Hollywood disc jockey, spending his days and nights hanging with buddies and working on the one track that will set the world on fire. Opportunity comes knocking when he meets James Reed, a charismatic DJ who takes the 23-year-old under his wing. Soon, his seemingly clear path to success gets complicated when he starts falling for his mentor''s girlfriend, jeopardizing his new friendship and the future he seems destined to fulfill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RzpN4aLjM5FUc7Q3WsvNn2MuaR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301351'),
  ('38175591844521555', 'We Are Zombies', 2024, 'Horror, Comedy, Thriller', 'François Simard, Anouk Whissell, Yoann-Karl Whissell', 'Yoann-Karl Whissell, François Simard, Anouk Whissell', 'Alexandre Nachi, Derek Johns, Megan Peta Hill, Vincent Leclerc, Benz Antoine, Carlo Mestroni, Guy Nadon, Patrick Abellard', null, 'In a city infested with the LIVING-IMPAIRED aka non-cannibal zombies - three slackers after easy money must fight small-time crooks and an evil megacorporation to save their kidnapped grandma.', 'In a city infested with the LIVING-IMPAIRED aka non-cannibal zombies - three slackers after easy money must fight small-time crooks and an evil megacorporation to save their kidnapped grandma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nU5ZeQpy32xbwtxHua1ZkT5QquZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1139106'),
  ('1063288164958987975', 'We Bare Bears: The Movie', 2020, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Daniel Chong', 'Louie Zong, Daniel Chong, Christina Chang', 'Eric Edelstein, Bobby Moynihan, Demetri Martin, Marc Evan Jackson, Jason Lee, Patton Oswalt, Lo Mutuc, Ellie Kemper', 'G', 'When Grizz, Panda, and Ice Bear''s love of food trucks and viral videos get out of hand, the brothers are now chased away from their home and embark on a trip to Canada, where they can live in peace.', 'When Grizz, Panda, and Ice Bear''s love of food trucks and viral videos get out of hand, the brothers are now chased away from their home and embark on a trip to Canada, where they can live in peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khtIr0Gxtz52T10RRQZ42o1a5Ry.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:677638'),
  ('104549902522611694', 'We Believe You', 2025, 'Drama', 'Arnaud Dufeys, Charlotte Devillers', 'Arnaud Dufeys, Charlotte Devillers', 'Myriem Akheddiou, Laurent Capelluto, Natali Broods, Ulysse Goffin, Adèle Pinckaers, Alisa Laub, Marion de Nanteuil, Mounir Bennaoum', null, 'Today, Alice stands before a judge, knowing there is no room for error. She must speak up for her children, as her custody is being called into question. Can she protect them from their father before it is too late?', 'Today, Alice stands before a judge, knowing there is no room for error. She must speak up for her children, as her custody is being called into question. Can she protect them from their father before it is too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBYQhsh65AZqEfPiDy3Z7AGbsw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1091196'),
  ('646323480215858266', 'We Believed', 2010, 'History, Drama', 'Roberto Abbado, Renato Berta, Mario Martone', 'Mario Martone', 'Luigi Lo Cascio, Valerio Binasco, Francesca Inaudi, Andrea Bosca, Edoardo Natoli, Luigi Pisani, Guido Caprino, Renato Carpentieri', null, '1828. After witnessing the brutal repression of revolutions in monarchist South, three young friends join Giuseppe Mazzini''s patriotic cause, seeking to finally unify Italy under a republican government. Their idealism will clash with the inevitable disillusionment as they grow apart over the following decades.', '1828. After witnessing the brutal repression of revolutions in monarchist South, three young friends join Giuseppe Mazzini''s patriotic cause, seeking to finally unify Italy under a republican government. Their idealism will clash with the inevitable disillusionment as they grow apart over the following decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukvpvdEYtJwbSshUGLpQMsV15zP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56853'),
  ('252458549986982085', 'We Blew It', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Baptiste Thoret', 'Jean-Baptiste Thoret', 'Ronee Blakley, Peter Bogdanovich, Charles Burnett, Tobe Hooper, Peter Hyams, Stanton Kaye, Jeff Lieberman, Michael Mann', null, 'How did America change from Easy Rider into Donald Trump? What became of the dreams and utopias of the 1960''s and 1970''s? What do the people who lived in that golden age think about it today? Did they really blow it? Shot in Cinemascope - from New Jersey to California - this melancholic and elegiac road-movie draws upon the portrait of a confused, complex and incandescent America one year after the start of the electoral campaign. That golden age has become its last romantic border and an inconsolable America is about to pull on a trigger called Trump.', 'How did America change from Easy Rider into Donald Trump? What became of the dreams and utopias of the 1960''s and 1970''s? What do the people who lived in that golden age think about it today? Did they really blow it? Shot in Cinemascope - from New Jersey to California - this melancholic and elegiac road-movie draws upon the portrait of a confused, complex and incandescent America one year after the start of the electoral campaign. That golden age has become its last romantic border and an inconsolable America is about to pull on a trigger called Trump.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEydnP3y6eiyELkxomAfvFC7Eeu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475246'),
  ('835023089640353366', 'We Bought a Zoo', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Rodrigo Prieto, Aldric La''Auli Porter, John Nasraway', 'Cameron Crowe, Aline Brosh McKenna', 'Matt Damon, Scarlett Johansson, Thomas Haden Church, Colin Ford, Maggie Elizabeth Jones, Angus Macfadyen, Elle Fanning, Patrick Fugit', 'PG', 'Benjamin has lost his wife and, in a bid to start his life over, purchases a large house that has a zoo – welcome news for his daughter, but his son is not happy about it. The zoo is in need of renovation and Benjamin sets about the work with the head keeper and the rest of the staff, but, the zoo soon runs into financial trouble.', 'Benjamin has lost his wife and, in a bid to start his life over, purchases a large house that has a zoo – welcome news for his daughter, but his son is not happy about it. The zoo is in need of renovation and Benjamin sets about the work with the head keeper and the rest of the staff, but, the zoo soon runs into financial trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dcOvIqdsojUdAtWt1nPT9xS76Su.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74465'),
  ('507125760517025673', 'We Broke Up', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Andrew Aiello, Jeff Rosenberg', 'Laura Jacqmin, Jeff Rosenberg', 'Aya Cash, William Jackson Harper, Sarah Bolger, Tony Cavalero, Peri Gilpin, Kobi Libii, Azita Ghanizada, Zak Steiner', null, 'Lori and Doug break up right before Lori''s sister''s wedding and decide to pretend they''re still together for the weekend as to not disrupt the fun.', 'Lori and Doug break up right before Lori''s sister''s wedding and decide to pretend they''re still together for the weekend as to not disrupt the fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPeSznx1YJkjKwd3B5yqRlxq0xD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680319'),
  ('1009218000799867976', 'We Bury the Dead', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Zak Hilditch, Mark Boskell, Sean Roe Curran', 'Zak Hilditch', 'Daisy Ridley, Brenton Thwaites, Mark Coles Smith, Matt Whelan, Chloe Hurst, Kym Jackson, Holly Hargreaves, Deanna Cooney', 'R', 'After a catastrophic military disaster, the dead don''t just rise - they hunt. Ava searches for her missing husband, but what she finds is far more terrifying.', 'After a catastrophic military disaster, the dead don''t just rise - they hunt. Ava searches for her missing husband, but what she finds is far more terrifying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZqo0yPARmyF8TACVNyaOACkYWG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1198984'),
  ('381556000340859132', 'We Can Be Heroes', 2020, 'Family, Action, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Robert Rodriguez, Robert Rodriguez, Michelle Wade Byrd', 'Robert Rodriguez', 'YaYa Gosselin, Lyon Daniels, Andy Walken, Hala Finley, Lotus Blossom, Dylan Henry Lau, Andrew Díaz, Isaiah Russell-Bailey', 'PG', 'When alien invaders capture Earth''s superheroes, their kids must learn to work together to save their parents - and the planet.', 'When alien invaders capture Earth''s superheroes, their kids must learn to work together to save their parents - and the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1S21HpcKY6uQ9UAw68aICmrJaq6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615677'),
  ('912643758071464726', 'We Can Do That', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Giulio Manfredonia, Mirta Guarnaschelli, Roberto Forza', 'Giulio Manfredonia, Fabio Bonifacci', 'Claudio Bisio, Anita Caprioli, Andrea Bosca, Giovanni Calcagno, Michele De Virgilio, Carlo Giuseppe Gabardini, Andrea Gattinoni, Natascia Macchniz', null, 'The film follows Nello, the recently hired director of a newly developed work cooperative of former mental patients. After the closure of state psychiatric hospitals and asylums in Italy under the Basaglia Law many former patients were left with few resources and little hope of reintegrating into society. With the intention of actually improving the lives of his pupils, rather than just sedating them, Nello encourages them to expand their individual abilities and explore the wider world around them although, regardless of intention, there is sometimes a price to pushing boundaries too quickly.', 'The film follows Nello, the recently hired director of a newly developed work cooperative of former mental patients. After the closure of state psychiatric hospitals and asylums in Italy under the Basaglia Law many former patients were left with few resources and little hope of reintegrating into society. With the intention of actually improving the lives of his pupils, rather than just sedating them, Nello encourages them to expand their individual abilities and explore the wider world around them although, regardless of intention, there is sometimes a price to pushing boundaries too quickly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRgjbl788t9w2DnhFCX8NSy73gM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23619'),
  ('621263831604719172', 'We Can''t Go Home Again', 1973, 'Drama', 'Nicholas Ray, Richard Bock', 'Nicholas Ray, Susan Ray, Tom Farrell', 'Nicholas Ray, Richard Bock, Tom Farrell, Danny Fisher, Jill Gannon, Jane Heymann, Leslie Levinson, Stanley Liu', null, 'Nicholas Ray plays himself, acting as mentor, friend, and artistic inspiration to his students at Binghamton. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation.', 'Nicholas Ray plays himself, acting as mentor, friend, and artistic inspiration to his students at Binghamton. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ftkI5LkdoNXNC4er5e44AvZmz0i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94438'),
  ('287037442712082485', 'We Can''t Live Without Cosmos', 2014, 'Animation, Drama', 'Konstantin Bronzit', 'Konstantin Bronzit', null, null, 'Two cosmonauts, two friends, try to do their best in their everyday training life to make their common dream a reality. But this story is not only about the dream.', 'Two cosmonauts, two friends, try to do their best in their everyday training life to make their common dream a reality. But this story is not only about the dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCjwEDNxYyGnxI8mya7Nstw7bZM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329063'),
  ('676237093412024863', 'We Couldn''t Become Adults', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Akiyoshi Yoshida, Yoshihiro Mori, Hayato Kawai', 'Ryo Takada', 'Mirai Moriyama, Sairi Ito, Masahiro Higashide, Sumire, Atsushi Shinohara, Yuko Oshima, Masato Hagiwara, Takehiro Hira', null, 'Prodded by a friend request, a feckless forty-something recalls his past relationships from the 90s onward, looking for his vanished hopes and dreams.', 'Prodded by a friend request, a feckless forty-something recalls his past relationships from the 90s onward, looking for his vanished hopes and dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3ul9VzWk8Vk5ic7EKujLn8eDeP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785544'),
  ('582190793675256996', 'We Did It on a Song', 2014, 'Documentary', 'David André, David André', 'David André', 'Gaëlle Bridoux, Nicolas Dourdin, Caroline Brimeux', null, 'This film tells the stormy tale of a group of friends from Boulogne-sur-Mer, a French town hit by the financial crisis. A year between dreams and disillusion, imagined by teenagers from a working or middle class background, with songs that regularly add poetry, laughter, and emotion to reality.', 'This film tells the stormy tale of a group of friends from Boulogne-sur-Mer, a French town hit by the financial crisis. A year between dreams and disillusion, imagined by teenagers from a working or middle class background, with songs that regularly add poetry, laughter, and emotion to reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNia5Nqoqxa24libA93hxecsyuP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295089'),
  ('239230925781936896', 'We Die Young', 2019, 'Drama, Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Orlin Ruevski, Ivan Vatsov, Lior Geller', 'Lior Geller', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, David Castañeda, Joana Metrass, Elijah Rodriguez, Nicholas Sean Johnny, Charlie MacGechan, Dean John-Wilson, Jim Caesar', 'R', 'Lucas, a 14-year-old boy inducted into the gang life in Washington D.C., is determined that his 10-year-old brother won''t follow the same path. When an Afghanistan war veteran comes into the neighborhood, an opportunity arises.', 'Lucas, a 14-year-old boy inducted into the gang life in Washington D.C., is determined that his 10-year-old brother won''t follow the same path. When an Afghanistan war veteran comes into the neighborhood, an opportunity arises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dB0Dl2nDRmvplaJLeHSfkppJXHs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538207'),
  ('282873648064937365', 'We Dive at Dawn', 1943, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Anthony Asquith, Jack E. Cox', 'Val Valentine, J.B. Williams, Frank Launder', 'John Mills, Eric Portman, Louis Bradfield, Ronald Millar, Jack Watling, Reginald Purdell, Caven Watson, Niall MacGinnis', null, 'A gripping tale of WWII naval warfare in the Baltics, starring John Mills as Lt. Freddie Taylor, a British submarine Captain. The crew of the Sea Tiger are summoned from leave on shore with their families, and sent on a secret mission to intercept the Nazi battleship Brandenburg. In the ensuing battle the British submarine is damaged by a German destroyer. The submarine is leaking fuel so badly that the crew won''t be able to make it back to Britain before running out somewhere along the Danish coast. When it seems that their only option may be to blow up the submarine and try to escape to Denmark, seaman James Hobson hatches a plan...', 'A gripping tale of WWII naval warfare in the Baltics, starring John Mills as Lt. Freddie Taylor, a British submarine Captain. The crew of the Sea Tiger are summoned from leave on shore with their families, and sent on a secret mission to intercept the Nazi battleship Brandenburg. In the ensuing battle the British submarine is damaged by a German destroyer. The submarine is leaking fuel so badly that the crew won''t be able to make it back to Britain before running out somewhere along the Danish coast. When it seems that their only option may be to blow up the submarine and try to escape to Denmark, seaman James Hobson hatches a plan...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tz2t5d2auUAqkXnGC0AkYyxUn0A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43519'),
  ('23254244786661365', 'We Don''t Live Here Anymore', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Curran, Robert Lee, Jennifer Kidd', 'Larry Gross, Andre Dubus', 'Mark Ruffalo, Laura Dern, Peter Krause, Naomi Watts, Sam Charles, Ginger Page, Jennifer Mawhinney, Jennifer Bishop', 'R', 'Married couple Jack and Terry Linden are experiencing a difficult period in their relationship. When Jack decides to step outside the marriage, he becomes involved with Edith, who happens to be the wife of his best friend and colleague, Hank Evans. Learning of their partners'' infidelity, Terry and Hank engage in their own extramarital affair together. Now, both marriages and friendships are on the brink of collapse.', 'Married couple Jack and Terry Linden are experiencing a difficult period in their relationship. When Jack decides to step outside the marriage, he becomes involved with Edith, who happens to be the wife of his best friend and colleague, Hank Evans. Learning of their partners'' infidelity, Terry and Hank engage in their own extramarital affair together. Now, both marriages and friendships are on the brink of collapse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBxDYB5nVssDh5VF0YDXHvpsBMF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23601'),
  ('227873721332148769', 'We Faw Down', 1928, 'Comedy', 'Leo McCarey, Scott, George Stevens', null, 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Vivien Oakland, Bess Flowers, Kay Deslys, Vera White, Allan Cavan, George Kotsonaros', null, 'Stan & Ollie attempt to fool their wives by sneaking out to a poker game, but instead get involved with two flirty ladies, one of whom is the girlfriend of a jealous boxer.', 'Stan & Ollie attempt to fool their wives by sneaking out to a poker game, but instead get involved with two flirty ladies, one of whom is the girlfriend of a jealous boxer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLj3ohqWK8JdydbrdaK24awnKZV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50918'),
  ('963635864253956633', 'We Feed People', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Ron Howard, Kris Kaczor', null, 'Carlota Andrés, Inés Andrés, José Andrés Puerta, Joe Biden, Sam Bloch, Bill Clinton, Patricia Fernandez de la Cruz, Robert Egger', null, 'We Feed People spotlights renowned chef José Andrés and his nonprofit World Central Kitchen’s incredible mission and evolution over 12 years from being a scrappy group of grassroots volunteers to becoming one of the most highly regarded humanitarian aid organizations in the disaster relief sector.', 'We Feed People spotlights renowned chef José Andrés and his nonprofit World Central Kitchen’s incredible mission and evolution over 12 years from being a scrappy group of grassroots volunteers to becoming one of the most highly regarded humanitarian aid organizations in the disaster relief sector.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okRUpZjZf7tlpXzLyyIU284RS4U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934660'),
  ('634433502487316474', 'We Feed the World', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Erwin Wagenhofer, Erwin Wagenhofer', null, 'Jean Ziegler, Peter Brabeck, Karl Otrok', null, 'A documentary that exposes the shocking truths behind industrial food production and food wastage, focusing on fishing, livestock and crop farming. A must-see for anyone interested in the true cost of the food on their plate.', 'A documentary that exposes the shocking truths behind industrial food production and food wastage, focusing on fishing, livestock and crop farming. A must-see for anyone interested in the true cost of the food on their plate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buVa28Mh962tUKetAwnbpadkKMm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11214'),
  ('937900528174104103', 'We Girls', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Feng Xiaogang, Florian Zinke, Jiang Wu', 'Feng Xiaogang, Longlong Xia', 'Zhao Liying, Lan Xiya, Chuai Ni, Wang Ju, Cheng Xiao, Wang Xiaoyu, Qian Yi, Li Huijun', null, 'Black Girl is a deaf-mute prisoner. Prison guard Deng Hong found White Fox, a prisoner who understands sign language, to supervise her transformation. The two made money together after serving their sentences, met Deng outside the prison.', 'Black Girl is a deaf-mute prisoner. Prison guard Deng Hong found White Fox, a prisoner who understands sign language, to supervise her transformation. The two made money together after serving their sentences, met Deng outside the prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEwqo3MUkvs16LCyIuBNnBvLWqm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1319738'),
  ('302598603389885902', 'We Give Pink Stamps', 1965, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Friz Freleng, Hawley Pratt', null, null, null, 'The Pink Panther hides himself inside Gamble''s Department Store after closing time. Once the janitor arrives he decides to have a little fun.', 'The Pink Panther hides himself inside Gamble''s Department Store after closing time. Once the janitor arrives he decides to have a little fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nerEmIe33wUuZWBymWKvBXxpfr2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251727'),
  ('26762847880200582', 'We Go In at Dawn', 2020, 'History, War, Thriller', 'Ben Mole, Pete Allibone, Toby Kearton', 'Ben Mole', 'Kelvin Fletcher, Christos Lawton, Audrey L''Ebrellec, Samantha Coughlan, Ryan Winsley, Tim Berrington, Guy Faulkner, Antonio Bustorff', null, 'When a high-ranking war planner is captured and held in a German prisoner of war camp, a team of specialists take on the dangerous mission of trying to break him out. Trouble is, he doesn''t want to be rescued.', 'When a high-ranking war planner is captured and held in a German prisoner of war camp, a team of specialists take on the dangerous mission of trying to break him out. Trouble is, he doesn''t want to be rescued.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQqLA58PeF0ofPzq36lNUFRSzCa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:683556'),
  ('753587962289479435', 'We Go On', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Andy Mitton, Jesse Holland', 'Jesse Holland, Andy Mitton', 'Clark Freeman, Jay Dunn, John Glover, Laura Heisler, Annette O''Toole, Giovanna Zacarías, David Bickford, Cassidy Freeman', null, 'Paralyzed by his fear of dying, Miles Grissom takes out an advert offering $30,000 in reward money to the first person who can show him evidence of an angel, a demon, or prove that ghosts exist - anything to prove to him that we go on after our deaths. He narrows the responses down to three viable candidates - a scientist, a medium, and a worldly entrepreneur. Along with his protective mother, he embarks on an adventure through Los Angeles that will spiral into an unthinkable nightmare.', 'Paralyzed by his fear of dying, Miles Grissom takes out an advert offering $30,000 in reward money to the first person who can show him evidence of an angel, a demon, or prove that ghosts exist - anything to prove to him that we go on after our deaths. He narrows the responses down to three viable candidates - a scientist, a medium, and a worldly entrepreneur. Along with his protective mother, he embarks on an adventure through Los Angeles that will spiral into an unthinkable nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igBeJLSb6bt1cSqd4ndWnKCdi4w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387399'),
  ('165267167982543992', 'We Grown Now', 2024, 'Drama', 'Minhal Baig, Pat Scola, Daniel Lugo', 'Minhal Baig', 'Blake Cameron James, Gian Knight Ramirez, S. Epatha Merkerson, Avery Holliday, Ora Jones, Lil Rel Howery, Jurnee Smollett, Patrick Dunham', 'PG', 'In 1992 Chicago, a story of two young legends in their own right begins. As wide-eyed and imaginative best friends Malik and Eric traverse the city, looking to escape the mundaneness of school and the hardships of growing up in public housing, their unbreakable bond is challenged when tragedy shakes their community just as they are learning to fly.', 'In 1992 Chicago, a story of two young legends in their own right begins. As wide-eyed and imaginative best friends Malik and Eric traverse the city, looking to escape the mundaneness of school and the hardships of growing up in public housing, their unbreakable bond is challenged when tragedy shakes their community just as they are learning to fly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGYX0LCsL4hcirSChhHAevT09nT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1163186'),
  ('957113913535560685', 'We Have a Ghost', 2023, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Christopher Landon, Marc Spicer, Lisa Vasconcellos', 'Christopher Landon', 'David Harbour, Jahi Di''Allo Winston, Anthony Mackie, Erica Ash, Niles Fitch, Isabella Russo, Tig Notaro, Tom Bower', 'PG-13', 'After Kevin finds a ghost named Ernest haunting his new home, he becomes an overnight social media sensation. But when Kevin and Ernest go rogue to investigate the mystery of the latter''s past, they become targets of the CIA.', 'After Kevin finds a ghost named Ernest haunting his new home, he becomes an overnight social media sensation. But when Kevin and Ernest go rogue to investigate the mystery of the latter''s past, they become targets of the CIA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xo0fgAUoEeVQ7KsKeMWypyglvnf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852096'),
  ('29010233709203188', 'We Have a Pope', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nanni Moretti, Barbara Daniele, Ciro Scognamiglio', 'Francesco Piccolo, Nanni Moretti, Federica Pontremoli', 'Michel Piccoli, Nanni Moretti, Margherita Buy, Jerzy Stuhr, Renato Scarpa, Franco Graziosi, Camillo Milli, Roberto Nobile', null, 'The newly elected Pope suffers a panic attack just as he is about to greet the faithful who have gathered to see him. His advisors, unable to convince him he is the right man for the job, call on a renowned therapist who also happens to be an atheist. But the Pope''s fear of his newfound responsibility is one he must face alone. Winner Best Film at the Italian Golden Globes.', 'The newly elected Pope suffers a panic attack just as he is about to greet the faithful who have gathered to see him. His advisors, unable to convince him he is the right man for the job, call on a renowned therapist who also happens to be an atheist. But the Pope''s fear of his newfound responsibility is one he must face alone. Winner Best Film at the Italian Golden Globes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8C8AncIi7XKq7Sg0SlN58RXpuqd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61667'),
  ('1085670091674617394', 'We Have Always Lived in the Castle', 2019, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Stacie Passon, Piers McGrail, Jonathan Shaw', 'Mark Kruger, Stacie Passon', 'Taissa Farmiga, Alexandra Daddario, Crispin Glover, Sebastian Stan, Paula Malcomson, Peter Coonan, Ian Toner, Joanne Crawford', 'NR', 'In Shirleyville, Vermont, during the sixties, sisters Merricat and Constance, along with their ailing uncle Julian, confined to a wheelchair, live isolated in a big mansion located on the hill overlooking the town, tormented by the memories of a family tragedy occurred six years ago. The arrival of cousin Charles will threaten the fragile equilibrium of their minds, haunted by madness, fear and superstition.', 'In Shirleyville, Vermont, during the sixties, sisters Merricat and Constance, along with their ailing uncle Julian, confined to a wheelchair, live isolated in a big mansion located on the hill overlooking the town, tormented by the memories of a family tragedy occurred six years ago. The arrival of cousin Charles will threaten the fragile equilibrium of their minds, haunted by madness, fear and superstition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejp1MQSlekBjH3bBJrBlWItpmQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411144'),
  ('798747253374593517', 'We Have Only One Life', 1958, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yorgos Tzavellas, Stelios Zografakis', 'Yorgos Tzavellas', 'Dimitris Horn, Yvonne Sanson, Vasilis Avlonitis, Hristos Tsaganeas, Periklis Hristoforidis, Lavrentis Dianellos, Koulis Stoligas, Dionysis Papagiannopoulos', null, 'A bank teller discovers an accounting error, becomes rich and lives his life like he''s never lived it.', 'A bank teller discovers an accounting error, becomes rich and lives his life like he''s never lived it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8Ps8x6soCS3aX3zwTzjB1r4hHO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24258'),
  ('535812942360617087', 'We Live in Public', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Ondi Timoner, Cory Brandon Clay', 'Ondi Timoner', 'Josh Harris, Douglas Rushkoff, Nacho Platas, Jason Calacanis, Cal Chamberlain, Leo Fernekes, Fred Wilson, Joshua White', null, 'In 1999, Internet entrepreneur Josh Harris recruits dozens of young men and women who agree to live in underground apartments for weeks at a time while their every movement is broadcast online. Soon, Harris and his girlfriend embark on their own subterranean adventure, with cameras streaming live footage of their meals, arguments, bedroom activities, and bathroom habits. This documentary explores the role of technology in our lives, as it charts the fragile nature of dot-com economy.', 'In 1999, Internet entrepreneur Josh Harris recruits dozens of young men and women who agree to live in underground apartments for weeks at a time while their every movement is broadcast online. Soon, Harris and his girlfriend embark on their own subterranean adventure, with cameras streaming live footage of their meals, arguments, bedroom activities, and bathroom habits. This documentary explores the role of technology in our lives, as it charts the fragile nature of dot-com economy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGKZn41ckFwyfXeQS7mtfIG8u4G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34015'),
  ('894198709238470694', 'We Live in Time', 2024, 'Romance, Drama', 'John Crowley, Zoe Liang, Stuart Bentley', 'Nick Payne', 'Andrew Garfield, Florence Pugh, Grace Delaney, Lee Braithwaite, Aoife Hinds, Adam James, Douglas Hodge, Amy Morgan', 'R', 'An up-and-coming chef and a recent divorcée find their lives forever changed when a chance encounter brings them together, in a decade-spanning, deeply moving romance.', 'An up-and-coming chef and a recent divorcée find their lives forever changed when a chance encounter brings them together, in a decade-spanning, deeply moving romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeDNBgnlGF6rnyX1P1K8Vl2f3lW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1100099'),
  ('776757464683441903', 'We Love You, You Bastard', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Claude Lelouch, Robert Alazraki', 'Claude Lelouch', 'Johnny Hallyday, Sandrine Bonnaire, Eddy Mitchell, Irène Jacob, Pauline Lefèvre, Sarah Kazemy, Jenna Thiam, Valérie Kaprisky', null, 'A war photographer and absent father, who spends more time taking care of his camera than his four daughters, enjoys a happy life in the Alps with his new girlfriend. But his life is turned upside down the day that his best friend tries to reconcile him with his family by telling them a big lie.', 'A war photographer and absent father, who spends more time taking care of his camera than his four daughters, enjoys a happy life in the Alps with his new girlfriend. But his life is turned upside down the day that his best friend tries to reconcile him with his family by telling them a big lie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65Cg36ylbqSa3bthnyVo5LC7ZgO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262117'),
