  ('1143935563196208183', 'We Might As Well Be Dead', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Natalia Sinelnikova, Jan Mayntz, Karl Schirnhofer', 'Natalia Sinelnikova, Viktor Gallandi', 'Ioana Iacob, Pola Geiger, Knut Berger, Susanne Wuest, Jörg Schüttauf, Şiir Eloğlu, Moritz Jahn, Mina Sagdiç', 'NR', 'The high-rise building block near the forest is famous for its carefully curated community. As a dog disappears and her daughter refuses to leave the bathroom, security officer Anna faces an absurd battle against the fear, that slowly spreads among the residents and shakes the utopia with a view.', 'The high-rise building block near the forest is famous for its carefully curated community. As a dog disappears and her daughter refuses to leave the bathroom, security officer Anna faces an absurd battle against the fear, that slowly spreads among the residents and shakes the utopia with a view.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qk2PGLBwYBXlz3xLcpEKqHFZKx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:818783'),
