  ('1121330658186333375', 'We Need to Talk', 2024, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Alessandro Siani, Tani Canevari, Filippo Orobello', 'Alessandro Siani, Gianluca Bernardini, Leonardo Pieraccioni', 'Alessandro Siani, Leonardo Pieraccioni, Francesca Chillemi, Brenda Lodigiani, Gea Dall''Orto, Tommaso Cassissa, Enrico Lo Verso, Sergio Friscia', null, 'A woman in common, a daughter in half and a patrol car for two. Antonio and Pieraldo share many things: a less-than-brilliant career, a less-than-ideal partnership, a long-term but slightly bruised bond -- two lives apparently too quiet for two police officers that fate has cleverly wanted to intertwine. Danger was definitely not their profession... until, incredibly, they will have to face a real crime, a very intricate and risky case that, between challenges against time and twists, will change their lives forever.', 'A woman in common, a daughter in half and a patrol car for two. Antonio and Pieraldo share many things: a less-than-brilliant career, a less-than-ideal partnership, a long-term but slightly bruised bond -- two lives apparently too quiet for two police officers that fate has cleverly wanted to intertwine. Danger was definitely not their profession... until, incredibly, they will have to face a real crime, a very intricate and risky case that, between challenges against time and twists, will change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kD3IRg28Wqcm9VYpdFYbtZc4Q27.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1273678'),
  ('515795759669108637', 'We Need to Talk About Kevin', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Lynne Ramsay, Seamus McGarvey, Ivan J. Fonseca', 'Rory Stewart Kinnear, Lynne Ramsay', 'Tilda Swinton, John C. Reilly, Ezra Miller, Jasper Newell, Rock Duer, Ashley Gerasimovich, Siobhan Fallon Hogan, Alex Manette', 'R', 'After her son Kevin commits a horrific act, troubled mother Eva reflects on her complicated relationship with her disturbed son as he grew from a toddler into a teenager.', 'After her son Kevin commits a horrific act, troubled mother Eva reflects on her complicated relationship with her disturbed son as he grew from a toddler into a teenager.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/auAmiRmbBQ5QIYGpWgcGBoBQY3b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71859'),
  ('364917288443313778', 'We Need Your Vote', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Jérôme Alméras, Mathieu Sapin', 'Mathieu Sapin, Noé Debré, Mathieu Sapin', 'Alexandra Lamy, Finnegan Oldfield, Gilles Cohen, Valérie Karsenti, Philippe Katerine, Brigitte Roüan, Gaspard Gantzer, Frédéric Neidhardt', null, 'Arnaud, a 25-year-old man, enters the campaign team of a candidate for the French presidential election as assistant to the Director of communication. While discovering the techniques, intricacies and rivalries of the electoral campaign, he will feel fascination for this world, as well as for its attractive director, Agnès.', 'Arnaud, a 25-year-old man, enters the campaign team of a candidate for the French presidential election as assistant to the Director of communication. While discovering the techniques, intricacies and rivalries of the electoral campaign, he will feel fascination for this world, as well as for its attractive director, Agnès.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/juvvBa9oS1OKlEi1CCmNMK7SAOS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:533932'),
  ('30918165965656379', 'We Never Die!', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Róbert Koltai, Gábor Halász', 'Róbert Koltai, Gábor Nógrádi', 'Róbert Koltai, Mihály Szabados, Gábor Máté, Tamás Jordán, Judit Pogány, Kathleen Gati, Andor Lukáts, Péter Blaskó', null, 'In 1960s Hungary, an introverted teenager’s life is turned upside down by a few days in the company of his coat hanger salesman uncle: a roguish charmer with a zest for life and a weakness for horse racing and women.', 'In 1960s Hungary, an introverted teenager’s life is turned upside down by a few days in the company of his coat hanger salesman uncle: a roguish charmer with a zest for life and a weakness for horse racing and women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHIcN3wahEbKh3UxDontGmOKvT9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41075'),
  ('13333038261401612', 'We of the Never Never', 1982, 'Drama, Western', 'Igor Auzins, Gary Hansen', 'Peter Schreck', 'Angela Punch McGregor, Arthur Dignam, Martin Vaughan, Lewis Fitz-Gerald, John Jarratt, Tony Barry, Tom E. Lewis, Donald Blitner', null, 'Based on the well-loved Australian classic by Mrs. Aeneas Gunn, this is the remarkable true story of Jeannie Gunn, a woman who fought to overcome sexual and racial prejudice amid the harsh beauties of the outback. Leaving her Melbourne existence for a new life on her husband''s isolated ranch, Jeannie''s feisty, good-natured attitude soon wins over the misogynistic stockmen, but she faces a much tougher challenge in trying to change their racist attitudes towards the indigenous aboriginal population.', 'Based on the well-loved Australian classic by Mrs. Aeneas Gunn, this is the remarkable true story of Jeannie Gunn, a woman who fought to overcome sexual and racial prejudice amid the harsh beauties of the outback. Leaving her Melbourne existence for a new life on her husband''s isolated ranch, Jeannie''s feisty, good-natured attitude soon wins over the misogynistic stockmen, but she faces a much tougher challenge in trying to change their racist attitudes towards the indigenous aboriginal population.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AfOT4cJQNyOnEblh9t3LSqJEh2l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41125'),
  ('1056334912279063562', 'We Own the Night', 2007, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'James Gray, Joaquín Baca-Asay, Doug Torres', 'James Gray', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Mark Wahlberg, Eva Mendes, Robert Duvall, Alex Veadov, Paul Herman, Antoni Corone, Tony Musante', 'R', 'A New York nightclub manager tries to save his brother and father from Russian mafia hitmen.', 'A New York nightclub manager tries to save his brother and father from Russian mafia hitmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcb2c9BcRc21iiWih23FQfT39uB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2001'),
  ('156208568216206407', 'We Shall Not Be Moved', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pierre Saint Martin Castellanos', 'Pierre Saint Martin Castellanos, Iker Compeán Leroux', 'Luisa Huertas, José Alberto Patiño, Rebeca Manríquez, Pedro Hernández, Agustina Quinci, Juan Carlos Colombo, Catalina López, Alejandro de la Rosa Jiménez', null, 'Socorro is a lawyer obsessed with finding the soldier who killed her brother during the 1968 Tlatelolco massacre. When she receives a crucial clue about the soldier’s whereabouts fifty years after her brother’s death, Socorro embarks on a reckless mission for revenge.', 'Socorro is a lawyer obsessed with finding the soldier who killed her brother during the 1968 Tlatelolco massacre. When she receives a crucial clue about the soldier’s whereabouts fifty years after her brother’s death, Socorro embarks on a reckless mission for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evNGdO5D1eAD8c3m4wVynTMhIrj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1252505'),
  ('98229136891166076', 'We Shall Overcome', 2006, 'Drama', 'Niels Arden Oplev, Lars Vestergaard', 'Niels Arden Oplev, Steen Bille', 'Janus Dissing Rathke, Sarah Juel Werner, Bent Mejding, Anders W. Berthelsen, Jens Jørn Spottag, Anne-Grethe Bjarup Riis, Gyrd Løfquist, Elin Reimer', null, 'A drama about a boy who''s inspired by Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. and challenges repressive school authority in 1969 Denmark.', 'A drama about a boy who''s inspired by Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. and challenges repressive school authority in 1969 Denmark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0MQPx5v2gCWqe9XbHKY6FFzuYl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1838'),
  ('525737914428083883', 'We Shall Overcome Someday', 2005, 'Drama, Action, Comedy', 'Kazuyuki Izutsu, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Kazuyuki Izutsu, Daisuke Habara', 'Shun Shioya, Erika Sawajiri, Sousuke Takaoka, Hiroyuki Onoue, Yoko Maki, Joe Odagiri, Keisuke Koide, Kazuki Namioka', null, 'Romeo, A.K.A. Kosuke Matsuyama, is a second-year high school student. A nice, normal, nonviolent type, he suddenly finds himself in the middle of a rampaging crowd of Korean boys, outraged by insults perpetrated by several of his idiotic class-mates on two Korean girls. He makes a narrow escape, but soon after, he and his best bud Yoshio are sent by their home-room teacher to invite the Korean students to a friendly soccer game as a way of restoring the peace.', 'Romeo, A.K.A. Kosuke Matsuyama, is a second-year high school student. A nice, normal, nonviolent type, he suddenly finds himself in the middle of a rampaging crowd of Korean boys, outraged by insults perpetrated by several of his idiotic class-mates on two Korean girls. He makes a narrow escape, but soon after, he and his best bud Yoshio are sent by their home-room teacher to invite the Korean students to a friendly soccer game as a way of restoring the peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30jcjfrwFlTyWqL6obLLzNQxwKK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129713'),
  ('186216344151104392', 'We Spin Around the Night Consumed by the Fire', 1978, 'Documentary', 'Guy Debord, André Mrugalski', 'Guy Debord', 'Guy Debord', null, 'A Latin palindrome is the title of Guy Debord''s last film, in which he, as narrator, explains that he will make neither concessions to the tastes of his viewers nor to the dominant ideas of his day. After extensively insulting the audience that goes to the cinema to forget its heteronomous life, the film becomes autobiographical, using images from the world of spectacle: advertising brochures, clips from feature films (Les enfants du paradis), comics, aerial footage of Paris, tracking shots through Venice, photographs of friends – all commented on by Debord, with an at times melancholy undertone: "This Paris no longer exists." His assessment is that one of the great pleasures of his life has been the sensation of the passage of time, and as a witness to the disintegration of social order, he has loved his epoch.', 'A Latin palindrome is the title of Guy Debord''s last film, in which he, as narrator, explains that he will make neither concessions to the tastes of his viewers nor to the dominant ideas of his day. After extensively insulting the audience that goes to the cinema to forget its heteronomous life, the film becomes autobiographical, using images from the world of spectacle: advertising brochures, clips from feature films (Les enfants du paradis), comics, aerial footage of Paris, tracking shots through Venice, photographs of friends – all commented on by Debord, with an at times melancholy undertone: "This Paris no longer exists." His assessment is that one of the great pleasures of his life has been the sensation of the passage of time, and as a witness to the disintegration of social order, he has loved his epoch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scz363a4qKgxLYCX6L0JvgoWRUV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61662'),
  ('522432553747135077', 'We Stand Alone Together: The Men of Easy Company', 2001, 'Documentary, War, TV Movie', 'Mark Cowen, Steven Wacks', 'William Richter', 'Roderick Bain, James Alley Jr., Lynn ''Buck'' Compton, Antonio Garcia de Pedro, William ''Bill'' Guarnere, Forrest Guth, Lester Hashey, Edward ''Babe'' Heffron', 'PG', 'Over a period of two years, Mark Cowen and his crew travelled to thirty U.S. states and ten European cities, to interview the veterans of Easy Company. The stories told by the veterans themselves, create a history of the Second World War from the point of view of this heroic company of men, made famous in the mini-series Band of Brothers.', 'Over a period of two years, Mark Cowen and his crew travelled to thirty U.S. states and ten European cities, to interview the veterans of Easy Company. The stories told by the veterans themselves, create a history of the Second World War from the point of view of this heroic company of men, made famous in the mini-series Band of Brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sB1gxrDCLp9ikxDzMEzraVKrTnj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235199'),
  ('371355925663503527', 'We Steal Secrets: The Story of WikiLeaks', 2013, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Alex Gibney, Maryse Alberti', 'Alex Gibney', 'Julian Assange, Chelsea Manning, Heather Brooke, Alex Gibney, Robert Manne, John ''Fuzface'' McMahon, Michael Hayden, J. William Leonard', 'R', 'Julian Assange. Bradley Manning. Collateral murder. Cablegate. WikiLeaks. These people and terms have exploded into public consciousness by fundamentally changing the way democratic societies deal with privacy, secrecy, and the right to information, perhaps for generations to come. We Steal Secrets: The Story of WikiLeaks is an extensive examination of all things related to WikiLeaks and the larger global debate over access to information.', 'Julian Assange. Bradley Manning. Collateral murder. Cablegate. WikiLeaks. These people and terms have exploded into public consciousness by fundamentally changing the way democratic societies deal with privacy, secrecy, and the right to information, perhaps for generations to come. We Steal Secrets: The Story of WikiLeaks is an extensive examination of all things related to WikiLeaks and the larger global debate over access to information.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJHQbEtZSUry2QDbQcv8ziMt7Ib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159154'),
  ('1131435023237366435', 'We Still Kill the Old Way', 1967, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Elio Petri, Marcello Crescenzi, Luigi Kuveiller', 'Elio Petri, Ugo Pirro', 'Gian Maria Volonté, Irene Papas, Gabriele Ferzetti, Laura Nucci, Mario Scaccia, Luigi Pistilli, Leopoldo Trieste, Salvo Randone', null, 'A leftist professor wants the truth about two men killed during a hunting party; but the mafia, the Church and corrupt politicians don''t want him to learn it.', 'A leftist professor wants the truth about two men killed during a hunting party; but the mafia, the Church and corrupt politicians don''t want him to learn it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBRjeDnVLWIrtMmNq25hKBzGEQ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80441'),
