  ('620095649773691775', 'We the Animals', 2018, 'Drama', 'Zak Mulligan, Kat Hess, Laura Klein', 'Daniel Kitrosser, Jeremiah Zagar', 'Evan Rosado, Raúl Castillo, Sheila Vand, Josiah Santiago, Isaiah Kristian, Giovanni Pacciarelli, Moe Isaac, Amelia Campbell', 'R', 'Manny, Joel and Jonah tear their way through childhood and push against the volatile love of their parents. As Manny and Joel grow into versions of their father and Ma dreams of escape, Jonah, the youngest, embraces an imagined world all his own.', 'Manny, Joel and Jonah tear their way through childhood and push against the volatile love of their parents. As Manny and Joel grow into versions of their father and Ma dreams of escape, Jonah, the youngest, embraces an imagined world all his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSMcNOpihv6U4JlNAaxfbl2qUj7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490000'),
  ('942051433487523311', 'We the Poor', 1948, 'Drama', 'Ismael Rodríguez, José Ortiz Ramos, Jorge López Portillo', 'Carlos González Dueñas', 'Pedro Infante, Blanca Estela Pavón, Evita Muñoz ''Chachita'', Carmen Montejo, Miguel Inclán, Rafael Alcayde, Katy Jurado, María Gentil Arcos', null, 'Carpenter Pepe El Toro lives peacefully with his daughter Chachita in an impoverished Mexico City neighborhood. He pursues a romance with the pretty Celia, but tragedy comes knocking on his door when he is falsely accused of having perpetrated a felony.', 'Carpenter Pepe El Toro lives peacefully with his daughter Chachita in an impoverished Mexico City neighborhood. He pursues a romance with the pretty Celia, but tragedy comes knocking on his door when he is falsely accused of having perpetrated a felony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NKT6FNlLvk0f14voE0FJHp9nP0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53510'),
  ('581115018780590670', 'We Think the World of You', 1988, 'Drama', 'Colin Gregg, Michael Garfath', 'Hugh Stoddart', 'Alan Bates, Gary Oldman, Liz Smith, Max Wall, Frances Barber, Sheila Ballantine, Pat Keen, David Swift', null, 'An aimless young man, Johnny, is sent prison. He entrusts his beloved dog, Evie, to the care of his former lover and best friend, Frank. When he gets out of prison, he has to face difficulties at home. Added to this, is the fact that he may have to give up Evie to Frank.', 'An aimless young man, Johnny, is sent prison. He entrusts his beloved dog, Evie, to the care of his former lover and best friend, Frank. When he gets out of prison, he has to face difficulties at home. Added to this, is the fact that he may have to give up Evie to Frank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwyuYjPd0NNiQbsRRbJ0JqPZw5Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123628'),
  ('817314491127387548', 'We Treat Women Too Well', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Clara Bilbao, Imanol Nabea', 'Miguel Barros', 'Carmen Machi, Antonio de la Torre, Luis Tosar, Isak Férriz, Óscar Ladoire, Julián Villagrán, Diego Anido, Felipe Pirazán', null, 'Remedios Buendía defends her homeland and will fight for it. This fateful day of 1945, a group of maquis take the post where she tries on her wedding dress. She will show how far she can go defending her values.', 'Remedios Buendía defends her homeland and will fight for it. This fateful day of 1945, a group of maquis take the post where she tries on her wedding dress. She will show how far she can go defending her values.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oiA1nWqckPwl3sOkoDFQNOLyY1k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1209285'),
  ('1148957561709907226', 'We Want Our Mummy', 1939, 'Comedy, Adventure, Horror', 'Del Lord', 'Elwood Ullman', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Dick Curtis, Bud Jamison, Theodore Lorch, Eddie Laughton, James C. Morton', 'NR', 'The stooges go to Egypt in search of the mummy of king Rootin-Tootin for which a museum will pay a $5000 prize. They wind up in the mummy''s tomb where they are harassed by some bad guys after the same objective. The villains, who have kidnapped a professor from the museum, want the jewels buried inside the mummy. When Curly accidentally destroys the mummy, Moe and Larry wrap him in bandages to fool the bad guys. They manage to rescue the professor and retrieve the real mummy of Rootin-Tootin who turns out to have been a midget.', 'The stooges go to Egypt in search of the mummy of king Rootin-Tootin for which a museum will pay a $5000 prize. They wind up in the mummy''s tomb where they are harassed by some bad guys after the same objective. The villains, who have kidnapped a professor from the museum, want the jewels buried inside the mummy. When Curly accidentally destroys the mummy, Moe and Larry wrap him in bandages to fool the bad guys. They manage to rescue the professor and retrieve the real mummy of Rootin-Tootin who turns out to have been a midget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qyBVpsLnQeC2sgftGo4K4ObwEty.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115923'),
  ('703331398651983835', 'We Want Roses Too', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Alina Marazzi', null, 'Anita Caprioli, Teresa Saponangelo, Valentina Carnelutti', null, 'The film looks again at recent events from a female point of view, through the first-hand accounts provided by the diaries of three women. Rather than focusing on the alleged objectivity of facts, the film gives space to a chorus of voices that narrate those events in first person, visually supported by archival footage of the period, drawn from the most varied sources - institutional, public, militant and private. Anita, Teresa and Valentina come from different Italian regions and different social backgrounds, but share the same feelings: they no longer feel as part of a society based on the patriarchal family, on the power of "husbands" and on the supremacy of males, which requires them to be efficient mothers, obedient wives and virtuous daughters.', 'The film looks again at recent events from a female point of view, through the first-hand accounts provided by the diaries of three women. Rather than focusing on the alleged objectivity of facts, the film gives space to a chorus of voices that narrate those events in first person, visually supported by archival footage of the period, drawn from the most varied sources - institutional, public, militant and private. Anita, Teresa and Valentina come from different Italian regions and different social backgrounds, but share the same feelings: they no longer feel as part of a society based on the patriarchal family, on the power of "husbands" and on the supremacy of males, which requires them to be efficient mothers, obedient wives and virtuous daughters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LZE1dt0ljZOeNZ2TcggNoYaDHb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57253'),
  ('494875679516815396', 'We Want the Colonels', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Alberto Spagnoli, Mario Monicelli, Carlo Vanzina', 'Agenore Incrocci, Furio Scarpelli, Mario Monicelli', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Claude Dauphin, Duilio Del Prete, Giuseppe Maffioli, Carla Tatò, François Périer, Lino Puglisi, Pino Zac', null, 'Italy 1973. Giuseppe Tritoni (Ugo Tognazzi) is an ultra-right-wing congressman that doesn''t agree anymore with his fascist party policy. He contacts many Italian Army officers and built a net of relationship in order to organize a Coup d''Etat (Golpe). Something goes wrong and the Interior Minister (Home Secretary) Mr. Li Masi (Lino Pugliesi) got the all information about the attempted Golpe. So the Minister organizes a counter-Golpe. Tritoni desperately, to save his project, kidnaps the Italian Republic President (Claude Dauphin) that immediately dies for heartache. Now Minister Mr. Li Masi is free to lay down the law to the rest of the country, realizing basically the actual Golpe! Tritoni surrenders and will spend rest of his time trying to sell his ideas about managing Golpe in Africa!', 'Italy 1973. Giuseppe Tritoni (Ugo Tognazzi) is an ultra-right-wing congressman that doesn''t agree anymore with his fascist party policy. He contacts many Italian Army officers and built a net of relationship in order to organize a Coup d''Etat (Golpe). Something goes wrong and the Interior Minister (Home Secretary) Mr. Li Masi (Lino Pugliesi) got the all information about the attempted Golpe. So the Minister organizes a counter-Golpe. Tritoni desperately, to save his project, kidnaps the Italian Republic President (Claude Dauphin) that immediately dies for heartache. Now Minister Mr. Li Masi is free to lay down the law to the rest of the country, realizing basically the actual Golpe! Tritoni surrenders and will spend rest of his time trying to sell his ideas about managing Golpe in Africa!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c20pDLAZT0x8kCZGMpRoOihIhai.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49907'),
  ('687765886551856042', 'We Were Children', 2024, 'Drama', 'Marco Martani, Valerio Azzali', 'Massimiliano Bruno', 'Lorenzo Richelmy, Alessio Lapice, Lucrezia Guidone, Francesco Russo, Giancarlo Commare, Romano Reggiani, Massimo Popolizio, Andrea Arru', null, 'In a police station in a small village, a sergeant interrogates a young and frightened postman, known as "Cacasotto". He, normally known for being calm and good-hearted, was arrested for having threatened a policeman on patrol with a knife. Eventually, Cacasotto begins to speak with the cop. And he tells what happened twenty years earlier to him and to his five best friends: Gianluca, Walter, Peppino, Margherita and his little brother, Andrea.', 'In a police station in a small village, a sergeant interrogates a young and frightened postman, known as "Cacasotto". He, normally known for being calm and good-hearted, was arrested for having threatened a policeman on patrol with a knife. Eventually, Cacasotto begins to speak with the cop. And he tells what happened twenty years earlier to him and to his five best friends: Gianluca, Walter, Peppino, Margherita and his little brother, Andrea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gm7qGYaAENEim5aJM3K30HDGQUB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1175094'),
  ('691985424571831206', 'We Were Fine Together', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Mattia Molinari, Dario Ghezzi', 'Marco Luca Cattaneo', 'Massimo Ambrosini, Gennaro Gattuso, Filippo Inzaghi, Paolo Maldini, Alessandro Nesta, Andrea Pirlo, Adriano Galliani, Carlo Ancelotti', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5tYmdB90dRv0IFrd86xpZyQ2mp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028850'),
  ('1088677601890017125', 'We Were One Man', 1979, 'Drama, War', 'Philippe Vallois, François About', 'Philippe Vallois', 'Serge Avédikian, Piotr Stanislas, Catherine Albin, Lucien Guérin', null, 'During the final days of World War II, a simple French peasant rescues a wounded German soldier and nurses him back to health. As their playful camaraderie grows, two young men who should be enemies begin to bond in ways neither thought possible.', 'During the final days of World War II, a simple French peasant rescues a wounded German soldier and nurses him back to health. As their playful camaraderie grows, two young men who should be enemies begin to bond in ways neither thought possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CsrAYMYL9Yh42fIlHITZ1Kp5hK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65888'),
  ('229407501104183912', 'We Were Soldiers', 2002, 'Action, History, War', 'Dean Semler, Randall Wallace, Daniel T. Dorrance', 'Randall Wallace', 'Mel Gibson, Madeleine Stowe, Greg Kinnear, Sam Elliott, Chris Klein, Keri Russell, Barry Pepper, Đơn Dương', 'R', 'The year is 1965 and America is at war with North Vietnam. Commanding the air cavalry is Lt. Col. Hal Moore (Gibson), a born leader committed to his troops. His target: the Ia Drang Valley, called "The Valley of Death." As Moore prepares for one of the most violent battles in U.S. history, he delivers a stirring promise to his soldiers and their families: "I will leave no man behind...dead or alive. We will all come home together."', 'The year is 1965 and America is at war with North Vietnam. Commanding the air cavalry is Lt. Col. Hal Moore (Gibson), a born leader committed to his troops. His target: the Ia Drang Valley, called "The Valley of Death." As Moore prepares for one of the most violent battles in U.S. history, he delivers a stirring promise to his soldiers and their families: "I will leave no man behind...dead or alive. We will all come home together."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpAMFrHHqpRCPbrBvYV9HHaVNB8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10590'),
  ('1134250545080190292', 'We Were Strangers', 1949, 'Drama, Thriller, Adventure, Romance', 'John Huston, Russell Metty', 'Peter Viertel, John Huston', 'Jennifer Jones, John Garfield, Pedro Armendáriz, Gilbert Roland, Ramon Novarro, Wally Cassell, David Bond, José Pérez', 'NR', 'China Valdes joins the Cuban underground after her brother is killed by the chief of the secret police, Ariete. She meets and falls in love with American expatriate Tony Fenner. Tony develops a plan to tunnel under the city''s cemetery to a plot owned by a high official, assassinate him, and blow up the whole Cuban hierarchy at the ensuing state funeral. Together with a band of dedicated revolutionaries, they begin digging.', 'China Valdes joins the Cuban underground after her brother is killed by the chief of the secret police, Ariete. She meets and falls in love with American expatriate Tony Fenner. Tony develops a plan to tunnel under the city''s cemetery to a plot owned by a high official, assassinate him, and blow up the whole Cuban hierarchy at the ensuing state funeral. Together with a band of dedicated revolutionaries, they begin digging.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dyjFLrxNESNqD61Zu3DgBhv6IN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50117'),
  ('571548612807587215', 'We Were There: First Love', 2012, 'Romance, Drama', 'Takahiro Miki, Miyako Araki', 'Yuki Obata', 'Toma Ikuta, Yuriko Yoshitaka, Sousuke Takaoka, Yuika Motokariya, Manami Higa, Ayaka Komatsu, Yumi Aso, Tasuku Emoto', null, 'We Were There follows the 10 year romance between Motoharu Yano & Nanami Takahashi. During their high school days, Motoharu Yano was the most popular boy in school, but can''t get over the death of his girlfriend from a car crash. Nanami Takahashi falls in love with Motoharu Yano and must deal with his inability to let go of the past.', 'We Were There follows the 10 year romance between Motoharu Yano & Nanami Takahashi. During their high school days, Motoharu Yano was the most popular boy in school, but can''t get over the death of his girlfriend from a car crash. Nanami Takahashi falls in love with Motoharu Yano and must deal with his inability to let go of the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jC29wKSagPc7czakzgqe7YErtdj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140054'),
  ('89436755299183847', 'We Were There: True Love', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Takahiro Miki, Miyako Araki', 'Tomoko Yoshida', 'Toma Ikuta, Yuriko Yoshitaka, Sousuke Takaoka, Yuika Motokariya, Manami Higa, Tasuku Emoto, Ayaka Komatsu, Yumi Aso', null, 'During the 2nd year of high school in the winter season, Yano transferred from Kushiro to Tokyo due to a family matter. Yano and Nanami promised to meet again. A couple of years later, Nanami is busy finding a job, while Yano''s friend Takeuchi supports her. in the beginning, Yano and Nanami kept their relationship, even with the long distance between them, but Yano suddenly stops contacting Nanami.', 'During the 2nd year of high school in the winter season, Yano transferred from Kushiro to Tokyo due to a family matter. Yano and Nanami promised to meet again. A couple of years later, Nanami is busy finding a job, while Yano''s friend Takeuchi supports her. in the beginning, Yano and Nanami kept their relationship, even with the long distance between them, but Yano suddenly stops contacting Nanami.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UgHwES47PtdiNGKV8lXJCG9zyd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129745'),
  ('653699139067024591', 'We Were Young', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Philippe Guillard, Ludovic Colbeau-Justin', 'Philippe Guillard', 'Kad Merad, Charles Berling, Benoît Magimel, Vincent Moscato, Jean-François Cayrey, Anne Charrier, Cécile Belin, Emma Colberti', null, 'Five long-term pals confront ageing and mortality as they enjoy their last weeks together before taking different paths.', 'Five long-term pals confront ageing and mortality as they enjoy their last weeks together before taking different paths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KQjT2OA7LIi2EVM2HzRU3WkHSU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341742'),
  ('881490516793032046', 'We Will All Meet in Paradise', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Yves Robert, René Mathelin', 'Jean-Loup Dabadie, Yves Robert', 'Jean Rochefort, Claude Brasseur, Guy Bedos, Victor Lanoux, Danièle Delorme, Marthe Villalonga, Jenny Arasse, Josiane Balasko', null, 'Having fortuitously discovered a photograph in which Marthe embraces someone unknown, Étienne Dorsay becomes jealous and imagines various stratagems to identify the lover. In the meantime, he and his friends acquire a weekend house for a very low price.', 'Having fortuitously discovered a photograph in which Marthe embraces someone unknown, Étienne Dorsay becomes jealous and imagines various stratagems to identify the lover. In the meantime, he and his friends acquire a weekend house for a very low price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwUIueYeSvjQ3Ax1d2qB8H0S1qr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40585'),
  ('539559789901172298', 'We Will Go', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Enya Baroux, Hugo Paturel, Kattin Iphutcha', 'Philippe Barrière, Enya Baroux, Martin Darondeau', 'Hélène Vincent, Pierre Lottin, David Ayala, Juliette Gasquet, Enya Baroux, Gabin Visona, Henock Cortes, Brigitte Aubry', null, 'An unexpected road trip brings a dysfunctional family together for one last journey with their elder, sparking moments of connection, joy, and reconciliation.', 'An unexpected road trip brings a dysfunctional family together for one last journey with their elder, sparking moments of connection, joy, and reconciliation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKeBqIoBGtXUuWc2RkZdUPVuoyc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1003504'),
