  ('767205593352217', 'We Will Rock You', 1982, 'Music', 'Saul Swimmer, Richard E. Brooks', null, 'Freddie Mercury, Roger Taylor, John Deacon, Brian May', null, 'In November 1981, and with “Under Pressure” topping the charts in the UK, Queen performed a blistering set of hits – including "We Will Rock You" and "Bohemian Rhapsody" – in front of an 18,000-strong crowd at Montreal''s Forum, in this stunning concert film.', 'In November 1981, and with “Under Pressure” topping the charts in the UK, Queen performed a blistering set of hits – including "We Will Rock You" and "Bohemian Rhapsody" – in front of an 18,000-strong crowd at Montreal''s Forum, in this stunning concert film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcHraddPeYdjw1gqg7OYcOEu82T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19352'),
  ('1007921737746487779', 'We Wish You a Married Christmas', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Paul Ziller, Paul Suderman', 'Nicole Baxter', 'Marisol Nichols, Kristoffer Polaha, Claude Knowlton, Brian Sills, Amy Groening, Lauren Cochrane, Carolina Campos, René Escobar Jr.', 'G', 'Becca and Robby are a married couple having a hard time connecting with each other as the holidays approach. Just before Christmas, they head to a cozy Vermont inn at the advice of their marriage coach so they can recharge. Their weekend away gets unexpectedly extended when a mishap puts their car out of commission and just may put them on the road to a very happily married Christmas.', 'Becca and Robby are a married couple having a hard time connecting with each other as the holidays approach. Just before Christmas, they head to a cozy Vermont inn at the advice of their marriage coach so they can recharge. Their weekend away gets unexpectedly extended when a mishap puts their car out of commission and just may put them on the road to a very happily married Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZjDTEpZ0SPER7NuuIIjPlGwEP8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1027338'),
  ('262647709271821053', 'We Won''t Grow Old Together', 1972, 'Romance, Drama', 'Maurice Pialat, Luciano Tovoli, Jean-Claude Bourlat', 'Maurice Pialat', 'Marlène Jobert, Jean Yanne, Harry-Max, Jacques Galland, Macha Méril, Christine Fabréga, Muse Dalbray, Maurice Risch', null, 'Jean, a married 40-year-old filmmaker, and his young working class lover, Catherine, engage in a circular series of spectacular blow-ups and tentative reunions, their mutual desire a fire that burns them again and again.', 'Jean, a married 40-year-old filmmaker, and his young working class lover, Catherine, engage in a circular series of spectacular blow-ups and tentative reunions, their mutual desire a fire that burns them again and again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwGa43RE2AaBMpoU2Jdlj08rK7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63230'),
  ('412480500715486573', 'We, the Women', 1953, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gianni Franciolini, Alfredo Guarini, Roberto Rossellini', 'Luigi Chiarini, Giorgio Prosperi, Suso Cecchi d''Amico', 'Ingrid Bergman, Anna Magnani, Isa Miranda, Alida Valli, Anna Amendola, Emma Danieli, Cristina Doria, Cristina Fantoni', null, 'Five portraits of actresses in their "common" life, seen as women rather than movie stars.', 'Five portraits of actresses in their "common" life, seen as women rather than movie stars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gG8UFZeWRlzUDM5Ui8ELuo4PSPv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82063'),
  ('552386868098907695', 'We''ll Be Young and Beautiful', 2018, 'Drama', 'Giuseppe Barletta, Letizia Lamartire, Giuseppe Chessa', 'Lisa Nur Sultan', 'Barbora Bobuľová, Alessandro Piavani, Massimiliano Gallo, Federica Sabatini, Elisabetta De Vito, Ciro Scalera, Paola Calliari, Victoria Silvestro', null, 'In the 90s, Isabella was eighteen and a star. 20 years later, she is still singing those same songs in small town bars with her son Bruno, playing guitar. It''s because of him that her career stopped. At least it''s what she tells herself.', 'In the 90s, Isabella was eighteen and a star. 20 years later, she is still singing those same songs in small town bars with her son Bruno, playing guitar. It''s because of him that her career stopped. At least it''s what she tells herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTkXnAtPtgTaMAd8XmreaWpB0uF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538610'),
  ('25089798256518786', 'We''ll Get Back to You', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Doğa Can Anafarta, Mehmet Başbaran', 'Doğa Can Anafarta', 'Hande Soral, Çağlar Ertuğrul, Fırat Albayram, Bestemsu Özdemir, Tarık Ündüz, Tuğçe Kurşunoğlu, Ceyda Kasabalı, Tuana Naz Tiryaki', null, 'The only cure of being jobelessness, unhappy and hopelessness is friendship, life is beautiful together.', 'The only cure of being jobelessness, unhappy and hopelessness is friendship, life is beautiful together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXtco41oFrZy0cuREcbnakrD9iw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450456'),
  ('13791254490667863', 'We''ll Kick Up a Fuss Tomorrow, Darling...', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Petr Schulhoff, Jiří Potsch, Jiří Vojta', 'Petr Schulhoff', 'Miloš Kopecký, Stella Zázvorková, Iva Janžurová, František Peterka, Luděk Sobota, Dagmar Havlová Veškrnová, Darja Hajská, Eva Trejtnarová-Hudečková', null, 'Mr. Novak tells a lie to his neighbor Mrs. Bartackova that her husband is unfaithful to her and that is how it all started.', 'Mr. Novak tells a lie to his neighbor Mrs. Bartackova that her husband is unfaithful to her and that is how it all started.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Mcxs6rJeGUCBHTEoy8HSN2wIBS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125392'),
  ('547246111080057381', 'We''ll Live Till Monday', 1968, 'Romance, Drama', 'Stanislav Rostotsky, Vyacheslav Shumskiy, Zoya Kurdumova', 'Georgi Polonsky', 'Vyacheslav Tikhonov, Irina Pechernikova, Nina Menshikova, Mikhail Zimin, Dalvin Shcherbakov, Nadir Malishevsky, Olga Zhizneva, Lyudmila Arkharova', null, 'A respected history teacher, Ilya Semenovich Melnikov, decides to quit his job due to distressing rumors about a colleague who is in love with him. His final week is disrupted when a student''s controversial essay on happiness sparks a classroom conflict. Melnikov''s intervention in the situation ultimately causes him to reconsider his decision to resign.', 'A respected history teacher, Ilya Semenovich Melnikov, decides to quit his job due to distressing rumors about a colleague who is in love with him. His final week is disrupted when a student''s controversial essay on happiness sparks a classroom conflict. Melnikov''s intervention in the situation ultimately causes him to reconsider his decision to resign.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8KACDBvRh7RnAxYc95w2aMT6nH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109774'),
  ('512389371689038261', 'We''ll Meet in Heaven', 2009, 'Drama', 'Jong Lin, Jiang Wenli', 'Jiang Wenli', 'Zhu Xu, Yao Jun, Zhu Yinuo, Liu Ye, Ma Sichun', null, 'In China, during the Cultural Revolution, a young girl''s parents are thrown in jail for ten years. She is raised by her grandfather. He introduces her to gymnastics where she does her best to fit in with the others.', 'In China, during the Cultural Revolution, a young girl''s parents are thrown in jail for ten years. She is raised by her grandfather. He introduces her to gymnastics where she does her best to fit in with the others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lsdrJdHWOrhtXBalyTlsi2x0JIX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112025'),
  ('720336121735234442', 'We''ll Never Have Paris', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jocelyn Towne, Simon Helberg, Polly Morgan', 'Simon Helberg', 'Simon Helberg, Melanie Lynskey, Zachary Quinto, Judith Light, Maggie Grace, Alfred Molina, Jason Ritter, Meredith Hagner', 'R', 'Quinn, a neurotic man, is diagnosed with a harmless eye condition and soon after his life spirals out of control. He second-guesses his plans to propose to his longtime girlfriend, Devon, after his beautiful coworker, Kelsey, confesses that she has a crush on him. After a conversation with his best friend, Jameson, he clumsily tries to explain his doubts to Devon, but his possible proposal turns into a break-up. When Devon flees to Paris, he follows her in a last-ditch effort to win back "the one."', 'Quinn, a neurotic man, is diagnosed with a harmless eye condition and soon after his life spirals out of control. He second-guesses his plans to propose to his longtime girlfriend, Devon, after his beautiful coworker, Kelsey, confesses that she has a crush on him. After a conversation with his best friend, Jameson, he clumsily tries to explain his doubts to Devon, but his possible proposal turns into a break-up. When Devon flees to Paris, he follows her in a last-ditch effort to win back "the one."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zX0JHMQbo41xCRXSKBJCYQ8fpHq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253287'),
  ('1112743134621344127', 'We''re All Christs', 2006, 'Drama', 'Marek Koterski, Edward Kłosiński, Małgorzata Adamska', 'Marek Koterski', 'Marek Kondrat, Michał Koterski, Andrzej Chyra, Janina Traczykówna, Małgorzata Bogdańska, Tomasz Sapryk, Marcin Dorociński, Bożena Adamek', null, 'Adaś Miauczyński, a Polish intellectual, has severe alcohol problems which affect his relationship with his son Sylwek.', 'Adaś Miauczyński, a Polish intellectual, has severe alcohol problems which affect his relationship with his son Sylwek.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5nkwbcZ8a2i9rpjRUZcVDzYsJT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36416'),
  ('793944305375202318', 'We''re All Going to the World''s Fair', 2022, 'Drama, Horror', 'Jeff Pinedo, Willy McGee, Daniel Patrick Carbone', 'Jane Schoenbrun', 'Anna Cobb, Michael J Rogers, May Leitz, Theo Anthony, Valeria Santiago, Turner Greaves, Holly Anne Frink, Slight Sounds', 'NR', 'Reality and fantasy begin to blur when a teenager, alone in her attic bedroom, immerses herself in a role-playing horror game online.', 'Reality and fantasy begin to blur when a teenager, alone in her attic bedroom, immerses herself in a role-playing horror game online.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXn4Nz1WCTEmzAFvwgEZoPHvptR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776501'),
  ('178173552405881128', 'We''re Back! A Dinosaur''s Story', 1993, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Family', 'Phil Nibbelink, Simon Wells, Dick Zondag', 'John Patrick Shanley', 'John Goodman, René Le Vant, Felicity Kendal, Charles Fleischer, Walter Cronkite, Jay Leno, Joey Shea, Yeardley Smith', 'G', 'Captain New Eyes travels back in time and feeds dinosaurs his Brain Grain cereal, which makes them intelligent and non-violent. They agree to go to the "Middle Future" in order to grant the wishes of children in New York City. They are to meet Dr. Bleeb of the Museum of Natural History, but get sidetracked with their new children friends and run into the Captain''s evil brother, Professor Screweyes.', 'Captain New Eyes travels back in time and feeds dinosaurs his Brain Grain cereal, which makes them intelligent and non-violent. They agree to go to the "Middle Future" in order to grant the wishes of children in New York City. They are to meet Dr. Bleeb of the Museum of Natural History, but get sidetracked with their new children friends and run into the Captain''s evil brother, Professor Screweyes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyFmhYlioe3PDZjSKWtcIhu5R02.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18890'),
  ('469699905830173674', 'We''re Both Grooms', 2022, 'Romance', 'Koji Tanaka', 'Masatoshi Nakamura', 'Shono Hayama, Hiroki Iijima, Kai Ogasawara, Munenori Nagano, Miho Kanazawa, Jinsei Morishita, Anna Kawamata, Mantaro Koichi', null, 'On his wedding day, Ryosuke’s secret—that he’s marrying a man—shocks his family, sparks chaos, and gets even messier when Mizuki’s ex shows up uninvited.', 'On his wedding day, Ryosuke’s secret—that he’s marrying a man—shocks his family, sparks chaos, and gets even messier when Mizuki’s ex shows up uninvited.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWNqv0e5QAdwEpoC5JVS8aecsiU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:943845'),
  ('356302089453254924', 'We''re Broke, My Lord!', 2023, 'History, Comedy', 'Tetsu Maeda, Yoko Itakura', 'Jiro Asada, Kazuhiro Inaba, Kentaro Ushio', 'Ryunosuke Kamiki, Hana Sugisaki, Kenichi Matsuyama, Shinya Kote, Dori Sakurada, Aoi Miyazaki, Tadanobu Asano, Koichi Sato', null, 'A commoner inherits lordship of debt-ridden Tanjousan Bun. Officials inform him of new role and substantial debts. He learns he is son of retired Daimyo when position becomes vacant.', 'A commoner inherits lordship of debt-ridden Tanjousan Bun. Officials inform him of new role and substantial debts. He learns he is son of retired Daimyo when position becomes vacant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mP9tlhEXm3dU9noFZCNU4P4fsRT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1126444'),
  ('859914267404276667', 'We''re from Jazz', 1983, 'Music, Comedy', 'Karen Shakhnazarov, Vladimir Shevtsik, E. Zelentsova', 'Aleksandr Borodyanskiy, Karen Shakhnazarov', 'Igor Sklyar, Aleksandr Pankratov-Chyornyy, Nikolai Averyushkin, Pyotr Shcherbakov, Elena Tsyplakova, Evgeniy Evstigneev, Pyotr Merkuryev, Boryslav Brondukov', null, 'A music student is expelled from school because he loves jazz, a kind of music that represents the US capitalism. He hires two street musicians to form a dixie band, and goes from one city to another trying to gain fame.', 'A music student is expelled from school because he loves jazz, a kind of music that represents the US capitalism. He hires two street musicians to form a dixie band, and goes from one city to another trying to gain fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DA3MFMm3I9vlSxUz3yWA2lYTJB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56477'),
  ('760325283004930610', 'We''re Going to Eat You', 1980, 'Action, Horror, Comedy', 'Tsui Hark, Lau Hung-Chuen', 'Sze-To Cheuk-Hon', 'Norman Tsui Siu-Keung, Melvin Wong, Eddy Ko Hung, Michelle Yim, Hon Kwok-Choi, Fung Fung, San Kuai, Tai Bo', null, 'Agent 999 is sent to a remote Chinese island to capture a notorious bandit named Rolex. Upon arrival, 999 begins to suspect that something is wrong, and soon learns that the island is inhabited by flesh-eating cannibals under control of a tribal chief. 999 ultimately teams up with Rolex to overthrow the evil chief and escape the island.', 'Agent 999 is sent to a remote Chinese island to capture a notorious bandit named Rolex. Upon arrival, 999 begins to suspect that something is wrong, and soon learns that the island is inhabited by flesh-eating cannibals under control of a tribal chief. 999 ultimately teams up with Rolex to overthrow the evil chief and escape the island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2XyByYI69vrNnC8xvidPeYmxWrT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39865'),
  ('478118984256538785', 'We''re in the Money', 1933, 'Animation, Comedy, Music', 'Rudolf Ising', null, null, null, 'After the last human has left the department store, the toys proceed to the music department where they start performing the Warren/Dubin song "We''re in the money". The money soon joins for a chorus, as well as display dolls in the wardrobe department.', 'After the last human has left the department store, the toys proceed to the music department where they start performing the Warren/Dubin song "We''re in the money". The money soon joins for a chorus, as well as display dolls in the wardrobe department.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nuWOtHeKFy50kUuW5fiDBgApV6y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161978'),
  ('253822777091672851', 'We''re No Angels', 1955, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Michael Curtiz, Loyal Griggs, John R. Coonan', 'Ranald MacDougall', 'Humphrey Bogart, Aldo Ray, Peter Ustinov, Joan Bennett, Basil Rathbone, Leo G. Carroll, John Baer, Gloria Talbott', 'NR', 'Three convicts escape from prison on Devil''s Island just before Christmas and arrive at a nearby French colonial town. They go to the store of the Ducotels, the only store that gives supplies on credit. They initially intend to take advantage of them but have a change of heart after they find the family is in financial troubles.', 'Three convicts escape from prison on Devil''s Island just before Christmas and arrive at a nearby French colonial town. They go to the store of the Ducotels, the only store that gives supplies on credit. They initially intend to take advantage of them but have a change of heart after they find the family is in financial troubles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UsrZkcoj95K8ZVf7FMnTiZ5P4C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5996'),
  ('465516720279425344', 'We''re No Angels', 1989, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Philippe Rousselot, Neil Jordan, Patrick Clayton', 'David Mamet, Ranald MacDougall', 'Robert De Niro, Sean Penn, Demi Moore, Hoyt Axton, Bruno Kirby, Ray McAnally, James Russo, Wallace Shawn', 'PG-13', 'Two escaped cons'' only prayer to escape is to pass themselves off as priests and pass by the police blockade at the border into the safety of Canada.', 'Two escaped cons'' only prayer to escape is to pass themselves off as priests and pass by the police blockade at the border into the safety of Canada.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XBVURkON7jyzxr0cONWeTbgAov.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5971'),
  ('386026310417004864', 'We''re Not Married!', 1952, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Edmund Goulding, Lionel Newman, Leo Tover', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'Ginger Rogers, Fred Allen, Victor Moore, Marilyn Monroe, David Wayne, Eve Arden, Paul Douglas, Eddie Bracken', 'PG', 'A Justice of the Peace performed weddings a few days before his license was valid. A few years later five couples learn they have never been legally married.', 'A Justice of the Peace performed weddings a few days before his license was valid. A few years later five couples learn they have never been legally married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sxgqy0ZdpZ1cWjHFIO4DH8TRaLD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24004'),
  ('224836809512272958', 'We''re So Young', 2013, 'Drama, Music', 'Antonio Carlos da Fontoura, Alexandre Ermel', 'Marcos Bernstein, Victor Atherino', 'Thiago Mendonça, Laila Zaid, Daniel Passi, Sandra Corveloni, Marcos Breda, Bianca Comparato, Bruno Torres, Conrado Godoy', null, 'The life of Renato Russo, from his first involvement with music, to his years in the punk rock band Aborto Alétrico, to the formation of Legião Urbana, in the Brasília rock scene of 1970s and 1980s.', 'The life of Renato Russo, from his first involvement with music, to his years in the punk rock band Aborto Alétrico, to the formation of Legião Urbana, in the Brasília rock scene of 1970s and 1980s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sakpWhGTY1ipnHDWAB4LvKawskp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191034'),
