  ('667691020053717971', 'Weapons', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Zach Cregger, Larkin Seiple, Cameron Beasley', 'Zach Cregger', 'Julia Garner, Josh Brolin, Alden Ehrenreich, Austin Abrams, Benedict Wong, Amy Madigan, Cary Christopher, Toby Huss', 'R', 'When all but one child from the same class mysteriously vanish on the same night at exactly the same time, a community is left questioning who or what is behind their disappearance.', 'When all but one child from the same class mysteriously vanish on the same night at exactly the same time, a community is left questioning who or what is behind their disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpf7vsRZ0MYRQcnLWteD5jK9ymT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1078605'),
  ('701669099306459834', 'Weapons of Death', 1977, 'Crime', 'Mario Caiano, Goffredo Unger, Pier Luigi Santi', 'Vincenzo Mannino, Gianfranco Clerici', 'Leonard Mann, Ida Galli, Henry Silva, Jeff Blynn, Massimo Deda, Adolfo Lastretti, Kirsten Gille, Enrico Maisto', null, 'When a crime boss sends out his thugs to terrorize an entire city, they do whatever they want, which includes anything from petty theft to robbing the police station in broad daylight. Napoli spara! (internationally released as Weapons of Death and Naples shoots) is a "poliziottesco" film directed by Mario Caiano in 1977. It is an unofficial sequel of Napoli violenta, of which reprises the character of Gennarino (still played by Massimo Deda).', 'When a crime boss sends out his thugs to terrorize an entire city, they do whatever they want, which includes anything from petty theft to robbing the police station in broad daylight. Napoli spara! (internationally released as Weapons of Death and Naples shoots) is a "poliziottesco" film directed by Mario Caiano in 1977. It is an unofficial sequel of Napoli violenta, of which reprises the character of Gennarino (still played by Massimo Deda).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rA6yh4VXtS6IKGJPe84zu0zKbN8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130286'),
  ('1068232213873830385', 'Weapons of Mass Distraction', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Stephen Surjik', 'Larry Gelbart', 'Gabriel Byrne, Ben Kingsley, Mimi Rogers, Jeffrey Tambor, Illeana Douglas, Paul Mazursky, Chris Mulkey, R. Lee Ermey', 'R', 'As two warring media moguls grapple for ownership of a coveted professional football team, they use the newspapers, magazines and television stations they own to destroy each other''s reputations.', 'As two warring media moguls grapple for ownership of a coveted professional football team, they use the newspapers, magazines and television stations they own to destroy each other''s reputations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ut2tdIcrOmfKdjmkCaNpaaQEvO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45045'),
  ('968302540408330696', 'Weary River', 1929, 'Drama, Romance', 'Frank Lloyd, Ernest Haller', 'Bradley King', 'Richard Barthelmess, Betty Compson, William Holden, Louis Natheaux, George E. Stone, Ray Turner, Gladden James, Ernie Adams', 'NR', 'A gangster is put in prison, but finds salvation through music while serving his time. Again on the outside, he finds success elusive and temptations abound.', 'A gangster is put in prison, but finds salvation through music while serving his time. Again on the outside, he finds success elusive and temptations abound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m10r3v7Im2ZFpdz62Jqp8SO5HLt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171446'),
  ('744673516153005796', 'Weasel', 2020, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Tufan Kılınç, Orçun Benli', 'Şükrü Üçpınar, Orçun Benli', 'Kaan Yıldırım, Ahmet Mümtaz Taylan, Hande Doğandemir, İnan Ulaş Torun, Bülent Emrah Parlak, Nilperi Şahinkaya, Yıldırım Beyazıt, Bulut Akkale', null, 'Ayhan is a police officer who has left his job. He starts a new life in the forest house, far from the organization and everything he has been struggling with for years. During an uneasy hunt, he shoots a weasel. Karadayı, who appeared at that time, warns Ayhan about weasels. Karadayı looks like a good person despite his strange demeanor, but his prophecy about weasels is terrifying. Facing with the memories of the past at home, Ayhan also struggles with the weasel that has haunted him.', 'Ayhan is a police officer who has left his job. He starts a new life in the forest house, far from the organization and everything he has been struggling with for years. During an uneasy hunt, he shoots a weasel. Karadayı, who appeared at that time, warns Ayhan about weasels. Karadayı looks like a good person despite his strange demeanor, but his prophecy about weasels is terrifying. Facing with the memories of the past at home, Ayhan also struggles with the weasel that has haunted him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgBN9ehMJ6ClYvDx9gk39C2PBwf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:745514'),
  ('1054184036126696556', 'Weasel Stop', 1956, 'Animation', 'Robert McKimson, Milt Franklyn', null, 'Mel Blanc, Daws Butler', null, 'A shaggy dog is the guard at a farm''s chicken coop when a lip-smacking weasel comes along, intending to gain access to the chickens.', 'A shaggy dog is the guard at a farm''s chicken coop when a lip-smacking weasel comes along, intending to gain access to the chickens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avAzbThExVlpo580R8On119RxGw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235134'),
  ('620210672729964676', 'Weasel While You Work', 1958, 'Animation', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Amid a snowy barnyard, Foghorn Leghorn deflects the carniverous attentions of a lip-smacking weasel.', 'Amid a snowy barnyard, Foghorn Leghorn deflects the carniverous attentions of a lip-smacking weasel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIYZEp0x2XfbrKk124kKV21yOiL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234974'),
  ('1072753822752131622', 'Weather Girl', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Blayne Weaver, Brandon Trost', 'Blayne Weaver', 'Tricia O''Kelley, Ryan Devlin, Patrick J. Adams, Alex Kapp Horner, Marin Hinkle, Mark Harmon, Kaitlin Olson, Jon Cryer', 'R', 'Succumbing to the stresses of her personal and professional lives, Sylvia, a Seattle morning show weather forecaster, has a meltdown live on-air. Now, unemployed, lacking career prospects, and with a mess of a romantic life, she moves in with her little brother. She must learn how to cope with being 35-years-old and unfortunately famous for melting down on live television.', 'Succumbing to the stresses of her personal and professional lives, Sylvia, a Seattle morning show weather forecaster, has a meltdown live on-air. Now, unemployed, lacking career prospects, and with a mess of a romantic life, she moves in with her little brother. She must learn how to cope with being 35-years-old and unfortunately famous for melting down on live television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p22bXXTDQvRbezyEcLU6mKiRikB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19900'),
  ('665485903741977496', 'Weather Woman', 1996, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Tomoaki Hosoyama, Yōichi Shiga', 'Tomoaki Hosoyama', 'Kei Mizutani, Takashi Sumida, Yasuyo Shirashima, Saori Taira, Ren Osugi, Hideyo Amamoto, Kunihiko Ida, Hiroshi Okochi', null, 'Keiko, a young, newly hired weather woman, is eager to give her channel''s flagging ratings a boost. She decides a panty shot might do the trick, so during her forecast she lifts her skirt, thereby capturing the attention and the hearts of viewers. Keiko''s stunt creates such a stir of excitement over the weather report that viewers begin religiously turning in to see what she''ll do next. However, this showboating routine earns the ire of Kaori, the beautiful and ambitious daughter of JTV''s chairman. Jealous of her success and aching to take over the weather report, Kaori is willing to do just about anything to get what she wants.', 'Keiko, a young, newly hired weather woman, is eager to give her channel''s flagging ratings a boost. She decides a panty shot might do the trick, so during her forecast she lifts her skirt, thereby capturing the attention and the hearts of viewers. Keiko''s stunt creates such a stir of excitement over the weather report that viewers begin religiously turning in to see what she''ll do next. However, this showboating routine earns the ire of Kaori, the beautiful and ambitious daughter of JTV''s chairman. Jealous of her success and aching to take over the weather report, Kaori is willing to do just about anything to get what she wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47kYSc38HFpQj70Lq4WWT8Wimmc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54131'),
  ('501437799297748827', 'Weather Woman Returns', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Tomoaki Hosoyama', 'Tomoaki Hosoyama', 'Misa Aika, Atsuki Katō, Ryou Kurihara, Takashi Sumida, Saori Taira, Kiyomi Itō', null, 'Keiko is the new owner of a local television station, and she''s determined to succeed, no matter what! But the rival TV station will stop at nothing to crush her, and one by one, Keiko''s new programs are humiliatingly sabotaged. When the weather woman falls victim to an underhanded trick, Keiko decides that she''s through being nice. While filling in for the stricken reporter, she flashes her underwear, making her weather forecast an instant hit! What follows is an outrageously sexy contest - which judges skimpy costumes and arm wrestling instead of beauty and talent - to determine who will be the reigning weather woman!', 'Keiko is the new owner of a local television station, and she''s determined to succeed, no matter what! But the rival TV station will stop at nothing to crush her, and one by one, Keiko''s new programs are humiliatingly sabotaged. When the weather woman falls victim to an underhanded trick, Keiko decides that she''s through being nice. While filling in for the stricken reporter, she flashes her underwear, making her weather forecast an instant hit! What follows is an outrageously sexy contest - which judges skimpy costumes and arm wrestling instead of beauty and talent - to determine who will be the reigning weather woman!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjMZDidcn6hqVyx1bGdWLDCoYdS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68753'),
  ('432908563478562107', 'Weathering', 2023, 'Thriller', 'Megalyn Echikunwoke, Pierluigi Malavasi', 'Megalyn Echikunwoke', 'Alexis Louder, Alfre Woodard, Jermaine Fowler, James Tupper, Behzad Dabu, Lorna Pitts', null, 'After losing her baby and nearly her life during labor, a journalist unravels amid disturbing visions and chilling attacks as she grieves alone at home.', 'After losing her baby and nearly her life during labor, a journalist unravels amid disturbing visions and chilling attacks as she grieves alone at home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGLE9Mq5Ml9CCVaAfcZ4nrqTRWK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1110586'),
  ('835597140939661808', 'Weathering with You', 2019, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Yoko Miki, Makoto Shinkai, Haru Yamada', 'Makoto Shinkai', 'Kotaro Daigo, Nana Mori, Tsubasa Honda, Sakura Kiryu, Sei Hiraizumi, Chieko Baisho, Shun Oguri, Yuki Kaji', 'PG-13', 'The summer of his high school freshman year, Hodaka runs away from his remote island home to Tokyo, and quickly finds himself pushed to his financial and personal limits. The weather is unusually gloomy and rainy every day, as if taking its cue from his life. After many days of solitude, he finally finds work as a freelance writer for a mysterious occult magazine. Then, one day, Hodaka meets Hina on a busy street corner. This bright and strong-willed girl possesses a strange and wonderful ability: the power to stop the rain and clear the sky.', 'The summer of his high school freshman year, Hodaka runs away from his remote island home to Tokyo, and quickly finds himself pushed to his financial and personal limits. The weather is unusually gloomy and rainy every day, as if taking its cue from his life. After many days of solitude, he finally finds work as a freelance writer for a mysterious occult magazine. Then, one day, Hodaka meets Hina on a busy street corner. This bright and strong-willed girl possesses a strange and wonderful ability: the power to stop the rain and clear the sky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgrk7r1fV4IjuoeiGS5HOhXNdLJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568160'),
  ('301410971607446476', 'Web of Seduction', 1999, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Ben Kufrin, Craig Borden, A. Brooks Medoff', 'Blain Brown', 'Lauren Hays, Eric Acsell, Tracy Ryan, Franc Luz, Michael A. George, Nancy O''Brien', 'R', 'In this erotic tale of suspense, seduction, and murder, a cleaning woman finds herself working for two wives who are wealthy, idle, and ignored by their husbands. The maid persuades the two woman to kill each other''s spouses and live happily ever after off the proceeds of their hubbies'' valuable art collections. However, the plan does not go as expected, and the conspirators find that their own lives are in danger.', 'In this erotic tale of suspense, seduction, and murder, a cleaning woman finds herself working for two wives who are wealthy, idle, and ignored by their husbands. The maid persuades the two woman to kill each other''s spouses and live happily ever after off the proceeds of their hubbies'' valuable art collections. However, the plan does not go as expected, and the conspirators find that their own lives are in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5t78ABdJ8fj0OFHcQ6tFJI8XSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362062'),
  ('209761776244978779', 'Web of the Spider', 1971, 'Horror', 'Antonio Margheriti, Guglielmo Mancori, Sandro Mancori', 'Bruno Corbucci, Giovanni Grimaldi, Antonio Margheriti', 'Anthony Franciosa, Michèle Mercier, Klaus Kinski, Peter Carsten, Silvano Tranquilli, Karin Field, Irina Maleeva, Raf Baldassarre', 'R', 'Alan Foster, a professional American journalist, travels to London to meet with Edgar Allan Poe for an interview. While in London, Alan soon finds himself in the company of Lord Blackwood, and Alan accepts a bet to spend a night in his castle', 'Alan Foster, a professional American journalist, travels to London to meet with Edgar Allan Poe for an interview. While in London, Alan soon finds himself in the company of Lord Blackwood, and Alan accepts a bet to spend a night in his castle', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FBfPu9jSdSBw0ZarW9UFeP9BvU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49130'),
  ('28673650281420925', 'Webmaster', 1998, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Thomas Borch Nielsen, Lars Beyer', 'Thomas Borch Nielsen', 'Lars Bom, Puk Scharbau, Jørgen Kiil, Mads Parsum, Dorte Westh Lehrmann, Flemming Jetmar, Sonnich Morgenstern, Alexandre Willaume', null, 'J.B. (Lars Bom) - an ultra-talented Webmaster of an illicit cyber-domain known for massive amounts of illegal money transfers is captured and is put under suspicion by the cyber-domain boss named Stoiss (Jørgen Kiil) when an intruder hacks into the system and steals the Stoiss’s money. Stoiss sticks a heart controller device on J.B. and gives him 35 hours to find who took his money or he dies.', 'J.B. (Lars Bom) - an ultra-talented Webmaster of an illicit cyber-domain known for massive amounts of illegal money transfers is captured and is put under suspicion by the cyber-domain boss named Stoiss (Jørgen Kiil) when an intruder hacks into the system and steals the Stoiss’s money. Stoiss sticks a heart controller device on J.B. and gives him 35 hours to find who took his money or he dies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hLf42osBftIxFf7AwYcoqjJWjpl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16909'),
  ('380281147593562905', 'Wedding', 1944, 'Comedy', 'Isidor Annensky, Yuri Yekelchik, Tamara Lobova', 'Isidor Annensky', 'Faina Ranevskaya, Aleksei Gribov, Zoya Fyodorova, Erast Garin, Mikhail Yanshin, Sergei Martinson, Vera Maretskaya, Nikolai Plotnikov', null, 'According to the eponymous vaudeville by A.P. Chekhov. Petty bourgeois Zhigalovs, whose daughter-in-law Dasha is being extradited, find out to their horror that the official Aplombov, who has been caring for Dasha all summer, has dined every day with them and has proved himself to be his bridegroom, is not going to marry at all.', 'According to the eponymous vaudeville by A.P. Chekhov. Petty bourgeois Zhigalovs, whose daughter-in-law Dasha is being extradited, find out to their horror that the official Aplombov, who has been caring for Dasha all summer, has dined every day with them and has proved himself to be his bridegroom, is not going to marry at all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kA3uHUmZBFxYMRKvHwaNkzXE5xW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270910'),
  ('604165290302393581', 'Wedding Association', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Selçuk Aydemir, Birkan Pusa, Yunus Emre Yurtseven', 'Selçuk Aydemir', 'Ahmet Kural, Murat Cemcir, Rasim Öztekin, Devrim Yakut, Barış Yıldız, İnan Ulaş Torun, Şinasi Yurtsever, Zerrin Sümer', null, 'Ismail''s son, Tarik returns to his village after long years of being away and announces that he is engaged to a Latvian woman named Nugesha and although he doesn''t have the means for it, Ismail still wants to be the one who pays for the expenses of the wedding. Several problems ensue as he tries to make sure that there is enough money for the wedding.', 'Ismail''s son, Tarik returns to his village after long years of being away and announces that he is engaged to a Latvian woman named Nugesha and although he doesn''t have the means for it, Ismail still wants to be the one who pays for the expenses of the wedding. Several problems ensue as he tries to make sure that there is enough money for the wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlkjSMHJvgqOTMa2cQyn9GscA8E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246524'),
  ('904176325168675944', 'Wedding Association 2: Circumcision', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Cem Terbiyeli, Ercan Eyigün, Vedat Uyar', 'Selçuk Aydemir', 'Ahmet Kural, Murat Cemcir, Rasim Öztekin, Barış Yıldız, Devrim Yakut, Şinasi Yurtsever, İnan Ulaş Torun, Ayhan Taş', null, 'Ismail and his old screwball crew land themselves in hot water when his grandson''s circumcision evolves into a buzz-making citywide event.', 'Ismail and his old screwball crew land themselves in hot water when his grandson''s circumcision evolves into a buzz-making citywide event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDwthBPG9MH75pQMMwmEciJf3j6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371153'),
