  ('534266715442631785', 'Wedding Crashers', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Dobkin, Julio Macat, Phil Pastuhov', 'Steve Faber, Bob Fisher', 'Owen Wilson, Vince Vaughn, Christopher Walken, Rachel McAdams, Isla Fisher, Jane Seymour, Ellen Albertini Dow, Keir O''Donnell', 'R', 'John and his buddy Jeremy are emotional criminals who know how to use a woman''s hopes and dreams for their own carnal gain. Their modus operandi: crashing weddings. Normally, they meet guests who want to toast the romantic day with a random hook-up. But when John meets Claire, he discovers what true love – and heartache – feels like.', 'John and his buddy Jeremy are emotional criminals who know how to use a woman''s hopes and dreams for their own carnal gain. Their modus operandi: crashing weddings. Normally, they meet guests who want to toast the romantic day with a random hook-up. But when John meets Claire, he discovers what true love – and heartache – feels like.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFM3lk2zVzC1YFnKm0r6LbFPyRu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9522'),
  ('828692274612931169', 'Wedding Daze', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Ian Black, Eric Henriquez, John Greenway', 'Michael Ian Black', 'Jason Biggs, Isla Fisher, Michael Weston, Ebon Moss-Bachrach, Joe Pantoliano, Heather Goldenhersh, Joanna Gleason, Edward Herrmann', 'R', 'After losing the woman of his dreams, Anderson is convinced he''ll never fall in love again. But at the urging of his best friend, he spontaneously proposes to a dissatisfied waitress named Katie and an innocent dare evolves into the kind of love that both have been looking for all along.', 'After losing the woman of his dreams, Anderson is convinced he''ll never fall in love again. But at the urging of his best friend, he spontaneously proposes to a dissatisfied waitress named Katie and an innocent dare evolves into the kind of love that both have been looking for all along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDqYrYciP76wfzmAqB8SLO5j6f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7839'),
  ('483474148227922909', 'Wedding Dress', 2010, 'Drama', 'Baek Dong-hyeon, Kwon Hyung-jin, Park Gun-woo', 'Yu Young-ah', 'Song Yun-ah, Kim Hyang-gi, Kim Myeong-kuk, Jeon Mi-seon, Kim Yeo-jin, Kim Ye-ryeong, Lee Ki-woo, Chae Sang-woo', null, 'When a single mother learns that she has terminal cancer, she prepares her young daughter to live without her, while saying goodbye to others around her.', 'When a single mother learns that she has terminal cancer, she prepares her young daughter to live without her, while saying goodbye to others around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nj1GiuU0zfGBtPvsgMUaXPlMct.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205218'),
  ('528461592546666627', 'Wedding Every Weekend', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Kevin Fair, Shawn Seifert', 'Julie Sherman Wolfe', 'Kimberley Sustad, Paul Campbell, Brandi Alexander, Jaime M. Callica, Malcolm Stewart, Nicole Major, Chris Ippolito, Princess Davis', null, 'Nate and Brooke are going to the same four weddings, four weekends in a row. To avoid the singles tables and set-ups, they agree to go together as "wedding buddies." But what starts as a friendship soon becomes something deeper.', 'Nate and Brooke are going to the same four weddings, four weekends in a row. To avoid the singles tables and set-ups, they agree to go together as "wedding buddies." But what starts as a friendship soon becomes something deeper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4SuUiPEtsk61VNVKpO8ayF9M4A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:725854'),
  ('436434547555050545', 'Wedding Fever in Campobello', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Neele Vollmar', 'Daniel Speck, Jan Weiler', 'Lino Banfi, Christian Ulmen, Mina Tander, Maren Kroymann, Gundi Ellert, Peter Prager, Paolo De Vita, Ludovica Modugno', null, 'When Jan decides to marry his girl-friend Sara, he is not aware of his opponent: her father, who is an Italian.', 'When Jan decides to marry his girl-friend Sara, he is not aware of his opponent: her father, who is an Italian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vypsnoxI3ACS5CMAuP76QNAJIU3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24631'),
  ('526845213732985185', 'Wedding for Money', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Cristian Ilișuan', 'Cristian Ilișuan, Mircea Popa', 'Mircea Popa, Alexandra Spătărelu, Adrian Cucu, Elena Ivanca, Dan Chiorean, Adriana Băilescu, Catalin Herlo, Elena Moldovan', null, 'Mircea hates weddings. And everyone knows that until he makes a controversial post on Facebook that goes viral. Because he has to return a huge amount of money due to wrong decisions, the only solution for him remains his own wedding.', 'Mircea hates weddings. And everyone knows that until he makes a controversial post on Facebook that goes viral. Because he has to return a huge amount of money due to wrong decisions, the only solution for him remains his own wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyNUW7bUvc2KLy0IZUhOb18coVd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1189532'),
  ('904386815216548446', 'Wedding High', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Akiko Ohku, Natsuyo Nakamura', 'Bakarhythm', 'Ryoko Shinohara, Tomoya Nakamura, Nagisa Sekimizu, Takanori Iwata, Osamu Mukai, Akiyoshi Nakao, Yōsuke Asari, Tomoya Maeno', null, 'What''s the biggest event for a couple? A wedding! The goofy but earnest Akito Ishikawa and the always cheerful Haruka Nitta are about to tie the knot. Thanks to the help of their wedding planner Nakagoshi, they''ve finally made it to the day of the wedding.', 'What''s the biggest event for a couple? A wedding! The goofy but earnest Akito Ishikawa and the always cheerful Haruka Nitta are about to tie the knot. Thanks to the help of their wedding planner Nakagoshi, they''ve finally made it to the day of the wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MYvDAxWQlPVimBo1aFf7dCV5c2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:912632'),
  ('1038903700399567690', 'Wedding in Blood', 1973, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Jean Rabier, Claude Chabrol', 'Claude Chabrol', 'Michel Piccoli, Stéphane Audran, Claude Piéplu, Clotilde Joano, Eliana De Santis, François Robert, Pippo Mérisi, Ermanno Casanova', 'PG', 'In a small French town, the mayor discovers his wife is cheating on him, a betrayal that eventually leads to murder.', 'In a small French town, the mayor discovers his wife is cheating on him, a betrayal that eventually leads to murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BAC8HGlfSfZobuN3WGzjaieZDt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42463'),
  ('944087800393769224', 'Wedding in Galilee', 1987, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michel Khleifi, Walther van den Ende', 'Michel Khleifi', 'Mohamad Ali El Akili, Bushra Karaman, Makram J. Khoury, Yussuf Abu-Warda, Anna Condo, Nazih Akleh, Sonia Amar, Eyad Anis', null, 'A Palestinian seeks Israeli permission to waive curfew to give his son a fine wedding. The military governor''s condition is that he and his officers attend. The groom berates his father for agreeing. Women ritually prepare the bride; men prepare the groom. Guests gather. The Arab youths plot violence. One Israeli officer swoons in the heat and Arab women take her into the cool house. A thoroughbred gets loose and runs to a mined field; soldiers and Arabs must cooperate to rescue it. As darkness falls, tensions between army and villagers rise, and the groom''s wedding-night anger and impotence threaten family dignity and honor. Can cool heads prevail?', 'A Palestinian seeks Israeli permission to waive curfew to give his son a fine wedding. The military governor''s condition is that he and his officers attend. The groom berates his father for agreeing. Women ritually prepare the bride; men prepare the groom. Guests gather. The Arab youths plot violence. One Israeli officer swoons in the heat and Arab women take her into the cool house. A thoroughbred gets loose and runs to a mined field; soldiers and Arabs must cooperate to rescue it. As darkness falls, tensions between army and villagers rise, and the groom''s wedding-night anger and impotence threaten family dignity and honor. Can cool heads prevail?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vr59JpOje6I21Ij8BS4M9MKJb36.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49168'),
  ('353093721520993417', 'Wedding in Malinovka', 1967, 'Comedy, War, Romance', 'Andrei Tutyshkin, Vyacheslav Fastovich, V. Kabanov', 'Leonid Yukhvid', 'Vladimir Samoylov, Lyudmyla Alfimova, Valentina Lysenko, Yevgeni Lebedev, Zoya Fyodorova, Geliy Sysoev, Mikhail Pugovkin, Nikolai Slichenko', null, 'The movie takes place during Russia''s civil war between the Reds (Bolsheviks) and the Whites (Mensheviks). Andrejka and Yarinka are a young betrothed couple in the village of Malinovka, caught between the battle lines. Gritsian is the leader of a Menshevik band who are planning to attack the village. Yarinka appeals to the local Bolshevik commander for his faction''s help. The Bolsheviks quickly come up with a plan to save the village... but the plan requires Yarinka to enter into a pretend marriage with Gritsian.', 'The movie takes place during Russia''s civil war between the Reds (Bolsheviks) and the Whites (Mensheviks). Andrejka and Yarinka are a young betrothed couple in the village of Malinovka, caught between the battle lines. Gritsian is the leader of a Menshevik band who are planning to attack the village. Yarinka appeals to the local Bolshevik commander for his faction''s help. The Bolsheviks quickly come up with a plan to save the village... but the plan requires Yarinka to enter into a pretend marriage with Gritsian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxVGHc6slieNkMmXaShGk7LcJrw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20879'),
  ('30285059180847017', 'Wedding in Paris', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Claudio Risi, Davide Cincis, Alice Di Giacomo', 'Gianluca Bomprezzi, Edoardo Falcone, Massimo Boldi', 'Massimo Boldi, Anna Maria Barbera, Biagio Izzo, Paola Minaccioni, Enzo Salvi, Massimo Ceccherini, Loredana De Nardis, Rocco Siffredi', null, 'A businessman in Italy, who doesn''t pay any taxes, and a financier always on the hunt for tax evaders come into contact because their sons share an apartment in Paris.', 'A businessman in Italy, who doesn''t pay any taxes, and a financier always on the hunt for tax evaders come into contact because their sons share an apartment in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wArciwseGZc7BoCNB2kRAocZ7qP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76999'),
  ('134876496738363968', 'Wedding in White', 1972, 'Drama', 'William Fruet, Richard Leiterman', 'William Fruet', 'Carol Kane, Donald Pleasence, Doris Petrie, Leo Phillips, Christine Thomas, Paul Bradley, Doug McGrath, Bonnie Carol Case', 'R', 'A young girl''s brother comes home from the army, and brings an army buddy with him. The three of them go out that night to celebrate, and after much drinking has been done, the brother''s friend rapes the sister. After the two men have gone back, the girl finds that she''s pregnant--and discovers that her parents don''t blame the soldier, but blame her.', 'A young girl''s brother comes home from the army, and brings an army buddy with him. The three of them go out that night to celebrate, and after much drinking has been done, the brother''s friend rapes the sister. After the two men have gone back, the girl finds that she''s pregnant--and discovers that her parents don''t blame the soldier, but blame her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4GffwB2qRH1eofrgk9nWhZQudG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84642'),
  ('956600921288269575', 'Wedding like... Greek', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Vasilis Georgiadis, Aristeidis Karydis-Fuchs, Pavlos Filippou', 'Napoleon Eleftheriou, Vasilis Georgiadis, Giorgos Konstantinou', 'Xenia Kalogeropoulou, Giorgos Konstantinou, Despo Diamantidou, Smaro Stefanidou, Katerina Gogou, Harry Klynn, Tasos Giannopoulos, Vyron Seraidaris', null, 'Mina is dreaming of becoming a painter and Petros works in a company. They meet and fall in love during the carnival, but later lose contact. They meet again without recognizing each other and eventually get married. However they have no idea how hard marriage is.', 'Mina is dreaming of becoming a painter and Petros works in a company. They meet and fall in love during the carnival, but later lose contact. They meet again without recognizing each other and eventually get married. However they have no idea how hard marriage is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZXVgiZ30UjskIwq2143ZGF966z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288875'),
  ('98591380149596787', 'Wedding night', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Giannis Dalianidis, Dinos Mavroeidis', 'Panagiotis Papadoukas', 'Kostas Voutsas, Martha Karagianni, Faidon Georgitsis, Betty Arvaniti, Mary Lalopoulou, Giannis Vogiatzis, Giorgos Tsitsopoulos, Mary Metaxa', null, 'As fate would have it, four newly-weds who aren''t quite total strangers unknowingly reunite at a sea-side resort, eager to experience a hot wedding night. However, love isn''t always a bed of roses. Will their first night be unforgettable?', 'As fate would have it, four newly-weds who aren''t quite total strangers unknowingly reunite at a sea-side resort, eager to experience a hot wedding night. However, love isn''t always a bed of roses. Will their first night be unforgettable?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rX8D9GAjCYhvqPvgIGAagGJDfbE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313884'),
  ('917620657614105463', 'Wedding Present', 1936, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Wallace, Leon Shamroy, Boris Morros', 'Joseph Anthony', 'Joan Bennett, Cary Grant, George Bancroft, Conrad Nagel, Gene Lockhart, William Demarest, Inez Courtney, Edward Brophy', null, 'Charlie Mason and Rusty Fleming are star reporters on a Chicago tabloid who are romantically involved as well. Although skilled in ferreting out great stories, they often behave in an unprofessional and immature manner. After their shenanigans cause their frustrated city editor to resign, the publisher promotes Charlie to the job, a decision based on the premise that only a slacker would be able crack down on other shirkers and underachievers. His pomposity soon alienates most of his co-workers and causes Rusty to move to New York. Charlie resigns and along with gangster friend Smiles Benson tries to win Rusty back before she marries a stuffy society author.', 'Charlie Mason and Rusty Fleming are star reporters on a Chicago tabloid who are romantically involved as well. Although skilled in ferreting out great stories, they often behave in an unprofessional and immature manner. After their shenanigans cause their frustrated city editor to resign, the publisher promotes Charlie to the job, a decision based on the premise that only a slacker would be able crack down on other shirkers and underachievers. His pomposity soon alienates most of his co-workers and causes Rusty to move to New York. Charlie resigns and along with gangster friend Smiles Benson tries to win Rusty back before she marries a stuffy society author.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRnkLWkYfCszBTzzjL5cnBEFZOG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81117'),
  ('667108465356945438', 'Wedding Ring', 1950, 'Drama, Romance', 'Keisuke Kinoshita, Hiroshi Kusuda', 'Keisuke Kinoshita', 'Kinuyo Tanaka, Toshirō Mifune, Jūkichi Uno, Kenji Susukida, Nobuko Otowa, Mitsuko Yoshikawa, Junji Masuda, Eiko Takamatsu', null, 'A jewelry store president begins to fall for the doctor treating her husband''s illness.', 'A jewelry store president begins to fall for the doctor treating her husband''s illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5gAbLNuvYQSNV54CRpD7MSbNMt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219244'),
  ('1019582244721731272', 'Wedding Season', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Tom Dey, Meena Singh', 'Shiwani Srivastava', 'Pallavi Sharda, Suraj Sharma, Arianna Afsar, Sean Kleier, Veena Sood, Rizwan Manji, Ruth Goodwin, Damian Thompson', null, 'Pressured by their immigrant parents to find spouses, two Indian-Americans pretend to date in order to survive a summer of weddings – but find themselves falling for each other as they struggle to balance who they are with who their parents want them to be.', 'Pressured by their immigrant parents to find spouses, two Indian-Americans pretend to date in order to survive a summer of weddings – but find themselves falling for each other as they struggle to balance who they are with who their parents want them to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFeXAZ1oOECPqEu8c2i4L5LmNyY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:818612'),
  ('403101193669480365', 'Wedding Trough', 1975, 'Horror, Romance', 'Thierry Zéno, Laurette Blanariu, Jean-Pol Ferbus', 'John Kupferschmidt, Thierry Zéno, Dominique Garny', 'Dominique Garny', null, 'Alone on a farm, a man spends his days tending to his animals, with a particular love for his sow. After an illicit encounter between the two creatures, the pig gives birth. However, tragedy strikes when the man tries to force the newborn piglets to love him as he loves them.', 'Alone on a farm, a man spends his days tending to his animals, with a particular love for his sow. After an illicit encounter between the two creatures, the pig gives birth. However, tragedy strikes when the man tries to force the newborn piglets to love him as he loves them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYO7GWQjVOuPxjtmVGR6MZx6YNG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35862'),
  ('567301691381735204', 'Wedding Unplanned', 2017, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Reem Kherici, Pierre-Hugues Galien', 'Reem Kherici, Stéphane Kazandjian', 'Reem Kherici, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Julia Piaton, Sylvie Testud, François-Xavier Demaison, Chantal Lauby, Lionnel Astier, Ève Saint-Louis', null, 'When she discovers a wedding planer''s business card, Alexia instantly says, "YES" to Mathias unaware that it belongs to his mistress. The groom is now trapped between his bride, and his lover who in charge of his unwanted marriage.', 'When she discovers a wedding planer''s business card, Alexia instantly says, "YES" to Mathias unaware that it belongs to his mistress. The groom is now trapped between his bride, and his lover who in charge of his unwanted marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9Xh6548vTyNhgTcWqFCE8MmdHv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438347'),
  ('217844235788520200', 'Wedding Wars', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Jim Fall, Ron Stannett, David Carruthers', 'Stephen Mazur', 'John Stamos, Eric Dane, Bonnie Somerville, Sean Maher, James Brolin, Rosemary Dunsmore, Jayne Eastwood, Sean McCann', 'NR', 'Ben, a slightly uptight man, ends up hiring his gay brother Shel, a party planner, to be his wedding planner. The two seem to be getting along famously, but then in the midst of planning, politics enters the fray. Ben is engaged to the governor''s daughter, and the governor has taken a public stance against same sex marriage. Though his constituents seem to approve of his political agenda, Shel doesn''t. And he shows his displeasure by walking off the job and going on strike for equal rights.', 'Ben, a slightly uptight man, ends up hiring his gay brother Shel, a party planner, to be his wedding planner. The two seem to be getting along famously, but then in the midst of planning, politics enters the fray. Ben is engaged to the governor''s daughter, and the governor has taken a public stance against same sex marriage. Though his constituents seem to approve of his political agenda, Shel doesn''t. And he shows his displeasure by walking off the job and going on strike for equal rights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnFmK2rQ7pbSEpRujxJ0VSSPGzQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20085'),
  ('591182783667573397', 'Weddings and Other Disasters', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Nina Di Majo, Cesare Accetta', 'Antonio Leotti, Francesco Bruni, Nina Di Majo', 'Margherita Buy, Fabio Volo, Luciana Littizzetto, Francesca Inaudi, Marisa Berenson, Italo Dall''Orto, Gianna Giachetti, Massimo De Francovich', null, 'A single, independent woman finds herself organizing her sister''s wedding with the help of her future brother-in-law.', 'A single, independent woman finds herself organizing her sister''s wedding with the help of her future brother-in-law.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Re6tPytooXNRAwfwWkWOnZY1pW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44897'),
  ('817375238702710913', 'Weddings and Wokes: A Family Dilemma', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Sönke Wortmann, Andreas Berger, Thomas Schiller', 'Claudius Pläging', 'Christoph Maria Herbst, Caroline Peters, Florian David Fitz, Janina Uhse, Iris Berben, Justus von Dohnányi, Kya-Celina Barucki, Jona Volkmann', null, 'Anna and Thomas want to get married in the South Tyrolean Alps. However, Stephan''s daughter Antigone and the family clan bring so much chaos to the planned idyll that it''s not just the wedding that is on the rocks.', 'Anna and Thomas want to get married in the South Tyrolean Alps. However, Stephan''s daughter Antigone and the family clan bring so much chaos to the planned idyll that it''s not just the wedding that is on the rocks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xS0IqNxxpEHJHOZy3ky3IwbfzXt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1219552'),
  ('161002474177957767', 'Weddings, christenings and funerals', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Alexandru Lustig', 'Alexandru Lustig', 'Șerban Pavlu, Andreea Mateiu, Gheorghe Ifrim, Anca Sigartău, Ioan Ionescu, Dan Radulescu, Nicodim Ungureanu, Ruxandra Maniu', null, 'Cosmin plays a tennis game with 3 friends. He looks at the clock and starts panicking: he is late to the Registry Office, to a wedding- his wedding, with his ex-wife, who he had divorced without his friends knowing. Everything starts in 2007 when the real-estate bubble reaches its peak. Cosmin gifts Reli a land on the edge of a lake, for their wedding anniversary. He plans to build 7 villas, sell them and win 1 million Euros.', 'Cosmin plays a tennis game with 3 friends. He looks at the clock and starts panicking: he is late to the Registry Office, to a wedding- his wedding, with his ex-wife, who he had divorced without his friends knowing. Everything starts in 2007 when the real-estate bubble reaches its peak. Cosmin gifts Reli a land on the edge of a lake, for their wedding anniversary. He plans to build 7 villas, sell them and win 1 million Euros.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQGSj7rWqojOGPp0NEVcb4P04GG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1023273'),
  ('349799823921796406', 'Wedlock', 1991, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, Crime, TV Movie', 'Lewis Teague, Dietrich Lohmann', 'Broderick Miller', 'Rutger Hauer, Mimi Rogers, Joan Chen, James Remar, Stephen Tobolowsky, Basil Wallace, Grand L. Bush, Denis Forest', 'R', 'A male prison escapee heads for his hidden loot, electronically attached to a female prisoner.', 'A male prison escapee heads for his hidden loot, electronically attached to a female prisoner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQNEJIKeCk9wNXRW7a2FiNCR3ie.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2125'),
  ('395135748994115518', 'Wedlock House: An Intercourse', 1959, 'Romance', 'Stan Brakhage, Jane Wodening', null, 'Jane Wodening, Stan Brakhage', null, 'We see a film negative of a nude couple embracing in bed. Then, back in regular black and white images, we see them alone and together, clothed, at home. It''s night, she sees his reflection in the window, she closes the drapes. After sex, again in a black and white negative, they sit, smoke, have coffee. They kiss, she smiles. They light candles. The images are often quick, the camera angles occasionally are off kilter; the room is sometimes dark and sometimes lit, as if lit by the rotating of a searchlight. The images again appear in negative when they return to bed.', 'We see a film negative of a nude couple embracing in bed. Then, back in regular black and white images, we see them alone and together, clothed, at home. It''s night, she sees his reflection in the window, she closes the drapes. After sex, again in a black and white negative, they sit, smoke, have coffee. They kiss, she smiles. They light candles. The images are often quick, the camera angles occasionally are off kilter; the room is sometimes dark and sometimes lit, as if lit by the rotating of a searchlight. The images again appear in negative when they return to bed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35RnrSQaeQJo34xMwdRYSJyFcuk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126128'),
  ('172699599972441609', 'Wednesdays Don''t Exist', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Peris Romano, Jon D. Domínguez', 'Peris Romano', 'Inma Cuesta, Gorka Otxoa, María León, Eduardo Noriega, William Miller, Alexandra Jiménez, Andrea Duro, Juan Carlos Lares', null, 'Three men and three women cross each others'' paths at different times and places in Madrid during their daily life and amorous pursuits.', 'Three men and three women cross each others'' paths at different times and places in Madrid during their daily life and amorous pursuits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcnGm7r0H2RF5aZuBfmD5iQ2T0w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340144'),
  ('1050711920695879551', 'Wee Sing in the Marvelous Musical Mansion', 1992, 'Family', null, null, 'Vana O''Brien, Steve Smith, Ariel Aver, L''Kaika Young, Dana Young, Duffy Epstein, Tony St. Clair, Burl Ross', 'G', 'A mysterious package from Timbuktu? A door knocker that rattles off riddles? Music boxes that come to life? Piccolo Pizza and Piano Pudding? Where will you find such magical, musical, mysterious things? At Uncle Rubato’s Marvelous Musical Mansion! Dance and sing in every room with enchanting new friends and help Uncle Rubato, Aunty Annabella, Alex, Benji, and Kelly solve a most baffling mystery---who or what took all the missing musical treasures? Enjoy this wholesome entertainment for the entire family. Dazzling sets and over 20 uplifting song and dance numbers showcase adorable characters who inspire the love of music while sharing important values including self-esteem and being considerate of others.', 'A mysterious package from Timbuktu? A door knocker that rattles off riddles? Music boxes that come to life? Piccolo Pizza and Piano Pudding? Where will you find such magical, musical, mysterious things? At Uncle Rubato’s Marvelous Musical Mansion! Dance and sing in every room with enchanting new friends and help Uncle Rubato, Aunty Annabella, Alex, Benji, and Kelly solve a most baffling mystery---who or what took all the missing musical treasures? Enjoy this wholesome entertainment for the entire family. Dazzling sets and over 20 uplifting song and dance numbers showcase adorable characters who inspire the love of music while sharing important values including self-esteem and being considerate of others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHLxG2wASGGnddkjlomCUIbhD11.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208816'),
  ('703386351365168255', 'Wee Wee Monsieur', 1938, 'Comedy', 'Del Lord', 'Searle Kramer', 'Curly Howard, Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Vernon Dent, William Irving, Bud Jamison', 'NR', 'The Stooges are artists living in Paris. When the landlord comes after the overdue rent, the boys skip out and wind up joining the French Foreign Legion. Posted to the desert, their assignment is to guard captain Gorgonzola from the natives. When the captain is kidnapped, the boys must disguise themselves as harem girls to infiltrate the chieftains hideout and rescue him.', 'The Stooges are artists living in Paris. When the landlord comes after the overdue rent, the boys skip out and wind up joining the French Foreign Legion. Posted to the desert, their assignment is to guard captain Gorgonzola from the natives. When the captain is kidnapped, the boys must disguise themselves as harem girls to infiltrate the chieftains hideout and rescue him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tIxy8spRO2XhwXiLo1fIyB3VhVh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114627'),
  ('780618148267540517', 'Wee Willie Winkie', 1937, 'Adventure, Family', 'John Ford, Edward O''Fearna, Arthur C. Miller', 'Ernest Pascal, Julien Josephson', 'Shirley Temple, Victor McLaglen, C. Aubrey Smith, June Lang, Michael Whalen, Cesar Romero, Constance Collier, Douglas Scott', 'NR', 'In 1897, little Priscilla Williams, along with her widowed mother, goes to live with her army colonel paternal grandfather on the British outpost he commands in northern India.', 'In 1897, little Priscilla Williams, along with her widowed mother, goes to live with her army colonel paternal grandfather on the British outpost he commands in northern India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpCZvLxpgJFzuClBdy6NcdsxCZn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43869'),
  ('618681923294200949', 'Weeding Night', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Osvaldo Benavides', 'Osvaldo Benavides, Issa López', 'Osvaldo Benavides, Ludwika Paleta, Marcela Guirado, Fernando Álvarez Rebeil, Ricardo Polanco, Daniel Tovar, Verónica Langer, Alexandra Dunnet', null, 'Lucía and Nico, the couple of the century, are about to say yes... although not with each other. It turns out that they both decided to get married on the same day and in the same place, but with other people.', 'Lucía and Nico, the couple of the century, are about to say yes... although not with each other. It turns out that they both decided to get married on the same day and in the same place, but with other people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2iQoSPyAGHseY5NhMM28orLkxjq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1211307'),
  ('577139085703074690', 'Weeds', 1987, 'Drama', 'John D. Hancock, Jan Weincke', 'John D. Hancock, Dorothy Tristan', 'Nick Nolte, Ernie Hudson, Rita Taggart, Mark Rolston, Lane Smith, John Toles-Bey, Joe Mantegna, Essex Smith', 'R', 'A San Quentin inmate, sentenced to life without parole, writes a play that catches the interest of a reporter.', 'A San Quentin inmate, sentenced to life without parole, writes a play that catches the interest of a reporter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GVWnb769243POxPy3f9OiyWdK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96333'),
  ('836945207279871298', 'Week-End at the Waldorf', 1945, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Z. Leonard, Robert H. Planck, Johnny Green', 'Sam Spewack, Bella Spewack', 'Ginger Rogers, Lana Turner, Walter Pidgeon, Van Johnson, Edward Arnold, Keenan Wynn, Robert Benchley, Phyllis Thaxter', 'NR', 'Anything can happen during a weekend at New York''s Waldorf-Astoria: a glamorous movie star meets a world-weary war correspondent and mistakes him for a jewel thief; a soldier learns that without an operation he''ll die and so looks for one last romance with a beautiful but ambitious stenographer; a cub reporter tries to get the goods on a shady man''s dealing with a foreign potentate.', 'Anything can happen during a weekend at New York''s Waldorf-Astoria: a glamorous movie star meets a world-weary war correspondent and mistakes him for a jewel thief; a soldier learns that without an operation he''ll die and so looks for one last romance with a beautiful but ambitious stenographer; a cub reporter tries to get the goods on a shady man''s dealing with a foreign potentate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3W4gxPk730tRJxZG0d4sv2eNhdq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94881'),
  ('50427027643281815', 'Week-End in Havana', 1941, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Walter Lang, Ernest Palmer', 'Karl Tunberg, Darrell Ware', 'Alice Faye, Carmen Miranda, John Payne, Cesar Romero, Cobina Wright, George Barbier, Sheldon Leonard, Leonid Kinskey', null, 'A ship company employee, Jay Williams, is sent to Florida where one of the company cruise ships is stuck on a reef off of the coast. He obtains waivers from all of the passengers with the exception of Nan Spencer, a department store salesgirl who wants her vacation now, not later. Jay is instructed to take Nan to Havana, set her up in the best hotel, and keep her entertained. She visits a nightclub where the star attraction is Rosita Rivas and meets Rosita''s worthless manager, Monte Blanca, who makes a play for her. Trouble also comes in the form of Jay''s fiancée, Terry McCracken, when a romance develops between Nan and Jay.', 'A ship company employee, Jay Williams, is sent to Florida where one of the company cruise ships is stuck on a reef off of the coast. He obtains waivers from all of the passengers with the exception of Nan Spencer, a department store salesgirl who wants her vacation now, not later. Jay is instructed to take Nan to Havana, set her up in the best hotel, and keep her entertained. She visits a nightclub where the star attraction is Rosita Rivas and meets Rosita''s worthless manager, Monte Blanca, who makes a play for her. Trouble also comes in the form of Jay''s fiancée, Terry McCracken, when a romance develops between Nan and Jay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgtPWHz2wyqw1BsJLdb0DJpBqJf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68013'),
  ('300176127354589997', 'Week-ends', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Anne Villacèque, Pierre Milon', 'Gilles Taurand', 'Karin Viard, Noémie Lvovsky, Jacques Gamblin, Ulrich Tukur, Aurélia Petit, Iliana Zabeth, Gisèle Casadesus', null, 'It sometimes takes little to spoil a weekend in the country. A simple misunderstanding in a supermarket parking lot, a bad reaction, and there you go, everything is awry. Nothing is going well for Christine. Jean leaves her. Her oldest friends, Sylvette and Ulrich, are no longer such good friends. Everything is falling apart at the seams. But life is always full of surprises.', 'It sometimes takes little to spoil a weekend in the country. A simple misunderstanding in a supermarket parking lot, a bad reaction, and there you go, everything is awry. Nothing is going well for Christine. Jean leaves her. Her oldest friends, Sylvette and Ulrich, are no longer such good friends. Everything is falling apart at the seams. But life is always full of surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9U2s4QlMpQqN9M17UluDGHr5YLp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257381'),
  ('1124527866847258784', 'Weekend', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Raoul Coutard, Jean-Luc Godard, Claude Miller', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Mireille Darc, Jean Yanne, Jean-Pierre Kalfon, Yves Afonso, Yves Beneyton, Juliet Berto, Michèle Breton, Michel Cournot', 'R', 'A supposedly idyllic weekend trip to the countryside turns into a never-ending nightmare of traffic jams, revolution, cannibalism and murder as French bourgeois society starts to collapse under the weight of its own consumer preoccupations.', 'A supposedly idyllic weekend trip to the countryside turns into a never-ending nightmare of traffic jams, revolution, cannibalism and murder as French bourgeois society starts to collapse under the weight of its own consumer preoccupations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9p8VdsAKXz1GoVXD36Lg5e3YKo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8075'),
