  ('772447550179728859', 'Weekend', 2020, 'Thriller', 'Timoty Aliprandi, Riccardo Grandi', 'Claudia De Angelis, Riccardo Grandi, Alfredo Arciero', 'Alessio Lapice, Eugenio Franceschini, Jacopo Olmo Antinori, Filippo Scicchitano, Lorenzo Zurzolo, Greta Ferro, Walter Cordopatri, Sara Ricci', null, 'A bunch of friends stuck in a mountain shelter during a snowstorm on a weekend. They will find out that the only way to be safe is to solve a disturbing mistery that involves all of them: finding out who in the past, has committed a terrible crime. Amid shocking and unexpected revelations, they will come to doubt each other.', 'A bunch of friends stuck in a mountain shelter during a snowstorm on a weekend. They will find out that the only way to be safe is to solve a disturbing mistery that involves all of them: finding out who in the past, has committed a terrible crime. Amid shocking and unexpected revelations, they will come to doubt each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ev9xDk9Mrl5aJV64z8BB1V1Hv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:672154'),
  ('860395578229690481', 'Weekend at Bernie''s', 1989, 'Comedy, Crime', 'François Protat, Ted Kotcheff, Conrad E. Palmisano', 'Robert Klane', 'Andrew McCarthy, Jonathan Silverman, Catherine Mary Stewart, Terry Kiser, Don Calfa, Catherine Parks, Eloise DeJoria, Gregory Salata', 'PG-13', 'Two young insurance corporation employees try to pretend that their murdered employer is alive by puppeteering his dead body, leading a hitman to attempt to track him down to finish him off.', 'Two young insurance corporation employees try to pretend that their murdered employer is alive by puppeteering his dead body, leading a hitman to attempt to track him down to finish him off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RtjBkBSqHG46uieHgTtM7oKlpo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8491'),
  ('122988426298659696', 'Weekend at Bernie''s II', 1993, 'Comedy, Crime, Adventure', 'Edward Morey III, Robert Klane, J. Tom Archuleta', 'Robert Klane', 'Andrew McCarthy, Jonathan Silverman, Terry Kiser, Troy Byer, Barry Bostwick, Tom Wright, Steve James, Novella Nelson', 'PG', 'Everybody''s favorite stiff is back! Working fools Larry Wilson and Richard Parker have uncovered a dirty, little secret: Their former boss, Bernie Lomax, embezzled $2 million and placed it in a safe deposit box in the Caribbean. Now, the boys are ready to go after the loot, but they can''t do it alone -- they need poor Bernie''s help. Can the buddies give their ex-boss new life?', 'Everybody''s favorite stiff is back! Working fools Larry Wilson and Richard Parker have uncovered a dirty, little secret: Their former boss, Bernie Lomax, embezzled $2 million and placed it in a safe deposit box in the Caribbean. Now, the boys are ready to go after the loot, but they can''t do it alone -- they need poor Bernie''s help. Can the buddies give their ex-boss new life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ylN3DZEPCnn60ecGq01y0AyWsTQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8494'),
  ('867880469631313720', 'Weekend at Dunkirk', 1964, 'Drama, War', 'Henri Verneuil, Henri Decaë, Pierre Cavassilas', null, 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Catherine Spaak, Georges Géret, Jean-Pierre Marielle, François Périer, Pierre Mondy, Ronald Howard, Dominique Zardi', 'NR', 'In June 1940, during the Dunkirk evacuation of Allied troops to England, French sergeant Julien Maillat and his men debate whether to evacuate to Britain or stay and fight the German troops that are closing-in from all directions.', 'In June 1940, during the Dunkirk evacuation of Allied troops to England, French sergeant Julien Maillat and his men debate whether to evacuate to Britain or stay and fight the German troops that are closing-in from all directions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAccmjsaK4bCtA7lBDYTK2p1GuI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75525'),
  ('221081456063155022', 'Weekend Couple', 2016, 'Romance', 'Gi Dae-ho', null, 'Jung Myung-seo, Kang Ye-na, Jang Seok-min, Ahn So-hee, Joo Ha-rin, Jo Ki-tae, Bae Geon-sik, Han Chae-you', null, 'Yeong-hoon realizes that he is strangely drawn to Mi-ran, a married woman, who is one of his colleagues at work and adored by many men. Yeong-hoon keeps flirting with her constantly and he finally ends up having a passionate sex with Mi-ran. He becomes deeply drowned into her allure. One day, Yeong-hoon receives a shocking video message when he visits Mi-ran’s house. The video informs him that Mi-ran’s couple has been using Yeong-hoon as their sex partner. Mi-ran’s husband, Jeong-wook invites him to join their games. Yeong-hoon cannot decide between his loving emotion for Mi-ran and his desire. Yeong-hoon after all tells the husband to let her go, because he is in love with Mi-ran. Jeong-wook accepts his request under one condition, which is that Yeong-hoon should have sex with Mi-ran in front of Jeong-wook. Yeong-hoon accepts the suggestion and starts having sex with Mi-ran in front of Jeong-wook, but he stops in the middle.', 'Yeong-hoon realizes that he is strangely drawn to Mi-ran, a married woman, who is one of his colleagues at work and adored by many men. Yeong-hoon keeps flirting with her constantly and he finally ends up having a passionate sex with Mi-ran. He becomes deeply drowned into her allure. One day, Yeong-hoon receives a shocking video message when he visits Mi-ran’s house. The video informs him that Mi-ran’s couple has been using Yeong-hoon as their sex partner. Mi-ran’s husband, Jeong-wook invites him to join their games. Yeong-hoon cannot decide between his loving emotion for Mi-ran and his desire. Yeong-hoon after all tells the husband to let her go, because he is in love with Mi-ran. Jeong-wook accepts his request under one condition, which is that Yeong-hoon should have sex with Mi-ran in front of Jeong-wook. Yeong-hoon accepts the suggestion and starts having sex with Mi-ran in front of Jeong-wook, but he stops in the middle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g97NphE53c4XaGlEN6z5QAkVJX1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410785'),
  ('392727774085776405', 'Weekend in Taipei', 2024, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'George Huang, Sylvia Liu Jing-Yi, Liang-Chun Lin', 'George Huang, Luc Besson', 'Luke Evans, Gwei Lun-mei, Sung Kang, Wyatt Yang, Pernell Walker, Zach Ireland, Patrick Lee, Virginia Chien', 'R', 'A former DEA agent and a former undercover operative revisit their romance during a fateful weekend in Taipei, unaware of the dangerous consequences of their past.', 'A former DEA agent and a former undercover operative revisit their romance during a fateful weekend in Taipei, unaware of the dangerous consequences of their past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSc0AUvs8mRy00R9y8QYEHWIAQ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1167271'),
  ('453711141631346648', 'Weekend of a Champion', 1972, 'Documentary', 'Frank Simon, Roman Polanski, Bill Brayne', 'Frank Simon', 'Roman Polanski, Jackie Stewart, Helen Stewart, François Cévert, Ken Tyrrell, Graham Hill, Ringo Starr, Joan Collins', null, 'Filmmaker Roman Polanski spends a weekend with world champion driver Jackie Stewart as he attempts to win the 1971 Monaco Grand Prix, offering an extraordinarily rare glimpse into the life of a gifted athlete at the height of his powers.', 'Filmmaker Roman Polanski spends a weekend with world champion driver Jackie Stewart as he attempts to win the 1971 Monaco Grand Prix, offering an extraordinarily rare glimpse into the life of a gifted athlete at the height of his powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81aJcjM7eqBIIWSiive0arOejck.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196253'),
  ('389516675897257633', 'Weekend Rebels', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marc Rothemund, Philip Peschlow', 'Richard Kropf', 'Florian David Fitz, Aylin Tezel, Cecilio Andresen, Joachim Król, Petra-Maria Cammin, Leslie Malton, Milena Dreißig, Nela Bartsch', null, 'Mirco von Juterczenka''s novel "Wir Wochenendrebellen" is the story of a father and his ten-year-old son, who is Asperger''s autistic. The boy has set his mind on finally finding his favourite football club. But his selection criteria are very specific and besides, he wants to experience all the clubs (no matter in which league they play) live in the stadium.', 'Mirco von Juterczenka''s novel "Wir Wochenendrebellen" is the story of a father and his ten-year-old son, who is Asperger''s autistic. The boy has set his mind on finally finding his favourite football club. But his selection criteria are very specific and besides, he wants to experience all the clubs (no matter in which league they play) live in the stadium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3H7rdXsFmoAA5coTaLOR7OTHyu4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888768'),
