  ('17870865826902951', 'Weekly Review No. 232: Maori Battalion Returns', 1946, null, 'Russell Reid', null, 'Rex Walden', null, 'The men of the The 28th (Māori) Battalion are seen returning to Wellington Harbour from WWII aboard the ship Dominion Monarch after their time spent serving in WW2. Their families wait to greet them with pōwhiri and hākari, whilst those men never to return are also remembered.', 'The men of the The 28th (Māori) Battalion are seen returning to Wellington Harbour from WWII aboard the ship Dominion Monarch after their time spent serving in WW2. Their families wait to greet them with pōwhiri and hākari, whilst those men never to return are also remembered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwafb5MkagWUxvtuGK1I3mXxtN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278926'),
  ('186841302210686520', 'Weighed But Found Wanting', 1974, 'Drama', 'Lino Brocka, Joe Batac', 'Mario O''Hara', 'Christopher de Leon, Lolita Rodriguez, Mario O''Hara, Hilda Koronel, Eddie Garcia, Lilia Dizon, Alicia Alonzo, Joseph Sytangco', null, 'A privileged teenager, disillusioned with the hypocrisy he witnesses in his small town, forms a bond with a lonely leper and a mentally unstable homeless woman.', 'A privileged teenager, disillusioned with the hypocrisy he witnesses in his small town, forms a bond with a lonely leper and a mentally unstable homeless woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKAEEJBtFVVp7wCUW3TfMY8hkOm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172472'),
  ('870948530142463690', 'Weiner', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Josh Kriegman, Elyse Steinberg, Josh Kriegman', null, 'Anthony Weiner, Huma Abedin, Amit Bagga, Adam S. Barta, Sydney Leathers, Jordan Zain Weiner, Camille Joseph, Barbara Morgan', 'R', 'Documentary featuring a jaw-dropping, behind-the-scenes look at the attempted comeback of Anthony Weiner in 2013 as he mounts a campaign for New York City mayor in the wake of his sexting scandal. Featuring unfettered access to the candidate and his campaign.', 'Documentary featuring a jaw-dropping, behind-the-scenes look at the attempted comeback of Anthony Weiner in 2013 as he mounts a campaign for New York City mayor in the wake of his sexting scandal. Featuring unfettered access to the candidate and his campaign.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56p58BDYpSISNXhRDHfXBV0i7Zj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376261'),
  ('696895167238345928', 'Weird Science', 1985, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Matthew F. Leonetti, John Hughes, Joseph W. Calloway', 'John Hughes', 'Anthony Michael Hall, Ilan Mitchell-Smith, Kelly LeBrock, Bill Paxton, Suzanne Snyder, Judie Aronson, Barbara Lang, Ivor Barry', 'PG-13', 'Two unpopular teenagers, Gary and Wyatt, fail at all attempts to be accepted by their peers. Their desperation to be liked leads them to "create" a woman via their computer. Their living and breathing creation is a gorgeous woman, Lisa, whose purpose is to boost their confidence level by putting them into situations which require Gary and Wyatt to act like men.', 'Two unpopular teenagers, Gary and Wyatt, fail at all attempts to be accepted by their peers. Their desperation to be liked leads them to "create" a woman via their computer. Their living and breathing creation is a gorgeous woman, Lisa, whose purpose is to boost their confidence level by putting them into situations which require Gary and Wyatt to act like men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaEauZd2joSAKn42D83gm3S0y3F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11814'),
  ('23843672752899643', 'Weird Woman', 1944, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Reginald Le Borg, Virgil Miller, Bernard B. Brown', 'Brenda Weisberg', 'Lon Chaney Jr., Anne Gwynne, Evelyn Ankers, Ralph Morgan, Elisabeth Risdon, Lois Collier, Harry Hayden, Elizabeth Russell', null, 'After bringing his beautiful new wife Paula home to America from a remote island on which she was raised, Professor Norman Reed begins to feel the clash between his world of rational science and hers of bizarre dancing and freaky voodoo rituals. Norman''s stuck-up friends also sense Paula''s strangeness, and soon their meddling gossip and suspicious scheming push the poor woman to use her magic to defend herself and her husband – and maybe even to kill! Or is it just the power of suggestion...?', 'After bringing his beautiful new wife Paula home to America from a remote island on which she was raised, Professor Norman Reed begins to feel the clash between his world of rational science and hers of bizarre dancing and freaky voodoo rituals. Norman''s stuck-up friends also sense Paula''s strangeness, and soon their meddling gossip and suspicious scheming push the poor woman to use her magic to defend herself and her husband – and maybe even to kill! Or is it just the power of suggestion...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t27Kgqo1n8rc6Io0rEZAQdyIij1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64076'),
  ('273410944062815965', 'Weird Years', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Zoran Čalić', 'Jovan Marković', 'Dragomir ''Gidra'' Bojanić, Marko Todorović, Velimir Živojinović, Nikola Simić, Taško Načić, Jelena Žigon, Maja Sabljić, Nikola ''Kole'' Angelovski', null, 'After the road accident, Zika and Milan end up in an overcrowded hospital, run by doctor Nedeljkovic and his sexually obsessed nurse. Accompanied by a crazy bandmaster and a peasant with farting problems, they will try to get away from the ongoing chaos.', 'After the road accident, Zika and Milan end up in an overcrowded hospital, run by doctor Nedeljkovic and his sexually obsessed nurse. Accompanied by a crazy bandmaster and a peasant with farting problems, they will try to get away from the ongoing chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xmRX54xQ8UXyD6EZoLeTymFfA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55121'),
  ('745223966725921328', 'Weird: The Al Yankovic Story', 2022, 'Music, Comedy', 'Eric Appel, Ross Riege, Silawn Lewis', 'Eric Appel, ''Weird Al'' Yankovic', 'Daniel Radcliffe, Evan Rachel Wood, Rainn Wilson, Toby Huss, Jack Lancaster, Spencer Treat Clark, Tommy O''Brien, Arturo Castro', 'PG-13', 'Exploring every facet of ‘Weird Al’ Yankovic’s life, from his meteoric rise to fame with early hits like ‘Eat It’ and ‘Like a Surgeon’ to his torrid celebrity love affairs and famously depraved lifestyle, this biopic takes audiences on a truly unbelievable journey through Yankovic’s life and career, from gifted child prodigy to the greatest musical legend of all time.', 'Exploring every facet of ‘Weird Al’ Yankovic’s life, from his meteoric rise to fame with early hits like ‘Eat It’ and ‘Like a Surgeon’ to his torrid celebrity love affairs and famously depraved lifestyle, this biopic takes audiences on a truly unbelievable journey through Yankovic’s life and career, from gifted child prodigy to the greatest musical legend of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcj2z13G0KjaIgc01ifiUKu7W07.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928344'),
  ('386180163225880988', 'Weirdsville', 2007, 'Drama, Action, Comedy', 'Allan Moyle, Adam Swica', 'Willem Wennekers', 'Scott Speedman, Taryn Manning, Wes Bentley, Matt Frewer, Greg Bryk, Maggie Castle, Raoul Bhaneja, Joe Dinicol', 'R', 'Dexter and Royce, two stoners in the small town of Weedsville, attempt to cover up the overdose of Royce''s girlfriend Matilda. What leads from an old drive-in being perfect place to ditch her turns into the accidental discovery of a Satanic cult, who brings Mattie back from the dead after their ritual is botched. Along with the two''s dealer Omar on their tail, how will these buddies and their slightly-off lady-on-board deal with the dangers of drug debt and demon-worshipping magic?', 'Dexter and Royce, two stoners in the small town of Weedsville, attempt to cover up the overdose of Royce''s girlfriend Matilda. What leads from an old drive-in being perfect place to ditch her turns into the accidental discovery of a Satanic cult, who brings Mattie back from the dead after their ritual is botched. Along with the two''s dealer Omar on their tail, how will these buddies and their slightly-off lady-on-board deal with the dangers of drug debt and demon-worshipping magic?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pIstBZoDPK9ryLzYk4micKKGpfQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14251'),
  ('901662920058514188', 'Weißbier im Blut', 2021, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Jörg Graser, Jürgen Schopper, Michael Wiesweg', 'Jörg Graser', 'Sigi Zimmerschied, Luise Kinseher, Brigitte Hobmeier, Johannes Herrschmann, David Zimmerschied, Max Schmidt, Gerhard Wittmann, Xari Wimbauer', null, 'Kreuzeder was once a successful commissioner, but now he rarely solves a case. After more than 20 years in the service, he just wants to retire as quickly as possible and leave everyday life in the homicide squad in Lower Bavaria behind. Kreuzeder is of the opinion that humanity is coming to an end anyway, so he prefers to get drunk in the tavern and flirt with the waitress Gerda Bichler there instead of going about his work.', 'Kreuzeder was once a successful commissioner, but now he rarely solves a case. After more than 20 years in the service, he just wants to retire as quickly as possible and leave everyday life in the homicide squad in Lower Bavaria behind. Kreuzeder is of the opinion that humanity is coming to an end anyway, so he prefers to get drunk in the tavern and flirt with the waitress Gerda Bichler there instead of going about his work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nT2lZ9e9pnlnUqFr7sB9syxwBuh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:822772'),
  ('272401908345030476', 'Welcome', 2007, 'Comedy, Crime, Family', 'Anees Bazmee', 'Anees Bazmee, Rajeev Kaul', 'Akshay Kumar, Katrina Kaif, Nana Patekar, Anil Kapoor, Paresh Rawal, Supriya Karnik, Feroz Khan, Mallika Sherawat', null, 'Two gangsters meet Rajiv, who belongs to a respectable family, and want to fix their sister''s wedding with him. However, when Rajiv''s uncle refuses to the match, a series of hilarious situations occur.', 'Two gangsters meet Rajiv, who belongs to a respectable family, and want to fix their sister''s wedding with him. However, when Rajiv''s uncle refuses to the match, a series of hilarious situations occur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fudxnXlTTBIDCkpR7XhlIgkNaUY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20294'),
  ('487748063064572197', 'Welcome', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Philippe Lioret, Laurent Dailland', 'Emmanuel Courcol, Olivier Adam', 'Vincent Lindon, Firat Ayverdi, Audrey Dana, Olivier Rabourdin, Derya Ayverdi, Yannick Renier, Thierry Godard, Jean-Paul Comart', null, 'Bilal is 17 years old, a Kurdish boy from Iraq. He sets off on an adventure-filled journey across Europe. He wants to get to England to see his love who lives there. Bilal finally reaches Calais, but how do you cover 32 kilometers of the English Channel when you can''t swim? The boy soon discovers that his trip won''t be as easy as he imagined... The community of struggling illegal aliens in Calais', 'Bilal is 17 years old, a Kurdish boy from Iraq. He sets off on an adventure-filled journey across Europe. He wants to get to England to see his love who lives there. Bilal finally reaches Calais, but how do you cover 32 kilometers of the English Channel when you can''t swim? The boy soon discovers that his trip won''t be as easy as he imagined... The community of struggling illegal aliens in Calais', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iC6LqtvuVO3Cecsn5PD2KeJ9Dvs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15712'),
  ('890297297756005112', 'Welcome Aboard', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Eric Lavaine, Stéphane Le Parc', 'Héctor Cabello Reyes', 'Franck Dubosc, Valérie Lemercier, Gérard Darmon, Luisa Ranieri, Lionnel Astier, Elisa Servier, Philippe Lellouche, Jean-Michel Lahmi', null, 'Isabelle, HR of a large cruise company, made the mistake of choosing her boss as a lover. Before embarking on the maiden voyage of the new flagship of the fleet, though, he decided to disembark from their relationship! Some women take their revenge by poison, firearm, or slander. Isabelle chooses Remy a flamboyant, unemployed ne''er-do-well who flunked out in life on land, but after all is said and done, might have better luck at sea... She recruits him as leader of her plot and on this Palace of the Seas, Remy will first prove to be the worst nightmare of the CEO and Richard, the Cruise Director...then, little by little, he will change his life and that of all those who cross his path...', 'Isabelle, HR of a large cruise company, made the mistake of choosing her boss as a lover. Before embarking on the maiden voyage of the new flagship of the fleet, though, he decided to disembark from their relationship! Some women take their revenge by poison, firearm, or slander. Isabelle chooses Remy a flamboyant, unemployed ne''er-do-well who flunked out in life on land, but after all is said and done, might have better luck at sea... She recruits him as leader of her plot and on this Palace of the Seas, Remy will first prove to be the worst nightmare of the CEO and Richard, the Cruise Director...then, little by little, he will change his life and that of all those who cross his path...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4gweAvrUR4H4hjJTPucPOO0mlw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75198'),
  ('245807882448417849', 'Welcome Aboard', 2012, 'Drama', 'Jean Becker, Arthur Cloquet', 'Jean Becker, François d''Épenoux', 'Patrick Chesnais, Jeanne Lambert, Miou-Miou, Jacques Weber, Xavier Gallais, Raphaëline Goupilleau, Didier Bénureau, Julien Barbier', null, 'Despite his fame, Taillandier has suddenly stopped painting. Deeply depressed, the sixty-year-old decides to go away. He has no clear goal and explains nothing to his close friends. During his travels, he has a strange encounter with Marylou, a wild teenager who was rejected by her mother. The lost girl and the man at the end of his tether will travel together awhile. Finally living like a father and daughter, at peace.', 'Despite his fame, Taillandier has suddenly stopped painting. Deeply depressed, the sixty-year-old decides to go away. He has no clear goal and explains nothing to his close friends. During his travels, he has a strange encounter with Marylou, a wild teenager who was rejected by her mother. The lost girl and the man at the end of his tether will travel together awhile. Finally living like a father and daughter, at peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWqNpB6mgMrRl0noAzgz6Uuiezv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129953'),
  ('883618593096395670', 'Welcome Back', 2015, 'Action, Comedy', 'Anees Bazmee, Shishir Pradhan, Jasvinder Bittu', 'Rajan Aggarwal, Anees Bazmee, Rajeev Kaul', 'John Abraham, Shruti Haasan, Anil Kapoor, Nana Patekar, Paresh Rawal, Dimple Kapadia, Naseeruddin Shah, Shiney Ahuja', null, 'A pair of reformed gangsters try to find a husband for their newly discovered sister, but complications arise due to mistaken identities.', 'A pair of reformed gangsters try to find a husband for their newly discovered sister, but complications arise due to mistaken identities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnRIT3ggVcJxGWylKw85n6pteLp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357563'),
  ('17976184827717938', 'Welcome Back', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ömer Kılınç, Dudu Elif Konuk, Umut Sarıboğa', 'Ogulcan Türe, Gizem Elci', 'Murat Boz, İrem Sak, Yasemin Kay Allen, Uraz Kaygılaroğlu, Serhat Özcan, Burak Sevinç, Taha Sönmezışık, Umut Açabuğa', null, 'Mehmet who is an idealist advertising photographer, has just separated from his girlfriend Selin. He deeply suffers from love pain but doesn''t lose his hope of regaining her. Then he meets the mysterious Defne, who encourages him to take action before everything is too late. With the other close friends of Mehmet, they make a secret plan to bring back the lost love, Selin who is a very popular singer now, and the hopeful adventure which no one is sure of its ending whether it will be happy or not, begins.', 'Mehmet who is an idealist advertising photographer, has just separated from his girlfriend Selin. He deeply suffers from love pain but doesn''t lose his hope of regaining her. Then he meets the mysterious Defne, who encourages him to take action before everything is too late. With the other close friends of Mehmet, they make a secret plan to bring back the lost love, Selin who is a very popular singer now, and the hopeful adventure which no one is sure of its ending whether it will be happy or not, begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbz1JZqmZINLzISnbSDLHmP6gam.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456669'),
  ('1090424972066403894', 'Welcome Back Mr. President', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Giuseppe G. Stasi, Giancarlo Fontana, Gian Enrico Bianchi', 'Fabio Bonifacci', 'Claudio Bisio, Sarah Felberbaum, Pietro Sermonti, Paolo Calabresi, Guglielmo Poggi, Ivano Marescotti, Antonio Petrocelli, Roberta Volponi', null, 'Peppino, a provincial librarian who became the accidental President of Italy, is now a father and has returned to a peaceful, happy life as a woodsman. That is, until his wife Janis decides to return to politics. Peppino is forced to abandon his home in the mountains and return to Rome to win back his love and help her defeat a speculative plot intended to damage Italy. Together, they must ﬁght against social media attacks of the opposition and get the country back on its feet.', 'Peppino, a provincial librarian who became the accidental President of Italy, is now a father and has returned to a peaceful, happy life as a woodsman. That is, until his wife Janis decides to return to politics. Peppino is forced to abandon his home in the mountains and return to Rome to win back his love and help her defeat a speculative plot intended to damage Italy. Together, they must ﬁght against social media attacks of the opposition and get the country back on its feet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UTKYM1MmcTPbcpBvxmpyNiN1Dk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586764'),
  ('1099498281766991253', 'Welcome Back, Mr. McDonald', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Koki Mitani, Kenji Takama', 'Koki Mitani', 'Toshiaki Karasawa, Kyoka Suzuki, Masahiko Nishimura, Keiko Toda, Toshiyuki Hosokawa, Jun Inoue, Takehiko Ono, Kaoru Okunuki', null, 'A love story written by an ordinary housewife is going to be broadcast as a radio drama and almost everyone among the crew insists on changing various parts of the play to their liking.', 'A love story written by an ordinary housewife is going to be broadcast as a radio drama and almost everyone among the crew insists on changing various parts of the play to their liking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1bFYM4d9YFVye1Jc8vgxJUfyOR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102227'),
  ('873662122442560474', 'Welcome Danger', 1929, 'Comedy', 'Clyde Bruckman, Malcolm St. Clair, Gaylord Lloyd', 'Harold Lloyd', 'Harold Lloyd, Barbara Kent, Noah Young, Charles Middleton, Will Walling, Grady Sutton, Brooks Benedict, Eddy Chandler', 'NR', 'A gentle botany student has to toughen up to replace his father as chief of police.', 'A gentle botany student has to toughen up to replace his father as chief of police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yOYX74ymJkaNHArfWydsFt0Zf05.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53528'),
  ('939093626523249437', 'Welcome Dollar', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Kostas Lyhnaras, Andreas Lapas', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Christos Giannakopoulos', 'Giorgos Konstantinou, Niki Linardou, Anna Kalouta, Orfeas Zahos, Alekos Tzanetakos, Nikos Fermas, Sotiris Moustakas, Sasa Kastoura', null, 'Philip (Giorgos Constantinou), a shy and dignified accountant and English teacher, lives with his mother (Zoli Garbi) and his two siblings in the same house. His and his mother''s meager income, just enough to support them all. His younger brother (Alekos Tzanetakos) remains unemployed and lazy rather out of conscience, while his older brother, Kimon (Orpheus Zachos), dreams of being re-elected prefect and refuses, although a qualified accountant, to work, considering the positions demeaning and irrelevant offered to him. His tragic financial situation will be further burdened by their imminent forced move to another house. It is also the first color Greek film, edited entirely in Greece. It is based on the play "The 6th American Fleet" by Alek Sakellarios and Christos Giannakopoulos, who also wrote the screenplay, while Sakellarios directed the film.', 'Philip (Giorgos Constantinou), a shy and dignified accountant and English teacher, lives with his mother (Zoli Garbi) and his two siblings in the same house. His and his mother''s meager income, just enough to support them all. His younger brother (Alekos Tzanetakos) remains unemployed and lazy rather out of conscience, while his older brother, Kimon (Orpheus Zachos), dreams of being re-elected prefect and refuses, although a qualified accountant, to work, considering the positions demeaning and irrelevant offered to him. His tragic financial situation will be further burdened by their imminent forced move to another house. It is also the first color Greek film, edited entirely in Greece. It is based on the play "The 6th American Fleet" by Alek Sakellarios and Christos Giannakopoulos, who also wrote the screenplay, while Sakellarios directed the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38ddMq5AHxDs2vPMS85KpItguDC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372387'),
  ('67975736274833163', 'Welcome Home', 1995, 'Drama', 'Makoto Shinozaki, Osamu Furuya', 'Ryo Yamamura, Makoto Shinozaki', 'Susumu Terajima, Miho Uemura, Tarō Suwa, Tomio Aoki, Shoichi Komatsu, Ayaka Horie, Shingo Takahashi, Hitoshi Ozawa', null, 'Yuriko, once a concert pianist, now practices home-making while husband Takashi stays out late with co-workers, leaving her to decay into severe mental illness.', 'Yuriko, once a concert pianist, now practices home-making while husband Takashi stays out late with co-workers, leaving her to decay into severe mental illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1H9NbaLZ5PK9IjCc8SM4vo9E4D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239328'),
  ('791342010655496516', 'Welcome Home', 2018, 'Thriller, Horror', 'George Ratliff, Shelly Johnson', 'David Levinson', 'Aaron Paul, Emily Ratajkowski, Riccardo Scamarcio, Katy Louise Saunders, Alice Bellagamba, Francesco Acquaroli, Nav Ghotra, Sam Mane', 'R', 'A couple try to repair their damaged union in an Italian vacation paradise. Then they discover the owner''s intentions.', 'A couple try to repair their damaged union in an Italian vacation paradise. Then they discover the owner''s intentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMhJQoMitAh0pN0fLlD7iUGcBp0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:525460'),
  ('395363365054487905', 'Welcome Home', 2020, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Pushkar Sunil Mahabal', 'Ankita Narang', 'Kashmira Irani, Swarda Thigle, Boloram Das, Tina Bhatia, Shashi Bhushan', null, 'Welcome Home is being touted as a psychological drama with lots of thrills. The movie follows a pregnant woman living in a house. She is visited by a few other ladies presumably some officials and ask her about her lifestyle.', 'Welcome Home is being touted as a psychological drama with lots of thrills. The movie follows a pregnant woman living in a house. She is visited by a few other ladies presumably some officials and ask her about her lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwYxdxIc3jUbivBB425MfhkBzw7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:761226'),
  ('869503291702672642', 'Welcome Home Brother Charles', 1975, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Jamaa Fanaka, James Babij', 'Jamaa Fanaka', 'Marlo Monte, Reatha Grey, Stan Kamber, Tiffany Peters, Ben Bigelow, Jake Carter, Jackie Ziegler, Ed Sander', 'R', 'After wrongly doing time in prison for murder, a man seeks revenge on a racist law enforcement system and the detective who framed him.', 'After wrongly doing time in prison for murder, a man seeks revenge on a racist law enforcement system and the detective who framed him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7sB2nh3peB72FZyEtb9be7kHMo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86201'),
  ('801511780015067914', 'Welcome Home Roscoe Jenkins', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Malcolm D. Lee, Donald Sparks, Greg Gardiner', 'Malcolm D. Lee', 'Martin Lawrence, James Earl Jones, Margaret Avery, Joy Bryant, Cedric the Entertainer, Nicole Ari Parker, Michael Clarke Duncan, Mike Epps', 'PG-13', 'When a celebrated TV show host returns to his hometown in the South, his family is there to remind him that going home is no vacation!', 'When a celebrated TV show host returns to his hometown in the South, his family is there to remind him that going home is no vacation!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1VzS2bkQHVcIxSeBJifOx65oxHK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13490'),
  ('148106069162980350', 'Welcome Home, Roxy Carmichael', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jim Abrahams, Paul Elliott, John T. Kretchmer', 'Karen Leigh Hopkins', 'Winona Ryder, Jeff Daniels, Stephen Tobolowsky, Dinah Manoff, Laila Robins, Thomas Wilson Brown, Joan McMurtrey, Graham Beckel', 'PG-13', 'Movie star Roxy Carmichael is abandoning the bright lights of Hollywood, Calif. and returning to her small Ohio hometown -- at least long enough to dedicate a city building. And now the whole town of Clyde is bracing for Carmichael''s return, most of all her now-married old flame Denton Webb and troubled teen Dinky Bossetti. An orphan with few friends, Dinky is convinced that Carmichael is her birth mother, and that the actress will reclaim her when she returns.', 'Movie star Roxy Carmichael is abandoning the bright lights of Hollywood, Calif. and returning to her small Ohio hometown -- at least long enough to dedicate a city building. And now the whole town of Clyde is bracing for Carmichael''s return, most of all her now-married old flame Denton Webb and troubled teen Dinky Bossetti. An orphan with few friends, Dinky is convinced that Carmichael is her birth mother, and that the actress will reclaim her when she returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gV8s670ExVqTkuk9lkyt1u7vXXT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31923'),
  ('578174679372287263', 'Welcome Mr. Marshall!', 1953, 'Comedy', 'Luis García Berlanga, Manuel Berenguer, Ricardo Muñoz Suay', 'Miguel Mihura, Luis García Berlanga, Juan Antonio Bardem', 'José Isbert, Manolo Morán, Lolita Sevilla, Alberto Romea, Elvira Quintillá, Luis Pérez de León, Félix Fernández, Nicolás D. Perchicot', null, 'A small Spanish town, Villar del Río, is alerted to the upcoming visit of American diplomats and its ruling townsmen begin preparations to impress the American visitors, in the hopes of benefiting under the Marshall Plan. Hoping to demonstrate the side of Spanish culture with which the visiting foreign officials would be more familiarized, the Castilian citizens don unfamiliar Andalusian costumes, hire a renowned flamenco performer, and re-decorate their town in Andalusian style, meantime waiting for their uncertain arrival.', 'A small Spanish town, Villar del Río, is alerted to the upcoming visit of American diplomats and its ruling townsmen begin preparations to impress the American visitors, in the hopes of benefiting under the Marshall Plan. Hoping to demonstrate the side of Spanish culture with which the visiting foreign officials would be more familiarized, the Castilian citizens don unfamiliar Andalusian costumes, hire a renowned flamenco performer, and re-decorate their town in Andalusian style, meantime waiting for their uncertain arrival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zj1kQTChTXJwdsyBsl7972MDfWS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31936'),
  ('22296119182919370', 'Welcome Mr. President!', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Riccardo Milani, Elide Albertinotti, Stefano Pastore', 'Fabio Bonifacci', 'Claudio Bisio, Kasia Smutniak, Giuseppe Fiorello, Remo Girone, Massimo Popolizio, Cesare Bocci, Omero Antonutti, Michele Alhaique', null, 'In a small mountain village lives a man with a challenging name, Giuseppe Garibaldi (one of Italy''s "fathers of the fatherland"), but everybody call him with the nickname Peppino. Love fishing, the company of friends, the library where he works as a precarious employee. He is an optimistic person even if his child accuse him of being a wannabe. One day, due to a mess of politicians, an amazing thing happens: Peppino is mistakenly elected President of the Italian Republic. Pulled out from his quiet life, is to play a role for which he knows he is obviously inappropriate, but his common sense and his instinctive gestures are incredibly effective, except for the etiquette, for which he is in trouble. The inflexible and fascinating Deputy Secretary General of the Presidency of the Republic, Janis Clementi, is anxious to no avail in an attempt to regulate the unpredictable actions of the President...', 'In a small mountain village lives a man with a challenging name, Giuseppe Garibaldi (one of Italy''s "fathers of the fatherland"), but everybody call him with the nickname Peppino. Love fishing, the company of friends, the library where he works as a precarious employee. He is an optimistic person even if his child accuse him of being a wannabe. One day, due to a mess of politicians, an amazing thing happens: Peppino is mistakenly elected President of the Italian Republic. Pulled out from his quiet life, is to play a role for which he knows he is obviously inappropriate, but his common sense and his instinctive gestures are incredibly effective, except for the etiquette, for which he is in trouble. The inflexible and fascinating Deputy Secretary General of the Presidency of the Republic, Janis Clementi, is anxious to no avail in an attempt to regulate the unpredictable actions of the President...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnPP1TfxcILUeZPc9lSahnSVNkR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178915'),
  ('909586971681926484', 'Welcome the Stranger', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Justin Kelly, Matt Klammer', 'Justin Kelly', 'Abbey Lee, Caleb Landry Jones, Riley Keough, Rosemary Howard, John Clofine', null, 'Alice arrives unannounced at her estranged brother Ethan''s house in an attempt to reconcile, but bizarre visions, the return of his strange girlfriend and Alice''s paranoia and suspicion force the siblings to cling onto reality amidst mysterious circumstances.', 'Alice arrives unannounced at her estranged brother Ethan''s house in an attempt to reconcile, but bizarre visions, the return of his strange girlfriend and Alice''s paranoia and suspicion force the siblings to cling onto reality amidst mysterious circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZch4FhfexA18gUUQjHXKnLmkjh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413852'),
  ('713621316438280129', 'Welcome to Chechnya', 2020, 'Documentary', 'David France, Askold Kurov, Derek Wiesehahn', 'David France, Tyler H. Walk', 'Maxim Lapunov, Olga Baranova, David Isteev, Vladimir Putin, Ramzan Kadyrov, Zelim Bakaev', null, 'This searing investigative work shadows a group of activists risking unimaginable peril to confront the ongoing anti-LGBTQ program raging in the repressive and closed Russian republic. Unfettered access and a remarkable approach to protecting anonymity exposes this under-reported atrocity–and an extraordinary group of people confronting evil.', 'This searing investigative work shadows a group of activists risking unimaginable peril to confront the ongoing anti-LGBTQ program raging in the repressive and closed Russian republic. Unfettered access and a remarkable approach to protecting anonymity exposes this under-reported atrocity–and an extraordinary group of people confronting evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wR1b8w3fFPQR5wpbkekviLmo4wW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653579'),
  ('116450106186372648', 'Welcome to Collinwood', 2002, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Charles Minsky, Anthony Russo, Joe Russo', 'Agenore Incrocci, Furio Scarpelli, Suso Cecchi d''Amico', 'Sam Rockwell, William H. Macy, Isaiah Washington, Michael Jeter, Andy Davoli, George Clooney, Luis Guzmán, Patricia Clarkson', 'R', 'Five hapless inner-city low-lifes attempt to burgle a pawnbroker''s safe, but end up being plagued by bad luck.', 'Five hapless inner-city low-lifes attempt to burgle a pawnbroker''s safe, but end up being plagued by bad luck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7XyvoOopwWwDCWOcItOQiAwm30b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9260'),
  ('302303775027490123', 'Welcome to Dongmakgol', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Bae Jong, Cho E-suck, Choi Sang-ho', 'Joong Kim, Jang Jin, Bae Jong', 'Jung Jae-young, Shin Ha-kyun, Kang Hye-jung, Steve Taschler, Im Ha-ryong, Seo Jae-kyeong, Ryu Deok-hwan, Jung Jae-jin', null, 'Based on the long running play by Jang Jin, the story is set in Korea during the Korean War in 1950. Soldiers from both the North and South, as well as an American pilot, find themselves in a secluded and naively idealistic village, its residents unaware of the outside world, including the war.', 'Based on the long running play by Jang Jin, the story is set in Korea during the Korean War in 1950. Soldiers from both the North and South, as well as an American pilot, find themselves in a secluded and naively idealistic village, its residents unaware of the outside world, including the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FQ8p7kXTqdHJ2EIvQ5Y9TDTSw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14968'),
  ('85675786760194546', 'Welcome to Hard Times', 1967, 'Western', 'Burt Kennedy, Harry Stradling Jr., Al Jennings', 'Burt Kennedy', 'Henry Fonda, Janice Rule, Keenan Wynn, Janis Paige, John Anderson, Warren Oates, Fay Spain, Edgar Buchanan', null, 'A sociopathic stranger all but destroys a small hardscrabble town but the ''mayor'' convinces its survivors to stay and rebuild.', 'A sociopathic stranger all but destroys a small hardscrabble town but the ''mayor'' convinces its survivors to stay and rebuild.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Y59enKhkNUJ9P1IxaMcxbuq99q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118017'),
  ('439872451478249476', 'Welcome to Hartmanns', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Simon Verhoeven, Jo Heim', 'Simon Verhoeven', 'Senta Berger, Heiner Lauterbach, Florian David Fitz, Palina Rojinski, Elyas M''Barek, Eric Kabongo, Uwe Ochsenknecht, Ulrike Kriener', null, 'The Hartmann family is turned upside down when mother Angelika decides to take in the refugee Diallo, against her husband''s will. Amidst the typical chaos of our time, hope remains that the family finds its stability, confidence and peace again - just like the whole country.', 'The Hartmann family is turned upside down when mother Angelika decides to take in the refugee Diallo, against her husband''s will. Amidst the typical chaos of our time, hope remains that the family finds its stability, confidence and peace again - just like the whole country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kseCyT0hPMh4S2nVEPLerTMNTSZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403348'),
  ('843701224450274162', 'Welcome to Hell', 2021, 'Horror', 'Jimena Monteoliva, Federico Bracken, Georgina Pretto', 'Camilo de Cabo, Jimena Monteoliva, Nicanor Loreti', 'Constanza Cardillo, Demián Salomón, Marta Lubos, William Prociuk, Emiliano Carrazzone, Miguel Ángel Vigna, Andrés Loreti, Lalo Rotaveria', null, 'To escape the leader of a satanic metal band and the father of her unborn child, Lucia moves to a remote cabin with her grandmother. Though safe in her surroundings, she is haunted by his memory and knows he will stop at nothing to track her down.', 'To escape the leader of a satanic metal band and the father of her unborn child, Lucia moves to a remote cabin with her grandmother. Though safe in her surroundings, she is haunted by his memory and knows he will stop at nothing to track her down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbfVzGNPyPUHpR2lSvAoChxIP0A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:878127'),
  ('716567237080298063', 'Welcome to L.A.', 1976, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Alan Rudolph, Tony Bishop, Tommy Thompson', 'Alan Rudolph', 'Keith Carradine, Sally Kellerman, Geraldine Chaplin, Harvey Keitel, Lauren Hutton, Viveca Lindfors, Sissy Spacek, Richard Baskin', 'R', 'The lives of a group of Hollywood neurotics intersect over the Christmas holidays. Foremost among them, a songwriter visits Los Angeles to work on a singer''s album. The gig, unbeknownst to him, is being bankrolled by his estranged father, a dairy magnate, who hopes to reunite with his son. When the songwriter meets an eccentric housewife who fancies herself a modern-day Garbo, his world of illusions comes crashing down.', 'The lives of a group of Hollywood neurotics intersect over the Christmas holidays. Foremost among them, a songwriter visits Los Angeles to work on a singer''s album. The gig, unbeknownst to him, is being bankrolled by his estranged father, a dairy magnate, who hopes to reunite with his son. When the songwriter meets an eccentric housewife who fancies herself a modern-day Garbo, his world of illusions comes crashing down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OlIqSuoilz6nLaOQNle1MXNtUx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86241'),
  ('674687317269078633', 'Welcome to Leith', 2015, 'Thriller, Crime, Documentary', 'Michael Beach Nichols, Michael Beach Nichols, Christopher K. Walker', 'Michael Beach Nichols, Christopher K. Walker', 'Craig Cobb', null, 'In September 2012, the tiny prairie town of Leith, North Dakota, sees its population of 24 grow by one. As the new resident''s behavior becomes more threatening, tensions soar, and the residents desperately look for ways to expel their unwanted neighbor.', 'In September 2012, the tiny prairie town of Leith, North Dakota, sees its population of 24 grow by one. As the new resident''s behavior becomes more threatening, tensions soar, and the residents desperately look for ways to expel their unwanted neighbor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNp6jfVGlF2WuGsqsXXr3tzl68y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318973'),
  ('244072024225285017', 'Welcome to Macintosh', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Robert Baca', null, 'Wayne Bibbens, Vince Briel, Charles DeVore, Richard Halsey, Andy Hertzfeld, Leander Kahney, Guy Kawasaki', null, '"Welcome to Macintosh" is a documentary that mixes history, criticism and an unapologetic revelry of all things Apple. Whether a long time Mac fanatic or new to computers, Welcome to Macintosh explores the many ways Apple Computer (now Apple, Inc.) has changed the world, from the early days of the Apple-I to the latest the company has to offer.', '"Welcome to Macintosh" is a documentary that mixes history, criticism and an unapologetic revelry of all things Apple. Whether a long time Mac fanatic or new to computers, Welcome to Macintosh explores the many ways Apple Computer (now Apple, Inc.) has changed the world, from the early days of the Apple-I to the latest the company has to offer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTT9aV8CG3ALT8TGT1XeatIH3nS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14981'),
  ('424640855309117798', 'Welcome to Marwen', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Robert Zemeckis, C. Kim Miles, Chris Beach', 'Caroline Thompson, Robert Zemeckis', 'Steve Carell, Leslie Mann, Merritt Wever, Janelle Monáe, Diane Kruger, Falk Hentschel, Eiza González, Gwendoline Christie', 'PG-13', 'When a devastating attack shatters Mark Hogancamp and wipes away all memories, no one expected recovery. Putting together pieces from his old and new life, Mark meticulously creates a wondrous town named Marwen where he can heal and be heroic. As he builds an astonishing art installation — a testament to the most powerful women he knows — through his fantasy world, he draws strength to triumph in the real one.', 'When a devastating attack shatters Mark Hogancamp and wipes away all memories, no one expected recovery. Putting together pieces from his old and new life, Mark meticulously creates a wondrous town named Marwen where he can heal and be heroic. As he builds an astonishing art installation — a testament to the most powerful women he knows — through his fantasy world, he draws strength to triumph in the real one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOULsxYQFsOR0cEBBB20xnjJkPD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351044'),
  ('92577297600012191', 'Welcome to Me', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shira Piven, Eric Alan Edwards, Jason C. Brown', 'Eliot Laurence', 'Kristen Wiig, James Marsden, Linda Cardellini, Wes Bentley, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Alan Tudyk, Tim Robbins, Joan Cusack', 'R', 'A year in the life of Alice Klieg, a woman with Borderline personality disorder who wins the Mega Millions lottery, quits her meds and buys her own talk show.', 'A year in the life of Alice Klieg, a woman with Borderline personality disorder who wins the Mega Millions lottery, quits her meds and buys her own talk show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGZV5m7T8NzNC4V2gk304W5SpVX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284537'),
  ('1138625564513424106', 'Welcome to Mooseport', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Donald Petrie, Victor Hammer, Branko Racki', 'Tom Schulman', 'Gene Hackman, Ray Romano, Marcia Gay Harden, Maura Tierney, Christine Baranski, Fred Savage, Rip Torn, June Squibb', 'PG-13', 'A US president who has retired after two terms in office returns to his hometown of Mooseport, Maine and decides to run for Mayor against another local candidate.', 'A US president who has retired after two terms in office returns to his hometown of Mooseport, Maine and decides to run for Mayor against another local candidate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpaaUiaSZiW8YUoKA17RkV84mAW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16784'),
  ('909083076562686972', 'Welcome to New York', 2014, 'Drama', 'Abel Ferrara, Ken Kelsch, Colin Walsh', 'Christ Zois, Abel Ferrara', 'Gérard Depardieu, Jacqueline Bisset, Shanyn Leigh, Marie Mouté, Charlotte Silvera, Ronald Guttman, Elizabeth Kemp, Drena De Niro', 'R', 'Mr. Devereaux is a powerful man. A man who handles billions of dollars every day. A man who controls the economic fate of nations. A man driven by a frenzied and unbridled sexual hunger. A man who dreamed of saving the world and who cannot save himself. A terrified man. A lost man.', 'Mr. Devereaux is a powerful man. A man who handles billions of dollars every day. A man who controls the economic fate of nations. A man driven by a frenzied and unbridled sexual hunger. A man who dreamed of saving the world and who cannot save himself. A terrified man. A lost man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxpCdLp3SHUDBQ0xOeZDuDnFxYm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197696'),
  ('693797388447414142', 'Welcome to Sajjanpur', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Shyam Benegal', 'Ashok Mishra', 'Shreyas Talpade, Amrita Rao, Kunal Kapoor, Ravi Kishan, Ravi Jhankal, Yashpal Sharma, Rajeshwari Sachdev, Divya Dutta', null, 'Mahadev (Shreyas Talpade) is an unemployed graduate with a Bachelor of Arts from Satna college, who is forced to make a living writing letters for the uneducated people of his village. His real ambition is to become a novel writer. Through his humble occupation, Mahadev has the potential to impact numerous lives. The movie is a satirical, but warm-hearted portrait of life in rural India.', 'Mahadev (Shreyas Talpade) is an unemployed graduate with a Bachelor of Arts from Satna college, who is forced to make a living writing letters for the uneducated people of his village. His real ambition is to become a novel writer. Through his humble occupation, Mahadev has the potential to impact numerous lives. The movie is a satirical, but warm-hearted portrait of life in rural India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKutRHnTtuuVJsaX4BHE275871.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35695'),
  ('935852864674599093', 'Welcome to Sarajevo', 1997, 'War, Drama, History', 'Michael Winterbottom, Daf Hobson, Robert Jazadziski', 'Michael Nicholson', 'Stephen Dillane, Woody Harrelson, Marisa Tomei, Goran Višnjić, Emira Nušević, Kerry Fox, James Nesbitt, Emily Lloyd', 'R', 'Follow a group of international journalists into the heart of the once cosmopolitan city of Sarajevo—now a danger zone of sniper and mortar attacks where residents still live. While reporting on an American aid worker who’s trying to get children out of the country, a British correspondent decides to take an orphaned girl home to London.', 'Follow a group of international journalists into the heart of the once cosmopolitan city of Sarajevo—now a danger zone of sniper and mortar attacks where residents still live. While reporting on an American aid worker who’s trying to get children out of the country, a British correspondent decides to take an orphaned girl home to London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGdDqsFCF0v9M5mB77fAF8vJMsy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14905'),
  ('514612759900762656', 'Welcome to Shama Town', 2010, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, Comedy, Western, Thriller', 'Li Weiran, Zhao Xiaoding', 'Zhou Zhiyong, Li Weiran', 'Sun Honglei, Lin Chi-ling, Lee Li-Chun, Gan Wei, Ma Jian, Huang Haibo, Cao Bingkun, Bao Bei''er', null, 'In the fictional Shama Town in Northwest China, legend has it that that robbers buried many hidden treasures among the town. Tang Gaopeng, the town leader, then decides to promote Shama Town as a bandit-themed tourist destination. Tang Gaopeng''s plan doesn''t go to well with the town attracting nearly zero tourists, but a group of international thieves do show up intent on finding the buried treasures ...', 'In the fictional Shama Town in Northwest China, legend has it that that robbers buried many hidden treasures among the town. Tang Gaopeng, the town leader, then decides to promote Shama Town as a bandit-themed tourist destination. Tang Gaopeng''s plan doesn''t go to well with the town attracting nearly zero tourists, but a group of international thieves do show up intent on finding the buried treasures ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liToaZf917VdjBzatzFsFxYY96X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63416'),
  ('1030076004741365121', 'Welcome to Smelliville', 2021, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Toby Genkel, Jens Møller', 'Toby Genkel, John Chambers', 'Sema''j Alexander Cunningham, Kya Stein, Lily Held, Tony Clark, Susan Tackenberg, Geraldine Blecker, Andrea Dewell, Phil Lewis', null, 'The Oggly family arrive at the municipal rubbish dump of Smelliville and must look for a new home, but they never feel really welcome anywhere. They stink and are for most humans just a tad too oggly. When Firebottom, the family dragon, crash-lands on the run-down rubbish tip of the small town of Smelliville, the Ogglies at once feel at home. And it''s here they want to stay.', 'The Oggly family arrive at the municipal rubbish dump of Smelliville and must look for a new home, but they never feel really welcome anywhere. They stink and are for most humans just a tad too oggly. When Firebottom, the family dragon, crash-lands on the run-down rubbish tip of the small town of Smelliville, the Ogglies at once feel at home. And it''s here they want to stay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7PJ7fBEYOuaAMKfYa4zmw45v3N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:805051'),
  ('863597469953782399', 'Welcome to Sudden Death', 2020, 'Action, Drama', 'Mark Irwin, Ronaldo Nacionales, Dallas Jackson', 'Dallas Jackson, Gene Quintano', 'Michael Jai White, Michael Eklund, Gary Owen, Sabryn Rock, Anthony Grant, Gillian White, Anthony J. Mifsud, Kristen Harris', 'R', 'Jesse Freeman is a former special forces officer and explosives expert now working a regular job as a security guard in a state-of-the-art basketball arena. Trouble erupts when a tech-savvy cadre of terrorists kidnap the team''s owner and Jesse''s daughter during opening night. Facing a ticking clock and impossible odds, it''s up to Jesse to not only save them but also a full house of fans in this highly charged action thriller.', 'Jesse Freeman is a former special forces officer and explosives expert now working a regular job as a security guard in a state-of-the-art basketball arena. Trouble erupts when a tech-savvy cadre of terrorists kidnap the team''s owner and Jesse''s daughter during opening night. Facing a ticking clock and impossible odds, it''s up to Jesse to not only save them but also a full house of fans in this highly charged action thriller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/elZ6JCzSEvFOq4gNjNeZsnRFsvj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741067'),
  ('413838512062905046', 'Welcome to Switzerland', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Léa Fazer', 'Léa Fazer', 'Vincent Perez, Emmanuelle Devos, Denis Podalydès, Marianne Basler', null, 'Thierry, an ethnologist specializing in the Sami people, travels to his native Switzerland with his partner, Sophie, to attend his grandmother''s funeral. There he reunites with his family and discovers that he has inherited two million Swiss francs, but that in order to obtain it, he will have to pretend to adapt to the Swiss values and lifestyle that he had rejected. To do so, he agrees to undergo a sort of crash course provided by his Swiss cousin Aloïs, who seems to have his eye on Sophie.', 'Thierry, an ethnologist specializing in the Sami people, travels to his native Switzerland with his partner, Sophie, to attend his grandmother''s funeral. There he reunites with his family and discovers that he has inherited two million Swiss francs, but that in order to obtain it, he will have to pretend to adapt to the Swiss values and lifestyle that he had rejected. To do so, he agrees to undergo a sort of crash course provided by his Swiss cousin Aloïs, who seems to have his eye on Sophie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Nm2SaKsKjmVes4RGvzC1V2dRNU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56785'),
  ('594679780459278740', 'Welcome to the Club', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', 'David Silverman', 'Christine Nangle, Joel H. Cohen, J. Stewart Burns', 'Yeardley Smith, Tress MacNeille, Nancy Cartwright, Tom Hiddleston, Dawnn Lewis, Kevin Michael Richardson, Chris Edgerly', null, 'Heart set on becoming a princess, Lisa Simpson is surprised to learn being bad might be more fun.', 'Heart set on becoming a princess, Lisa Simpson is surprised to learn being bad might be more fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxB9E6fo0ycHzd13oOTHmGa5Njd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1015602'),
  ('392011464949011200', 'Welcome to the Dollhouse', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Todd Solondz, Randy Drummond, Kelly McKaig', 'Todd Solondz', 'Heather Matarazzo, Brendan Sexton III, Eric Mabius, Matthew Faber, Daria Kalinina, Angela Pietropinto, Bill Buell, Will Lyman', 'R', 'An unattractive 7th grader struggles to cope with suburban life as the middle child with inattentive parents and bullies at school.', 'An unattractive 7th grader struggles to cope with suburban life as the middle child with inattentive parents and bullies at school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fsMMOVto87pvUQyozOF9CaT9aMR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11446'),
  ('257788421719431376', 'Welcome to the Jungle', 2007, 'Horror', 'Jonathan Hensleigh', 'Jonathan Hensleigh', 'Sandi Gardiner, Veronica Sywak, Callard Harris, Nick Richey, John Leonetti, Rich Morris', null, 'Two young couples head into the New Guinea wilderness in an effort to find Michael Rockefeller, the heir to the Rockefeller fortune who disappeared in 1961.', 'Two young couples head into the New Guinea wilderness in an effort to find Michael Rockefeller, the heir to the Rockefeller fortune who disappeared in 1961.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vppaSfqiihKSRs0ky4ZLkcdVKms.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40458'),
  ('244929174435779096', 'Welcome to the Jungle', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Rob Meltzer, Robert Colón, Eric Haase', 'Jeff Kauffmann', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Adam Brody, Rob Huebel, Kristen Schaal, Megan Boone, Bianca Bree, Aaron Takahashi, Robert Peters', 'NR', 'A company retreat on a tropical island goes terribly awry.', 'A company retreat on a tropical island goes terribly awry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWXn2Pfrkbe7Xuwv2BZ2UL53Wdf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205724'),
  ('227005028819204379', 'Welcome to the North', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Luca Miniero, Chantal Toesca, Paolo Carnera', 'Fabio Bonifacci, Luca Miniero', 'Claudio Bisio, Alessandro Siani, Angela Finocchiaro, Valentina Lodovini, Nando Paone, Nunzia Schiano, Salvatore Misticone, Teco Celio', null, 'Now in the Far North (i.e. Milan!), Alberto has accepted to manage a program for efficiency improvement in the Italian Post. He devotes all his time and all his energy to this noble task and neglects his wife Silvia, which of course annoys her beyond limits. Things do not fare much better in Castellabate where it is rather Maria, Matta''s wife, who gets on his nerves by always blaming him for his lack of ambition. One day, due to a misunderstanding, Mattia is transferred to... Milan! And on whose doorstep does he land? Alberto''s of course!', 'Now in the Far North (i.e. Milan!), Alberto has accepted to manage a program for efficiency improvement in the Italian Post. He devotes all his time and all his energy to this noble task and neglects his wife Silvia, which of course annoys her beyond limits. Things do not fare much better in Castellabate where it is rather Maria, Matta''s wife, who gets on his nerves by always blaming him for his lack of ambition. One day, due to a misunderstanding, Mattia is transferred to... Milan! And on whose doorstep does he land? Alberto''s of course!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZTQUqeQuyGlOZ0WLCTNrSGV3I5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85038'),
  ('999539420694072681', 'Welcome to the Punch', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Eran Creevy, John Marzano, Ed Wild', 'Eran Creevy', 'James McAvoy, Mark Strong, David Morrissey, Peter Mullan, Daniel Mays, Andrea Riseborough, Daniel Kaluuya, Ruth Sheen', 'R', 'When notorious criminal Jacob Sternwood is forced to return to London, it gives detective Max Lewinsky one last chance to take down the man he''s always been after.', 'When notorious criminal Jacob Sternwood is forced to return to London, it gives detective Max Lewinsky one last chance to take down the man he''s always been after.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mCyfp7nk1sTZNtvLSVGrO0sPeH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93828'),
  ('600429672279692091', 'Welcome to the Quiet Room', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Suzuki Matsuo, Akihiro Okabayashi', 'Suzuki Matsuo', 'Yuki Uchida, Kankuro Kudo, Yu Aoi, Ryo, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Shinobu Otake, Yuko Nakamura, Seiko Iwaido', null, '28 year old freelance writer Sakura Asuka wakes up tied in a white room. The white room is a protected room located in an isolated ward of a psychiatric hospital. Sakura first became unconscious because of heavy alcohol use and a druge overdose. She’s confined in the single room because of her high risk of committing suicide. Sakura tried to talk to the nurses and doctors but they didn’t listen to her. Under the circumstances another patient Miki, who suffers from an eating disorder, leads her to understand the unknown world. But, Sakura is looking for the way to get back to the real world as soon as possible.', '28 year old freelance writer Sakura Asuka wakes up tied in a white room. The white room is a protected room located in an isolated ward of a psychiatric hospital. Sakura first became unconscious because of heavy alcohol use and a druge overdose. She’s confined in the single room because of her high risk of committing suicide. Sakura tried to talk to the nurses and doctors but they didn’t listen to her. Under the circumstances another patient Miki, who suffers from an eating disorder, leads her to understand the unknown world. But, Sakura is looking for the way to get back to the real world as soon as possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94HsOFZGKqHTJUQFzrLt3yXEYHY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39011'),
  ('1074939764752519678', 'Welcome to the Rileys', 2010, 'Drama', 'Jake Scott, Christopher Soos, Jesse Nye', 'Ken Hixon', 'Kristen Stewart, James Gandolfini, Melissa Leo, Joe Chrest, Ally Sheedy, Eisa Davis, Lance E. Nichols, Tiffany Coty', 'R', 'Years after their teenage daughter’s death, Lois and Doug Riley, an upstanding Indiana couple, are frozen by estranging grief. Doug escapes to New Orleans on a business trip. Compelled by urgencies he doesn’t understand, he insinuates himself into the life of an underage hooker, becoming her platonic guardian.', 'Years after their teenage daughter’s death, Lois and Doug Riley, an upstanding Indiana couple, are frozen by estranging grief. Doug escapes to New Orleans on a business trip. Compelled by urgencies he doesn’t understand, he insinuates himself into the life of an underage hooker, becoming her platonic guardian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tt9pBPoXjFu36rPqObwrgkYCY3t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31007'),
  ('1054420212703607915', 'Welcome to the South', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Luca Miniero, Chantal Toesca, Paolo Carnera', 'Massimo Gaudioso', 'Claudio Bisio, Alessandro Siani, Angela Finocchiaro, Valentina Lodovini, Nando Paone, Riccardo Zinna, Nunzia Schiano, Salvatore Misticone', null, 'Alberto, post office manager of a small town in Brianza, under pressure of his wife Sylvia, is willing to do anything to get the transfer to Milan. Even pretending to be disabled to climb in the ranking. But the trick does not work and as punishment, he is transferred in a small town in Campania, which to an inhabitant of the north is equivalent to a nightmare ...', 'Alberto, post office manager of a small town in Brianza, under pressure of his wife Sylvia, is willing to do anything to get the transfer to Milan. Even pretending to be disabled to climb in the ranking. But the trick does not work and as punishment, he is transferred in a small town in Campania, which to an inhabitant of the north is equivalent to a nightmare ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diKOb5QAFTjCzllB0ZcghmKE2nk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48415'),
  ('754813097519238072', 'Welcome to the Space Show', 2010, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Takaharu Ozaki, Koji Masunari, Masashi Ishihama', 'Hideyuki Kurata', 'Takuto Yoshinaga, Tomoyo Kurosawa, Tamaki Matsumoto, Keiji Fujiwara, Honoka Ikezuki, Masaya Onosaka, Noriko Hidaka, Masanori Takeda', null, 'Five children save the life of a dog-like alien while at a self-run summer camp. He attempts to reward them by taking them to an alien colony on the Moon. Events take a turn for the worse when his report on that attack that injured him causes passage from the Moon to the Earth to be banned, and children are stranded in space. The children need to find a way back home before camp ends and their parents discover that they are missing. They also have to avoid the poachers that injured their alien friend, and now seem to be stalking them all.', 'Five children save the life of a dog-like alien while at a self-run summer camp. He attempts to reward them by taking them to an alien colony on the Moon. Events take a turn for the worse when his report on that attack that injured him causes passage from the Moon to the Earth to be banned, and children are stranded in space. The children need to find a way back home before camp ends and their parents discover that they are missing. They also have to avoid the poachers that injured their alien friend, and now seem to be stalking them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZSzBnXU4Wk7HA5JSCrlnBK1pwp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61591'),
  ('41670647217540243', 'Welcome to the Sticks', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Dany Boon, Pierre Aïm, Nicolas Guy', 'Dany Boon, Alexandre Charlot, Franck Magnier', 'Kad Merad, Dany Boon, Zoé Félix, Lorenzo Ausilia-Foret, Anne Marivin, Philippe Duquesne, Guy Lecluyse, Line Renaud', null, 'Although living a comfortable life in Salon-de-Provence, a charming town in the South of France, Julie has been feeling depressed for a while. To please her, Philippe Abrams, a post office administrator, her husband, tries to obtain a transfer to a seaside town, on the French Riviera, at any cost. The trouble is that he is caught red-handed while trying to scam an inspector. Philippe is immediately banished to the distant unheard of town of Bergues, in the Far North of France...', 'Although living a comfortable life in Salon-de-Provence, a charming town in the South of France, Julie has been feeling depressed for a while. To please her, Philippe Abrams, a post office administrator, her husband, tries to obtain a transfer to a seaside town, on the French Riviera, at any cost. The trouble is that he is caught red-handed while trying to scam an inspector. Philippe is immediately banished to the distant unheard of town of Bergues, in the Far North of France...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnUkc60SkI1PCY1SyfLFpZc0T7C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8265'),
  ('1618637058936900', 'Welcome to Woop Woop', 1998, 'Music, Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Stephan Elliott, Mike Molloy, Andre Fleuren', 'Michael Thomas', 'Johnathon Schaech, Rod Taylor, Susie Porter, Dee Smart, Richard Moir, Maggie Kirkpatrick, Paul Mercurio, Rachel Griffiths', 'R', 'A con artist escapes a deal gone wrong in New York and winds up in the Aussie outback in a strange town whose inhabitants are an oddball collection of misfits.', 'A con artist escapes a deal gone wrong in New York and winds up in the Aussie outback in a strange town whose inhabitants are an oddball collection of misfits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ek9pyqNFQbtwtXptRZxsIGkOuN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6970'),
  ('194020855229997988', 'Welcome Venice', 2021, 'Drama', 'Andrea Segre, Matteo Calore, Cinzia Castania', 'Andrea Segre, Marco Pettenello', 'Paolo Pierobon, Andrea Pennacchi, Ottavia Piccolo, Roberto Citran, Anna Bellato, Sandra Toffolatti, Francesco Bovara, Giuliana Musso', null, 'Two brothers are in conflict over the way the Venetian lagoon has been transformed, and the identity of the city and its residents has drastically changed.', 'Two brothers are in conflict over the way the Venetian lagoon has been transformed, and the identity of the city and its residents has drastically changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwZSSaGUfTtsqhECh8NJyiowBgr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:856403'),
  ('758863488994230620', 'Welcome, or No Trespassing', 1964, 'Comedy, Family', 'Elem Klimov, Anatoliy Kuznetsov, Viktor Zorin', 'Ilya Nusinov, Semyon Lungin', 'Evgeniy Evstigneev, Arina Aleynikova, Viktor Kosykh, Yekaterina Mazurova, Ilya Rutberg, Lidiya Smirnova, Aleksei Smirnov, Lida Volkova', null, 'Children rebel against the strict rules and regulations they face during their time in a Communist Young Pioneer camp.', 'Children rebel against the strict rules and regulations they face during their time in a Communist Young Pioneer camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QijJUlaeuNpuePp8nkQt24sGSb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20886'),
  ('851715565109343766', 'Welfare', 1975, 'Documentary', 'Frederick Wiseman, William Brayne', null, null, null, 'WELFARE shows the nature and complexity of the welfare system in sequences illustrating the staggering diversity of problems that constitute welfare: housing, unemployment, divorce, medical and psychiatric problems, abandoned and abused children, and the elderly. These issues are presented in a context where welfare workers as well as clients struggle to cope with and interpret the laws and regulations that govern their work and life.', 'WELFARE shows the nature and complexity of the welfare system in sequences illustrating the staggering diversity of problems that constitute welfare: housing, unemployment, divorce, medical and psychiatric problems, abandoned and abused children, and the elderly. These issues are presented in a context where welfare workers as well as clients struggle to cope with and interpret the laws and regulations that govern their work and life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1eFgNI93rRSOFZZ9cajF3tMmGPc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90511'),
  ('648276808992284242', 'Well', 2016, 'Drama', 'Attila Gigor', 'Attila Gigor', 'Péter Jankovics, Zsolt Kovács, Nóra Trokán, Niké Kurta, Roland Tzafetás, Lia Pokorny, Ferenc Pusztai, Zsolt László', null, 'At a gas station in the middle of nowhere, a young man arrives to meet his father he hasn''t seen for 30 years. On the same day, a van with four prostitutes breaks down at the very same gas station, on the way to Switzerland. The three days they spend together in the station change their lives forever.', 'At a gas station in the middle of nowhere, a young man arrives to meet his father he hasn''t seen for 30 years. On the same day, a van with four prostitutes breaks down at the very same gas station, on the way to Switzerland. The three days they spend together in the station change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ur0O4VSHLlkgcbpFZ9cjlqTkOb9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414597'),
  ('810886985340874691', 'Well-Off People', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Patierno, Maurizio Calvesi, Fabio Simonelli', 'Francesco Patierno, Federico Favot, Federico Baccomo', 'Claudio Bisio, Margherita Buy, Diego Abatantuono, Jennipher Rodriguez, Claudio Bigagli, Raul Cremona, Carlo Buccirosso, Laura Baldi', null, 'Umberto Maria Durloni is a successful lawyer and a socialite who likes parties and a lavish life. He''s got it all, except any ethical qualms.Only a step away from the top, his perfect world crumbles, showing him the brutal do downside to his life.', 'Umberto Maria Durloni is a successful lawyer and a socialite who likes parties and a lavish life. He''s got it all, except any ethical qualms.Only a step away from the top, his perfect world crumbles, showing him the brutal do downside to his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKMmC8fZgVywk5Jja8NYAIFjgAb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249457'),
  ('745748476375008159', 'Well, We Were Lucky with the Weather', 1980, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Kjell Sundvall, Jens Ekholm, Kjell-Åke Andersson', 'Kjell Sundvall, Börje Hansson, Kjell-Åke Andersson', 'Rolf Skoglund, Claire Wikholm, Gunnar ''Knas'' Lindkvist, Lotta Thomsen, Johan Öhman, Karl-Erik Andersson, Folke Asplund, Kenneth Josefsson', null, 'The Backlund family is going on a caravanning holiday. According to the father Gösta it is the best way to see Sweden. The son Johan does not want to do anything but bathing and the daugther Lotta don''t even want to come along. You get to see the Backlunds in resturants, beaches and caravan sites. Gösta likes to rule his family but it does not go very well.', 'The Backlund family is going on a caravanning holiday. According to the father Gösta it is the best way to see Sweden. The son Johan does not want to do anything but bathing and the daugther Lotta don''t even want to come along. You get to see the Backlunds in resturants, beaches and caravan sites. Gösta likes to rule his family but it does not go very well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6QdiKdfzjyF395ky9O6Lg6vrPh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18920'),
  ('239399025933346718', 'Wellness für Paare', 2016, 'TV Movie, Comedy', 'Jan Georg Schütte', 'Jan Georg Schütte', 'Anke Engelke, Bjarne Mädel, Anneke Kim Sarnau, Magdalena Boczarska, Devid Striesow, Gabriela Maria Schmeide, Michael Wittenborn, Katharina M. Schubert', null, 'A wellness hotel in a small German castle specializes in well-off couples, offering a wide range of services, including one some partners feel trapped into : relational therapy. It''s truth time, for some liberating, forcing others to face their secrets of dysfunctional relationship.', 'A wellness hotel in a small German castle specializes in well-off couples, offering a wide range of services, including one some partners feel trapped into : relational therapy. It''s truth time, for some liberating, forcing others to face their secrets of dysfunctional relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMXVhrhgnWNFNcZ40iT6giqHsts.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427474'),
  ('496269652967496250', 'Wells Fargo', 1937, 'History, Western', 'Frank Lloyd, Theodor Sparkuhl, William Tummel', 'Paul Schofield, Gerald Geraghty, Frederick J. Jackson', 'Joel McCrea, Bob Burns, Frances Dee, Lloyd Nolan, Henry O''Neill, Mary Nash, Ralph Morgan, Johnny Mack Brown', 'NR', 'In the 1840s, Ramsey MacKay, the driver for the struggling Wells Fargo mail and freight company, will secure an important contract if he delivers fresh oysters to Buffalo from New York City. When he rescues Justine Pryor and her mother, who are stranded in a broken wagon on his route, he doesn''t let them slow him down and gives the ladies an exhilirating ride into Buffalo. He arrives in time to obtain the contract and is then sent by company president Henry Wells to St. Louis to establish a branch office.', 'In the 1840s, Ramsey MacKay, the driver for the struggling Wells Fargo mail and freight company, will secure an important contract if he delivers fresh oysters to Buffalo from New York City. When he rescues Justine Pryor and her mother, who are stranded in a broken wagon on his route, he doesn''t let them slow him down and gives the ladies an exhilirating ride into Buffalo. He arrives in time to obtain the contract and is then sent by company president Henry Wells to St. Louis to establish a branch office.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ZWmhTWDgQD3NwDOroyEmRcTheY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111997'),
  ('910331671670286436', 'Wendell & Wild', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure, Horror', 'Melissa St. Onge, Helder K. Sun, Henry Selick', 'Jordan Peele, Henry Selick', 'Lyric Ross, Keegan-Michael Key, Jordan Peele, Sam Zelaya, James Hong, Angela Bassett, Gabrielle Dennis, Gary Gatewood', 'PG-13', 'Two scheming demons strike a deal with a punk rock-loving teen so they can leave the Underworld and live out their dreams in the Land of the Living.', 'Two scheming demons strike a deal with a punk rock-loving teen so they can leave the Underworld and live out their dreams in the Land of the Living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7XxXJ7ponaLAkxiySRxox2Ssc4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511817'),
  ('1059811979199080568', 'Wendigo', 2002, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Larry Fessenden, Terry Stacey', 'Larry Fessenden', 'Patricia Clarkson, Erik Per Sullivan, Jake Weber, John Speredakos, Christopher Wynkoop, Lloyd Oxendine, Brian Delate, Daniel Stewart Sherman', 'R', 'A family from the city decide to spend a weekend away at a friend''s country farmhouse. But a fluke accident sets off a chain of events that alters their lives forever and conjures up the ferocious spirit of the Wendigo.', 'A family from the city decide to spend a weekend away at a friend''s country farmhouse. But a fluke accident sets off a chain of events that alters their lives forever and conjures up the ferocious spirit of the Wendigo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPtteHPYzO0ZBgr94Bx0a87zmzy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44340'),
  ('1022971135478608392', 'Wendy', 2020, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Benh Zeitlin, Sturla Brandth Grøvlen', 'Benh Zeitlin, Eliza Zeitlin', 'Devin France, Yashua Mack, Gage Naquin, Gavin Naquin, Krzysztof Meyn, Ahmad Cage, Romyri Ross, Kevin Pugh', 'PG-13', 'A re-imagining of "Peter Pan" from the point of view of Wendy Darling, who finds herself lost on a mysterious island where aging and time have come unglued. She must fight to save her family, her freedom and the joyous spirit of youth.', 'A re-imagining of "Peter Pan" from the point of view of Wendy Darling, who finds herself lost on a mysterious island where aging and time have come unglued. She must fight to save her family, her freedom and the joyous spirit of youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nphsStbtAuJ2IaXtCvDXDwMUF5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399363'),
  ('496179762320369840', 'Wendy - Der Film', 2017, 'Family, Adventure', 'Dagmar Seume', 'Caroline Hecht', 'Jule Hermann, Benjamin Sadler, Jasmin Gerat, Maren Kroymann, Nadeshda Brennicke, Waldemar Kobus, Henriette Morawe, Julius Hotz', null, 'Twelve-year-old Wendy is not at all happy that she has to spend her summer vacation with her parents at her grandma Herta''s run-down riding stables. Wendy has been afraid of horses ever since a riding accident. But then she meets the pretty mare Dixie, who has run away from the butcher. Slowly, a deep friendship develops between the horse and the girl, and while Wendy does everything she can to save Dixie, she also manages to overcome her fear.', 'Twelve-year-old Wendy is not at all happy that she has to spend her summer vacation with her parents at her grandma Herta''s run-down riding stables. Wendy has been afraid of horses ever since a riding accident. But then she meets the pretty mare Dixie, who has run away from the butcher. Slowly, a deep friendship develops between the horse and the girl, and while Wendy does everything she can to save Dixie, she also manages to overcome her fear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8qtsiseF7rkePOdpG0LfHgTZWR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410655'),
  ('520537872549408576', 'Wendy and Lucy', 2008, 'Drama', 'Kelly Reichardt, Sam Levy', 'Kelly Reichardt, Jonathan Raymond', 'Michelle Williams, Wally Dalton, Will Oldham, John Robinson, Will Patton, Lucy, David Koppell, Max Clement', null, 'A near-penniless drifter''s journey to Alaska in search of work is interrupted when she loses her dog while attempting to shoplift food for it.', 'A near-penniless drifter''s journey to Alaska in search of work is interrupted when she loses her dog while attempting to shoplift food for it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVtF8SW4zMbculTXD52RDvmQAAR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8942'),
  ('732735597109220323', 'Wendy Wu: Homecoming Warrior', 2006, 'Family, Action, Adventure, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Kevin Riley, John Laing, Koichi Sakamoto', 'Vince Cheung, Ben Montanio, B. Mark Seabrooks', 'Brenda Song, Shin Koyamada, Susan Chuang, Justin Chon, Michael David Cheng, Andy Fischer-Price, Ellen Woglom, Tsai Chin', 'G', 'It is the story of an average, popular American teenager named Wendy Wu who discovers that in order to win the coveted crown she must first learn the way of the warrior. Wendy Wu has a one track mind, and that track leads directly to the title of homecoming queen -- no unscheduled stops, and no unnecessary detours. When a mysterious Chinese monk named Shen arrives to mold Wendy into a fearless kung fu warrior, however, her royal aspirations suddenly jump the track as she desperately attempts to juggle her boyfriend, her homework, and of course, the fierce competition to become homecoming queen. Now, as Wendy begins to train her mind, body, and spirit in the ancient tradition of the martial arts and her inner warrior gradually begins to emerge, the girl who once obsessed over popularity finally begins to put that popularity into perspective as she gradually realizes what truly matters in life.', 'It is the story of an average, popular American teenager named Wendy Wu who discovers that in order to win the coveted crown she must first learn the way of the warrior. Wendy Wu has a one track mind, and that track leads directly to the title of homecoming queen -- no unscheduled stops, and no unnecessary detours. When a mysterious Chinese monk named Shen arrives to mold Wendy into a fearless kung fu warrior, however, her royal aspirations suddenly jump the track as she desperately attempts to juggle her boyfriend, her homework, and of course, the fierce competition to become homecoming queen. Now, as Wendy begins to train her mind, body, and spirit in the ancient tradition of the martial arts and her inner warrior gradually begins to emerge, the girl who once obsessed over popularity finally begins to put that popularity into perspective as she gradually realizes what truly matters in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6EfY13SHzvpwXg2KPixnbCXuUoR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61717'),
  ('1099575415411364575', 'Went the Day Well?', 1942, 'War, Thriller', 'Alberto Cavalcanti, Ernest Irving, Wilkie Cooper', 'John Dighton, Diana Morgan, Angus MacPhail', 'Leslie Banks, Elizabeth Allan, Frank Lawton, Basil Sydney, Valerie Taylor, Mervyn Johns, Edward Rigby, Marie Lohr', null, 'The quiet village of Bramley End is taken over by German troops posing as Royal Engineers. Their task is to disrupt England''s radar network in preparation for a full scale German invasion. Once the villagers discover the true identity of the troops, they do whatever they can to thwart the Nazis plans.', 'The quiet village of Bramley End is taken over by German troops posing as Royal Engineers. Their task is to disrupt England''s radar network in preparation for a full scale German invasion. Once the villagers discover the true identity of the troops, they do whatever they can to thwart the Nazis plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6P9SOdqj4fQf3aYatq95f2g3ME6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23924'),
  ('425771180951411595', 'Wer', 2013, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'William Brent Bell, Simona Dinu, Ovidiu Paunescu', 'William Brent Bell, Matthew Peterman', 'A. J. Cook, Sebastian Roché, Simon Quarterman, Vik Sahay, Brian Scott O''Connor, Stephanie Lemelin, Oaklee Pendergast, Angelina Armani', 'R', 'A defense attorney begins to suspect that her client, who is charged with the murders of a vacationing family, might be more than meets the eye.', 'A defense attorney begins to suspect that her client, who is charged with the murders of a vacationing family, might be more than meets the eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWkkgAuYIyXxNDUs5zydwEr9xfg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222461'),
  ('587104053213380729', 'Wer 4 Sind', 2019, 'Documentary, Music', 'Thomas Schwendemann', 'Thomas Schwendemann', 'Michael Beck, Thomas D, Andreas Rieke, Smudo', null, 'What is the secret of Germany''s most successful hip-hop band? What makes them different? How did they make their mark in German pop culture and develop over the years? A behind-the-scenes look at a band that has written German music history and continues to do so.', 'What is the secret of Germany''s most successful hip-hop band? What makes them different? How did they make their mark in German pop culture and develop over the years? A behind-the-scenes look at a band that has written German music history and continues to do so.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7a6LIu029qfhdOTL7SQ6vKefd2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:621912'),
  ('987817814809249832', 'Wer aufgibt ist tot', 2016, 'TV Movie, Drama, Comedy', 'Stephan Wagner', null, 'Bjarne Mädel, Friederike Kempter, Katharina M. Schubert, Amber Bongard, Till Florian Beyerbach, Charlotte Bohning, David C. Bunners, Viola Pobitschka', null, 'Just a few minutes ago, Paul Lohmann picked up a hitchhiker at the side of the road when he suddenly sees himself lying badly injured in his car. His car has overturned after a crash and Paul is angry about his apparent demise. He was just about to get his career off to a flying start and get his family life back on track. He still had so much planned! Then the hitchhiker, who turns out to be an angel, explains to him that he is in an intermediate world and still has a chance to overturn his fate. But Paul keeps experiencing situations from his past. Will he manage to turn the catastrophe around in time and prevent the car accident?', 'Just a few minutes ago, Paul Lohmann picked up a hitchhiker at the side of the road when he suddenly sees himself lying badly injured in his car. His car has overturned after a crash and Paul is angry about his apparent demise. He was just about to get his career off to a flying start and get his family life back on track. He still had so much planned! Then the hitchhiker, who turns out to be an angel, explains to him that he is in an intermediate world and still has a chance to overturn his fate. But Paul keeps experiencing situations from his past. Will he manage to turn the catastrophe around in time and prevent the car accident?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2zBrs0xzRpL9Nbb7yTbNj3LImd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403793'),
  ('1081126429000439094', 'Wer''s glaubt wird selig', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Marcus H. Rosenmüller', 'Jeremy Leven', 'Christian Ulmen, Marie Leuenberger, Nikolaus Paryla, Hannelore Elsner, Lisa Maria Potthoff, Fahri Yardım, Simon Schwarz, Jürgen Tonkel', null, 'The snow is staying away from the Bavarian ski village of Haunzenberg, and so are the skiers. Business is failing and so is Georg''s relationship with Emilie. During his attempt to reignite the fires of passion, the wooden cross in the next room falls down, crushing Emilie''s very Catholic mother Daisy. Wracked with guilt, Georg and his drinking buddies hatch a plan to have Daisy canonized by the Church, hoping to save both the village and his relationship. Everything goes according to plan until the Vatican sends a Priest to examine the miracles of Saint Daisy... Written by Anthony Parkhurst', 'The snow is staying away from the Bavarian ski village of Haunzenberg, and so are the skiers. Business is failing and so is Georg''s relationship with Emilie. During his attempt to reignite the fires of passion, the wooden cross in the next room falls down, crushing Emilie''s very Catholic mother Daisy. Wracked with guilt, Georg and his drinking buddies hatch a plan to have Daisy canonized by the Church, hoping to save both the village and his relationship. Everything goes according to plan until the Vatican sends a Priest to examine the miracles of Saint Daisy... Written by Anthony Parkhurst', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aglu5kkTky0wVWYskIALRvw1pMs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117464'),
  ('338164761993098937', 'Were the World Mine', 2008, 'Fantasy, Romance', 'Tom Gustafson, Kira Kelly', 'Tom Gustafson, Cory Krueckeberg', 'Tanner Cohen, Judy McLane, Zelda Williams, Wendy Robie, Jill Larson, Ricky Goldman, Nathaniel David Becker, Christian Stolte', null, 'If you had a love-potion, who would you make fall madly in love with you? Timothy, prone to escaping his dismal high school reality through dazzling musical daydreams, gets to answer that question in a very real way. After his eccentric teacher casts him as Puck in A Midsummer Night''s Dream, he stumbles upon a recipe hidden within the script to create the play''s magical, purple love-pansy.', 'If you had a love-potion, who would you make fall madly in love with you? Timothy, prone to escaping his dismal high school reality through dazzling musical daydreams, gets to answer that question in a very real way. After his eccentric teacher casts him as Puck in A Midsummer Night''s Dream, he stumbles upon a recipe hidden within the script to create the play''s magical, purple love-pansy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g59ynRRLSyBNpLul3pqd9o7WHWm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19375'),
  ('765296617731229298', 'Werewolf', 1996, 'Horror', 'Tony Zarindast', 'Tony Zarindast, Brad Hornbacher', 'Jorge Rivero, Richard Lynch, Federico Cavalli, Adrianna Miles, Joe Estevez, Jules Desjarlais, R.C. Bates, Lisa Frantz', 'R', 'After an archaeological team in Arizona unearths a werewolf skeleton and one of them develops symptoms of lycanthropy before dying, the dig''s foreman, Yuri, tries to infect other townspeople as an experiment. When a science writer named Paul takes up residence in the town to cover the dig and develops a romantic interest in a female team member, Yuri makes Paul his next target.', 'After an archaeological team in Arizona unearths a werewolf skeleton and one of them develops symptoms of lycanthropy before dying, the dig''s foreman, Yuri, tries to infect other townspeople as an experiment. When a science writer named Paul takes up residence in the town to cover the dig and develops a romantic interest in a female team member, Yuri makes Paul his next target.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0BRhfzR5cnRXhqX77puFzhccoQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87874'),
  ('104714030934087082', 'Werewolf', 2019, 'Horror, War, History', 'Dominik Danilczyk, Adrian Panek, Radosław Chrześciański', 'Adrian Panek', 'Nicolas Przygoda, Kamil Polnisiak, Sonia Mietielica, Werner Daehn, Danuta Stenka, Jakub Syska, Helena Mazur, Krzysztof Durski', null, 'Summer of 1945. A temporary orphanage is established in an abandoned palace surrounded by forests for the eight children liberated from the Gross-Rosen camp. Hanka, also a former inmate, becomes their guardian. After the atrocities of the camp, the protagonists slowly begin to regain what is left of their childhood but the horror returns quickly. Camp Alsatians roam the forests around. Released by the SS earlier on, they have gone feral and are starving. Looking for food they besiege the palace. The children are terrified and their camp survival instinct is triggered.', 'Summer of 1945. A temporary orphanage is established in an abandoned palace surrounded by forests for the eight children liberated from the Gross-Rosen camp. Hanka, also a former inmate, becomes their guardian. After the atrocities of the camp, the protagonists slowly begin to regain what is left of their childhood but the horror returns quickly. Camp Alsatians roam the forests around. Released by the SS earlier on, they have gone feral and are starving. Looking for food they besiege the palace. The children are terrified and their camp survival instinct is triggered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egSBfZCPeZvaSx4IKXKRqhH8DIg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500915'),
  ('638387108732854209', 'Werewolf by Night', 2022, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror', 'Michael Giacchino, Zoë White, Janell Sammelman', null, 'Gael García Bernal, Laura Donnelly, Harriet Sansom Harris, Kirk R. Thatcher, Eugenie Bondurant, Leonardo Nam, Daniel J. Watts, Al Hamacher', 'PG-13', 'On a dark and somber night, a secret cabal of monster hunters emerge from the shadows and gather at the foreboding Bloodstone Temple following the death of their leader. In a strange and macabre memorial to the leader’s life, the attendees are thrust into a mysterious and deadly competition for a powerful relic—a hunt that will ultimately bring them face to face with a dangerous monster.', 'On a dark and somber night, a secret cabal of monster hunters emerge from the shadows and gather at the foreboding Bloodstone Temple following the death of their leader. In a strange and macabre memorial to the leader’s life, the attendees are thrust into a mysterious and deadly competition for a powerful relic—a hunt that will ultimately bring them face to face with a dangerous monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvIvNKRIJPPS7WSFarFhOAGIVnU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:894205'),
  ('616410876084747479', 'Werewolf Castle', 2022, 'Horror, Fantasy, History, Action', 'Charlie Steeds', 'Charlie Steeds', 'Peter Lofsgard, Greg Draven, Derek Nelson, Tim Cartwright, Jay O''Connell, James Swanton, Ricardo Freitas, Jake Watkins', null, 'When a pack of werewolves attack a medieval village, Thorfinn, whose lover perished in the attack, joins knights Thomas, Osmund, Hamelin, and Hal Skullsplitter as they lead the fight back against the vicious lycanthropes.', 'When a pack of werewolves attack a medieval village, Thorfinn, whose lover perished in the attack, joins knights Thomas, Osmund, Hamelin, and Hal Skullsplitter as they lead the fight back against the vicious lycanthropes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjMjnbS3pEdlGU1I2ahb3kXCGRt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854867'),
  ('631037991157595079', 'Werewolf in a Girls'' Dormitory', 1961, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Paolo Heusch, Renato del Frate', 'Ernesto Gastaldi', 'Carl Schell, Barbara Lass, Curt Lowens, Maurice Marsac, Luciano Pigozzi, Joseph Mercier, Michela Roc, Anni Steinart', null, 'The new science teacher Dr. Julian Olcott with a mysterious past arrives in an institutional boarding school for troublemaker girls. Along the night, the intern Mary Smith, who is blackmailing another teacher - Sir Alfred Whiteman - with some love letters, is slaughtered by a werewolf. The detective in charge of the investigation attributes the crime to a wolf, while her mate Priscilla believes she was killed by Sir Alfred. On the next days, other deaths happen in the school, reducing the list of suspects.', 'The new science teacher Dr. Julian Olcott with a mysterious past arrives in an institutional boarding school for troublemaker girls. Along the night, the intern Mary Smith, who is blackmailing another teacher - Sir Alfred Whiteman - with some love letters, is slaughtered by a werewolf. The detective in charge of the investigation attributes the crime to a wolf, while her mate Priscilla believes she was killed by Sir Alfred. On the next days, other deaths happen in the school, reducing the list of suspects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmwehN09D2RUTEvxQuveRaeH0gN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44444'),
  ('218354762855647848', 'Werewolf of London', 1935, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Stuart Walker, Charles J. Stumar, Charles S. Gould', 'Edmund Pearson', 'Henry Hull, Warner Oland, Valerie Hobson, Lester Matthews, Lawrence Grant, Spring Byington, Clark Williams, J.M. Kerrigan', null, 'A strange animal attack turns a botanist into a bloodthirsty monster.', 'A strange animal attack turns a botanist into a bloodthirsty monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78kD3Fpvgd8qubKMbhS5dKofjR8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27970'),
  ('141489672862530917', 'Werewolf Woman', 1976, 'Horror', 'Rino Di Silvestro, Mario Capriotti, Dennis Kull', 'Rino Di Silvestro', 'Annik Borel, Howard Ross, Dagmar Lassander, Pietro Torrisi, Elio Zamuto, Andrea Scotti, Frederick Stafford, Tino Carraro', 'R', 'A woman has dreams that she is a werewolf so she goes out and finds men. She proceeds to have sex with them and then rip their throats out with her teeth. She eventually falls in love but then she is raped and her lover is murdered so she goes out for revenge.', 'A woman has dreams that she is a werewolf so she goes out and finds men. She proceeds to have sex with them and then rip their throats out with her teeth. She eventually falls in love but then she is raped and her lover is murdered so she goes out for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvOpwD1repotP22ZWsyJo1Bz3pJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92751'),
  ('860112243770822113', 'Werewolf: The Beast Among Us', 2012, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Louis Morneau, Philip Robertson, Diana Ghinea', 'Louis Morneau, Michael Tabb', 'Ed Quinn, Guy Wilson, Stephen Rea, Rachel DiPillo, Adam Croasdell, Ana Ularu, Steven Bauer, Nia Peeples', 'R', 'Set in a 19th century village, a young man studying under a local doctor joins a team of hunters on the trail of a wolf-like creature.', 'Set in a 19th century village, a young man studying under a local doctor joins a team of hunters on the trail of a wolf-like creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VHFRTE8TWSL2ivZaVcUEu6ACc1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132137'),
  ('304503010022949262', 'Werewolves', 2024, 'Action, Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Steven C. Miller, Brandon Cox', 'Matthew Kennedy', 'Frank Grillo, Katrina Law, Ilfenesh Hadera, Jimmy Cummings, Lou Diamond Phillips, Kamdynn Gary, Lydia Styslinger, Daniel Fernandez', 'R', 'A year after a supermoon’s light activated a dormant gene, transforming humans into bloodthirsty werewolves and causing nearly a billion deaths, the nightmare resurfaces as the supermoon rises again. Two scientists attempt to stop the mutation but fail and must now struggle to reach one of their family homes.', 'A year after a supermoon’s light activated a dormant gene, transforming humans into bloodthirsty werewolves and causing nearly a billion deaths, the nightmare resurfaces as the supermoon rises again. Two scientists attempt to stop the mutation but fail and must now struggle to reach one of their family homes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/otXBlMPbFBRs6o2Xt6KX59Qw6dL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:970450'),
  ('642098766494084045', 'Werewolves on Wheels', 1971, 'Action, Horror', 'Michel Levesque, Isidore Mankofsky', 'David M. Kaufman, Michel Levesque', 'Steve Oliver, Donna Anderson, Gene Shane, Billy Gray, Gray Johnson, Barry MacGuire, Owen Orr, Anna Lynn Brown', 'R', 'A biker gang visits a monastery where they encounter black-robed monks engaged in worshipping Satan. When the monks try to persuade one of the female bikers, Helen, to become a satanic sacrifice the bikers smash up the monastery and leave. The monks have the last laugh, though, as Helen, as a result of the satanic rituals, is now possessed and at night changes into a werewolf, with dire results for the biker gang.', 'A biker gang visits a monastery where they encounter black-robed monks engaged in worshipping Satan. When the monks try to persuade one of the female bikers, Helen, to become a satanic sacrifice the bikers smash up the monastery and leave. The monks have the last laugh, though, as Helen, as a result of the satanic rituals, is now possessed and at night changes into a werewolf, with dire results for the biker gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykkxRp24xBQFKpu3N80V0nsSXr1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56259'),
  ('477838495538969632', 'Werewolves Within', 2021, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Lenny Payan, Anne Marie Dentici, Caitlin Ayer', 'Mishna Wolff', 'Sam Richardson, Milana Vayntrub, George Basil, Sarah Burns, Michael Chernus, Catherine Curtin, Wayne Duvall, Harvey Guillén', 'R', 'When a proposed pipeline creates hostilities between residents of a small town, a newly-arrived forest ranger must keep the peace after a snowstorm confines the townspeople to an old lodge. But when a mysterious creature begins terrorizing the group, their worst tendencies and prejudices rise to the surface, and it is up to the ranger to keep the residents alive, both from each other and the monster which plagues them.', 'When a proposed pipeline creates hostilities between residents of a small town, a newly-arrived forest ranger must keep the peace after a snowstorm confines the townspeople to an old lodge. But when a mysterious creature begins terrorizing the group, their worst tendencies and prejudices rise to the surface, and it is up to the ranger to keep the residents alive, both from each other and the monster which plagues them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5CGgbgyvmE39Yoqa80GKsgClbQm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800497'),
  ('278908101825654580', 'Werner - Eiskalt!', 2011, 'Comedy, Animation, Action', 'Gernot Roll, Rötger Feldmann, Gernot Roll', 'Rötger Feldmann, Thomas Platt, Herman Weigel', 'Rötger Feldmann, Andi Feldmann, Klaus Büchner, Ivonne Schönherr, Marysol Fernandez, Richard Sammel, Kalle Haverland, Jochen Nickel', null, 'Werner and Holgi are friends, but also lifelong rivals. Now Werner finally has enough of being the eternal second and is planning his revenge. With his special motorcycle, the ''Red Porsche Killer'', he challenges Holgi and his car.', 'Werner and Holgi are friends, but also lifelong rivals. Now Werner finally has enough of being the eternal second and is planning his revenge. With his special motorcycle, the ''Red Porsche Killer'', he challenges Holgi and his car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AwzbPyuGl7XVyGz2PUzSwKmWyKP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66896'),
  ('463917007590056038', 'Werner - Gekotzt wird später!', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Action', 'Michael Schaack, Graham Tiernan, Toby Genkel', 'Rötger Feldmann, Andi Feldmann', 'Klaus Büchner, Andi Feldmann, Otto Sander, Kulle Westphal, Bertram Hiese, Rötger Feldmann, Lilo Wanders, Heinz Schenk', null, 'Werner, Andi and Eckat play dice to determine the next king of the trio. When Werner is crowned king, he decides for all of them to skip work and start for Korsika.', 'Werner, Andi and Eckat play dice to determine the next king of the trio. When Werner is crowned king, he decides for all of them to skip work and start for Korsika.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBv3CtwUaERWjZSokGmhP2Gks2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10470'),
  ('443401040697052720', 'Werner - Volles Rooäää!!!', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy, Action', 'Gerhard Hahn, Petra Feldmann, Sahin Ersöz', 'Andi Feldmann, Christian Sievers, Rötger Feldmann', 'Klaus Büchner, Rötger Feldmann, Thomas Struck, Andi Feldmann, Kulle Westphal, Robert Schlunze, Benno Hoffmann, Harald Wehmeier', null, 'A wicked investor wants Werner''s residential area razed to the ground in order to build a shopping center. However, building tycoon Günzelsen has not reckoned with Werner. Together with his master Röhrich he''s planning to blow away the plumbings with a gigantic obstruction...', 'A wicked investor wants Werner''s residential area razed to the ground in order to build a shopping center. However, building tycoon Günzelsen has not reckoned with Werner. Together with his master Röhrich he''s planning to blow away the plumbings with a gigantic obstruction...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JcuWbkqCfKuG3D7Ja6u5snEyqe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9496'),
  ('977086141977163429', 'Werner and the Wizard of Booze', 1990, 'Animation, Comedy, Action', 'Egon Werdin, Niki List, Michael Schaack', 'Ernst Kahl', 'Klaus Büchner, Rötger Feldmann, Andi Feldmann, Kulle Westphal, Meret Becker, I Stangl, Johannes Silberschneider, Ludger Pistor', null, 'Comic artist Brösel trades a magic pen that helps him come up with funny stories for the promise to fulfill one of Rumpelstiltskin''s wishes. The resulting animated films show episodes of the life of Werner, a plumber apprentice and motorbike enthusiast and his friends. They are interspersed with the live-action portions.', 'Comic artist Brösel trades a magic pen that helps him come up with funny stories for the promise to fulfill one of Rumpelstiltskin''s wishes. The resulting animated films show episodes of the life of Werner, a plumber apprentice and motorbike enthusiast and his friends. They are interspersed with the live-action portions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vptblYAQRE8qrYJmYVnl6pSU7YA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9742'),
  ('1083226108115883007', 'Werner Herzog Eats His Shoe', 1988, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Les Blank', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog, Errol Morris, Tom Luddy, Michael Goodwin, Chris Strachwitz, Phil Harberts, Alice Waters', null, 'Directors Werner Herzog and Errol Morris make a bet which results in Herzog living up to his promise that he would eat his shoe if Errol Morris ever completed the film Gates of Heaven.', 'Directors Werner Herzog and Errol Morris make a bet which results in Herzog living up to his promise that he would eat his shoe if Errol Morris ever completed the film Gates of Heaven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUJ2HJN74q4niaaEmH74AaFE3T8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99189'),
  ('359351332227253772', 'Werner Herzog: Radical Dreamer', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Thomas von Steinaecker, Henning Brümmer', 'Thomas von Steinaecker', 'Werner Herzog, Nicole Kidman, Christian Bale, Robert Pattinson, Carl Weathers, Chloé Zhao, Joshua Oppenheimer, Wim Wenders', null, 'With exclusive behind-the-scenes access into Herzog’s everyday life, rare archive material and in-depth interviews with celebrated collaborators – including Christian Bale, Nicole Kidman, and Robert Pattinson, we are given an exciting glimpse into the work and personal life of the iconic artist.', 'With exclusive behind-the-scenes access into Herzog’s everyday life, rare archive material and in-depth interviews with celebrated collaborators – including Christian Bale, Nicole Kidman, and Robert Pattinson, we are given an exciting glimpse into the work and personal life of the iconic artist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ne3aPYNq6OD22jr4E43Q3hUoltO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1016753'),
  ('321259535612297108', 'Werner: Eat My Dust!!!', 1996, 'Animation, Comedy, Action', 'Udo Beissel, Michael Schaack, Graham Tiernan', 'Rötger Feldmann, Andi Feldmann, Christian Sievers', 'Klaus Büchner, Andi Feldmann, Kulle Westphal, Günter Willumeit, Monty Arnold, Thomas Struck, Christian Sievers, Harald Wehmeier', null, 'Because of a bet, Werner and his friend have to construct the fastest vehicle to win a race, because life depends on it.', 'Because of a bet, Werner and his friend have to construct the fastest vehicle to win a race, because life depends on it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPpFMbEl5RvcHdKo5ZLrcJYffsr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9514'),
  ('85187552567187623', 'Werwulf', 2026, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Robert Eggers, Jarin Blaschke, Ben Howard', 'Robert Eggers, Sjón', 'Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Lily-Rose Depp, Willem Dafoe, Ralph Ineson, Jack Morris, Bodhi Rae Breathnach, Jan Bijvoet, Ritchi Edwards', null, 'Set in 13th century England, the story focuses on local villagers who are stalked by a mysterious creature. As the attacks continue, ancient folklore and superstition bleed into a terrifying reality.', 'Set in 13th century England, the story focuses on local villagers who are stalked by a mysterious creature. As the attacks continue, ancient folklore and superstition bleed into a terrifying reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hFPW8XfkirlocgGr0n7BorAoOW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1421903'),
  ('386152731714871690', 'Wes Craven''s New Nightmare', 1994, 'Horror, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Mark Irwin, Wes Craven, Gary Marcus', 'Wes Craven', 'Heather Langenkamp, Robert Englund, Miko Hughes, Wes Craven, David Newsom, Tracy Middendorf, Fran Bennett, John Saxon', 'R', 'A demonic force has chosen Freddy Krueger as its portal to the real world. Can Heather Langenkamp play the part of Nancy one last time and trap the evil trying to enter our world?', 'A demonic force has chosen Freddy Krueger as its portal to the real world. Can Heather Langenkamp play the part of Nancy one last time and trap the evil trying to enter our world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5BWxfL1x34nyYSvA3Qo5odleGW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11596'),
  ('1072281322708674610', 'Wesh, Wesh, What''s Happening?', 2001, 'Drama, Crime', 'Rabah Ameur-Zaïmeche, Olivier Smittarello', 'Rabah Ameur-Zaïmeche, Madjid Benaroudj', 'Rabah Ameur-Zaïmeche, Ahmed Hammoudi, Brahim Ameur-Zaïmeche', null, 'Kamel, a young man from the french ghetto, near Paris, is coming back to France. He was arrested for dealing drugs, he spent five years in jail and was banned from France for two years. He tries, with his family''s support, to find a job and live a normal life. But nothing''s normal in the ghetto.', 'Kamel, a young man from the french ghetto, near Paris, is coming back to France. He was arrested for dealing drugs, he spent five years in jail and was banned from France for two years. He tries, with his family''s support, to find a job and live a normal life. But nothing''s normal in the ghetto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2HieFsNQX9XDB9ClbqtlyitG5t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104234'),
  ('554280441232497393', 'West', 2013, 'Drama', 'Christian Schwochow, Frank Lamm, Iulia Mitzner', 'Heide Schwochow', 'Jördis Triebel, Tristan Göbel, Alexander Scheer, Jacky Ido, Anja Antonowicz, Stefan Lampadius, Andreas Nickl, Gabriele Schulze', null, 'East Germany. Summer, late 70''s. Three years after her boyfriend Wassilij''s apparent death, Nelly Senff decides to escape from behind the Berlin wall with her son Alexej, leaving her traumatic memories and past behind. Pretending to marry a West German, she crosses the border to start a new life in the West. But soon her past starts to haunt her as the Allied Secret Service begin to question Wassilij''s mysterious disappearance. Is he still alive? Was he a spy? Plagued by her past and fraught with paranoia, Nelly is forced to choose between discovering the truth about her former lover and her hopes for a better tomorrow.', 'East Germany. Summer, late 70''s. Three years after her boyfriend Wassilij''s apparent death, Nelly Senff decides to escape from behind the Berlin wall with her son Alexej, leaving her traumatic memories and past behind. Pretending to marry a West German, she crosses the border to start a new life in the West. But soon her past starts to haunt her as the Allied Secret Service begin to question Wassilij''s mysterious disappearance. Is he still alive? Was he a spy? Plagued by her past and fraught with paranoia, Nelly is forced to choose between discovering the truth about her former lover and her hopes for a better tomorrow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1DBtCgFYKmEWF5VMauvEaMKdRW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243233'),
  ('916458670972239622', 'West 11', 1963, 'Drama, Crime', 'Michael Winner, Otto Heller', 'Willis Hall, Keith Waterhouse', 'Alfred Lynch, Kathleen Breck, Eric Portman, Diana Dors, Kathleen Harrison, Freda Jackson, Finlay Currie, Marie Ney', null, 'In Notting Hill''s jazz club, coffee bar and bedsit land of the early 1960s, Joe Beckett is a young unemployed misfit and drifter whose life takes a turn for the worse when he encounters Richard Dyce, an ex-army officer.', 'In Notting Hill''s jazz club, coffee bar and bedsit land of the early 1960s, Joe Beckett is a young unemployed misfit and drifter whose life takes a turn for the worse when he encounters Richard Dyce, an ex-army officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b55G6ZQAg85XFJukKdPqIwILbwe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76147'),
  ('778232798324007469', 'West and Soda', 1965, 'Animation, Western, Comedy', 'Bruno Bozzetto, Roberto Scarpa, Luciano Marzetti', 'Attilio Giovannini, Bruno Bozzetto, Sergio Crivellaro', 'Nando Gazzolo, Vittoria Febbi, Carlo Romano, Luigi Pavese, Willy Moser, Lydia Simoneschi, Gianfranco Bellini, Anna Miserocchi', null, 'A greedy villain tries to coerce a woman into marrying him so he can take over her land, when a stranger rides into town intent on taking down the bad guys.', 'A greedy villain tries to coerce a woman into marrying him so he can take over her land, when a stranger rides into town intent on taking down the bad guys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeSxgjtzoVfoxvM3iPe4R9SaWpK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53093'),
  ('741824606199106942', 'West Beirut', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Ziad Doueiri, Ricardo Jacques Gale', 'Ziad Doueiri', 'Rami Doueiri, Mohammad Chamas, Rola Al Amin, Carmen Lebbos, Joseph Bou Nassar, Liliane Nemri, Mahmoud Mabsout, Hassan Farhat', null, 'In 1975, the long slog of civil war has recently begun in Beirut. Two friends, Tarek and Omar, suffer during the Lebanese civil war. Conflicts arise when they decide to cross from West to East, crossing the Muslim-Christian line that divides Beirut.', 'In 1975, the long slog of civil war has recently begun in Beirut. Two friends, Tarek and Omar, suffer during the Lebanese civil war. Conflicts arise when they decide to cross from West to East, crossing the Muslim-Christian line that divides Beirut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djx4ceoh6o5kdLKRuPsMULNWvDl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49184'),
  ('72409218762066682', 'West Coast', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Benjamin Weill', null, 'Devi Couzigou, Sullivan Loyez, Mathis Crusson, Victor Le Blond, Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Simon Astier, Isabelle Nanty, Gaia Bermani Amaral', null, 'Four inseparable teenagers in a small town in Brittany (France). As lifelong fans of the West Coast, they think are real gangstas. Together as a "gang", they are invincible, respected, fearless and nothing can reach them, certainly not the teasing and contempt of their fellow classmates. So when Fle-O, the leader of this merry gang, learns that he has to leave his town and his friends at the end of the year, his whole world falls apart leaving him vulnerable when the most popular kid in school decides to make fun of them in front of everyone. Humiliated, our protagonists decide to take their revenge through one last expedition together that will lead them further than they would have imagined. Through incongruous situations and successive meetings, they will grow and learn.', 'Four inseparable teenagers in a small town in Brittany (France). As lifelong fans of the West Coast, they think are real gangstas. Together as a "gang", they are invincible, respected, fearless and nothing can reach them, certainly not the teasing and contempt of their fellow classmates. So when Fle-O, the leader of this merry gang, learns that he has to leave his town and his friends at the end of the year, his whole world falls apart leaving him vulnerable when the most popular kid in school decides to make fun of them in front of everyone. Humiliated, our protagonists decide to take their revenge through one last expedition together that will lead them further than they would have imagined. Through incongruous situations and successive meetings, they will grow and learn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqijZiFEEdiH3rdcdDSyFn6gIEv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393712'),
  ('165143129576935213', 'West Indies', 1979, 'Music, History, Drama', 'Med Hondo, François Catonné, Philippe Dupuis-Mendel', 'Med Hondo, Daniel Boukman', 'Robert Liensol, Roland Bertin, Philippe Clévenot, Hélène Vincent, Théo Légitimus, Georges Hilarion, Elliot Roy, Cyril Aventurin', null, 'Aboard a giant slave ship in an abandoned Citroën factory, the history of the West Indies is traced through several centuries of French oppression. The ship becomes a stage for the people to tell stories via song and dance—from their enslavement to their displacement in Metropolitan France.', 'Aboard a giant slave ship in an abandoned Citroën factory, the history of the West Indies is traced through several centuries of French oppression. The ship becomes a stage for the people to tell stories via song and dance—from their enslavement to their displacement in Metropolitan France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/px8QJjA5i0l8r9kWov2FNpkpP47.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271858'),
  ('748186637031333156', 'West North West', 2018, 'Drama', 'Yasutaka Sekiné, Moe Hayami, Makoto Kawasaki', 'Takuro Nakamura', 'Hanae Kan, Sahel Rosa, Yuka Yamauchi, Lin Chuhan, Jiro Takasaki, Mio Agazuma, Kensuke Fukatsu, Takahiro Ono', null, 'Kei works at a cocktail bar, while Ai works as a model. Fearing she''ll be ostracized by society, Kei chooses not to admit her sexual orientation to anyone, and, as a result, she becomes distressed and lonely. One day, Kei gets close to Naima, an Iranian student studying art in Japan.', 'Kei works at a cocktail bar, while Ai works as a model. Fearing she''ll be ostracized by society, Kei chooses not to admit her sexual orientation to anyone, and, as a result, she becomes distressed and lonely. One day, Kei gets close to Naima, an Iranian student studying art in Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYyqFETFKvHn4BWXzhe0c9etJmL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448419'),
  ('27867605036076548', 'West of Hot Dog', 1924, 'Comedy, Western', 'Joe Rock, Scott Pembroke, Edgar Lyons', null, 'Stan Laurel, Julie Leonard, Lew Meehan', null, 'Stan travels to the small town of Hot Dog to collect an inheritance. He learns his late uncle left him everything - but in the event of Stan''s death it all goes to his two outlaw cousins.', 'Stan travels to the small town of Hot Dog to collect an inheritance. He learns his late uncle left him everything - but in the event of Stan''s death it all goes to his two outlaw cousins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJA0BcZfV9FNvUDYddGkPScn1Jv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107294'),
  ('665615605308457404', 'West of Memphis', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Amy J. Berg, Maryse Alberti, Ronan Killeen', 'Billy McMillin, Amy J. Berg', 'Damien Echols, Jessie Misskelley Jr., Jason Baldwin, Pam Hobbs, Steve Jones, John Fogleman, Jerry Driver, Sharon French', 'R', 'The documentary tells the hitherto unknown story behind an extraordinary and desperate fight to bring the truth to light. Told and made by those who lived it, the filmmakers'' unprecedented access to the inner workings of the defense allows the film to show the investigation, research, and appeals process in a way that has never been seen before; revealing shocking and disturbing new information about a case that still haunts the American South.', 'The documentary tells the hitherto unknown story behind an extraordinary and desperate fight to bring the truth to light. Told and made by those who lived it, the filmmakers'' unprecedented access to the inner workings of the defense allows the film to show the investigation, research, and appeals process in a way that has never been seen before; revealing shocking and disturbing new information about a case that still haunts the American South.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/468k7zjR95COOXcMLxE5GbXjerQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84351'),
  ('389037042673200523', 'West of the Divide', 1934, 'Action, Western', 'Robert N. Bradbury, Archie Stout', 'Robert N. Bradbury', 'John Wayne, Virginia Brown Faire, George ''Gabby'' Hayes, Lloyd Whitlock, Yakima Canutt, Lafe McKee, Billy O''Brien, Dick Dickinson', 'NR', 'Ted Hayden impersonates a wanted man and joins Gentry''s gang only to learn later that Gentry was the one who killed his father.', 'Ted Hayden impersonates a wanted man and joins Gentry''s gang only to learn later that Gentry was the one who killed his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zC5Lt0TOa9R30KfotXzFNehoexQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40799'),
  ('612979061841282735', 'West of the Pesos', 1960, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Tom Holland', null, 'Sylvester Cat is a guard at a Mexican experimental laboratory where mice are confined for research. The families of the captured mice place a call to Speedy Gonzales, the fastest mouse in Mexico, to help them rescue their compadres. Speedy comes and engages in the usual battle of wits and feet with Sylvester.', 'Sylvester Cat is a guard at a Mexican experimental laboratory where mice are confined for research. The families of the captured mice place a call to Speedy Gonzales, the fastest mouse in Mexico, to help them rescue their compadres. Speedy comes and engages in the usual battle of wits and feet with Sylvester.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8FmSCCz6IdhgoKhsbMyU7x8jpH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234756'),
  ('681878129230436165', 'West of Zanzibar', 1928, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Percy Hilburn, Tod Browning, Harry Sharrock', 'Elliott J. Clawson', 'Lon Chaney, Lionel Barrymore, Mary Nolan, Warner Baxter, Jacqueline Gadsden, Tiny Ward, Kalla Pasha, Curtis Nero', 'NR', 'A magician seeks vengeance upon the man who paralyzed him and the illegitimate daughter he sired with the magician''s wife.', 'A magician seeks vengeance upon the man who paralyzed him and the illegitimate daughter he sired with the magician''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwnhJhF73rADB9MURcpQ6AeLrPg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27506'),
  ('1130075047948014148', 'West Sex Journey 2', 1998, 'Romance', null, null, null, null, 'The Tang monk said: It is difficult to be a monk, and it is difficult to be a monk with a face better than a talent; It is difficult to be a non-mainstream monk with good looks and talents. Sun Wukong said: Junior Brother Sha, that old guy is starting to lose his face again. ZBJ said: It''s easy to be a pig, but it''s not easy to be a pig that I do. The sand monk said: Don''t look at my rough appearance, in fact, my inner thief is gentle and dripping. The little white dragon said: Don''t talk to me, you''ve seen a few handsome guys who will open their mouths at will.', 'The Tang monk said: It is difficult to be a monk, and it is difficult to be a monk with a face better than a talent; It is difficult to be a non-mainstream monk with good looks and talents. Sun Wukong said: Junior Brother Sha, that old guy is starting to lose his face again. ZBJ said: It''s easy to be a pig, but it''s not easy to be a pig that I do. The sand monk said: Don''t look at my rough appearance, in fact, my inner thief is gentle and dripping. The little white dragon said: Don''t talk to me, you''ve seen a few handsome guys who will open their mouths at will.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kcME07YvukipFBmg9UArSRZqsEb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1137047'),
  ('750536793219314136', 'West Side Story', 1961, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Jerome Robbins, Robert Wise, Daniel L. Fapp', 'Ernest Lehman', 'Natalie Wood, Richard Beymer, Russ Tamblyn, Rita Moreno, George Chakiris, Simon Oakland, Ned Glass, William Bramley', 'NR', 'In Manhattan’s Upper West Side, rival gangs of Polish-Americans and newly arrived Puerto Ricans clash for control of the neighborhood, even as two young members from opposite sides fall dangerously in love.', 'In Manhattan’s Upper West Side, rival gangs of Polish-Americans and newly arrived Puerto Ricans clash for control of the neighborhood, even as two young members from opposite sides fall dangerously in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzCMu6D5q60i2bVrIQ0DxlRSgCZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1725'),
  ('514145004056252937', 'West Side Story', 2021, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Adam Somner, Jeremy Marks, Jurasama Arunchai', 'Tony Kushner', 'Ansel Elgort, Rachel Zegler, Ariana DeBose, David Alvarez, Mike Faist, Brian d''Arcy James, Corey Stoll, Rita Moreno', 'PG-13', 'Two youngsters from rival New York City gangs fall in love, but tensions between their respective friends build toward tragedy.', 'Two youngsters from rival New York City gangs fall in love, but tensions between their respective friends build toward tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfz3IUoYYSY32tkb97HlUBGFsnh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511809'),
  ('807298397903254555', 'Westbound', 1959, 'Western', 'Budd Boetticher, William Kissell, J. Peverell Marley', 'Berne Giler', 'Randolph Scott, Virginia Mayo, Karen Steele, Michael Dante, Andrew Duggan, Michael Pate, Wally Brown, John Daheim', 'NR', 'As the Civil War spills our nation’s blood, Capt. John Hayes fights on a vital but little-known battlefront. He aims to ship gold to Union banks through a small Colorado town, defying Southern sympathizers who aim to stop him at any cost.', 'As the Civil War spills our nation’s blood, Capt. John Hayes fights on a vital but little-known battlefront. He aims to ship gold to Union banks through a small Colorado town, defying Southern sympathizers who aim to stop him at any cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ik2DvCkFwyRX3iIeYcuCuNpNAiy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110139'),
  ('1135591909907215450', 'Westerland', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tim Staffel, Fabian Spuck', 'Tim Staffel', 'Wolfram Schorlemmer, Burak Yiğit, Tamer Arslan, Jule Böwe, Maxim Mehmet, Murat Seven', null, 'In the midst of a freezing winter on the island of Sylt, Cem comes across Jesús, who is on the verge of committing suicide. The two young men become fast friends, with their friendship unexpectedly threatening to develop into something more. Cem and Jesús - laconic, alienated loners - find their previously uneventful lives starting to spin out of control now that each has someone who means something to him.', 'In the midst of a freezing winter on the island of Sylt, Cem comes across Jesús, who is on the verge of committing suicide. The two young men become fast friends, with their friendship unexpectedly threatening to develop into something more. Cem and Jesús - laconic, alienated loners - find their previously uneventful lives starting to spin out of control now that each has someone who means something to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZFgvtwuLvhh5OSiU0f9man4yfJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199310'),
  ('694332650479068004', 'Western', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Manuel Poirier', null, 'Sergi López, Sacha Bourdo, Élisabeth Vitali, Marie Matheron, Bernard Mazzinghi, Serge Riaboukine, Michel Vivier, Marilyne Canto', null, 'Catalonian Paco is a traveling rep for a shoe manufacturer. When he stops to pick up Russian emigree hitchhiker Nino, Paco soon finds himself on the side of the road with everything stolen out from under him. Local gift shop owner Marinette gives the Spaniard a lift. Their mutual attraction manifests itself quickly, and Paco, who was fired over the stolen-car episode, hangs around. When he happens to spot Nino in the same town, he beats up the scrawny Russian, who lands in the hospital. Oddly enough, this marks the beginning of a beautiful friendship. Paco and Nino soon take the trip down the road together', 'Catalonian Paco is a traveling rep for a shoe manufacturer. When he stops to pick up Russian emigree hitchhiker Nino, Paco soon finds himself on the side of the road with everything stolen out from under him. Local gift shop owner Marinette gives the Spaniard a lift. Their mutual attraction manifests itself quickly, and Paco, who was fired over the stolen-car episode, hangs around. When he happens to spot Nino in the same town, he beats up the scrawny Russian, who lands in the hospital. Oddly enough, this marks the beginning of a beautiful friendship. Paco and Nino soon take the trip down the road together', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7P3htHY9FDaEFgtRdp5B830L4O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39968'),
  ('662609062901536673', 'Western', 2017, 'Drama', 'Valeska Grisebach, Bernhard Keller', 'Valeska Grisebach', 'Meinhard Neumann, Reinhardt Wetrek, Syuleyman Alilov Letifo, Veneta Frangipova, Viara Borisova, Detlef Schaich, Waldemar Zang', null, 'A group of German construction workers set out for a foreign construction site in the Bulgarian province. The strange country awakens adventure feelings among the men. At the same time, they are confronted with their prejudices and mistrust. For two of the men, a nearby village becomes the stage for a competition for the recognition and favor of the village.', 'A group of German construction workers set out for a foreign construction site in the Bulgarian province. The strange country awakens adventure feelings among the men. At the same time, they are confronted with their prejudices and mistrust. For two of the men, a nearby village becomes the stage for a competition for the recognition and favor of the village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLWwFrU0JFHIzQzxDpF8CKxfeey.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452000'),
  ('411312748041886277', 'Western for the SDS', 1968, null, 'Günter Peter Straschek', null, 'Marlies Beddies, Johannes Beringer, Elke Edelmann, Lore Ditzen, Peter Homann, Peter Thomas Krüger, Freya Raimbault, Christian Semler', null, 'West­ern for the SDS por­trays the de­vel­op­ment of the left as a learn­ing pro­cess among wo­m­en who shar­p­en their aware­ness in the move­ment but cont­in­ue to have no say. The con­tro­ver­sy sur­round­ing the film is shown in the DFFB week­ly news­reel Re­quiem for a Com­pany. The West­ern was con­fis­cat­ed by the ad­min­is­tra­tion, and eigh­teen stu­dents who sid­ed with Straschek were ex­pelled from the acade­my. The film was considered lost until its rediscovery in 2018.', 'West­ern for the SDS por­trays the de­vel­op­ment of the left as a learn­ing pro­cess among wo­m­en who shar­p­en their aware­ness in the move­ment but cont­in­ue to have no say. The con­tro­ver­sy sur­round­ing the film is shown in the DFFB week­ly news­reel Re­quiem for a Com­pany. The West­ern was con­fis­cat­ed by the ad­min­is­tra­tion, and eigh­teen stu­dents who sid­ed with Straschek were ex­pelled from the acade­my. The film was considered lost until its rediscovery in 2018.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9m7uH6aMrQ9vTpDhkYk3gmDGS0t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524175'),
  ('1016352512364141450', 'Western Spaghetti', 2008, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'PES', 'PES', null, null, 'Stop motion movie showing the cooking of spaghetti using everyday objects instead of food.', 'Stop motion movie showing the cooking of spaghetti using everyday objects instead of food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWTVN9WAUkXExF0ewdEZtmcTXmW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167190'),
  ('647148793786566504', 'Western Union', 1941, 'Western', 'Fritz Lang, David Buttolph, Allen M. Davey', 'George Bruce', 'Robert Young, Randolph Scott, Dean Jagger, Virginia Gilmore, John Carradine, Chill Wills, Slim Summerville, Barton MacLane', 'NR', 'When Edward Creighton leads the construction of the Western Union to unite East with West, he hires a Western reformed outlaw and a tenderfoot Eastern surveyor. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with Twentieth Century Fox Film Corporation in 2000.', 'When Edward Creighton leads the construction of the Western Union to unite East with West, he hires a Western reformed outlaw and a tenderfoot Eastern surveyor. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with Twentieth Century Fox Film Corporation in 2000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpWsAhUjcOnnkGCcGDDeEWehMw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43804'),
  ('380991122152850180', 'Westfront 1918', 1930, 'War, Drama', 'G.W. Pabst, Charles Métain, Fritz Arno Wagner', 'Peter Martin Lampel', 'Fritz Kampers, Gustav Diessl, Hans-Joachim Moebis, Claus Clausen, Gustav Püttjer, Vladimir Sokoloff, Jackie Monnier, Hanna Hoessrich', null, 'A group of German infantrymen of the First World War live out their lives in the trenches of France. They find brief entertainment and relief in a village behind the lines, but primarily terror fills their lives as the attacks on and from the French army ebb and flow. One of the men, Karl, goes home on leave only to discover the degradation forced on his family by wartime poverty. He returns to the lines in time to face an enormous attack by French tanks.', 'A group of German infantrymen of the First World War live out their lives in the trenches of France. They find brief entertainment and relief in a village behind the lines, but primarily terror fills their lives as the attacks on and from the French army ebb and flow. One of the men, Karl, goes home on leave only to discover the degradation forced on his family by wartime poverty. He returns to the lines in time to face an enormous attack by French tanks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oaMSB0DZY0GK8VdaDuHQLLdtHkg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80705'),
  ('381293285978536620', 'Westler: East of the Wall', 1985, 'Drama, Romance', 'Wieland Speck, Klemens Becker', 'Wieland Speck, Egbert Hörmann', 'Sigurd Rachman, Rainer Strecker, Andy Lucas, Harry Baer, Christoph Eichhorn, Thomas Kretschmann, Andreas Bernhardt, Zazie de Paris', null, 'Felix from West-Berlin falls in love with Thomas in East-Berlin. At first they keep their relationship going by regular visits from Felix, but the curfew forces him to return every evening. When the East-German authorities become suspicious, Thomas decides to try and flee to the West.', 'Felix from West-Berlin falls in love with Thomas in East-Berlin. At first they keep their relationship going by regular visits from Felix, but the curfew forces him to return every evening. When the East-German authorities become suspicious, Thomas decides to try and flee to the West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6CY1fNNVbB1ShrTC0en34Z2ZJ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39360'),
  ('199422128912499218', 'Westward Ho', 1935, 'History, Western', 'Robert N. Bradbury, Archie Stout', 'Robert Emmett Tansey, Lindsley Parsons', 'John Wayne, Sheila Bromley, Frank McGlynn Jr., Jim Farley, Bradley Metcalfe, Dickie Jones, Mary MacLaren, Hank Bell', 'NR', 'Ballard''s trail jumpers attack the Wyatt Company wagon train, killing young John''s parents and kidnaping his brother, Jim. In post-Civil War California, John Wyatt, now a man, pulls together a vigilante posse, The Singing Riders, who all ride white horses, dress alike, and ride the trails singing and rounding up outlaw gangs. Meanwhile, John is ever on the lookout for the gang that murdered his parents As a youngster John Wyatt saw his parents killed and his brother kidnapped. On a wagon train heading West he meets his brother who is now a spy for the gang which originally did the dirty work. He and his brother both fall for Mary Gordon When Ballard and his men attack the Wyatt wagon train, they kill all except two young brothers. Twelve years later one brother John has organized a vigilante group. The other brother Jim is now part of Ballard''s gang and the two are destined to meet again', 'Ballard''s trail jumpers attack the Wyatt Company wagon train, killing young John''s parents and kidnaping his brother, Jim. In post-Civil War California, John Wyatt, now a man, pulls together a vigilante posse, The Singing Riders, who all ride white horses, dress alike, and ride the trails singing and rounding up outlaw gangs. Meanwhile, John is ever on the lookout for the gang that murdered his parents As a youngster John Wyatt saw his parents killed and his brother kidnapped. On a wagon train heading West he meets his brother who is now a spy for the gang which originally did the dirty work. He and his brother both fall for Mary Gordon When Ballard and his men attack the Wyatt wagon train, they kill all except two young brothers. Twelve years later one brother John has organized a vigilante group. The other brother Jim is now part of Ballard''s gang and the two are destined to meet again', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oElXscst8xmymgROqsMMz2TZliV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61985'),
  ('558572112429942169', 'Westward Ho, The Wagons!', 1956, 'Adventure, Western', 'Charles P. Boyle, William Beaudine', 'Thomas W. Blackburn', 'Fess Parker, Kathleen Crowley, Jeff York, David Stollery, Sebastian Cabot, George Reeves, Doreen Tracey, Barbara Woodell', 'NR', 'The pioneering trail to Oregon was littered with constant danger. Yet, the hope of the "promised land" keeps American families westward bound despite overwhelming odds. A calm, clear-thinking pioneer attempts to lead a wagon train through territory occupied by Pawnees and Sioux. Along the way, the hardy settlers face horse thieves, kidnappers, and unpredictable Indian attacks in their push to establish a new life in the rugged West.', 'The pioneering trail to Oregon was littered with constant danger. Yet, the hope of the "promised land" keeps American families westward bound despite overwhelming odds. A calm, clear-thinking pioneer attempts to lead a wagon train through territory occupied by Pawnees and Sioux. Along the way, the hardy settlers face horse thieves, kidnappers, and unpredictable Indian attacks in their push to establish a new life in the rugged West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSGHzJ28UMZulHVQkHnaDSMLvOm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64862'),
  ('392364417948385914', 'Westward the Women', 1951, 'Adventure, Drama, Western', 'William A. Wellman, William C. Mellor', 'Charles Schnee', 'Robert Taylor, Denise Darcel, Hope Emerson, John McIntire, Julie Bishop, Lenore Lonergan, Henry Nakamura, Marilyn Erskine', 'NR', 'There''s a deficit of good, honest women in the West, and Roy Whitman wants to change that. His solution is to bring a caravan of over 100 mail-order brides from Chicago to California. It will be a long, difficult and dangerous journey for the women. So Whitman hires hardened, cynical Buck Wyatt to be their guide across the inhospitable frontier. But as disaster strikes on the trail, Buck just might discover that these women are stronger than he thinks.', 'There''s a deficit of good, honest women in the West, and Roy Whitman wants to change that. His solution is to bring a caravan of over 100 mail-order brides from Chicago to California. It will be a long, difficult and dangerous journey for the women. So Whitman hires hardened, cynical Buck Wyatt to be their guide across the inhospitable frontier. But as disaster strikes on the trail, Buck just might discover that these women are stronger than he thinks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ys78QNYypeTxhJKQVL78JzO6Faq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101557'),
  ('316227557827262783', 'Westward Whoa', 1936, 'Animation, Comedy, Western', 'Jack King', null, 'Count Cutelli, Joe Dougherty, Bernice Hansen, Tommy Bond', null, 'Porky Pig and his friends Beans, Little Kitty and Ham and Ex, travel as pioneers toward the western frontier. As their wagon travels across the prairie, Ham and Ex cause trouble by pretending to be Indians. Then the real Indians show up!', 'Porky Pig and his friends Beans, Little Kitty and Ham and Ex, travel as pioneers toward the western frontier. As their wagon travels across the prairie, Ham and Ex cause trouble by pretending to be Indians. Then the real Indians show up!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ivO0ZYZErK2McDTcdGmw8wIDLqS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202050'),
  ('981885368281644239', 'Westwind', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Robert Thalheim, Eeva Fleig', 'Susann Schimk, Ilja Haller', 'Friederike Becht, Luise Heyer, Franz Dinda, Volker Bruch, Hannes Wegener, Hans-Uwe Bauer, Albrecht Schuch, Golo Euler', null, 'Set in the Summer of 1988 and based on real events, the film tells the story of East-German twins Isabel and Doreen, two aspiring oarswomen, whose lives are changed dramatically during a training camp at Lake Balaton in Hungary. There, the girls make the acquaintance of West-German friends Arne and Nico. The holiday flirt soon turns serious when Doreen and Arne fall in love. As the end of their stay approaches, Arne asks the inseparable sisters to flee to the West with him…', 'Set in the Summer of 1988 and based on real events, the film tells the story of East-German twins Isabel and Doreen, two aspiring oarswomen, whose lives are changed dramatically during a training camp at Lake Balaton in Hungary. There, the girls make the acquaintance of West-German friends Arne and Nico. The holiday flirt soon turns serious when Doreen and Arne fall in love. As the end of their stay approaches, Arne asks the inseparable sisters to flee to the West with him…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kojv98l4HDhEGllBu8Cbrw1J7Tf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78045'),
  ('971969165782504798', 'Westworld', 1973, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Western', 'Michael Crichton, Gene Polito, Dick Ziker', 'Michael Crichton', 'Yul Brynner, Richard Benjamin, James Brolin, Norman Bartold, Alan Oppenheimer, Victoria Shaw, Dick Van Patten, Linda Gaye Scott', 'PG', 'Delos is a futuristic amusement park that features themed worlds populated by human-like androids. After two patrons have a run-in with a menacing gunslinger in West World, the androids at Delos all begin to malfunction, causing havoc throughout the park.', 'Delos is a futuristic amusement park that features themed worlds populated by human-like androids. After two patrons have a run-in with a menacing gunslinger in West World, the androids at Delos all begin to malfunction, causing havoc throughout the park.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNt29HzxwZ4jGTgSRxdA34ino9Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2362'),
  ('555510144358653505', 'Wet and Wild Summer', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Martin McGrath, Maurice Murphy', 'Phillip Avalon', 'Christopher Atkins, Julian McMahon, Elliott Gould, Vanessa Steele, Richard Carter, Christopher Pate, Rebecca Cross, Lois Larimore', null, 'A property developer wants to take over an Australian beach for a high rise resort. He sends his son to Australia to check out the situation, posing as an exchange lifeguard. He falls in love with a woman who owns the land his father needs for the development and finds himself sympathising with the locals.', 'A property developer wants to take over an Australian beach for a high rise resort. He sends his son to Australia to check out the situation, posing as an exchange lifeguard. He falls in love with a woman who owns the land his father needs for the development and finds himself sympathising with the locals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aO2uJTEqav0av2fvdp7STmqURox.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5688'),
  ('98550228997793215', 'Wet Dog', 2021, 'Drama', 'Damir Lukacevic', null, 'Doguhan Kabadayi, Mohammad Eliraqui, Derya Dilber, Kida Khodr Ramadan, Judith Hofmann, Dorka Gryllus, Ariella Hirshfeld', null, 'Based on a provocative autobiography, this story — set in a largely Muslim neighborhood in Berlin — follows a teenage gang member who is caught between hiding his Jewish identity and saving his life.', 'Based on a provocative autobiography, this story — set in a largely Muslim neighborhood in Berlin — follows a teenage gang member who is caught between hiding his Jewish identity and saving his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9R1YPGAwv2aFCKWJIdhNrAqIFh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:729793'),
  ('635419524349505305', 'Wet Dreams', 2002, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Zeong Cho-sin, Seo Jeong-min', 'Park Chae-woon', 'Kim Seon-a, Lee Beom-soo, Roh Hyung-wuk, Jeon Jae-hyeong, Jeong Dae-hoon, An Jae-hong, Park Yong-sik, Kim Ae-kyung', null, 'Dong-hyun, Seok-gu, Sang-min and Young-je are typical adolescent high school boys deeply curious about sexual matters. When a female apprentice teacher, Ms. Kim Yoo-ri begins teaching at their all boys school, she captures the lust and imagination of four of her students, who cannot stop fantasizing about her. Dong-hyuns secret ''love'' for his teacher is shattered by news of her affections for another teacher Mr Gong. Yoo-ri has already fallen for the homeroom teacher, Mr Gong, and has her own daydreams about what it would be like with him. Unfortunately, Mr Gong has forsaken love in his life, and is immune to her come-ons. Yoo-ri must get him to accept her advances, while rejecting the rapid-fire advance of her four students.', 'Dong-hyun, Seok-gu, Sang-min and Young-je are typical adolescent high school boys deeply curious about sexual matters. When a female apprentice teacher, Ms. Kim Yoo-ri begins teaching at their all boys school, she captures the lust and imagination of four of her students, who cannot stop fantasizing about her. Dong-hyuns secret ''love'' for his teacher is shattered by news of her affections for another teacher Mr Gong. Yoo-ri has already fallen for the homeroom teacher, Mr Gong, and has her own daydreams about what it would be like with him. Unfortunately, Mr Gong has forsaken love in his life, and is immune to her come-ons. Yoo-ri must get him to accept her advances, while rejecting the rapid-fire advance of her four students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iNQaIZ47hUqo4ER3LEaI18cmaqa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87771'),
  ('1021629993855570185', 'Wet Dreams 2', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Zeong Cho-sin', 'Park Chae-woon', 'Song Eun-Chae, Lee Ji-hoon, Jeon Hye-bin, Shin Joo-ah, Kim Ji-young, Park Seul-gi, Jeon Jae-hyeong, Park Ye-jin', null, '17 year-olds Sung-eun, and Mi-sook are always curious about sexual matters that nobody teaches them about. One day, new teacher Bong-gu, a handsome and well bred stud,arrives at school and begins to teach their class. He becomes an object to watch and study. Bong-gu, although he seems fine on the outside, suffers from an unknown illness that makes him fart whenever he feels aroused. Three girls learn about this and they go on a mission to make him fart.', '17 year-olds Sung-eun, and Mi-sook are always curious about sexual matters that nobody teaches them about. One day, new teacher Bong-gu, a handsome and well bred stud,arrives at school and begins to teach their class. He becomes an object to watch and study. Bong-gu, although he seems fine on the outside, suffers from an unknown illness that makes him fart whenever he feels aroused. Three girls learn about this and they go on a mission to make him fart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w10M0egcmloikhqdIGyHAQmtnO0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131926'),
  ('307359835836308151', 'Wet Hot American Summer', 2001, 'Comedy', 'David Wain, Ben Weinstein', 'Michael Showalter, David Wain', 'Janeane Garofalo, David Hyde Pierce, Michael Showalter, Marguerite Moreau, Paul Rudd, Zak Orth, Christopher Meloni, A.D. Miles', 'R', 'The setting is Camp Firewood, the year 1981. It''s the last day before everyone goes back to the real world, but there''s still a summer''s worth of unfinished business to resolve. At the center of the action is camp director Beth, who struggles to keep order while she falls in love with the local astrophysics professor. He is busy trying to save the camp from a deadly piece of NASA''s Skylab which is hurtling toward earth. All that, plus: a dangerous waterfall rescue, love triangles, misfits, cool kids, and talking vegetable cans. The questions will all be resolved, of course, at the big talent show at the end of the day.', 'The setting is Camp Firewood, the year 1981. It''s the last day before everyone goes back to the real world, but there''s still a summer''s worth of unfinished business to resolve. At the center of the action is camp director Beth, who struggles to keep order while she falls in love with the local astrophysics professor. He is busy trying to save the camp from a deadly piece of NASA''s Skylab which is hurtling toward earth. All that, plus: a dangerous waterfall rescue, love triangles, misfits, cool kids, and talking vegetable cans. The questions will all be resolved, of course, at the big talent show at the end of the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTwZCGbCIKmfwfRkbmh2fbuuH5w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2171'),
  ('222035350006654246', 'Wet Paint', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald re-paints his car, and a bird lands on it. In the mayhem that ensues, the car ends up covered with handprints, spotted a dozen different colors, stripped of paint, and covered with the stuffing from the seats so that it resembles a sheepdog.', 'Donald re-paints his car, and a bird lands on it. In the mayhem that ensues, the car ends up covered with handprints, spotted a dozen different colors, stripped of paint, and covered with the stuffing from the seats so that it resembles a sheepdog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MSiSz5Eehr39jakRZsaqlvcmtU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67712'),
  ('805257812721111371', 'Wet Season', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Anthony Chen, Sam Care, Koo Chia Meng', 'Anthony Chen', 'Yeo Yann Yann, Koh Jia Ler, Christopher Lee, Yang Shi Bin, Brayden Koh', null, 'Wet Season revolves around the life of Ling, a schoolteacher who deals with infertility while having to take care of her infirm father-in-law at home. One of Ling''s students, Kok Wei Lun, develops a crush on her during remedial Chinese classes. The two become closer as Wei Lun embraces Ling''s extra tutoring.', 'Wet Season revolves around the life of Ling, a schoolteacher who deals with infertility while having to take care of her infirm father-in-law at home. One of Ling''s students, Kok Wei Lun, develops a crush on her during remedial Chinese classes. The two become closer as Wei Lun embraces Ling''s extra tutoring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyqqHPkF7EoNGlqDJ2aDchRxfnq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584242'),
  ('217283498515654269', 'Wetherby', 1985, 'Drama, Mystery', 'David Hare, Stuart Harris', 'David Hare', 'Vanessa Redgrave, Ian Holm, Judi Dench, Stuart Wilson, Tim McInnerny, Suzanna Hamilton, Tom Wilkinson, Joely Richardson', null, 'The mysterious death of an enigmatic young man newly arrived in the suburb of Wetherby releases the long-repressed, dark passions of some of its residents.', 'The mysterious death of an enigmatic young man newly arrived in the suburb of Wetherby releases the long-repressed, dark passions of some of its residents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/koVPZF3r1jFS1gKMTK27dco6crv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147747'),
  ('1040601542566135030', 'Wetland', 2021, 'Thriller', 'Iñaki Sánchez Arrieta, Carlos Aparicio', 'Iñaki Sánchez Arrieta', 'Raúl Arévalo, Paz Vega, Roberto Álamo, Joaquín Climent, Susi Sánchez, Enric Juezas, Susana Merino', null, 'As a severe drought punishes the vast expanses of rice fields in eastern Spain, the natural region of Laguna Blanca is named a Nature Preserve. A prestigious biologist, Ricardo, arrives in San Pedro to protect it. His family, however, is going through tough times but Ricardo is convinced that a change in their lives will help them move on. And it’s also an opportunity to get back to his roots, to his origins, to where he grew up as a boy and to reclaim this spot that had been buried in his fondest memories. Ricardo’s mission is to hinder the abusive and illegal use that everyone makes of the lagoon. But pressure and threats from the locals just keep getting worse. They consider Ricardo a traitor because all they are trying to do is defend their existence and their livelihood. Ricardo eventually comes to the realization that his life and that of his family are in danger.', 'As a severe drought punishes the vast expanses of rice fields in eastern Spain, the natural region of Laguna Blanca is named a Nature Preserve. A prestigious biologist, Ricardo, arrives in San Pedro to protect it. His family, however, is going through tough times but Ricardo is convinced that a change in their lives will help them move on. And it’s also an opportunity to get back to his roots, to his origins, to where he grew up as a boy and to reclaim this spot that had been buried in his fondest memories. Ricardo’s mission is to hinder the abusive and illegal use that everyone makes of the lagoon. But pressure and threats from the locals just keep getting worse. They consider Ricardo a traitor because all they are trying to do is defend their existence and their livelihood. Ricardo eventually comes to the realization that his life and that of his family are in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHtzPOtNRSVdlyTUPM197wIPI7x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:808969'),
  ('835243931811350335', 'Wetlands', 2011, 'Drama', 'Guy Édoin, Serge Desrosiers', 'Guy Édoin', 'Pascale Bussières, Gabriel Maillé, Luc Picard, François Papineau, Angèle Coutu, Denise Dubois, Sébastien Valade, Martin McDuff', null, 'On a dairy farm in the Eastern Townships, in the middle of a drought and while the land is parching, a drama will disrupt the life of the Santerre family. Confronted to each other they will have to learn to forgive.', 'On a dairy farm in the Eastern Townships, in the middle of a drought and while the land is parching, a drama will disrupt the life of the Santerre family. Confronted to each other they will have to learn to forgive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17XgUXWVF8dijwMUNmXJv4C00v3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86916'),
  ('1126894551394262778', 'Wetlands', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'David Wnendt', 'Sabine Pochhammer', 'Carla Juri, Axel Milberg, Meret Becker, Peri Baumeister, Christoph Letkowski, Edgar Selge, Marlen Kruse, Clara Wunsch', 'R', 'Helen is a nonconformist teenage girl who maintains a conflictual relationship with her parents. Hanging out most of her time with her friend Corinna, with whom she breaks one social taboo after another, she uses sex as a way to rebel and break the conventional bourgeois ethic. After an intimate shaving accident, Helen ends up in the hospital where it doesn’t take long before she makes waves. But there she finds Robin, a male nurse who will sweep her off her feet...', 'Helen is a nonconformist teenage girl who maintains a conflictual relationship with her parents. Hanging out most of her time with her friend Corinna, with whom she breaks one social taboo after another, she uses sex as a way to rebel and break the conventional bourgeois ethic. After an intimate shaving accident, Helen ends up in the hospital where it doesn’t take long before she makes waves. But there she finds Robin, a male nurse who will sweep her off her feet...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hfZij2Nd8rCT1tezRkbzm7xWkl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208277'),
  ('75799403467553000', 'WeWork: or The Making and Breaking of a $47 Billion Unicorn', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Wolfgang Held, Jed Rothstein', null, 'Adam Neumann, Rebekah Paltrow Neumann', 'R', 'Explore the rise and fall of one of the biggest corporate flameouts and venture capitalist bubbles in recent years – the story of WeWork, and its hippie-messianic leader Adam Neumann.', 'Explore the rise and fall of one of the biggest corporate flameouts and venture capitalist bubbles in recent years – the story of WeWork, and its hippie-messianic leader Adam Neumann.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfRPVpEwlTFmnUyB4CpyFG2Wtz1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795622'),
  ('867563963823263263', 'Whale Nation', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Albert Lièvre', 'Jean-Albert Lièvre', 'Jean Dujardin', null, 'A humpback whale is beached on a remote shore. During the fight to save its life, we will discover the story of these extraordinary creatures, denizens of the world''s oceans. Inspired by Heathcote William''s bestselling book, WHALE NATION takes us on a journey of discovery into the unexplored territories and barely known society of whales, with their remarkable abilities and incredibly rich and complex social lives.', 'A humpback whale is beached on a remote shore. During the fight to save its life, we will discover the story of these extraordinary creatures, denizens of the world''s oceans. Inspired by Heathcote William''s bestselling book, WHALE NATION takes us on a journey of discovery into the unexplored territories and barely known society of whales, with their remarkable abilities and incredibly rich and complex social lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2OSFurEZIO0TRCokWHVozlS2cG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977021'),
  ('1102596742108984773', 'Whale Rider', 2003, 'Drama, Family', 'Niki Caro, Leon Narbey, Sigmund Spath', 'Niki Caro', 'Keisha Castle-Hughes, Rawiri Paratene, Vicky Haughton, Cliff Curtis, Grant Roa, Mana Taumaunu, Rachel House, Taungaroa Emile', 'PG-13', 'A contemporary story of love, rejection, and triumph as a young Māori girl fights to fulfill a destiny her grandfather refuses to recognize.', 'A contemporary story of love, rejection, and triumph as a young Māori girl fights to fulfill a destiny her grandfather refuses to recognize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVBZQZq091KtwBm2qObOv0JTFcH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1088'),
  ('1052569700089510338', 'Wham-Bam-Slam!', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Jules White, Fred Jackman Jr., Willard Sheldon', 'Clyde Bruckman, Felix Adler', 'Shemp Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Matt McHugh, Alyn Lockwood, Doris Revier, Wanda Perry', 'NR', 'Shemp is a sick man with a bad case of nerves. The stooge''s friend Claude, a self-taught healer, tries to cure Shemp with various home- made remedies. When nothing seems to work, Claude suggests they buy his old lemon of a car so they can take Shemp on a trip to the country. The car won''t start, and the trip never gets off the ground, but not to worry, Shemp is cured by all the excitement.', 'Shemp is a sick man with a bad case of nerves. The stooge''s friend Claude, a self-taught healer, tries to cure Shemp with various home- made remedies. When nothing seems to work, Claude suggests they buy his old lemon of a car so they can take Shemp on a trip to the country. The car won''t start, and the trip never gets off the ground, but not to worry, Shemp is cured by all the excitement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBOY2CD8TALzKypJxr0fLpV7wvB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116949'),
  ('161069665527799887', 'WHAM!', 2023, 'Documentary, Music', 'Chris Smith', null, 'Andrew Ridgeley, George Michael, Elton John, David Bowie, Mick Jagger, Sting, Freddie Mercury, Paul McCartney', 'NR', 'Through archival interviews and footage, George Michael and Andrew Ridgeley relive the arc of their Wham! career, from 70s best buds to 80s pop icons.', 'Through archival interviews and footage, George Michael and Andrew Ridgeley relive the arc of their Wham! career, from 70s best buds to 80s pop icons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQbva3zRZz2f6Vuov0RmevYsolj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1134865'),
  ('715599947341182949', 'What a Beautiful Day', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Gennaro Nunziante, Simone Spada, Dora Dalla Chiesa', 'Checco Zalone, Gennaro Nunziante', 'Checco Zalone, Nabiha Akkari, Rocco Papaleo, Tullio Solenghi, Anna Rita Del Piano, Michele Alhaique, Mehdi Mahdloo, Anna Bellato', null, 'Checco, an uneducated but self-satisfied fellow from Milan, who has always dreamed of becoming a police officer, fails his entrance exam for the third time. It must be said that at the oral examination Checco said that the reason why he wanted to join the police was benefits in kind and cronyism! But the young man has connections and he soon finds himself a security agent at the Milan Cathedral. Of course the bumbling idiot proves a living catastrophe! Spotted by Sufien, an Arab terrorist who is preparing an attack against the cathedral, Checco appears as the perfect sucker. To manipulate him, he sends his charming sister Farah to him, with the mission to seduce him...', 'Checco, an uneducated but self-satisfied fellow from Milan, who has always dreamed of becoming a police officer, fails his entrance exam for the third time. It must be said that at the oral examination Checco said that the reason why he wanted to join the police was benefits in kind and cronyism! But the young man has connections and he soon finds himself a security agent at the Milan Cathedral. Of course the bumbling idiot proves a living catastrophe! Spotted by Sufien, an Arab terrorist who is preparing an attack against the cathedral, Checco appears as the perfect sucker. To manipulate him, he sends his charming sister Farah to him, with the mission to seduce him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGNakJZRSxFsXXJCoy38zW5Kp0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53319'),
  ('703869739491964656', 'What a Carve Up!', 1961, 'Horror, Comedy, Thriller, Mystery', 'Pat Jackson, Bill Herlihy', 'Ray Cooney, Tony Hilton', 'Sidney James, Kenneth Connor, Donald Pleasence, Shirley Eaton, Dennis Price, Michael Gough, Valerie Taylor, Esma Cannon', null, 'Ernie''s Uncle Gabriel has just died but to claim his inheritance he must spend the night in the ancestral family home with the rest of his rather eccentric relatives. Ernie''s imagination has been affected by his constant immersion in cheap horror novels, but his wildest fears turn out to be justified when the guests begin to drop dead.', 'Ernie''s Uncle Gabriel has just died but to claim his inheritance he must spend the night in the ancestral family home with the rest of his rather eccentric relatives. Ernie''s imagination has been affected by his constant immersion in cheap horror novels, but his wildest fears turn out to be justified when the guests begin to drop dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMmUAveIfqZ5IfYC06oe815XUbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50409'),
  ('929726315253303938', 'What a Crush', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Selçuk Aydemir, Gökhan Tiryaki', 'Selçuk Aydemir', 'Ahmet Kural, Murat Cemcir, Cengiz Bozkurt, Saadet Işıl Aksoy, Günay Karacaoğlu, Çağlar Ertuğrul, Bihter Dinçel, Güven Murat Akpınar', null, 'Ferhat is a spoiled man who takes over his father''s company. Ferhat''s right hand is his childhood friend, the company''s finance manager, Gökhan. They are not very kind to their employees. One day they will be friends with the restaurant owner. Ferhat falls in love with the restaurant owner''s daughter Elif. But Elif is not a delicate and pure young girl. Her career, her hard character, and her witless intelligence, which are full of special trainings and superior services, will make Ferhat much more difficult.', 'Ferhat is a spoiled man who takes over his father''s company. Ferhat''s right hand is his childhood friend, the company''s finance manager, Gökhan. They are not very kind to their employees. One day they will be friends with the restaurant owner. Ferhat falls in love with the restaurant owner''s daughter Elif. But Elif is not a delicate and pure young girl. Her career, her hard character, and her witless intelligence, which are full of special trainings and superior services, will make Ferhat much more difficult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ulvZA5VSMCs2msRXiC1UtClBhYA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474722'),
  ('150063747600949880', 'What a Drag', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Gabriel Aghion, Fabio Conversi', 'Patrick Timsit, Gabriel Aghion', 'Patrick Timsit, Fanny Ardant, Richard Berry, Michèle Laroque, Jacques Gamblin, Christian Bujeau, Boris Terral, Axelle Abbadie', null, 'A closeted gay man''s attempt to "act straight" for the sake of his job has unexpected consequences.', 'A closeted gay man''s attempt to "act straight" for the sake of his job has unexpected consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eTsacNYD4grU2dAnINLUcttxzY2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31789'),
