  ('870222927809078187', 'What a Girl Wants', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama, Family', 'Dennie Gordon, Andrew Dunn, Michael Stevenson', 'William Douglas-Home', 'Amanda Bynes, Colin Firth, Kelly Preston, Eileen Atkins, Anna Chancellor, Jonathan Pryce, Oliver James, Christina Cole', 'PG', 'An American girl, Daphne, heads to Europe in search of the father she''s never met. But instead of finding a British version of her bohemian mother, she learns the love of her mom''s life is an uptight politician. The only problem now is that her long-lost dad is engaged to a fiercely territorial social climber with a daughter who makes Daphne''s life miserable.', 'An American girl, Daphne, heads to Europe in search of the father she''s never met. But instead of finding a British version of her bohemian mother, she learns the love of her mom''s life is an uptight politician. The only problem now is that her long-lost dad is engaged to a fiercely territorial social climber with a daughter who makes Daphne''s life miserable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGpMruX59KWNuAXgHpiAm8hiChw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10735'),
  ('1136591706974298049', 'What a Good Secretary Wants', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Kim Hyo-jae', null, 'Kim Do-hee, Jung Won-II, James', null, 'The silent secret of the perfect woman. Genius Consulting is a recruiting company that provides Board of Members of large corporates and professional talents to China. As the original secretary for Joo Yeong-cheol, CEO of the company went on her maternity leave, Ji-won, a new secretary is hired and starts filling the position. All the employees welcome her who looks sexy at a glance, is capable of doing her job and also has a warm good personality. On a rainy night, CEO Joo and his new secretary Ji-won have a brief beer break, while working until late at night in the office.', 'The silent secret of the perfect woman. Genius Consulting is a recruiting company that provides Board of Members of large corporates and professional talents to China. As the original secretary for Joo Yeong-cheol, CEO of the company went on her maternity leave, Ji-won, a new secretary is hired and starts filling the position. All the employees welcome her who looks sexy at a glance, is capable of doing her job and also has a warm good personality. On a rainy night, CEO Joo and his new secretary Ji-won have a brief beer break, while working until late at night in the office.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXLx1o1x8u5ZbV7jpCJwWMg7Byf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409276'),
  ('806105213458969035', 'What a Life!', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Duccio Cimatti, Giuseppe Battiston', 'Giuseppe Battiston, Marco Pettenello', 'Giuseppe Battiston, Rolando Ravello, Teco Celio, Diane Fleri, Ariella Reggio, Alfonso Santagata, Maurizio Fanin, Giovanni Franzoni', null, 'Biasutti and Perbellini have the same name, Fausto, and they both hate life in the big city. They meet by chance during a trip for amateur photographers, become friends and begin to cultivate together the dream of going to live in the countryside, keeping with the fruit of their efforts. When Biasutti inherits his grandmother’s old house in Valvana, in the hills of the north east, the dream can finally become reality: the welcome in the village, however, proves less warm than expected.', 'Biasutti and Perbellini have the same name, Fausto, and they both hate life in the big city. They meet by chance during a trip for amateur photographers, become friends and begin to cultivate together the dream of going to live in the countryside, keeping with the fruit of their efforts. When Biasutti inherits his grandmother’s old house in Valvana, in the hills of the north east, the dream can finally become reality: the welcome in the village, however, proves less warm than expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KEh6a9SJ2PRDAmfcukLophGtnx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1070244'),
  ('898245492610469013', 'What a Man', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Matthias Schweighöfer, Torsten Künstler, Bernhard Jasper', 'Matthias Schweighöfer, Doron Wisotzky', 'Matthias Schweighöfer, Sibel Kekilli, Elyas M''Barek, Thomas Kretschmann, Mavie Hörbiger, Milan Peschel, Theresa Underberg, Nora Jokhosha', null, 'What a man is a comedy that tells the story of a young professor, Alex (Matthias Schweighofer), who after being left by his girlfriend Caroline (Mavie Hörbiger), begins a journey to know himself. But how do you overcome the difficulties of a man today? Or rather what is it that makes a man a man?', 'What a man is a comedy that tells the story of a young professor, Alex (Matthias Schweighofer), who after being left by his girlfriend Caroline (Mavie Hörbiger), begins a journey to know himself. But how do you overcome the difficulties of a man today? Or rather what is it that makes a man a man?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sa04uwV0R7ta9ZAjatczgPZxmQ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73770'),
  ('320901308576863131', 'What a Man Wants', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Kim Hye-young, Lee Byeong-heon, Park Sung-chan', 'Bae Se-young, Jang Kyu-sung, Lee Byeong-heon', 'Lee Sung-min, Shin Ha-kyun, Song Ji-hyo, Lee El, Jang Young-nam, Go Joon, Yang Hyun-min, Lee Hanee', null, 'Set on Jeju Island, Seok-Geun is a middle-aged man and he works as a taxi driver. He is married to Dam-Deok. Seok-Geun constantly cheats on his wife, but it doesn''t mean he does not love his wife.', 'Set on Jeju Island, Seok-Geun is a middle-aged man and he works as a taxi driver. He is married to Dam-Deok. Seok-Geun constantly cheats on his wife, but it doesn''t mean he does not love his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2H8E0rsV65FiPuCer0nVlGznnOA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511883'),
  ('111716458565980287', 'What a Mess', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Yorgos Apostolidis, Yannis Smaragdis, Yiannis Typaldos', 'Yannis Kakoulidis, Harry Klynn', 'Harry Klynn, Dimitris Piatas, Joly Garbi, Manos Destounis, Konstantinos Tzoumas, Nitsa Tsaganea, Giorgos Nezos, Giorgos Papastefanou', null, 'Three short stories satirizing the Greece of “Change” in early 80''s. A take-off on the police dramas of Giannis Maris; a satire of the films of the New Greek Cinema; and a satire of the “fustanella (Greek kilt)” films as well.', 'Three short stories satirizing the Greece of “Change” in early 80''s. A take-off on the police dramas of Giannis Maris; a satire of the films of the New Greek Cinema; and a satire of the “fustanella (Greek kilt)” films as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgKo3FI8eoQnDAI1tPPZUzSE36m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166721'),
  ('174897532410200275', 'What a Mess!', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Vladimir Menshov, Vadim Alisov, Varvara Shuvaeva', 'Vladimir Menshov, Vitaly Moskalenko, Andrei Samsonov', 'Valeriy Garkalin, Vera Alentova, Inna Churikova, Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Igor Ugolnikov, Sergey Batalov, Rolan Bykov, Leonid Kuravlyov', null, 'A Russian criminal steals a giant diamond from the Mafia, hides it, and suddenly runs into his unknown brothers; unexpected, absurd events with participation of the mob, doctors, musicians, Americans, militia, and gypsies ensue.', 'A Russian criminal steals a giant diamond from the Mafia, hides it, and suddenly runs into his unknown brothers; unexpected, absurd events with participation of the mob, doctors, musicians, Americans, militia, and gypsies ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aboB73RjkfM3oqxTad0lF9JRLGw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97666'),
  ('1008630241372190309', 'What a Nightmare, Charlie Brown!', 1978, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Bill Melendez, Phil Roman', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Bill Melendez, Liam Martin', 'G', 'What a Nightmare, Charlie Brown! is the 17th primetime animated TV specials based upon the popular comic strip Peanuts, created by Charles M. Schulz. The plot is similar to that of Jack London''s Call of the Wild.', 'What a Nightmare, Charlie Brown! is the 17th primetime animated TV specials based upon the popular comic strip Peanuts, created by Charles M. Schulz. The plot is similar to that of Jack London''s Call of the Wild.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mruSx5m24rk1YRSMnhvg53gDqGs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55444'),
  ('81534596322468454', 'What a Way to Go!', 1964, 'Comedy, Romance', 'J. Lee Thompson, Leon Shamroy, Fred R. Simpson', 'Adolph Green, Betty Comden', 'Shirley MacLaine, Paul Newman, Robert Mitchum, Dean Martin, Gene Kelly, Robert Cummings, Dick Van Dyke, Reginald Gardiner', 'NR', 'A four-time widow discusses her four marriages, in which all of her husbands became incredibly rich and died prematurely because of their drive to be rich.', 'A four-time widow discusses her four marriages, in which all of her husbands became incredibly rich and died prematurely because of their drive to be rich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fuRkL3OhoeubEOULCMVJsUTaAU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23574'),
  ('210314830364212743', 'What a Whopper', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Gilbert Gunn', 'Terry Nation', 'Adam Faith, Carole Lesley, Terence Longdon, Marie France Dousset, Freddie Frinton, Sidney James, Charles Hawtrey, Clive Dunn', null, 'A writer attempts to raise some cash by writing a book about the Loch Ness Monster. No publisher will take it because they all think there isn''t really a monster. The writer and some of his friends make a fake monster and take photographs and then travel to Scotland to see if they can convince the locals.', 'A writer attempts to raise some cash by writing a book about the Loch Ness Monster. No publisher will take it because they all think there isn''t really a monster. The writer and some of his friends make a fake monster and take photographs and then travel to Scotland to see if they can convince the locals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHqJe3EdWgCmwFLLqe1xl1EMrUR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253815'),
  ('518353446339055528', 'What a Woman!', 1956, 'Comedy', 'Alessandro Blasetti, Otello Martelli, Isa Bartalini', 'Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Ennio Flaiano, Sandro Continenza', 'Sophia Loren, Charles Boyer, Marcello Mastroianni, Elisa Cegani, Titina De Filippo, Nino Besozzi, Margherita Bagni, Anna Carena', null, 'A photographer named Corrado snaps a picture of Antonietta. When it shows up on the front page of a magazine, she wants to take him to court over it.', 'A photographer named Corrado snaps a picture of Antonietta. When it shows up on the front page of a magazine, she wants to take him to court over it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cL2gm7XIxTiF2nkXUvyGLZaSYSk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327049'),
  ('990435038043369604', 'What a Wonderful Family!', 2016, 'Comedy, Family', 'Yoji Yamada, Masashi Chikamori, Takuya Hisano', 'Yoji Yamada, Emiko Hiramatsu', 'Isao Hashizume, Kazuko Yoshiyuki, Masahiko Nishimura, Yui Natsukawa, Hayashiya Shōzō IX, Tomoko Nakajima, Yu Aoi, Satoshi Tsumabuki', null, 'A husband and wife have been married for 50 years. For her birthday, the husband asks the wife what she wants for her birthday present. She replies that she wants a divorce. The wife''s divorce announcement sends the entire family into chaos.', 'A husband and wife have been married for 50 years. For her birthday, the husband asks the wife what she wants for her birthday present. She replies that she wants a divorce. The wife''s divorce announcement sends the entire family into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KarFzFYCUTLKKnUJ9L7Bo51Q2o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389972'),
  ('538525909925781222', 'What a Wonderful Family! 2', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Yoji Yamada, Masashi Chikamori', 'Yoji Yamada, Emiko Hiramatsu', 'Isao Hashizume, Kazuko Yoshiyuki, Masahiko Nishimura, Yu Aoi, Yui Natsukawa, Tomoko Nakajima, Hayashiya Shōzō IX, Satoshi Tsumabuki', null, 'Several years after Shuzo settled his wife’s birthday-surprise divorce proposal (What a Wonderful Family, 40th), the Hirata family faces new problems. Ignoring his family’s worry that he is too old to drive, Shuzo takes his old schoolmate for a spin after carousing. Soon, a new disturbance arises for the Hirata family. Veteran director Yamada Yoji continues his comedy about the “perfect“ Japanese family turned upside down in chaos, laughters and understanding. This time, with an additional taste of death.', 'Several years after Shuzo settled his wife’s birthday-surprise divorce proposal (What a Wonderful Family, 40th), the Hirata family faces new problems. Ignoring his family’s worry that he is too old to drive, Shuzo takes his old schoolmate for a spin after carousing. Soon, a new disturbance arises for the Hirata family. Veteran director Yamada Yoji continues his comedy about the “perfect“ Japanese family turned upside down in chaos, laughters and understanding. This time, with an additional taste of death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5Fd1v07C53TBqD52r524hWJxtG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452313'),
  ('495737762796372947', 'What a Wonderful Family! 3', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yoji Yamada, Masashi Chikamori', 'Yoji Yamada, Emiko Hiramatsu', 'Isao Hashizume, Kazuko Yoshiyuki, Masahiko Nishimura, Yui Natsukawa, Tomoko Nakajima, Hayashiya Shōzō IX, Satoshi Tsumabuki, Yu Aoi', null, 'At the Hirata home, three generations of their family live together. A crisis ensues when one afternoon, housewife Fumie falls asleep and wakes up to find a thief has stolen her secret money she kept hidden in the refrigerator.', 'At the Hirata home, three generations of their family live together. A crisis ensues when one afternoon, housewife Fumie falls asleep and wakes up to find a thief has stolen her secret money she kept hidden in the refrigerator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98oRXIB6og638YFQOiMOOybezbg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500372'),
  ('131818337323061232', 'What About Bob?', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Frank Oz, Michael Ballhaus, Donald J. Lee Jr.', 'Tom Schulman', 'Bill Murray, Richard Dreyfuss, Julie Hagerty, Charlie Korsmo, Kathryn Erbe, Tom Aldredge, Susan Willis, Roger Bowen', 'PG', 'Before going on vacation, self-involved psychiatrist Dr. Leo Marvin has the misfortune of taking on a new patient: Bob Wiley. An exemplar of neediness and a compendium of phobias, Bob follows Marvin to his family''s country house. Dr. Marvin tries to get him to leave; the trouble is, everyone loves Bob. As his oblivious patient makes himself at home, Dr. Marvin loses his professional composure and, before long, may be ready for the loony bin himself.', 'Before going on vacation, self-involved psychiatrist Dr. Leo Marvin has the misfortune of taking on a new patient: Bob Wiley. An exemplar of neediness and a compendium of phobias, Bob follows Marvin to his family''s country house. Dr. Marvin tries to get him to leave; the trouble is, everyone loves Bob. As his oblivious patient makes himself at home, Dr. Marvin loses his professional composure and, before long, may be ready for the loony bin himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFCrGGGhV5xeAdvEysv6aSv8T13.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10276'),
  ('610446526345190503', 'What About Juvenile Delinquency', 1955, 'Crime, Drama', 'Herk Harvey', 'Margaret Travis', 'Arden Booth, Tom McGinnis, Ernie Pontius, Richard Schiefelbusch, M.C. Slough, Bret Waller, Arthur H. Wolf', null, 'A teen drops out of a gang when they mug his father for his pencil.', 'A teen drops out of a gang when they mug his father for his pencil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aU71gDhptL6RsBS8SoSWAB91l43.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247155'),
  ('1000214989210389223', 'What Am I Doing in the Middle of the Revolution?', 1972, 'Adventure, Comedy, Western', 'Sergio Corbucci, Alejandro Ulloa, Ricardo Huertas Frutos', 'Sabatino Ciuffini, Massimo Franciosa, Sergio Corbucci', 'Vittorio Gassman, Paolo Villaggio, Eduardo Fajardo, Riccardo Garrone, Rosanna Yanni, Leo Anchóriz, José Canalejas, Simón Arriaga', null, 'In the beginning of the 20th. century Italian actor Guido Guidi, more enthusiastic than talented, and his ensemble tour Texas. The mysterious and obviously rich Peppino Garibaldi gives them an offer, they can’t deny: For a large amount of dough they should play “Richard III.” in the Mexican town Vera Cruz. But Peppino is not really interested in cultural affairs: He supports “La Revolución” and “General” Carasco, who utilizes the feastful premiere of “Richard III.” to raid Vera Cruz for Comandante Zapata. But shortly after the Mexican Army shows up with some canons in tow to sort things out. Guidi and Padre Albino, Italian like him, succeed to flee and save Carasco accidentially from the firing squad. Whereas the latter coninues his revolutionary fight, Guidi and Albino start an odyssey through the struggling Mexico, which lets them fall one time in the hands of Carasco the other time in those of Herrera or even in the clutches of “hand-taking” bandidos.', 'In the beginning of the 20th. century Italian actor Guido Guidi, more enthusiastic than talented, and his ensemble tour Texas. The mysterious and obviously rich Peppino Garibaldi gives them an offer, they can’t deny: For a large amount of dough they should play “Richard III.” in the Mexican town Vera Cruz. But Peppino is not really interested in cultural affairs: He supports “La Revolución” and “General” Carasco, who utilizes the feastful premiere of “Richard III.” to raid Vera Cruz for Comandante Zapata. But shortly after the Mexican Army shows up with some canons in tow to sort things out. Guidi and Padre Albino, Italian like him, succeed to flee and save Carasco accidentially from the firing squad. Whereas the latter coninues his revolutionary fight, Guidi and Albino start an odyssey through the struggling Mexico, which lets them fall one time in the hands of Carasco the other time in those of Herrera or even in the clutches of “hand-taking” bandidos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmXGkIfWYpZFPbKLLeQz1OlOdEt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124504'),
  ('1000851252288674188', 'What Are the Clouds?', 1968, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Sergio Citti, Tonino Delli Colli, Pier Paolo Pasolini', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini', 'Totò, Ninetto Davoli, Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Laura Betti, Adriana Asti, Domenico Modugno, Carlo Pisacane', null, 'Some puppets come to life in a theater with no windows. This time the puppets interpret William Shakespeare''s Othello.', 'Some puppets come to life in a theater with no windows. This time the puppets interpret William Shakespeare''s Othello.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tILCecacPhUhkz4RojA0XbDVe9U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512770'),
  ('464278587383265337', 'What Becomes of the Broken Hearted?', 1999, 'Drama', 'Ian Mune, Allen Guilford', 'Alan Duff', 'Temuera Morrison, Rena Owen, Clint Eruera, Nancy Brunning, Pete Smith, Lawrence Makoare, Rawiri Paratene, Julian Arahanga', null, 'Five years have passed and Jake has turned his back on his family. He''s still up to his usual tricks in McClutchy''s Bar, unaware, as he downs his latest opponent, that his eldest son, Nig, has died in a gang fight. The uncomfortable family reunion at Nig''s funeral sparks a confrontation with second son, Sonny, and sets Jake and Sonny on a downward spiral.', 'Five years have passed and Jake has turned his back on his family. He''s still up to his usual tricks in McClutchy''s Bar, unaware, as he downs his latest opponent, that his eldest son, Nig, has died in a gang fight. The uncomfortable family reunion at Nig''s funeral sparks a confrontation with second son, Sonny, and sets Jake and Sonny on a downward spiral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdjZtu4hpapjPLekFZXLOijuLzX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13893'),
  ('866263724966566375', 'What Breaks the Ice', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Rebecca Eskreis, Greta Zozula', 'Rebecca Eskreis', 'Sofia Hublitz, Madelyn Cline, Lukas Gage, Aimee Mullins, Erik Jensen, Shakira Barrera, Brett Zimmerman, Catherine Curtin', null, 'A coming of age thriller about two 15-year-old girls, Sammy and Emily, who hark from different worlds but strike up a quick and deep friendship. But what should be the best summer of their lives takes an unexpected turn when they become accidental accomplices in a fatal crime.', 'A coming of age thriller about two 15-year-old girls, Sammy and Emily, who hark from different worlds but strike up a quick and deep friendship. But what should be the best summer of their lives takes an unexpected turn when they become accidental accomplices in a fatal crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f5CafHf4ZEaHtEViJFz7oIMYwAb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:695513'),
  ('730450310362130598', 'What Color is the Wind?', 1973, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Servando González', 'Miriam Salinas Price, Aida Berkman, Servando González', 'Vilma González, Héctor Suárez, Ofelia Medina, Ahui Camacho, María Eugenia San Martín, Enrique Pontón, María Elena García, Raúl Quijada', null, 'Two blind children have bonded deeply in their special-ed classroom. The sight of one of them is restored with an operation.', 'Two blind children have bonded deeply in their special-ed classroom. The sight of one of them is restored with an operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Mk6WgqTPWh15lSJWHkch9ewH1k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297846'),
  ('778403596169565942', 'What Comes Around', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Amy Redford, Bobby Bukowski', 'Scott Organ', 'Summer Phoenix, Grace Van Dien, Jesse García, Kyle Gallner, Indiana Affleck, Reina Hardesty, Sierra Rose, Gabriel Monroe Eckert', null, 'A young love affair becomes a menacing game of cat and mouse where nothing is what it seems in this immersive thriller.', 'A young love affair becomes a menacing game of cat and mouse where nothing is what it seems in this immersive thriller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/raLJMVxSvdfuAPW15CoPOFKxiGJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005731'),
  ('451179952727033844', 'WHAT DID JACK DO?', 2017, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'David Lynch, Scott Andrew Ressler', 'David Lynch', 'Jack Cruz, David Lynch, Emily Stofle, Toototabon', null, 'In a locked down train station, a homicide detective conducts an interview with a tormented monkey who is suspected of murder.', 'In a locked down train station, a homicide detective conducts an interview with a tormented monkey who is suspected of murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68FofMgclH1qCNXoL6foBqPfNFD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528491'),
  ('120533451893732242', 'What Did the Lady Forget?', 1937, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Yûharu Atsuta, Hideo Shigehara', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Akira Fushimi', 'Sumiko Kurishima, Tatsuo Saitō, Michiko Kuwano, Shūji Sano, Takeshi Sakamoto, Chōko Iida, Ken Uehara, Mitsuko Yoshikawa', null, 'A professor, Komiya, and his bossy wife, Tokiko, are to look after Setsuko, their high-spirited niece from Osaka. Despite being a minor, Setsuko is a liberated woman who does whatever she wants, including smoking. She even convinces Koyima to take her to a geisha house. When she gets rather tipsy, the professor calls Okada, one of his students, to take her home. The wife becomes suspicious of Setsuko when she sees Okada bringing her home.', 'A professor, Komiya, and his bossy wife, Tokiko, are to look after Setsuko, their high-spirited niece from Osaka. Despite being a minor, Setsuko is a liberated woman who does whatever she wants, including smoking. She even convinces Koyima to take her to a geisha house. When she gets rather tipsy, the professor calls Okada, one of his students, to take her home. The wife becomes suspicious of Setsuko when she sees Okada bringing her home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9YuhEMPlMaqpIoKnVDckXZRpnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98635'),
  ('1010393538460402815', 'What Did You Do in the War, Daddy?', 1966, 'Comedy, War', 'Blake Edwards, Philip H. Lathrop, Harold E. Wellman', 'William Peter Blatty', 'James Coburn, Dick Shawn, Sergio Fantoni, Aldo Ray, Giovanna Ralli, Harry Morgan, Carroll O''Connor, Leon Askin', 'NR', 'A by-the-book Captain is ordered to capture a strategic village in Italy. The Italian soldiers are willing to surrender, if they can have a festival first. The lieutenant convinces the Captain this is the only way. Because of aerial reconnaissance, they must look like they are fighting. To sort this out an intelligence officer is sent in. Meanwhile the festival gets complicated with the Mayors daughter.', 'A by-the-book Captain is ordered to capture a strategic village in Italy. The Italian soldiers are willing to surrender, if they can have a festival first. The lieutenant convinces the Captain this is the only way. Because of aerial reconnaissance, they must look like they are fighting. To sort this out an intelligence officer is sent in. Meanwhile the festival gets complicated with the Mayors daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgJL21bZBUF22jJHt66be84mcpc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36283'),
  ('304259403268744143', 'What Did You Do in the War, Thanassi?', 1971, 'Drama, Comedy, History', 'Dinos Katsouridis', 'Dinos Katsouridis, Asimakis Gialamas', 'Thanasis Veggos, Efi Roditi, Antonis Papadopoulos, Kaiti Lambropoulou, Katerina Gogou, Nikitas Platis, Manos Destounis, Christos Kalavrouzos', null, 'A wild tale of mistaken identity set during the Nazi occupation of Greece and starring the great Thanasis Vengos. Thanasis is called upon, during the Occupation, to testify at the trial of a tavern owner accused of serving cat meat to his customers. He too is accused of perjury and imprisoned with some resistance fighters. The resistance fighters escape, but Thanasis remains in his cell. He is accused of being Ivan, the notorious ringleader of certain revolutionaries.', 'A wild tale of mistaken identity set during the Nazi occupation of Greece and starring the great Thanasis Vengos. Thanasis is called upon, during the Occupation, to testify at the trial of a tavern owner accused of serving cat meat to his customers. He too is accused of perjury and imprisoned with some resistance fighters. The resistance fighters escape, but Thanasis remains in his cell. He is accused of being Ivan, the notorious ringleader of certain revolutionaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAg6FORYyRDEvzrD6R5cNdrMzlx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164827'),
  ('570624467383901957', 'What Did You Eat Yesterday?', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kazuhito Nakae', 'Naoko Adachi', 'Hidetoshi Nishijima, Seiyo Uchino, Koji Yamamoto, Hayato Isomura, Makita Sports, Misako Tanaka, Meiko Kaji, Airi Matsuyama', 'NR', 'Kenji is overjoyed when his usually thrifty boyfriend takes him on a trip to Kyoto for his birthday, but the trip ends up uncovering a painful topic.', 'Kenji is overjoyed when his usually thrifty boyfriend takes him on a trip to Kyoto for his birthday, but the trip ends up uncovering a painful topic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZL8EQSarjLeREvA97QJ0Jx7yX5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:824362'),
  ('354379707591917609', 'What Did You Tell God?', 2014, 'Music, Comedy', 'Alejandro Cantú, Teresa Suárez', 'Teresa Suárez', 'Mar Contreras, Olinka Velázquez, Erika de la Rosa, Gina Vargas, Mark Tacher, Victor García, Alejandro de la Madrid, Regina Orozco', null, 'Martina and Lupita are two housemaids who steal shoes and clothes from their boss Marcela, trying to impress Lupita''s boyfriend. When Marcela founds out about the robbery, she and her friend Marifer go looking for them to retrieve her stuff and bring them to justice. "What did you tell God?" is a comedy that uses Juan Gabriel''s songs.', 'Martina and Lupita are two housemaids who steal shoes and clothes from their boss Marcela, trying to impress Lupita''s boyfriend. When Marcela founds out about the robbery, she and her friend Marifer go looking for them to retrieve her stuff and bring them to justice. "What did you tell God?" is a comedy that uses Juan Gabriel''s songs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDvVnTt4PnwqzlwSDAx5mNGlbVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247726'),
  ('729861782476118419', 'What Do We See When We Look at the Sky?', 2021, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Tamar Shubitidze, Ketevan Kapanadze, Ana Iakobashvili', 'Alexandre Koberidze', 'Oliko Barbakadze, Giorgi Ambroladze, Ani Karseladze, Giorgi Bochorishvili, Sofio Chanishvili, Vakhtang Panchulidze, Irina Chelidze, Sofio Sharashidze', null, 'In the Georgian riverside town of Kutaisi, summertime romance and World Cup fever are in the air. After a pair of chance encounters, pharmacist Lisa and soccer player Giorgi find their plans for a date undone when they both awaken magically transformed with no way to recognize each other.', 'In the Georgian riverside town of Kutaisi, summertime romance and World Cup fever are in the air. After a pair of chance encounters, pharmacist Lisa and soccer player Giorgi find their plans for a date undone when they both awaken magically transformed with no way to recognize each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4n2Furdryy0tAsJZWNiB8CsYvI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795815'),
  ('667555414182699079', 'What Do You Think?', 1986, 'Drama', 'Paul Leduc, Toni Kuhn', null, 'Blanca Guerra, Roberto Sosa, Cecilia Toussaint, Eduardo López Rojas, Ana Ofelia Murguía, Rafael Pérez Fons, Max Kerlow, Nora Velázquez', null, 'A gritty musical drama about life in the ghettos of Mexico City during the 1980s. With a soundtrack of Mexican rock music, the camera takes the viewer through the streets, to rock concerts, and to the bars and clubs, where he exposes the hunger, repression, unhealthy conditions and violence in the marginal communities of Mexico''s capital city.', 'A gritty musical drama about life in the ghettos of Mexico City during the 1980s. With a soundtrack of Mexican rock music, the camera takes the viewer through the streets, to rock concerts, and to the bars and clubs, where he exposes the hunger, repression, unhealthy conditions and violence in the marginal communities of Mexico''s capital city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3nGCA7ppviYeEIj0NbfpvxBf4x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203947'),
  ('53814384333099995', 'What Does That Nature Say to You', 2025, 'Drama', 'Hong Sang-soo, Hong Sang-soo', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Ha Seong-guk, Kwon Hae-hyo, Cho Yun-hee, Kang So-yi, Park Mi-so', null, 'A young poet drops his girlfriend off at her parents'' house and is amazed by its size. He bumps into her father, meets her mother and sister, and they all end up spending a long day together; fueled by conversation, food and libations.', 'A young poet drops his girlfriend off at her parents'' house and is amazed by its size. He bumps into her father, meets her mother and sister, and they all end up spending a long day together; fueled by conversation, food and libations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnW2xfpB8BnHuHOiT7XA8EBSW9F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1418849'),
  ('765040876110305676', 'What Doesn''t Kill Us', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sandra Nettelbeck, Michael Bertl', 'Sandra Nettelbeck', 'August Zirner, Johanna ter Steege, Barbara Auer, Oliver Broumis, Jenny Schily, Christian Berkel, Mark Waschke, Deborah Kaufmann', null, 'As a divorced father of two teenage daughters, with a head-strong ex-wife for a best friend, too many peculiar patients to keep up with and a new dog, psychotherapist Max certainly doesn''t need another challenge. But when Sophie, a compulsive gambler with a boyfriend problem, regularly shows up late for her appointments, she rocks his world in ways he''s not ready for.', 'As a divorced father of two teenage daughters, with a head-strong ex-wife for a best friend, too many peculiar patients to keep up with and a new dog, psychotherapist Max certainly doesn''t need another challenge. But when Sophie, a compulsive gambler with a boyfriend problem, regularly shows up late for her appointments, she rocks his world in ways he''s not ready for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzHgz70I9P84n6HCgNCWb98P9NV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432671'),
  ('752028376413124568', 'What Doesn''t Kill You', 2008, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Brian Goodman, Christopher Norr', null, 'Ethan Hawke, Mark Ruffalo, Amanda Peet, Donnie Wahlberg, Will Lyman, Brian Goodman, Angela Featherstone, Edward Lynch', 'R', 'Two childhood friends from South Boston turn to crime as a way to get by, ultimately causing a strain in their personal lives and their friendship.', 'Two childhood friends from South Boston turn to crime as a way to get by, ultimately causing a strain in their personal lives and their friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqnhe3LFtFVeXv0vBO3vaOiY2ZX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15801'),
  ('994844832009176038', 'What Dreams May Come', 1998, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Eduardo Serra, Vincent Ward, Tomas Voth', 'Ronald Bass', 'Robin Williams, Cuba Gooding Jr., Annabella Sciorra, Josh Paddock, Jessica Brooks Grant, Max von Sydow, Wilma Bonet, Lucinda Jenney', 'PG-13', 'Chris Nielsen dies to find himself in a heaven more amazing than he could have ever dreamed of. There is one thing missing: his wife. After he dies, his wife Annie killed herself and went to hell. Chris decides to risk eternity in Hades for the small chance that he will be able to bring her back to heaven.', 'Chris Nielsen dies to find himself in a heaven more amazing than he could have ever dreamed of. There is one thing missing: his wife. After he dies, his wife Annie killed herself and went to hell. Chris decides to risk eternity in Hades for the small chance that he will be able to bring her back to heaven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78wCdphUzeb528wLZw2W0fn7yGB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12159'),
  ('675439978549934104', 'What Drives Us', 2021, 'Documentary, Music', 'Dave Grohl', null, 'Jennifer Finch, Tony Kanal, Flea, Lars Ulrich, Charlie Gabriel, Brian Johnson, St. Vincent, Dave Lombardo', null, 'The stories of some of the biggest artists in music, recalling the romance and adventure, as well as the idiocy and chaos, of their time on the road. While the world has changed, the custom has not changed. There is no other way to know whether you can make it in this business. You have to get in the van.', 'The stories of some of the biggest artists in music, recalling the romance and adventure, as well as the idiocy and chaos, of their time on the road. While the world has changed, the custom has not changed. There is no other way to know whether you can make it in this business. You have to get in the van.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/blnGO5tz1J3sQtj7995vC8kmyDl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:817775'),
  ('578494068160545063', 'What Ever Happened to Aunt Alice?', 1969, 'Crime, Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Lee H. Katzin, Daisy Gerber, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Theodore Apstein', 'Geraldine Page, Ruth Gordon, Rosemary Forsyth, Robert Fuller, Mildred Dunnock, Joan Huntington, Peter Brandon, Michael Barbera', null, 'An aging widow hides a deadly secret which she will do anything to keep buried.', 'An aging widow hides a deadly secret which she will do anything to keep buried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myKAhtxPkf8xyRBcBZOazR3dENW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77571'),
  ('543169679576418224', 'What Ever Happened to Baby Jane?', 1991, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'David Greene, Stevan Larner', null, 'Vanessa Redgrave, Lynn Redgrave, Bruce A. Young, Amy Steel, John Scott Clough, John Glover, Samantha Jordan, Erinn Canavan', null, 'An elderly, bedridden former movie star is "cared for" by her sister, who hates her and keeps her a virtual prisoner in the family mansion.', 'An elderly, bedridden former movie star is "cared for" by her sister, who hates her and keeps her a virtual prisoner in the family mansion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FYKeMWMjq07U7D5B5nzj7Wt92E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137536'),
  ('181284147640120417', 'What Ever Happened to Baby Toto?', 1964, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Ottavio Alessi, Sergio D''Offizi, Albino Cocco', 'Giovanni Grimaldi, Bruno Corbucci, Ottavio Alessi', 'Totò, Pietro De Vico, Mischa Auer, Piero Morgia, Ivy Holzer, Edy Biagetti, Alicia Brandet, Mario Castellani', null, 'A pair of brothers, Baby Toto and Pietro, sons of different mothers, live stealing suitcases at the Termini Station in Rome. After a theft, they discover that the stolen suitcase they got from an apparent sweet old lady actually contains a corpse.', 'A pair of brothers, Baby Toto and Pietro, sons of different mothers, live stealing suitcases at the Termini Station in Rome. After a theft, they discover that the stolen suitcase they got from an apparent sweet old lady actually contains a corpse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrteoia3J2oMrs6GktDANpqrqpE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68881'),
  ('313437985992333499', 'What Father… Is My Family?', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Rodrigo Vidal', null, 'Carlos Ponce, Marlene Favela, Eduardo Yáñez, Omar Elizondo, Verónica Montes', null, 'Fello and Marisa had been drifting apart under the weight of children, money troubles, and the strain of daily modern life in Mexico City. When they win a weekend in a luxurious resort, and the chance to compete for the money that would solve their troubles, the entire family must come together to win the prize. In the process, Fello and Maritza will learn that marriage and family is still worth fighting for.', 'Fello and Marisa had been drifting apart under the weight of children, money troubles, and the strain of daily modern life in Mexico City. When they win a weekend in a luxurious resort, and the chance to compete for the money that would solve their troubles, the entire family must come together to win the prize. In the process, Fello and Maritza will learn that marriage and family is still worth fighting for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxSnWIyBvDkJkkvc0pzEtK9Pz5p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1046013'),
  ('113017793026531946', 'What Goes Up', 2009, 'Drama', 'Jonathan Glatzer', 'Jonathan Glatzer, Robert C. Lawson', 'Steve Coogan, Hilary Duff, Olivia Thirlby, Josh Peck, Molly Shannon, Brett Kelly, Molly Price, Max Hoffman', null, 'Set in the mid-80s, when a reporter is sent to cover the Challenger Space Shuttle launch only to become mixed up in the lives of some local students.', 'Set in the mid-80s, when a reporter is sent to cover the Challenger Space Shuttle launch only to become mixed up in the lives of some local students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mTwq6K6zdZ3kHLKMVOMDBx0Vwn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19874'),
  ('46444883365676155', 'What Happened at the Carpenter''s Shop', 2020, 'Romance', 'No Hyun-jin', null, 'Tae Joo, Ahn So-hee, Min Do-yoon, Gil Dong, Hae Il', null, 'A rumour spread out all over the neighborhood. Yeon-joo, a beautiful, entertaining SNS celebrity, and also a woodworker is being watched and admired by Do-shik. He decides to ask her for a date one weekend. Do-shik appeared and grasped Yeon-joo without her noticing him. Meanwhile, the clueless, naïve, and honest bookkeeper of the carpenter shop is keeping two huge secrets no one would even thought of. Finally, the great secret of Yeon-joo and Tae-ju is revealed, turning the tables around.', 'A rumour spread out all over the neighborhood. Yeon-joo, a beautiful, entertaining SNS celebrity, and also a woodworker is being watched and admired by Do-shik. He decides to ask her for a date one weekend. Do-shik appeared and grasped Yeon-joo without her noticing him. Meanwhile, the clueless, naïve, and honest bookkeeper of the carpenter shop is keeping two huge secrets no one would even thought of. Finally, the great secret of Yeon-joo and Tae-ju is revealed, turning the tables around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMhxD4DKRJM1dydluvsS5aL2Tci.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:685833'),
  ('337255145854670373', 'What Happened to Monday', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery, Action', 'Tommy Wirkola, José David Montero', 'Max Botkin, Kerry Williamson', 'Noomi Rapace, Glenn Close, Willem Dafoe, Marwan Kenzari, Christian Rubeck, Pål Sverre Hagen, Tomiwa Edun, Cassie Clare', 'R', 'In a world where families are limited to one child due to overpopulation, a set of identical septuplets must avoid being put to a long sleep by the government and dangerous infighting while investigating the disappearance of one of their own.', 'In a world where families are limited to one child due to overpopulation, a set of identical septuplets must avoid being put to a long sleep by the government and dangerous infighting while investigating the disappearance of one of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atOgZMJpMrTdpqvPiHVPfBhR61l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406990'),
  ('923424301570620047', 'What Happened to Mr. Cha?', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Baek Sang-il, Kim Dong-gyu, Jeong Duk-hee', 'Kim Dong-gyu', 'Cha In-pyo, Jo Dal-hwan, Song Jae-ryong, Ji Seung-hyun, Shin Ae-ra, Shin Shin-ae, Ryu Seung-ryong, Jo Han-joon', 'NR', 'With the peak of his career long behind him, an actor clings to his past glory — until a sudden wake-up call forces him to face who he''s become.', 'With the peak of his career long behind him, an actor clings to his past glory — until a sudden wake-up call forces him to face who he''s become.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3iX03yeqKVbiYDY7oGalorDYmop.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:629277'),
  ('579132098509682790', 'What Happened to Our Nest Egg!?', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Tetsu Maeda, Akira Sako', 'Hiroshi Saito', 'Yuki Amami, Yutaka Matsushige, Mitsuko Kusabue, Rie Shibata, Yua Shinkawa, Ryo Kato, Mayumi Wakamura, Tomochika', null, 'Atsuko and Akira are a husband and wife duo with a daughter and a son. Atsuko is in charge of the retirement finances. She saves from money given to her by her husband and also earns money herself by working part-time. She stretches every yen by leading a frugal life. yet, expenses come up. These include their daughter''s upcoming wedding and the funeral expenses of the husband''s father. Then, and at exactly the worst time, the couple finds itself unemployed.', 'Atsuko and Akira are a husband and wife duo with a daughter and a son. Atsuko is in charge of the retirement finances. She saves from money given to her by her husband and also earns money herself by working part-time. She stretches every yen by leading a frugal life. yet, expenses come up. These include their daughter''s upcoming wedding and the funeral expenses of the husband''s father. Then, and at exactly the worst time, the couple finds itself unemployed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6SzV4m5FWbWpQXMKJO5daJXTYTC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:704035'),
  ('19024158062975289', 'What Happened to the Inquisitive Janitor', 1901, 'Comedy', 'Ferdinand Zecca', null, null, null, 'Pathé film number 380, released as "What Happened to the Inquisitive Janitor" in the US and as "Peeping Tom" in the UK. The title "What is Seen Through a Keyhole" was given ''a posteriori'' and should not be regarded as its original. As a janitor is cleaning a hotel, he decides to peek through the keyholes to observe some of the guests in their rooms. In room 8, a woman is busy making herself look more attractive, and the janitor enjoys watching her. There are also some interesting things going on in the other rooms on the floor.', 'Pathé film number 380, released as "What Happened to the Inquisitive Janitor" in the US and as "Peeping Tom" in the UK. The title "What is Seen Through a Keyhole" was given ''a posteriori'' and should not be regarded as its original. As a janitor is cleaning a hotel, he decides to peek through the keyholes to observe some of the guests in their rooms. In room 8, a woman is busy making herself look more attractive, and the janitor enjoys watching her. There are also some interesting things going on in the other rooms on the floor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Lplk6fxxc4aTp1OZ9hGYYaOqOT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142042'),
  ('22023857261034145', 'What Happened Was...', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Tom Noonan, Steve Apicella, Joe DeSalvo', 'Tom Noonan', 'Karen Sillas, Tom Noonan', null, 'Jackie and Michael are coworkers at a large law firm. They decide to meet at Jackie''s for dinner one night.', 'Jackie and Michael are coworkers at a large law firm. They decide to meet at Jackie''s for dinner one night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mke5aNX5cT6JIWk2ER4ng9dGNNL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83718'),
  ('160050660778792853', 'What Happened, Miss Simone?', 2015, 'Music, Documentary', 'Liz Garbus, Igor Martinović', 'Liz Garbus', 'Nina Simone, Lisa Simone, Dick Gregory, Stanley Crouch, Elisabeth Henry-Macari, Ilyasah Shabazz', null, 'The film chronicles Nina Simone''s journey from child piano prodigy to iconic musician and passionate activist, told in her own words.', 'The film chronicles Nina Simone''s journey from child piano prodigy to iconic musician and passionate activist, told in her own words.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XpM91NVq6IyCnDkiWf4xjHpewK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318044'),
  ('202383491914011992', 'What Happens in Vegas', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tom Vaughan, Matthew F. Leonetti, Rose Heeter', 'Dana Fox', 'Cameron Diaz, Ashton Kutcher, Rob Corddry, Lake Bell, Jason Sudeikis, Treat Williams, Deirdre O''Connell, Michelle Krusiec', 'PG-13', 'During a wild vacation in Las Vegas, career woman Joy McNally and playboy Jack Fuller come to the sober realization that they have married each other after a night of drunken abandon. They are then compelled, for legal reasons, to live life as a couple for a limited period of time. At stake is a large amount of money.', 'During a wild vacation in Las Vegas, career woman Joy McNally and playboy Jack Fuller come to the sober realization that they have married each other after a night of drunken abandon. They are then compelled, for legal reasons, to live life as a couple for a limited period of time. At stake is a large amount of money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7bQ7Lj6UhArgnx49wmkaTxM4iU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9029'),
  ('587079307411982096', 'What Happens Later', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Meg Ryan, Bartosz Nalazek', 'Steven Dietz, Kirk Lynn, Meg Ryan', 'Meg Ryan, David Duchovny, Rob Gilchrist, Will Reed, Patricia Rouse, Hal Liggett, Jared Rogers', 'R', 'Two ex-lovers get snowed in at a regional airport overnight. Indefinitely delayed, Willa, a magical thinker, and Bill, a catastrophic one, find themselves just as attracted to and annoyed by one another as they did decades earlier. But as they unpack the riddle of their mutual past and compare their lives to the dreams they once shared, they begin to wonder if their reunion is mere coincidence, or something more enchanted.', 'Two ex-lovers get snowed in at a regional airport overnight. Indefinitely delayed, Willa, a magical thinker, and Bill, a catastrophic one, find themselves just as attracted to and annoyed by one another as they did decades earlier. But as they unpack the riddle of their mutual past and compare their lives to the dreams they once shared, they begin to wonder if their reunion is mere coincidence, or something more enchanted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSAdS03j8zbjv35gKdjrIL5snw1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:970948'),
  ('762081631736291173', 'What Happens When Love Comes to Town', 1984, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Zoran Čalić', 'Zoran Čalić, Jovan Marković', 'Dragomir ''Gidra'' Bojanić, Marko Todorović, Rialda Kadrić, Vladimir Petrović, Nikola Kojo, Gala Videnović, Jelena Žigon, Ljiljana Janković', null, 'Misa in the music school falls in love with a young Russian girl Natasha, who was then located in Belgrade. But their parents think that they are too young for love. Natasha''s parents do not allow that connection, so they go back to Moscow. Unlike parents who want to end their relationship Zika and Milan are on their side. Zika begins to learn the Russian language.', 'Misa in the music school falls in love with a young Russian girl Natasha, who was then located in Belgrade. But their parents think that they are too young for love. Natasha''s parents do not allow that connection, so they go back to Moscow. Unlike parents who want to end their relationship Zika and Milan are on their side. Zika begins to learn the Russian language.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsjWhMmzrKKKqLKfYK5nxwzit0H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55118'),
  ('931402253868283040', 'What Have I Done to Deserve This?', 1984, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pedro Almodóvar, Ángel Luis Fernández, José María de Cossío', 'Pedro Almodóvar', 'Carmen Maura, Luis Hostalot, Ryo Hiruma, Ángel de Andrés López, Gonzalo Suárez, Verónica Forqué, Juan Martínez, Chus Lampreave', null, 'A henpecked housewife ekes out a meager existence, surrounded by a host of colorful characters: her ungrateful husband, her delinquent sons, her headstrong mother-in-law, and her sex worker neighbor, among others.', 'A henpecked housewife ekes out a meager existence, surrounded by a host of colorful characters: her ungrateful husband, her delinquent sons, her headstrong mother-in-law, and her sex worker neighbor, among others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMgvMt3fV57JmNpsaEQefjvw1hl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8221'),
  ('445184336538554417', 'What Have They Done to Your Daughters?', 1974, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Massimo Dallamano, Mimmola Girosi, Franco Delli Colli', 'Massimo Dallamano, Ettore Sanzò', 'Giovanna Ralli, Claudio Cassinelli, Mario Adorf, Franco Fabrizi, Farley Granger, Marina Berti, Paolo Turco, Corrado Gaipa', 'R', 'An unidentified fifteen year-old girl is found hanged after an anonymous tip-off. The girl, Silvia Polvesi, is soon discovered to have been murdered. A peeping tom is caught with photos of her having sex with a teenage drop-out but he is later released due to lack of evidence. The investigation, conducted by Inspector Silvestri and the assistant public prosecutor Vittoria Stori, focuses on the girl''s parents. Conspiracies and horrors pile up, as do the body parts.', 'An unidentified fifteen year-old girl is found hanged after an anonymous tip-off. The girl, Silvia Polvesi, is soon discovered to have been murdered. A peeping tom is caught with photos of her having sex with a teenage drop-out but he is later released due to lack of evidence. The investigation, conducted by Inspector Silvestri and the assistant public prosecutor Vittoria Stori, focuses on the girl''s parents. Conspiracies and horrors pile up, as do the body parts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubaVM4VuJQ0NdghwWj8oVxpWM4i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69578'),
  ('722760791872730134', 'What Have We Done to Deserve This?', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Andreas Thalhammer, Xiaosu Han, Eva Spreitzhofer', 'Eva Spreitzhofer', 'Caroline Peters, Chantal Zitzenbacher, Simon Schwarz, Emily Cox, Pia Hierzegger, Michaela Schausberger, Kida Khodr Ramadan, Marcel Mohab', null, 'Wanda''s world has been turned upside down when her teenage daughter Nina suddenly turns up in a hijab. Nina has secretly converted to Islam.', 'Wanda''s world has been turned upside down when her teenage daughter Nina suddenly turns up in a hijab. Nina has secretly converted to Islam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4g4uoXZKzfvaJT4qGZH1lWB3Nhr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548633'),
  ('1092799727536186079', 'What Have We Learned, Charlie Brown?', 1983, 'Animation, History, Comedy, Family, TV Movie, War', 'Bill Melendez', 'John McCrae, Charles M. Schulz', 'Brad Kesten, Jeremy Schoenberg, Stacy Heather Tolkin, Brent Hauer, Victoria Vargas, Michael Dockery, Monica Parker, Bill Melendez', 'PG', 'As they begin their journey home from their student exchange term, Charlie Brown and the gang find themselves sidetracked. They have severe car trouble and more importantly, they pass by various monuments to World Wars I &amp; II. With Linus guiding them through these memorials, they learn about the events of the wars and the sacrifices required of the troops who fought them.', 'As they begin their journey home from their student exchange term, Charlie Brown and the gang find themselves sidetracked. They have severe car trouble and more importantly, they pass by various monuments to World Wars I &amp; II. With Linus guiding them through these memorials, they learn about the events of the wars and the sacrifices required of the troops who fought them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwo9NCIEtq6zsT3kCfKRDfImzUj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149827'),
  ('1092414322606166261', 'What Have You Done to Solange?', 1972, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Bruno Nicolai, Joe D''Amato, Luigi Urbani', 'Massimo Dallamano, Bruno Di Geronimo, Peter M. Thouet', 'Fabio Testi, Karin Baal, Cristina Galbó, Joachim Fuchsberger, Günther Stoll, Claudia Butenuth, Camille Keaton, Maria Monti', null, 'After several Catholic school pupils are murdered, a teacher who is having an affair with one of his students becomes a suspect. When other gruesome murders start occurring shortly thereafter, the teacher suspects that he may be the cause of them.', 'After several Catholic school pupils are murdered, a teacher who is having an affair with one of his students becomes a suspect. When other gruesome murders start occurring shortly thereafter, the teacher suspects that he may be the cause of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMwcPwaqPckzR0c312v0eCyfQ5U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6591'),
  ('696508276099318179', 'What I Did for Love', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jérôme Cornuau', null, 'Ophélie Winter, Jean-Marc Barr, Philippe Duquesne, Raquel Welch, Sam Anderson, Didier Cauchy, Frédéric Bouraly, Gilles Lellouche', null, 'A man falls in love from afar with a woman who has just broken up acrimoniously with her husband and is disgusted with all men except her gay friends.', 'A man falls in love from afar with a woman who has just broken up acrimoniously with her husband and is disgusted with all men except her gay friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8uAdtN6YYxCFScoQv1AtPvmkZDF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86098'),
  ('512148629719444175', 'What I Feel For You', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Peyi Guzmán, Raúl Camilo', 'Giovanna Bonnelly', 'Frank Perozo, Nashla Bogaert, Ico Abreu, Javier Alejo Cruz, Yordanka Ariosa, Zoilo Batista', null, 'Three simultaneous stories of social inclusion, led by a single mother of two autistic teenagers, a marriage trying unsuccessfully to have a child, and the father of a Special Olympics athlete.', 'Three simultaneous stories of social inclusion, led by a single mother of two autistic teenagers, a marriage trying unsuccessfully to have a child, and the father of a Special Olympics athlete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gqcCfCt9DVGYysrbG9SK50HKw7j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:572764'),
  ('678192076602201116', 'What If', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Dowse, Rogier Stoffers, Robin D. Cook', 'Elan Mastai', 'Daniel Radcliffe, Zoe Kazan, Megan Park, Adam Driver, Mackenzie Davis, Rafe Spall, Lucius Hoyos, Jemima Rooper', 'PG-13', 'Medical-school dropout Wallace has been repeatedly burned by bad relationships. So while everyone around him, including his roommate Allan, seems to be finding the perfect partner, Wallace decides to put his love life on hold. It is then that he meets Chantry, an animator who lives with her longtime boyfriend Ben. Wallace and Chantry form an instant connection, striking up a close friendship. Still, there is no denying the chemistry between them, leading the pair to wonder, what if the love of your life is actually your best friend?', 'Medical-school dropout Wallace has been repeatedly burned by bad relationships. So while everyone around him, including his roommate Allan, seems to be finding the perfect partner, Wallace decides to put his love life on hold. It is then that he meets Chantry, an animator who lives with her longtime boyfriend Ben. Wallace and Chantry form an instant connection, striking up a close friendship. Still, there is no denying the chemistry between them, leading the pair to wonder, what if the love of your life is actually your best friend?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67x9NJyjK4u02NpISnChDMKzCUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212716'),
  ('750828213330913786', 'What if...', 2010, 'Romance, Family, Fantasy, Drama', 'Dallas Jenkins', 'Chuck Konzelman, Andrea Gyertson Nasfell, Cary Solomon', 'Kevin Sorbo, Kristy Swanson, John Ratzenberger, Debby Ryan, Kristin Minter, Toni Trucks, Taylor Groothuis, Stelio Savante', 'PG', 'Fifteen years ago, Ben Walker made a decision to leave his college sweetheart and ultimately his faith, in order to pursue a lucrative business opportunity. Now with a high-paying career and a trophy fiancé, he is visited by an angel, who gives him a glimpse into what his life would look like had he followed his calling.', 'Fifteen years ago, Ben Walker made a decision to leave his college sweetheart and ultimately his faith, in order to pursue a lucrative business opportunity. Now with a high-paying career and a trophy fiancé, he is visited by an angel, who gives him a glimpse into what his life would look like had he followed his calling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqwZH7DzDdQuJhPuBrasC3e6GR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42950'),
  ('170079000932613539', 'What If...?', 2008, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Léa Fazer, Myriam Vinocour', 'Léa Fazer', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Alice Taglioni, Jocelyn Quivrin, Pascale Arbillot, Julie Ferrier, Antonio Cauchois, Denise Aron-Schropfer, Farid Bentoumi', null, 'Victor and Margot are two lawyers on the fast track to success at a major law firm. They are also a loving couple. After a senior partner at the firm dies unexpectedly, it is decided that either Margot or Victor will be promoted to the important position. The other will have to settle for a supporting role. Both scenarios are explored.', 'Victor and Margot are two lawyers on the fast track to success at a major law firm. They are also a loving couple. After a senior partner at the firm dies unexpectedly, it is decided that either Margot or Victor will be promoted to the important position. The other will have to settle for a supporting role. Both scenarios are explored.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCfOyFRoTBgfnmI1dBhXUp7MpDw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18466'),
