  ('34463595547384564', 'What Is It Worth?', 2005, 'Drama', 'Sérgio Bianchi, Gustavo Pinheiro, Thiago Villas Boas', 'Sérgio Bianchi, Newton Cannito, Eduardo Benain', 'Danton Mello, Leona Cavalli, Lázaro Ramos, Caio Blat, Sílvio Guindane, Zezé Motta, Marcélia Cartaxo, Caco Ciocler', null, 'Free adaptation of Machado de Assis''s short story "Pai Contra Mãe", having some of Nireu Cavalcanti''s 18th Century chronicles as inspiration, the film traces parallels between life in during the slavery period and in modern Brazil.', 'Free adaptation of Machado de Assis''s short story "Pai Contra Mãe", having some of Nireu Cavalcanti''s 18th Century chronicles as inspiration, the film traces parallels between life in during the slavery period and in modern Brazil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBDlpHsNqDJ8tpMn8wO3i4LjS0c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163959'),
  ('913158470510012819', 'What Is Love?', 2019, 'Romance, Drama', 'Rikiya Imaizumi, Hiroshi Iwanaga, Ryuji Yagami', 'Rikiya Imaizumi, Kaori Sawai', 'Yukino Kishii, Ryo Narita, Mai Fukagawa, Ryuya Wakaba, Noriko Eguchi, Mariko Tsutsui, Reiko Kataoka, Moeka Hoshi', null, 'Teruko is a 28-year-old office worker. 5 months ago, she fell in love with Mamoru at first sight. Since that time, she has not cared about her work or her friends. She then loses her job and her friends look at her coldly. Yet, Teruko is happy as long as she is with Mamoru. Meanwhile, Mamoru thinks Teruko is an easy woman for him to not love. Teruko''s unrequited love grows deeper.', 'Teruko is a 28-year-old office worker. 5 months ago, she fell in love with Mamoru at first sight. Since that time, she has not cared about her work or her friends. She then loses her job and her friends look at her coldly. Yet, Teruko is happy as long as she is with Mamoru. Meanwhile, Mamoru thinks Teruko is an easy woman for him to not love. Teruko''s unrequited love grows deeper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6P0ltSjk8Gq7GxtlvGux5isokrd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529934'),
  ('315666014473958295', 'What Jennifer Did', 2024, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Jenny Popplewell, Michael Sinyi', 'Jenny Popplewell', 'Fernando Baldassini, Samantha Chang, Alan Cooke, Bill Courtice, Deborah Gladding', 'R', 'When Jennifer Pan calls 911 to report that her parents have been shot, she becomes the primary focus of a captivating criminal case.', 'When Jennifer Pan calls 911 to report that her parents have been shot, she becomes the primary focus of a captivating criminal case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3PJPXuSArGK8tM6lBUyPUTtIbJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1261924'),
  ('441464730382939216', 'What Josiah Saw', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Stephen Vincent, Sig De Miguel, Josh Brandli', 'Robert Alan Dilts', 'Robert Patrick, Nick Stahl, Scott Haze, Kelli Garner, Tony Hale, Jake Weber, Ronnie Gene Blevins, Louanne Stephens', null, 'A family with buried secrets reunite at a farmhouse after two decades to pay for their past sins.', 'A family with buried secrets reunite at a farmhouse after two decades to pay for their past sins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfKY55tfwyg0D0m9aWibmRoKLq4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:696605'),
  ('342850275460370267', 'What Just Happened', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Barry Levinson, Stéphane Fontaine, Chip Signore', 'Art Linson', 'Robert De Niro, Sean Penn, Bruce Willis, Robin Wright, Stanley Tucci, John Turturro, Kristen Stewart, Lily Rabe', 'R', 'During the course of an ordinary week in Hollywood, movie producer Ben must navigate his way through shark-infested waters as he struggles to complete his latest projects. A demanding studio boss demands extensive changes to a movie starring Sean Penn, while another chief won''t greenlight a project unless star Bruce Willis shaves his beard. Meanwhile, Ben tries to reconcile with his wife and maintain a relationship with his young daughter.', 'During the course of an ordinary week in Hollywood, movie producer Ben must navigate his way through shark-infested waters as he struggles to complete his latest projects. A demanding studio boss demands extensive changes to a movie starring Sean Penn, while another chief won''t greenlight a project unless star Bruce Willis shaves his beard. Meanwhile, Ben tries to reconcile with his wife and maintain a relationship with his young daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o88aPDDMtdwQsPyXqSKhu98jjru.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8944'),
  ('816511453889075454', 'What Keeps You Alive', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Colin Minihan, David Schuurman, Braden Croft', 'Colin Minihan', 'Hannah Emily Anderson, Brittany Allen, Martha MacIsaac, Joey Klein, Charlotte Lindsay Marron', 'R', 'Majestic mountains, a still lake and venomous betrayals engulf a married couple attempting to celebrate their first anniversary.', 'Majestic mountains, a still lake and venomous betrayals engulf a married couple attempting to celebrate their first anniversary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHrNKFoG3XOy5oPygR90TR5nfJt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503752'),
  ('361955380790958873', 'What Lies Below', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Jimmy Jung Lu, Braden R. Duemmler', 'Braden R. Duemmler', 'Ema Horvath, Mena Suvari, Trey Tucker, Haskiri Velazquez, Troy Iwata, Danny Corbo, Olan Montgomery', null, 'A socially awkward teenager is blindsided when her mother introduces her to her new fiancée. At first, his charm, intelligence, and beauty seem too good to be true, and after a series of strange occurrences, the teenage daughter realizes that this new member of their family is not exactly who he seems.', 'A socially awkward teenager is blindsided when her mother introduces her to her new fiancée. At first, his charm, intelligence, and beauty seem too good to be true, and after a series of strange occurrences, the teenage daughter realizes that this new member of their family is not exactly who he seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25FaS1xPTz1reG95D1M68Gc7NNG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:716703'),
  ('841567800796942038', 'What Lies Beneath', 2000, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Robert Zemeckis, Don Burgess, Andrew Menzies', 'Clark Gregg', 'Michelle Pfeiffer, Harrison Ford, Diana Scarwid, James Remar, Miranda Otto, Ray Baker, Wendy Crewson, Amber Valletta', 'PG-13', 'Norman and Claire Spencer are a seemingly happily married couple who uncover a terrible secret… a secret so disturbing it threatens to destroy them.', 'Norman and Claire Spencer are a seemingly happily married couple who uncover a terrible secret… a secret so disturbing it threatens to destroy them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2L3Cn0CizbSy2E9KJt1SiOSyb6p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2655'),
  ('1031536824126074443', 'What Love Is', 2007, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Mars Callahan, David Stump, Nicolas Harvard', 'Mars Callahan', 'Cuba Gooding Jr., Matthew Lillard, Sean Astin, Terrence ''T.C.'' Carson, Anne Heche, Gina Gershon, Tamala Jones, Shiri Appleby', null, 'It''s Valentine''s Day and Tom has big plans. He''s about to get engaged and has a surprise party planned to share the good news with friends. But things take a turn for the worse. Tom returns home only to discover his girlfriend has packed up and left him. Now, instead of a surprise party, the surprise is on Tom. Fortunately, his friends are there to help him make sense of it all.', 'It''s Valentine''s Day and Tom has big plans. He''s about to get engaged and has a surprise party planned to share the good news with friends. But things take a turn for the worse. Tom returns home only to discover his girlfriend has packed up and left him. Now, instead of a surprise party, the surprise is on Tom. Fortunately, his friends are there to help him make sense of it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c08XFez7JngaahzAZ2fojewfNrt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25973'),
  ('64105342470961992', 'What Lucia Saw', 2022, 'Drama', 'Imanol Uribe', 'Daniel Cebrián', 'Juana Acosta, Juan Carlos Martínez, Carmelo Gómez, Karra Elejalde, Angel Bonanni, Harlys Becerra, Manu Fullola, Gerald B. Fillmore', null, 'During a night of 1989, in the middle of the Salvadoran civil war, six Jesuit priests were murdered at the UCA University. The news has an immediate international repercussion since their contribution was key in the foreseeable peace agreement after a decade of bloody war. Who killed them? The government immediately blamed the guerrillas but an eyewitness debunked the official version. Her name is Lucía and she works as a cleaning employee at the UCA. She has seen who were the real killers: the army. Now she will have to choose between testifying for the truth or protecting her family.', 'During a night of 1989, in the middle of the Salvadoran civil war, six Jesuit priests were murdered at the UCA University. The news has an immediate international repercussion since their contribution was key in the foreseeable peace agreement after a decade of bloody war. Who killed them? The government immediately blamed the guerrillas but an eyewitness debunked the official version. Her name is Lucía and she works as a cleaning employee at the UCA. She has seen who were the real killers: the army. Now she will have to choose between testifying for the truth or protecting her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l77N5CxDqIrCHHLLATJW4OtINPF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:929453'),
  ('224960734552753885', 'What Lurks Beneath', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jamie Bailey', 'Marcus Raul', 'Dela Reilley, Ryan Giesen, Simon Phillips, Sienna Star, Michael Swatton, Blake Canning, Anne-Carolyne Binette, Nick Biskupek', null, 'The crew of USS Titan find themselves on the brink of World War 3 with Russia, when a naked stowaway appears in one of their torpedo tubes. The captain banks fears she may be Russian, but she''s something far more dangerous.', 'The crew of USS Titan find themselves on the brink of World War 3 with Russia, when a naked stowaway appears in one of their torpedo tubes. The captain banks fears she may be Russian, but she''s something far more dangerous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LFSdNB610uSUZ08Y6xN4V3p8OV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1330167'),
  ('667167917130367670', 'What Maisie Knew', 2013, 'Drama', 'David Siegel, Scott McGehee, Giles Nuttgens', 'Carroll Cartwright, Nancy Doyne', 'Julianne Moore, Steve Coogan, Alexander Skarsgård, Joanna Vanderham, Onata Aprile, Diana García, Sadie Rae, Jesse Stone Spadaccini', 'R', 'In New York City, a young girl is caught in the middle of her parents'' bitter custody battle.', 'In New York City, a young girl is caught in the middle of her parents'' bitter custody battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1unkWKdT68ba6NdiSsPqzJeylxc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127373'),
  ('549740555580896571', 'What Makes a Family', 2001, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Rhett Morita, Eric J. Robertson, William Spahic', 'Robert L. Freedman', 'Brooke Shields, Cherry Jones, Whoopi Goldberg, Anne Meara, Al Waxman, Jordy Benattar, Melanie Nicholls-King, Stewart Arnott', null, 'Janine and Sandy are a lesbian couple who decide to have a baby, but after a few years Sandy dies. This tragedy is exploited by Sandy''s parents to snatch the girl from Janine''s care. But then, and despite having the laws against her, Janine decides to fight in order to regain custody of her daughter.', 'Janine and Sandy are a lesbian couple who decide to have a baby, but after a few years Sandy dies. This tragedy is exploited by Sandy''s parents to snatch the girl from Janine''s care. But then, and despite having the laws against her, Janine decides to fight in order to regain custody of her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d28Sh51xcYwW86IY7GuvGYEC8CV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59884'),
